export default {"format":"cadcraft-help","version":1,"app":"takeoffcraft","name":"TakeoffCraft","common":"basics","sections":{"start":"Getting started","tasks":"Walkthroughs","switching":"Coming from other software","reference":"Reference","trouble":"Troubleshooting and limits"},"variants":{"os":{"mac":"Mac","windows":"Windows","linux":"Linux"},"browser":{"chromium":"Chrome or Edge","firefox":"Firefox","safari":"Safari"},"shell":{"web":"In the browser","desktop":"Desktop app"},"net":{"online":"Online","offline":"Offline"},"input":{"mouse":"Mouse","touch":"Touch"}},"topics":[{"slug":"whats-new","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Waxa cusub ee 0.9","summary":"Akhri dherarka mitir, sentimitir ama millimitir, aagga metric-ka oo m2 ah oo leh aagga darbiga, diyaarka miisaanka 1:75 iyo 1:150, unitiyada miisaanka iyo heerkulka, Qaanso oo leh toban habood, iyo live cursors, Raac iyo liiska dadka.","section":"start","order":5,"keywords":["waxa cusub","what's new","sheekada isbeddelada","changelog","0.9","muuji dherarka sida","mitir","sentimitir","millimitir","metric","raac guud","unitiyo","unitiyada muuqaalka","m2","mitir laba jibbaaran","aagga darbiga","diyaarka miisaanka","1:75","1:150","miisaan","kiilo","kg","tonne","ton","lb","heerkul","celsius","fahrenheit","qaanso","habka qaansada","radius","live","cursors","raac","liiska dadka","class","tooltips","qaabeyn","isbeddel","0.8","0.8.1","nooca","astaamo cusub","tirinta oo dhan","legend","calaamada legend","set oo dhan","xusuusta qiimaha","shaqooyinka hore","shaqadii ugu dambaysay","qiimaha typical","bixiye","kaydka","waqtiga sugitaanka","backorder","liiska dalabka","yaraanta","panelka dhibaatooyinka","kaaliye","luuqadaha","aaladaha gelinta","safafka qalabka","dwg"],"headings":[{"id":"cusub","text":"Cusub","level":2},{"id":"akhri-dherarka-mitir-sentimitir-ama-millimitir","text":"Akhri dherarka mitir, sentimitir ama millimitir","level":3},{"id":"aagga-iyo-miisaanka-shaqada-metric-ka","text":"Aagga iyo miisaanka shaqada metric-ka","level":3},{"id":"qaanso-oo-leh-toban-habood","text":"Qaanso oo leh toban habood","level":3},{"id":"wada-shaqaynta","text":"Wada shaqaynta","level":3},{"id":"in-every-app","text":"In every app","level":2},{"id":"xaddidaadaha-runta-ah","text":"Xaddidaadaha runta ah","level":2},{"id":"dib-u-eeg-0-8-iyo-0-8-1","text":"Dib u eeg: 0.8 iyo 0.8.1","level":2},{"id":"cusub-2","text":"Cusub","level":3},{"id":"waxa-la-sixay-0-8-1","text":"Waxa la sixay 0.8.1","level":3},{"id":"weli-kuma-jirto-nooca-tan","text":"Weli kuma jirto nooca tan","level":3}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWaxaa kaga wada hadlaynaa waxa isbeddelay TakeoffCraft 0.9, marka la barbardhigo 0.8.1. Waa sii deyn yar oo app-kan: dherarka hadda waa la akhriyi karaa mitir, sentimitir ama millimitir, aagga iyo miisaankuna si sax ah ayay u raacaan metric-ka, Qaanso waxay leedahay toban siyaabood oo loo rinjiyeeyo. Fadhiyada toosan waxay sidoo kale muujiyaan qofka halka uu joogo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cusub\"\u003ECusub\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"akhri-dherarka-mitir-sentimitir-ama-millimitir\"\u003EAkhri dherarka mitir, sentimitir ama millimitir\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuji dherarka sida.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji dherarka sida\u003C/span\u003E oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaac Guud\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFut-inji\u003C/span\u003E, m, cm iyo mm. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaac Guud\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu isticmaalaa unitiga dherarka metric-ka ee aad calaamadisay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaalami\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnit-yada\u003C/span\u003E, iyo fut-inji marka mid aan la calaamadin. Waxa uu beddelaa sida dherarku u akhriyo xaashiga, safka xaaladda iyo panelada, oo ay ku jiraan dhererka, qotada, dhumucda iyo heerarka. Lambar aan unit lahayn oo lagu qoro sanduuqa dhererka waxaa loo akhrinayaa unitiga la muujiyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaal kaliya.\u003C/strong\u003E Qadarrada, kharashyada iyo dhoofinta waxaa laga xisaabiyaa dherarka saxda ah. Doorashada 1/16, 1/8 iyo 1/4 inch waxay muuqataa kaliya fut-inji. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/show-lengths-in-meters\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/show-lengths-in-meters\"\u003EMuuji dherarka mitir\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnitiyada miisaanka.\u003C/strong\u003E Walax \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQadar gacanta lagu qoray (naqshadaa la&#039;aan)\u003C/span\u003E waxay hadda ku jiri kartaa lb, TON, kg ama t, waxaana lagu qiimayn karaa unit kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeerkulka.\u003C/strong\u003E Walax kasta waxay leedahay goob ikhtiyaari ah oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeerkulka\u003C/span\u003E ah oo ku jirta tafatiraha walaxda, oo lagu qoro digrii C ama F. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji heerkulka sida\u003C/span\u003E ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu bixiyaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaac Guud\u003C/span\u003E, °C ama °F.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"aagga-iyo-miisaanka-shaqada-metric-ka\"\u003EAagga iyo miisaanka shaqada metric-ka\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAagga m2 naqshadda.\u003C/strong\u003E Aag la cabbiray walax metric ah hadda waxay ku qortaa m2 calaamadda naqshadda iyo panelka calaamadaha sidoo kale, halkii SF; wuxuu u dhowdahay waxa ku qoran shaxanka. Xeerku waa m2 marka walaxda lagu qiimeeyo metric ama dherarka lagu muujiyo m, cm ama mm, iyo SF haddii kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAagga darbiga.\u003C/strong\u003E Walax xariiq ah oo leh dhererka ayaa sidoo kale muujinaysa aagga darbiga (dherer x joog) liiska Walaxaha iyo safka qoraalka hoosta shaxanka qadarka walax walax.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDiyaarka miisaanka 1:75 iyo 1:150.\u003C/strong\u003E Waxay ku jiraan liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiyaar\u003C/span\u003E ee kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E, oo hadda leedahay 32 miisaan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/scale-presets\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/scale-presets\"\u003EDiyaarka miisaanka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"qaanso-oo-leh-toban-habood\"\u003EQaanso oo leh toban habood\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaanso\u003C/span\u003E la shido (badhanka qalabka sare ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), sanduuq \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHabka qaansada\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo baxaa safka xaashiga: Saddex-Barbar, Bilow, Dhexe, Dhammaad, Bilow, Dhexe, Xagal, Bilow, Dhexe, Dherer, Bilow, Dhammaad, Xagal, Bilow, Dhammaad, Jihada, Bilow, Dhammaad, Radius, Dhexe, Bilow, Dhammaad, Dhexe, Bilow, Xagal iyo Dhexe, Bilow, Dherer. Xagal, dherer, radius iyo jihada waxa la riixi karaa ama lagu qori karaa. Waxay ku shaqeysaa safafka toosan, aagga iyo jarista. Faylasha la kaydiyay ka hor 0.9 isla sidaas ayay furmaan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/draw-arcs-ten-methods\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/draw-arcs-ten-methods\"\u003EQaansooyin toban habood\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"wada-shaqaynta\"\u003EWada shaqaynta\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EArag cursors-ka kale.\u003C/strong\u003E Fadhiga Live, mid kasta oo ka mid ah wuxuu muujiyaa dhibcihiisa xaashiga oo leh magacyadiisa iyo midabkiisa, iyo sanduuq jajab ah oo ku wareegsan calaamadaha uu xulay. Dadka xaashi kale joogaa waxa lagu liistaa magaca xaashigaas. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/work-live\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/work-live\"\u003EWada shaqee Live\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERaac qof, iyo liiska dadka.\u003C/strong\u003E Badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDadka\u003C/span\u003E ee fadhiga Live wuxuu liisayaa qof kasta qalabka uu isticmaalo, xaashiga uu joogo, iyo waqtiga ugu dambeeyay ee tafatiray. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaac\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa aragtaadaas la socota, martiqaadaha ayaa isticmaali kara \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dalbo dhammaan inay i raacaan\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/follow-a-teammate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/follow-a-teammate\"\u003ERaac saaxiibka fadhiga Live\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"in-every-app\"\u003EIn every app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETooltips iyo tilmaamaha bilowga.\u003C/strong\u003E Qoraalka hover-ka waa Bootstrap tooltip, tilmaamaha bilowga waa la xidhi karaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELiisaska tab-ka ee soo-jeedinta.\u003C/strong\u003E Safka tab-ka panel-ka oo aan ku habboonayn wuu soo jeediyaa halkii uu ka jari lahaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECinwaanka tab-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Tab-ka browser-ka wuxuu akhrinayaa \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;document&gt; - TakeoffCraft | CadCraft\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaabeyn.\u003C/strong\u003E Liiska qaabeynta ku jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E waa drop-down wuxuuna muujinayaa qaabeynta la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELuuqad.\u003C/strong\u003E Luuqada aad doorato hadda waxay gaadhaa ereyada bogga laftiisa ku daabacan, sida New, Open iyo Save. Luuqadaha aan Ingiriisi ahayn waa qabyo ilaa dad ku hadla luuqadda ay akhriyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaddidaadaha-runta-ah\"\u003EXaddidaadaha runta ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuujinta dherarka, unitiyada miisaanka iyo heerkulka iyo diyaarradii cusbaa waxa tijaabiyay tijaabooyin iyo bogga. Dhammaan panelada unit kasta looma hubin gacanta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiiska dadka looma hubin gacanta fasal dhab ah oo macallimiin iyo arday.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELuuqadaha aan Ingiriisi ahayn waa qabyo mashiinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInstallers-ka Windows lama saxeexin (More info, ka dibna Run anyway). Sawirka diskiga Mac lama bixin (midig-riix, ka dibna Open).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-eeg-0-8-iyo-0-8-1\"\u003EDib u eeg: 0.8 iyo 0.8.1\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaa kaga wada hadlaynaa waxa isbeddelay TakeoffCraft 0.8 (la sii daayay 2026-11-01) iyo 0.8.1 (2026-11-02), marka la barbardhigo 0.7. Legend-ka calaamadda waxa hadda la tiri karaa set oo dhan marka hal mar, shaqo cusub waxay ka bilaabi kartaa qiimaha shaqooyinkaaga hore, oo xisaabintana waxa lagu hubin karaa kaydka bixiyaha. 0.8.1 waa sii deyn sixitaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cusub-2\"\u003ECusub\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETiri wax kasta oo ku jira set-ka\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESanduuq legend mar keliya.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiri wax kasta\u003C/span\u003E ee qalabka sare wuxuu akhrinayaa legend calaamadeed: jiid sanduuq calaamadaha iyo magacyada lagu qoro dhinaciisa. Calaamad kasta waxa lagu liistaa sawirkeeda iyo magaciisa, magacuna wuxuu noqdaa magaca walaxda. Kuwa aadan doonin ka saar, ka dibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiri xaashiyada N\u003C/span\u003E. Safka wuxuu muujiyaa xaashiga la raadinayo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu joojiyaa socodka, bogguna wuu sii shaqeynayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhammaan xaashiyada hal socod.\u003C/strong\u003E Calaamad kasta waxa lagu tiraa xaashi kasta oo furan. Xaashi loo rinjiyeeyay miisaan kale waxa lagu raadiyaa miisaankaas, calaamadaha waxa laga helaa xagal kasta oo toosan. Calaamadaha legend-ka laftiisa lagama tiro xaashigiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEegis ka hor intaan wax lagu dhicin.\u003C/strong\u003E Tirada kasta waxay leedahay xiriir xaashi kasta (&quot;E-103: 4&quot;) oo tagaya xaashigaas. Guji sanduuq si aad uga baxdo, ku guji mar kale si aad u soo celiso. Heerka isbarbardhigga (50% ilaa 100%) wuxuu kaliya shaandhaynayaa waxa la helay; ma jiro raadin dib loo sameeyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar N calaamadood\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa walax tiro ah calaamad kasta, calaamad calaamad kasta oo la helay. Magaca walax tiro oo horeba kuu jirta waa dib loo isticmaalaa. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu dib u qaadaa walaxda iyo calaamadaha oo dhan. Waxa aad aqbasho waxa kaloo lagu daraa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaxa la baray\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadaha xagal kasta.\u003C/strong\u003E Calaamad \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAstaamaha xagal kasta\u003C/span\u003E ka hor inta aadan tirin si aad u hesho calaamadaha loo rogay xagal aan toosan. Raadintu markaas wuxuu calaamad kasta u rogaa 15 darajo kasta, calaamad aan wareeg ahayn waxay qaadan kartaa ilaa lix jeer wakhti dheer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxa ay tahay.\u003C/strong\u003E Isbarbardhig calaamadaha fudud oo ku salaysan xaashiyadaada, oo aan moodel tababarnayn, wax kastana kumbuyuutarkaaga ma ka baxo. Set ka 200 xaashi oo la sameeyay, wuxuu qaadday 9.4 ilbiriqsi dhammaantiis Chrome ee desktop degdeg ah; set-yada dhabta ah way ka daahaan doonaan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-everything\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-everything\"\u003ETiri wax kasta set-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXusuusta qiimaha shaqooyinkaaga hore\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETakeoffCraft wuu xasuustaa qiimahaaga.\u003C/strong\u003E Marka aad xisaabinta kaydiso, walax kasta oo qiimaysan oo la isticmaalay waa la xasuustaa magac iyo nooc: qiimaha agabka, qiimaha shaqada, qashinka iyo unit-ka. 12 shaqo ugu dambeeya ayaa loo hayaa magac kasta. Waxay ku kaydsan tahay kombiyuutarkan dhinaca kaydka qiimaha Library, marna kuma jirto fayl xisaabin, waxna looma dirayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBilow xisaabin cusub qiimaha ka soo qaad.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiimayaasha\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare wuxuu muujiyaa, walax kasta, qiimaha shaqada ugu dambeeya, qiimaha caadiga ah iyo kala duwanaanshaha. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal kii ugu dambaysay\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal caadiga\u003C/span\u003E waxay qiimeeyaan hal walax, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiimee N walax aan qiimo lahayn xusuusta\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu buuxiyaa walax kasta oo aan qiimo lahayn. Isticmaal kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShaqooyinka hore.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa bar tirin hore…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu xasuustaa walaxda qiimaysan ee xisaabin kaydsan (.json).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEeg, beddel, illow.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax walba oo xusuusan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liisayaa magac kasta; badhanka qashinka wuxuu illoobiyaa mid, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENadiifi qiimaha oo dhan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu illoobiyaa dhammaan. Demi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXasuso qiimayaasha markaan tirin kaydiyo\u003C/span\u003E si aad joojiso. Qiimaha halkii unit-ka lagu qiimeeyo marna lagama dhigo walax lagu qiimeeyo dherer. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/price-memory\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/price-memory\"\u003EXusuusta qiimaha shaqooyinkaaga hore\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydka bixiyaha iyo waqtiga sugitaanka\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHubi liiska bixiyaha.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBixin\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare wuxuu qaataa liiska kaydka bixiyaha (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar fayl bixiye…\u003C/span\u003E), CSV ama miiska xisaabta, wuxuuna hubiyaa waxa xisaabintu u baahan tahay, iyo qashinka, marka la barbardhigo. Ilaa shan fayl ayaa la kaydiyaa. Waxba lama dirayo, bixiyaha weydiinna ma jiro: adigu fayl keenta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxa uu sheegayaa.\u003C/strong\u003E Walaxaha yaraanta marka hore ayay yimaadaan: &quot;Yaraanta 120 EA&quot;, &quot;Waqtiga sugitaanka 21 maalmood&quot;, &quot;On backorder&quot;, &quot;Unitigu way kala duwan yahay&quot;, &quot;Ma jiro tirada kaydka&quot; ama &quot;Kaydka waa jiraa&quot;. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaqtiga ugu dheer ee la doonayo (maalmo)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka bilaabmaa 14.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELiiska dalabka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELiiska dalabka (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo dejiyaa walaxaha yaraanta, tirada ay yaraatay, bixiyaha iyo waqtiga sugitaanka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQiimayaasha u gudba Library.\u003C/strong\u003E Haddii faylku leeyo qiimo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiimayaasha Maktabadda\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dejiyaa qiimaha agabka mid kasta oo Library ah oo magac iyo unit isku mid ah. Dib u qiimee Library si aad xisaabinta ugu soo celiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPanelka dhibaatooyinka.\u003C/strong\u003E Yaraanta waa digniin, waqtiga dheer waa qoraal, waxaana ku jira &quot;Kaydka bixiyaha&quot;. Waad aqbali kartaa sabab, sababtaasna waa la kaydiyaa xisaabinta. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/supplier-stock\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/supplier-stock\"\u003EHubi kaydka bixiyaha iyo waqtiga sugitaanka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaaliyayaasha AI\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQalab dhammaantood.\u003C/strong\u003E Marka kaaliyayaasha la ogolaado \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E, kaaliyuhu wuxuu akhrin karaa legend (\u003Ccode\u003Elegend_open\u003C/code\u003E), wuxuu socodsiin karaa tirinta (\u003Ccode\u003Elegend_count_start\u003C/code\u003E, ka dibna \u003Ccode\u003Elegend_count_status\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Elegend_count_result\u003C/code\u003E) wuxuuna ku dari karaa (\u003Ccode\u003Elegend_count_add\u003C/code\u003E, oo hore u eegi karaa). Wuxuu akhrin karaa qiimaha la xasuusto (\u003Ccode\u003Eprices_list\u003C/code\u003E) wuxuuna walaxda ka qiimayn karaa (\u003Ccode\u003Eprices_apply\u003C/code\u003E, oo hore u eegi karaa), wuxuuna akhrin karaa hubinta bixiyaha (\u003Ccode\u003Esupply_check\u003C/code\u003E). Ku darista fayl bixiye waxa uu adigu sameynaysaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/use-with-ai-assistants\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/use-with-ai-assistants\"\u003EIsticmaal TakeoffCraft kaaliye AI ah\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhammaan appsyada\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELuuqadaha.\u003C/strong\u003E Shan iyo konton luuqadood oo wadar ah; toban ayaa cusub (Lithuanian, Latvian, Bosnian, Marathi, Telugu, Albanian, Afrikaans, Filipino, Swahili iyo Uzbek). Luuqadaha aan Ingiriisi ahayn waa qabyo mashiinka ilaa dad ku hadla luuqadda ay akhriyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAaladaha gelinta.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaalami\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAaladaha gelinta\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dejiyaa waxa trackpad, badhanka dhinaca ee mouse, qalin, 3D mouse, controller-ka ciyaarta ama controller-ka MIDI ay sameeyaan, app kasta ama mid keliya. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/input-devices\" data-topic=\"basics/input-devices\"\u003EIsticmaal trackpad, 3D mouse ama controller\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafafka qalabka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESafafka qalabka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu bixiyaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELafmeyso\u003C/span\u003E (bilowga), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E2 safka\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E1 safka\u003C/span\u003E; kooxaha aan ku habboonayn waxay u dhaqaaqaan dhinac. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHabee panelada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPanelka dhibaatooyinka.\u003C/strong\u003E Panelka wadaagga ah ee digniinta iyo qoraalada hadda wuxuu leeyahay hubinta kaydka bixiyaha oo sare, oo ku dhaaftay hubinta kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAdd-ons.\u003C/strong\u003E Add-ons waxay raacaan liiska account-kaaga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/addons-basics\" data-topic=\"basics/addons-basics\"\u003EAdd-ons iyo liiska account-kaaga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu xidh AI-gaaga.\u003C/strong\u003E CadCraft Studio waa xarunta: ku xidh kaaliyahaaga mar keliya dhammaan siddeed appsyada. Studio ma lahan AI gaar ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"waxa-la-sixay-0-8-1\"\u003EWaxa la sixay 0.8.1\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybta classes ee DWG.\u003C/strong\u003E Qaybta classes ee faylka DWG waxa loo akhriyay nooc khalad ah. Taas waa la sixay TakeoffCraft, iyo afar app oo kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStudio wuu beddeli karaa luuqadda isagoo socda.\u003C/strong\u003E Hore, Studio iyo nooceeda la xidhay waxay ahaayeen Ingiriisi kaliya. Tani looma tijaabin desktop-ka dhammaan platform-yada; sheeg haddii luuqadda aanay isbeddelin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"weli-kuma-jirto-nooca-tan\"\u003EWeli kuma jirto nooca tan\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELama saxeexin koodka.\u003C/strong\u003E Windows way digi karaa, Mac-ka markii ugu horeysay midig-riix oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E. Dukaamada store-ka (Microsoft Store, Google Play, App Store) waa la hakiyay, dhismaha iPad iyo iPhone looma dib u dhisin 0.8.1.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECusboonaysiinta Studio.\u003C/strong\u003E Installer-ka Windows iyo xirmooyinka Linux maalin kasta ayay hubiyaan, oo marka hore way weydiiyaan. Zip-ka portable-ka kaliya ayuu sheegaa, macOS iyo APK-du isma cusboonaysiiyaan. .dmg-ka macOS ee 0.8 wuxuu raacayaa sii deynta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu xidh AI-gaaga.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku xidhid hal-guji oo ka dhex jira Studio, connector-ka martiqaadka ah ee AI ee browser-ka, furaha API-gaaga oo ka dhex jira Studio, iyo xirmada MCP ee la daabacay lama ballan qaadayo nooca tan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETirinta wax kasta.\u003C/strong\u003E Waxay u baahan tahay calaamado loo rinjiyeeyay sida ay ku jirtaan legend-ka, calaamad ay ku jirto derbi ama xariiq dheer ayaa laga dhici karaa. Calaamadaha la rogay lama helo, xaashi aan miisaan lahayn oo lagu rinjiyeeyay cabbir kale waxa lagu raadiyaa cabbirka legend-ka. Hubi raadinta xaashiga koowaad ka hor intaadan kuwa kale isku halayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydka bixiyaha.\u003C/strong\u003E Tirooyinka kaydka waxay la mid yihiin faylka aad ku darto oo keliya. Hubinta ma weydiiso bixiye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELuuqadaha.\u003C/strong\u003E Tamil app bar-ka wuu dhacaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa kale oo dhan waxaa laga akhrin karaa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E. Sii deynta ka horreysa, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/whats-new-0-7\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/whats-new-0-7\"\u003EWaxa cusub ee 0.7\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxaa kaga wada hadlaynaa waxa isbeddelay TakeoffCraft 0.9, marka la barbardhigo 0.8.1. Waa sii deyn yar oo app-kan: dherarka hadda waa la akhriyi karaa mitir, sentimitir ama millimitir, aagga iyo miisaankuna si sax ah ayay u raacaan metric-ka, Qaanso waxay leedahay toban siyaabood oo loo rinjiyeeyo. Fadhiyada toosan waxay sidoo kale muujiyaan qofka halka uu joogo. Cusub Akhri dherarka mitir, sentimitir ama millimitir Muuji dherarka sida. Dejinta › TakeoffCraft wuxuu leeyahay Muuji dherarka sida oo leh Raac Guud, Fut-inji, m, cm iyo mm. Raac Guud wuxuu isticmaalaa unitiga dherarka metric-ka ee aad calaamadisay Dejinta › Caalami › Unit-yada, iyo fut-inji marka mid aan la calaamadin. Waxa uu beddelaa sida dherarku u akhriyo xaashiga, safka xaaladda iyo panelada, oo ay ku jiraan dhererka, qotada, dhumucda iyo heerarka. Lambar aan unit lahayn oo lagu qoro sanduuqa dhererka waxaa loo akhrinayaa unitiga la muujiyay. Muuqaal kaliya. Qadarrada, kharashyada iyo dhoofinta waxaa laga xisaabiyaa dherarka saxda ah. Doorashada 1/16, 1/8 iyo 1/4 inch waxay muuqataa kaliya fut-inji. Eeg Muuji dherarka mitir. Unitiyada miisaanka. Walax Qadar gacanta lagu qoray (naqshadaa la'aan) waxay hadda ku jiri kartaa lb, TON, kg ama t, waxaana lagu qiimayn karaa unit kasta. Heerkulka. Walax kasta waxay leedahay goob ikhtiyaari ah oo Heerkulka ah oo ku jirta tafatiraha walaxda, oo lagu qoro digrii C ama F. Muuji heerkulka sida ee Dejinta › TakeoffCraft wuxuu bixiyaa Raac Guud, °C ama °F. Aagga iyo miisaanka shaqada metric-ka Aagga m2 naqshadda. Aag la cabbiray walax metric ah hadda waxay ku qortaa m2 calaamadda naqshadda iyo panelka calaamadaha sidoo kale, halkii SF; wuxuu u dhowdahay waxa ku qoran shaxanka. Xeerku waa m2 marka walaxda lagu qiimeeyo metric ama dherarka lagu muujiyo m, cm ama mm, iyo SF haddii kale. Aagga darbiga. Walax xariiq ah oo leh dhererka ayaa sidoo kale muujinaysa aagga darbiga (dherer x joog) liiska Walaxaha iyo safka qoraalka hoosta shaxanka qadarka walax walax. Diyaarka miisaanka 1:75 iyo 1:150. Waxay ku jiraan liiska Diyaar ee kooxda Miisaan, oo hadda leedahay 32 miisaan. Eeg Diyaarka miisaanka. Qaanso oo leh toban habood Inta Qaanso la shido (badhanka qalabka sare ama R), sanduuq Habka qaansada wuxuu soo baxaa safka xaashiga: Saddex-Barbar, Bilow, Dhexe, Dhammaad, Bilow, Dhexe, Xagal, Bilow, Dhexe, Dherer, Bilow, Dhammaad, Xagal, Bilow, Dhammaad, Jihada, Bilow, Dhammaad, Radius, Dhexe, Bilow, Dhammaad, Dhexe, Bilow, Xagal iyo Dhexe, Bilow, Dherer. Xagal, dherer, radius iyo jihada waxa la riixi karaa ama lagu qori karaa. Waxay ku shaqeysaa safafka toosan, aagga iyo jarista. Faylasha la kaydiyay ka hor 0.9 isla sidaas ayay furmaan. Eeg Qaansooyin toban habood. Wada shaqaynta Arag cursors-ka kale. Fadhiga Live, mid kasta oo ka mid ah wuxuu muujiyaa dhibcihiisa xaashiga oo leh magacyadiisa iyo midabkiisa, iyo sanduuq jajab ah oo ku wareegsan calaamadaha uu xulay. Dadka xaashi kale joogaa waxa lagu liistaa magaca xaashigaas. Eeg Wada shaqee Live. Raac qof, iyo liiska dadka. Badhanka Dadka ee fadhiga Live wuxuu liisayaa qof kasta qalabka uu isticmaalo, xaashiga uu joogo, iyo waqtiga ugu dambeeyay ee tafatiray. Raac wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa aragtaadaas la socota, martiqaadaha ayaa isticmaali kara Ku dalbo dhammaan inay i raacaan. Eeg Raac saaxiibka fadhiga Live. In every app Tooltips iyo tilmaamaha bilowga. Qoraalka hover-ka waa Bootstrap tooltip, tilmaamaha bilowga waa la xidhi karaa. Liisaska tab-ka ee soo-jeedinta. Safka tab-ka panel-ka oo aan ku habboonayn wuu soo jeediyaa halkii uu ka jari lahaa. Cinwaanka tab-ka. Tab-ka browser-ka wuxuu akhrinayaa \u003Cdocument\u003E - TakeoffCraft | CadCraft. Qaabeyn. Liiska qaabeynta ku jira Dejinta waa drop-down wuxuuna muujinayaa qaabeynta la doortay. Luuqad. Luuqada aad doorato hadda waxay gaadhaa ereyada bogga laftiisa ku daabacan, sida New, Open iyo Save. Luuqadaha aan Ingiriisi ahayn waa qabyo ilaa dad ku hadla luuqadda ay akhriyaan. Xaddidaadaha runta ah Muujinta dherarka, unitiyada miisaanka iyo heerkulka iyo diyaarradii cusbaa waxa tijaabiyay tijaabooyin iyo bogga. Dhammaan panelada unit kasta looma hubin gacanta. Liiska dadka looma hubin gacanta fasal dhab ah oo macallimiin iyo arday. Luuqadaha aan Ingiriisi ahayn waa qabyo mashiinka. Installers-ka Windows lama saxeexin (More info, ka dibna Run anyway). Sawirka diskiga Mac lama bixin (midig-riix, ka dibna Open). Dib u eeg: 0.8 iyo 0.8.1 Waxaa kaga wada hadlaynaa waxa isbeddelay TakeoffCraft 0.8 (la sii daayay 2026-11-01) iyo 0.8.1 (2026-11-02), marka la barbardhigo 0.7. Legend-ka calaamadda waxa hadda la tiri karaa set oo dhan marka hal mar, shaqo cusub waxay ka bilaabi kartaa qiimaha shaqooyinkaaga hore, oo xisaabintana waxa lagu hubin karaa kaydka bixiyaha. 0.8.1 waa sii deyn sixitaan. Cusub Tiri wax kasta oo ku jira set-ka Sanduuq legend mar keliya. Tiri wax kasta ee qalabka sare wuxuu akhrinayaa legend calaamadeed: jiid sanduuq calaamadaha iyo magacyada lagu qoro dhinaciisa. Calaamad kasta waxa lagu liistaa sawirkeeda iyo magaciisa, magacuna wuxuu noqdaa magaca walaxda. Kuwa aadan doonin ka saar, ka dibna dooro Tiri xaashiyada N. Safka wuxuu muujiyaa xaashiga la raadinayo, Jooji wuxuu joojiyaa socodka, bogguna wuu sii shaqeynayaa. Dhammaan xaashiyada hal socod. Calaamad kasta waxa lagu tiraa xaashi kasta oo furan. Xaashi loo rinjiyeeyay miisaan kale waxa lagu raadiyaa miisaankaas, calaamadaha waxa laga helaa xagal kasta oo toosan. Calaamadaha legend-ka laftiisa lagama tiro xaashigiisa. Eegis ka hor intaan wax lagu dhicin. Tirada kasta waxay leedahay xiriir xaashi kasta (\"E-103: 4\") oo tagaya xaashigaas. Guji sanduuq si aad uga baxdo, ku guji mar kale si aad u soo celiso. Heerka isbarbardhigga (50% ilaa 100%) wuxuu kaliya shaandhaynayaa waxa la helay; ma jiro raadin dib loo sameeyo. Hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo. Ku dar N calaamadood wuxuu sameeyaa walax tiro ah calaamad kasta, calaamad calaamad kasta oo la helay. Magaca walax tiro oo horeba kuu jirta waa dib loo isticmaalaa. Ctrl+Z wuxuu dib u qaadaa walaxda iyo calaamadaha oo dhan. Waxa aad aqbasho waxa kaloo lagu daraa Waxa la baray. Calaamadaha xagal kasta. Calaamad Astaamaha xagal kasta ka hor inta aadan tirin si aad u hesho calaamadaha loo rogay xagal aan toosan. Raadintu markaas wuxuu calaamad kasta u rogaa 15 darajo kasta, calaamad aan wareeg ahayn waxay qaadan kartaa ilaa lix jeer wakhti dheer. Waxa ay tahay. Isbarbardhig calaamadaha fudud oo ku salaysan xaashiyadaada, oo aan moodel tababarnayn, wax kastana kumbuyuutarkaaga ma ka baxo. Set ka 200 xaashi oo la sameeyay, wuxuu qaadday 9.4 ilbiriqsi dhammaantiis Chrome ee desktop degdeg ah; set-yada dhabta ah way ka daahaan doonaan. Eeg Tiri wax kasta set-ka. Xusuusta qiimaha shaqooyinkaaga hore TakeoffCraft wuu xasuustaa qiimahaaga. Marka aad xisaabinta kaydiso, walax kasta oo qiimaysan oo la isticmaalay waa la xasuustaa magac iyo nooc: qiimaha agabka, qiimaha shaqada, qashinka iyo unit-ka. 12 shaqo ugu dambeeya ayaa loo hayaa magac kasta. Waxay ku kaydsan tahay kombiyuutarkan dhinaca kaydka qiimaha Library, marna kuma jirto fayl xisaabin, waxna looma dirayo. Bilow xisaabin cusub qiimaha ka soo qaad. Qiimayaasha qalabka sare wuxuu muujiyaa, walax kasta, qiimaha shaqada ugu dambeeya, qiimaha caadiga ah iyo kala duwanaanshaha. Isticmaal kii ugu dambaysay ama Isticmaal caadiga waxay qiimeeyaan hal walax, Qiimee N walax aan qiimo lahayn xusuusta wuxuu buuxiyaa walax kasta oo aan qiimo lahayn. Isticmaal kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo. Shaqooyinka hore. Ka bar tirin hore… wuxuu xasuustaa walaxda qiimaysan ee xisaabin kaydsan (.json). Eeg, beddel, illow. Wax walba oo xusuusan wuxuu liisayaa magac kasta; badhanka qashinka wuxuu illoobiyaa mid, Nadiifi qiimaha oo dhan wuxuu illoobiyaa dhammaan. Demi Xasuso qiimayaasha markaan tirin kaydiyo si aad joojiso. Qiimaha halkii unit-ka lagu qiimeeyo marna lagama dhigo walax lagu qiimeeyo dherer. Eeg Xusuusta qiimaha shaqooyinkaaga hore. Kaydka bixiyaha iyo waqtiga sugitaanka Hubi liiska bixiyaha. Bixin qalabka sare wuxuu qaataa liiska kaydka bixiyaha (Ku dar fayl bixiye…), CSV ama miiska xisaabta, wuxuuna hubiyaa waxa xisaabintu u baahan tahay, iyo qashinka, marka la barbardhigo. Ilaa shan fayl ayaa la kaydiyaa. Waxba lama dirayo, bixiyaha weydiinna ma jiro: adigu fayl keenta. Waxa uu sheegayaa. Walaxaha yaraanta marka hore ayay yimaadaan: \"Yaraanta 120 EA\", \"Waqtiga sugitaanka 21 maalmood\", \"On backorder\", \"Unitigu way kala duwan yahay\", \"Ma jiro tirada kaydka\" ama \"Kaydka waa jiraa\". Waqtiga ugu dheer ee la doonayo (maalmo) wuxuu ka bilaabmaa 14. Liiska dalabka. Liiska dalabka (CSV) wuxuu soo dejiyaa walaxaha yaraanta, tirada ay yaraatay, bixiyaha iyo waqtiga sugitaanka. Qiimayaasha u gudba Library. Haddii faylku leeyo qiimo, Qiimayaasha Maktabadda wuxuu dejiyaa qiimaha agabka mid kasta oo Library ah oo magac iyo unit isku mid ah. Dib u qiimee Library si aad xisaabinta ugu soo celiso. Panelka dhibaatooyinka. Yaraanta waa digniin, waqtiga dheer waa qoraal, waxaana ku jira \"Kaydka bixiyaha\". Waad aqbali kartaa sabab, sababtaasna waa la kaydiyaa xisaabinta. Eeg Hubi kaydka bixiyaha iyo waqtiga sugitaanka. Kaaliyayaasha AI Qalab dhammaantood. Marka kaaliyayaasha la ogolaado Dejinta, kaaliyuhu wuxuu akhrin karaa legend (legend_open), wuxuu socodsiin karaa tirinta (legend_count_start, ka dibna legend_count_status iyo legend_count_result) wuxuuna ku dari karaa (legend_count_add, oo hore u eegi karaa). Wuxuu akhrin karaa qiimaha la xasuusto (prices_list) wuxuuna walaxda ka qiimayn karaa (prices_apply, oo hore u eegi karaa), wuxuuna akhrin karaa hubinta bixiyaha (supply_check). Ku darista fayl bixiye waxa uu adigu sameynaysaa. Eeg Isticmaal TakeoffCraft kaaliye AI ah. Dhammaan appsyada Luuqadaha. Shan iyo konton luuqadood oo wadar ah; toban ayaa cusub (Lithuanian, Latvian, Bosnian, Marathi, Telugu, Albanian, Afrikaans, Filipino, Swahili iyo Uzbek). Luuqadaha aan Ingiriisi ahayn waa qabyo mashiinka ilaa dad ku hadla luuqadda ay akhriyaan. Aaladaha gelinta. Dejinta › Caalami › Aaladaha gelinta wuxuu dejiyaa waxa trackpad, badhanka dhinaca ee mouse, qalin, 3D mouse, controller-ka ciyaarta ama controller-ka MIDI ay sameeyaan, app kasta ama mid keliya. Eeg Isticmaal trackpad, 3D mouse ama controller. Safafka qalabka. Dejinta › Guud › Safafka qalabka wuxuu bixiyaa Lafmeyso (bilowga), 2 safka iyo 1 safka; kooxaha aan ku habboonayn waxay u dhaqaaqaan dhinac. Eeg Habee panelada. Panelka dhibaatooyinka. Panelka wadaagga ah ee digniinta iyo qoraalada hadda wuxuu leeyahay hubinta kaydka bixiyaha oo sare, oo ku dhaaftay hubinta kale. Add-ons. Add-ons waxay raacaan liiska account-kaaga. Eeg Add-ons iyo liiska account-kaaga. Ku xidh AI-gaaga. CadCraft Studio waa xarunta: ku xidh kaaliyahaaga mar keliya dhammaan siddeed appsyada. Studio ma lahan AI gaar ah. Waxa la sixay 0.8.1 Qaybta classes ee DWG. Qaybta classes ee faylka DWG waxa loo akhriyay nooc khalad ah. Taas waa la sixay TakeoffCraft, iyo afar app oo kale. Studio wuu beddeli karaa luuqadda isagoo socda. Hore, Studio iyo nooceeda la xidhay waxay ahaayeen Ingiriisi kaliya. Tani looma tijaabin desktop-ka dhammaan platform-yada; sheeg haddii luuqadda aanay isbeddelin. Weli kuma jirto nooca tan Lama saxeexin koodka. Windows way digi karaa, Mac-ka markii ugu horeysay midig-riix oo dooro Fur. Dukaamada store-ka (Microsoft Store, Google Play, App Store) waa la hakiyay, dhismaha iPad iyo iPhone looma dib u dhisin 0.8.1. Cusboonaysiinta Studio. Installer-ka Windows iyo xirmooyinka Linux maalin kasta ayay hubiyaan, oo marka hore way weydiiyaan. Zip-ka portable-ka kaliya ayuu sheegaa, macOS iyo APK-du isma cusboonaysiiyaan. .dmg-ka macOS ee 0.8 wuxuu raacayaa sii deynta. Ku xidh AI-gaaga. Ku xidhid hal-guji oo ka dhex jira Studio, connector-ka martiqaadka ah ee AI ee browser-ka, furaha API-gaaga oo ka dhex jira Studio, iyo xirmada MCP ee la daabacay lama ballan qaadayo nooca tan. Tirinta wax kasta. Waxay u baahan tahay calaamado loo rinjiyeeyay sida ay ku jirtaan legend-ka, calaamad ay ku jirto derbi ama xariiq dheer ayaa laga dhici karaa. Calaamadaha la rogay lama helo, xaashi aan miisaan lahayn oo lagu rinjiyeeyay cabbir kale waxa lagu raadiyaa cabbirka legend-ka. Hubi raadinta xaashiga koowaad ka hor intaadan kuwa kale isku halayn. Kaydka bixiyaha. Tirooyinka kaydka waxay la mid yihiin faylka aad ku darto oo keliya. Hubinta ma weydiiso bixiye. Luuqadaha. Tamil app bar-ka wuu dhacaa. Waxa kale oo dhan waxaa laga akhrin karaa Weli lama dhisin. Sii deynta ka horreysa, eeg Waxa cusub ee 0.7.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"whats-new-0-7","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Waxa cusub ee 0.7 (hore)","summary":"Naqshadaha DWG iyo DXF waxay furmaan sida xaashiyo leh miisaankooda, tirooyin iyo dherer saxda ah oo naqshadda laftiisa ka timid, qiimaha tartanka qandaraasleyda la doortay oo ah qiimaha xidhmada, memo tartan oo qiimo la xidhay, awoodaha kaaliyaha ee naqshadaha, iyo USD oo ka timid muuqaalka hubinta 3D.","section":"start","order":6,"keywords":["waxa cusub 0.7","nooca hore","sii deynta","sheekada isbeddelada","isbeddel","0.7","nooca","astaamo cusub","dwg","dxf","naqshad","qaabab","model space","miisaanka naqshadda","tirinta naqshadda","cad count","bloogyo","bloogyo dynamic","sifooyin","lakabyo","xref","naqshad xiriirsan","cabbir naqshadda","polilayn","hatch","PDF calaamadsan","qiimaha tartanka","isticmaal tartan","dir tartan","memo tartan","tartan xidhan","furitaanka tartanka","tartan dambe","diiwaanka qandaraasleyda","csv","kaaliye","mcp","usd","usdz","unitiyo","liisaska unitiyada","kooban","panels","dialogs","Portuguese"],"headings":[{"id":"cusub","text":"Cusub","level":2},{"id":"naqshadaha-dwg-iyo-dxf","text":"Naqshadaha DWG iyo DXF","level":3},{"id":"tirooyin-iyo-dherer-saxda-ah-naqshadda","text":"Tirooyin iyo dherer saxda ah naqshadda","level":3},{"id":"tartanka","text":"Tartanka","level":3},{"id":"kaaliyayaasha-ai","text":"Kaaliyayaasha AI","level":3},{"id":"usd","text":"USD","level":3},{"id":"dhammaan-appsyada","text":"Dhammaan appsyada","level":2},{"id":"weli-kuma-jirto-nooca-tan","text":"Weli kuma jirto nooca tan","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWaxaan kaga wada hadlaynaa waxa isbeddelay TakeoffCraft 0.7, marka la barbardhigo 0.6. Hadda naqshadaha waxay furmaan sida ay yihiin, iyada oo aan marka hore PDF loo daabicin, xirmada tartanka waxaa loo diri karaa qandaraasleyda, oo waxaa dib loo soo celin karaa iyada oo qiimaysan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cusub\"\u003ECusub\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"naqshadaha-dwg-iyo-dxf\"\u003ENaqshadaha DWG iyo DXF\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFur naqshad sida xaashiyo.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur qorshayaasha\u003C/span\u003E ee kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama soo rid faylasha) wuxuu qaataa naqshadaha DWG iyo DXF oo ay ag yaallaan PDF-yada. Model space iyo layout kasta waxay noqdaan xaashiyo ku jira liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaashiyada\u003C/span\u003E, xisaabintuna way daboolaysaa naqshadaha iyo PDF-yada wada jir. Waxba lama soo rarin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\"\u003EFur naqshadda DWG ama DXF\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMiisaanka waxa ka imanaya naqshadda.\u003C/strong\u003E Layout wuxuu bilowdaa miisaanka viewport-ka ugu weyn, oo loo magacaabaa sida diyaar haddii ay tahay, sida 1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;. Model wuxuu bilowdaa unitiyada naqshadda. Naqshad aan unitiyo lahayn waxay tidhi &quot;No scale&quot; ilaa aad cabbirto. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiyaar\u003C/span\u003E ayaa weli ka mudan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing#the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-hash=\"the-scale\"\u003EMiisaanka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELakabyada iyo naqshadaha xiriirsan.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELakabyada\u003C/span\u003E ee safka xaashiga wuxuu muujiyaa ama qariyaa lakabyada naqshadda. Lakabyada faylku damiyay ama qaboojiyay waxay bilowdaan qarsan oo lama tiriyo ilaa aad doorato. Naqshad xiriirsan (xref) oo furan oo ku xiran naqshadda martida waa la rinjiyeeyaa oo la tiriyaa meesha ay ku jirto; ilaa ay furan tahay, safka xaaladda wuxuu sheegaa waxa maqan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing#layers\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-hash=\"layers\"\u003ELakabyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPDF calaamadsan wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa naqshad.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofin\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF calaamadsan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu marka hore naqshadda xaashiyadeeda calaamadsan PDF ugu rinjiyeeyaa, si nuqulku u muujiyo calaamadaadii iyo sharaxaaddu tallaabo daabacaad la&#039;aan. Waxa uu ku rinjiyeeyaa madow ama midabka naqshadda, iyada oo aan miiskii midabka daabacaadda la isticmaalin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate#a-marked-pdf\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-hash=\"a-marked-pdf\"\u003EPDF calaamadsan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"tirooyin-iyo-dherer-saxda-ah-naqshadda\"\u003ETirooyin iyo dherer saxda ah naqshadda\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETiri waxa naqshaddu sheegayso inuu jiro.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirinta CAD\u003C/span\u003E ee safka xaashiga wuxuu tiraa bloog magac ahaan (oo ay ku jiraan bloogyo dhex jira, gobolada bloogyada dynamic-ka iyo safafka bloogyada), wax kasta oo nooc keliya ah lakab dushiisa, ama qoraal ama qiime sifo ah. Wuxuu tiraa waxa xaashigu muujinayo ama naqshadda oo dhan mar keliya. Calaamadaha ku darista waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo, tirinta mar kale waxay ku darraa kaliya waxa cusub. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/span\u003E wuu sii jiraa PDF-yada iyo calaamadaha aan bloog ahayn. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003ETirinta naqshadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbir xariiqyada naqshadda laftiisa.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshadda ka cabbir\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaataa xariiqyada, qaansooyinka, polilaynnada, goobooyinka iyo hatch-yada aad riixdo ama daaqad ku xulato, calaamad u ah walax dherer ama aag ah. Qaansooyinka, bulge-yada iyo godadka hatch-ka waxay soo baxaan sax ah; ellipse-yada iyo spline-yada waxa lagu cabbiraa xariiqyo yaryar, safka ayaa sheegaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\"\u003ECabbirka naqshadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"tartanka\"\u003ETartanka\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsticmaal tartanka qandaraasleyda sida qiimaha xirmada.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofin\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXirmooyinka tartanka iyo isku-simaynta…\u003C/span\u003E, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal\u003C/span\u003E tartan kasta. Walxaha xirmada way ku sii jiraan tiro, hal safka \u003Cstrong\u003ETartanka la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qaadaa qiimaha, walxaha uu tartanku ka reebay way ku sii jiraan kharashkaaga, dhaqaale-dhimista, faa&#039;iidada iyo bond-ka waxay ku dhacaan. Beddelka tartan kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo; buug-shaqeedka iyo warbixinta tartanka way qaadaan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-leveling#use-a-bid-as-the-packages-price\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-leveling\" data-hash=\"use-a-bid-as-the-packages-price\"\u003EIsticmaal tartan sida qiimaha xirmada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDir xirmada tartanka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDir tartan…\u003C/span\u003E hoosta xirmada wuxuu iimayl u dirayaa qandaraasley kasta xiriir ah bog aan account u baahnayn: waxay arkaan scope-ka iyo xaashiyada PDF ahaan, waxay qoraan qiime safka kasta ama calaamadiyaan inaysan ku jirin, ku daraan qoraallo iyo ilaa saddex fayl, ama diidan karaan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHel qiimayaasha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo geliyaa waxa soo noqday xaashiga isku-simaynta, oo lagu calaamadiyay \u003Cstrong\u003Eweb\u003C/strong\u003E. Diritaanku waxa uu u furan yahay kaliya account-yada CadCraft team-ku awoodeeyay intii tijaabinta socota (eeg hoose). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-invitations\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-invitations\"\u003EDir xirmada tartan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQarsan ilaa furitaanka.\u003C/strong\u003E Qiimaha wuxuu ku sii jiri karaa qarsan ilaa waqti furitaan oo aad dejisay: ilaa markaas qofna qiimaha ma arko, adiguna mid ma aragto. Furitaanka, tartan kasta si isku mid ah ayuu u muuqdaa, tartanka ka dib waqtiga dhamaadka la calaamadiyo daahay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-invitations#sealed-bids-and-the-opening\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-invitations\" data-hash=\"sealed-bids-and-the-opening\"\u003ETartan qarsan iyo furitaanka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDiiwaanka qandaraasleyda.\u003C/strong\u003E Account-kaaga getcadcraft.com wuxuu hayaa xiriirrada shirkad kasta, shaqooyinka, jawaabaha ahlaanta, iyo taariikhaha daboolka iyo shatiga (lagu calaamadiyo mar kasta oo ka dhaafay ama uu ku jiro 30 maalmood gudahood), iyo tartamadooda hore. Waxaad ka soo geli kartaa oo ku dhoofin kartaa CSV, waxaana laga dooran karaa marka aad dirto xirmo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-invitations#on-the-website\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-invitations\" data-hash=\"on-the-website\"\u003EWebsaydhka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"kaaliyayaasha-ai\"\u003EKaaliyayaasha AI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaaliyayaasha ayaa ku dari kara xisaabinta.\u003C/strong\u003E Marka \u003Cstrong\u003ETafatir\u003C/strong\u003E la calaamadiyo, kaaliyahaaga ayaa ku dari kara walxaha (\u003Ccode\u003Eitems_add\u003C/code\u003E) iyo cabbiraa safafka, aagga iyo tirooyinka xaashi (\u003Ccode\u003Emarks_add\u003C/code\u003E; dherer iyo aag kaliya xaashi miisaan leh), wac kasta oo ah hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka kaaliyaha ee naqshadaha.\u003C/strong\u003E DWG ama DXF furan, kaaliyaha wuxuu liis gareyn karaa xaashiyadeeda iyo waxa la tiri karo, wuxuu tiri karaa saxda ah, wuxuu ku dari karaa calaamadaha tirada, wuxuuna ka cabbiri karaa geometry-ga naqshadda. TakeoffCraft la&#039;aanteed, MCP server-ka CadCraft wuxuu naqshad u furaa xisaabin cusub oo kaydiyaa, \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft count\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu tiraa amarka qoraalka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/use-with-ai-assistants#what-an-assistant-can-ask-for\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/use-with-ai-assistants\" data-hash=\"what-an-assistant-can-ask-for\"\u003EWaxa kaaliye uu weydiisan karo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"usd\"\u003EUSD\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalka hubinta 3D ee USD.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXidhmada USD (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E oo ag yaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGLB\u003C/span\u003E muuqaalka hubinta 3D wuxuu qoraa derbi kasta, dabaq, roobaan, tiir tiro iyo safka mid kasta sida walax u gaar ah, oo loo magacaabo walaxdeeda, oo qadarkeeda ku jira, mitir ku qoran. Kaaliyuhu wuu dhoofin karaa sidoo kale (\u003Ccode\u003Eusd_export\u003C/code\u003E). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/usd\"\u003EDhoofi muuqaalka hubinta 3D ee USD\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhammaan-appsyada\"\u003EDhammaan appsyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnitiyada.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnit-yada\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay liis kasta oo dherer, aag, mug, xagal iyo dhalaalid, oo leh cabbirrada saxda ah ee qeexidda unitiyadaas (US survey foot waa unit u gaar ah). Demi unitiyada aadan waligood isticmaalin, waxay ka baxaan liisaska unitiyada; calaamadee mid, shaqada cusubi waxay ku bilowdaa. Fayl kastaa wuxuu hayaa unitiyadiisa. TakeoffCraft liisaska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnug\u003C/span\u003E ee walxaha way raacaan badhamada, walax cusub waxay ku bilowdaa unitiga dherer ama aagga la calaamadiyay, safka-saqafka (SQ), acre iyo hectare waa unitiyo aag cusub, sanduuqa dherer wuxuu aqbalaa calaamada unit kasta, sida \u003Ccode\u003E3 yd\u003C/code\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/unit-lists\" data-topic=\"basics/unit-lists\"\u003EUnitiyada, qiimaha qoran iyo liisaska unitiyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaabeyn kaabaan leh iyo panel-yo la dhigo.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirka qaabeynta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKooban\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu wax badan ku dhigaa shaashadda (shaashadaha taabashada iyo telefoonada way ilaalinayaan badhamadooda waaweyn). Panel kasta oo dhinac ah wuxuu leeyahay safka cinwaan yar: jiid si aad u xidho ama u xoreeyo, u dhig dhinaca panel kale si aad u wadaagto hal qaab sida tabs, ku xidh si uu u ruxo gees, ama qari oo ku soo celi geesta. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels#make-the-layout-denser\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\" data-hash=\"make-the-layout-denser\"\u003EHabee panelada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDialogs way dhaqaaqaan.\u003C/strong\u003E Dialog jiid safka cinwaanka si uu uga baxo naqshadda; wuxuu ku soo noqdaa meeshii aad ka tagtay. Laba jeer riix safka cinwaanka si dib dhexda loogu geeyo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels#move-a-dialog\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\" data-hash=\"move-a-dialog\"\u003EDialog u wareeji\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETusaalooyinka kaaliyayaasha AI.\u003C/strong\u003E Toban codsi oo shaqo ah kaaliyahaaga (naqshad nadiifi, set rinji, naqshadaha hubi, moodelka su&#039;aal weydii, xisaabinta wadar, qiimayso kala duwanaanshaha qaybta…), mid kasta oo leh qalabka uu isticmaalo iyo ogolaanshaha uu u baahan yahay, oo mid kasta tijaabooyinkeenu dib u socodsiiyaan. Appsyadu ma leeyihiin AI. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/assistants-recipes\" data-topic=\"basics/assistants-recipes\"\u003ETusaalooyinka kaaliyayaasha AI\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELuuqadaha.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cstrong\u003EPortuguês (Portugal)\u003C/strong\u003E waa cusub \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELuuqad\u003C/span\u003E. Iyada, \u003Cstrong\u003EPortuguês (Brasil)\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EEspañol (México)\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EBahasa Indonesia\u003C/strong\u003E hadda waxay leeyihiin ereyada appsyada oo dhan, sida qabyo aan weli dadka ku hadla luuqadda ay dib u eegin. Bogagga caawinta waxay ku jiraan Ingiriisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sheegaa sababta cusboonaysiinta hubinta fashilmay (faylka nidaamkaaga weli ma jiro, shabakad la&#039;aan, saxeexa xun) halkii uu ku dhihi lahaa &quot;Done&quot;, wuxuuna joojiyaa soo celinta kaarka Waxa cusub ee aad xidhay ilaa ay jirto sii deyn cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-kuma-jirto-nooca-tan\"\u003EWeli kuma jirto nooca tan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E0.7 lama saxeexin koodka.\u003C/strong\u003E Saxeexa, iyo xirmada Microsoft Store, waxay u guureen 0.8 sababtoo ah xaqiijinta shatiga weli ma imaan. Hubi SHA-256 ee fayl kasta getcadcraft.com/download. Windows-ka haddii SmartScreen joojiyo installer-ka, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore info\u003C/span\u003E, ka dibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun anyway\u003C/span\u003E. Mac-ka, markii ugu horeysay, midig-riix CadCraft Studio oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E. CadCraft Studio weli kuma jiro dukaanka appsyada, weliba ma jiro dhismo iPad ama iPhone.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiisaska zaaviyada iyo dhalaalidka ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnitiyada\u003C/span\u003E waa la kaydiyaa, laakiin weli qaar sanduuq ma akhrinayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMartida tartanka waxa laga xidhay akoonada badankood.\u003C/strong\u003E Intii la tijaabinayo awoodda, iimaylka qandaraasleyda dibadda waxa uu ka baxayaa kaliya account-yada CadCraft team-ku awoodeeyay. Bogagga qandaraasleyda way shaqeeyaan martiqaadyada hore loo diray oo dhan. Kuwa kale: soo deji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScope CSV\u003C/span\u003E, iimayl u dir naftaada, ku qor qiimayaasha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaaqadda CadCraft Studio ma diri karto martiyada tartanka weli: waxay ku leedahay isticmaal TakeoffCraft browser-ka. Furista xisaabin leh codsiyo la diray, isku-simaynta iyo doorashada tartan way shaqeeyaan Studio-ga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu darista, shahaadooyinka shatiga, sahan shaqo oo qandaraasley kasta saxeexo, iyo xusuusin toos ah ka hor taariikhda daboolka dhacdo ma la dhisin. Tartan la doortay ma qiimayn dhagaxa alternate-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaqshadaha: miiska style-ka daabacaadda iyo faylasha CTB lama dabaqo, DXF binary waa la diidaa (ku kaydi ASCII DXF ama DWG), naqshadaha xiriirsan waxay raadinayaan kaliya faylasha furan magaca faylka, PDF underlays, sawirro iyo OLE objects naqshadda ma la rinjiyeeyo ama la tiriyo. Tirooyinka iyo miisaanka waxa lagu hubiyay naqshadaha tijaabada, weli ma aha naqshadaha shaqo dhab ah oo laga furay barnaamijka ay ka sameysay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaaliyuhu wuxuu ku dari karaa walxaha iyo calaamadaha laakiin ma dhaqdhaqaajin, ma beddelin, mana tirtiri karo calaamadaha horeba u jiray.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa kale oo dhan waxaa laga akhrin karaa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxaan kaga wada hadlaynaa waxa isbeddelay TakeoffCraft 0.7, marka la barbardhigo 0.6. Hadda naqshadaha waxay furmaan sida ay yihiin, iyada oo aan marka hore PDF loo daabicin, xirmada tartanka waxaa loo diri karaa qandaraasleyda, oo waxaa dib loo soo celin karaa iyada oo qiimaysan. Cusub Naqshadaha DWG iyo DXF Fur naqshad sida xaashiyo. Fur qorshayaasha ee kooxda Fayl (Ctrl+O, ama soo rid faylasha) wuxuu qaataa naqshadaha DWG iyo DXF oo ay ag yaallaan PDF-yada. Model space iyo layout kasta waxay noqdaan xaashiyo ku jira liiska Xaashiyada, xisaabintuna way daboolaysaa naqshadaha iyo PDF-yada wada jir. Waxba lama soo rarin. Eeg Fur naqshadda DWG ama DXF. Miisaanka waxa ka imanaya naqshadda. Layout wuxuu bilowdaa miisaanka viewport-ka ugu weyn, oo loo magacaabaa sida diyaar haddii ay tahay, sida 1/2\" = 1'-0\". Model wuxuu bilowdaa unitiyada naqshadda. Naqshad aan unitiyo lahayn waxay tidhi \"No scale\" ilaa aad cabbirto. Hagaaji, Hubi iyo Diyaar ayaa weli ka mudan. Eeg Miisaanka. Lakabyada iyo naqshadaha xiriirsan. Lakabyada ee safka xaashiga wuxuu muujiyaa ama qariyaa lakabyada naqshadda. Lakabyada faylku damiyay ama qaboojiyay waxay bilowdaan qarsan oo lama tiriyo ilaa aad doorato. Naqshad xiriirsan (xref) oo furan oo ku xiran naqshadda martida waa la rinjiyeeyaa oo la tiriyaa meesha ay ku jirto; ilaa ay furan tahay, safka xaaladda wuxuu sheegaa waxa maqan. Eeg Lakabyada. PDF calaamadsan wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa naqshad. Dhoofin › PDF calaamadsan wuxuu marka hore naqshadda xaashiyadeeda calaamadsan PDF ugu rinjiyeeyaa, si nuqulku u muujiyo calaamadaadii iyo sharaxaaddu tallaabo daabacaad la'aan. Waxa uu ku rinjiyeeyaa madow ama midabka naqshadda, iyada oo aan miiskii midabka daabacaadda la isticmaalin. Eeg PDF calaamadsan. Tirooyin iyo dherer saxda ah naqshadda Tiri waxa naqshaddu sheegayso inuu jiro. Tirinta CAD ee safka xaashiga wuxuu tiraa bloog magac ahaan (oo ay ku jiraan bloogyo dhex jira, gobolada bloogyada dynamic-ka iyo safafka bloogyada), wax kasta oo nooc keliya ah lakab dushiisa, ama qoraal ama qiime sifo ah. Wuxuu tiraa waxa xaashigu muujinayo ama naqshadda oo dhan mar keliya. Calaamadaha ku darista waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo, tirinta mar kale waxay ku darraa kaliya waxa cusub. Tirin otomaatig ah wuu sii jiraa PDF-yada iyo calaamadaha aan bloog ahayn. Eeg Tirinta naqshadda. Cabbir xariiqyada naqshadda laftiisa. Naqshadda ka cabbir wuxuu qaataa xariiqyada, qaansooyinka, polilaynnada, goobooyinka iyo hatch-yada aad riixdo ama daaqad ku xulato, calaamad u ah walax dherer ama aag ah. Qaansooyinka, bulge-yada iyo godadka hatch-ka waxay soo baxaan sax ah; ellipse-yada iyo spline-yada waxa lagu cabbiraa xariiqyo yaryar, safka ayaa sheegaa. Eeg Cabbirka naqshadda. Tartanka Isticmaal tartanka qandaraasleyda sida qiimaha xirmada. Ku Dhoofin › Xirmooyinka tartanka iyo isku-simaynta…, dooro Isticmaal tartan kasta. Walxaha xirmada way ku sii jiraan tiro, hal safka Tartanka la doortay wuxuu qaadaa qiimaha, walxaha uu tartanku ka reebay way ku sii jiraan kharashkaaga, dhaqaale-dhimista, faa'iidada iyo bond-ka waxay ku dhacaan. Beddelka tartan kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo; buug-shaqeedka iyo warbixinta tartanka way qaadaan. Eeg Isticmaal tartan sida qiimaha xirmada. Dir xirmada tartanka. Dir tartan… hoosta xirmada wuxuu iimayl u dirayaa qandaraasley kasta xiriir ah bog aan account u baahnayn: waxay arkaan scope-ka iyo xaashiyada PDF ahaan, waxay qoraan qiime safka kasta ama calaamadiyaan inaysan ku jirin, ku daraan qoraallo iyo ilaa saddex fayl, ama diidan karaan. Hel qiimayaasha wuxuu soo geliyaa waxa soo noqday xaashiga isku-simaynta, oo lagu calaamadiyay web. Diritaanku waxa uu u furan yahay kaliya account-yada CadCraft team-ku awoodeeyay intii tijaabinta socota (eeg hoose). Eeg Dir xirmada tartan. Qarsan ilaa furitaanka. Qiimaha wuxuu ku sii jiri karaa qarsan ilaa waqti furitaan oo aad dejisay: ilaa markaas qofna qiimaha ma arko, adiguna mid ma aragto. Furitaanka, tartan kasta si isku mid ah ayuu u muuqdaa, tartanka ka dib waqtiga dhamaadka la calaamadiyo daahay. Eeg Tartan qarsan iyo furitaanka. Diiwaanka qandaraasleyda. Account-kaaga getcadcraft.com wuxuu hayaa xiriirrada shirkad kasta, shaqooyinka, jawaabaha ahlaanta, iyo taariikhaha daboolka iyo shatiga (lagu calaamadiyo mar kasta oo ka dhaafay ama uu ku jiro 30 maalmood gudahood), iyo tartamadooda hore. Waxaad ka soo geli kartaa oo ku dhoofin kartaa CSV, waxaana laga dooran karaa marka aad dirto xirmo. Eeg Websaydhka. Kaaliyayaasha AI Kaaliyayaasha ayaa ku dari kara xisaabinta. Marka Tafatir la calaamadiyo, kaaliyahaaga ayaa ku dari kara walxaha (items_add) iyo cabbiraa safafka, aagga iyo tirooyinka xaashi (marks_add; dherer iyo aag kaliya xaashi miisaan leh), wac kasta oo ah hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo. Qalabka kaaliyaha ee naqshadaha. DWG ama DXF furan, kaaliyaha wuxuu liis gareyn karaa xaashiyadeeda iyo waxa la tiri karo, wuxuu tiri karaa saxda ah, wuxuu ku dari karaa calaamadaha tirada, wuxuuna ka cabbiri karaa geometry-ga naqshadda. TakeoffCraft la'aanteed, MCP server-ka CadCraft wuxuu naqshad u furaa xisaabin cusub oo kaydiyaa, cadcraft count wuxuu tiraa amarka qoraalka. Eeg Waxa kaaliye uu weydiisan karo. USD Muuqaalka hubinta 3D ee USD. Xidhmada USD (.usdz) oo ag yaal GLB muuqaalka hubinta 3D wuxuu qoraa derbi kasta, dabaq, roobaan, tiir tiro iyo safka mid kasta sida walax u gaar ah, oo loo magacaabo walaxdeeda, oo qadarkeeda ku jira, mitir ku qoran. Kaaliyuhu wuu dhoofin karaa sidoo kale (usd_export). Eeg Dhoofi muuqaalka hubinta 3D ee USD. Dhammaan appsyada Unitiyada. Dejinta › Guud › Unit-yada wuxuu leeyahay liis kasta oo dherer, aag, mug, xagal iyo dhalaalid, oo leh cabbirrada saxda ah ee qeexidda unitiyadaas (US survey foot waa unit u gaar ah). Demi unitiyada aadan waligood isticmaalin, waxay ka baxaan liisaska unitiyada; calaamadee mid, shaqada cusubi waxay ku bilowdaa. Fayl kastaa wuxuu hayaa unitiyadiisa. TakeoffCraft liisaska Unug ee walxaha way raacaan badhamada, walax cusub waxay ku bilowdaa unitiga dherer ama aagga la calaamadiyay, safka-saqafka (SQ), acre iyo hectare waa unitiyo aag cusub, sanduuqa dherer wuxuu aqbalaa calaamada unit kasta, sida 3 yd. Eeg Unitiyada, qiimaha qoran iyo liisaska unitiyada. Qaabeyn kaabaan leh iyo panel-yo la dhigo. Dejinta › Guud › Cabbirka qaabeynta › Kooban wuxuu wax badan ku dhigaa shaashadda (shaashadaha taabashada iyo telefoonada way ilaalinayaan badhamadooda waaweyn). Panel kasta oo dhinac ah wuxuu leeyahay safka cinwaan yar: jiid si aad u xidho ama u xoreeyo, u dhig dhinaca panel kale si aad u wadaagto hal qaab sida tabs, ku xidh si uu u ruxo gees, ama qari oo ku soo celi geesta. Eeg Habee panelada. Dialogs way dhaqaaqaan. Dialog jiid safka cinwaanka si uu uga baxo naqshadda; wuxuu ku soo noqdaa meeshii aad ka tagtay. Laba jeer riix safka cinwaanka si dib dhexda loogu geeyo. Eeg Dialog u wareeji. Tusaalooyinka kaaliyayaasha AI. Toban codsi oo shaqo ah kaaliyahaaga (naqshad nadiifi, set rinji, naqshadaha hubi, moodelka su'aal weydii, xisaabinta wadar, qiimayso kala duwanaanshaha qaybta…), mid kasta oo leh qalabka uu isticmaalo iyo ogolaanshaha uu u baahan yahay, oo mid kasta tijaabooyinkeenu dib u socodsiiyaan. Appsyadu ma leeyihiin AI. Eeg Tusaalooyinka kaaliyayaasha AI. Luuqadaha. Português (Portugal) waa cusub Dejinta › Guud › Luuqad. Iyada, Português (Brasil), Español (México) iyo Bahasa Indonesia hadda waxay leeyihiin ereyada appsyada oo dhan, sida qabyo aan weli dadka ku hadla luuqadda ay dib u eegin. Bogagga caawinta waxay ku jiraan Ingiriisi. CadCraft Studio wuxuu sheegaa sababta cusboonaysiinta hubinta fashilmay (faylka nidaamkaaga weli ma jiro, shabakad la'aan, saxeexa xun) halkii uu ku dhihi lahaa \"Done\", wuxuuna joojiyaa soo celinta kaarka Waxa cusub ee aad xidhay ilaa ay jirto sii deyn cusub. Weli kuma jirto nooca tan 0.7 lama saxeexin koodka. Saxeexa, iyo xirmada Microsoft Store, waxay u guureen 0.8 sababtoo ah xaqiijinta shatiga weli ma imaan. Hubi SHA-256 ee fayl kasta getcadcraft.com/download. Windows-ka haddii SmartScreen joojiyo installer-ka, dooro More info, ka dibna Run anyway. Mac-ka, markii ugu horeysay, midig-riix CadCraft Studio oo dooro Fur. CadCraft Studio weli kuma jiro dukaanka appsyada, weliba ma jiro dhismo iPad ama iPhone. Liisaska zaaviyada iyo dhalaalidka ee Unitiyada waa la kaydiyaa, laakiin weli qaar sanduuq ma akhrinayo. Martida tartanka waxa laga xidhay akoonada badankood. Intii la tijaabinayo awoodda, iimaylka qandaraasleyda dibadda waxa uu ka baxayaa kaliya account-yada CadCraft team-ku awoodeeyay. Bogagga qandaraasleyda way shaqeeyaan martiqaadyada hore loo diray oo dhan. Kuwa kale: soo deji Scope CSV, iimayl u dir naftaada, ku qor qiimayaasha. Daaqadda CadCraft Studio ma diri karto martiyada tartanka weli: waxay ku leedahay isticmaal TakeoffCraft browser-ka. Furista xisaabin leh codsiyo la diray, isku-simaynta iyo doorashada tartan way shaqeeyaan Studio-ga. Ku darista, shahaadooyinka shatiga, sahan shaqo oo qandaraasley kasta saxeexo, iyo xusuusin toos ah ka hor taariikhda daboolka dhacdo ma la dhisin. Tartan la doortay ma qiimayn dhagaxa alternate-ka. Naqshadaha: miiska style-ka daabacaadda iyo faylasha CTB lama dabaqo, DXF binary waa la diidaa (ku kaydi ASCII DXF ama DWG), naqshadaha xiriirsan waxay raadinayaan kaliya faylasha furan magaca faylka, PDF underlays, sawirro iyo OLE objects naqshadda ma la rinjiyeeyo ama la tiriyo. Tirooyinka iyo miisaanka waxa lagu hubiyay naqshadaha tijaabada, weli ma aha naqshadaha shaqo dhab ah oo laga furay barnaamijka ay ka sameysay. Kaaliyuhu wuxuu ku dari karaa walxaha iyo calaamadaha laakiin ma dhaqdhaqaajin, ma beddelin, mana tirtiri karo calaamadaha horeba u jiray. Waxa kale oo dhan waxaa laga akhrin karaa Weli lama dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"getting-started","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Bilow TakeoffCraft","summary":"Waa maxay TakeoffCraft, halka ay ku shaqeyso, iyo shayadaada ugu horreysa ee la cabbiray oo la qiimeeyay oo ka timid kooxda qorshayaasha PDF.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["bilow","xisaabinta ugu horreysa","bilow degdeg ah","hordhac","qiyaas kharash","xisaabinta qadarka","kooxda qorshayaasha","pdf"],"headings":[{"id":"halka-uu-ku-shaqeeyo","text":"Halka uu ku shaqeeyo","level":2},{"id":"xisaabintaadii-ugu-horreysay-ee-tallaabo-toban","text":"Xisaabintaadii ugu horreysay ee tallaabo toban","level":2},{"id":"waxa-xiga-ee-aad-akhrida","text":"Waxa xiga ee aad akhrida","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffCraft wuxuu cabbiraa kooxyada qorshayaasha, PDF-yada iyo naqshadaha DWG ama DXF, wuxuuna cabbiraha u beddelaa qiyaas qiimeysan. Waad furtaa faylasha (naqshad wuxuu si toos ah xisaabiyaa bloogyadiisa: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\"\u003EFur naqshad DWG ama DXF\u003C/a\u003E), xaashi kasta miisaan ayaad siisaa (naqshad kasta miisaankeeda ayay leedahay), samaysaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eshay\u003C/strong\u003E (nooc darbi, dhamaad dhul, qalab), oo ku dhufo xaashiyada si aad u xisaabiso. Tirooyinka, kharashyada iyo wadarta mashruucu way cusbooneeyaan markaad sii socoto. Qiyaasta waxaad u dhoofin kartaa jadwal iyo nuqul PDF-yada oo xisaabintaadu lagu sawiray.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad xisaabin ku sameysay barnaamijyo kale, akhri \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/coming-from\"\u003EKa imaanka barnaamijyada xisaabinta kale\u003C/a\u003E xiga. Qaar ka mid ah waxyaabaha halkan si kale ayay u shaqeeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"halka-uu-ku-shaqeeyo\"\u003EHalka uu ku shaqeeyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffCraft wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa browserka webka. Furo TakeoffCraft shaashaddu waa diyaar isla markiiba; ma jiro wax la rakibo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPDF-yadaadu kumbiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sii jiraan.\u003C/strong\u003E Browserku ayaa furaa oo ma la soo raro. Kaydinta waa soo dejin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWuxuu shaqeeyaa Chrome, Edge, Firefox iyo Safari ee hadda jira. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EBrowserrada iyo kumbiyuutarrada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWuxuu shaqeeyaa xidhiidh internet la&#039;aan markaad dooratid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E barta app-ka oo uu yidhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EShaqada khadka ka baxsan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaydinta cloud weli ma diyaar. Desktop app ahaan, TakeoffCraft wuxuu ku jiraa CadCraft Studio, oo leh todobada app ee kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xisaabintaadii-ugu-horreysay-ee-tallaabo-toban\"\u003EXisaabintaadii ugu horreysay ee tallaabo toban\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECasharkan wuxuu cabbiraa hal nooc darbi oo wuxuu qiimeeyaa. Wuxuu qaadanayaa dhowr daqiiqo qorshe kasta oo aad haysid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur qorshayaasha\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E ee toolbar-ka (ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), dooro PDF hal ama dhowr, oo dooro Fur. Waxaad sidoo kale ku riixi kartaa PDF-yada meel kasta bogga. Xaashiyada waxay ka muuqdaan bidix, xaashida ugu horreysay ayaa furma dhexda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaadi miisaanka la daabacay ee xaashida, inta ku jirta blockka cinwaanka ama hoos cinwaanka naqshadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiyaar\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro miisaankaas, tusaale \u003Ccode\u003E1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. Bar-ka hoose ee xaashida hadda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Miisaan 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi\u003C/span\u003E (ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) oo guji labada dhamaad ee cabbir daabacan naqshadda. Akhriska bar-ka hoose bidix wuxuu la mid noqonayaa cabbirka la daabacay. Haddii aanu la mid ahayn, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EDeji miisaanka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E ee midig, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShay cusub\u003C/span\u003E, ku qor magac sida \u003Ccode\u003EInterior wall type A\u003C/code\u003E, ka tag nooca oo ahaado \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXariiq (dherer)\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESocod\u003C/span\u003E toolbar-ka (ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji bilowga darbiga, kadibna xagal kasta oo ku xiga. Laba jeer guji, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama midig-guji si aad u dhammaysid socodka. Socodka waxaa lagu sawiraa midabka shayga, dhererkiisana wuxuu ku muuqdaa xiga shayga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETafatiraha shayga hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E, ku qor \u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoog\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0.85\u003C/code\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgab $/LF\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E1.20\u003C/code\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShaqada $/LF\u003C/span\u003E. Miiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirooyinka\u003C/span\u003E ee hoose wuxuu muujinayaa dhererka, agabka iyo shaqada oo la kordhiyay, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWadarta shaqada\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi xisaabinta\u003C/span\u003E (ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Browserkaagu wuxuu soo dejiyaa fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E. Wuxuu haystaa shayadaada, miisaankaaga iyo calaamadahaaga, wuxuuna dib ugu furmaa PDF-yadaas isku mid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofin\u003C/span\u003E toolbar-ka oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E si aad u soo dejiso qiyaasta jadwal ahaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u joojiso wixii aad sameynayso oo aad ugu noqoto qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ka noqdaa isbeddel kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-xiga-ee-aad-akhrida\"\u003EWaxa xiga ee aad akhrida\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/workspace\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/workspace\"\u003EShaashadda TakeoffCraft\u003C/a\u003E waxay magacaabaysaa qayb kasta oo daaqadda ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\"\u003EBilow xisaabin oo fur kooxda qorshayaasha\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu daboolayaa PDF-yo badan iyo liiska xaashiyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003ESamee shayada xisaabinta\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu sharaxayaa noocyada, unugyada, qashinka iyo qiimaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EIsku-dhisyada iyo qaacidooyinka\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu cabbir hal ah u beddelaa tiirar yaryar, lowxyo loox ah iyo wax ka badan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/keyboard\"\u003EKiiboodhka iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu liisankaa furayaasha oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"TakeoffCraft wuxuu cabbiraa kooxyada qorshayaasha, PDF-yada iyo naqshadaha DWG ama DXF, wuxuuna cabbiraha u beddelaa qiyaas qiimeysan. Waad furtaa faylasha (naqshad wuxuu si toos ah xisaabiyaa bloogyadiisa: eeg Fur naqshad DWG ama DXF), xaashi kasta miisaan ayaad siisaa (naqshad kasta miisaankeeda ayay leedahay), samaysaa shay (nooc darbi, dhamaad dhul, qalab), oo ku dhufo xaashiyada si aad u xisaabiso. Tirooyinka, kharashyada iyo wadarta mashruucu way cusbooneeyaan markaad sii socoto. Qiyaasta waxaad u dhoofin kartaa jadwal iyo nuqul PDF-yada oo xisaabintaadu lagu sawiray. Haddii aad xisaabin ku sameysay barnaamijyo kale, akhri Ka imaanka barnaamijyada xisaabinta kale xiga. Qaar ka mid ah waxyaabaha halkan si kale ayay u shaqeeyaan. Halka uu ku shaqeeyo TakeoffCraft wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa browserka webka. Furo TakeoffCraft shaashaddu waa diyaar isla markiiba; ma jiro wax la rakibo. PDF-yadaadu kumbiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sii jiraan. Browserku ayaa furaa oo ma la soo raro. Kaydinta waa soo dejin. Wuxuu shaqeeyaa Chrome, Edge, Firefox iyo Safari ee hadda jira. Eeg Browserrada iyo kumbiyuutarrada. Wuxuu shaqeeyaa xidhiidh internet la'aan markaad dooratid Kaydi khadka ka baxsan barta app-ka oo uu yidhi Khadka ka baxsan diyaar. Eeg Shaqada khadka ka baxsan. Kaydinta cloud weli ma diyaar. Desktop app ahaan, TakeoffCraft wuxuu ku jiraa CadCraft Studio, oo leh todobada app ee kale. Xisaabintaadii ugu horreysay ee tallaabo toban Casharkan wuxuu cabbiraa hal nooc darbi oo wuxuu qiimeeyaa. Wuxuu qaadanayaa dhowr daqiiqo qorshe kasta oo aad haysid. Dooro Fur qorshayaasha kooxda Fayl ee toolbar-ka (ama riix Ctrl+O), dooro PDF hal ama dhowr, oo dooro Fur. Waxaad sidoo kale ku riixi kartaa PDF-yada meel kasta bogga. Xaashiyada waxay ka muuqdaan bidix, xaashida ugu horreysay ayaa furma dhexda. Raadi miisaanka la daabacay ee xaashida, inta ku jirta blockka cinwaanka ama hoos cinwaanka naqshadda. Fur liiska Diyaar kooxda Miisaan oo dooro miisaankaas, tusaale 1/4\" = 1'-0\". Bar-ka hoose ee xaashida hadda wuxuu leeyahay \"Miisaan 1/4\" = 1'-0\"\". Dooro Hubi (ama riix D) oo guji labada dhamaad ee cabbir daabacan naqshadda. Akhriska bar-ka hoose bidix wuxuu la mid noqonayaa cabbirka la daabacay. Haddii aanu la mid ahayn, eeg Deji miisaanka. Panelka Walxaha ee midig, dooro Shay cusub, ku qor magac sida Interior wall type A, ka tag nooca oo ahaado Xariiq (dherer), kadibna dooro Ku dar. Dooro Socod toolbar-ka (ama riix L). Guji bilowga darbiga, kadibna xagal kasta oo ku xiga. Laba jeer guji, riix Enter ama midig-guji si aad u dhammaysid socodka. Socodka waxaa lagu sawiraa midabka shayga, dhererkiisana wuxuu ku muuqdaa xiga shayga. Tafatiraha shayga hoosta Walxaha, ku qor 9'-0\" Joog, 0.85 Agab $/LF iyo 1.20 Shaqada $/LF. Miiska Tirooyinka ee hoose wuxuu muujinayaa dhererka, agabka iyo shaqada oo la kordhiyay, iyo Wadarta shaqada. Dooro Kaydi xisaabinta (ama riix Ctrl+S). Browserkaagu wuxuu soo dejiyaa fayl .takeoff.json. Wuxuu haystaa shayadaada, miisaankaaga iyo calaamadahaaga, wuxuuna dib ugu furmaa PDF-yadaas isku mid. Fur menu-ga Dhoofin toolbar-ka oo dooro XLSX si aad u soo dejiso qiyaasta jadwal ahaan. Riix Esc si aad u joojiso wixii aad sameynayso oo aad ugu noqoto qalabka Dooro. Ctrl+Z wuxuu ka noqdaa isbeddel kasta. Waxa xiga ee aad akhrida Shaashadda TakeoffCraft waxay magacaabaysaa qayb kasta oo daaqadda ah. Bilow xisaabin oo fur kooxda qorshayaasha wuxuu daboolayaa PDF-yo badan iyo liiska xaashiyada. Samee shayada xisaabinta wuxuu sharaxayaa noocyada, unugyada, qashinka iyo qiimaha. Isku-dhisyada iyo qaacidooyinka wuxuu cabbir hal ah u beddelaa tiirar yaryar, lowxyo loox ah iyo wax ka badan. Kiiboodhka iyo mouse-ka wuxuu liisankaa furayaasha oo dhan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"workspace","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Shaashadda TakeoffCraft","summary":"Dalxiis ku saabsan daaqadda oo laga magacaabo shaashadda - toolbar-ka, liiska xaashiyada, xaashida, panelka Walxaha, miiska Tirooyinka iyo bar-ka xaaladda.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["shaashad","qaabeyn","ribbon","baadhaha mashruuca","toolbox","sanduuqa macluumaadka","toolbar","panelada","liiska xaashiyada","panelka walxaha","tirooyinka","bar-ka xaaladda","dalxiis","interface"],"headings":[{"id":"toolbar-ka","text":"Toolbar-ka","level":2},{"id":"xaashiyada-bidix","text":"Xaashiyada (bidix)","level":2},{"id":"xaashida-dhexda","text":"Xaashida (dhexda)","level":2},{"id":"walxaha-midig","text":"Walxaha (midig)","level":2},{"id":"tirooyinka-hoose","text":"Tirooyinka (hoose)","level":2},{"id":"bar-ka-xaaladda-hoose","text":"Bar-ka xaaladda (hoose)","level":2},{"id":"habayn-kale","text":"Habayn kale","level":2},{"id":"shaashad-buuxda-iyo-midabada","text":"Shaashad buuxda iyo midabada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffCraft wuxuu buuxiyaa daaqadda browserka hoosta app bar-ka CadCraft. Sare ilaa hoos iyo bidix ilaa midig:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQayb\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu u shaqeeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EApp bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESare-sare\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca app-ka, nooca, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu saabsan TakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaawimaad\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShaashad buuxda\u003C/span\u003E iyo kala-beddelka midabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWarqad\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodeel\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EToolbar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHoosta app bar-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmar kasta, kooxaha: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofin\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXisaabinta\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaal\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashiyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBidix\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBog kasta oo PDF kasta oo furan, sawirkiisa yar, miisaankiisa iyo tirada calaamadahiisa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashida\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBogga furan. Halkan ayaad cabbirta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWalxaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMidig\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShayada xisaabintaada, dejinta shayga la doortay, iyo calaamada la doortay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirooyinka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHoose\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirooyinka iyo kharashyada sida shayga ama xaashiga, iyo wadarta mashruuca.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBar-ka xaaladda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHoose-hoose\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirka toosan, fariimaha, talo 45°, iyo zoom-ka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"toolbar-ka\"\u003EToolbar-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhan kasta ku dhaji si aad u aragto waxa uu sameeyo iyo furayaasha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKooxda\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhamada\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusub\u003C/span\u003E (xisaabin faaruug), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur PDF-yada\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur xisaabinta\u003C/span\u003E (mashruuc \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi xisaabinta\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofin\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal menu: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF calaamadsan\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), iyo liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiyaar\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXisaabinta\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESocod\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAag\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaanso\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, badhan on/off), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa jar\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, on/off), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGod\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiri\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax badan\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGooy\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji meeshii\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENuqul\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro midna\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaal\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBogga buuxi\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBallaca buuxi\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabka aad isticmaalayso waa la riixay. Badhamada \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaanso\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa jar\u003C/span\u003E way riixan yihiin intay yihiin on.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaashiyada-bidix\"\u003EXaashiyada (bidix)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERaadi xaashiyada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu shaandheeyaa liiska magaca xaashiga, magaca faylka ama calaamadda bogga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXaashi kasta wuxuu muujiyaa sawir yar (la sawirayo markaad hoos u dhacayso), magaceeda, iyo miisaankeeda ama \u003Cstrong\u003EMiisaan ma jiro\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhinaca midig ee safka kasta wuxuu muujiyaa tirada calaamadaha xaashigaas. Shay la iftiimiyay ayaa hadda muujinaya tirada calaamadaha shayadaas ee xaashigaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji xaashi si aad u furto. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay u dhaqaajiyaan xaashiga xiga iyo kii hore liiska.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka xisaabintu daboosho PDF-yo aan furnayn, qoraal hoos liiska ayaa magacyadooda sheegaya. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003EKaydi oo dib u fur xisaabinta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMagacyada xaashiyada waxay ka imanayaan PDF-ka: calaamad bog ah sida \u003Ccode\u003EA-101\u003C/code\u003E ayaa noqonaysa magaca xaashiga. Bog aan calaamad lahayn waxa loo magacaabaa faylkiisa iyo lambarka bogga, sida &quot;Plans, bogga 3&quot;. Marka PDF-yo badan la furo, xaashiyada calaamadaysan waxay sidoo kale muujiyaan magaca faylka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaashida-dhexda\"\u003EXaashida (dhexda)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBarta hoose xaashida waxay tusaysaa magaca xaashiga iyo miisaankiisa, ama &quot;Weli miisaan ma jiro: dooro diyaar ah ama hagaaji&quot;. Badhamadeeda: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/span\u003E (marka app-kaas uu qaadi karo PDF-ka; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\"\u003EBilow xisaabin oo fur kooxda qorshayaasha\u003C/a\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBarbardhig\u003C/span\u003E (nooc hore oo xaashi ah oo ku dul yaal kan: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\"\u003EBarbardhig xaashi dib loo eegay\u003C/a\u003E), &quot;(n) la hubiyo&quot; (calaamado la calaamadeeyay, markay jiraan) iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003Earagtida hubinta 3D\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa hor intaan PDF la furin, dhexdu waxay muujinaysaa hagid gaaban oo shan tallaabo ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWheel-ka wuxuu zoom-gareeyaa meesha mouse-ka joogo. Jiid si aad u wareejiso. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/keyboard\"\u003EKiiboodhka iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkaad isticmaalayso \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/span\u003E, bar iyo badhamadiisa ayaa soo muuqda xaashida sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"walxaha-midig\"\u003EWalxaha (midig)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESare, liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAagga tartanka\u003C/span\u003E: dhismaha, dabaqa ama marxaladda calaamadaha cusub ku dhigmaan (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\"\u003EAagagga tartanka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShay cusub\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa foom yar: magac, nooc (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXariiq (dherer)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAag\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiri\u003C/span\u003E) iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiiska wuxuu muujinaa midabka shay kasta, astaamaha nooca, magaca iyo tirada. Guji shay si aad uga sawirto oo aad u iftiimiso calaamadaheeda xaashi kasta. Mar kale guji si aad u joojiso iftiiminta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta liiska, \u003Cstrong\u003EShay: (magac)\u003C/strong\u003E waa tafatiraha shayga: magaca, nooca, midabka, unugga, joogga ama qoto-dheerka, qashinka, qiimaha agabka iyo shaqada, qiyaasaha la cabbiray, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku-dhis\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003ESamee shayada xisaabinta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamada la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muuqdaa markaad dooratid calaamad: shayada ay tahay, xaashigeeda, qiyaasteeda, iyo badhamo sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar cut-out\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir calaamadda\u003C/span\u003E. Markii calaamado badan la doortay waxay noqotaa \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadaha la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E: intee shay kasta, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENuqul\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGooy\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir calaamadaha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETafatiraha shayga wuxuu ku dhammaadaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee shayga\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee nuqul shayga\u003C/span\u003E: shay ay wataan isku-dhiskiisa iyo kharashyada, laakiin calaamad la&#039;aan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKoobiyee, dhaji iyo nuqul calaamadaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tirooyinka-hoose\"\u003ETirooyinka (hoose)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESida shayba\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liisankaa shay kasta iyo qaybaha isku-dhiskiisa, oo leh tiro, qashin, qiimo iyo kharash ballaaran. Qashinka iyo qiimaha waxaad ku qori kartaa shaxda si toos ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESida xaashiga\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liisankaa tirada shay kasta xaashi kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDigniin ka bilaabata \u003Cstrong\u003EAan dhammaystirnayn:\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa soo muuqda markii wax ka maqan yihiin wadarta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWadarta shaqada\u003C/span\u003E waxay ku taal midig madasha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBadhanka fallaadha ee ugu midig wuxuu qariyaa ama muujinayaa shaxda si xaashida u helo meel ballaaran.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/read-quantities\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/read-quantities\"\u003EAkhri tirooyinka iyo qiyaasta kharashka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bar-ka-xaaladda-hoose\"\u003EBar-ka xaaladda (hoose)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMidig ilaa bidix: cabbirka toosan markaad sawirayso (dherer, aag, radius ama natiijada hubinta), sanduuqa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeli\u003C/span\u003E markaad ku qorayso dherer, fariimaha TakeoffCraft, digniinta &quot;Shift ku dhejiya 45°&quot; (ama &quot;Ku dhejiya 45°; Shift ayaa xagasha xorayso&quot; marka taas la daaro \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/a\u003E), badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu xidh\u003C/span\u003E (ku xidhka xariiqyada xaashida, wuu shaqeeyaa marka uu iftiimo; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), iyo boqolkiiba zoom-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkhri bar-ka xaaladda marka wax aan dhicin. TakeoffCraft halkaas ayuu ku sharaxaa sababta uu u diiday guji, tusaale &quot;Xaashidan wali miisaan ma leh&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"habayn-kale\"\u003EHabayn kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax walba oo kor ku xusan waa habaynta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft classic\u003C/span\u003E, bilowga. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaalami\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaabeynta\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu siinayaa laba kale; qalabka iyo furayaasha isku mid ah ayaa ku shaqeeya saddexdaba, dooritaanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft classic\u003C/span\u003E mar kale ayuu dib u soo celinayaa dhammaan xakamaynta meeshooda hore.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHabayn\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETakeoffCraft-ka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERibbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERibbon-ka xisaabinta qadarka\u003C/span\u003E sare (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003ELiiskyada, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E), bar ee qalabka socda, tab kasta oo xaashi ah oo aad furto (Model-ka iyo layouts-ka naqshadda waa xaashiyo sidoo kale), oo leh diyaarka miisaanka iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBogga buuxi\u003C/span\u003E hoosta xaashida. Panelka bidix wuxuu haystaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/span\u003E (shayga, qoraalka ama calaamada la doortay) oo ka sarreeya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBaaraha xisaabinta qadarka\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaashiyada\u003C/span\u003E (guji mid si uu tab-ka uga furto), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaaladaha\u003C/span\u003E (guji mid si aad ugu sawirto) iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas kharash\u003C/span\u003E (wadarta shay kasta iyo wadarta mashruuca); sawiruhu waa tab-kiisa labaad.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalabka sanduuqa iyo sanduuqa macluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EToolbar-ka xaashida kor, sanduuq macluumaad oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAagga tartanka\u003C/span\u003E, qalabka socda ama dooritaanka iyo bar-ka xaashida, tiir ee qalabka xisaabinta dhinaca bidix, tab kasta oo xaashi ah, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu xidh\u003C/span\u003E iyo zoom-ka hoosta xaashida.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIntaad hubinta 3D (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003EHubi 3D\u003C/a\u003E) furan tahay, tab-yada xaashida iyo bar-ka hoosta xaashida way dhaqaaqaan; xir aragtida 3D si aad mar kale u cabbirto. Telefoonka dhexdiisa, layout-ka telefoonka had iyo jeer ayuu shaqeeyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shaashad-buuxda-iyo-midabada\"\u003EShaashad buuxda iyo midabada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShaashad buuxda\u003C/span\u003E badhanka app bar-ka, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (Control oo dhan nidaam, Mac-kaba sidoo kale), wuxuu wareejiyaa caadi, shaashad buuxda, iyo shaashad buuxda oo bar-yadii la qariyay. Bar-yadu marka la qariyo, mouse-ka u dhaadhac sare si aad mar kale u soo muujiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWarqad\u003C/span\u003E waa midabka iftiinka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodeel\u003C/span\u003E waa midabka mugdiga. Moodeel-ka naqshaddu waxay muuqataa rogsan (xariiqyo iftiin ah oo madow dul ku yaal) shaashadda kaliya; qaababka dhoofinta lama beddelo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"TakeoffCraft wuxuu buuxiyaa daaqadda browserka hoosta app bar-ka CadCraft. Sare ilaa hoos iyo bidix ilaa midig: Qayb Halka Waxa uu u shaqeeyo App bar Sare-sare Magaca app-ka, nooca, Ku saabsan TakeoffCraft, Caawimaad (F1), Kaydi khadka ka baxsan, Dejinta (Ctrl+,), badhanka Shaashad buuxda iyo kala-beddelka midabka Warqad / Moodeel. Toolbar Hoosta app bar-ka Amar kasta, kooxaha: Fayl, Dhoofin, Miisaan, Xisaabinta, Wax ka beddel, Muuqaal. Xaashiyada Bidix Bog kasta oo PDF kasta oo furan, sawirkiisa yar, miisaankiisa iyo tirada calaamadahiisa. Xaashida Dhexda Bogga furan. Halkan ayaad cabbirta. Walxaha Midig Shayada xisaabintaada, dejinta shayga la doortay, iyo calaamada la doortay. Tirooyinka Hoose Tirooyinka iyo kharashyada sida shayga ama xaashiga, iyo wadarta mashruuca. Bar-ka xaaladda Hoose-hoose Cabbirka toosan, fariimaha, talo 45°, iyo zoom-ka. Toolbar-ka Badhan kasta ku dhaji si aad u aragto waxa uu sameeyo iyo furayaasha. Kooxda Badhamada Fayl Cusub (xisaabin faaruug), Fur PDF-yada (Ctrl+O), Fur xisaabinta (mashruuc .takeoff.json), Kaydi xisaabinta (Ctrl+S) Dhoofin Hal menu: XLSX, CSV, PDF calaamadsan Miisaan Hagaaji (K), Hubi (D), iyo liiska Diyaar Xisaabinta Dooro (V), Socod (L), Aag (A), Goobo (O), Qaanso (R, badhan on/off), Ka jar (E, on/off), God (X), Tiri (C), Tirin otomaatig ah (S) Wax ka beddel Ka noqo (Ctrl+Z), Samee mar kale (Ctrl+Y), Koobiyee (Ctrl+C), Dhaji (Ctrl+V), iyo Wax badan: Gooy, Koobiyee, Dhaji, Dhaji meeshii, Nuqul, Tirtir, Dooro dhammaan, Dooro midna Muuqaal Bogga buuxi (F), Ballaca buuxi (W) Qalabka aad isticmaalayso waa la riixay. Badhamada Qaanso iyo Ka jar way riixan yihiin intay yihiin on. Xaashiyada (bidix) Raadi xaashiyada wuxuu shaandheeyaa liiska magaca xaashiga, magaca faylka ama calaamadda bogga. Xaashi kasta wuxuu muujiyaa sawir yar (la sawirayo markaad hoos u dhacayso), magaceeda, iyo miisaankeeda ama Miisaan ma jiro. Dhinaca midig ee safka kasta wuxuu muujiyaa tirada calaamadaha xaashigaas. Shay la iftiimiyay ayaa hadda muujinaya tirada calaamadaha shayadaas ee xaashigaas. Guji xaashi si aad u furto. Page Down iyo Page Up waxay u dhaqaajiyaan xaashiga xiga iyo kii hore liiska. Marka xisaabintu daboosho PDF-yo aan furnayn, qoraal hoos liiska ayaa magacyadooda sheegaya. Eeg Kaydi oo dib u fur xisaabinta. Magacyada xaashiyada waxay ka imanayaan PDF-ka: calaamad bog ah sida A-101 ayaa noqonaysa magaca xaashiga. Bog aan calaamad lahayn waxa loo magacaabaa faylkiisa iyo lambarka bogga, sida \"Plans, bogga 3\". Marka PDF-yo badan la furo, xaashiyada calaamadaysan waxay sidoo kale muujiyaan magaca faylka. Xaashida (dhexda) Barta hoose xaashida waxay tusaysaa magaca xaashiga iyo miisaankiisa, ama \"Weli miisaan ma jiro: dooro diyaar ah ama hagaaji\". Badhamadeeda: MarkupCraft (marka app-kaas uu qaadi karo PDF-ka; eeg Bilow xisaabin oo fur kooxda qorshayaasha), Barbardhig (nooc hore oo xaashi ah oo ku dul yaal kan: Barbardhig xaashi dib loo eegay), \"(n) la hubiyo\" (calaamado la calaamadeeyay, markay jiraan) iyo 3D (aragtida hubinta 3D). Ka hor intaan PDF la furin, dhexdu waxay muujinaysaa hagid gaaban oo shan tallaabo ah. Wheel-ka wuxuu zoom-gareeyaa meesha mouse-ka joogo. Jiid si aad u wareejiso. Eeg Kiiboodhka iyo mouse-ka. Markaad isticmaalayso Tirin otomaatig ah, bar iyo badhamadiisa ayaa soo muuqda xaashida sare. Walxaha (midig) Sare, liiska Aagga tartanka: dhismaha, dabaqa ama marxaladda calaamadaha cusub ku dhigmaan (Aagagga tartanka). Shay cusub wuxuu furaa foom yar: magac, nooc (Xariiq (dherer), Aag ama Tiri) iyo Ku dar. Liiska wuxuu muujinaa midabka shay kasta, astaamaha nooca, magaca iyo tirada. Guji shay si aad uga sawirto oo aad u iftiimiso calaamadaheeda xaashi kasta. Mar kale guji si aad u joojiso iftiiminta. Hoosta liiska, Shay: (magac) waa tafatiraha shayga: magaca, nooca, midabka, unugga, joogga ama qoto-dheerka, qashinka, qiimaha agabka iyo shaqada, qiyaasaha la cabbiray, iyo Isku-dhis. Eeg Samee shayada xisaabinta. Calaamada la doortay wuxuu muuqdaa markaad dooratid calaamad: shayada ay tahay, xaashigeeda, qiyaasteeda, iyo badhamo sida Ku dar cut-out iyo Tirtir calaamadda. Markii calaamado badan la doortay waxay noqotaa Calaamadaha la doortay: intee shay kasta, iyo Koobiyee, Nuqul, Gooy iyo Tirtir calaamadaha. Tafatiraha shayga wuxuu ku dhammaadaa Koobiyee shayga iyo Samee nuqul shayga: shay ay wataan isku-dhiskiisa iyo kharashyada, laakiin calaamad la'aan. Eeg Koobiyee, dhaji iyo nuqul calaamadaha. Tirooyinka (hoose) Sida shayba wuxuu liisankaa shay kasta iyo qaybaha isku-dhiskiisa, oo leh tiro, qashin, qiimo iyo kharash ballaaran. Qashinka iyo qiimaha waxaad ku qori kartaa shaxda si toos ah. Sida xaashiga wuxuu liisankaa tirada shay kasta xaashi kasta. Digniin ka bilaabata Aan dhammaystirnayn: ayaa soo muuqda markii wax ka maqan yihiin wadarta. Wadarta shaqada waxay ku taal midig madasha. Badhanka fallaadha ee ugu midig wuxuu qariyaa ama muujinayaa shaxda si xaashida u helo meel ballaaran. Eeg Akhri tirooyinka iyo qiyaasta kharashka. Bar-ka xaaladda (hoose) Midig ilaa bidix: cabbirka toosan markaad sawirayso (dherer, aag, radius ama natiijada hubinta), sanduuqa Geli markaad ku qorayso dherer, fariimaha TakeoffCraft, digniinta \"Shift ku dhejiya 45°\" (ama \"Ku dhejiya 45°; Shift ayaa xagasha xorayso\" marka taas la daaro Dejinta), badhanka Ku xidh (ku xidhka xariiqyada xaashida, wuu shaqeeyaa marka uu iftiimo; F3), iyo boqolkiiba zoom-ka. Akhri bar-ka xaaladda marka wax aan dhicin. TakeoffCraft halkaas ayuu ku sharaxaa sababta uu u diiday guji, tusaale \"Xaashidan wali miisaan ma leh\". Habayn kale Wax walba oo kor ku xusan waa habaynta CadCraft classic, bilowga. Dejinta (Ctrl+,) › Caalami › Qaabeynta wuxuu siinayaa laba kale; qalabka iyo furayaasha isku mid ah ayaa ku shaqeeya saddexdaba, dooritaanka CadCraft classic mar kale ayuu dib u soo celinayaa dhammaan xakamaynta meeshooda hore. Habayn TakeoffCraft-ka Ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca Ribbon-ka xisaabinta qadarka sare (Liiskyada, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka), bar ee qalabka socda, tab kasta oo xaashi ah oo aad furto (Model-ka iyo layouts-ka naqshadda waa xaashiyo sidoo kale), oo leh diyaarka miisaanka iyo Bogga buuxi hoosta xaashida. Panelka bidix wuxuu haystaa Sifooyinka (shayga, qoraalka ama calaamada la doortay) oo ka sarreeya Baaraha xisaabinta qadarka: Xaashiyada (guji mid si uu tab-ka uga furto), Xaaladaha (guji mid si aad ugu sawirto) iyo Qiyaas kharash (wadarta shay kasta iyo wadarta mashruuca); sawiruhu waa tab-kiisa labaad. Qalabka sanduuqa iyo sanduuqa macluumaadka Toolbar-ka xaashida kor, sanduuq macluumaad oo leh Aagga tartanka, qalabka socda ama dooritaanka iyo bar-ka xaashida, tiir ee qalabka xisaabinta dhinaca bidix, tab kasta oo xaashi ah, iyo Ku xidh iyo zoom-ka hoosta xaashida. Intaad hubinta 3D (Hubi 3D) furan tahay, tab-yada xaashida iyo bar-ka hoosta xaashida way dhaqaaqaan; xir aragtida 3D si aad mar kale u cabbirto. Telefoonka dhexdiisa, layout-ka telefoonka had iyo jeer ayuu shaqeeyaa. Shaashad buuxda iyo midabada Shaashad buuxda badhanka app bar-ka, ama Ctrl+Shift+F (Control oo dhan nidaam, Mac-kaba sidoo kale), wuxuu wareejiyaa caadi, shaashad buuxda, iyo shaashad buuxda oo bar-yadii la qariyay. Bar-yadu marka la qariyo, mouse-ka u dhaadhac sare si aad mar kale u soo muujiso. Warqad waa midabka iftiinka, Moodeel waa midabka mugdiga. Moodeel-ka naqshaddu waxay muuqataa rogsan (xariiqyo iftiin ah oo madow dul ku yaal) shaashadda kaliya; qaababka dhoofinta lama beddelo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"files","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Faylasha TakeoffCraft furo oo kaydiyo","summary":"PDF-yo lagu soo geliyo, fayl mashruuc xisaabineed, miisaan-xisaabeed iyo PDF calaamadsan oo ka baxa - waxa mid kasta ku jiro, halka uu tagayo, iyo waxa isbedela khadka ku jira, khadka ka baxsan iyo browserrada kala duwan.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["fayl","qaabab","pdf","takeoff.json","fayl mashruuc","xlsx","csv","pdf calaamadsan","soo dejin","kaydi","fur","khadka ka baxsan"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-ay-furto","text":"Waxa ay furto","level":2},{"id":"waxa-ay-kaydiyo","text":"Waxa ay kaydiyo","level":2},{"id":"halka-soo-dejintu-tagto","text":"Halka soo dejintu tagto","level":2},{"id":"sababta-faylka-mashruuca-iyo-pdf-yada-u-kala-gaar-yihiin","text":"Sababta faylka mashruuca iyo PDF-yada u kala gaar yihiin","level":2},{"id":"khadka-ku-jira-iyo-khadka-ka-baxsan","text":"Khadka ku jira iyo khadka ka baxsan","level":2},{"id":"jadwalada-xisaabta","text":"Jadwalada xisaabta","level":2},{"id":"desktop-iyo-cloud","text":"Desktop iyo cloud","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-ay-furto\"\u003EWaxa ay furto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFayl\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESida\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaallo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF (\u003Ccode\u003E.pdf\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur qorshayaasha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama ku riix bogga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhowr mar hal mar. Bog kasta wuxuu noqdaa xaashi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMashruuca xisaabinta (\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur xisaabinta\u003C/span\u003E, ama ku riix bogga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShayadaada, miisaankaaga iyo calaamadahaaga. Waxaad ku riixi kartaa PDF-yadiisa isla markaana.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylasha kale ee lagu riixo bogga waa la dhaafaa, sadarka xaaladdana magacyadooda ayuu sheegaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPDF-yada furaha ah\u003C/strong\u003E ma furmaan: &quot;(name) waa ilaalisan yahay furaha sirta ah. Fur nuqul aan ilaalin lahayn.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPDF isku mid laba jeer\u003C/strong\u003E hal mar ayaa la furaa: &quot;(name) horay ayuu u furan yahay.&quot; TakeoffCraft faylasha wuxuu ku aqoonsadaa waxa ku jira, ma aha magacyadooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPDF-yada sawirka ah\u003C/strong\u003E way furmaan oo way la cabbiraa sida kuwa kale; TakeoffCraft ma u baahna qoraalka PDF-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQorshayaasha waaweyn\u003C/strong\u003E: PDF kasta waa la akhrinayaa oo dhan markii la furayo (si loo aqoonsado), sidaas darteed faylka aad u weyn wax yar ayuu qaadan doonaa. Sawirrada yaryar mid mid ayaa la sawirayaa markaad hoos u dhacayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-ay-kaydiyo\"\u003EWaxa ay kaydiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydin kasta waa soo dejin. Waxba kuma qoro PDF-yadaada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxaad dooratay\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxaad heshay\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ku jira\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi xisaabinta\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(name).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShayada, isku-dhisyada, qiimayaasha, miisaanka xaashiyada iyo calaamad kasta, oo lagu xidhay PDF kasta iyada oo loo eegayo waxa ku jira. Ma jiraan bogagga PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(name).xlsx\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAfar xaashi: Qiyaas kharash (qaacidooyin toos ah), Sida xaashiga, Calaamadaha, Miisaanka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(name).csv\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiyaasta oo ah qiimo cad, hal safar shay kasta iyo qayb kasta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF calaamadsan\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(PDF name) (takeoff).pdf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqul PDF kasta oo furan oo leh calaamado, xisaabinta oo bogagiisa lagu sawiray iyo sharraxaad. Hal fayl PDF kasta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMagaca waxaa laga qaadaa PDF-ka ugu horreeya ee aad furtay xisaabintan. Weli ma jiro sanduuq magac-bedel: haddii aad rabto magac kale, magac fayl soo dejisay ku beddel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003EDhoofi qiyaasta iyo PDF calaamadsan\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-columns\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-columns\"\u003ETiirarka dhoofinta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"halka-soo-dejintu-tagto\"\u003EHalka soo dejintu tagto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBrowserkaagu wuxuu kaydiyaa soo dejinta halka uu ku kaydiyo soo dejin kasta, badanaa folder-ka Downloads. Ka hel \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Emaamulaha faylalkaaga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E. Haddii browserkaagu kuu weydiiyo halka lagu kaydinayo fayl kasta, wuu weydiin doonaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF calaamadsan\u003C/span\u003E oo leh PDF calaamadsan dhowr ah wuxuu soo dejiyaa dhowr fayl hal mar. Chrome iyo Edge way weydiin karaan hal mar in site-kan oggolaado inuu soo dejiyo fayloo badan. Dooro Allow.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafari wuxuu kaydiyaa Downloads ilaa aad beddesho meesha soo dejinta ee Safari Settings, hoos General.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sababta-faylka-mashruuca-iyo-pdf-yada-u-kala-gaar-yihiin\"\u003ESababta faylka mashruuca iyo PDF-yada u kala gaar yihiin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFayl \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu haystaa xisaabintaada keliya. Wuxuu PDF-yadiisa dib u helaa iyada oo loo eegayo waxa ku jira (farta fayl kasta), sidaas darteed:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMagac-bedelka ama dhaqdhaqaaqa PDF ma muhiimka ahan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPDF la beddelay ama dib loo kaydiyay barnaamij kale waxaa loo tixgeliyaa fayl kale, xataa haddii magacu isku mid yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadaha PDF-yada aan furnayn weli waxay ku tirmaan wadarta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003EKaydi oo dib u fur xisaabinta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khadka-ku-jira-iyo-khadka-ka-baxsan\"\u003EKhadka ku jira iyo khadka ka baxsan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPDF-yadaada iyo xisaabintaadu marna kama baxaan kumbiyuutarkaaga, khadka ku jira ama khadka ka baxsan. Xidhiidhku wuxuu muhiim yahay oo keliya markii TakeoffCraft laftiisa la soo rarayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u shaqeysid la&#039;aan xidhiidh, ka hor intaadan xidhiidh lahayn kaydi app-ka markaad khadka ku jirto:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E barta app-ka sare. Badhanku wuxuu tirinayaa, &quot;Kaydinta 12 ka 40&quot;, inta uu kaydinayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESug \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydinta TakeoffCraft wuxuu browserka ku hayaa app-ka, caawimaadan, akhristaha PDF, qoraha PDF-ka ee loo isticmaalo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF calaamadsan\u003C/span\u003E iyo shaqaalaha auto count, qiyaastii 6 MB. Markii ay tidhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E, wax walba waa shaqeeyaan khadka ka baxsan: furista PDF-yada, cabbirka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi xisaabinta\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF calaamadsan\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhanku wuxuu leeyahay\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMicnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrowserkan weli lama kaydin. Dooro si aad u kaydiso.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydinta (n) ka (m)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHadda waa la kaydinayaa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELa kaydiyay. Dooro si aad u dhigto \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMar kale kaydi (hel nooca ugu dambeeya)\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar nuqulka khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELama kaydin karin\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaar ka mid ah faylasha lama soo dejin. Hubi xidhiidhkaaga, oo mar kale dooro.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan lama heli karo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaaqadan browserka lama kari karo inuu nuqul khadka ka baxsan hayo (daaqadaha gaarka ah iyo kumbiyuutarrada la maamulo qaarkood ayaa xannibaya).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDheeraad ah, iyo sida nuqulka la kaydiyay u dhaadhacayo browser kasta: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EShaqada khadka ka baxsan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad khadka ka baxsan tahay. Haddii barta app-ka ay tidhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E, wax walba waa shaqeeyaan. Haddii aanay tidhin, qaybaha TakeoffCraft ee aan weli tab-kan soo rarin (qoraha PDF-ka ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF calaamadsan\u003C/span\u003E, shaqaalaha auto count) hadda ma soo rari karaan, oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF calaamadsan\u003C/span\u003E wuu joogsanayaa wuxuuna tidhi &quot;PDF calaamadsan lama qori karin&quot;. Xisaabintaadu way ammaan tahay in kasta: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi xisaabinta\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E ma u baahna xidhiidh. Ha dib u rarin tab-ka ilaa aad khadka ku jirto mar kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:online\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOnline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad khadka ku jirtaa. Kahor booqasho goobeed ama duulimaad, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E oo sug \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jadwalada-xisaabta\"\u003EJadwalada xisaabta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXLSX-ka wuxuu haystaa qaacidooyin toos ah, sidaas darteed barnaamijka jadwalku wuu dib u xisaabiyaa qiyaasta markuu furo faylka, wuuna sax ahaanayaa markaad qiimaha ama qashinka halkaas beddesho. Buugga shaqada waxaa lagu hubiyay LibreOffice Calc, kaasoo dib u xisaabiyay wadar kasta si isku mid ah sentiga. Weli Excel lama furin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECSV waa qiimo cad oo leh calaamada byte order mark, sidaas darteed barnaamijyada jadwalku waxay akhrin karaan xaraf sida m² sax ahaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"desktop-iyo-cloud\"\u003EDesktop iyo cloud\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"shell:desktop\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EDesktop app\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELaga bilaabo 0.5, app-ka desktop-ka waa CadCraft Studio: TakeoffCraft iyo todobada app ee kale hal rakibid. Ma jiro rakibe TakeoffCraft oo gaar ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydinta cloud weli ma diyaar. Faylasha \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E ku hay PDF-yada shaqada, oo kaydi sida faylasha kale ee aad leedahay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EHalka faylalkaagu tagaan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa ay furto Fayl Sida Faallo PDF (.pdf) Fur qorshayaasha, Ctrl+O, ama ku riix bogga Dhowr mar hal mar. Bog kasta wuxuu noqdaa xaashi. Mashruuca xisaabinta (.takeoff.json) Fur xisaabinta, ama ku riix bogga Shayadaada, miisaankaaga iyo calaamadahaaga. Waxaad ku riixi kartaa PDF-yadiisa isla markaana. Faylasha kale ee lagu riixo bogga waa la dhaafaa, sadarka xaaladdana magacyadooda ayuu sheegaa. PDF-yada furaha ah ma furmaan: \"(name) waa ilaalisan yahay furaha sirta ah. Fur nuqul aan ilaalin lahayn.\" PDF isku mid laba jeer hal mar ayaa la furaa: \"(name) horay ayuu u furan yahay.\" TakeoffCraft faylasha wuxuu ku aqoonsadaa waxa ku jira, ma aha magacyadooda. PDF-yada sawirka ah way furmaan oo way la cabbiraa sida kuwa kale; TakeoffCraft ma u baahna qoraalka PDF-ka. Qorshayaasha waaweyn: PDF kasta waa la akhrinayaa oo dhan markii la furayo (si loo aqoonsado), sidaas darteed faylka aad u weyn wax yar ayuu qaadan doonaa. Sawirrada yaryar mid mid ayaa la sawirayaa markaad hoos u dhacayso. Waxa ay kaydiyo Kaydin kasta waa soo dejin. Waxba kuma qoro PDF-yadaada. Waxaad dooratay Waxaad heshay Waxa ku jira Kaydi xisaabinta (name).takeoff.json Shayada, isku-dhisyada, qiimayaasha, miisaanka xaashiyada iyo calaamad kasta, oo lagu xidhay PDF kasta iyada oo loo eegayo waxa ku jira. Ma jiraan bogagga PDF. XLSX (name).xlsx Afar xaashi: Qiyaas kharash (qaacidooyin toos ah), Sida xaashiga, Calaamadaha, Miisaanka. CSV (name).csv Qiyaasta oo ah qiimo cad, hal safar shay kasta iyo qayb kasta. PDF calaamadsan (PDF name) (takeoff).pdf Nuqul PDF kasta oo furan oo leh calaamado, xisaabinta oo bogagiisa lagu sawiray iyo sharraxaad. Hal fayl PDF kasta. Magaca waxaa laga qaadaa PDF-ka ugu horreeya ee aad furtay xisaabintan. Weli ma jiro sanduuq magac-bedel: haddii aad rabto magac kale, magac fayl soo dejisay ku beddel. Eeg Dhoofi qiyaasta iyo PDF calaamadsan iyo Tiirarka dhoofinta. Halka soo dejintu tagto Browserkaagu wuxuu kaydiyaa soo dejinta halka uu ku kaydiyo soo dejin kasta, badanaa folder-ka Downloads. Ka hel Finder / File Explorer / maamulaha faylalkaaga. Haddii browserkaagu kuu weydiiyo halka lagu kaydinayo fayl kasta, wuu weydiin doonaa. PDF calaamadsan oo leh PDF calaamadsan dhowr ah wuxuu soo dejiyaa dhowr fayl hal mar. Chrome iyo Edge way weydiin karaan hal mar in site-kan oggolaado inuu soo dejiyo fayloo badan. Dooro Allow. Safari wuxuu kaydiyaa Downloads ilaa aad beddesho meesha soo dejinta ee Safari Settings, hoos General. Sababta faylka mashruuca iyo PDF-yada u kala gaar yihiin Fayl .takeoff.json wuxuu haystaa xisaabintaada keliya. Wuxuu PDF-yadiisa dib u helaa iyada oo loo eegayo waxa ku jira (farta fayl kasta), sidaas darteed: Magac-bedelka ama dhaqdhaqaaqa PDF ma muhiimka ahan. PDF la beddelay ama dib loo kaydiyay barnaamij kale waxaa loo tixgeliyaa fayl kale, xataa haddii magacu isku mid yahay. Calaamadaha PDF-yada aan furnayn weli waxay ku tirmaan wadarta. Eeg Kaydi oo dib u fur xisaabinta. Khadka ku jira iyo khadka ka baxsan PDF-yadaada iyo xisaabintaadu marna kama baxaan kumbiyuutarkaaga, khadka ku jira ama khadka ka baxsan. Xidhiidhku wuxuu muhiim yahay oo keliya markii TakeoffCraft laftiisa la soo rarayo. Si aad u shaqeysid la'aan xidhiidh, ka hor intaadan xidhiidh lahayn kaydi app-ka markaad khadka ku jirto: Dooro Kaydi khadka ka baxsan barta app-ka sare. Badhanku wuxuu tirinayaa, \"Kaydinta 12 ka 40\", inta uu kaydinayo. Sug Khadka ka baxsan diyaar. Kaydinta TakeoffCraft wuxuu browserka ku hayaa app-ka, caawimaadan, akhristaha PDF, qoraha PDF-ka ee loo isticmaalo PDF calaamadsan iyo shaqaalaha auto count, qiyaastii 6 MB. Markii ay tidhi Khadka ka baxsan diyaar, wax walba waa shaqeeyaan khadka ka baxsan: furista PDF-yada, cabbirka, Tirin otomaatig ah, Kaydi xisaabinta, XLSX, CSV iyo PDF calaamadsan. Badhanku wuxuu leeyahay Micnaha Kaydi khadka ka baxsan Browserkan weli lama kaydin. Dooro si aad u kaydiso. Kaydinta (n) ka (m) Hadda waa la kaydinayaa. Khadka ka baxsan diyaar La kaydiyay. Dooro si aad u dhigto Mar kale kaydi (hel nooca ugu dambeeya) ama Ka saar nuqulka khadka ka baxsan. Lama kaydin karin Qaar ka mid ah faylasha lama soo dejin. Hubi xidhiidhkaaga, oo mar kale dooro. Khadka ka baxsan lama heli karo Daaqadan browserka lama kari karo inuu nuqul khadka ka baxsan hayo (daaqadaha gaarka ah iyo kumbiyuutarrada la maamulo qaarkood ayaa xannibaya). Dheeraad ah, iyo sida nuqulka la kaydiyay u dhaadhacayo browser kasta: Shaqada khadka ka baxsan. Waxaad khadka ka baxsan tahay. Haddii barta app-ka ay tidhi Khadka ka baxsan diyaar, wax walba waa shaqeeyaan. Haddii aanay tidhin, qaybaha TakeoffCraft ee aan weli tab-kan soo rarin (qoraha PDF-ka ee PDF calaamadsan, shaqaalaha auto count) hadda ma soo rari karaan, oo PDF calaamadsan wuu joogsanayaa wuxuuna tidhi \"PDF calaamadsan lama qori karin\". Xisaabintaadu way ammaan tahay in kasta: Kaydi xisaabinta, XLSX iyo CSV ma u baahna xidhiidh. Ha dib u rarin tab-ka ilaa aad khadka ku jirto mar kale. Waxaad khadka ku jirtaa. Kahor booqasho goobeed ama duulimaad, dooro Kaydi khadka ka baxsan oo sug Khadka ka baxsan diyaar. Jadwalada xisaabta XLSX-ka wuxuu haystaa qaacidooyin toos ah, sidaas darteed barnaamijka jadwalku wuu dib u xisaabiyaa qiyaasta markuu furo faylka, wuuna sax ahaanayaa markaad qiimaha ama qashinka halkaas beddesho. Buugga shaqada waxaa lagu hubiyay LibreOffice Calc, kaasoo dib u xisaabiyay wadar kasta si isku mid ah sentiga. Weli Excel lama furin. CSV waa qiimo cad oo leh calaamada byte order mark, sidaas darteed barnaamijyada jadwalku waxay akhrin karaan xaraf sida m² sax ahaan. Desktop iyo cloud Laga bilaabo 0.5, app-ka desktop-ka waa CadCraft Studio: TakeoffCraft iyo todobada app ee kale hal rakibid. Ma jiro rakibe TakeoffCraft oo gaar ah. Kaydinta cloud weli ma diyaar. Faylasha .takeoff.json ku hay PDF-yada shaqada, oo kaydi sida faylasha kale ee aad leedahay. Eeg Halka faylalkaagu tagaan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"open-plan-set","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Bilow xisaabinta qadarka oo fur majmuuca qorshayaasha","summary":"Fur PDF mid ama dhowr ah oo ah majmuuc qorshe, ku hel jidkaaga xaashiyada, oo u gudub dhexdooda.","section":"tasks","order":10,"keywords":["fur","majmuuca qorshayaasha","dhowr pdf","faylal badan","xaashiyada","naqshadaha","calaamadaha bogga","liiska xaashiyada","u gudub","ku rid","gacan-siin","calaamadin"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-pdf-yada","text":"Fur PDF-yada","level":2},{"id":"naqshadaha-la-socda-pdf-yada","text":"Naqshadaha la socda PDF-yada","level":2},{"id":"pdf-laga-wareejiyay-barnaamij-kale","text":"PDF laga wareejiyay barnaamij kale","level":2},{"id":"hel-xaashi","text":"Hel xaashi","level":2},{"id":"sida-xaashiyada-loo-magacaabo","text":"Sida xaashiyada loo magacaabo","level":2},{"id":"ku-eeg-xaashi","text":"Ku eeg xaashi","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMajmuuca qorshayaasha badanaa waa dhowr PDF: naqshadda dhismaha, qaab-dhismeedka, mikaanikada. TakeoffCraft wuxuu u furaa iyaga oo dhan sida liis keliya oo xaashiyo ah, xisaabintana mid ayey dhammaantood daboolaysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-pdf-yada\"\u003EFur PDF-yada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur qorshayaasha\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. (Habka kale ee menu-ga wuxuu ugu yeeraa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur PDF-yada…\u003C/span\u003E.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaaqadda faylka, dooro PDF kasta oo majmuucda ah. Riix \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003ECommand\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E si aad dhowr u doorato, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad xadka u doorato.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro Fur. Fariin &quot;Furaya (name)…&quot; ayaa muuqda inta fayl kasta la akhrinayo. Markaasna bog kasta waxaa ka muuqda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaashiyada\u003C/span\u003E hoosteeda, PDF-ka cusub ee ugu horreeya bogga koowaad ayaa furmaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa kale oo aad PDF-yada ka jiidi kartaa \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Emaareeyaha faylashaada\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E oo aad ku rido TakeoffCraft meel kasta. Inta aad jiidayso waxaa muuqda daaqad &quot;Ku rid PDF, naqshadaha DWG ama DXF, ama .takeoff.json&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad PDF dheeri ah u darto mar dambe, sidaas oo kale samee. PDF-yada horey u furan waa la dhaafaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShaashadda bilowga waxay sidoo kale liistaa PDF-yada iyo xisaabinta aad dhawaan furtay, browser-yada oggolaanaya bog inuu fayl mar kale furo (Chrome iyo Edge). Guji mid si aad u furto; browser-ku wuxuu u baahan karaa ogolaansho marka hore. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EFaylasheeda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax lama soo dejiyo. Browser-ku wuxuu PDF-yada ka akhrisaa kombiyuutarkaaga, waana laga tirtiraa TakeoffCraft markaad xirto tab-ka ama aad dooratid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusub\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"naqshadaha-la-socda-pdf-yada\"\u003ENaqshadaha la socda PDF-yada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur qorshayaasha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sidoo kale qaataa naqshadaha DWG iyo DXF, keligood ama PDF-yada la socda: model space-ka naqshad kasta iyo layout-kiisa waxay noqdaan xaashiyo liiska isku mid ah. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\"\u003EFur naqshad DWG ama DXF\u003C/a\u003E, kadibna \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003EKa tir naqshadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pdf-laga-wareejiyay-barnaamij-kale\"\u003EPDF laga wareejiyay barnaamij kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBarnaamij kale oo ka mid ah silsiladda ayaa kuu wareejin kara PDF uu furan yahay: wuxuu furaa TakeoffCraft tab cusub, PDF-kuna halkaas ayuu ka furmaa sidii aad ku ridday. Status bar-ku wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Waa la furay (name), laga wareejiyay (app). Faylka asalka ahi isma beddelin.&quot; Wax lama soo dejiyo; faylku wuxuu ka gudbaa kaydka browser-kan, oo ka baxaa markii uu furmo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii status bar-ku sheego in PDF-ku &quot;aanu gaarin&quot;, tab-ku wuu sugay wakhti dheer, ama PDF-ka horey ayaa loo furay tab kale: fur adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur qorshayaasha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhinaca kale, marka MarkupCraft uu shaqeeyo meesha aad joogto oo uu faylka qaadan karo, xaashi-barka hoosta naqshadda waxaa ku jira badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/span\u003E: wuxuu furaa PDF-ka xaashida shaashadda ku jirta tab cusub oo MarkupCraft ah, si aad u eegto oo u calaamadiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hel-xaashi\"\u003EHel xaashi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dhaaji liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaashiyada\u003C/span\u003E bidix oo guji xaashi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor \u003Cstrong\u003ERaadi xaashiyada\u003C/strong\u003E kor ee liiska si aad ugu shaandhayso lambarka xaashida, magaca faylka ama calaamadda bogga. Tirada ku xigta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaashiyada\u003C/span\u003E waxay muujinaysaa &quot;3 of 40&quot; inta shaandhe ku jirto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E xaashida xigta iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tan hore. Waxay raacaan liiska sida la shaandheeyey.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiiboodhka Mac-ga oo aan lahayn furayaasha Page Up iyo Page Down, riix fn oo raac fallaadha sare ama hoose.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-xaashiyada-loo-magacaabo\"\u003ESida xaashiyada loo magacaabo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBog kasta oo PDF-ku siiyo calaamad, sida \u003Ccode\u003EA-101\u003C/code\u003E, waxaa loo magacaabaa calaamadaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBog aan calaamad lahayn (ama calaamadu tahay lambarka bogga oo keliya) waxaa loo magacaabaa &quot;(magaca faylka), bog (n)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkii dhowr PDF la furo, xaashiyada calaamadaysan waxay sidoo kale leeyihiin magaca faylka: &quot;A-101 — Dhismaha&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMagacyada xaashiyada gacanta lagama qori karo wali.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-eeg-xaashi\"\u003EKu eeg xaashi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu rog batanka dhegaha si aad u weyneyso marka uu xagga ku yaal calaamadu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu jiid bidix ama dhexe si aad u guurto. Marka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E la shido, ama marka aad ka bilowdo geeska calaamad, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inta aad jiidayso, ama jiid badhanka dhexe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBogga buuxi\u003C/span\u003E si aad u aragto xaashida oo dhan; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBallaca buuxi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu buuxiyaa ballaceeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"=\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u weyneyso, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u yareyso, ku-dhawaad dhexda muuqaalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXaashi kasta wuxuu xusuustaa weynaynteeda iyo meeshiisa inta ay furan tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa hor intaadan xaashi cabbiri karin, waxay u baahan tahay miisaan: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EDejinta miisaanka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Majmuuca qorshayaasha badanaa waa dhowr PDF: naqshadda dhismaha, qaab-dhismeedka, mikaanikada. TakeoffCraft wuxuu u furaa iyaga oo dhan sida liis keliya oo xaashiyo ah, xisaabintana mid ayey dhammaantood daboolaysaa. Fur PDF-yada Dooro Fur qorshayaasha kooxda Fayl, ama riix Ctrl+O. (Habka kale ee menu-ga wuxuu ugu yeeraa Fur PDF-yada….) Daaqadda faylka, dooro PDF kasta oo majmuucda ah. Riix Command / Ctrl / Ctrl si aad dhowr u doorato, ama Shift si aad xadka u doorato. Dooro Fur. Fariin \"Furaya (name)…\" ayaa muuqda inta fayl kasta la akhrinayo. Markaasna bog kasta waxaa ka muuqda Xaashiyada hoosteeda, PDF-ka cusub ee ugu horreeya bogga koowaad ayaa furmaa. Waxa kale oo aad PDF-yada ka jiidi kartaa Finder / File Explorer / maareeyaha faylashaada oo aad ku rido TakeoffCraft meel kasta. Inta aad jiidayso waxaa muuqda daaqad \"Ku rid PDF, naqshadaha DWG ama DXF, ama .takeoff.json\". Si aad PDF dheeri ah u darto mar dambe, sidaas oo kale samee. PDF-yada horey u furan waa la dhaafaa. Shaashadda bilowga waxay sidoo kale liistaa PDF-yada iyo xisaabinta aad dhawaan furtay, browser-yada oggolaanaya bog inuu fayl mar kale furo (Chrome iyo Edge). Guji mid si aad u furto; browser-ku wuxuu u baahan karaa ogolaansho marka hore. Eeg Faylasheeda. Wax lama soo dejiyo. Browser-ku wuxuu PDF-yada ka akhrisaa kombiyuutarkaaga, waana laga tirtiraa TakeoffCraft markaad xirto tab-ka ama aad dooratid Cusub. Naqshadaha la socda PDF-yada Fur qorshayaasha wuxuu sidoo kale qaataa naqshadaha DWG iyo DXF, keligood ama PDF-yada la socda: model space-ka naqshad kasta iyo layout-kiisa waxay noqdaan xaashiyo liiska isku mid ah. Eeg Fur naqshad DWG ama DXF, kadibna Ka tir naqshadda. PDF laga wareejiyay barnaamij kale Barnaamij kale oo ka mid ah silsiladda ayaa kuu wareejin kara PDF uu furan yahay: wuxuu furaa TakeoffCraft tab cusub, PDF-kuna halkaas ayuu ka furmaa sidii aad ku ridday. Status bar-ku wuxuu leeyahay \"Waa la furay (name), laga wareejiyay (app). Faylka asalka ahi isma beddelin.\" Wax lama soo dejiyo; faylku wuxuu ka gudbaa kaydka browser-kan, oo ka baxaa markii uu furmo. Haddii status bar-ku sheego in PDF-ku \"aanu gaarin\", tab-ku wuu sugay wakhti dheer, ama PDF-ka horey ayaa loo furay tab kale: fur adigoo isticmaalaya Fur qorshayaasha. Dhinaca kale, marka MarkupCraft uu shaqeeyo meesha aad joogto oo uu faylka qaadan karo, xaashi-barka hoosta naqshadda waxaa ku jira badhanka MarkupCraft: wuxuu furaa PDF-ka xaashida shaashadda ku jirta tab cusub oo MarkupCraft ah, si aad u eegto oo u calaamadiso. Hel xaashi Ku dhaaji liiska Xaashiyada bidix oo guji xaashi. Ku qor Raadi xaashiyada kor ee liiska si aad ugu shaandhayso lambarka xaashida, magaca faylka ama calaamadda bogga. Tirada ku xigta Xaashiyada waxay muujinaysaa \"3 of 40\" inta shaandhe ku jirto. Riix Page Down xaashida xigta iyo Page Up tan hore. Waxay raacaan liiska sida la shaandheeyey. Kiiboodhka Mac-ga oo aan lahayn furayaasha Page Up iyo Page Down, riix fn oo raac fallaadha sare ama hoose. Sida xaashiyada loo magacaabo Bog kasta oo PDF-ku siiyo calaamad, sida A-101, waxaa loo magacaabaa calaamadaas. Bog aan calaamad lahayn (ama calaamadu tahay lambarka bogga oo keliya) waxaa loo magacaabaa \"(magaca faylka), bog (n)\". Markii dhowr PDF la furo, xaashiyada calaamadaysan waxay sidoo kale leeyihiin magaca faylka: \"A-101 — Dhismaha\". Magacyada xaashiyada gacanta lagama qori karo wali. Ku eeg xaashi Ku rog batanka dhegaha si aad u weyneyso marka uu xagga ku yaal calaamadu. Ku jiid bidix ama dhexe si aad u guurto. Marka Auto count la shido, ama marka aad ka bilowdo geeska calaamad, riix Space inta aad jiidayso, ama jiid badhanka dhexe. Riix F ama dooro Bogga buuxi si aad u aragto xaashida oo dhan; W ama Ballaca buuxi wuxuu buuxiyaa ballaceeda. Riix + ama = si aad u weyneyso, − si aad u yareyso, ku-dhawaad dhexda muuqaalka. Xaashi kasta wuxuu xusuustaa weynaynteeda iyo meeshiisa inta ay furan tahay. Xiga Ka hor intaadan xaashi cabbiri karin, waxay u baahan tahay miisaan: Dejinta miisaanka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"open-a-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Fur naqshad DWG ama DXF","summary":"Fur faylka naqshadda sida xaashiyo (model space iyo layout kasta), ka bilow miisaanka ay naqshaddu siiso, muuji ama qari lakabyadeeda, oo soo geli naqshadaha xiriirsan.","section":"tasks","order":12,"keywords":["dwg","dxf","cad","naqshad","fur naqshad","layouts","model space","paper space","xaashiyo","unitsyo","insunits","miisaanka viewport","xref","naqshad xiriirsan","lakabyo","qarsan","ma jiro pdf","plot","la'aan plotting"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-naqshadda","text":"Fur naqshadda","level":2},{"id":"xaashiyada","text":"Xaashiyada","level":2},{"id":"miisaanka","text":"Miisaanka","level":2},{"id":"lakabyada","text":"Lakabyada","level":2},{"id":"naqshadaha-xiriirsan-xrefs","text":"Naqshadaha xiriirsan (xrefs)","level":2},{"id":"xaddidaadyada","text":"Xaddidaadyada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffCraft wuxuu furaa naqshad DWG ama DXF sida uu PDF u furo: uma baahnid inaad mar hore PDF ugu plot-garayso. Tirinta naqshadda laftiisa way saxan tahay, sababtoo ah naqshaddu waxay ogtahay walax kasta waa maxay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003EKa tir naqshadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-naqshadda\"\u003EFur naqshadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur qorshayaasha\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro faylka DWG ama DXF. Waad dooran kartaa dhowr, iyo PDF-yada la socda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro Fur.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa kale oo aad ku ridi kartaa faylasha naqshadda TakeoffCraft, sida PDF-yada. Wax lama soo dejiyo: browser-ku wuxuu faylka ka akhriyaa kombiyuutarkaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffCraft wuxuu akhriyaa DWG ka AutoCAD 2000 ilaa 2018 iyo ASCII DXF ka R12 ilaa 2018. Wuxuu diidaa DXF binary (kaydi ASCII, ama DWG) iyo fayl aan midkoodna ahayn, wuuna sababta sheegaa. Fayl dhaawac ah wuxuu furmaa wixii la akhrin karay, fariin ayaa taas sheegta; tirooyinkeeda way dhammaysan karaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaashiyada\"\u003EXaashiyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel\u003C/strong\u003E waa model space-ka naqshadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELayout kasta\u003C/strong\u003E (tab-ka paper space) waa xaashi, magacyada tab-kiisa, tabaha kala horreeya. Layout-ku wuxuu muujiyaa modelka viewport-keeda, sida uu u plot-garayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWeynee, guuri muuqaal, ku dhejinta khadadka naqshadda, calaamadaha, qoraallada, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E iyo kuwa kale waxay u shaqeeyaan sida PDF-ka. Xaashiyada naqshadda waxaa lagu kaydiyaa xisaabinta magaca faylka iyo farta-farta xogteeda, sida PDF-ka: mar kale faylka fur, calaamadahu xaashiyadooda ayey ku jiraan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"miisaanka\"\u003EMiisaanka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXaashi kasta wuxuu ka bilaabaa miisaanka uu naqshaddu siiso:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELayout\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qaadaa miisaanka viewport-kiisa ugu weyn. Miisaan sida 1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; waxaa loo magacaabaa diyaarka uu yahay; miisaan kasta oo kale waxaa lagu muujiyaa &quot;Viewport-ka naqshadda: 1&quot; = 2.5&#039;&quot;. Haddii layout-ku leeyahay viewports miisaanno kale, midka ugu weyn ayaa xaashida miisaankeeda dejiya: hubi kuwa kale adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qaadaa unitsyada naqshadda (inches, millimeters, feet…) sida miisaan, &quot;Unitsyada naqshadda (inches)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshad aan unit lahayn\u003C/strong\u003E (naqshaddu weligeed ma sheegin inta unit-ka inch ama millimeter tahay) ma leh miisaan: xaashidu waxay leedahay &quot;Miisaan ma jiro&quot;, cabbirkuna waa la diidaa, sida PDF aan miisaan lahayn. Tirintu miisaan uma baahna. Siiso mid adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi\u003C/span\u003E iyo liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiyaar\u003C/span\u003E waxay beddelaan miisaanka wakhti kasta, waxayna ka guuleystaan kan naqshadda. Liiska diyaarka ma shaqeeyo Model-ka, sababtoo ah ma leh cabbirka warqadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lakabyada\"\u003ELakabyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELakabyada\u003C/span\u003E xaashi-barka ayaa liistaa lakabyada naqshadda iyo inta walax ah ee lakab kasta ku leeyahay xaashidan. Lakabyada faylku damiyay ama qabatay waxay ku bilaabmaan qarsan. Ka saar calaamadda lakab si aad u qariso, ama calaamadi lakab qarsan si aad u muujiso: xaashidu mar kale way sawirtaa, wixii qarsan waxaa laga reebaa tirinta iyo walxaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeasure drawing\u003C/span\u003E, ilaa aad codsato inaad tirto lakabyada qarsan sidoo kale. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa lakab kasta; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu noqo lakabyada faylka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dib u celiyaa wixii aad beddeshay. Doorashooyinka lakabyadu waxay ku jiraan kalfadhigan, ma aha faylka xisaabinta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"naqshadaha-xiriirsan-xrefs\"\u003ENaqshadaha xiriirsan (xrefs)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENaqshad xiriirsiinaysa naqshado kale waxay muujisaa iyaga meelaha lagu geliyay. TakeoffCraft wuxuu naqshad xiriirsan ka helaa \u003Cstrong\u003Efaylasha furan\u003C/strong\u003E dhexdooda, magaciisa fayl: fur naqshadda martida iyo naqshadda xiriirsan wada, ama mid kale ka dib. Ilaa markaas status bar-ku wuxuu sheegaa inta naqshad xiriirsan aan la helin, wixii ay sawiraan ayaa maqan, tirooyinkuna way sheegaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaddidaadyada\"\u003EXaddidaadyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalxaha TakeoffCraft aan akhrin ama dhigi karin (proxy objects, fasallo aan la aqoon) waxaa lagu liiskaa daaqadda tirinta sida nooca; weligood lama tuurayo iyada oo aan wax la odhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaqshadaha aad u waaweyn qayb ayaa la sawiraa, tirintuna waxay joogsataa xadka, iyada oo sheegta. Fur PDF plot ah oo naqshaddaas ah oo bedelkeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaqshad waxaa lagu sawiraa madow iyo midabkeeda, si loo dhumuqsiiyo warqadda cad. Miisaska qaabka plot-ka iyo qoridda qalinka lama dabaqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"TakeoffCraft wuxuu furaa naqshad DWG ama DXF sida uu PDF u furo: uma baahnid inaad mar hore PDF ugu plot-garayso. Tirinta naqshadda laftiisa way saxan tahay, sababtoo ah naqshaddu waxay ogtahay walax kasta waa maxay. Eeg Ka tir naqshadda. Fur naqshadda Dooro Fur qorshayaasha kooxda Fayl, ama riix Ctrl+O. Dooro faylka DWG ama DXF. Waad dooran kartaa dhowr, iyo PDF-yada la socda. Dooro Fur. Waxa kale oo aad ku ridi kartaa faylasha naqshadda TakeoffCraft, sida PDF-yada. Wax lama soo dejiyo: browser-ku wuxuu faylka ka akhriyaa kombiyuutarkaaga. TakeoffCraft wuxuu akhriyaa DWG ka AutoCAD 2000 ilaa 2018 iyo ASCII DXF ka R12 ilaa 2018. Wuxuu diidaa DXF binary (kaydi ASCII, ama DWG) iyo fayl aan midkoodna ahayn, wuuna sababta sheegaa. Fayl dhaawac ah wuxuu furmaa wixii la akhrin karay, fariin ayaa taas sheegta; tirooyinkeeda way dhammaysan karaan. Xaashiyada Model waa model space-ka naqshadda. Layout kasta (tab-ka paper space) waa xaashi, magacyada tab-kiisa, tabaha kala horreeya. Layout-ku wuxuu muujiyaa modelka viewport-keeda, sida uu u plot-garayo. Weynee, guuri muuqaal, ku dhejinta khadadka naqshadda, calaamadaha, qoraallada, Hagaaji iyo kuwa kale waxay u shaqeeyaan sida PDF-ka. Xaashiyada naqshadda waxaa lagu kaydiyaa xisaabinta magaca faylka iyo farta-farta xogteeda, sida PDF-ka: mar kale faylka fur, calaamadahu xaashiyadooda ayey ku jiraan. Miisaanka Xaashi kasta wuxuu ka bilaabaa miisaanka uu naqshaddu siiso: Layout wuxuu qaadaa miisaanka viewport-kiisa ugu weyn. Miisaan sida 1/2\" = 1'-0\" waxaa loo magacaabaa diyaarka uu yahay; miisaan kasta oo kale waxaa lagu muujiyaa \"Viewport-ka naqshadda: 1\" = 2.5'\". Haddii layout-ku leeyahay viewports miisaanno kale, midka ugu weyn ayaa xaashida miisaankeeda dejiya: hubi kuwa kale adigoo isticmaalaya Hubi. Model wuxuu qaadaa unitsyada naqshadda (inches, millimeters, feet…) sida miisaan, \"Unitsyada naqshadda (inches)\". Naqshad aan unit lahayn (naqshaddu weligeed ma sheegin inta unit-ka inch ama millimeter tahay) ma leh miisaan: xaashidu waxay leedahay \"Miisaan ma jiro\", cabbirkuna waa la diidaa, sida PDF aan miisaan lahayn. Tirintu miisaan uma baahna. Siiso mid adigoo isticmaalaya Hagaaji. Hagaaji, Hubi iyo liiska Diyaar waxay beddelaan miisaanka wakhti kasta, waxayna ka guuleystaan kan naqshadda. Liiska diyaarka ma shaqeeyo Model-ka, sababtoo ah ma leh cabbirka warqadda. Lakabyada Lakabyada xaashi-barka ayaa liistaa lakabyada naqshadda iyo inta walax ah ee lakab kasta ku leeyahay xaashidan. Lakabyada faylku damiyay ama qabatay waxay ku bilaabmaan qarsan. Ka saar calaamadda lakab si aad u qariso, ama calaamadi lakab qarsan si aad u muujiso: xaashidu mar kale way sawirtaa, wixii qarsan waxaa laga reebaa tirinta iyo walxaha Measure drawing, ilaa aad codsato inaad tirto lakabyada qarsan sidoo kale. Muuji dhammaan wuxuu muujiyaa lakab kasta; Ku noqo lakabyada faylka wuxuu dib u celiyaa wixii aad beddeshay. Doorashooyinka lakabyadu waxay ku jiraan kalfadhigan, ma aha faylka xisaabinta. Naqshadaha xiriirsan (xrefs) Naqshad xiriirsiinaysa naqshado kale waxay muujisaa iyaga meelaha lagu geliyay. TakeoffCraft wuxuu naqshad xiriirsan ka helaa faylasha furan dhexdooda, magaciisa fayl: fur naqshadda martida iyo naqshadda xiriirsan wada, ama mid kale ka dib. Ilaa markaas status bar-ku wuxuu sheegaa inta naqshad xiriirsan aan la helin, wixii ay sawiraan ayaa maqan, tirooyinkuna way sheegaan. Xaddidaadyada Walxaha TakeoffCraft aan akhrin ama dhigi karin (proxy objects, fasallo aan la aqoon) waxaa lagu liiskaa daaqadda tirinta sida nooca; weligood lama tuurayo iyada oo aan wax la odhan. Naqshadaha aad u waaweyn qayb ayaa la sawiraa, tirintuna waxay joogsataa xadka, iyada oo sheegta. Fur PDF plot ah oo naqshaddaas ah oo bedelkeeda. Naqshad waxaa lagu sawiraa madow iyo midabkeeda, si loo dhumuqsiiyo warqadda cad. Miisaska qaabka plot-ka iyo qoridda qalinka lama dabaqo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"open-an-ifc-file","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Ka soo geli tirooyinka faylka IFC 4.3","summary":"Fur fayl IFC 4.3 oo jid, waddo, buul ama shaqada dhulka ah oo hel tiro sida fasal kasta, oo leh dherer, aag iyo mug sida faylku sheego, oo ah tirooyin nooca la qoray.","section":"tasks","order":13,"keywords":["ifc","ifc4x3","ifc 4.3","waddo","jidka tareenka","buul","dusha waddada","dhinaca-jidka","lakabyada","shaqada dhulka","qaabka ku xidha","dhismaha dhulka","tirooyinka","bim","civil","tirooyin nooca la qoray"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-faylka","text":"Fur faylka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aan-samayn","text":"Waxa aan samayn","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFayl IFC 4.3 wuxuu hayaa waddo, jid tareen, buul, shaqada badda iyo qaybaha ay ka sameysan yihiin: dusha waddada, lakabyada, dhinaca-jidka, jidadka, shaqada dhulka, qaabka ku xidha, tiirarka dhulka iyo wax kale oo badan. TakeoffCraft wuxuu akhriyaa kuwaas wuxuuna u beddelaa tirooyin nooca la qoray oo aad qiimayn kartid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-faylka\"\u003EFur faylka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur qorshayaasha\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro faylka IFC (waad ku dooran kartaa oo PDF-yada la socda), ama ku rid TakeoffCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETiro nooca la qoray mid ayaa loo sameeyaa fasal kasta iyo nooc hore loo qeexay, tusaale ahaan &quot;Dusha waddada (flexible): tiro&quot;, iyo, marka faylku sheego, &quot;length&quot; in m, &quot;area&quot; in m² iyo &quot;volume&quot; in m³. Qoraalka walax kasta wuxuu sheegaa inta walxood la tiriyay iyo inta aan tiro sheegin. Fur fayl cusub oo magac isku mid ah wuxuu cusboonaysiinayaa tirooyinkaas halkii uu wax kale ku daro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aan-samayn\"\u003EWaxa aan samayn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaliya fasallada qaab-dhismeedka dhulka ee IFC 4.3 ayaa la akhriyaa. Faylka dhismaha (darbiyada, albaabada, sagxadaha) looma beddelo tirooyin halkan; fayl aan IFC 4.3 ahayn wuu sheegaa oo wax ma keenayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWuxuu akhriyaa quantity sets (IfcElementQuantity) ee faylku hayo. Ma cabbiro qaabka 3D, sidaas darteed walax aan quantity set lahayn waa la tiraa laakiin ma ku darto dherer, aag ama mug.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnitsyada waa kuwa faylka, waxaana loo beddelaa mitir.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Fayl IFC 4.3 wuxuu hayaa waddo, jid tareen, buul, shaqada badda iyo qaybaha ay ka sameysan yihiin: dusha waddada, lakabyada, dhinaca-jidka, jidadka, shaqada dhulka, qaabka ku xidha, tiirarka dhulka iyo wax kale oo badan. TakeoffCraft wuxuu akhriyaa kuwaas wuxuuna u beddelaa tirooyin nooca la qoray oo aad qiimayn kartid. Fur faylka Dooro Fur qorshayaasha kooxda Fayl, ama riix Ctrl+O. Dooro faylka IFC (waad ku dooran kartaa oo PDF-yada la socda), ama ku rid TakeoffCraft. Tiro nooca la qoray mid ayaa loo sameeyaa fasal kasta iyo nooc hore loo qeexay, tusaale ahaan \"Dusha waddada (flexible): tiro\", iyo, marka faylku sheego, \"length\" in m, \"area\" in m² iyo \"volume\" in m³. Qoraalka walax kasta wuxuu sheegaa inta walxood la tiriyay iyo inta aan tiro sheegin. Fur fayl cusub oo magac isku mid ah wuxuu cusboonaysiinayaa tirooyinkaas halkii uu wax kale ku daro. Waxa aan samayn Kaliya fasallada qaab-dhismeedka dhulka ee IFC 4.3 ayaa la akhriyaa. Faylka dhismaha (darbiyada, albaabada, sagxadaha) looma beddelo tirooyin halkan; fayl aan IFC 4.3 ahayn wuu sheegaa oo wax ma keenayo. Wuxuu akhriyaa quantity sets (IfcElementQuantity) ee faylku hayo. Ma cabbiro qaabka 3D, sidaas darteed walax aan quantity set lahayn waa la tiraa laakiin ma ku darto dherer, aag ama mug. Unitsyada waa kuwa faylka, waxaana loo beddelaa mitir.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"set-the-scale","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Dejiso miisaanka","summary":"Siiso xaashi kasta miisaan diyaar ah ama hagaaji cabbir la yaqaan, hubi, oo fahmi sababta xaashiyada aan miisaan lahayn looga reebo wadarta.","section":"tasks","order":20,"keywords":["ogaanshaha miisaanka","akhri miisaanka","miisaanka qoraalka","dhammaan xaashiyada","miisaan","hagaaji","diyaar","hubi miisaanka","cabbir la yaqaan","aan miisaan lahayn","nisbad","dejiso miisaanka"],"headings":[{"id":"isticmaal-diyaar-marka-pdf-ka-lagu-daabacay-cabbir-buuxa","text":"Isticmaal diyaar (marka PDF-ka lagu daabacay cabbir buuxa)","level":2},{"id":"akhri-miisaannada-qoraalka-xaashiyada","text":"Akhri miisaannada qoraalka xaashiyada","level":2},{"id":"hagaaji-cabbir-la-yaqaan","text":"Hagaaji cabbir la yaqaan","level":2},{"id":"hubi-miisaanka","text":"Hubi miisaanka","level":2},{"id":"beddel-miisaanka","text":"Beddel miisaanka","level":2},{"id":"sababta-xaashiyada-aan-miisaan-lahayn-looga-reebo-wadarta","text":"Sababta xaashiyada aan miisaan lahayn looga reebo wadarta","level":2},{"id":"talooyin","text":"Talooyin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EXaashi kasta wuxuu leeyahay miisaankiisa. Adigu ayaad dejisaa, ama TakeoffCraft wuu ka akhrin karaa qoraalka xaashiyada (hoos), kadibna hubi. Ilaa xaashi uu leeyahay miisaan, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESocod\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAag\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobo\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGod\u003C/span\u003E way diidaan inay ku cabbiraan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiri\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/span\u003E waxay shaqeeyaan iyagoon miisaan lahayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska xaashiyada wuxuu muujinayaa miisaan kasta oo xaashi, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EAan miisaan lahayn\u003C/strong\u003E. Bar-ka hoosta xaashiga furan wuxuu leeyahay isku mid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isticmaal-diyaar-marka-pdf-ka-lagu-daabacay-cabbir-buuxa\"\u003EIsticmaal diyaar (marka PDF-ka lagu daabacay cabbir buuxa)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur xaashiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiyaar\u003C/span\u003E ee kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro miisaanka lagu daabacay naqshadda, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003E1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E hoosta Mimaarka. Jaanqaadka xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Miisaanka xaashigan: 1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHubi (hoos).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDiyaar wuxuu qaadanayaa in PDF-ku yahay cabbirka warqadda dhabta ah ee naqshadda loogu talo galay. Haddii qof uu sameeyay PDF-ka &quot;fit to page&quot;, ama uu yahay set nus-cabbir ah, diyaarku waa khalad. Taas beddelkeeda hagaaji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska oo dhan waxaa ku jira \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/scale-presets\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/scale-presets\"\u003EDiyaarinta miisaanka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhri-miisaannada-qoraalka-xaashiyada\"\u003EAkhri miisaannada qoraalka xaashiyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENaqshado badan waxay sheegaan miisaankooda: \u003Ccode\u003ESCALE: 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E xaashiga macluumaadka, \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E hoosta aragti. TakeoffCraft wuu akhriyi karaa oo wuu dejin karaa xaashi kasta hal mar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiyaar\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaashiyada qoraalkooda…\u003C/span\u003E (kore).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiiska wuxuu muujinayaa xaashi kasta: miisaankeeda hadda, iyo waxa qoraalkeedu leeyahay — \u003Cstrong\u003EWaxay leedahay 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EQoraal miisaan ma leh\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EWaxay leedahay ma-miisaano\u003C/strong\u003E (NTS).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXaashiyada aan miisaan lahayn oo leh mid ayaa la calaamadeeyay. Calaamee ama ka saar kuwa kale, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejiso miisaanka la calaamadiyay\u003C/span\u003E. Hal \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa dhammaantood soo celiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHubi hal cabbir xaashi kasta adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi\u003C/span\u003E (hoos): diyaar waa sax kaliya marka PDF-ka lagu daabacay cabbir buuxa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWuxuu akhriyaa qaababka mimaarka (\u003Ccode\u003E3/16&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E), injineeriga (\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 20&#039;\u003C/code\u003E) iyo metric (\u003Ccode\u003E1:50\u003C/code\u003E) oo waafaqa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/scale-presets\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/scale-presets\"\u003Ediyaar\u003C/a\u003E. Marka xaashi uu leeyahay in ka badan hal miisaan (naqshad leh faahfaahin weyneysan), wuxuu qaadanayaa kan ugu badan ee qoran, kan la qoray kadib erayga SCALE wuxuu ka mudan yahay laba jeer; kuwa kale waxaa lagu muujiyaa midab casaan ah si aad u hubisid. Xaashi la sawiray ma leh qoraal: miisaankiisa gacanta ku dejiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hagaaji-cabbir-la-yaqaan\"\u003EHagaaji cabbir la yaqaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsticmaal tan marka aanad aaminin miisaan la daabacay, marka set-ka la beddelay, ama xaashigu leeyahay &quot;not to scale&quot; laakiin leeyahay cabbiro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur xaashiga oo weynee cabbir dheer oo aad yaqaan, sida masaafadda gridka ama cabbirka guud ee dhismaha. Ka dheer, ka sax badan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E, ama taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji hal dhammaad cabbirka. Weynee dhammaad kasta si aad u sax u noqoto; waad weynayn kartaa oo waad u jiidi kartaa intaad gujinayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji dhammaadka kale. Hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si xariiqdu u ahaato 0°, 45° ama 90°. Wada-hadalka \u003Cstrong\u003EHagaaji xaashigan\u003C/strong\u003E wuu furmaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor masaafada dhabta ah \u003Cstrong\u003EMasaafada dhabta ah\u003C/strong\u003E, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E24.5\u003C/code\u003E (feet tobanle), \u003Ccode\u003E30&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E7.5 m\u003C/code\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EGalinta dherarka, qiimaha iyo boqolkiiba\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejiso miisaanka\u003C/span\u003E. Bar-ka xaaladda wuxuu muujinayaa miisaanka sida &quot;1&quot; = (n)&#039;&quot;, marka uu ku dhow yahay 0.5% diyaar wuxuu sheegaa kee, tusaale ahaan &quot;oo waafaqa 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; (dooro diyaarkaas si aad u hesho miisaan sax ah)&quot;. TakeoffCraft wuxuu dib ugu noqdaa qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka hagaajintu waafaqdo diyaar, dooro diyaarkaas wuxuu siinayaa miisaan sax ah halkii uu ku xirnaan lahaa meesha aad gujisay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubi-miisaanka\"\u003EHubi miisaanka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMar walba hubi miisaan cusub cabbir labaad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E, ama taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji labada dhammaad ee cabbir naqshadda lagu daabacay. Bar-ka xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Hubi: 12&#039;-6&quot;&quot; oo isla dhererkaas feet tobanle iyo mitir ah, xariiqda hubinta ayaana xaashiga ku sii jirta dhererkeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsbar-bar la-yeel cabbirka lagu daabacay. Haddii uu khaldan yahay, hagaaji cabbir ka dheer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u nadiifiso xariiqda hubinta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-miisaanka\"\u003EBeddel miisaanka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro diyaar kale ama dib u hagaaji. Haddii xaashigu hore u lahaa cabbiro, TakeoffCraft wuxuu weydiinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EMa beddelaa miisaanka xaashigan?\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuuna sheegayaa inta cabbir dib loo cabbiri doono. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeddel miisaanka\u003C/span\u003E. Socod kasta iyo aag kasta oo xaashiga ku jira ayaa dib loo cabbiraa miisaanka cusub. Waad ka noqon kartaa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sababta-xaashiyada-aan-miisaan-lahayn-looga-reebo-wadarta\"\u003ESababta xaashiyada aan miisaan lahayn looga reebo wadarta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadda xaashi aan miisaan lahayn ma leh dherer ama aag dhab ah. TakeoffCraft weligiis uma tiro eber, taasoo si aan la dareemin u dhigi lahayd qiyaaskaaga mid aad u hooseeya. Halkaas wuxuu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eka reebaa calaamadahaas wadarta,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Emuujiyaa &quot;+(n) aan miisaan lahayn&quot; shayga ku xiga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirooyinka\u003C/span\u003E,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Emuujiyaa &quot;Aan dhammaystirnayn: (n) calaamo oo xaashiyo aan miisaan lahayn (lama geliyo wadarta)&quot; madasha miiska,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eqoraa tirada tiirka qoraalka ee dhoofinta miiska xisaabta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETani waxay dhici kartaa marka aad furto mashruuc aan miisaankiisu la dejin. Xaashiga miisaan sii, calaamadahana waa la tirin doonaa isla markiiba. Calaamadaha tirada (Count) had iyo jeer waa la tirinayaa; uma baahna miisaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"talooyin\"\u003ETalooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDejiso miisaanka xaashi kasta oo aad cabbiri doonto ka hor intaadan bilaabin. Ka raadi liiska xaashiyada \u003Cstrong\u003EAan miisaan lahayn\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u hesho kuwa hadhay (sanduuqa raadinta wuxuu eegaa magacyada xaashiyada, ma aha miisaannada).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaahfaahinta iyo qorshayaasha la weyneeyay ee isla xaashi badanaa waxay leeyihiin miisaan kale. TakeoffCraft wuxuu xaashi kasta leeyahay hal miisaan; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWixii weli la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaqshado metric: dooro diyaar metric sida \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E, ama hagaaji masaafad metric sida \u003Ccode\u003E6000 mm\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Xaashi kasta wuxuu leeyahay miisaankiisa. Adigu ayaad dejisaa, ama TakeoffCraft wuu ka akhrin karaa qoraalka xaashiyada (hoos), kadibna hubi. Ilaa xaashi uu leeyahay miisaan, Socod, Aag, Goobo iyo God way diidaan inay ku cabbiraan. Tiri iyo Tirin otomaatig ah waxay shaqeeyaan iyagoon miisaan lahayn. Liiska xaashiyada wuxuu muujinayaa miisaan kasta oo xaashi, ama Aan miisaan lahayn. Bar-ka hoosta xaashiga furan wuxuu leeyahay isku mid. Isticmaal diyaar (marka PDF-ka lagu daabacay cabbir buuxa) Fur xaashiga. Fur liiska Diyaar ee kooxda Miisaan. Dooro miisaanka lagu daabacay naqshadda, tusaale ahaan 1/8\" = 1'-0\" hoosta Mimaarka. Jaanqaadka xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"Miisaanka xaashigan: 1/8\" = 1'-0\".\" Hubi (hoos). Diyaar wuxuu qaadanayaa in PDF-ku yahay cabbirka warqadda dhabta ah ee naqshadda loogu talo galay. Haddii qof uu sameeyay PDF-ka \"fit to page\", ama uu yahay set nus-cabbir ah, diyaarku waa khalad. Taas beddelkeeda hagaaji. Liiska oo dhan waxaa ku jira Diyaarinta miisaanka. Akhri miisaannada qoraalka xaashiyada Naqshado badan waxay sheegaan miisaankooda: SCALE: 1/4\" = 1'-0\" xaashiga macluumaadka, 1:100 hoosta aragti. TakeoffCraft wuu akhriyi karaa oo wuu dejin karaa xaashi kasta hal mar. Fur liiska Diyaar oo dooro Xaashiyada qoraalkooda… (kore). Liiska wuxuu muujinayaa xaashi kasta: miisaankeeda hadda, iyo waxa qoraalkeedu leeyahay — Waxay leedahay 1/4\" = 1'-0\", Qoraal miisaan ma leh, ama Waxay leedahay ma-miisaano (NTS). Xaashiyada aan miisaan lahayn oo leh mid ayaa la calaamadeeyay. Calaamee ama ka saar kuwa kale, kadibna dooro Dejiso miisaanka la calaamadiyay. Hal Ctrl+Z ayaa dhammaantood soo celiya. Hubi hal cabbir xaashi kasta adigoo isticmaalaya Hubi (hoos): diyaar waa sax kaliya marka PDF-ka lagu daabacay cabbir buuxa. Wuxuu akhriyaa qaababka mimaarka (3/16\" = 1'-0\", 1 1/2\" = 1'-0\"), injineeriga (1\" = 20') iyo metric (1:50) oo waafaqa diyaar. Marka xaashi uu leeyahay in ka badan hal miisaan (naqshad leh faahfaahin weyneysan), wuxuu qaadanayaa kan ugu badan ee qoran, kan la qoray kadib erayga SCALE wuxuu ka mudan yahay laba jeer; kuwa kale waxaa lagu muujiyaa midab casaan ah si aad u hubisid. Xaashi la sawiray ma leh qoraal: miisaankiisa gacanta ku dejiso. Hagaaji cabbir la yaqaan Isticmaal tan marka aanad aaminin miisaan la daabacay, marka set-ka la beddelay, ama xaashigu leeyahay \"not to scale\" laakiin leeyahay cabbiro. Fur xaashiga oo weynee cabbir dheer oo aad yaqaan, sida masaafadda gridka ama cabbirka guud ee dhismaha. Ka dheer, ka sax badan. Dooro Hagaaji kooxda Miisaan, ama taabo K. Guji hal dhammaad cabbirka. Weynee dhammaad kasta si aad u sax u noqoto; waad weynayn kartaa oo waad u jiidi kartaa intaad gujinayso. Guji dhammaadka kale. Hay Shift si xariiqdu u ahaato 0°, 45° ama 90°. Wada-hadalka Hagaaji xaashigan wuu furmaa. Ku qor masaafada dhabta ah Masaafada dhabta ah, tusaale ahaan 24'-6 1/2\", 24.5 (feet tobanle), 30\" ama 7.5 m. Eeg Galinta dherarka, qiimaha iyo boqolkiiba. Dooro Dejiso miisaanka. Bar-ka xaaladda wuxuu muujinayaa miisaanka sida \"1\" = (n)'\", marka uu ku dhow yahay 0.5% diyaar wuxuu sheegaa kee, tusaale ahaan \"oo waafaqa 1/4\" = 1'-0\" (dooro diyaarkaas si aad u hesho miisaan sax ah)\". TakeoffCraft wuxuu dib ugu noqdaa qalabka Dooro. Marka hagaajintu waafaqdo diyaar, dooro diyaarkaas wuxuu siinayaa miisaan sax ah halkii uu ku xirnaan lahaa meesha aad gujisay. Hubi miisaanka Mar walba hubi miisaan cusub cabbir labaad. Dooro Hubi kooxda Miisaan, ama taabo D. Guji labada dhammaad ee cabbir naqshadda lagu daabacay. Bar-ka xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"Hubi: 12'-6\"\" oo isla dhererkaas feet tobanle iyo mitir ah, xariiqda hubinta ayaana xaashiga ku sii jirta dhererkeeda. Isbar-bar la-yeel cabbirka lagu daabacay. Haddii uu khaldan yahay, hagaaji cabbir ka dheer. Taabo Esc si aad u nadiifiso xariiqda hubinta. Beddel miisaanka Dooro diyaar kale ama dib u hagaaji. Haddii xaashigu hore u lahaa cabbiro, TakeoffCraft wuxuu weydiinayaa Ma beddelaa miisaanka xaashigan? wuxuuna sheegayaa inta cabbir dib loo cabbiri doono. Dooro Beddel miisaanka. Socod kasta iyo aag kasta oo xaashiga ku jira ayaa dib loo cabbiraa miisaanka cusub. Waad ka noqon kartaa Ctrl+Z. Sababta xaashiyada aan miisaan lahayn looga reebo wadarta Calaamadda xaashi aan miisaan lahayn ma leh dherer ama aag dhab ah. TakeoffCraft weligiis uma tiro eber, taasoo si aan la dareemin u dhigi lahayd qiyaaskaaga mid aad u hooseeya. Halkaas wuxuu: ka reebaa calaamadahaas wadarta, muujiyaa \"+(n) aan miisaan lahayn\" shayga ku xiga Tirooyinka, muujiyaa \"Aan dhammaystirnayn: (n) calaamo oo xaashiyo aan miisaan lahayn (lama geliyo wadarta)\" madasha miiska, qoraa tirada tiirka qoraalka ee dhoofinta miiska xisaabta. Tani waxay dhici kartaa marka aad furto mashruuc aan miisaankiisu la dejin. Xaashiga miisaan sii, calaamadahana waa la tirin doonaa isla markiiba. Calaamadaha tirada (Count) had iyo jeer waa la tirinayaa; uma baahna miisaan. Talooyin Dejiso miisaanka xaashi kasta oo aad cabbiri doonto ka hor intaadan bilaabin. Ka raadi liiska xaashiyada Aan miisaan lahayn si aad u hesho kuwa hadhay (sanduuqa raadinta wuxuu eegaa magacyada xaashiyada, ma aha miisaannada). Faahfaahinta iyo qorshayaasha la weyneeyay ee isla xaashi badanaa waxay leeyihiin miisaan kale. TakeoffCraft wuxuu xaashi kasta leeyahay hal miisaan; eeg Wixii weli la dhisin. Naqshado metric: dooro diyaar metric sida 1:100, ama hagaaji masaafad metric sida 6000 mm.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"create-items","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Abuur walxaha qadarka","summary":"Samee walxaha socodka, aagga iyo tirada, oo deji unugooda, joogga ama qotada, qashinka, iyo heerarka agabka iyo shaqada.","section":"tasks","order":30,"keywords":["kooxda","heerka wax soo saarka","tirada kooxda","mushahar","saacadaha","saacadaha ninka","saacadaha shaqaalaha","maalmaha kooxda","saacadaha shaqada","shay","shay cusub","xaalad","xaalado badan","sidoo kale cabbir","noocyo badan","qol","socod","aag","tiri","unug","joog","qoto","qashin","agab","shaqo","qiime","midab","kharash"],"headings":[{"id":"qadarka-gacanta-lagu-qoray-naqshad-la-aan","text":"Qadarka gacanta lagu qoray (naqshad la'aan)","level":2},{"id":"samee-shay","text":"Samee shay","level":2},{"id":"dooro-shayga-aad-ku-jiidayso","text":"Dooro shayga aad ku jiidayso","level":2},{"id":"deji-shayga","text":"Deji shayga","level":2},{"id":"hal-shay-noocyo-calaamo-badan","text":"Hal shay, noocyo calaamo badan","level":2},{"id":"heerarka-miiskha","text":"Heerarka miiskha","level":2},{"id":"sida-qiimaynta-u-shaqeyso","text":"Sida qiimaynta u shaqeyso","level":2},{"id":"shaqada-kooxda","text":"Shaqada kooxda","level":2},{"id":"shayada-metric","text":"Shayada metric","level":2},{"id":"next","text":"Next","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShay\u003C/strong\u003E waa wax aad cabbirto oo qiimeyso: nooca darbi, dhamaadka dabaqa, saqaf, albaab, iftiinka. Calaamad kasta oo aad jiido waxay ka tirsan tahay shay. Barnaamijyada kale waxay u yaqaanaan xaalado.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShay kastaa wuxuu leeyahay nooc (waxaana uu aqbali karaa noocyo kale oo calaamo ah, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items#one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-hash=\"one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\"\u003EHal shay, noocyo calaamo badan\u003C/a\u003E):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENooca\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxaad jiidaysaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sheegaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUnugyada\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESocod\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESilsiladaha dhibcaha xiriirsan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDherer, tirada orodyada, iyo aagga darbiga marka ay leedahay joog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF ama m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAag\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaabab xidhan oo leh god-dhaanta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAag, hareer, tirada aagagga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESF, SY, SQ, ac, ha ama m²\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal guji halkii shay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta jirta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEA\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQadar gacanta lagu qoray\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxba: qadarka ayaa lagu qoraa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirada aad qortay (ama mid laga keenay CivilCraft)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELS, EA, CY, m³, lb, TON, kg, t, LF, m, SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha ama m²\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qadarka-gacanta-lagu-qoray-naqshad-la-aan\"\u003EQadarka gacanta lagu qoray (naqshad la&#039;aan)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxyaabo qaarkood ee qiyaasta lama sawiro abid: diyaarinta, ogolaanshaha, xaaladaha degdega ah, qandaraasta guud ee hal qiime, iyo jaridda iyo buuxinta oo CivilCraft xisaabiyay. Ka dhig \u003Cstrong\u003EQadar gacanta lagu qoray\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShay cusub\u003C/span\u003E, qor magac, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQadarka gacanta lagu qoray (naqshad la&#039;aan)\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaabka shayga dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnug\u003C/span\u003E (LS haddii ay tahay qiime guud), kadibna qor \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiro\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E1\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2.5\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E1,250\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQashinka iyo heerarka u deji sida shay kasta oo kale. Qaababka xisaabinta ee assembly-ga waxay isticmaalaan \u003Ccode\u003EQ\u003C/code\u003E, taas oo ah qadarka, tusaale \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(Q / 12)\u003C/code\u003E oo ah raritaanno baabuur.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQadarka gacanta lagu qoray ma qaadato calaamo, weliba ma ka dhigo qiyaasta mid aan dhammaystirnayn. Marka qiyaasta ay leedahay aagag tartan, qaabeeyaha wuxuu leeyahay sidoo kale \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAagga tartanka\u003C/span\u003E: qadarka markaa wuxuu ku tiriyaa aagaas, isbadalkiisa iyo wadarteeda, siday calaamad halkaas ku tiri lahayd. Qadarka laga keenay barnaamij kale wuxuu sheegaa halka uu ka yimid, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/earthwork#cut-and-fill-from-civilcraft\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/earthwork\" data-hash=\"cut-and-fill-from-civilcraft\"\u003EDhulka iyo dhibcaha sare\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-shay\"\u003ESamee shay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu jira dhinaca midig \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShay cusub\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor magac, sida \u003Ccode\u003EDarbiga gudaha nooca A\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003EDhar sagxadda\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro nooca: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESocod\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAag\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiri\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar\u003C/span\u003E (ama taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Shayga ayaa ka soo muuqda liiska midabkiisa, wuxuuna noqdaa shayga aad ku jiidayso, qaabeeyaha hoostiisa ayaa furmaya. Xariiqda xaaladda ayaa kuu sheegaysa qalabka xiga ee aad dooratid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E foomka dhexdiisa si aad u xirto adigoon shay ku darin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad marka hore doorato qalab cabbir, TakeoffCraft wuxuu isticmaalaa shayga ugu dambeeya ee nooca saxda ah, ama wuxuu furaa foomka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShay cusub\u003C/span\u003E oo nooca horey loogu doortay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-shayga-aad-ku-jiidayso\"\u003EDooro shayga aad ku jiidayso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji shay liiska ku jira. Wuxuu noqdaa shayga calaamadaha cusub loo geliyo, calaamadihiisa waxay ku iftiimaan xaashi kasta, kuwa kalena waxay ifuraan. Haddii xaashida furan aysan ku jirin calaamadihiisa, TakeoffCraft wuxuu kugu boodaa xaashi leh. Mar kale guji shayga si aad u joojiso iftiinka; wuxuu sii ahaanayaa shayga aad ku jiidayso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamad guji adigoo isticmaalaya qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E sidoo kale waxay shayga uu leeyahay ka dhigaysaa mid hadda jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"deji-shayga\"\u003EDeji shayga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabeeyaha shayga (\u003Cstrong\u003EShay: (magac)\u003C/strong\u003E) wuxuu leeyahay goobahan. Mid kasta waa la kaydiyaa markaad ka baxdo goobta ama markaad taabato \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, mid kastana waa la furi karaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGoobta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ay sameyso\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMagac\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxaa lagu muujiyaa liiska, miiskhadka iyo dhoofinta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeli\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESocod, Aag ama Tiri. Waa la xidhaa marka shaygu leeyahay calaamado (&quot;Shay leh calaamado wuxuu hayaa nooceeda&quot;).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMidabka calaamadihiisa shaashadda iyo PDF-ka calaamadaysan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnug\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxa qadarka lagu soo sheegayo: LF ama m socodka; SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha ama m² aagga; EA tirada.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESidoo kale cabbir\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENoocyada kale ee calaamadaha ee shaygu aqbalo, mid kasta unugiisa. Eeg hoose.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoog\u003C/span\u003E (socod)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJoogga darbi. Shaygaas wuxuu kaloo sheegaa aagga darbiga (dherer × joog). Orodyada ka imanaya moodeelka BimCraft waxay leeyihiin albaabkooda iyo daaqadahooda: kuwaas waa la jaraa hal mar, shayguna wuxuu sheegaa aagga guud, furayaasha iyo halka saafiga ah. Mashruuca BimCraft ee qaabka cabbirka la doortay waa lagu cabbiraa habkaas halkan sidoo kale (qoraalku wuu magacaabaa, isagoo ilaha sheegaya, wuxuuna sheegaa in aan la hubin tirinta hanti-qiimeeyaha); habkaas halkan looma beddeli karo. Dhagaxyada ama baloogyada iyo qorraxda nooca darbiga waxay yimaadaan labo qayb: unugyada la dalbanayo iyo mugga qorraxda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoto\u003C/span\u003E (aag)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoto ama dhumuc, oo loo isticmaalo qaababka assembly-ga (tusaale mugga kaadi).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQashin %\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxaa lagu daraa qadarka ka hor qiimaynta: 10 waxay micnaheedu tahay qadar × 1.10.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgab $/LF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKharashka agabka unug kasta. Calaamadda waxay raacdaa unugga: $/SF, $/EA iwm.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShaqada $/LF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKharashka shaqada unug kasta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELambarka CSI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELambarkiisa CSI MasterFormat, tusaale \u003Ccode\u003E09 21 16\u003C/code\u003E (ama kaliya qaybta, \u003Ccode\u003E09\u003C/code\u003E). Xaashida By division ee buug-shaqada ayaa kharashka ku kooxeysa isaga. Shayada \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003Exirmooyinka shaqada\u003C/a\u003E horey buu u leeyahay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJoogga iyo qotada waxay qaataan fiid iyo inji (\u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E8&#039; 6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E) ama fiid tobanle (\u003Ccode\u003E9\u003C/code\u003E) unugyada imperial, iyo mitir (\u003Ccode\u003E2.7\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2700 mm\u003C/code\u003E) unugyada metric. Heerarku waxay qaataan qadar sida \u003Ccode\u003E12.50\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E$1,250\u003C/code\u003E, ilaa afar meel tobanle. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EGelinta dherer, heer iyo boqolkiiba\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta goobaha, \u003Cstrong\u003ELa cabbiray\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa wadarta qaababka shaygu isticmaali karo, oo leh xarfahooda: Dherer (L), Orodyo (N), Aagga darbiga (A) socodka; Aag (A), Hareer (P), Aagag (N) aagga; Tiro (N) tirada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hal-shay-noocyo-calaamo-badan\"\u003EHal shay, noocyo calaamo badan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaa jira waxyaabo lagu cabbiro laba ama ka badan oo siyaabood ah: qol wuxuu leeyahay dabaq (aag), sal ah oo ku dhex jira darbiyadiisa (socod) iyo albaabbo (tiro). Halkii aad saddex shay samayn lahayd, hal shay samee:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamee shayga nooceeda ugu weyn, tusaale shay aag oo \u003Ccode\u003EQolka 101\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESidoo kale cabbir\u003C/span\u003E ee qaabeeyaha, calaamee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESocod\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiri\u003C/span\u003E ama labadaba. Mid kasta wuxuu helaa unug ag ku dhow.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu jiid qalab kasta oo nooca uu shaygu aqbalo: marka \u003Ccode\u003EQolka 101\u003C/code\u003E uu hadda jiro, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAag\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu jiidaa dabaqa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESocod\u003C/span\u003E salka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiri\u003C/span\u003E albaabbadiisa. TakeoffCraft ma weydiinayo shay kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska shayada wuxuu muujinayaa qadar kasta (\u003Ccode\u003E50.00 SF + 2 EA\u003C/code\u003E). Miiskha qadarka safka shayga waxa ku jira qadarkiisa ugu weyn, nooc kasta oo kale safkiisa hoose ayuu helaa, tusaale \u003Cstrong\u003EQolka 101 (tiri)\u003C/strong\u003E, oo leh qashinkiisa, agabkiisa iyo heerarka shaqadiisa. Dhoofinta, miiskha xaashida, iyo sharraxaadda PDF-ka calaamadaysan ayaa sidaas oo kale ku liistaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGoobaha nooca ugu weyn waxay ahaadaan kuwa sheeganta: joogga ama qotada, garaaca, ka jarista dhabarka, iyo qaabka 3D waxay khuseeyaan calaamadahooda oo keliya. Socod la jiidayo shay aag ahi waxa lagu cabbiraa si fudud dhanka qorshaha, waxayna u muuqataa mid taag ah 3D. Qaababka assembly-ga waxay isticmaalaan wadarta nooca ugu weyn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENooc kasta waxa laga furi karaa oo keliya inta shaygu aanu lahayn calaamado noocaas ah; tirtir, ama marka hore u wareeji shay kale hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamada la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E. Calaamadaha waxa loo wareejin karaa shay kasta oo aqbalaysa noocooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta waxaa ku jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssembly\u003C/span\u003E: qaybaha sida kuwa birta ama loox, mid walba qaabkiisa iyo heerarkiisa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EAssemblies iyo qaababka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta dhammaadka: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKor u dhaqaaq\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHoos u dhaqaaq\u003C/span\u003E waxay beddelaan meesha shayga ku yaal liiska iyo dhoofinta, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir shay\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu tirtiraa shayga iyo calaamadihiisa oo dhan (kadib su&#039;aal; waad furi kartaa).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShayada aagga waxay leeyihiin sidoo kale \u003Cstrong\u003EGaraaca\u003C/strong\u003E (dusha saqafka oo lagu cabbiro janjeerka: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/roofs-and-slopes\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/roofs-and-slopes\"\u003ESaqafyada iyo janjeerrada\u003C/a\u003E) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EKa jarista\u003C/strong\u003E (calaamadahooda waxay ka jaraan aagagga shayada kale: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas#back-outs-columns-shafts-and-openings-taken-out-of-several-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-hash=\"back-outs-columns-shafts-and-openings-taken-out-of-several-items\"\u003ECabbir aagagga\u003C/a\u003E). Shayada socodka waxay leeyihiin \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeer\u003C/strong\u003E (Sinji, Gees, Hip ama xagaa) iyo, geeska iyo hipka, \u003Cstrong\u003EGaraaca\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"heerarka-miiskha\"\u003EHeerarka miiskha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad sidoo kale ku qori kartaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQashin %\u003C/span\u003E, heerarka agabka iyo shaqada miiskha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirooyinka\u003C/span\u003E ee hoose (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESida shayba\u003C/span\u003E). Waa isla dejinta sida qaabeeyaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-qiimaynta-u-shaqeyso\"\u003ESida qiimaynta u shaqeyso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShay kasta iyo qayb kasta oo assembly ah:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQashin ku jira\u003C/strong\u003E = qadar × (1 + qashin %).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAgab\u003C/strong\u003E = qashin ku jira × agab unugga, lagu soo wareejiyay sentiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShaqo\u003C/strong\u003E = qashin ku jira × shaqo unugga, lagu soo wareejiyay sentiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWadarta\u003C/strong\u003E = agab + shaqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWadarta shaqada\u003C/span\u003E waxay isku darta shay kasta iyo qayb kasta. Shay wuxuu leeyahay heerarkiisa iyo assembly isla waqtigaas; labaduba waa la tiriyaa, sidaas darteed ka dhig heerarka shayga 0 marka qaybahiisa ay qaadaan kharashka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shaqada-kooxda\"\u003EShaqada kooxda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHalkii heer shaqo oo unug kasta, shaqada shayga waxay ka imaan kartaa kooxda: inta ay wax soo saarto saacad kasta, inta qof, iyo waxa mid kasta uu kasbado. Hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShaqaalaha kooxda\u003C/span\u003E ee qaabeeyaha shayga, calaamee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiimaha shaqada ka qaad kooxda\u003C/span\u003E oo buuxi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGoobta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETusaale\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax soo saarka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E20\u003C/code\u003E LF saacad kasta (unugga shayga) kooxda oo dhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirada kooxda\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2\u003C/code\u003E qof\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMushahar $/saac mid kasta\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E45\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffCraft wuxuu xisaabiyaa, qadarka ku jira qashinka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Esaacadaha kooxda\u003C/strong\u003E = qadar ÷ wax soo saar (110 LF ÷ 20 = 5.5),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Esaacadaha shaqaalaha\u003C/strong\u003E = saacadaha kooxda × tirada kooxda (11),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Emaalmaha kooxda\u003C/strong\u003E = saacadaha kooxda ÷ 8 (0.69),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eshaqo\u003C/strong\u003E = saacadaha shaqaalaha × mushahar ($495.00).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabeeyaha wuxuu muujinayaa natiijada iyo heerka ay gaarto ($4.50/LF). Heerka shaqada shayga markaas wuu akhriska kaliya yahay, qaabeeyaha iyo miiskha labadooduba. Madasha miiskha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirooyinka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa saacadaha shaqaalaha iyo maalmaha kooxda ee shaqada. Dhoofinta wuxuu sheegaa saacadaha kooxda kasta, buug-shaqada unugga shaqada waa qaacido kooxda ku xiran (\u003Ccode\u003EROUND(F2/20*2*45,2)\u003C/code\u003E). Ka saar sanduuqa si aad ugu noqoto heer unug kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shayada-metric\"\u003EShayada metric\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro m (socod) ama m² (aag) unug ahaan. Qadarka, joogga iyo qiyamka qaababka markaa waxay ku jiraan mitir. Miisaanka xaashida wuxuu noqon karaa mid kasta oo preset ama calibration ah; unugyada iyo miisaanku waa kuwo madaxbanaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"next\"\u003ENext\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\"\u003ECabbir socodka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\"\u003ECabbir aagagga leh god-dhaanta\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-by-hand\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-by-hand\"\u003ETirin gacanta\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Shay waa wax aad cabbirto oo qiimeyso: nooca darbi, dhamaadka dabaqa, saqaf, albaab, iftiinka. Calaamad kasta oo aad jiido waxay ka tirsan tahay shay. Barnaamijyada kale waxay u yaqaanaan xaalado. Shay kastaa wuxuu leeyahay nooc (waxaana uu aqbali karaa noocyo kale oo calaamo ah, eeg Hal shay, noocyo calaamo badan): Nooca Waxaad jiidaysaa Waxa uu sheegaa Unugyada Socod Silsiladaha dhibcaha xiriirsan Dherer, tirada orodyada, iyo aagga darbiga marka ay leedahay joog LF ama m Aag Qaabab xidhan oo leh god-dhaanta Aag, hareer, tirada aagagga SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha ama m² Tiri Hal guji halkii shay Inta jirta EA Qadar gacanta lagu qoray Waxba: qadarka ayaa lagu qoraa Tirada aad qortay (ama mid laga keenay CivilCraft) LS, EA, CY, m³, lb, TON, kg, t, LF, m, SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha ama m² Qadarka gacanta lagu qoray (naqshad la'aan) Waxyaabo qaarkood ee qiyaasta lama sawiro abid: diyaarinta, ogolaanshaha, xaaladaha degdega ah, qandaraasta guud ee hal qiime, iyo jaridda iyo buuxinta oo CivilCraft xisaabiyay. Ka dhig Qadar gacanta lagu qoray: Dooro Shay cusub, qor magac, dooro Qadarka gacanta lagu qoray (naqshad la'aan), kadibna dooro Ku dar. Qaabka shayga dooro Unug (LS haddii ay tahay qiime guud), kadibna qor Tiro: 1, 2.5 ama 1,250. Qashinka iyo heerarka u deji sida shay kasta oo kale. Qaababka xisaabinta ee assembly-ga waxay isticmaalaan Q, taas oo ah qadarka, tusaale ceil(Q / 12) oo ah raritaanno baabuur. Qadarka gacanta lagu qoray ma qaadato calaamo, weliba ma ka dhigo qiyaasta mid aan dhammaystirnayn. Marka qiyaasta ay leedahay aagag tartan, qaabeeyaha wuxuu leeyahay sidoo kale Aagga tartanka: qadarka markaa wuxuu ku tiriyaa aagaas, isbadalkiisa iyo wadarteeda, siday calaamad halkaas ku tiri lahayd. Qadarka laga keenay barnaamij kale wuxuu sheegaa halka uu ka yimid, eeg Dhulka iyo dhibcaha sare. Samee shay Ku jira dhinaca midig Walxaha, dooro Shay cusub. Qor magac, sida Darbiga gudaha nooca A ama Dhar sagxadda. Dooro nooca: Socod, Aag ama Tiri. Dooro Ku dar (ama taabo Enter). Shayga ayaa ka soo muuqda liiska midabkiisa, wuxuuna noqdaa shayga aad ku jiidayso, qaabeeyaha hoostiisa ayaa furmaya. Xariiqda xaaladda ayaa kuu sheegaysa qalabka xiga ee aad dooratid. Taabo Esc foomka dhexdiisa si aad u xirto adigoon shay ku darin. Haddii aad marka hore doorato qalab cabbir, TakeoffCraft wuxuu isticmaalaa shayga ugu dambeeya ee nooca saxda ah, ama wuxuu furaa foomka Shay cusub oo nooca horey loogu doortay. Dooro shayga aad ku jiidayso Guji shay liiska ku jira. Wuxuu noqdaa shayga calaamadaha cusub loo geliyo, calaamadihiisa waxay ku iftiimaan xaashi kasta, kuwa kalena waxay ifuraan. Haddii xaashida furan aysan ku jirin calaamadihiisa, TakeoffCraft wuxuu kugu boodaa xaashi leh. Mar kale guji shayga si aad u joojiso iftiinka; wuxuu sii ahaanayaa shayga aad ku jiidayso. Calaamad guji adigoo isticmaalaya qalabka Dooro sidoo kale waxay shayga uu leeyahay ka dhigaysaa mid hadda jira. Deji shayga Qaabeeyaha shayga (Shay: (magac)) wuxuu leeyahay goobahan. Mid kasta waa la kaydiyaa markaad ka baxdo goobta ama markaad taabato Enter, mid kastana waa la furi karaa. Goobta Waxa ay sameyso Magac Waxaa lagu muujiyaa liiska, miiskhadka iyo dhoofinta. Geli Socod, Aag ama Tiri. Waa la xidhaa marka shaygu leeyahay calaamado (\"Shay leh calaamado wuxuu hayaa nooceeda\"). Midab Midabka calaamadihiisa shaashadda iyo PDF-ka calaamadaysan. Unug Waxa qadarka lagu soo sheegayo: LF ama m socodka; SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha ama m² aagga; EA tirada. Sidoo kale cabbir Noocyada kale ee calaamadaha ee shaygu aqbalo, mid kasta unugiisa. Eeg hoose. Joog (socod) Joogga darbi. Shaygaas wuxuu kaloo sheegaa aagga darbiga (dherer × joog). Orodyada ka imanaya moodeelka BimCraft waxay leeyihiin albaabkooda iyo daaqadahooda: kuwaas waa la jaraa hal mar, shayguna wuxuu sheegaa aagga guud, furayaasha iyo halka saafiga ah. Mashruuca BimCraft ee qaabka cabbirka la doortay waa lagu cabbiraa habkaas halkan sidoo kale (qoraalku wuu magacaabaa, isagoo ilaha sheegaya, wuxuuna sheegaa in aan la hubin tirinta hanti-qiimeeyaha); habkaas halkan looma beddeli karo. Dhagaxyada ama baloogyada iyo qorraxda nooca darbiga waxay yimaadaan labo qayb: unugyada la dalbanayo iyo mugga qorraxda. Qoto (aag) Qoto ama dhumuc, oo loo isticmaalo qaababka assembly-ga (tusaale mugga kaadi). Qashin % Waxaa lagu daraa qadarka ka hor qiimaynta: 10 waxay micnaheedu tahay qadar × 1.10. Agab $/LF Kharashka agabka unug kasta. Calaamadda waxay raacdaa unugga: $/SF, $/EA iwm. Shaqada $/LF Kharashka shaqada unug kasta. Lambarka CSI Lambarkiisa CSI MasterFormat, tusaale 09 21 16 (ama kaliya qaybta, 09). Xaashida By division ee buug-shaqada ayaa kharashka ku kooxeysa isaga. Shayada xirmooyinka shaqada horey buu u leeyahay. Joogga iyo qotada waxay qaataan fiid iyo inji (9'-0\", 8' 6\") ama fiid tobanle (9) unugyada imperial, iyo mitir (2.7, 2700 mm) unugyada metric. Heerarku waxay qaataan qadar sida 12.50 ama $1,250, ilaa afar meel tobanle. Eeg Gelinta dherer, heer iyo boqolkiiba. Hoosta goobaha, La cabbiray wuxuu muujiyaa wadarta qaababka shaygu isticmaali karo, oo leh xarfahooda: Dherer (L), Orodyo (N), Aagga darbiga (A) socodka; Aag (A), Hareer (P), Aagag (N) aagga; Tiro (N) tirada. Hal shay, noocyo calaamo badan Waxaa jira waxyaabo lagu cabbiro laba ama ka badan oo siyaabood ah: qol wuxuu leeyahay dabaq (aag), sal ah oo ku dhex jira darbiyadiisa (socod) iyo albaabbo (tiro). Halkii aad saddex shay samayn lahayd, hal shay samee: Samee shayga nooceeda ugu weyn, tusaale shay aag oo Qolka 101. Hoosta Sidoo kale cabbir ee qaabeeyaha, calaamee Socod, Tiri ama labadaba. Mid kasta wuxuu helaa unug ag ku dhow. Ku jiid qalab kasta oo nooca uu shaygu aqbalo: marka Qolka 101 uu hadda jiro, Aag wuxuu jiidaa dabaqa, Socod salka, Tiri albaabbadiisa. TakeoffCraft ma weydiinayo shay kale. Liiska shayada wuxuu muujinayaa qadar kasta (50.00 SF + 2 EA). Miiskha qadarka safka shayga waxa ku jira qadarkiisa ugu weyn, nooc kasta oo kale safkiisa hoose ayuu helaa, tusaale Qolka 101 (tiri), oo leh qashinkiisa, agabkiisa iyo heerarka shaqadiisa. Dhoofinta, miiskha xaashida, iyo sharraxaadda PDF-ka calaamadaysan ayaa sidaas oo kale ku liistaa. Goobaha nooca ugu weyn waxay ahaadaan kuwa sheeganta: joogga ama qotada, garaaca, ka jarista dhabarka, iyo qaabka 3D waxay khuseeyaan calaamadahooda oo keliya. Socod la jiidayo shay aag ahi waxa lagu cabbiraa si fudud dhanka qorshaha, waxayna u muuqataa mid taag ah 3D. Qaababka assembly-ga waxay isticmaalaan wadarta nooca ugu weyn. Nooc kasta waxa laga furi karaa oo keliya inta shaygu aanu lahayn calaamado noocaas ah; tirtir, ama marka hore u wareeji shay kale hoosta Calaamada la doortay. Calaamadaha waxa loo wareejin karaa shay kasta oo aqbalaysa noocooda. Hoosta waxaa ku jira Assembly: qaybaha sida kuwa birta ama loox, mid walba qaabkiisa iyo heerarkiisa. Eeg Assemblies iyo qaababka. Hoosta dhammaadka: Kor u dhaqaaq iyo Hoos u dhaqaaq waxay beddelaan meesha shayga ku yaal liiska iyo dhoofinta, Tirtir shay wuxuu tirtiraa shayga iyo calaamadihiisa oo dhan (kadib su'aal; waad furi kartaa). Shayada aagga waxay leeyihiin sidoo kale Garaaca (dusha saqafka oo lagu cabbiro janjeerka: Saqafyada iyo janjeerrada) iyo Ka jarista (calaamadahooda waxay ka jaraan aagagga shayada kale: Cabbir aagagga). Shayada socodka waxay leeyihiin Janjeer (Sinji, Gees, Hip ama xagaa) iyo, geeska iyo hipka, Garaaca. Heerarka miiskha Waxaad sidoo kale ku qori kartaa Qashin %, heerarka agabka iyo shaqada miiskha Tirooyinka ee hoose (Sida shayba). Waa isla dejinta sida qaabeeyaha. Sida qiimaynta u shaqeyso Shay kasta iyo qayb kasta oo assembly ah: Qashin ku jira = qadar × (1 + qashin %). Agab = qashin ku jira × agab unugga, lagu soo wareejiyay sentiga. Shaqo = qashin ku jira × shaqo unugga, lagu soo wareejiyay sentiga. Wadarta = agab + shaqo. Wadarta shaqada waxay isku darta shay kasta iyo qayb kasta. Shay wuxuu leeyahay heerarkiisa iyo assembly isla waqtigaas; labaduba waa la tiriyaa, sidaas darteed ka dhig heerarka shayga 0 marka qaybahiisa ay qaadaan kharashka. Shaqada kooxda Halkii heer shaqo oo unug kasta, shaqada shayga waxay ka imaan kartaa kooxda: inta ay wax soo saarto saacad kasta, inta qof, iyo waxa mid kasta uu kasbado. Hoosta Shaqaalaha kooxda ee qaabeeyaha shayga, calaamee Qiimaha shaqada ka qaad kooxda oo buuxi: Goobta Tusaale Wax soo saarka 20 LF saacad kasta (unugga shayga) kooxda oo dhan Tirada kooxda 2 qof Mushahar $/saac mid kasta 45 TakeoffCraft wuxuu xisaabiyaa, qadarka ku jira qashinka: saacadaha kooxda = qadar ÷ wax soo saar (110 LF ÷ 20 = 5.5), saacadaha shaqaalaha = saacadaha kooxda × tirada kooxda (11), maalmaha kooxda = saacadaha kooxda ÷ 8 (0.69), shaqo = saacadaha shaqaalaha × mushahar ($495.00). Qaabeeyaha wuxuu muujinayaa natiijada iyo heerka ay gaarto ($4.50/LF). Heerka shaqada shayga markaas wuu akhriska kaliya yahay, qaabeeyaha iyo miiskha labadooduba. Madasha miiskha Tirooyinka wuxuu ku daraa saacadaha shaqaalaha iyo maalmaha kooxda ee shaqada. Dhoofinta wuxuu sheegaa saacadaha kooxda kasta, buug-shaqada unugga shaqada waa qaacido kooxda ku xiran (ROUND(F2/20*2*45,2)). Ka saar sanduuqa si aad ugu noqoto heer unug kasta. Shayada metric Dooro m (socod) ama m² (aag) unug ahaan. Qadarka, joogga iyo qiyamka qaababka markaa waxay ku jiraan mitir. Miisaanka xaashida wuxuu noqon karaa mid kasta oo preset ama calibration ah; unugyada iyo miisaanku waa kuwo madaxbanaan. Next Cabbir socodka Cabbir aagagga leh god-dhaanta Tirin gacanta","lang":"so"},{"slug":"measure-from-a-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Ka cabbir naqshadda","summary":"Ka qaado dherer iyo aag xariiqyada, qaansooyinka, polylayn-ada iyo hatch-yada naqshadda laftiisa adigoo ku doorata, iyada oo qaansooyinka iyo godadka saxda ah, halkii aad ku raadin lahayd riix.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["ka cabbir naqshadda","joomitari","polylayn","qaanso","goobo","hatch","bulge","dherer saxda ah","aag saxda ah","dooro","daaqad","raad","CAD-ka","dherer","aag"],"headings":[{"id":"shayada-u-qaado-shay-socod-ama-aag-ahaan","text":"Shayada u qaado shay socod ama aag ahaan","level":2},{"id":"waxa-nooc-kasta-oo-shay-qaadaa","text":"Waxa nooc kasta oo shay qaadaa","level":2},{"id":"saxda-ah-iyo-ku-dhowaad-saxda-ah","text":"Saxda ah iyo ku dhowaad saxda ah","level":2},{"id":"waxa-uu-ka-qaadaa-meelaha","text":"Waxa uu ka qaadaa meelaha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshadda ka cabbir\u003C/span\u003E bar-ka xaashiga DWG ama DXF wuxuu shayagga naqshadda laftiisa u qaadaa calaamado, sidaas darteed ma raadiso riix. Dherer polylayn, dherer qaanso, aagga goobo iyo aagga hatch-ka oo godadkiisa leh waxay soo baxaan saxda ah, xisaabta xisaabinta qadarka u isticmaasho calaamad kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shayada-u-qaado-shay-socod-ama-aag-ahaan\"\u003EShayada u qaado shay socod ama aag ahaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamee ama riix shay \u003Cstrong\u003Esocod\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003Eaag\u003C/strong\u003E ah hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E. Xaashigu wuxuu u baahan yahay miisaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshadda ka cabbir\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix shayada xaashiga si aad u doorato, ama jiid daaqad ku wareegsan: wax kasta oo gudaha ku jira ayaa la doortaa. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu daaqad ku daraa wixii la doortay; mar kale riix shay la doortay si aad ka saarto. Bar-ku wuxuu tusayaa wadarta: &quot;6 socod: 108&#039;-9 1/8&quot; wadar ahaan.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro badhanka ku dar, kaas oo magacaabaya tirada iyo shayga, tusaale ahaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar 6 Edge\u003C/span\u003E (ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Shay kasta waxa uu noqdaa hal calaamad oo shayga ah, hal tallaabo ka noqo. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu nadiifiyaa wixii la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-nooc-kasta-oo-shay-qaadaa\"\u003EWaxa nooc kasta oo shay qaadaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShay \u003Cstrong\u003Esocod\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qaadaa xariiqyada, qaansooyinka, polylayn-ada, goobooyinka iyo splines-ka dherer ahaan. Qaab xidhan wuxuu tiraa dhinaca wareega. Hatch-ka way ka baxdaa: wuxuu leeyahay aag, ma aha dherer, barku waa sheegaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShay \u003Cstrong\u003Eaag\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qaadaa qaababka xidhan: polylayn xidhan, goobooyin, 2D solids, iyo hatch-ka godadkiisa. Socodyada furan way ka baxaan, barku waa sheegaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"saxda-ah-iyo-ku-dhowaad-saxda-ah\"\u003ESaxda ah iyo ku dhowaad saxda ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiqyada, qaansooyinka (bulge kasta), polylayn-ada leh bulge iyo goobooyinku waa saxda ah: dherarka iyo aagagga waxay isticmaalaan radius-ka qaanso iyo jeexdiisa, ma aha sawir ku saabsan. Ellipse-yada, splines-ka iyo hatch-yada xadkoodu ka kooban yahay geesaha waxaa lagu cabbiraa qaybo toosan oo hal digree ah ama ka yar, taasoo ku jirta boqolaad-keyd boqolkiiba ellipse-yada iyo tobankiiba inta kale; barku wuxuu sheegayaa inta aad doorato ee qallooc noocaas ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-uu-ka-qaadaa-meelaha\"\u003EWaxa uu ka qaadaa meelaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMoodeel\u003C/strong\u003E: shayada moodeelka. \u003Cstrong\u003ELayout\u003C/strong\u003E: xariiqyadiisa, iyo shayada moodeelka ku jira viewport-ka, oo miisaankooda la beddelay. Shay geesta viewport-ka gooya lama soo bandhigo (waa la gooyaa marka la daabacayo); shay labo viewport ay labadaba muujiyaan waa la qaadaa mar keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaliya lakabyada xaashigu muujiyo. Bloogyada waa la tiriyaa, ma cabbirmo: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003ETiri naqshadda\u003C/a\u003E. Polylayn 3D, meshes, solids iyo regions lama soo bandhigo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Naqshadda ka cabbir bar-ka xaashiga DWG ama DXF wuxuu shayagga naqshadda laftiisa u qaadaa calaamado, sidaas darteed ma raadiso riix. Dherer polylayn, dherer qaanso, aagga goobo iyo aagga hatch-ka oo godadkiisa leh waxay soo baxaan saxda ah, xisaabta xisaabinta qadarka u isticmaasho calaamad kasta. Shayada u qaado shay socod ama aag ahaan Samee ama riix shay socod ama aag ah hoosta Walxaha. Xaashigu wuxuu u baahan yahay miisaan. Dooro Naqshadda ka cabbir. Riix shayada xaashiga si aad u doorato, ama jiid daaqad ku wareegsan: wax kasta oo gudaha ku jira ayaa la doortaa. Shift wuxuu daaqad ku daraa wixii la doortay; mar kale riix shay la doortay si aad ka saarto. Bar-ku wuxuu tusayaa wadarta: \"6 socod: 108'-9 1/8\" wadar ahaan.\" Dooro badhanka ku dar, kaas oo magacaabaya tirada iyo shayga, tusaale ahaan Ku dar 6 Edge (ama riix Enter). Shay kasta waxa uu noqdaa hal calaamad oo shayga ah, hal tallaabo ka noqo. Esc wuxuu nadiifiyaa wixii la doortay. Waxa nooc kasta oo shay qaadaa Shay socod wuxuu qaadaa xariiqyada, qaansooyinka, polylayn-ada, goobooyinka iyo splines-ka dherer ahaan. Qaab xidhan wuxuu tiraa dhinaca wareega. Hatch-ka way ka baxdaa: wuxuu leeyahay aag, ma aha dherer, barku waa sheegaa. Shay aag wuxuu qaadaa qaababka xidhan: polylayn xidhan, goobooyin, 2D solids, iyo hatch-ka godadkiisa. Socodyada furan way ka baxaan, barku waa sheegaa. Saxda ah iyo ku dhowaad saxda ah Xariiqyada, qaansooyinka (bulge kasta), polylayn-ada leh bulge iyo goobooyinku waa saxda ah: dherarka iyo aagagga waxay isticmaalaan radius-ka qaanso iyo jeexdiisa, ma aha sawir ku saabsan. Ellipse-yada, splines-ka iyo hatch-yada xadkoodu ka kooban yahay geesaha waxaa lagu cabbiraa qaybo toosan oo hal digree ah ama ka yar, taasoo ku jirta boqolaad-keyd boqolkiiba ellipse-yada iyo tobankiiba inta kale; barku wuxuu sheegayaa inta aad doorato ee qallooc noocaas ah. Waxa uu ka qaadaa meelaha Moodeel: shayada moodeelka. Layout: xariiqyadiisa, iyo shayada moodeelka ku jira viewport-ka, oo miisaankooda la beddelay. Shay geesta viewport-ka gooya lama soo bandhigo (waa la gooyaa marka la daabacayo); shay labo viewport ay labadaba muujiyaan waa la qaadaa mar keliya. Kaliya lakabyada xaashigu muujiyo. Bloogyada waa la tiriyaa, ma cabbirmo: eeg Tiri naqshadda. Polylayn 3D, meshes, solids iyo regions lama soo bandhigo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"snap-to-the-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Ku xidh xariiqyada naqshadda","summary":"Barta ayaa ku degta xariiqyada PDF-ka markaad cabbirayso ama hagaajinayso: dhammaadyada, dhexdhexaadyada, isgoyska ama meel kasta oo xariiq ku taal, iyada oo calaamad sheegaysa waxa la xidhay.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["ku xidh","osnap","object snap","dhammaad","dhexdhexaad","isgoys","ugu dhow","vector","xariiqyo","xariiqyada","saxda ah","dhab ah","f3","birta","geesta"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-uu-ku-xidhmo","text":"Waxa uu ku xidhmo","level":2},{"id":"meelaha-uu-ka-shaqeeyo","text":"Meelaha uu ka shaqeeyo","level":2},{"id":"xaashiyada-aan-lagu-xidhi-karin","text":"Xaashiyada aan lagu xidhi karin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQorshooyinka badankood waa PDF vector: derbiyadooda iyo geesahooda waa xariiqyo dhab ah, ma aha pikseel. Intaad cabbirayso, TakeoffCraft wuxuu riixyadaada ku xidhaa xariiqyadaas, sidaas darteed socodku wuxuu bilaabmaa si sax ah geesta darbiga, hagaajinna wuxuu akhrinayaa cabbirka uu naqshadeeyuhu sawiray, ma aha pikselka aad riixday.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu xidhku wuu shaqeeyaa markaad bilaabato. Ku demi ama ku shid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu xidh\u003C/span\u003E ee bar xaaladda ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; dejintu waxay ku kaydsan tahay browser-kan (waxaa sidoo kale ku jirta \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-uu-ku-xidhmo\"\u003EWaxa uu ku xidhmo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkii calaamadeeyuhu u soo dhowaado xariiq qiyaastii 10 pikseel oo shaashad ah, calaamad ayaa muujinaysa halka riixdu ku degi doonto, magaceeda oo la sheegay:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECalaamad\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMagac\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeesha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba jibbaaran\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhammaad\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhammaadka xariiq, ama geed halka xariiqyo isku kulmaan. Labada dhammaad ee qalooca waa la tiriyaa; dhibcaha u dhexeeya ma tirinayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaddex-geesle\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhexdhexaad\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexda xariiq toosan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamad X\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsgoys\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHalka laba xariiq isku gudbaan, ama halka mid ku dhamaado mid kale.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaacad-qaloocan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXariiqda dushiisa\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarta ugu dhow ee xariiq, marka dhammaad, dhexdhexaad ama isgoys dhow aan jirin.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhammaadka, dhexdhexaadka ama isgoyska ugu dhow ayaa lagu doortaa. Kaliya marka midna dhow aanu jirin, barta waxay u dhaaftaa xariiqda laftiisa. Kor u kac si aad u dooratid dhibcaha isku dhow: 10 pikseladu waa pikselada shaashadda, sidaas darteed heerka kor u kacan waxay daboolaan qayb yar oo xaashiga ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meelaha-uu-ka-shaqeeyo\"\u003EMeelaha uu ka shaqeeyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu xidhku wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESocod\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAag\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGod\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi\u003C/span\u003E, iyo marka aad jiidayso geesta calaamad la doortay. Sidoo kale wuxuu goobaa dhibcaha qaansada. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiri\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/span\u003E iyo ku dhejinta ma ku xidhmaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhibic la xidhay ayaa ka mudan 45° ee \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: si aad u sawirto 45° xariiqyada ka fog, marka hore demi ku xidhka adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHagaaji adigoo ku xidhku shidan yahay. Riix labada dhammaad ee khadka cabbirka ama darbi aad taqaanno: labada barood ayaa si sax ah ugu degaya naqshadda, miisaankuna waa sax (bar xaaladda ayaa markaas magacaabaysa diyaarka uu u eg yahay).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaashiyada-aan-lagu-xidhi-karin\"\u003EXaashiyada aan lagu xidhi karin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXaashiyada la iskaaniyay (scan)\u003C/strong\u003E waa sawirro aan xariiq lahayn oo lagu xidho. Bar xaaladda waxay leedahay &quot;Xaashigan ma lahan xariiq lagu xidho (boqol la iskaaniyay waa sawir).&quot; iyo barta waxay u dhaaftaa meesha aad riixday.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshado aad u waaweyn\u003C/strong\u003E: ku xidhku wuxuu akhriyaa ilaa 400,000 qayb xariiq xaashi kasta. Xaashi ka badan, waxay sheegtaa oo kaliya kuwii ugu horreeyay ayuu ku xidhaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQoraalka\u003C/strong\u003E lagama xidho, mooyaane PDF-ku xarfaha u sawiro xariiqyo (qaar ka mid ah printer-yada).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiqyada xaashiga waxaa la akhriyaa markii ugu horraysay ee la furo, gadaal ka shaqeynaya; xaashi weyn ayaa qaadan kara ilbiriqsi ka hor inta calaamadaha soo muuqan.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Qorshooyinka badankood waa PDF vector: derbiyadooda iyo geesahooda waa xariiqyo dhab ah, ma aha pikseel. Intaad cabbirayso, TakeoffCraft wuxuu riixyadaada ku xidhaa xariiqyadaas, sidaas darteed socodku wuxuu bilaabmaa si sax ah geesta darbiga, hagaajinna wuxuu akhrinayaa cabbirka uu naqshadeeyuhu sawiray, ma aha pikselka aad riixday. Ku xidhku wuu shaqeeyaa markaad bilaabato. Ku demi ama ku shid Ku xidh ee bar xaaladda ama F3; dejintu waxay ku kaydsan tahay browser-kan (waxaa sidoo kale ku jirta Dejinta). Waxa uu ku xidhmo Markii calaamadeeyuhu u soo dhowaado xariiq qiyaastii 10 pikseel oo shaashad ah, calaamad ayaa muujinaysa halka riixdu ku degi doonto, magaceeda oo la sheegay: Calaamad Magac Meesha Laba jibbaaran Dhammaad Dhammaadka xariiq, ama geed halka xariiqyo isku kulmaan. Labada dhammaad ee qalooca waa la tiriyaa; dhibcaha u dhexeeya ma tirinayo. Saddex-geesle Dhexdhexaad Dhexda xariiq toosan. Calaamad X Isgoys Halka laba xariiq isku gudbaan, ama halka mid ku dhamaado mid kale. Saacad-qaloocan Xariiqda dushiisa Barta ugu dhow ee xariiq, marka dhammaad, dhexdhexaad ama isgoys dhow aan jirin. Dhammaadka, dhexdhexaadka ama isgoyska ugu dhow ayaa lagu doortaa. Kaliya marka midna dhow aanu jirin, barta waxay u dhaaftaa xariiqda laftiisa. Kor u kac si aad u dooratid dhibcaha isku dhow: 10 pikseladu waa pikselada shaashadda, sidaas darteed heerka kor u kacan waxay daboolaan qayb yar oo xaashiga ah. Meelaha uu ka shaqeeyo Ku xidhku wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa Socod, Aag, Goobo, God, Hagaaji iyo Hubi, iyo marka aad jiidayso geesta calaamad la doortay. Sidoo kale wuxuu goobaa dhibcaha qaansada. Tiri, Tirin otomaatig ah iyo ku dhejinta ma ku xidhmaan. Dhibic la xidhay ayaa ka mudan 45° ee Shift: si aad u sawirto 45° xariiqyada ka fog, marka hore demi ku xidhka adigoo isticmaalaya F3. Hagaaji adigoo ku xidhku shidan yahay. Riix labada dhammaad ee khadka cabbirka ama darbi aad taqaanno: labada barood ayaa si sax ah ugu degaya naqshadda, miisaankuna waa sax (bar xaaladda ayaa markaas magacaabaysa diyaarka uu u eg yahay). Xaashiyada aan lagu xidhi karin Xaashiyada la iskaaniyay (scan) waa sawirro aan xariiq lahayn oo lagu xidho. Bar xaaladda waxay leedahay \"Xaashigan ma lahan xariiq lagu xidho (boqol la iskaaniyay waa sawir).\" iyo barta waxay u dhaaftaa meesha aad riixday. Naqshado aad u waaweyn: ku xidhku wuxuu akhriyaa ilaa 400,000 qayb xariiq xaashi kasta. Xaashi ka badan, waxay sheegtaa oo kaliya kuwii ugu horreeyay ayuu ku xidhaa. Qoraalka lagama xidho, mooyaane PDF-ku xarfaha u sawiro xariiqyo (qaar ka mid ah printer-yada). Xariiqyada xaashiga waxaa la akhriyaa markii ugu horraysay ee la furo, gadaal ka shaqeynaya; xaashi weyn ayaa qaadan kara ilbiriqsi ka hor inta calaamadaha soo muuqan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"pick-the-lines","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Dooro xariiqyada PDF-ka","summary":"Guji xariiq PDF vector ah si aad u cabbirto jidkiisa oo dhan ee isku xidhan, ama guji gudaha kontuur xiran si aad u hesho aagga, adigoo muujinaya dulqaadka godka iyo hal ka-noqo mid kasta oo qeyb ah.","section":"tasks","order":36,"keywords":["jid","dooro","xariiq","khadad","isku xidhan","socodka oo dhan","raadi","kontuur","dhererka hareeraha","god","dulqaad","gees-bixin","qeybaha","tab","vector","aag khadadka","p"],"headings":[{"id":"dooro-jid-ama-kontuur","text":"Dooro jid ama kontuur","level":2},{"id":"dulqaadka-godka","text":"Dulqaadka godka","level":2},{"id":"furayaasha","text":"Furayaasha","level":2},{"id":"waxa-fiican-inaad-ogaatid","text":"Waxa fiican inaad ogaatid","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKu saabsan PDF vector-ka, darbiyada iyo geesaha waa khadad dhab ah. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJid\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu u qaataa sida loo sawiray: hal riix oo ku dhacda xariiq wuxuu cabbiraa wixii isku xidhan oo dhan, bilow ilaa dhammaad, adigoo aan darbi geesaha u riixin. Xaashidu waxay u baahan tahay miisaan. Bog la skaanay ma leh xariiqyo la doorto; halkaas isticmaal \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\"\u003EToosan\u003C/a\u003E ama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\"\u003EAag\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-jid-ama-kontuur\"\u003EDooro jid ama kontuur\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJid\u003C/span\u003E. Xariiqa ku jira hoosta calaamadaha ayaa la muujiyaa, iyo jidadka kale ee la sawiri karo oo khafiif ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji xariiq: jidka isku xidhan oo dhan ayaa la doortaa. Bar-ka hoos qalabka wuxuu bixiyaa qeybaheeda, dhererka, dulqaadka godka iyo inta god la buuxiyay. Jid u soo noqda bilowgiisa waa xidhan yahay oo wuxuu sidoo kale sheegaa hareeraha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma guji gudaha kontuur xiran, meel ka fog xariiqyada: kontuurka ku wareegsan bartaas ayaa aag ahaan loo doortaa. Kan ugu yar ayaa horreeya; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu isku dayaa kan ka weyn ee xiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama riix midig, ama laba jeer guji) si aad calaamadaha u darto. Jid la doortay wuxuu noqdaa calaamad \u003Cstrong\u003Etoosan\u003C/strong\u003E oo shay toosan ah, kontuur wuxuu noqdaa calaamad \u003Cstrong\u003Eaag\u003C/strong\u003E oo shay aag ah: shayga firfircoon haddii uu nooca leeyahay, haddii kale shayga cusub ee nooca sidaas. Haddii aan wax jirin, foomka shay cusub ayaa furmaa, wax ma la darin ilaa aad mar kale riixdo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Wax kasta oo la doortay waxaa lagu daraa hal tallaabo oo ka-noqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dulqaadka-godka\"\u003EDulqaadka godka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENaqshadeeyayaashu godad yaryar ayey ka tagaan meelaha xariiqyadu ku kulmi lahaayeen. Laba xariiq way isku xidhaan marka dhammaadyadoodu ka dhow yihiin \u003Cstrong\u003Edulqaadka godka\u003C/strong\u003E. Wuxuu ka bilaabmaa 1.5 point xaashida (lagu muujiyo feet iyo inch miisaanka xaashida), wareeg kala-jabsan oo dhererkaas u eg ayaa raacaa calaamadaha, wuxuuna saaran yahay dhammaad kasta jidka hoostiisa. God kasta oo la xidhay ayaa lagu wareegaa oranji jid la doortay, bar-kuna wuu tiriyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"]\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu dulqaadka ballaadhiyaa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"[\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu yareeyaa. Jid la doortay mar kale ayaa isku xidha dulqaad cusub meel walba. Meel isgoysa jidku waxa uu sii socdaa toosan, jidka ugu yar foorarsada, oo wuxuu ka tegaa laanta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furayaasha\"\u003EFurayaasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFure ama ficil\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro jidka hoostiisa calaamadaha, ama kontuurka ku wareegsan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + guji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar jid ama kontuur kale wixii la doortay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku day jidka xiga ee calaamadaha hoosteeda, ama kontuurka ka weyn ee xiga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa qaad qeybtii ugu dambeysay jidkii la doortay, mar mar hal qeyb. Jid aan qeyb ka haray waa baxaa. Wax la doortay ma jiro, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa ka-noqo caadi ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"[\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"]\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDulqaad godka oo yar iyo oo ballaadhan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadaha ku dar.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENadiifi wixii la doortay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-fiican-inaad-ogaatid\"\u003EWaxa fiican inaad ogaatid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalooca naqshadda waa silsilad xariiqyo gaaban oo toosan, sidaas darteed dhererkeedu wuxuu ka yar yahay qawska dhabta ah. Qaws sax ah, cabbir faylka naqshadda laftiisa (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\"\u003ECabbir naqshadda\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGod la xidhay waxaa lagu tiriyaa dhaqaaq toos ah oo ka dhex dhaca, sidaas darteed hareeraha kontuur xiran wuxuu ku jiraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaliya xariiqyada iyo buuxinta jidadka bogga laftiisa ayaa ah xariiqyo. Qoraal lagu qoray xarfaha iyo sawirada ma aha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Ku saabsan PDF vector-ka, darbiyada iyo geesaha waa khadad dhab ah. Jid (P) wuxuu u qaataa sida loo sawiray: hal riix oo ku dhacda xariiq wuxuu cabbiraa wixii isku xidhan oo dhan, bilow ilaa dhammaad, adigoo aan darbi geesaha u riixin. Xaashidu waxay u baahan tahay miisaan. Bog la skaanay ma leh xariiqyo la doorto; halkaas isticmaal Toosan ama Aag. Dooro jid ama kontuur Dooro Jid. Xariiqa ku jira hoosta calaamadaha ayaa la muujiyaa, iyo jidadka kale ee la sawiri karo oo khafiif ah. Guji xariiq: jidka isku xidhan oo dhan ayaa la doortaa. Bar-ka hoos qalabka wuxuu bixiyaa qeybaheeda, dhererka, dulqaadka godka iyo inta god la buuxiyay. Jid u soo noqda bilowgiisa waa xidhan yahay oo wuxuu sidoo kale sheegaa hareeraha. Ama guji gudaha kontuur xiran, meel ka fog xariiqyada: kontuurka ku wareegsan bartaas ayaa aag ahaan loo doortaa. Kan ugu yar ayaa horreeya; Tab wuxuu isku dayaa kan ka weyn ee xiga. Riix Enter (ama riix midig, ama laba jeer guji) si aad calaamadaha u darto. Jid la doortay wuxuu noqdaa calaamad toosan oo shay toosan ah, kontuur wuxuu noqdaa calaamad aag oo shay aag ah: shayga firfircoon haddii uu nooca leeyahay, haddii kale shayga cusub ee nooca sidaas. Haddii aan wax jirin, foomka shay cusub ayaa furmaa, wax ma la darin ilaa aad mar kale riixdo Enter. Wax kasta oo la doortay waxaa lagu daraa hal tallaabo oo ka-noqo. Dulqaadka godka Naqshadeeyayaashu godad yaryar ayey ka tagaan meelaha xariiqyadu ku kulmi lahaayeen. Laba xariiq way isku xidhaan marka dhammaadyadoodu ka dhow yihiin dulqaadka godka. Wuxuu ka bilaabmaa 1.5 point xaashida (lagu muujiyo feet iyo inch miisaanka xaashida), wareeg kala-jabsan oo dhererkaas u eg ayaa raacaa calaamadaha, wuxuuna saaran yahay dhammaad kasta jidka hoostiisa. God kasta oo la xidhay ayaa lagu wareegaa oranji jid la doortay, bar-kuna wuu tiriyaa. ] wuxuu dulqaadka ballaadhiyaa, [ wuu yareeyaa. Jid la doortay mar kale ayaa isku xidha dulqaad cusub meel walba. Meel isgoysa jidku waxa uu sii socdaa toosan, jidka ugu yar foorarsada, oo wuxuu ka tegaa laanta. Furayaasha Fure ama ficil Waxa uu sameeyo Guji Dooro jidka hoostiisa calaamadaha, ama kontuurka ku wareegsan. Shift + guji Ku dar jid ama kontuur kale wixii la doortay. Tab Isku day jidka xiga ee calaamadaha hoosteeda, ama kontuurka ka weyn ee xiga. Backspace ama Ctrl+Z Ka qaad qeybtii ugu dambeysay jidkii la doortay, mar mar hal qeyb. Jid aan qeyb ka haray waa baxaa. Wax la doortay ma jiro, Ctrl+Z waa ka-noqo caadi ah. [ iyo ] Dulqaad godka oo yar iyo oo ballaadhan. Enter Calaamadaha ku dar. Esc Nadiifi wixii la doortay. Waxa fiican inaad ogaatid Qalooca naqshadda waa silsilad xariiqyo gaaban oo toosan, sidaas darteed dhererkeedu wuxuu ka yar yahay qawska dhabta ah. Qaws sax ah, cabbir faylka naqshadda laftiisa (Cabbir naqshadda). God la xidhay waxaa lagu tiriyaa dhaqaaq toos ah oo ka dhex dhaca, sidaas darteed hareeraha kontuur xiran wuxuu ku jiraa. Kaliya xariiqyada iyo buuxinta jidadka bogga laftiisa ayaa ah xariiqyo. Qoraal lagu qoray xarfaha iyo sawirada ma aha.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"measure-linear","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Ka cabbir socodyada toosan","summary":"Qaad dherarka derbiyada, tuubada, trim-ka iyo dherarka kale sida socodyo, oo leh qaybo toosan, qaansooyin iyo Shift 45-darajo.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["toosan","dherer","socod","polylayn","derbiyada","lf","feet dherer","qaanso","qallooc","45 darajo","ortho","qabso","qaybo","geli","isku-xidhka","masaafada","masaafad toosan","polar"],"headings":[{"id":"socod-sawir","text":"Socod sawir","level":2},{"id":"xariiqyo-toosan-oo-45-ah","text":"Xariiqyo toosan oo 45° ah","level":2},{"id":"qaansooyin-iyo-derbiyo-qallooc-leh","text":"Qaansooyin iyo derbiyo qallooc leh","level":2},{"id":"dherarka-iyo-isku-xidhka-qor","text":"Dherarka iyo isku-xidhka qor","level":2},{"id":"qayb-socod-ka-jar","text":"Qayb socod ka jar","level":2},{"id":"faahfaahinta-socodka-eeg","text":"Faahfaahinta socodka eeg","level":2},{"id":"socod-saxi","text":"Socod saxi","level":2},{"id":"aagga-derbiga","text":"Aagga derbiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EShay socod wuxuu cabiraa dherer. Socod kasta waa silsilad barado ah: qaybo toosan, iyo qaansooyin marka aad shido habka qaansada. Shay wuxuu leeyahay tiro kasta oo socod ah oo ku jira xaashiyo kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa hor: xaashigu wuxuu u baahan yahay miisaan (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EDejiso miisaanka\u003C/a\u003E), waxaadna u baahan tahay shay socod (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003EAbuur walxaha xisaabinta\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPDF vector ah, riixitaankaaga waxay ku qabsadaan xariiqyada naqshadda laftiisa: dhamaadka, dhexdhexaadka iyo isgoyska (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\"\u003EKu qabso xariiqyada naqshadda\u003C/a\u003E; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa demiya).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"socod-sawir\"\u003ESocod sawir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix shayga socodka ee hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESocod\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix bilowga socodka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix geesaha mid mid. Saddex-ka hoose wuxuu tusayaa &quot;Dherer&quot; (socodka ilaa hadda, ilaa mawshinka) iyo &quot;qayb&quot; (qaybta aad sawirayso), feet iyo inch.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhammee socodka: labo-riix barta u dambaysa, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama midig-riix. Socodka waxa lagu sawiraa midabka shayga, wuxuuna noqdaa calaamadda la doortay. Dhererka shayga liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E iyo miiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirooyinka\u003C/span\u003E wuu kor u kacaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabku wuxuu sii joogaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESocod\u003C/span\u003E, si aad socodka xiga isla markiiba u bilawdo. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad ugu noqoto \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIntii aad sawirayso:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu ka saaraa barta u dambaysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu tuurayaa socodka aan dhammaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiidista wuxuu guuraa xaashiga, shubiska wuxuu weynaynayaa, iyada oo aan barar lagu darin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMac trackpad-ka, midig-riixu waa labo-farood riix (shid secondary click Dejinta nidaamka, hoosta Trackpad). TakeoffCraft wuxuu akhrisaa badhanka labaad kaliya, sidaas darteed Control-riix waxa laga yaabaa in loo qaato riix caadi ah oo barta ku daro. Labo-riix ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E mar walba way dhammeeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShaashad taabasho, taabo si aad barar u dhigto, jiid hal farood si aad u guurto, labo farood si aad u weyneyso. Ku dhammee riix-dheer, labo-taabo, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhammee\u003C/span\u003E bar-ka xaashiga hoose (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDambe\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo celiyaa barta u dambaysa). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/troubleshooting#touch-screens\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/troubleshooting\" data-hash=\"touch-screens\"\u003EXallinta dhibaatada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xariiqyo-toosan-oo-45-ah\"\u003EXariiqyo toosan oo 45° ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hay intaad barta dhigayso. Qaybta laga bilaabo barta u dambaysa waxay ku qabsataa jihada 0°, 45°, 90° ama 135° ee ugu dhow, iyadoo dhererka aad jiiday la xafidayo. Saddex-ka hoose wuxuu ku xasuusinayaa: &quot;Shift wuxuu ku qabsadaa 45°&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHabka qaansada, waxay ku dhacdaa meesha qaanso dhammaadayso: qaansada qaybta toosan waxay u socotaa 45° laga bilaabo meesha ay ka bilaabanayso. Barta aad riixdo qalloocda weligeed lama qabsado.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaansooyin-iyo-derbiyo-qallooc-leh\"\u003EQaansooyin iyo derbiyo qallooc leh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIntaad socodka sawirayso, dhig barta ay qalloocdu ka bilaabanayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShid habka qaansada: dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaanso\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Badhanku wuu dhegta riixan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix barta kasta ee qalloocda, meel ku taal dhexdeeda. Saddex-ka hoose wuxuu ku daraa &quot;(qaanso: riix meesha ay ku dhammaanayso)&quot; hortana muuqaalku wuxuu ku foorarsadaa barteeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix meesha qalloocdu ku dhammaato. Qaansadu waa la daraa. Dherkeeda waa dherer qaansada saxda ah, ma aha silsiladda qaybo gaaban.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix barta kale ee qalloocda xiga iyo dhammaadkeeda si aad u sii sawirto qaansooyin, ama mar kale riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad ugu noqoto qaybo toosan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E marka hore barta qalloocda sugaysa ayay tuurayaan; mar kale riix si aad barar caadi ah u ka saarto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dherarka-iyo-isku-xidhka-qor\"\u003EDherarka iyo isku-xidhka qor\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBarta ugu horeysa ka dib, waxaad qori kartaa meesha barta xigu tagayso halkii aad riixi lahayd. Qor lambar, \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E: sanduuqa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeli\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furmaa saddex-ka hoose, wuxuu muujinayaa waxa aad qortay. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad barta u dhigto; sanduuqu wuu furan yahay barta xigta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQor\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBarta xigu waxay u tagaysaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12&#039;-6&quot; laga bilaabo barta u dambaysa, mawshinka dhinaca (tilmaam jihada, kadibna qor dhererka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;&lt;45\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12&#039;-6&quot; 45°, lagu tiriyo wareega soo rogaya laga bilaabo midig shaashadda (\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;90\u003C/code\u003E waa sare, \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;-90\u003C/code\u003E waa hoose)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E@6&#039;,-4&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6&#039; midig iyo 4&#039; hoos barta u dambaysa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E6&#039;,4&#039;\u003C/code\u003E (ama \u003Ccode\u003E#6&#039;,4&#039;\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6&#039; midig iyo 4&#039; sare barta ugu horeysa ee socodkan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDherarka waxa loo qoraa sida meel kasta oo TakeoffCraft (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EQaababka gelinta\u003C/a\u003E): \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12.5\u003C/code\u003E (feet), \u003Ccode\u003E30&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3.2 m\u003C/code\u003E. &quot;Midig&quot; iyo &quot;sare&quot; waa sida aad xaashiga aragto, xitaa marka bogga PDF-ka la wareejiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E sanduuq madhan ayuu socodka dhammeeyaa, sida \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E xaashiga; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu xiraa sanduuqa oo socodka wuu sii wadaa. Barar la qoray waxay raacaan sharciyada riixitaanka: ka jar, qallooc iyo aag xidhitaanka oo dhan way shaqeeyaan. Sanduuqa isku mid ahi wuxuu shaqeeyaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAag\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGod\u003C/span\u003E; goobada dhexdeeda ka dib wuxuu qaataa radius.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qayb-socod-ka-jar\"\u003EQayb socod ka jar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESocod derbi oo marka albaab ama daaqad dukaan ah ka gudbo waa la sawiri karaa toos ahaan, oo wuxuu weli tirinayaa derbiga oo keliya: qaybaha furitaanka ka gudba waa \u003Cstrong\u003Eka jar\u003C/strong\u003E. Waa la sawiraa jajab iyo khafiif, mana la tiriyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIntii aad sawirayso:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhig barta meesha furitaanku ka bilaabanayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa jar\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Badhanku wuu dhegta riixan yahay, saddex-ka hoosena wuxuu sheegayaa qaybaha xiga waa ka jar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix meesha furitaanku ku dhammaado. Qaybta waa la sawiraa jajab; &quot;Dherer&quot; saddex-ka hoose ma ku darto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMar kale riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo sii wad derbiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa dib sawirka: dooro socodka. Hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadda la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E, qayb kasta waxay leedahay sanduuq \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa jar\u003C/span\u003E: calig si aad qaybtaas uga jarto, ka saar calig si mar kale loo tiriyo. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESocod waa inuu had iyo jeer hayo ugu yaraan hal qayb oo tirineysa. Panelka waxa uu tusayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EKa jaray\u003C/strong\u003E (dhererka la jaray) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ELa sawiray\u003C/strong\u003E (socodka oo dhan); \u003Cstrong\u003EDherer\u003C/strong\u003E, tirada shayga, aagga derbiga iyo kharashyada oo dhan waxay isticmaalaan dherer aan ka jarin. Muuqaalka 3D wuxuu derbiga ku daraa gal, PDF-ka calaamadsan wuxuu sawiraa ka jaraya jajab, xaashiga \u003Cstrong\u003EMarks\u003C/strong\u003E ee la dhoofiyay ayaa liistaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeesta guurinta ayaa ka jaraha hayso. Barar ku dartaa ama ka saaraa (adigoo socodka mar kale sawirayo) wuxuu bilaabmaa iyada oo aan ka jarin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faahfaahinta-socodka-eeg\"\u003EFaahfaahinta socodka eeg\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) oo riix socodka. \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadda la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E dhinaca midig wuxuu tusayaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eshayga uu ka tirsan yahay (dooro shay socod kale liiska si aad socodka halkaas u guurto),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Exaashiga,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDherer\u003C/strong\u003E feet iyo inch iyo LF,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Etirada \u003Cstrong\u003EQaybaha\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EAagga derbiga\u003C/strong\u003E marka shayga leeyahay dhererka,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edherarka qayb kasta, oo &quot;(qaanso)&quot; ku dhex jirta qaansooyinka, iyo sanduuqa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa jar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXaashiga, qayb kasta oo socodka la doortay waxa lagu calaamadiyaa dherkeeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"socod-saxi\"\u003ESocod saxi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGuuri barta\u003C/strong\u003E: dooro socodka, kadibna jiid mid ka mid ah gacmaha geesaha afar-jibbaaran. Hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si qaybta la guuray ay ugu qabsato 45°. Qaansadu waxay haysataa bulge-keeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFoorar qaanso\u003C/strong\u003E: socod la doortay wuxuu tusaa gacan wareeg dhexda qaanso kasta. Jiid: qaansadu waxay mari doontaa meesha aad ka sii dayso, sidaas darteed way fool-xumaysan kartaa, ka yar ama kale ugu foorarsan. Haddii lagu jiido xariiqda toosan ee ka dhex taal dhamaadyadeeda, waxay noqonaysaa qayb toosan. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka noqonaya (&quot;Foorar qaanso&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETirtir socod\u003C/strong\u003E: dooro oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E menu-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax badan\u003C/span\u003E ee qalabka sare, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir calaamadda\u003C/span\u003E panelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa noqo\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; \u003Cstrong\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWeli ma gelin kartid barta dhexda socod. Tirtir socodka oo mar kale sawir.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"aagga-derbiga\"\u003EAagga derbiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShayga socodka siiso \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoog\u003C/span\u003E (tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E). Markaasuu soo sheegaa \u003Cstrong\u003EAagga derbiga (A)\u003C/strong\u003E = dherer × joog, SF (ama m² shay metric ah), oo aagga derbiga wuxuu galaa tiirka qoraalka ee dhoofinta spreadsheet-ka. Isticmaal isku-dhisyada gudo, rinji ama kulayl-u-celin: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EIsku-dhisyada iyo qaacidooyinka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Shay socod wuxuu cabiraa dherer. Socod kasta waa silsilad barado ah: qaybo toosan, iyo qaansooyin marka aad shido habka qaansada. Shay wuxuu leeyahay tiro kasta oo socod ah oo ku jira xaashiyo kasta. Ka hor: xaashigu wuxuu u baahan yahay miisaan (Dejiso miisaanka), waxaadna u baahan tahay shay socod (Abuur walxaha xisaabinta). PDF vector ah, riixitaankaaga waxay ku qabsadaan xariiqyada naqshadda laftiisa: dhamaadka, dhexdhexaadka iyo isgoyska (Ku qabso xariiqyada naqshadda; F3 ayaa demiya). Socod sawir Riix shayga socodka ee hoosta Walxaha. Dooro Socod qalabka sare, ama riix L. Riix bilowga socodka. Riix geesaha mid mid. Saddex-ka hoose wuxuu tusayaa \"Dherer\" (socodka ilaa hadda, ilaa mawshinka) iyo \"qayb\" (qaybta aad sawirayso), feet iyo inch. Dhammee socodka: labo-riix barta u dambaysa, riix Enter, ama midig-riix. Socodka waxa lagu sawiraa midabka shayga, wuxuuna noqdaa calaamadda la doortay. Dhererka shayga liiska Walxaha iyo miiska Tirooyinka wuu kor u kacaa. Qalabku wuxuu sii joogaa Socod, si aad socodka xiga isla markiiba u bilawdo. Riix Esc si aad ugu noqoto Dooro. Intii aad sawirayso: Backspace (ama Delete) wuxuu ka saaraa barta u dambaysa. Esc wuxuu tuurayaa socodka aan dhammaan. Jiidista wuxuu guuraa xaashiga, shubiska wuxuu weynaynayaa, iyada oo aan barar lagu darin. Mac trackpad-ka, midig-riixu waa labo-farood riix (shid secondary click Dejinta nidaamka, hoosta Trackpad). TakeoffCraft wuxuu akhrisaa badhanka labaad kaliya, sidaas darteed Control-riix waxa laga yaabaa in loo qaato riix caadi ah oo barta ku daro. Labo-riix ama Enter mar walba way dhammeeyaan. Shaashad taabasho, taabo si aad barar u dhigto, jiid hal farood si aad u guurto, labo farood si aad u weyneyso. Ku dhammee riix-dheer, labo-taabo, ama Dhammee bar-ka xaashiga hoose (Dambe wuxuu soo celiyaa barta u dambaysa). Eeg Xallinta dhibaatada. Xariiqyo toosan oo 45° ah Shift hay intaad barta dhigayso. Qaybta laga bilaabo barta u dambaysa waxay ku qabsataa jihada 0°, 45°, 90° ama 135° ee ugu dhow, iyadoo dhererka aad jiiday la xafidayo. Saddex-ka hoose wuxuu ku xasuusinayaa: \"Shift wuxuu ku qabsadaa 45°\". Habka qaansada, waxay ku dhacdaa meesha qaanso dhammaadayso: qaansada qaybta toosan waxay u socotaa 45° laga bilaabo meesha ay ka bilaabanayso. Barta aad riixdo qalloocda weligeed lama qabsado. Qaansooyin iyo derbiyo qallooc leh Intaad socodka sawirayso, dhig barta ay qalloocdu ka bilaabanayso. Shid habka qaansada: dooro Qaanso qalabka sare ama riix R. Badhanku wuu dhegta riixan. Riix barta kasta ee qalloocda, meel ku taal dhexdeeda. Saddex-ka hoose wuxuu ku daraa \"(qaanso: riix meesha ay ku dhammaanayso)\" hortana muuqaalku wuxuu ku foorarsadaa barteeda. Riix meesha qalloocdu ku dhammaato. Qaansadu waa la daraa. Dherkeeda waa dherer qaansada saxda ah, ma aha silsiladda qaybo gaaban. Riix barta kale ee qalloocda xiga iyo dhammaadkeeda si aad u sii sawirto qaansooyin, ama mar kale riix R si aad ugu noqoto qaybo toosan. Backspace ama Esc marka hore barta qalloocda sugaysa ayay tuurayaan; mar kale riix si aad barar caadi ah u ka saarto. Dherarka iyo isku-xidhka qor Barta ugu horeysa ka dib, waxaad qori kartaa meesha barta xigu tagayso halkii aad riixi lahayd. Qor lambar, @ ama #: sanduuqa Geli wuxuu furmaa saddex-ka hoose, wuxuu muujinayaa waxa aad qortay. Riix Enter si aad barta u dhigto; sanduuqu wuu furan yahay barta xigta. Qor Barta xigu waxay u tagaysaa 12'6\" 12'-6\" laga bilaabo barta u dambaysa, mawshinka dhinaca (tilmaam jihada, kadibna qor dhererka) 12'6\"\u003C45 12'-6\" 45°, lagu tiriyo wareega soo rogaya laga bilaabo midig shaashadda (\u003C90 waa sare, \u003C-90 waa hoose) @6',-4' 6' midig iyo 4' hoos barta u dambaysa 6',4' (ama #6',4') 6' midig iyo 4' sare barta ugu horeysa ee socodkan Dherarka waxa loo qoraa sida meel kasta oo TakeoffCraft (Qaababka gelinta): 12'-6 1/2\", 12.5 (feet), 30\", 3.2 m. \"Midig\" iyo \"sare\" waa sida aad xaashiga aragto, xitaa marka bogga PDF-ka la wareejiyo. Enter sanduuq madhan ayuu socodka dhammeeyaa, sida Enter xaashiga; Esc wuxuu xiraa sanduuqa oo socodka wuu sii wadaa. Barar la qoray waxay raacaan sharciyada riixitaanka: ka jar, qallooc iyo aag xidhitaanka oo dhan way shaqeeyaan. Sanduuqa isku mid ahi wuxuu shaqeeyaa Aag iyo God; goobada dhexdeeda ka dib wuxuu qaataa radius. Qayb socod ka jar Socod derbi oo marka albaab ama daaqad dukaan ah ka gudbo waa la sawiri karaa toos ahaan, oo wuxuu weli tirinayaa derbiga oo keliya: qaybaha furitaanka ka gudba waa ka jar. Waa la sawiraa jajab iyo khafiif, mana la tiriyo. Intii aad sawirayso: Dhig barta meesha furitaanku ka bilaabanayso. Dooro Ka jar qalabka sare ama riix E. Badhanku wuu dhegta riixan yahay, saddex-ka hoosena wuxuu sheegayaa qaybaha xiga waa ka jar. Riix meesha furitaanku ku dhammaado. Qaybta waa la sawiraa jajab; \"Dherer\" saddex-ka hoose ma ku darto. Mar kale riix E oo sii wad derbiga. Ka dib sawirka: dooro socodka. Hoosta Calaamadda la doortay, qayb kasta waxay leedahay sanduuq Ka jar: calig si aad qaybtaas uga jarto, ka saar calig si mar kale loo tiriyo. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Socod waa inuu had iyo jeer hayo ugu yaraan hal qayb oo tirineysa. Panelka waxa uu tusayaa Ka jaray (dhererka la jaray) iyo La sawiray (socodka oo dhan); Dherer, tirada shayga, aagga derbiga iyo kharashyada oo dhan waxay isticmaalaan dherer aan ka jarin. Muuqaalka 3D wuxuu derbiga ku daraa gal, PDF-ka calaamadsan wuxuu sawiraa ka jaraya jajab, xaashiga Marks ee la dhoofiyay ayaa liistaa. Geesta guurinta ayaa ka jaraha hayso. Barar ku dartaa ama ka saaraa (adigoo socodka mar kale sawirayo) wuxuu bilaabmaa iyada oo aan ka jarin. Faahfaahinta socodka eeg Dooro Dooro (V) oo riix socodka. Calaamadda la doortay dhinaca midig wuxuu tusayaa: shayga uu ka tirsan yahay (dooro shay socod kale liiska si aad socodka halkaas u guurto), xaashiga, Dherer feet iyo inch iyo LF, tirada Qaybaha, iyo Aagga derbiga marka shayga leeyahay dhererka, dherarka qayb kasta, oo \"(qaanso)\" ku dhex jirta qaansooyinka, iyo sanduuqa Ka jar. Xaashiga, qayb kasta oo socodka la doortay waxa lagu calaamadiyaa dherkeeda. Socod saxi Guuri barta: dooro socodka, kadibna jiid mid ka mid ah gacmaha geesaha afar-jibbaaran. Hay Shift si qaybta la guuray ay ugu qabsato 45°. Qaansadu waxay haysataa bulge-keeda. Foorar qaanso: socod la doortay wuxuu tusaa gacan wareeg dhexda qaanso kasta. Jiid: qaansadu waxay mari doontaa meesha aad ka sii dayso, sidaas darteed way fool-xumaysan kartaa, ka yar ama kale ugu foorarsan. Haddii lagu jiido xariiqda toosan ee ka dhex taal dhamaadyadeeda, waxay noqonaysaa qayb toosan. Ctrl+Z ayaa ka noqonaya (\"Foorar qaanso\"). Tirtir socod: dooro oo riix Delete, dooro Tirtir menu-ka Wax badan ee qalabka sare, ama Tirtir calaamadda panelka. Ka noqo: Ctrl+Z; Samee mar kale: Ctrl+Y. Weli ma gelin kartid barta dhexda socod. Tirtir socodka oo mar kale sawir. Aagga derbiga Shayga socodka siiso Joog (tusaale ahaan 9'-0\"). Markaasuu soo sheegaa Aagga derbiga (A) = dherer × joog, SF (ama m² shay metric ah), oo aagga derbiga wuxuu galaa tiirka qoraalka ee dhoofinta spreadsheet-ka. Isticmaal isku-dhisyada gudo, rinji ama kulayl-u-celin: eeg Isku-dhisyada iyo qaacidooyinka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"show-lengths-in-meters","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Muuji dherarka mitir","summary":"Akhri dherarka mitir, sentimitir ama millimitir halkii feet-inji, oo arag xaaladaha m2.","section":"tasks","order":45,"keywords":["mitir","sentimitir","millimitir","metric","muuji dherarka sida","raac guud","unit-yada","muuqaal","m2","mitir labajibbaaran","aagga derbiga","feet-inji","heerkulka","celsius"],"headings":[{"id":"waxaad-samayn-doontaa","text":"Waxaad samayn doontaa","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"ogaysiisyo","text":"Ogaysiisyo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxaad-samayn-doontaa\"\u003EWaxaad samayn doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeddel sida TakeoffCraft u muujiyo dherarka, si mashruuc metric ah u akhriyo mitirro, sentimitirro ama millimitirro xaashiga, bar-ka xaaladda iyo panelada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E badhanka gear ee app bar-ka ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, oo ku sii jir tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaadi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDherarka muuji sida\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFeet-inji\u003C/span\u003E, m, cm ama mm. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaac Guud\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu isticmaalaa unugga dherarka metric ee lagu calaamadeeyay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaalami\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnit-yada\u003C/span\u003E, feet-inji haddii aan wax calaamad lagu xulin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEeg xaashiga: dherarka bar-ka xaaladda, liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E iyo panelada hadda waxay akhrinayaan unugga aad dooratay. Dhererka, qoto-dheerka, dhumucda iyo heerarkuba waa sidaas oo kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u akhrido heerkulka shayada darajooyinka C ama F, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji heerkulka sida\u003C/span\u003E isla tab-kaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ogaysiisyo\"\u003EOgaysiisyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuujinta keliya ayaa isbeddela. Tirooyinka, kharashyada iyo dhoofintu waxay ka xisaabsan yihiin dherarka sax ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETiro la&#039;aan ah oo lagu qoro goobta dhererka waxaa loo akhriyaa unugga la muujiyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDoorashada 1/16, 1/8 iyo 1/4 inji waxay muuqataa oo keliya feet-inji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAagga lagu cabbiray shay metric ah wuxuu ku qoran yahay m2 naqshadda, panelka calaamadda iyo miiska. Shay leh dherer kor ah waxay sidoo kale muujisaa aagga derbiga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/units\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/units\"\u003EUnit-yada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxaad samayn doontaa Beddel sida TakeoffCraft u muujiyo dherarka, si mashruuc metric ah u akhriyo mitirro, sentimitirro ama millimitirro xaashiga, bar-ka xaaladda iyo panelada. Tallaabooyin Fur Dejinta badhanka gear ee app bar-ka ama Ctrl+,, oo ku sii jir tab-ka TakeoffCraft. Raadi Dherarka muuji sida oo dooro Feet-inji, m, cm ama mm. Raac Guud wuxuu isticmaalaa unugga dherarka metric ee lagu calaamadeeyay Dejinta › Caalami › Unit-yada, feet-inji haddii aan wax calaamad lagu xulin. Eeg xaashiga: dherarka bar-ka xaaladda, liiska Walxaha iyo panelada hadda waxay akhrinayaan unugga aad dooratay. Dhererka, qoto-dheerka, dhumucda iyo heerarkuba waa sidaas oo kale. Si aad u akhrido heerkulka shayada darajooyinka C ama F, dooro Muuji heerkulka sida isla tab-kaas. Ogaysiisyo Muujinta keliya ayaa isbeddela. Tirooyinka, kharashyada iyo dhoofintu waxay ka xisaabsan yihiin dherarka sax ah. Tiro la'aan ah oo lagu qoro goobta dhererka waxaa loo akhriyaa unugga la muujiyay. Doorashada 1/16, 1/8 iyo 1/4 inji waxay muuqataa oo keliya feet-inji. Aagga lagu cabbiray shay metric ah wuxuu ku qoran yahay m2 naqshadda, panelka calaamadda iyo miiska. Shay leh dherer kor ah waxay sidoo kale muujisaa aagga derbiga. Eeg Unit-yada.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"draw-arcs-ten-methods","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Qaansooyinka leh toban hab","summary":"Dooro sida qaansada loo sawiro: saddex barood, ama bilow, dhexe, dhammaad, xagal, dherer, jihe ama shucaac.","section":"tasks","order":46,"keywords":["qaanso","qaansooyin","qalloocan","derbi qalloocan","3-point","shucaac","xagal","dherer xariiq","jihe","dhexe","bilow","dhammaad","habka qaansada"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"ogeysiisyo","text":"Ogeysiisyo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeeso qalloocan oo socod, aag ama god ah sawir, adigoo isticmaalaya habka qaansada ee la waafaqa cabbirrada aad haysato.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBilow socod, khad ama god, oo dhig barta uu curinta ka bilaabmayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaanso\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHabka qaansada\u003C/span\u003E bar xaashiga. Waxay muuqataa oo keliya inta Qaanso uu shid yahay. Dooro 3-Point, Start, Center, End, Start, Center, Angle, Start, Center, Length, Start, End, Angle, Start, End, Direction, Start, End, Radius, Center, Start, End, Center, Start, Angle ama Center, Start, Length.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaac status bar-ka. Waxay sheegaysaa waxa qaansadu sugayo: dhexaadkeeda, barta dhammaadka, xagalka, dherer, jihada ama shucaaca. Riix barta, ama qor tirada (xagal, dherer, shucaac iyo jihe).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka gelinta u dambaysa la siiyo, qaansada waxa lagu daraa socodka. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu joojiyaa qaansada, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu soo celinayaa tallaabadii u dambaysay, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu damiyaa Qaanso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ogeysiisyo\"\u003EOgeysiisyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaansada waa la diidaa, fariin status bar-ka ku jirta, marka barooradeeda isku dhacaan ama ku jiraan khad toos ah, ama shucaacu uusan gaari karin barta dhammaadka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDherer qaansada waa dherer qaanso saxda ah, faylashii hore waxay ku furmaan isla sidaas. Dheeraad: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#arcs-and-curved-walls\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"arcs-and-curved-walls\"\u003ECabbir socodyada toosan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Geeso qalloocan oo socod, aag ama god ah sawir, adigoo isticmaalaya habka qaansada ee la waafaqa cabbirrada aad haysato. Tallaabooyinka Bilow socod, khad ama god, oo dhig barta uu curinta ka bilaabmayo. Shid Qaanso qalabka sare ama riix R. Fur Habka qaansada bar xaashiga. Waxay muuqataa oo keliya inta Qaanso uu shid yahay. Dooro 3-Point, Start, Center, End, Start, Center, Angle, Start, Center, Length, Start, End, Angle, Start, End, Direction, Start, End, Radius, Center, Start, End, Center, Start, Angle ama Center, Start, Length. Raac status bar-ka. Waxay sheegaysaa waxa qaansadu sugayo: dhexaadkeeda, barta dhammaadka, xagalka, dherer, jihada ama shucaaca. Riix barta, ama qor tirada (xagal, dherer, shucaac iyo jihe). Marka gelinta u dambaysa la siiyo, qaansada waxa lagu daraa socodka. Esc wuu joojiyaa qaansada, Backspace wuxuu soo celinayaa tallaabadii u dambaysay, R wuxuu damiyaa Qaanso. Ogeysiisyo Qaansada waa la diidaa, fariin status bar-ka ku jirta, marka barooradeeda isku dhacaan ama ku jiraan khad toos ah, ama shucaacu uusan gaari karin barta dhammaadka. Dherer qaansada waa dherer qaanso saxda ah, faylashii hore waxay ku furmaan isla sidaas. Dheeraad: Cabbir socodyada toosan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"sign-off-the-estimate","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Qiimaha maqan iyo saxeexida qiyaasta","summary":"Eeg khadadka qiyaasta ee leh tiro iyo aan qiime lahayn, saxeex qiyaasta magacaaga si faylku u diiwaangeliyo cida, goorta iyo wadarta, oo guji tiro si aad u doorto calaamadaha uu ka soo baxay.","section":"tasks","order":46,"keywords":["qiyaas kharash","saxeex","saxeexid","la oggolaaday","oggolaansho","qiime maqan","aan qiime lahayn","qiime","wadar","tiro","diiwaan","saxeexeyaha tirooyinka","dooro calaamadaha","raad"],"headings":[{"id":"waxaad-samayn-doontaa","text":"Waxaad samayn doontaa","level":2},{"id":"khadadka-aan-qiime-lahayn","text":"Khadadka aan qiime lahayn","level":2},{"id":"saxeex-qiyaasta","text":"Saxeex qiyaasta","level":2},{"id":"qof-kaliya-ayaa-saxeexa","text":"Qof kaliya ayaa saxeexa","level":2},{"id":"guji-tiro-si-aad-u-aragto-meesha-ka-timid","text":"Guji tiro si aad u aragto meesha ka timid","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-ogaan-lahaa","text":"Waxa la ogaan lahaa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxaad-samayn-doontaa\"\u003EWaxaad samayn doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHubi in khad kasta oo qiyaasta uu qiime leeyahay, kadibna magacaaga ku qor. Faylka xisaabintu wuxuu diiwaangeliyaa yaa saxeexay, goorta, iyo wadarta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khadadka-aan-qiime-lahayn\"\u003EKhadadka aan qiime lahayn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ETirooyinka › Sida shayba\u003C/strong\u003E, khad leh tiro laakiin aan alaab ama shaqo qiime lahayn wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EAan qiime lahayn\u003C/strong\u003E, bar-ka kor ku yaal miiska wuxuu sheegayaa inta ay yihiin. Khadkaas wadarta ma ku daro wax. Shay aan qiime lahayn oo keligiis ah lama calaamadayo marka qayb ka mid ah ay qiime leedahay: isku-dhis waxaa lagu qiimeeyaa qaybahaas. Qiyaasta la dhoofiyay waxay ku qortaa \u003Cstrong\u003EAan qiime lahayn\u003C/strong\u003E tiirka qoraalka khad kasta oo noocaas ah, waxayna tirisaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"saxeex-qiyaasta\"\u003ESaxeex qiyaasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cstrong\u003ESaxeex qiyaasta\u003C/strong\u003E kor miiska Tirooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWada-hadalku wuxuu sheegayaa wadarta aad saxeexayso iyo khadadka aan qiime lahayn. Ku qor magacaaga, iyo doorkaaga haddii aad jeceshid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cstrong\u003ESaxeex\u003C/strong\u003E. Bar-ka hadda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Waxaa saxeexay … goorta …&quot; iyo wadarta. Kaydi xisaabinta si aad u hayso faylka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaxeexdu waxay ku xidhan tahay tirooyinka aad saxeexday. Isbeddel kasta oo dambe oo ku yimaado tiro, qiime ama khad wuu tirtirayaa, TakeoffCraft wuu kugu sheegayaa. Ka noqo wuxuu soo celinayaa qiyaasta aad saxeexday, saxeexdeedana waa la soo celinayaa. Dib u magacaabida khad ma ahan isbeddel tiro. \u003Cstrong\u003EKa saar saxeexda\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa qaadaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylka xisaabinta oo dibadda TakeoffCraft laga tafatiray ka dib markii la saxeexay, wuxuu furmaa iyadoo aan saxeexdu ku jirin, oo qoraal sidaas sheegaya. Qiyaasta la dhoofiyay (CSV iyo XLSX) waxay magacaabaa saxeexda hoosta wadarta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qof-kaliya-ayaa-saxeexa\"\u003EQof kaliya ayaa saxeexa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECaawiye AI wuxuu akhriyi karaa in qiyaasta la saxeexay iyo qiimayaasha maqan; ma leh hab uu ku saxeexo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"guji-tiro-si-aad-u-aragto-meesha-ka-timid\"\u003EGuji tiro si aad u aragto meesha ka timid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji tiro ama qiime khad ah si aad u doorato calaamadaha laga qiyaasay. Haddii ay xaashi kale ku yaalaan, xaashigaas ayaa furmaa. Guji tiro ka mid ah khadka \u003Cstrong\u003EWadarta mashruuca\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u doorato dhammaan calaamadaha xaashiga. Tiro la qoray ma leh calaamado.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-ogaan-lahaa\"\u003EWaxa la ogaan lahaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESaxeexdu waxay diiwaangelisaa magac sida la qoray. Waa diiwaan faylka ku jira, ma aha saxeex elektarooniyeed.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii shaqo-bakhaaleyo loo bixiyay qandaraasleyaasha hoose ama beddelaad ku jira xisaabinta, wadarta la saxeexay waa \u003Cstrong\u003Etartanka aasaasiga ah\u003C/strong\u003E oo ah wadarta lagu muujiyay \u003Cstrong\u003EWadarta mashruuca\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxaad samayn doontaa Hubi in khad kasta oo qiyaasta uu qiime leeyahay, kadibna magacaaga ku qor. Faylka xisaabintu wuxuu diiwaangeliyaa yaa saxeexay, goorta, iyo wadarta. Khadadka aan qiime lahayn Hoosta Tirooyinka › Sida shayba, khad leh tiro laakiin aan alaab ama shaqo qiime lahayn wuxuu leeyahay Aan qiime lahayn, bar-ka kor ku yaal miiska wuxuu sheegayaa inta ay yihiin. Khadkaas wadarta ma ku daro wax. Shay aan qiime lahayn oo keligiis ah lama calaamadayo marka qayb ka mid ah ay qiime leedahay: isku-dhis waxaa lagu qiimeeyaa qaybahaas. Qiyaasta la dhoofiyay waxay ku qortaa Aan qiime lahayn tiirka qoraalka khad kasta oo noocaas ah, waxayna tirisaa. Saxeex qiyaasta Guji Saxeex qiyaasta kor miiska Tirooyinka. Wada-hadalku wuxuu sheegayaa wadarta aad saxeexayso iyo khadadka aan qiime lahayn. Ku qor magacaaga, iyo doorkaaga haddii aad jeceshid. Guji Saxeex. Bar-ka hadda wuxuu leeyahay \"Waxaa saxeexay … goorta …\" iyo wadarta. Kaydi xisaabinta si aad u hayso faylka. Saxeexdu waxay ku xidhan tahay tirooyinka aad saxeexday. Isbeddel kasta oo dambe oo ku yimaado tiro, qiime ama khad wuu tirtirayaa, TakeoffCraft wuu kugu sheegayaa. Ka noqo wuxuu soo celinayaa qiyaasta aad saxeexday, saxeexdeedana waa la soo celinayaa. Dib u magacaabida khad ma ahan isbeddel tiro. Ka saar saxeexda ayaa qaadaya. Faylka xisaabinta oo dibadda TakeoffCraft laga tafatiray ka dib markii la saxeexay, wuxuu furmaa iyadoo aan saxeexdu ku jirin, oo qoraal sidaas sheegaya. Qiyaasta la dhoofiyay (CSV iyo XLSX) waxay magacaabaa saxeexda hoosta wadarta. Qof kaliya ayaa saxeexa Caawiye AI wuxuu akhriyi karaa in qiyaasta la saxeexay iyo qiimayaasha maqan; ma leh hab uu ku saxeexo. Guji tiro si aad u aragto meesha ka timid Guji tiro ama qiime khad ah si aad u doorato calaamadaha laga qiyaasay. Haddii ay xaashi kale ku yaalaan, xaashigaas ayaa furmaa. Guji tiro ka mid ah khadka Wadarta mashruuca si aad u doorato dhammaan calaamadaha xaashiga. Tiro la qoray ma leh calaamado. Waxa la ogaan lahaa Saxeexdu waxay diiwaangelisaa magac sida la qoray. Waa diiwaan faylka ku jira, ma aha saxeex elektarooniyeed. Haddii shaqo-bakhaaleyo loo bixiyay qandaraasleyaasha hoose ama beddelaad ku jira xisaabinta, wadarta la saxeexay waa tartanka aasaasiga ah oo ah wadarta lagu muujiyay Wadarta mashruuca.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"office-layout","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"\"Qaabka xafiiska: kooxaynta, wadar-yarta, cinwaanka iyo madax-yada Siyaasadaha caadiga ah\"","summary":"Shid Siyaasadaha caadiga ah ee kordhinta, oo qiyaasta, tirooyinka xaashi kasta, dhoofinta iyo waxa kaaliyuhu akhriyo ku qaad qaabka jadwalka xafiiskaaga, oo ah isku qaabka jadwalada BimCraft qaadanaya.","section":"tasks","order":47,"keywords":["xafiis caadi","qaabka xafiiska","siyaasadaha caadiga ah","kordhin","qaabka jadwalka","kooxee sida nooca","kooxee sida xaashida","wadar-yar","wadar","cinwaan","madax-yada","xarfaha waaweyn","qaabka qiyaasta","qaabka dhoofinta","dejinta"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-qaabka-qaata","text":"Waxa qaabka qaata","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wax-u-haya","text":"Waxa wax u haya","level":2},{"id":"waxa-fiican-inaad-ogaatid","text":"Waxa fiican inaad ogaatid","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa dhig TakeoffCraft inuu miisaskiisa u habeeyo sida xafiiskaagu u soo saaro, adigoo aan mar kasta xisaabinta ku dejin. Qaabka waxaa lagu dejiyaa mar, Siyaasadaha caadiga ah, wuxuuna u shaqeeyaa dhammaan barnaamijyada kombiyuutarkan: wixii aad ku dejiso BimCraft ama CadCraft waa wixii TakeoffCraft isticmaalo, iyo sidoo kale dhinaca kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003EDejinta › Kordhinta\u003C/strong\u003E oo shid \u003Cstrong\u003ESiyaasadaha caadiga ah\u003C/strong\u003E. Waa la damiyay ilaa aad shidayso; haddii la damiyo ama aan wax la dejin, TakeoffCraft wuu isla sidii hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003EDejinta › Caalami › Siyaasadaha caadiga ah\u003C/strong\u003E oo hel \u003Cstrong\u003EQaabka jadwalka (heerka xafiiska)\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESiyaasad\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu ku sameeyo TakeoffCraft\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKooxee jadwalada sida\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENooca\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qiyaasta kooxeeyaa sida nooca walxa (Linear, Area, Count, Typed quantity). \u003Cstrong\u003EHeerka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu tirooyinka kooxeeyaa sida xaashidooda. \u003Cstrong\u003EQolka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EMa jiro kooxayn\u003C/strong\u003E midkoodna kooxayn ma sameeyaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWadarta jadwalada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWadar-yar hoos kooxda kasta iyo wadar\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu hoos kasta kooxda ku daraa wadar-yar. Wadarta shaqada weligeed way joogtaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECinwaanka jadwalka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiq ka sarreeya miiska, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003E{schedule}: qaabka xafiiska\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMadax-yada tiirarka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESida la qoray, XARFAHA WAAWEYN ama Xarfo Waaweyn\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXir \u003Cstrong\u003EDejinta\u003C/strong\u003E. Miisaskuna isla markiiba way raacaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-qaabka-qaata\"\u003EWaxa qaabka qaata\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETirooyinka › Sida walxa\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESida xaashida\u003C/strong\u003E: madax-yada kooxaha, wadar-yar hoos kooxda kasta, cinwaanka iyo qaabka xarfaha. Xariiq hoos cinwaanka ayaa sheegaya qaybaha uu qaabka xafiiskaagu dejiyay. Safafku waa isla safafkii: wali waxaad ku qortaa qiimaha iyo qashinka, oo waxaad gujisaa tirooyinka si aad calaamadahooda u xuliso. Qayb ama shuruud labaad waxay ku sii jirtaa walxeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQiyaasta la dhoofiyay\u003C/strong\u003E (CSV iyo XLSX): kooxo iyo wadar-yar isku mid ah. Buug-shaqada, wadar-yar waa \u003Ccode\u003ESUBTOTAL\u003C/code\u003E qaacido oo kooxdeeda ku saleysan, wadarta shaqadana waa mid, sidaas darteed si aan waxba laba jeer loo tirin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxa kaaliyuhu akhriyo\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_estimate\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_quantities\u003C/code\u003E (sida xaashida) waxay ku darayaan qaybta \u003Ccode\u003Elayout\u003C/code\u003E oo leh kooxaha, safafka iyo wadar-yarrada, waxayna sheegaan qaybaha uu xafisku dejiyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wax-u-haya\"\u003EWaxa wax u haya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETirooyinka › Sida aagga\u003C/strong\u003E kooxeyntiisa (sida aagga tartanka) ayuu sheegaa oo wuu ilaaliyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWadarta shaqada\u003C/strong\u003E, calaamadinta soo koobida tartanka iyo beddelka lama dib u kooxeeyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKooxayn miiska aan tiir u lahayn waa la reebaa: qiyaasta ma leh heer, tirooyinka xaashi kasta ma leh nooc.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-fiican-inaad-ogaatid\"\u003EWaxa fiican inaad ogaatid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESiyaasadaha waxaa lagu hayaa browser-kan barnaamij kasta oo CadCraft ah, waxayna u socdaan faylka Siyaasadaha caadiga ah (\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi fayl\u003C/strong\u003E / \u003Cstrong\u003EKa soo geli fayl\u003C/strong\u003E isla meeshaas), sidaas darteed xafiis wuxuu wadaagaa hal fayl.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQiyaas la dhoofiyay CSV oo leh kooxo waa mid loo akhriyo. Si qiyaasta dib loogu soo geliyo maktabad qiimo, dhoofi iyada oo aan kooxayn lahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhinaca BimCraft ee isla heerkaas: jadwalada, dejinta iyo dhoofinta. TakeoffCraft weli siyaasado gaar ah ma laha, sidaas darteed ma jiro qaybta Siyaasadaha caadiga ah ee hoos Dejinta › TakeoffCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Ka dhig TakeoffCraft inuu miisaskiisa u habeeyo sida xafiiskaagu u soo saaro, adigoo aan mar kasta xisaabinta ku dejin. Qaabka waxaa lagu dejiyaa mar, Siyaasadaha caadiga ah, wuxuuna u shaqeeyaa dhammaan barnaamijyada kombiyuutarkan: wixii aad ku dejiso BimCraft ama CadCraft waa wixii TakeoffCraft isticmaalo, iyo sidoo kale dhinaca kale. Tallaabooyinka Fur Dejinta › Kordhinta oo shid Siyaasadaha caadiga ah. Waa la damiyay ilaa aad shidayso; haddii la damiyo ama aan wax la dejin, TakeoffCraft wuu isla sidii hore. Fur Dejinta › Caalami › Siyaasadaha caadiga ah oo hel Qaabka jadwalka (heerka xafiiska): Siyaasad Waxa uu ku sameeyo TakeoffCraft Kooxee jadwalada sida Nooca wuxuu qiyaasta kooxeeyaa sida nooca walxa (Linear, Area, Count, Typed quantity). Heerka wuxuu tirooyinka kooxeeyaa sida xaashidooda. Qolka iyo Ma jiro kooxayn midkoodna kooxayn ma sameeyaan Wadarta jadwalada Wadar-yar hoos kooxda kasta iyo wadar wuxuu hoos kasta kooxda ku daraa wadar-yar. Wadarta shaqada weligeed way joogtaa Cinwaanka jadwalka Xariiq ka sarreeya miiska, tusaale ahaan {schedule}: qaabka xafiiska Madax-yada tiirarka Sida la qoray, XARFAHA WAAWEYN ama Xarfo Waaweyn Xir Dejinta. Miisaskuna isla markiiba way raacaan. Waxa qaabka qaata Tirooyinka › Sida walxa iyo Sida xaashida: madax-yada kooxaha, wadar-yar hoos kooxda kasta, cinwaanka iyo qaabka xarfaha. Xariiq hoos cinwaanka ayaa sheegaya qaybaha uu qaabka xafiiskaagu dejiyay. Safafku waa isla safafkii: wali waxaad ku qortaa qiimaha iyo qashinka, oo waxaad gujisaa tirooyinka si aad calaamadahooda u xuliso. Qayb ama shuruud labaad waxay ku sii jirtaa walxeeda. Qiyaasta la dhoofiyay (CSV iyo XLSX): kooxo iyo wadar-yar isku mid ah. Buug-shaqada, wadar-yar waa SUBTOTAL qaacido oo kooxdeeda ku saleysan, wadarta shaqadana waa mid, sidaas darteed si aan waxba laba jeer loo tirin. Waxa kaaliyuhu akhriyo: takeoff_estimate iyo takeoff_quantities (sida xaashida) waxay ku darayaan qaybta layout oo leh kooxaha, safafka iyo wadar-yarrada, waxayna sheegaan qaybaha uu xafisku dejiyay. Waxa wax u haya Tirooyinka › Sida aagga kooxeyntiisa (sida aagga tartanka) ayuu sheegaa oo wuu ilaaliyaa. Wadarta shaqada, calaamadinta soo koobida tartanka iyo beddelka lama dib u kooxeeyo. Kooxayn miiska aan tiir u lahayn waa la reebaa: qiyaasta ma leh heer, tirooyinka xaashi kasta ma leh nooc. Waxa fiican inaad ogaatid Siyaasadaha waxaa lagu hayaa browser-kan barnaamij kasta oo CadCraft ah, waxayna u socdaan faylka Siyaasadaha caadiga ah (Kaydi fayl / Ka soo geli fayl isla meeshaas), sidaas darteed xafiis wuxuu wadaagaa hal fayl. Qiyaas la dhoofiyay CSV oo leh kooxo waa mid loo akhriyo. Si qiyaasta dib loogu soo geliyo maktabad qiimo, dhoofi iyada oo aan kooxayn lahayn. Dhinaca BimCraft ee isla heerkaas: jadwalada, dejinta iyo dhoofinta. TakeoffCraft weli siyaasado gaar ah ma laha, sidaas darteed ma jiro qaybta Siyaasadaha caadiga ah ee hoos Dejinta › TakeoffCraft.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"follow-a-teammate","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Raac xubin kale Live session-ka","summary":"Arag cida ku jirta session-ka, waxay sameynayaan, oo u dhaqaaq aragtaada iyada oo raacaysa qofkaas.","section":"tasks","order":47,"keywords":["raac","live","liiska dadka","fasal","asxaab","jiritaan","cursor","session","ku dalbo dhammaan inay i raacaan","barasho"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samaynayso","text":"Waxa aad samaynayso","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"fiiro-gaar-ah","text":"Fiiro gaar ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samaynayso\"\u003EWaxa aad samaynayso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELive session-ka, arag qof kasta qalabkiisa iyo xaashidiisa, oo raac aragta mid ka mid ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBilow ama ku biir Live session CadCraft Studio. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/work-live\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/work-live\"\u003EShaqaynta toos ah dadka kale\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDadka\u003C/span\u003E si aad u furto liiska dadka. Safka kasta wuxuu leeyahay midabka iyo magaca qofka, qalabka uu socodsiinayo, xaashida uu ku jiro, iyo waqtigii ugu dambeeyay ee wax ka beddelay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaac\u003C/span\u003E magac kasta. Aragtaadu way raacaysaa tiisa, xariiq ayaa kugu sheegaya inaad raacayso; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E ayaa dhammaysiya. Adigoo aragta u kala durugsanaya ama weynaynaya (pan ama zoom) ayaa sidoo kale joojisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESidii martiga (host), riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dalbo dhammaan inay i raacaan\u003C/span\u003E liiska dadka si aad uga dalbato kuwa kale inay kuu raacaan. Waxay helayaan xariiq leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaac\u003C/span\u003E. Riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji in aan ku dalbado dhammaan inay i raacaan\u003C/span\u003E si aad u dhammaysid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fiiro-gaar-ah\"\u003EFiiro gaar ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii qofku uu xaashi kale ku jiro, xariiqdu waxay sheegaysaa tii ay tahay. Haddii aragtiisa aan lagu raaci karin aragtaada, waxay taas sidoo kale sheegaysaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiritaanka qofku marna lagama kaydiyo xisaabinta, ama undo-ga qof kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samaynayso Live session-ka, arag qof kasta qalabkiisa iyo xaashidiisa, oo raac aragta mid ka mid ah. Tallaabooyin Bilow ama ku biir Live session CadCraft Studio. Eeg Shaqaynta toos ah dadka kale. Riix badhanka Dadka si aad u furto liiska dadka. Safka kasta wuxuu leeyahay midabka iyo magaca qofka, qalabka uu socodsiinayo, xaashida uu ku jiro, iyo waqtigii ugu dambeeyay ee wax ka beddelay. Riix Raac magac kasta. Aragtaadu way raacaysaa tiisa, xariiq ayaa kugu sheegaya inaad raacayso; Jooji ayaa dhammaysiya. Adigoo aragta u kala durugsanaya ama weynaynaya (pan ama zoom) ayaa sidoo kale joojisa. Sidii martiga (host), riix Ku dalbo dhammaan inay i raacaan liiska dadka si aad uga dalbato kuwa kale inay kuu raacaan. Waxay helayaan xariiq leh Raac. Riix Jooji in aan ku dalbado dhammaan inay i raacaan si aad u dhammaysid. Fiiro gaar ah Haddii qofku uu xaashi kale ku jiro, xariiqdu waxay sheegaysaa tii ay tahay. Haddii aragtiisa aan lagu raaci karin aragtaada, waxay taas sidoo kale sheegaysaa. Jiritaanka qofku marna lagama kaydiyo xisaabinta, ama undo-ga qof kasta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"measure-areas","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Aagagga ka cabbir oo god ka jar","summary":"Qeex dabaqa, saqafka iyo sagxadda, ka jar godad gudihiisa ka mid ah, ku dar geesaha qallooca, goobooyinka iyo godadka wareegsan, oo akhri aagga iyo dhinaca wareega.","section":"tasks","order":50,"keywords":["buuxinta qolka","riix qolka gudihiisa","aag otomaatig ah","back-out","tiir","bir-god","ka jar dhowr shay","aag","poligon","kontuur","square feet","sf","cut-out","god","goobo","wareeg","qaanso","dhinaca wareega","dabaq","saqaf","sagxad"],"headings":[{"id":"qeex-aag","text":"Qeex aag","level":2},{"id":"geesaha-qallooca","text":"Geesaha qallooca","level":2},{"id":"goobo","text":"Goobo","level":2},{"id":"qol-hal-riix-ku-buuxi","text":"Qol hal riix ku buuxi","level":2},{"id":"god-ka-jar-aag","text":"God ka jar aag","level":2},{"id":"back-outs-tiirar-bir-godad-iyo-furitaano-laga-jaro-dhowr-shay","text":"Back-outs: tiirar, bir-godad iyo furitaano laga jaro dhowr shay","level":2},{"id":"aagga-akhri","text":"Aagga akhri","level":2},{"id":"aag-saxi","text":"Aag saxi","level":2},{"id":"dhererka-mugga","text":"Dhererka mugga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EShayga aagga wuxuu cabiraa aagga la xidhay. Qeex kasta wuxuu ka jari karaa godad (bir-god, tiir, beer dhir), geesihiisuna waa toos ama qallooc.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa hor inta aanad bilaabin: xaashigu wuxuu u baahan yahay miisaan (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EDejiso miisaanka\u003C/a\u003E), waxaadna u baahan tahay shay aag (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003EAbuur walxaha xisaabinta\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qeex-aag\"\u003EQeex aag\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix shayga aagga ee hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAag\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix geesaha qolka ama sagxadda mid mid. Hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u sameyso geesaha 0°, 45° iyo 90°. Laga bilaabo barta saddexaad, qeexdu way buuxmaysaa, saddex-ka hoose wuxuu tusayaa &quot;Aag&quot; iyo &quot;dhinaca wareega&quot;. Giraan yar ayaa ku muuqata barta koowaad ku wareegsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXir qeexda: riix barta koowaad (gudaha giraankeeda), riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, labo-riix, ama midig-riix. Aagga waxa lagu buuxiyaa midab khafiif ah oo shayga, lagu calaamadiyaa fiidada laba jibbaaran, oo wuxuu noqdaa calaamadda la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ka saaraa geesta u dambaysa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu tuurayaa qeexda oo dhan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQeex is gooyso naftiisa waa la diidaa: &quot;Qeexdu waa is-goysay, markaa aagga waa khalad. Dib u sawir isla aan gooynin.&quot; Taas beddelkeeda qaab laba-goboleed ah ku sawir laba aag.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"geesaha-qallooca\"\u003EGeesaha qallooca\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIntii aad qeexayso, shid habka qaansada (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaanso\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Geesta ka dib, riix barta ku taal qallooca, kadibna meesha uu qalloocu ku dhammaado. Si aad qeexda ugu xirto qallooc, ka dhig riixitaankaas u dambaysa barta koowaad. Aagga iyo dhinaca wareega waxay isticmaalaan qallooca saxda ah. Mar kale riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E geesaha toosan. Si aad qallooca dib u beddesho, dooro aagga oo jiid gacanta wareega ee qallooca dhexe. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#arcs-and-curved-walls\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"arcs-and-curved-walls\"\u003ECabbir socodyada toosan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"goobo\"\u003EGoobo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShay aag ah ku jira, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobo\u003C/span\u003E ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix dhexda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix barta kasta ee geeska. Intaad dhaqdhaqaaqayso, saddex-ka hoose wuxuu tusayaa radius-ka iyo aagga. Goobada waxa lagu daraa calaamad aag ah oo leh aag iyo dhinac wareeg saxda ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qol-hal-riix-ku-buuxi\"\u003EQol hal riix ku buuxi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka qolalka loo sawiro derbi xidhan, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQol\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu ka qaadaa dabaqa hal riix:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro shay aag ah (tusaale ahaan dhamaystirka dabaqa) oo xaashiga siiso miisaankiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQol\u003C/span\u003E koox \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXisaabinta\u003C/span\u003E, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix gudaha qol, dhulka furan (ma aha xariiq ama calaamad).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffCraft wuxuu akhrinayaa xariiqyada xaashiga, wuxuu helaa meesha ku wareegsan riixa, wuxuuna qeexayaa dhinaca gudaha derbiyada, sida aag shayga hadda jira. Furitaanka albaabka ilaa \u003Cstrong\u003E4&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E waa la tixgeliyaa inuu xidhan yahay, sidaas darteed qeexdu toos ayey u gudubtaa albaabka; \u003Cstrong\u003EDejinta › TakeoffCraft › Qolka buuxi xidha furitaanno ilaa\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa bedeli karta ballaacaas (3&#039;-0&quot; ilaa 8&#039;-0&quot;). Magacyada qolka, alaabta iyo rakibaadka gudaha qolka ma sameeyaan godad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaa diidaa, isla markaana sababta sheegaa, marka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eriixitaanku uu xariiq yahay (&quot;Taasi waa xariiq&quot;);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Emeesha aan xidhnayn: furitaan ka ballaaran dejinta ayaa u ogolaanaya inuu ka baxo geeska xaashiga. Kor u qaad dejinta, ama qeex qolkaas gacanta oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAag\u003C/span\u003E ku qeex;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Emeesha ay yar tahay (calaamad, ma aha qol).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka albaabku ka ballaaran yahay dejinta, buuxintu waxay gashaa qolka xiga oo labadaba wada qeexdaa: ka noqo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), kor u qaad dejinta, kadibna mar kale riix. Qeexda u eeg sida aag kasta: jiid geesaheeda si aad u saxdo. Xaashi la sawiray wuu isla shaqeeyaa, laakiin xariiqyadiisu waa inay madow ku filan yihiin; xariiqyo cawl-cirro ah ayaa laga yaabaa inaysan joojin buuxinta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"god-ka-jar-aag\"\u003EGod ka jar aag\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) oo riix aagga. Wuxuu tusayaa gacmo labajibbaaran geesaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGod\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare (ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar cut-out\u003C/span\u003E hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadda la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix geesaha godka, gudaha aagga. Habka qaansada halkan ayaa sidoo kale shaqeeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXir sida aagga: riix barta koowaad, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, labo-riix ama midig-riix. Godku ma buuxmo, saddex-ka hoose wuxuu yidhi: &quot;God waa lagu daray. Mid kale sawir, ama riix Esc.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGodad kale ku sawir isla aagga, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGodka wareegsan, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar cut-out wareegsan\u003C/span\u003E hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadda la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E, riix dhexdeeda, kadibna barta geeskeeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGod waa inuu gudaha aagga ku jiraa gebi ahaanba, mana isku dhegi karo god kale. Haddii kale TakeoffCraft way diidaa: &quot;God waa inuu gudaha aagga gebi ahaan ku jiraa.&quot; ama &quot;Godadka isma dhegi karaan.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad godka u dambaysa mar kale uga saarto, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar cut-outkii ugu dambeeyay\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"back-outs-tiirar-bir-godad-iyo-furitaano-laga-jaro-dhowr-shay\"\u003EBack-outs: tiirar, bir-godad iyo furitaano laga jaro dhowr shay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGod wuxuu u jiraa calaamad aag keliya. \u003Cstrong\u003EBack-out\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu la sawiraa hal mar, wuxuuna ka soo baxaa aag kasta oo uu isku dhaco, shayagga aad dooratay: tiirarka hal mar sawir, oo waxay ka soo baxaan dabaqa dhamaystirka, saqafka iyo sagxadda isla markaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUgu tala shay aag, sida &quot;Tiirar&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDejinta shayga, calig \u003Cstrong\u003EBack-out: calaamadiisu aagga ka jarayaa shayagga kale\u003C/strong\u003E. Liis shayada aagga kale ee aad leedahay ayaa soo muuqda, oo dhammaantood waa la calaamadiyey: ka saar kuwa back-outku aanu taabanayn (tusaale ahaan rinjiga darbiyada).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETiirarka ka cabbir \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAag\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobo\u003C/span\u003E, sida caadiga ah. Mid kastaa waxa lagu sawiraa xariiq jajab ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamad kasta oo aag ah oo shay calaamadsan ku jirta isla xaashiga waxay lumisaa qaybta uu back-outku daboosho: back-out oo dhan markuu gudaha ku jiro, kaliya qaybta isku dhacda markuu geesta gooyo, iyo waxba godka gudihiisa. Aagga la doortay panelkiisa wuxuu tusayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EBack-outs\u003C/strong\u003E iyo aagga hadhay. Tirada shayga, qaacidooyinka isku-dhisme, kharashyada, muuqaalka 3D iyo dhoofinta oo dhan waxay isticmaalaan aagga hadhay; qoraallada qiyaasku waxay sheegaan inta back-outs ay ka jarteen. Shayga back-out-ka laftiisu aagiisa ayuu tiraa (ka tag kharashyadiisa eber haddii aanad qiimayn).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBack-out waa inuu noqdaa \u003Cstrong\u003Equmman\u003C/strong\u003E: laydh, goobo ama qeex aan geesaha gudaha lahayn. TakeoffCraft way diidaa inuu midka aan qummanayn sawiro; qaab L ah oo godka ah ku sawir laba back-out. Back-outs ma leeyihin godad, laba back-out oo isku dhacaana labadaba way tirmaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhinaca wareega (\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E) ma beddelo: back-outs waxay ka jaraan aagga oo keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"aagga-akhri\"\u003EAagga akhri\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro aagga. \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadda la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu tusayaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESafka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAagga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAagga saafiga ah: qeexda oo ka dhimma godadka. Waa midka shayga tiraa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQeex\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAagga guud ee qeexda gudihiisa (wuu muuqdaa marka godad jiraan).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGodad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta god, iyo aagooda wadarta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhinaca wareega\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDherer geesta qeexda, \u003Cstrong\u003Eiyo\u003C/strong\u003E geesaha godad kasta (&quot;godadka oo leh&quot;).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhinaca wareega wuxuu ku daraa geesaha godadka si ula kac ah, tusaale ahaan foomamka geesta ama saldhigga oo wareega godka. Haddii aad u baahan tahay geesta dibadda oo keliya, ka ilaali godadka shayaga, ama geesta dibadda ka cabbir sida socod toosan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnug\u003C/span\u003E shayga ayaa go&#039;aaminaya sida wadarta loo sheego: SF, SY ama m². Panelka \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadda la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E iyo saddex-ka hoose weligood waxay tusaan square feet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"aag-saxi\"\u003EAag saxi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeesta guri\u003C/strong\u003E: dooro aagga oo jiid gacanta geesta (godadku gacmo bay leeyihiin). Haddii qaabka cusub isgoysay ama god dibadda ku riixayo, geeska dib ayaa loo celinayaa: &quot;Barta waa dib loo celiyay.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGuri shay kale\u003C/strong\u003E: dooro shay aag kale liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EShayga\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadda la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETirtir\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E menu-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax badan\u003C/span\u003E ee qalabka sare, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir calaamadda\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhererka-mugga\"\u003EDhererka mugga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShayga aagga siiso \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoto\u003C/span\u003E (tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003E0&#039;-4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E sagxad ahaan) oo isticmaal \u003Ccode\u003EA * H / 27\u003C/code\u003E qayb isku-dhis si aad u hesho cubic yards. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EIsku-dhisyada iyo qaacidooyinka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Shayga aagga wuxuu cabiraa aagga la xidhay. Qeex kasta wuxuu ka jari karaa godad (bir-god, tiir, beer dhir), geesihiisuna waa toos ama qallooc. Ka hor inta aanad bilaabin: xaashigu wuxuu u baahan yahay miisaan (Dejiso miisaanka), waxaadna u baahan tahay shay aag (Abuur walxaha xisaabinta). Qeex aag Riix shayga aagga ee hoosta Walxaha. Dooro Aag qalabka sare, ama riix A. Riix geesaha qolka ama sagxadda mid mid. Hay Shift si aad u sameyso geesaha 0°, 45° iyo 90°. Laga bilaabo barta saddexaad, qeexdu way buuxmaysaa, saddex-ka hoose wuxuu tusayaa \"Aag\" iyo \"dhinaca wareega\". Giraan yar ayaa ku muuqata barta koowaad ku wareegsan. Xir qeexda: riix barta koowaad (gudaha giraankeeda), riix Enter, labo-riix, ama midig-riix. Aagga waxa lagu buuxiyaa midab khafiif ah oo shayga, lagu calaamadiyaa fiidada laba jibbaaran, oo wuxuu noqdaa calaamadda la doortay. Backspace wuxuu ka saaraa geesta u dambaysa; Esc wuxuu tuurayaa qeexda oo dhan. Qeex is gooyso naftiisa waa la diidaa: \"Qeexdu waa is-goysay, markaa aagga waa khalad. Dib u sawir isla aan gooynin.\" Taas beddelkeeda qaab laba-goboleed ah ku sawir laba aag. Geesaha qallooca Intii aad qeexayso, shid habka qaansada (Qaanso ama R). Geesta ka dib, riix barta ku taal qallooca, kadibna meesha uu qalloocu ku dhammaado. Si aad qeexda ugu xirto qallooc, ka dhig riixitaankaas u dambaysa barta koowaad. Aagga iyo dhinaca wareega waxay isticmaalaan qallooca saxda ah. Mar kale riix R geesaha toosan. Si aad qallooca dib u beddesho, dooro aagga oo jiid gacanta wareega ee qallooca dhexe. Eeg Cabbir socodyada toosan. Goobo Shay aag ah ku jira, dooro Goobo ama riix O. Riix dhexda. Riix barta kasta ee geeska. Intaad dhaqdhaqaaqayso, saddex-ka hoose wuxuu tusayaa radius-ka iyo aagga. Goobada waxa lagu daraa calaamad aag ah oo leh aag iyo dhinac wareeg saxda ah. Qol hal riix ku buuxi Marka qolalka loo sawiro derbi xidhan, Qol (B) wuxuu ka qaadaa dabaqa hal riix: Dooro shay aag ah (tusaale ahaan dhamaystirka dabaqa) oo xaashiga siiso miisaankiisa. Dooro Qol koox Xisaabinta, ama riix B. Riix gudaha qol, dhulka furan (ma aha xariiq ama calaamad). TakeoffCraft wuxuu akhrinayaa xariiqyada xaashiga, wuxuu helaa meesha ku wareegsan riixa, wuxuuna qeexayaa dhinaca gudaha derbiyada, sida aag shayga hadda jira. Furitaanka albaabka ilaa 4'-0\" waa la tixgeliyaa inuu xidhan yahay, sidaas darteed qeexdu toos ayey u gudubtaa albaabka; Dejinta › TakeoffCraft › Qolka buuxi xidha furitaanno ilaa ayaa bedeli karta ballaacaas (3'-0\" ilaa 8'-0\"). Magacyada qolka, alaabta iyo rakibaadka gudaha qolka ma sameeyaan godad. Waa diidaa, isla markaana sababta sheegaa, marka: riixitaanku uu xariiq yahay (\"Taasi waa xariiq\"); meesha aan xidhnayn: furitaan ka ballaaran dejinta ayaa u ogolaanaya inuu ka baxo geeska xaashiga. Kor u qaad dejinta, ama qeex qolkaas gacanta oo Aag ku qeex; meesha ay yar tahay (calaamad, ma aha qol). Marka albaabku ka ballaaran yahay dejinta, buuxintu waxay gashaa qolka xiga oo labadaba wada qeexdaa: ka noqo (Ctrl+Z), kor u qaad dejinta, kadibna mar kale riix. Qeexda u eeg sida aag kasta: jiid geesaheeda si aad u saxdo. Xaashi la sawiray wuu isla shaqeeyaa, laakiin xariiqyadiisu waa inay madow ku filan yihiin; xariiqyo cawl-cirro ah ayaa laga yaabaa inaysan joojin buuxinta. God ka jar aag Dooro Dooro (V) oo riix aagga. Wuxuu tusayaa gacmo labajibbaaran geesaha. Dooro God qalabka sare (ama riix X), ama Ku dar cut-out hoosta Calaamadda la doortay. Riix geesaha godka, gudaha aagga. Habka qaansada halkan ayaa sidoo kale shaqeeya. Xir sida aagga: riix barta koowaad, riix Enter, labo-riix ama midig-riix. Godku ma buuxmo, saddex-ka hoose wuxuu yidhi: \"God waa lagu daray. Mid kale sawir, ama riix Esc.\" Godad kale ku sawir isla aagga, ama riix Esc. Godka wareegsan, dooro Ku dar cut-out wareegsan hoosta Calaamadda la doortay, riix dhexdeeda, kadibna barta geeskeeda. God waa inuu gudaha aagga ku jiraa gebi ahaanba, mana isku dhegi karo god kale. Haddii kale TakeoffCraft way diidaa: \"God waa inuu gudaha aagga gebi ahaan ku jiraa.\" ama \"Godadka isma dhegi karaan.\" Si aad godka u dambaysa mar kale uga saarto, dooro Ka saar cut-outkii ugu dambeeyay. Back-outs: tiirar, bir-godad iyo furitaano laga jaro dhowr shay God wuxuu u jiraa calaamad aag keliya. Back-out wuxuu la sawiraa hal mar, wuxuuna ka soo baxaa aag kasta oo uu isku dhaco, shayagga aad dooratay: tiirarka hal mar sawir, oo waxay ka soo baxaan dabaqa dhamaystirka, saqafka iyo sagxadda isla markaa. Ugu tala shay aag, sida \"Tiirar\". Dejinta shayga, calig Back-out: calaamadiisu aagga ka jarayaa shayagga kale. Liis shayada aagga kale ee aad leedahay ayaa soo muuqda, oo dhammaantood waa la calaamadiyey: ka saar kuwa back-outku aanu taabanayn (tusaale ahaan rinjiga darbiyada). Tiirarka ka cabbir Aag ama Goobo, sida caadiga ah. Mid kastaa waxa lagu sawiraa xariiq jajab ah. Calaamad kasta oo aag ah oo shay calaamadsan ku jirta isla xaashiga waxay lumisaa qaybta uu back-outku daboosho: back-out oo dhan markuu gudaha ku jiro, kaliya qaybta isku dhacda markuu geesta gooyo, iyo waxba godka gudihiisa. Aagga la doortay panelkiisa wuxuu tusayaa Back-outs iyo aagga hadhay. Tirada shayga, qaacidooyinka isku-dhisme, kharashyada, muuqaalka 3D iyo dhoofinta oo dhan waxay isticmaalaan aagga hadhay; qoraallada qiyaasku waxay sheegaan inta back-outs ay ka jarteen. Shayga back-out-ka laftiisu aagiisa ayuu tiraa (ka tag kharashyadiisa eber haddii aanad qiimayn). Back-out waa inuu noqdaa qumman: laydh, goobo ama qeex aan geesaha gudaha lahayn. TakeoffCraft way diidaa inuu midka aan qummanayn sawiro; qaab L ah oo godka ah ku sawir laba back-out. Back-outs ma leeyihin godad, laba back-out oo isku dhacaana labadaba way tirmaan. Dhinaca wareega (P) ma beddelo: back-outs waxay ka jaraan aagga oo keliya. Aagga akhri Dooro aagga. Calaamadda la doortay wuxuu tusayaa: Safka Macnaha Aagga Aagga saafiga ah: qeexda oo ka dhimma godadka. Waa midka shayga tiraa. Qeex Aagga guud ee qeexda gudihiisa (wuu muuqdaa marka godad jiraan). Godad Inta god, iyo aagooda wadarta. Dhinaca wareega Dherer geesta qeexda, iyo geesaha godad kasta (\"godadka oo leh\"). Dhinaca wareega wuxuu ku daraa geesaha godadka si ula kac ah, tusaale ahaan foomamka geesta ama saldhigga oo wareega godka. Haddii aad u baahan tahay geesta dibadda oo keliya, ka ilaali godadka shayaga, ama geesta dibadda ka cabbir sida socod toosan. Unug shayga ayaa go'aaminaya sida wadarta loo sheego: SF, SY ama m². Panelka Calaamadda la doortay iyo saddex-ka hoose weligood waxay tusaan square feet. Aag saxi Geesta guri: dooro aagga oo jiid gacanta geesta (godadku gacmo bay leeyihiin). Haddii qaabka cusub isgoysay ama god dibadda ku riixayo, geeska dib ayaa loo celinayaa: \"Barta waa dib loo celiyay.\" Guri shay kale: dooro shay aag kale liiska Shayga hoosta Calaamadda la doortay. Tirtir: Delete, Tirtir menu-ka Wax badan ee qalabka sare, ama Tirtir calaamadda. Dhererka mugga Shayga aagga siiso Qoto (tusaale ahaan 0'-4\" sagxad ahaan) oo isticmaal A * H / 27 qayb isku-dhis si aad u hesho cubic yards. Eeg Isku-dhisyada iyo qaacidooyinka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"roofs-and-slopes","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Saqafyada iyo janjeerrada","summary":"Ku sii janjeer aagga si aad dusha saqafka uga qiyaasto qorshaha, oo dhinacyada janjeeray, hipsyada iyo valleysyada ku qiyaas dhererkooda janjeerka.","section":"tasks","order":55,"keywords":["saqaf","janjeer","dhalaal","janjeerka","kor","socod","6:12","rake","hip","valley","gable","saqaf-dahaar","kare","aagga janjeeray","dherer dhab ah","aagga qorshaha"],"headings":[{"id":"qorista-janjeerka","text":"Qorista janjeerka","level":2},{"id":"aagagga-saqafka","text":"Aagagga saqafka","level":2},{"id":"rakes-hips-iyo-valleys","text":"Rakes, hips iyo valleys","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQorshaha saqafku wuxuu muujiyaa qayb kasta oo saqaf oo siman, sida laga arko kor. Saqafka laftiisu way ka weyn yahay: saqaf 6:12 wuxuu leeyahay ku dhawaad 12% dusha ka badan qorshihiisa, geesaha janjeeray way ka dheer yihiin sidii ay u muuqdaan. Siiso shayga janjeerkiisa, TakeoffCraft wuxuu ku qiyaasaa dhinaca janjeerka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qorista-janjeerka\"\u003EQorista janjeerka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJanjeerku waa kor ee laga helo 12 socod, sida calaamadaha janjeerka ee qorshaha saqafka. Qor sida \u003Ccode\u003E6:12\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6/12\u003C/code\u003E ama kaliya \u003Ccode\u003E6\u003C/code\u003E; socod kale ayaa sidoo kale shaqeysa (\u003Ccode\u003E4:10\u003C/code\u003E waa 4.8:12). Xagal waxay shaqeysaa calaamadda darajada: \u003Ccode\u003E26.57°\u003C/code\u003E. Madhan ama \u003Ccode\u003E0\u003C/code\u003E waa sinaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"aagagga-saqafka\"\u003EAagagga saqafka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamee shay aag ah oo saqafka, ama fur midka aad haysid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDejinteeda, qor \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeerka\u003C/strong\u003E sida \u003Ccode\u003E6:12\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQorshaha ku qeex qorshaha saqaf kasta adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAag\u003C/span\u003E, sida caadiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaqaf kasta wuxuu tiraa aagiisa qorshaha oo lagu dhufto caamilka janjeerka: √(1 + (kor ÷ 12)²), taas oo ah 1.118 6:12 iyo 1.414 12:12. Dooro saqaf si aad u aragto \u003Cstrong\u003EAagga\u003C/strong\u003E (janjeerka dusheeda), \u003Cstrong\u003EAagga qorshaha\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ECaamilka janjeerka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaqafyo janjeer kale leh: dooro saqafka oo ku qor \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeerka\u003C/strong\u003E gaarka ah panelkiisa. Ka tag madhan si uu u isticmaalo kan shayga. Aragtida 3D ee hubinta, isku-dhisyada (\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E waa aagga janjeeray), kharashyada iyo dhoofintu dhammaantood waxay isticmaalaan aagga janjeeray. Ka jarista saqafka janjeeray, sida daaqadaha saqafka, waxay ka baxaan isla janjeerkaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPerimeter-ka (\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E) wuxuu sii ahaan doonaa wareegga qorshaha. Qiyaas geesaha hoose, rakes, hips iyo valleys sida socodyo (hoos).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rakes-hips-iyo-valleys\"\u003ERakes, hips iyo valleys\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamee shay socod ah, sida &quot;Geeska rake&quot; ama &quot;Hips&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDejiso \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeerka\u003C/strong\u003E si uu u noqdo \u003Cstrong\u003ERake\u003C/strong\u003E (geeska janjeeray, sida geeska gable) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EHip ama valley\u003C/strong\u003E (xariiqda laba qorshe ku kulmaan), oo qor \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeerka\u003C/strong\u003E saqafyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor socodyada qorshaha adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESocod\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERake wuxuu tiraa dhererkiisa qorshaha oo lagu dhufto caamilka janjeerka. Hip ama valley wuxuu u socdaa 45° qorshaha dhexdiisa laba qorshe oo isku janjeer ah, sidaas darteed dhererkiisa dhabta ah waa dherer qorshe × √(1 + (kor ÷ 12)² ÷ 2): 1.061 6:12, 1.225 12:12.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHal socod ayaa isku dari kara labadaba. Dooro: qayb kasta oo panelkiisa waxaa ku jira liis janjeer — \u003Cstrong\u003EShayga\u003C/strong\u003E (dejinta shayga), \u003Cstrong\u003EHeer\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ERake\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EHip ama valley\u003C/strong\u003E — iyo dhererkiisa janjeerka. \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeerka\u003C/strong\u003E socodka ee panelka wuxuu bedelaa kan shayga qaybaha oo dhan. Panelku wuxuu sidoo kale muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EDherer qorshe\u003C/strong\u003E, calaamadaha xaashiyana waxay muujinayaan dherarka janjeerka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhimistu weli way shaqeysaa: qayb la dhimay wax ma tirto, janjeer ha ahaado ama ha ahaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHips iyo valleys waxay u qaataan in labada qorshe ay isku janjeer yihiin. Qorshayaasha janjeerradoodu kala duwan yihiin, qiyaas hip-ka dhererkiisa dhabta ah meel kale, ama ku sawir sida rake janjeer la mid ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Qorshaha saqafku wuxuu muujiyaa qayb kasta oo saqaf oo siman, sida laga arko kor. Saqafka laftiisu way ka weyn yahay: saqaf 6:12 wuxuu leeyahay ku dhawaad 12% dusha ka badan qorshihiisa, geesaha janjeeray way ka dheer yihiin sidii ay u muuqdaan. Siiso shayga janjeerkiisa, TakeoffCraft wuxuu ku qiyaasaa dhinaca janjeerka. Qorista janjeerka Janjeerku waa kor ee laga helo 12 socod, sida calaamadaha janjeerka ee qorshaha saqafka. Qor sida 6:12, 6/12 ama kaliya 6; socod kale ayaa sidoo kale shaqeysa (4:10 waa 4.8:12). Xagal waxay shaqeysaa calaamadda darajada: 26.57°. Madhan ama 0 waa sinaha. Aagagga saqafka Samee shay aag ah oo saqafka, ama fur midka aad haysid. Dejinteeda, qor Janjeerka sida 6:12. Qorshaha ku qeex qorshaha saqaf kasta adigoo isticmaalaya Aag, sida caadiga. Saqaf kasta wuxuu tiraa aagiisa qorshaha oo lagu dhufto caamilka janjeerka: √(1 + (kor ÷ 12)²), taas oo ah 1.118 6:12 iyo 1.414 12:12. Dooro saqaf si aad u aragto Aagga (janjeerka dusheeda), Aagga qorshaha iyo Caamilka janjeerka. Saqafyo janjeer kale leh: dooro saqafka oo ku qor Janjeerka gaarka ah panelkiisa. Ka tag madhan si uu u isticmaalo kan shayga. Aragtida 3D ee hubinta, isku-dhisyada (A waa aagga janjeeray), kharashyada iyo dhoofintu dhammaantood waxay isticmaalaan aagga janjeeray. Ka jarista saqafka janjeeray, sida daaqadaha saqafka, waxay ka baxaan isla janjeerkaas. Perimeter-ka (P) wuxuu sii ahaan doonaa wareegga qorshaha. Qiyaas geesaha hoose, rakes, hips iyo valleys sida socodyo (hoos). Rakes, hips iyo valleys Samee shay socod ah, sida \"Geeska rake\" ama \"Hips\". Dejiso Janjeerka si uu u noqdo Rake (geeska janjeeray, sida geeska gable) ama Hip ama valley (xariiqda laba qorshe ku kulmaan), oo qor Janjeerka saqafyada. Qor socodyada qorshaha adigoo isticmaalaya Socod. Rake wuxuu tiraa dhererkiisa qorshaha oo lagu dhufto caamilka janjeerka. Hip ama valley wuxuu u socdaa 45° qorshaha dhexdiisa laba qorshe oo isku janjeer ah, sidaas darteed dhererkiisa dhabta ah waa dherer qorshe × √(1 + (kor ÷ 12)² ÷ 2): 1.061 6:12, 1.225 12:12. Hal socod ayaa isku dari kara labadaba. Dooro: qayb kasta oo panelkiisa waxaa ku jira liis janjeer — Shayga (dejinta shayga), Heer, Rake ama Hip ama valley — iyo dhererkiisa janjeerka. Janjeerka socodka ee panelka wuxuu bedelaa kan shayga qaybaha oo dhan. Panelku wuxuu sidoo kale muujinayaa Dherer qorshe, calaamadaha xaashiyana waxay muujinayaan dherarka janjeerka. Dhimistu weli way shaqeysaa: qayb la dhimay wax ma tirto, janjeer ha ahaado ama ha ahaan. Hips iyo valleys waxay u qaataan in labada qorshe ay isku janjeer yihiin. Qorshayaasha janjeerradoodu kala duwan yihiin, qiyaas hip-ka dhererkiisa dhabta ah meel kale, ama ku sawir sida rake janjeer la mid ah.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"count-by-hand","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Tiri gacanta","summary":"Riix albaab kasta, qalab iftiin ama aalad si aad u tirto, hubi tirooyinkaaga, oo saxo khaladaad.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["tiri","kasta","ea","qalabka iftiinka","albaabbo","aaladaha","astaamaha","tallaan","riix tiri","tiro gacmeed"],"headings":[{"id":"tiri","text":"Tiri","level":2},{"id":"saxid-tiro","text":"Saxid tiro","level":2},{"id":"cabbirka-dhibicda-shaashadda-iyo-pdf-ka","text":"Cabbirka dhibicda, shaashadda iyo PDF-ka","level":2},{"id":"tiro-badan-oo-isku-mid-ah","text":"Tiro badan oo isku mid ah","level":2},{"id":"isticmaalka-tirooyinka-qaacidooyinka","text":"Isticmaalka tirooyinka qaacidooyinka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWalaxda tirada ah waxay tirisaa waxyaabaha: albaabbo, qalabka iftiinka, koronto-geliyaasha, qalabka biyaha. Riix kasta oo xaashiga ku jira wuxuu ku daraa hal calaamad tiro. Tirintu ma u baahna miisaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tiri\"\u003ETiri\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamee ama riix walax tiro ah oo ku jirta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E (nooca \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiri\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiri\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix kasta oo xaashiga ku jira. Riix kasta wuxuu dhigaa dhibic midabka walaxda, tirada walaxdana waxay kor u kacdaa hal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETag xaashiga xiga (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) oo sii tiri. Qalabku wuxuu sii joogaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiri\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E marka aad dhammayso. TakeoffCraft wuxuu ku laabanayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJiidistu weli waxay dhaqaajinaysaa xaashiga, tirada wareegguna wuu weyneeyaa intaad tirinayso, sidaas darteed waad ku wareegi kartaa xaashiga iyada oo aan dhibic lagu darin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix walaxda tirada si aad u iftiimiso dhibcaheeda xaashi kasta. Liiska xaashiyada wuxuu markaas tusayaa inta dhibic ee xaashi kasta ku jirta, taasoo ku caawisa inaad hesho xaashiyada aadan weli tirin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"saxid-tiro\"\u003ESaxid tiro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa saar dhibic\u003C/strong\u003E: dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), riix dhibicda, oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir calaamadda\u003C/span\u003E. Ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isla markaaba kadib riix qaldan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhaqaajin dhibic\u003C/strong\u003E: dooro, kadibna jiid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxaa lagu tiriyay walax qaldan\u003C/strong\u003E: dooro dhibicda oo dooro walaxda saxda ah liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EWalax\u003C/strong\u003E ee hoos \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadda la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbirka-dhibicda-shaashadda-iyo-pdf-ka\"\u003ECabbirka dhibicda, shaashadda iyo PDF-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhibicyadu waxay ku haystaan hal cabbir shaashadda, intaad weyneysid ama yareysid. Si aad u beddesho, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E, tab-ka TakeoffCraft, oo dooro \u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirka calaamadda tirada\u003C/strong\u003E: Aad u yar, Yar, Dhexe (caadiga) ama Weyn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhoofinta PDF-ka (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofin\u003C/span\u003E › PDF calaamadsan) wuxuu dhibic kasta ku sawiraa cabbir isku mid ah warqadda, xaashi kasta ha ahaato cabbirkiisa: muuqaaleeyaha PDF-ka oo muuqaalka 100% ku muujinaya wuxuu arkayaa dhibcaha sida weyn ee ay shaashadda ku yihiin. Halka dhibcaha xaashi weli is taabanayaan, dhoofintu wuxuu dhibcaha xaashigaas ka dhigaa mid yar si mid kastaa loo akhrin karo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tiro-badan-oo-isku-mid-ah\"\u003ETiro badan oo isku mid ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAstaan isku mid ah oo xaashi badan ku celisa, isku day \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/a\u003E: sanduuq mid, eeg waxa ay helayso, kadibna ku dar dhammaan hal tallaabo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isticmaalka-tirooyinka-qaacidooyinka\"\u003EIsticmaalka tirooyinka qaacidooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETirada walaxda tirinta waa \u003Cstrong\u003EN\u003C/strong\u003E. Qaybaha isku-dhiska ayaa isticmaali kara, tusaale ahaan lalabada \u003Ccode\u003EN * 3\u003C/code\u003E albaabbada. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EIsku-dhisyada iyo qaacidooyinka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Walaxda tirada ah waxay tirisaa waxyaabaha: albaabbo, qalabka iftiinka, koronto-geliyaasha, qalabka biyaha. Riix kasta oo xaashiga ku jira wuxuu ku daraa hal calaamad tiro. Tirintu ma u baahna miisaan. Tiri Samee ama riix walax tiro ah oo ku jirta Walxaha (nooca Tiri). Dooro Tiri qalabka sare, ama riix C. Riix kasta oo xaashiga ku jira. Riix kasta wuxuu dhigaa dhibic midabka walaxda, tirada walaxdana waxay kor u kacdaa hal. Tag xaashiga xiga (Page Down) oo sii tiri. Qalabku wuxuu sii joogaa Tiri. Riix Esc marka aad dhammayso. TakeoffCraft wuxuu ku laabanayaa Dooro. Jiidistu weli waxay dhaqaajinaysaa xaashiga, tirada wareegguna wuu weyneeyaa intaad tirinayso, sidaas darteed waad ku wareegi kartaa xaashiga iyada oo aan dhibic lagu darin. Riix walaxda tirada si aad u iftiimiso dhibcaheeda xaashi kasta. Liiska xaashiyada wuxuu markaas tusayaa inta dhibic ee xaashi kasta ku jirta, taasoo ku caawisa inaad hesho xaashiyada aadan weli tirin. Saxid tiro Ka saar dhibic: dooro Dooro (V), riix dhibicda, oo riix Delete ama dooro Tirtir calaamadda. Ama riix Ctrl+Z isla markaaba kadib riix qaldan. Dhaqaajin dhibic: dooro, kadibna jiid. Waxaa lagu tiriyay walax qaldan: dooro dhibicda oo dooro walaxda saxda ah liiska Walax ee hoos Calaamadda la doortay. Cabbirka dhibicda, shaashadda iyo PDF-ka Dhibicyadu waxay ku haystaan hal cabbir shaashadda, intaad weyneysid ama yareysid. Si aad u beddesho, fur Dejinta, tab-ka TakeoffCraft, oo dooro Cabbirka calaamadda tirada: Aad u yar, Yar, Dhexe (caadiga) ama Weyn. Dhoofinta PDF-ka (Dhoofin › PDF calaamadsan) wuxuu dhibic kasta ku sawiraa cabbir isku mid ah warqadda, xaashi kasta ha ahaato cabbirkiisa: muuqaaleeyaha PDF-ka oo muuqaalka 100% ku muujinaya wuxuu arkayaa dhibcaha sida weyn ee ay shaashadda ku yihiin. Halka dhibcaha xaashi weli is taabanayaan, dhoofintu wuxuu dhibcaha xaashigaas ka dhigaa mid yar si mid kastaa loo akhrin karo. Tiro badan oo isku mid ah Astaan isku mid ah oo xaashi badan ku celisa, isku day Tirin otomaatig ah: sanduuq mid, eeg waxa ay helayso, kadibna ku dar dhammaan hal tallaabo. Isticmaalka tirooyinka qaacidooyinka Tirada walaxda tirinta waa N. Qaybaha isku-dhiska ayaa isticmaali kara, tusaale ahaan lalabada N * 3 albaabbada. Eeg Isku-dhisyada iyo qaacidooyinka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"auto-count","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Tirin otomaatig ah calaamad","summary":"Ku saami hal calaamad, oo ka dhig TakeoffCraft inuu kuwa kale ka helo xaashidan ama xaashiyada furan oo dhan, dib u eeg isbarbardhigyada adigoo isticmaalaya xiriiqa, oo ku dar hal tallaabo.","section":"tasks","order":70,"keywords":["xagasha kasta","la wareejiyay","la rogay","miisaan kale","miisaan kala duwan","tirin otomaatig ah","tirin toos ah","raadinta calaamadaha","hel calaamadaha","qaab","qaabka","isbarbardhig","ogaan","aaladda tirinta"],"headings":[{"id":"hel-calaamadaha","text":"Hel calaamadaha","level":2},{"id":"dib-u-eeg-isbarbardhigyada","text":"Dib u eeg isbarbardhigyada","level":2},{"id":"ku-dar","text":"Ku dar","level":2},{"id":"waxa-uu-helo-iyo-waxa-uu-seego","text":"Waxa uu helo iyo waxa uu seego","level":2},{"id":"xawaaraha-iyo-browser-yada","text":"Xawaaraha iyo browser-yada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu helaa nuqul kasta oo calaamad ah ka dib markaad saadiso mid. Kadibna waxaad dib u eegtaa isbarbardhigyada xaashida, oo waxaad ku dartaa kuwa aad aqbasho inay yihiin calaamado tiro ah. Waa caawiye, ma aha wax hubaal ah: had iyo jeer dib u eeg ka hor intaadan ku darin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hel-calaamadaha\"\u003EHel calaamadaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamee ama guji shay tiro ah oo ku hoos yaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur xaash ay calaamaddu ku muuqato.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare, ama taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Xariiq ayaa ka soo muuqda sare xaashida: &quot;Jiid sanduuq hal calaamad oo ku jirta xaashidan.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u raadiso dhammaan xaashiyada furan, mitabka ma aha xaashidan oo keliya, calaamee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaadi dhammaan xaashiyada furan\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dhow wax ka ogow si calaamaddu u fiicnaato, kadibna jiid sanduuq dhow mid ka mid ah nuqulkeeda. Ku dar calaamadda oo dhan; waraaqda madhan ee ku wareegsan waa la jaraa. Xariiqdu waxay muujinaysaa &quot;Raadinaya…&quot; oo leh xariiq horumar iyo badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E. Bogga ayaa weli jawaabaya: waad weynayn kartaa, wareegi kartaa, oo waad u dhaqaaqi kartaa xaashiyada kale. Qalab kale oo aad doorato, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ayaa joojiya raadinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka ay dhammaysato, isbarbardhigyada ayaa xaashida ku muuqda sida sanduuqyo midabka shayga leh, xariiqduna waxay muujinaysaa koobvaan sida &quot;22 isbarbardhig, 19 la ku daro (3 horey loo tiriyay). Guji sanduuq si aad u diido ama u soo celiso.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/span\u003E, jiidista xaashida waxay samaysaa sanduuq halkii ay ka guuri lahayd. Si aad u guurto, hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo jiid, ama jiid badhanka dhexe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-eeg-isbarbardhigyada\"\u003EDib u eeg isbarbardhigyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGuji sanduuq\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u diido. Sanduuqa la diiday wuxuu noqdaa mid qoto-dheer oo jarran. Mar kale guji si aad u soo celiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhaqaaji xiriiqa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsbarbardhig\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E (50% ilaa 95%, wuxuuna bilaabmaa 75%). Heer sare waxay muujinaysaa kuwa dhow oly; heer hoose waxay muujinaysaa kuwa ka dhaqsaneysa. Xiriiqu waxa uu kaliya shaandheeyaa waxa la helay; ma raadiso mar kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHorey loo tiriyay\u003C/strong\u003E: isbarbardhigyada meel ku yaal calaamad tiro oo horey u jirtay oo ka mid ah shaygan, waxay bilaabmaan la diiday, si aanad wax labo jeer ugu tirin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXaashiyo kale\u003C/strong\u003E: markaad raadiso dhammaan xaashiyada furan, u gudub xaashiyada adigoo isticmaalaya liiska xaashiyada ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, oo dib u eeg mid kasta. Koobvaanku wuxuu sheegayaa xaashiyada ay ku yaalliin isbarbardhigyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar\"\u003EKu dar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar\u003C/span\u003E. Badhanku wuxuu sheegayaa inta uu yahay, tusaale &quot;Ku dar 19 calaamadood&quot;. Calaamadaha tirinta waxaa lagu daraa bartamaha sanduuq kasta oo la aqbalay: &quot;Waxaa lagu daray 19 calaamadood tiro oo &quot;Duplex receptacle&quot;. Ctrl+Z ayaa dhammaantood tirtira.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxdan oo dhan waa hal tallaabo oo dib u celin ah, sidaas darteed hal \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa tirtira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u tuurto dib u eegista adigoon wax ku darin, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETuur\u003C/span\u003E ama taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Marka qalab kale la doorto ayaa sidoo kale tuurta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-uu-helo-iyo-waxa-uu-seego\"\u003EWaxa uu helo iyo waxa uu seego\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffCraft wuxuu barbardhigaa naqshadda, sida pikseelada, calaamadda aad sanduuqeysay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWuxuu helaa calaamadda oo la rogay 0°, 90°, 180° iyo 270°. Calaamee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXagasha kasta (way gaabisaa)\u003C/span\u003E xariiqda tirinta ka hor intaadan jiidin sanduuqa si aad uga helo xagasha kasta. Wuxuu isku dayaa 15° kasta, kadibna mid kasta wuxuu hagaajiyaa ilaa degree iyo badh. Taasi waxay qaadataa qiyaastii lix jeer wakhti dheer. Ma heleyso calaamad lagu muraayad-sawiray (mooyaane haddii calaamaddu isku mid tahay marka la muraayadeeyo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaadi dhammaan xaashiyada furan\u003C/span\u003E la calaameeyo, xaashi miisaan kale leh waxaa lagu raadiyaa cabbirka ay calaamaddu ku leedahay halkaas: qalab la qiyaasay miisaanka 1/8&quot; qorshe ayaa ah nus cabbirkiisa 1/4&quot; qorshe, weli wuu helaa. Xaashidaas waxa kale oo lagu raadiyaa cabbirka sanduuqa u gaar ah, tusaale tagyada iyo calaamadaha lagu daabacay hal cabbir xaashi kasta. Tani waxay u baahan tahay miisaan labada xaashi; xaashi aan miisaan lahayn waxaa lagu raadiyaa cabbirka sanduuqa oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamado aad isu eg ayaa isku mid noqon kara: tusaale, qabka laba-jeer iyo afar-jeer, ama laba tag oo kala duwan hal xaraf. Kor u qaad xiriiqa ilaa kuwa saxda ah ay ku hadhaan, oo gacanta ka diid kuwa kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamad ay khadadku, qalinkeedu ama qoraalku gudbayaan waxay helaa dhibco hoose oo waxay u baahan tahay dejin xiriiq oo hoose.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESanduuqyada aad u yar waa la diidaa: &quot;Sanduuqaasi aad buu u yar yahay. Ku jiid calaamadda oo dhan.&quot; Sanduuq madhan sidoo kale waa la diidaa: &quot;Sanduuqaasi aad buu madhan yahay. Ku jiid calaamad.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXaashi aad u weyn oo cabbirkeeda loo baahan yahay calaamaddan ayaa la dhaafaa, koobvaanku wuxuu leeyahay &quot;1 xaashi aad bay u weyn tahay si loo raadiyo calaamaddan.&quot; Sanduuq calaamad weyn ku jiid, ama xaashidaas gacanta ku tiri.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii waxba la helin, xariiqa xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Ma jiro isbarbardhig. Hoos u dhig xiriiqa isbarbardhiga, ama calaamadda si adag u sanduuqee.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xawaaraha-iyo-browser-yada\"\u003EXawaaraha iyo browser-yada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERaadintu waxay ku socotaa shaqaale asal ah, sidaas darteed bogga ayaa weli jawaabaya oo waad joojin kartaa wakhti kasta. Xaashi kastaa marka hore waxaa lagu sawiraa cabbirka shaqada bogga kor, taas oo sababi karta in xaashi aad u weyn ay wakhti yar joogsato. Waxay ku shaqeysaa Chrome, Edge, Firefox iyo Safari ee casriga ah. Xaashiyo badan raadintu way qaadataa wakhti dheer; xariiqda horumarka ayaa u dhaqaaqda xaashi xaashi. Khadka ka baxsan, tirinta otomaatiga waxay shaqeysaa marka xariiqda app-ka ay muujinayso \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E ayaa sidoo kale hayn shaqaalaha. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EShaqada khadka ka baxsan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Tirin otomaatig ah wuxuu helaa nuqul kasta oo calaamad ah ka dib markaad saadiso mid. Kadibna waxaad dib u eegtaa isbarbardhigyada xaashida, oo waxaad ku dartaa kuwa aad aqbasho inay yihiin calaamado tiro ah. Waa caawiye, ma aha wax hubaal ah: had iyo jeer dib u eeg ka hor intaadan ku darin. Hel calaamadaha Samee ama guji shay tiro ah oo ku hoos yaal Walxaha. Fur xaash ay calaamaddu ku muuqato. Dooro Tirin otomaatig ah qalabka sare, ama taabo S. Xariiq ayaa ka soo muuqda sare xaashida: \"Jiid sanduuq hal calaamad oo ku jirta xaashidan.\" Si aad u raadiso dhammaan xaashiyada furan, mitabka ma aha xaashidan oo keliya, calaamee Raadi dhammaan xaashiyada furan. Ku dhow wax ka ogow si calaamaddu u fiicnaato, kadibna jiid sanduuq dhow mid ka mid ah nuqulkeeda. Ku dar calaamadda oo dhan; waraaqda madhan ee ku wareegsan waa la jaraa. Xariiqdu waxay muujinaysaa \"Raadinaya…\" oo leh xariiq horumar iyo badhanka Jooji. Bogga ayaa weli jawaabaya: waad weynayn kartaa, wareegi kartaa, oo waad u dhaqaaqi kartaa xaashiyada kale. Qalab kale oo aad doorato, ama Esc, ayaa joojiya raadinta. Marka ay dhammaysato, isbarbardhigyada ayaa xaashida ku muuqda sida sanduuqyo midabka shayga leh, xariiqduna waxay muujinaysaa koobvaan sida \"22 isbarbardhig, 19 la ku daro (3 horey loo tiriyay). Guji sanduuq si aad u diido ama u soo celiso.\" Ku jira Tirin otomaatig ah, jiidista xaashida waxay samaysaa sanduuq halkii ay ka guuri lahayd. Si aad u guurto, hay Space oo jiid, ama jiid badhanka dhexe. Dib u eeg isbarbardhigyada Guji sanduuq si aad u diido. Sanduuqa la diiday wuxuu noqdaa mid qoto-dheer oo jarran. Mar kale guji si aad u soo celiso. Dhaqaaji xiriiqa Isbarbardhig (50% ilaa 95%, wuxuuna bilaabmaa 75%). Heer sare waxay muujinaysaa kuwa dhow oly; heer hoose waxay muujinaysaa kuwa ka dhaqsaneysa. Xiriiqu waxa uu kaliya shaandheeyaa waxa la helay; ma raadiso mar kale. Horey loo tiriyay: isbarbardhigyada meel ku yaal calaamad tiro oo horey u jirtay oo ka mid ah shaygan, waxay bilaabmaan la diiday, si aanad wax labo jeer ugu tirin. Xaashiyo kale: markaad raadiso dhammaan xaashiyada furan, u gudub xaashiyada adigoo isticmaalaya liiska xaashiyada ama Page Down, oo dib u eeg mid kasta. Koobvaanku wuxuu sheegayaa xaashiyada ay ku yaalliin isbarbardhigyo. Ku dar Dooro Ku dar. Badhanku wuxuu sheegayaa inta uu yahay, tusaale \"Ku dar 19 calaamadood\". Calaamadaha tirinta waxaa lagu daraa bartamaha sanduuq kasta oo la aqbalay: \"Waxaa lagu daray 19 calaamadood tiro oo \"Duplex receptacle\". Ctrl+Z ayaa dhammaantood tirtira.\" Kooxdan oo dhan waa hal tallaabo oo dib u celin ah, sidaas darteed hal Ctrl+Z ayaa tirtira. Si aad u tuurto dib u eegista adigoon wax ku darin, dooro Tuur ama taabo Esc. Marka qalab kale la doorto ayaa sidoo kale tuurta. Waxa uu helo iyo waxa uu seego TakeoffCraft wuxuu barbardhigaa naqshadda, sida pikseelada, calaamadda aad sanduuqeysay. Wuxuu helaa calaamadda oo la rogay 0°, 90°, 180° iyo 270°. Calaamee Xagasha kasta (way gaabisaa) xariiqda tirinta ka hor intaadan jiidin sanduuqa si aad uga helo xagasha kasta. Wuxuu isku dayaa 15° kasta, kadibna mid kasta wuxuu hagaajiyaa ilaa degree iyo badh. Taasi waxay qaadataa qiyaastii lix jeer wakhti dheer. Ma heleyso calaamad lagu muraayad-sawiray (mooyaane haddii calaamaddu isku mid tahay marka la muraayadeeyo). Marka Raadi dhammaan xaashiyada furan la calaameeyo, xaashi miisaan kale leh waxaa lagu raadiyaa cabbirka ay calaamaddu ku leedahay halkaas: qalab la qiyaasay miisaanka 1/8\" qorshe ayaa ah nus cabbirkiisa 1/4\" qorshe, weli wuu helaa. Xaashidaas waxa kale oo lagu raadiyaa cabbirka sanduuqa u gaar ah, tusaale tagyada iyo calaamadaha lagu daabacay hal cabbir xaashi kasta. Tani waxay u baahan tahay miisaan labada xaashi; xaashi aan miisaan lahayn waxaa lagu raadiyaa cabbirka sanduuqa oo keliya. Calaamado aad isu eg ayaa isku mid noqon kara: tusaale, qabka laba-jeer iyo afar-jeer, ama laba tag oo kala duwan hal xaraf. Kor u qaad xiriiqa ilaa kuwa saxda ah ay ku hadhaan, oo gacanta ka diid kuwa kale. Calaamad ay khadadku, qalinkeedu ama qoraalku gudbayaan waxay helaa dhibco hoose oo waxay u baahan tahay dejin xiriiq oo hoose. Sanduuqyada aad u yar waa la diidaa: \"Sanduuqaasi aad buu u yar yahay. Ku jiid calaamadda oo dhan.\" Sanduuq madhan sidoo kale waa la diidaa: \"Sanduuqaasi aad buu madhan yahay. Ku jiid calaamad.\" Xaashi aad u weyn oo cabbirkeeda loo baahan yahay calaamaddan ayaa la dhaafaa, koobvaanku wuxuu leeyahay \"1 xaashi aad bay u weyn tahay si loo raadiyo calaamaddan.\" Sanduuq calaamad weyn ku jiid, ama xaashidaas gacanta ku tiri. Haddii waxba la helin, xariiqa xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"Ma jiro isbarbardhig. Hoos u dhig xiriiqa isbarbardhiga, ama calaamadda si adag u sanduuqee.\" Xawaaraha iyo browser-yada Raadintu waxay ku socotaa shaqaale asal ah, sidaas darteed bogga ayaa weli jawaabaya oo waad joojin kartaa wakhti kasta. Xaashi kastaa marka hore waxaa lagu sawiraa cabbirka shaqada bogga kor, taas oo sababi karta in xaashi aad u weyn ay wakhti yar joogsato. Waxay ku shaqeysaa Chrome, Edge, Firefox iyo Safari ee casriga ah. Xaashiyo badan raadintu way qaadataa wakhti dheer; xariiqda horumarka ayaa u dhaqaaqda xaashi xaashi. Khadka ka baxsan, tirinta otomaatiga waxay shaqeysaa marka xariiqda app-ka ay muujinayso Khadka ka baxsan diyaar: Kaydi khadka ka baxsan ayaa sidoo kale hayn shaqaalaha. Eeg Shaqada khadka ka baxsan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"count-everything","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Tiri dhammaan set-ka","summary":"Sanduuq hal jadwal astaamaha mar, TakeoffCraft wuxuu tirinayaa astaamo kasta oo ku jira xaashi kasta oo furan hal orod. Tiro kasta waa xiriir ilaa xaashigeeda, waxaana dib u eegtaa kahor intaan wax lagu darin.","section":"tasks","order":71,"keywords":["tiri dhammaan","jadwal","jadwalka astaamaha","set-ka oo dhan","xaashi kasta","dhammaan xaashiyada","dhammaan albaabbada","dhammaan qalabka","aaladaha","astaamaha","tirin otomaatig ah","tiri dhammaan","set-ka qorshaha","200 xaashi","heerka isku mid","isku eeg"],"headings":[{"id":"tiri-jadwal","text":"Tiri jadwal","level":2},{"id":"dib-u-eeg-tirooyinka","text":"Dib u eeg tirooyinka","level":2},{"id":"ku-dar","text":"Ku dar","level":2},{"id":"caawiyayaasha","text":"Caawiyayaasha","level":2},{"id":"astaamo-xagal-kasta","text":"Astaamo xagal kasta","level":2},{"id":"waxyaabaha-lagu-faa-iidaysto","text":"Waxyaabaha lagu faa'iidaysto","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiri wax kasta\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhriyaa jadwal astaamaha, kadibna wuxuu tirinayaa astaamo kasta oo xaashi kasta oo furan ku jira. Waa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/span\u003E jadwal oo dhan mar. Waa isku-dhigga astaamaha xaashiyadaada oo keliya, ma aha moodel la tababbaray, waxna kombiyuutarkaaga kama baxo. Dib u eeg tirooyinka ka hor intaadan ku darin: waa caawiye, ma aha dammaanad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tiri-jadwal\"\u003ETiri jadwal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur qorshayaasha. Jadwal xaashi kasta ha ku jiro ayaa wanaagsan: astaamaha oo magacyadooda ku dhinac.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiri wax kasta\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid sanduuq ku wareegsan jadwalka: astaamaha, sawirada iyo magacyada. Cinwaan aan astaan ku dhinac lahayn (SYMBOL LEGEND) ayaa keligiis laga reebayaa. Daaqaddu waxay liisaa astaamaha, sawirkooda iyo magaca ku qoran ee dhinaca. Magaca waxa uu noqonayaa magaca walaxda, markaa halkan dib u magacee haddii aad jeclaatid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa saar astaamaha aadan doonayn in la tiriyo. Astaan aan la baari karin (yar ama bannaan) ayaa sababta sheegaysaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiri N xaashi\u003C/span\u003E. Bar ayaa muujinaya xaashiga la baarayo; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu joojiyaa orodka. Bogga wuu sii shaqeeyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAstaamaha jadwalka lafteedu xaashigooda kama tirinayaan. Xaashi lagu cabbiray miisaan kale waxa lagu baaraa miisaankaas, astaamaha waxa la helaa iyagoo la rogay xagal toosan kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-eeg-tirooyinka\"\u003EDib u eeg tirooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAstaan kasta wuxuu muujinayaa wadarteeda, hoosteedana xiriir xaashi kasta leh (&quot;E-103: 4&quot;). Riix mid si aad ugu tagto xaashigaas. Helidyada waxa lagu sanduuqeeyaa midabka walaxda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERiix sanduuq\u003C/strong\u003E si aad helidaas uga saarto. Waxay noqotaa mid jajaban oo jarnaan lagu sameeyay; mar kale riix si aad u soo celiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhaqaajin heerka isku mid\u003C/strong\u003E (50% ilaa 100%, oo bilaabmaya heerkaaga Dejinta). Kor u kac wuxuu hayaa oo keliya isku mid dhow. Qayb-kiisha waxay sifeysaa oo keliya waxa la helay; wax dib looma baarayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELaba astaan oo isu eeg (duplex iyo quad) isku barta ayaa ku dhici kara. Isku mid ee ugu fiican ayaa qaadanaya, daaqaddu waxay sheegaysaa intee meelood oo ay taasi ku dhacday, si aad u hubiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXaashi weyn oo aan lagu baari karin cabbirka astaanta waa la dhaafaa, daaqaddu waa sheegtaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar\"\u003EKu dar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar N calaamadood\u003C/span\u003E. Astaan kasta wuxuu noqdaa walax tiro ah oo leh calaamad helid kasta. Magac hore u ah walax tiro oo aad leedahay ayaa dib loo isticmaalaa (waxba laba jeer ma la sameeyo halkii aad hore gacanta ku calaamadisay). Orodka oo dhan waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu dhammaan walaxda iyo calaamadaha dib ugu celiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa aad aqbashay waxa sidoo kale lagu kaydiyaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaxa la baray\u003C/span\u003E: astaamaha waa la xasuustaa faylka xisaabinta qadarka xilliga soo socda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"caawiyayaasha\"\u003ECaawiyayaasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad oggolaatay caawiyayaasha Dejinta, way akhriyi karaan jadwal (legend_open), orod tiro gadaal ku socda (legend_count_start, kadibna legend_count_status), akhriyi tirooyinka (legend_count_result) iyo ku dar (legend_count_add, kaas oo marka hore horumar ku muujin kara waxa ku dari lahaa). Waa isla orodka aad daaqadda ku aragto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"astaamo-xagal-kasta\"\u003EAstaamo xagal kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAstaamaha xagal kasta\u003C/span\u003E ka hor tirinta si aad u hesho astaamaha laga sawiray xagal aan ahayn xagal toosan (plug-ka wadnaha dhibcaha, qalab la rogay si uu u raaco saqafka). Raadintu markaas wuxuu leexiyaa astaamaha 15 digrii kasta; astaan wareeg ah weli hal raadin ayuu u baahan yahay, astaan aan wareeg ahayn ilaa lix jeer ayuu qaadan karaa. Ka dhig fiko xaashiyada toosan loo sawiray.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxyaabaha-lagu-faa-iidaysto\"\u003EWaxyaabaha lagu faa&#039;iidaysto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxay u baahan tahay astaamo lagu sawiray si la mid ah jadwalka. Jadwal la sawiray cabbir ka duwan xaashiyada waa fiican marka miisaanka xaashiyada la dejiyo; haddii aan miisaan lahayn, astaamaha waxa loo baaraa cabbirka jadwalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAstaan darbi ama khad dheer oo toos uga gudba ayaa la lumin karaa, sababtoo ah waxay ka dhigan tahay sawirka jadwalka. Hubi helidyada xaashiga koowaad ka hor intaadan aaminin kuwa kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EScan aan qoraal lahayn weli waa shaqeeyaa: astaamaha waxa la helaa safafkooda, magacyada adiga ayaad qortaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Tiri wax kasta wuxuu akhriyaa jadwal astaamaha, kadibna wuxuu tirinayaa astaamo kasta oo xaashi kasta oo furan ku jira. Waa Tirin otomaatig ah jadwal oo dhan mar. Waa isku-dhigga astaamaha xaashiyadaada oo keliya, ma aha moodel la tababbaray, waxna kombiyuutarkaaga kama baxo. Dib u eeg tirooyinka ka hor intaadan ku darin: waa caawiye, ma aha dammaanad. Tiri jadwal Fur qorshayaasha. Jadwal xaashi kasta ha ku jiro ayaa wanaagsan: astaamaha oo magacyadooda ku dhinac. Dooro Tiri wax kasta qalabka sare. Jiid sanduuq ku wareegsan jadwalka: astaamaha, sawirada iyo magacyada. Cinwaan aan astaan ku dhinac lahayn (SYMBOL LEGEND) ayaa keligiis laga reebayaa. Daaqaddu waxay liisaa astaamaha, sawirkooda iyo magaca ku qoran ee dhinaca. Magaca waxa uu noqonayaa magaca walaxda, markaa halkan dib u magacee haddii aad jeclaatid. Ka saar astaamaha aadan doonayn in la tiriyo. Astaan aan la baari karin (yar ama bannaan) ayaa sababta sheegaysaa. Dooro Tiri N xaashi. Bar ayaa muujinaya xaashiga la baarayo; Jooji wuxuu joojiyaa orodka. Bogga wuu sii shaqeeyaa. Astaamaha jadwalka lafteedu xaashigooda kama tirinayaan. Xaashi lagu cabbiray miisaan kale waxa lagu baaraa miisaankaas, astaamaha waxa la helaa iyagoo la rogay xagal toosan kasta. Dib u eeg tirooyinka Astaan kasta wuxuu muujinayaa wadarteeda, hoosteedana xiriir xaashi kasta leh (\"E-103: 4\"). Riix mid si aad ugu tagto xaashigaas. Helidyada waxa lagu sanduuqeeyaa midabka walaxda. Riix sanduuq si aad helidaas uga saarto. Waxay noqotaa mid jajaban oo jarnaan lagu sameeyay; mar kale riix si aad u soo celiso. Dhaqaajin heerka isku mid (50% ilaa 100%, oo bilaabmaya heerkaaga Dejinta). Kor u kac wuxuu hayaa oo keliya isku mid dhow. Qayb-kiisha waxay sifeysaa oo keliya waxa la helay; wax dib looma baarayo. Laba astaan oo isu eeg (duplex iyo quad) isku barta ayaa ku dhici kara. Isku mid ee ugu fiican ayaa qaadanaya, daaqaddu waxay sheegaysaa intee meelood oo ay taasi ku dhacday, si aad u hubiso. Xaashi weyn oo aan lagu baari karin cabbirka astaanta waa la dhaafaa, daaqaddu waa sheegtaa. Ku dar Dooro Ku dar N calaamadood. Astaan kasta wuxuu noqdaa walax tiro ah oo leh calaamad helid kasta. Magac hore u ah walax tiro oo aad leedahay ayaa dib loo isticmaalaa (waxba laba jeer ma la sameeyo halkii aad hore gacanta ku calaamadisay). Orodka oo dhan waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z wuxuu dhammaan walaxda iyo calaamadaha dib ugu celiyaa. Waxa aad aqbashay waxa sidoo kale lagu kaydiyaa Waxa la baray: astaamaha waa la xasuustaa faylka xisaabinta qadarka xilliga soo socda. Caawiyayaasha Haddii aad oggolaatay caawiyayaasha Dejinta, way akhriyi karaan jadwal (legend_open), orod tiro gadaal ku socda (legend_count_start, kadibna legend_count_status), akhriyi tirooyinka (legend_count_result) iyo ku dar (legend_count_add, kaas oo marka hore horumar ku muujin kara waxa ku dari lahaa). Waa isla orodka aad daaqadda ku aragto. Astaamo xagal kasta Calaamee Astaamaha xagal kasta ka hor tirinta si aad u hesho astaamaha laga sawiray xagal aan ahayn xagal toosan (plug-ka wadnaha dhibcaha, qalab la rogay si uu u raaco saqafka). Raadintu markaas wuxuu leexiyaa astaamaha 15 digrii kasta; astaan wareeg ah weli hal raadin ayuu u baahan yahay, astaan aan wareeg ahayn ilaa lix jeer ayuu qaadan karaa. Ka dhig fiko xaashiyada toosan loo sawiray. Waxyaabaha lagu faa'iidaysto Waxay u baahan tahay astaamo lagu sawiray si la mid ah jadwalka. Jadwal la sawiray cabbir ka duwan xaashiyada waa fiican marka miisaanka xaashiyada la dejiyo; haddii aan miisaan lahayn, astaamaha waxa loo baaraa cabbirka jadwalka. Astaan darbi ama khad dheer oo toos uga gudba ayaa la lumin karaa, sababtoo ah waxay ka dhigan tahay sawirka jadwalka. Hubi helidyada xaashiga koowaad ka hor intaadan aaminin kuwa kale. Scan aan qoraal lahayn weli waa shaqeeyaa: astaamaha waxa la helaa safafkooda, magacyada adiga ayaad qortaa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"count-from-a-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Tiri laga bilaabo naqshadda","summary":"Tiri bloogyada, walxaha lakab kasta, ama qoraal si toos ah DWG ama DXF: sax ah, bloogyada dhex-jiray, kala duwanaanshaha bloogyada dynamic iyo kooxaha array lagu maamulo, hal tallaabo oo ka noqod.","section":"tasks","order":71,"keywords":["tiri laga bilaabo naqshadda","tirinta CAD","tirinta bloogyada","tiri bloogyada","insert","magaca bloogga","bloogyada dhex-jiray","bloog dynamic","kala duwanaansho","minsert","array","lakab","nooca entity","goobo","qoraal","sifo","tag","lakabyada qarsoon","tiro sax ah","sida loo sameeyo","albaabbo","qalabka iftiinka"],"headings":[{"id":"tiri-bloog","text":"Tiri bloog","level":2},{"id":"waxa-tirinaya","text":"Waxa tirinaya","level":3},{"id":"waxa-aan-tirinin","text":"Waxa aan tirinin","level":3},{"id":"xaashiga-muujinaya-ama-naqshadda-oo-dhan","text":"Xaashiga muujinaya, ama naqshadda oo dhan","level":2},{"id":"tiri-mar-kale","text":"Tiri mar kale","level":2},{"id":"lakab-iyo-nooc-ahaan","text":"Lakab iyo nooc ahaan","level":2},{"id":"qoraal-ahaan","text":"Qoraal ahaan","level":2},{"id":"marka-loo-isticmaalo-tirinta-otomaatig-ah","text":"Marka loo isticmaalo Tirinta otomaatig ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirinta CAD\u003C/span\u003E bar xaashiga (amarka \u003Cstrong\u003ETiri laga bilaabo naqshadda\u003C/strong\u003E qaababka menyuu kale) wuxuu tiriyaa waxa DWG ama DXF uu sheegayo inuu jiro. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu raadiyaa sawir astaan ah oo mararka qaarkood mid luntiyo ama mid been ah helo; tanina waxay tirisaa walxaha: insert kasta oo bloog magaciisu yahay \u003Ccode\u003EDOOR-36\u003C/code\u003E waa hal albaab. Marka hore fur naqshadda: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\"\u003EFur DWG ama DXF naqshad\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tiri-bloog\"\u003ETiri bloog\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur xaashi naqshadda ah. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirinta CAD\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku yaal bar xaashiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix. Daaqaddu waxay liistaa bloogyada iyo inta mid kasta oo ay yihiin. Ku raadi magac, kadibna dooro mid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEeg khadka hoose ee liiska: &quot;22 la helay, 22 la darayo.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoos \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar\u003C/span\u003E, dooro walax tiro, ama ka tag \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiro cusub oo shay ah\u003C/span\u003E oo siiso magac.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix badhanka ku darista oo tirada ku magacaabaysa: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar 22 calaamadood\u003C/span\u003E. Calaamadaha waxay ku soo muuqdaan meelaha bloogga la geliyay, tirada walaxduna waa tirada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu qaadaa calaamadaha (iyo walax cusub) hal mar. Xisaabta, miiska xisaabinta iyo PDF-ka calaamadsan walaxda waxay u dhaqmaan sida walax tiro kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"waxa-tirinaya\"\u003EWaxa tirinaya\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInsert kasta oo magaca bloogga ah\u003C/strong\u003E, cabbirkiisa iyo xagalkiisa ha ahaado, qaybta moodelka ama qaybta layout-ka. Magacyada bloogyada xaraf weyn-yar ma kala saaraan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKooxaha bloogyada\u003C/strong\u003E (MINSERT): nuqul kasta oo kooxda ku jira waa hal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBloogyada dhex-jiray.\u003C/strong\u003E Bloog lagu dhigay bloog kale waa la tiriyaa heer kasta. Liiska wuxuu leeyahay &quot;6 gudaha bloogyada kale&quot;; ka saar calaamadda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBloogyada gudaha bloogyada kale sidoo kale tiri\u003C/span\u003E si aad u tirto oo keliya insert-yada si toos ah loogu dhigay naqshadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBloogyada dynamic.\u003C/strong\u003E Bloog dynamic wuxuu tiriyaa magiciisa, ma aha nuqullada aan magac lahayn (\u003Ccode\u003E*U12\u003C/code\u003E) ee faylku hayo. Gobollada ka madhan ayaa lagu liistaa (&quot;Single 12, Double 4&quot;): dooro gobol si aad u tirto oo keliya kuwaas, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhammaan noocyada\u003C/span\u003E. Marka faylku uusan sheegin gobolka nuqulka tusaya, waxay la liistaa &quot;(gobolka lama og)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShaandhaynta lakabka.\u003C/strong\u003E Bloog dhowr lakab ku jira: dooro mid hoos \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELakabka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"waxa-aan-tirinin\"\u003EWaxa aan tirinin\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELakabyada qarsoon.\u003C/strong\u003E Walax lakab damay ama qabsaday faylka (ama aad ka qarisay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELakabyada\u003C/span\u003E) waa la reebaa, khadku wuxuu sheegaa inta ay tahay: &quot;3 lakab qarsoon oo laga reebay&quot;. Calaamadee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiri iyana\u003C/span\u003E si aad u ku darto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshado xidhan oo aan la furin\u003C/strong\u003E waa la reebaa; daaqaddu waa sheegtaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWalxaha si sax ah isku dul saaran walax kale oo isku nooc ah\u003C/strong\u003E waxa loo tiriyaa laba (waa laba walax); daaqaddu waa sheegtaa. Badanaa waa khalad naqshadeed oo u baahan fiiro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaashiga-muujinaya-ama-naqshadda-oo-dhan\"\u003EXaashiga muujinaya, ama naqshadda oo dhan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxa xaashigan muujinaya\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu tiriyaa walaxda xaashigu muujiyo: layout-ka, walxaha moodelka ee gudaha viewport-yadiisa (lakab damay viewport-ka halkaas lama tirinayo) iyo walaxda layout-ka laftiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadda oo dhan, walax kasta mar\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu tiriyaa model space mar, calaamadaha xaashiga Model, mana tirinayo waxa dhowr layout ay mar kale muujiyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETirinta waxa layout-ku muujinayo iyo tirinta waxa Model muujinayo waxay siiyaan tiro isku mid walaxda isku mid ah; ha ku darin labadaba hal walax.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tiri-mar-kale\"\u003ETiri mar kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETirinta bloog isku mid ah isla walax ku jirta waxay ku daraa oo keliya waxa cusub: &quot;22 horay loo tiriyay.&quot; Calaamad kasta waxay matalaysaa hal walax.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lakab-iyo-nooc-ahaan\"\u003ELakab iyo nooc ahaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELakab iyo nooc ahaan\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro lakab iyo nooc walax (goobo, polyline, hatch…): &quot;dhammaan goobaha E-LITE&quot;. Calaamee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShayaadka gudaha bloogyada sidoo kale tiri\u003C/span\u003E si aad u ku darto kuwa ku jira qeexidda bloogga, meel kasta oo bloogga lagu geliyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qoraal-ahaan\"\u003EQoraal ahaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoraal ahaan\u003C/span\u003E ku qor qoraalka, sida \u003Ccode\u003EA3\u003C/code\u003E, oo sheeg inuu yahay sidaas oo kale, ku jiro, ama eray dhamaystiran. Walxaha qoraalka, qoraalka multileader iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eqiimaha sifada bloogga\u003C/strong\u003E oo dhan waa la tiriyaa (sifada tag \u003Ccode\u003EITEM = A3\u003C/code\u003E waa la helaa); dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifada ku jirta\u003C/span\u003E si aad u tirto hal sifo oo keliya. Qoraallada ugu badan waa la liistaa si loo riixo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-loo-isticmaalo-tirinta-otomaatig-ah\"\u003EMarka loo isticmaalo Tirinta otomaatig ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/span\u003E PDF-yada iyo astaamaha naqshadda ee aan bloog ahayn (la sawiray xor ah, ama la furay). Haddii loo sawiray bloog, halkan ku tiri.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Tirinta CAD bar xaashiga (amarka Tiri laga bilaabo naqshadda qaababka menyuu kale) wuxuu tiriyaa waxa DWG ama DXF uu sheegayo inuu jiro. Tirin otomaatig ah wuxuu raadiyaa sawir astaan ah oo mararka qaarkood mid luntiyo ama mid been ah helo; tanina waxay tirisaa walxaha: insert kasta oo bloog magaciisu yahay DOOR-36 waa hal albaab. Marka hore fur naqshadda: Fur DWG ama DXF naqshad. Tiri bloog Fur xaashi naqshadda ah. Tirinta CAD wuxuu ku yaal bar xaashiga. Riix. Daaqaddu waxay liistaa bloogyada iyo inta mid kasta oo ay yihiin. Ku raadi magac, kadibna dooro mid. Eeg khadka hoose ee liiska: \"22 la helay, 22 la darayo.\" Hoos Ku dar, dooro walax tiro, ama ka tag Tiro cusub oo shay ah oo siiso magac. Riix badhanka ku darista oo tirada ku magacaabaysa: Ku dar 22 calaamadood. Calaamadaha waxay ku soo muuqdaan meelaha bloogga la geliyay, tirada walaxduna waa tirada. Waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod: Ctrl+Z wuxuu qaadaa calaamadaha (iyo walax cusub) hal mar. Xisaabta, miiska xisaabinta iyo PDF-ka calaamadsan walaxda waxay u dhaqmaan sida walax tiro kale. Waxa tirinaya Insert kasta oo magaca bloogga ah, cabbirkiisa iyo xagalkiisa ha ahaado, qaybta moodelka ama qaybta layout-ka. Magacyada bloogyada xaraf weyn-yar ma kala saaraan. Kooxaha bloogyada (MINSERT): nuqul kasta oo kooxda ku jira waa hal. Bloogyada dhex-jiray. Bloog lagu dhigay bloog kale waa la tiriyaa heer kasta. Liiska wuxuu leeyahay \"6 gudaha bloogyada kale\"; ka saar calaamadda Bloogyada gudaha bloogyada kale sidoo kale tiri si aad u tirto oo keliya insert-yada si toos ah loogu dhigay naqshadda. Bloogyada dynamic. Bloog dynamic wuxuu tiriyaa magiciisa, ma aha nuqullada aan magac lahayn (*U12) ee faylku hayo. Gobollada ka madhan ayaa lagu liistaa (\"Single 12, Double 4\"): dooro gobol si aad u tirto oo keliya kuwaas, ama Dhammaan noocyada. Marka faylku uusan sheegin gobolka nuqulka tusaya, waxay la liistaa \"(gobolka lama og)\". Shaandhaynta lakabka. Bloog dhowr lakab ku jira: dooro mid hoos Lakabka. Waxa aan tirinin Lakabyada qarsoon. Walax lakab damay ama qabsaday faylka (ama aad ka qarisay Lakabyada) waa la reebaa, khadku wuxuu sheegaa inta ay tahay: \"3 lakab qarsoon oo laga reebay\". Calaamadee Tiri iyana si aad u ku darto. Naqshado xidhan oo aan la furin waa la reebaa; daaqaddu waa sheegtaa. Walxaha si sax ah isku dul saaran walax kale oo isku nooc ah waxa loo tiriyaa laba (waa laba walax); daaqaddu waa sheegtaa. Badanaa waa khalad naqshadeed oo u baahan fiiro. Xaashiga muujinaya, ama naqshadda oo dhan Waxa xaashigan muujinaya wuxuu tiriyaa walaxda xaashigu muujiyo: layout-ka, walxaha moodelka ee gudaha viewport-yadiisa (lakab damay viewport-ka halkaas lama tirinayo) iyo walaxda layout-ka laftiisa. Naqshadda oo dhan, walax kasta mar wuxuu tiriyaa model space mar, calaamadaha xaashiga Model, mana tirinayo waxa dhowr layout ay mar kale muujiyaan. Tirinta waxa layout-ku muujinayo iyo tirinta waxa Model muujinayo waxay siiyaan tiro isku mid walaxda isku mid ah; ha ku darin labadaba hal walax. Tiri mar kale Tirinta bloog isku mid ah isla walax ku jirta waxay ku daraa oo keliya waxa cusub: \"22 horay loo tiriyay.\" Calaamad kasta waxay matalaysaa hal walax. Lakab iyo nooc ahaan Dooro Lakab iyo nooc ahaan oo dooro lakab iyo nooc walax (goobo, polyline, hatch…): \"dhammaan goobaha E-LITE\". Calaamee Shayaadka gudaha bloogyada sidoo kale tiri si aad u ku darto kuwa ku jira qeexidda bloogga, meel kasta oo bloogga lagu geliyay. Qoraal ahaan Dooro Qoraal ahaan ku qor qoraalka, sida A3, oo sheeg inuu yahay sidaas oo kale, ku jiro, ama eray dhamaystiran. Walxaha qoraalka, qoraalka multileader iyo qiimaha sifada bloogga oo dhan waa la tiriyaa (sifada tag ITEM = A3 waa la helaa); dooro Sifada ku jirta si aad u tirto hal sifo oo keliya. Qoraallada ugu badan waa la liistaa si loo riixo. Marka loo isticmaalo Tirinta otomaatig ah Isticmaal Tirin otomaatig ah PDF-yada iyo astaamaha naqshadda ee aan bloog ahayn (la sawiray xor ah, ama la furay). Haddii loo sawiray bloog, halkan ku tiri.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"what-it-learned","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Waxa uu ka baray tirintaada","summary":"TakeoffCraft wuxuu xasuustaa calaamadaha aad ku xaqiijisay Tirin otomaatig ah, koox-shuruudaha, isku-dhisyada aad inta badan isticmaasho iyo qaababka aad bog kasta ku celiso, dhammaan gudaha faylka xisaabintan. Ka eeg, isticmaal, tirtir.","section":"tasks","order":72,"keywords":["baro","waxa la baray","barasho","kaaliye","xusuus","astaamo","qaabab","isla sida shaqadii ugu dambaysay","shaqadii ugu dambaysay","koox-shuruudo","shuruudo","dib u isticmaal","isku-dhisyo","inta badan la isticmaalo","soo jeedin","ku celi bog kasta","bog kasta","qoraalka cinwaanka","qaab","ka saar dhammaan","illow","asturnaan"],"headings":[{"id":"calaamadaha","text":"Calaamadaha","level":2},{"id":"koox-shuruudaha","text":"Koox-shuruudaha","level":2},{"id":"isla-sida-shaqadii-ugu-dambaysay","text":"Isla sida shaqadii ugu dambaysay","level":2},{"id":"isku-dhisyada-aad-inta-badan-isticmaasho","text":"Isku-dhisyada aad inta badan isticmaasho","level":2},{"id":"ku-celi-bog-kasta","text":"Ku celi bog kasta","level":2},{"id":"eeg-tirtir","text":"Eeg, tirtir","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaan","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaan","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffCraft wuu degdegaa marka aad xisaabinta badan ku samayso. Wuxuu \u003Cstrong\u003Ekaliya\u003C/strong\u003E ka baraa waxa aad aqbasho:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ecalaamadaha aad ku xuddun-dahay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/a\u003E kadibna aad ku dartay,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ekoox-shuruudaha aad kaydiyo,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eisku-dhisyada aad isticmaasho (mar kasta shaqo),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eqaababka calaamadaha aad bog kasta ku celiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaa isbarbardhig fudud oo ku saleysan xaashiyadaada, oo ah isla raadinta Tirin otomaatig ah ku samayso. Ma aha moodel la tababaray. Wax kasta oo uu barto waxaa lagu hayaa \u003Cstrong\u003Efaylka xisaabintan\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E), wax meel ayaana looma dirayo. Si aad u qaaddo shaqada xigta, isticmaal \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/what-it-learned#same-as-last-job\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/what-it-learned\" data-hash=\"same-as-last-job\"\u003EIsla sida shaqadii ugu dambaysay\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaxa la baray\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare (laambadda iftiinka, ag dhow \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/span\u003E) si aad u aragto dhammaantood.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"calaamadaha\"\u003ECalaamadaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka aad ku xuddun-dahay calaamad \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/span\u003E oo aad dooratid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar\u003C/span\u003E, calaamadii aad xuddun-dahay waa la kaydiyaa, iyo heerka isbarbardhigga aad aqbashay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaxa la baray\u003C/span\u003E, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa hel xaashigan\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa hel xaashi kasta\u003C/span\u003E. Sawirka caadiga ah ee Tirin otomaatig ah ayaa furmaa: guji sanduuq si aad uga baxdo, dhaqaajri jiifka, ka dibna ku dar. Waxba lama darin ilaa aad sameyso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka aad furto xaashi aan weli leh calaamad baratay, buundo sare ayaa kugu soo jeedinaysa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHel …\u003C/span\u003E oo ku saabsan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHadda maya\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qarinayaa xaashigaas oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii xisaabintu aanay lahayn walax magacaas leh, ku darista calaamadaha waxa kaloo lagu daraa walax (hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar mar kale calaamadda walax isku mid ah waxay ku xisaabtaa tan ay horey u garanaysay; calaamad aan u eeganaynin waxay noqotaa mid labaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESida Tirin otomaatig ah, wuxuu helaa calaamadda xagal xagal ah iyo xaashiyada miisaan kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koox-shuruudaha\"\u003EKoox-shuruudaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoox wuxuu hayaa shuruudaha xisaabintan (walxaha, unit-yadooda, qiimaha, qashinka iyo isku-dhisyada), iyada oo aan calaamadaha la socon.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaxa la baray\u003C/span\u003E, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi shuruudaha tirintan sida koox…\u003C/span\u003E oo bixi magac. Koox leh magac isku mid ah ayaa la beddelaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXisaabinta leh kooxda, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu geliyaa shuruudaha aan weli lahayn. Shuruudaha leh magac iyo nooc isku mid ah way ka tagaan. Waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isla-sida-shaqadii-ugu-dambaysay\"\u003EIsla sida shaqadii ugu dambaysay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylka shaqadii ugu dambaysay wuxuu hayaa waxa uu baray. Si aad shaqo cusub uga bilowdo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur qorshayaasha cusub, ka dibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaxa la baray\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsla sida shaqadii ugu dambaysay…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E ee shaqadii ugu dambaysay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadi waxa aad keento: shuruudaheeda (kaliya kuwa xisaabintan aanay lahayn), iyo waxa uu baray (calaamadaha, kooxaha, isku-dhisyada, qaababka). Ka dib \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo geli\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShuruudaha shaqadaas waxaa sidoo kale lagu kaydiyaa koox magacooda shaqadaas. Calaamadaha iyo tirooyinka waxay ku sii jiraan faylkooda. Dhammaantood waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-dhisyada-aad-inta-badan-isticmaasho\"\u003EIsku-dhisyada aad inta badan isticmaasho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWalax leh isku-dhis waxa loo tiriyaa mar kasta shaqo oo keliya marka ay leedahay qadar oo aad keydiso xisaabinta. Shaqo waa qorshayaasha faylasha ay ka xisaabinayso, sidaas darteed kaydinta isla xisaabinta mar kale ma tiriyo laba jeer. Liiska ku yaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku-dhisyada aad inta badan isticmaasho\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kuwa aad inta badan isticmaasho hore u keenaa. Wuxuu ka reebaa kuwa xisaabintan horeba u leh. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu mid geliyaa sida aad markii dambe isticmaashay, qaybahooda oo dhan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-celi-bog-kasta\"\u003EKu celi bog kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadaha isku mid ah bog kasta oo koox ah, sida tiro cinwaanka ama faahfaahin caadi ah:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro calaamadaha xaashi hal ah (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste#select-the-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-hash=\"select-the-marks\"\u003EDooro calaamadaha\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaxa la baray\u003C/span\u003E, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu celi calaamadaha la doortay bog kasta…\u003C/span\u003E, magac u bixi qaabka oo xaqiiji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxay ku dhacaan bog kasta oo kale oo furan \u003Cstrong\u003Eoo cabbir isku mid ah\u003C/strong\u003E, isla meeshaas, hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo. Dherer iyo aag waxay ku dhacaan kaliya bogagga isku miisaan ah; tirooyinka waxay ku dhacaan bog kasta oo cabbirkaas ah. Bog horeba leh calaamadahaas waa la dhaafaa. Qaabka waa la kaydiyaa, sidaas darteed bogagga aad markii dambe furto waxay helaan soo jeedinta buundada, ama waad isticmaali kartaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu celi bog kasta\u003C/span\u003E liiska.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eeg-tirtir\"\u003EEeg, tirtir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax kasta oo la baray waxaa lagu liisanayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaxa la baray\u003C/span\u003E. Qashinka hal shay ayuu tirtiraa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu tirtiraa wax kasta oo la baray, walxaha iyo calaamadaha aad hayso wuu ka reebaa. Labaduba waa la dib u celin karaa ilaa aad xidho xisaabinta, labaduba faylka xisaabinta waa lagu kaydiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u joojiso barashada xisaabin hal ah, ka saar xulashada \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa baro tirintan\u003C/span\u003E. Wax cusub looma baro, waxa liiska ku jiraa wuu sii jiraa ilaa aad tirtirto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaan\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la yaqaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoocyada hore ee TakeoffCraft waxay furaan fayl leh waxyaabo la baray si caadi ah. Way iska indho tirtiraan qaybtaas, oo way ka saaraan haddii mar kale kaydiyaan faylka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamad la baray waa sawir yar oo waxa aad xuddun-dahay, oo ku kaydsan faylka (dhowr kiilobaayt mid kasta).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadaha la baray waxa loo raadiyaa sida Tirin otomaatig ah u raadiso, sidaas darteed isla xaddidaadyadaas ayaa khuseeya: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah calaamad\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"TakeoffCraft wuu degdegaa marka aad xisaabinta badan ku samayso. Wuxuu kaliya ka baraa waxa aad aqbasho: calaamadaha aad ku xuddun-dahay Tirin otomaatig ah kadibna aad ku dartay, koox-shuruudaha aad kaydiyo, isku-dhisyada aad isticmaasho (mar kasta shaqo), qaababka calaamadaha aad bog kasta ku celiso. Waa isbarbardhig fudud oo ku saleysan xaashiyadaada, oo ah isla raadinta Tirin otomaatig ah ku samayso. Ma aha moodel la tababaray. Wax kasta oo uu barto waxaa lagu hayaa faylka xisaabintan (.takeoff.json), wax meel ayaana looma dirayo. Si aad u qaaddo shaqada xigta, isticmaal Isla sida shaqadii ugu dambaysay. Dooro Waxa la baray qalabka sare (laambadda iftiinka, ag dhow Tirin otomaatig ah) si aad u aragto dhammaantood. Calaamadaha Marka aad ku xuddun-dahay calaamad Tirin otomaatig ah oo aad dooratid Ku dar, calaamadii aad xuddun-dahay waa la kaydiyaa, iyo heerka isbarbardhigga aad aqbashay. Ku Waxa la baray, dooro Ka hel xaashigan ama Ka hel xaashi kasta. Sawirka caadiga ah ee Tirin otomaatig ah ayaa furmaa: guji sanduuq si aad uga baxdo, dhaqaajri jiifka, ka dibna ku dar. Waxba lama darin ilaa aad sameyso. Marka aad furto xaashi aan weli leh calaamad baratay, buundo sare ayaa kugu soo jeedinaysa Hel … oo ku saabsan. Hadda maya wuxuu qarinayaa xaashigaas oo keliya. Haddii xisaabintu aanay lahayn walax magacaas leh, ku darista calaamadaha waxa kaloo lagu daraa walax (hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo). Ku dar mar kale calaamadda walax isku mid ah waxay ku xisaabtaa tan ay horey u garanaysay; calaamad aan u eeganaynin waxay noqotaa mid labaad. Sida Tirin otomaatig ah, wuxuu helaa calaamadda xagal xagal ah iyo xaashiyada miisaan kale. Koox-shuruudaha Koox wuxuu hayaa shuruudaha xisaabintan (walxaha, unit-yadooda, qiimaha, qashinka iyo isku-dhisyada), iyada oo aan calaamadaha la socon. Ku Waxa la baray, dooro Kaydi shuruudaha tirintan sida koox… oo bixi magac. Koox leh magac isku mid ah ayaa la beddelaa. Xisaabinta leh kooxda, Ku dar wuxuu geliyaa shuruudaha aan weli lahayn. Shuruudaha leh magac iyo nooc isku mid ah way ka tagaan. Waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo. Isla sida shaqadii ugu dambaysay Faylka shaqadii ugu dambaysay wuxuu hayaa waxa uu baray. Si aad shaqo cusub uga bilowdo: Fur qorshayaasha cusub, ka dibna dooro Waxa la baray › Isla sida shaqadii ugu dambaysay…. Dooro .takeoff.json ee shaqadii ugu dambaysay. Calaamadi waxa aad keento: shuruudaheeda (kaliya kuwa xisaabintan aanay lahayn), iyo waxa uu baray (calaamadaha, kooxaha, isku-dhisyada, qaababka). Ka dib Soo geli. Shuruudaha shaqadaas waxaa sidoo kale lagu kaydiyaa koox magacooda shaqadaas. Calaamadaha iyo tirooyinka waxay ku sii jiraan faylkooda. Dhammaantood waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo. Isku-dhisyada aad inta badan isticmaasho Walax leh isku-dhis waxa loo tiriyaa mar kasta shaqo oo keliya marka ay leedahay qadar oo aad keydiso xisaabinta. Shaqo waa qorshayaasha faylasha ay ka xisaabinayso, sidaas darteed kaydinta isla xisaabinta mar kale ma tiriyo laba jeer. Liiska ku yaal Isku-dhisyada aad inta badan isticmaasho wuxuu kuwa aad inta badan isticmaasho hore u keenaa. Wuxuu ka reebaa kuwa xisaabintan horeba u leh. Ku dar wuxuu mid geliyaa sida aad markii dambe isticmaashay, qaybahooda oo dhan. Ku celi bog kasta Calaamadaha isku mid ah bog kasta oo koox ah, sida tiro cinwaanka ama faahfaahin caadi ah: Dooro calaamadaha xaashi hal ah (Dooro calaamadaha). Ku Waxa la baray, dooro Ku celi calaamadaha la doortay bog kasta…, magac u bixi qaabka oo xaqiiji. Waxay ku dhacaan bog kasta oo kale oo furan oo cabbir isku mid ah, isla meeshaas, hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo. Dherer iyo aag waxay ku dhacaan kaliya bogagga isku miisaan ah; tirooyinka waxay ku dhacaan bog kasta oo cabbirkaas ah. Bog horeba leh calaamadahaas waa la dhaafaa. Qaabka waa la kaydiyaa, sidaas darteed bogagga aad markii dambe furto waxay helaan soo jeedinta buundada, ama waad isticmaali kartaa Ku celi bog kasta liiska. Eeg, tirtir Wax kasta oo la baray waxaa lagu liisanayaa Waxa la baray. Qashinka hal shay ayuu tirtiraa. Ka saar dhammaan wuxuu tirtiraa wax kasta oo la baray, walxaha iyo calaamadaha aad hayso wuu ka reebaa. Labaduba waa la dib u celin karaa ilaa aad xidho xisaabinta, labaduba faylka xisaabinta waa lagu kaydiyaa. Si aad u joojiso barashada xisaabin hal ah, ka saar xulashada Ka baro tirintan. Wax cusub looma baro, waxa liiska ku jiraa wuu sii jiraa ilaa aad tirtirto. Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaan Noocyada hore ee TakeoffCraft waxay furaan fayl leh waxyaabo la baray si caadi ah. Way iska indho tirtiraan qaybtaas, oo way ka saaraan haddii mar kale kaydiyaan faylka. Calaamad la baray waa sawir yar oo waxa aad xuddun-dahay, oo ku kaydsan faylka (dhowr kiilobaayt mid kasta). Calaamadaha la baray waxa loo raadiyaa sida Tirin otomaatig ah u raadiso, sidaas darteed isla xaddidaadyadaas ayaa khuseeya: Tirin otomaatig ah calaamad.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"price-memory","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Xusuusta qiimaha shaqooyinka hore","summary":"TakeoffCraft wuxuu xasuustaa qiimayaasha aad isticmaashay xisaabinadii hore, computer-kan oo keliya, si xisaabin cusub uga bilaabi karo waxa aad bixisay mar kii ugu dambeeyay. Arag, isticmaal, iska illow.","section":"tasks","order":73,"keywords":["xusuusta qiimaha","qiimayaasha","xasuuso qiimaha","shaqadii hore","shaqooyinka hore","qiimo caadi ah","dhexe","median","rates","aan qiimo lahayn","dib-u-qiimee","ka bar xisaabin hore","illow","maktabad"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-la-xasuusto","text":"Waxa la xasuusto","level":2},{"id":"isticmaal-xisaabin-cusub","text":"Isticmaal xisaabin cusub","level":2},{"id":"arag-beddel-iska-illow","text":"Arag, beddel, iska illow","level":2},{"id":"kaaliyahaaga","text":"Kaaliyahaaga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiimayaasha\u003C/span\u003E toolbar-ka (calaamadda doollarka) wuxuu furaa wixii TakeoffCraft xusuusta ka qabo qiimayaasha aad isticmaashay. Waa liis fudud: magac walxa kasta, qiimayaasha shaqooyinkaaga ee ugu dambeeyay. Waxaa lagu hayaa browser-kan (Studio-ga, webview-kiisa gaarka ah) oo ku dhegan maktabadda qiimaha, weligeed kuma jiro faylka xisaabinta, wax meel loo dirayo ma jiro. Ma aha model tababbaran.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-xasuusto\"\u003EWaxa la xasuusto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad xisaabinta kaydiso, walax kasta oo leh qiime oo la isticmaalay (leh calaamad, ama tiro ka weyn eber oo la qoray) waxaa lagu xasuustaa magaciisa iyo nooceeda: qiimaha alaabta, qiimaha shaqaalaha, qashinka iyo unitka. Shaqo waa faylasha qorshaha laga qaaday, sidaas darteed xisaabinta isku mid mar kale kaydinta waxay beddelaysaa qiimayaasha u gaarka ah halkii ay ku dari lahayd shaqo kale. Shaqada 12 ugu dambeysay ayaa loo hayaa magac kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u bilowdo shaqadaadii hore, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa bar tirin hore…\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro xisaabin la kaydiyay (.json). Walxaha ay leedahay qiime oo la isticmaalay waxaa lagu xasuustaa isla siyaasadaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMagacyadu way is-waafaqaan marka erayadoodu is-waafaqaan, xarfaha weyn ama yaryar ama calaamadaha ma muhiimaan. (&quot;2x4 Stud, 8 ft&quot; iyo &quot;2x4 stud 8 FT&quot; waa isku mid.) Isla erayada nooc kale oo walax (walax toosan iyo walax tiro) isma aha isku qiime.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isticmaal-xisaabin-cusub\"\u003EIsticmaal xisaabin cusub\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamee walxaha xisaabinta cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiimayaasha\u003C/span\u003E. Hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXisaabintan\u003C/span\u003E waxaad arkaysaa walx kasta oo qiime xusuusan leh, waxa haysto hadda, qiimaha shaqada ugu dambaysay, qiimaha caadiga ah (dhexda shaqooyinka la xasuustay) iyo kala-duwanaanta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal kii ugu dambaysay\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal caadiga\u003C/span\u003E walxa mid kasta, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiimee N walax aan qiimo lahayn xusuusta\u003C/span\u003E si aad u buuxiso walxaha aan qiimo lahayn oo dhan qiimaha shaqada ugu dambaysay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsticmaal kasta hal tallaabo ayuu yahay: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa dib u celiya. Walx magac u dhow oo kaliya leh (hal magac uu ku jiro kan kale) waa sheegaa, badhamadu qiimaha magaca u dhow ayey isticmaalaan. Qiime la xasuusto oo ah &quot;each&quot; weligeed looma dhigo walx &quot;per foot&quot;: wada-hadalku wuxuu sheegaa in unitsyadu kala duwan yihiin, wuuna ka tagaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arag-beddel-iska-illow\"\u003EArag, beddel, iska illow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax walba oo xusuusan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa magac kasta qiimayaashiisa iyo tirada shaqooyinka. Badhanka qashinka wuxuu illaysiiyaa hal magac; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENadiifi qiimaha oo dhan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu illaysiiyaa dhammaantood. Dami \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXasuuso qiimayaasha markaan tirin kaydiyo\u003C/span\u003E si aad u joojiso xusuusta; wixii horey loo xasuustay wuu jiraa ilaa aad iska illowdo. Xisaabintaadu iyo maktabadda qiimaha weligood lama taabanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaaliyahaaga\"\u003EKaaliyahaaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad oggolaatay kaaliyada Settings, waxay akhrin karaan wixii la xasuustay walxaha xisaabinta (prices_list) iyo qiime walxaha ka (prices_apply, oo horay u muuji karo). Waa liistii isku mid ah ee daaqadda.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Qiimayaasha toolbar-ka (calaamadda doollarka) wuxuu furaa wixii TakeoffCraft xusuusta ka qabo qiimayaasha aad isticmaashay. Waa liis fudud: magac walxa kasta, qiimayaasha shaqooyinkaaga ee ugu dambeeyay. Waxaa lagu hayaa browser-kan (Studio-ga, webview-kiisa gaarka ah) oo ku dhegan maktabadda qiimaha, weligeed kuma jiro faylka xisaabinta, wax meel loo dirayo ma jiro. Ma aha model tababbaran. Waxa la xasuusto Markaad xisaabinta kaydiso, walax kasta oo leh qiime oo la isticmaalay (leh calaamad, ama tiro ka weyn eber oo la qoray) waxaa lagu xasuustaa magaciisa iyo nooceeda: qiimaha alaabta, qiimaha shaqaalaha, qashinka iyo unitka. Shaqo waa faylasha qorshaha laga qaaday, sidaas darteed xisaabinta isku mid mar kale kaydinta waxay beddelaysaa qiimayaasha u gaarka ah halkii ay ku dari lahayd shaqo kale. Shaqada 12 ugu dambeysay ayaa loo hayaa magac kasta. Si aad u bilowdo shaqadaadii hore, dooro Ka bar tirin hore… oo dooro xisaabin la kaydiyay (.json). Walxaha ay leedahay qiime oo la isticmaalay waxaa lagu xasuustaa isla siyaasadaas. Magacyadu way is-waafaqaan marka erayadoodu is-waafaqaan, xarfaha weyn ama yaryar ama calaamadaha ma muhiimaan. (\"2x4 Stud, 8 ft\" iyo \"2x4 stud 8 FT\" waa isku mid.) Isla erayada nooc kale oo walax (walax toosan iyo walax tiro) isma aha isku qiime. Isticmaal xisaabin cusub Samee walxaha xisaabinta cusub. Dooro Qiimayaasha. Hoosta Xisaabintan waxaad arkaysaa walx kasta oo qiime xusuusan leh, waxa haysto hadda, qiimaha shaqada ugu dambaysay, qiimaha caadiga ah (dhexda shaqooyinka la xasuustay) iyo kala-duwanaanta. Dooro Isticmaal kii ugu dambaysay ama Isticmaal caadiga walxa mid kasta, ama Qiimee N walax aan qiimo lahayn xusuusta si aad u buuxiso walxaha aan qiimo lahayn oo dhan qiimaha shaqada ugu dambaysay. Isticmaal kasta hal tallaabo ayuu yahay: Ctrl+Z ayaa dib u celiya. Walx magac u dhow oo kaliya leh (hal magac uu ku jiro kan kale) waa sheegaa, badhamadu qiimaha magaca u dhow ayey isticmaalaan. Qiime la xasuusto oo ah \"each\" weligeed looma dhigo walx \"per foot\": wada-hadalku wuxuu sheegaa in unitsyadu kala duwan yihiin, wuuna ka tagaa. Arag, beddel, iska illow Wax walba oo xusuusan wuxuu liistaa magac kasta qiimayaashiisa iyo tirada shaqooyinka. Badhanka qashinka wuxuu illaysiiyaa hal magac; Nadiifi qiimaha oo dhan wuxuu illaysiiyaa dhammaantood. Dami Xasuuso qiimayaasha markaan tirin kaydiyo si aad u joojiso xusuusta; wixii horey loo xasuustay wuu jiraa ilaa aad iska illowdo. Xisaabintaadu iyo maktabadda qiimaha weligood lama taabanayo. Kaaliyahaaga Haddii aad oggolaatay kaaliyada Settings, waxay akhrin karaan wixii la xasuustay walxaha xisaabinta (prices_list) iyo qiime walxaha ka (prices_apply, oo horay u muuji karo). Waa liistii isku mid ah ee daaqadda.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"supplier-stock","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Hubi kaydka bixiyaha iyo waqtiyada keenista","summary":"Ku dar liiska kaydka bixiyaha (CSV ama buug-shaqo) TakeoffCraft wuxuu hubiyaa waxa xisaabintu u baahan tahay, iyo qashinka ku jira, isagoo ka eegaya; intuu ku filan yahay kaydka iyo intee la sugayo. Yaraanta iyo sugista dheer waxay ka muuqdaan guddiga Dhibaatooyinka.","section":"tasks","order":74,"keywords":["bixiye","kayd","ku jira kaydka","waqtiga keenista","diyaar","yaraan","dalab dib u dhac","liiska dalabka","csv","sku","iibiye","agabka","bixin","dhibaatooyin"],"headings":[{"id":"faylka","text":"Faylka","level":2},{"id":"hubi-xisaabinta","text":"Hubi xisaabinta","level":2},{"id":"buug-shaqada-iyo-maktabadda-qiimaha","text":"Buug-shaqada iyo Maktabadda qiimaha","level":2},{"id":"guddiga-dhibaatooyinka","text":"Guddiga Dhibaatooyinka","level":2},{"id":"kaaliyahaaga","text":"Kaaliyahaaga","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-xusuusto","text":"Waxa la xusuusto","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBixin\u003C/span\u003E oo ku yaal qalabka (baabuurka) waxay hubisaa waxa xisaabintaadu u baahan tahay ka eegaysa liiska kaydka bixiyaha. Safafka bixiyaha ee muhiimka ah waxay ku kaydsan yihiin faylka xisaabintaada. Waxba looma dirin meel, bixiyaha lama weydiiyo: adigaa keenaya faylka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylka\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFayl CSV ah oo leh safka madasha (header). Waxa loo baahan yahay tiir magac ama SKU ah iyo tiir kayd ama waqtiga keenista ah. Madasha la aqoonsanayo (ayaa kala horreeya, xarfaha weyn iyo yar ma muhiimka): Item, Name, Description ama Product; SKU, Part ama Item #; In stock, On hand, Available ama Quantity; Lead time ama Delivery days; Unit ama UOM; Price ama Cost; Supplier ama Vendor.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaydku wuxuu noqon karaa tiro (1,200), &quot;In stock&quot; ama &quot;Out of stock&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaqtiga keenista wuxuu noqon karaa &quot;5 days&quot;, &quot;2 weeks&quot;, &quot;2-3 weeks&quot; (kan dheer ayaa la isticmaalaa), &quot;3 months&quot;, &quot;same day&quot; ama &quot;backorder&quot;. Tiro kaliya waa unugga madasha (maalmo, marka madashu aan sheegin toddobaad ama bil).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylasha Excel lama akhriyo: marka hore kaydi xaashiga CSV.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubi-xisaabinta\"\u003EHubi xisaabinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBixin\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar fayl bixiye…\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro CSV-ga. Ku dar wax ka badan: ilaa shan fayl, 2,000 safaf oo wadar ah ayaa la hayaa, kuwa shayadaada la waafaqa ayaa marka hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShay kasta, shuruud labaad iyo qayb isku-dhis oo leh tiro waxaa lagu xidhaa safka magac ama SKU magaceeda ku jira. Magac u eg (mid ku jira mid kale) waa la isticmaalaa marka magac sax ah aanu jirin, waanana la sheegaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoos \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaxa xisaabintu u baahan tahay\u003C/span\u003E, kuwa gaaban ayaa hore u yimaadda: &quot;Short by 120 EA&quot;, &quot;Lead time 21 days&quot;, &quot;On backorder&quot;, &quot;Unit differs&quot;, &quot;No stock figure&quot; ama &quot;In stock&quot;. Baahiga wuxuu ku jiraa qashinka. Unugga bixiyaha oo aan ahayn kii qiyaasta (tan halka fut) waa la sheegaa oo weligeed looma isbarbar dhigo. Safka kasta wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro shayga\u003C/span\u003E, kaas oo kugu geeya shayga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaqtiga ugu dheer ee la doonayo (maalmo)\u003C/span\u003E (caadi ahaan 14). Shay aan kayd ku jirin oo sugaysa wakhti ka dheer taas waa la calaamadiyaa, koobku wuxuu magacaabaa sugista ugu dheer ee muhiimka ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELiiska dalabka (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo dejiyaa shayada gaaban, tirada ay ka yar yihiin, bixiyaha iyo waqtiga keenista. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa reeb\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu baahiga ka saaraa hubinta (waa tallaabo ka noqo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buug-shaqada-iyo-maktabadda-qiimaha\"\u003EBuug-shaqada iyo Maktabadda qiimaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska bixiyaha wuxuu noqon karaa buug-shaqo Excel (.xlsx) sidoo kale CSV-ga: xaashiga ugu horreeya ayaa la akhriyaa, iyadoo la isticmaalayo magacyada tiirarka isku mid ah. Qaacidooyinka lama fuliyo; qiimaha uu faylku hayo ayaa la akhriyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkii fayl leh qiimayaal la daro, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiimayaasha Maktabadda\u003C/span\u003E oo ku yaal sanduuqa hadalka wuxuu dejiyaa qiimaha agabka ee kasta oo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/price-library\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/price-library\"\u003EMaktabadda\u003C/a\u003E ah oo faylku qiimeeyo: isla magac, iyo unug isku mid ah (ama aan la sheegin). Shaqada, qashinka, dhererka iyo isku-dhisyada way sii joogaan sidooda, qoraalka qaybtana wuxuu sheegayaa faylka qiimaha laga soo qaatay. Qaybta mitirka ah lama qiimeeyo liis fut ah, kaas oo aan magac u dhigmin waa la reebaa; xariiqda xaaladda ayaa sheegaysa inta laga reebay unugga. Ku qiimee mar kale Maktabadda si qiimaha cusub ugu yimaado xisaabintan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"guddiga-dhibaatooyinka\"\u003EGuddiga Dhibaatooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYaraanta waa digniin, sugista dheer waa ogeysiis, oo ku jira guddiga la wadaago ee Dhibaatooyinka (&quot;Bixinta alaabta&quot;), sidaas darteed waxay la jiraan hubin kasta oo kale. Waxaad aqbali kartaa mid sabab la sheegay, aqbalaaddaasna waa lagu kaydiyaa xisaabinta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaaliyahaaga\"\u003EKaaliyahaaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad oggolaysid kaaliyayaasha Dejinta, way akhrin karaan hubinta (supply_check). Ku dar fayl bixiye waa shaqada adigaa leh.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-xusuusto\"\u003EWaxa la xusuusto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETirooyinka kaydka waxay sax yihiin sida cusub faylka aad daratay. Dib u dar faylka si aad u cusboonaysiiso: fayl magac isku mid ah ayaa kii hore beddelaya.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Bixin oo ku yaal qalabka (baabuurka) waxay hubisaa waxa xisaabintaadu u baahan tahay ka eegaysa liiska kaydka bixiyaha. Safafka bixiyaha ee muhiimka ah waxay ku kaydsan yihiin faylka xisaabintaada. Waxba looma dirin meel, bixiyaha lama weydiiyo: adigaa keenaya faylka. Faylka Fayl CSV ah oo leh safka madasha (header). Waxa loo baahan yahay tiir magac ama SKU ah iyo tiir kayd ama waqtiga keenista ah. Madasha la aqoonsanayo (ayaa kala horreeya, xarfaha weyn iyo yar ma muhiimka): Item, Name, Description ama Product; SKU, Part ama Item #; In stock, On hand, Available ama Quantity; Lead time ama Delivery days; Unit ama UOM; Price ama Cost; Supplier ama Vendor. Kaydku wuxuu noqon karaa tiro (1,200), \"In stock\" ama \"Out of stock\". Waqtiga keenista wuxuu noqon karaa \"5 days\", \"2 weeks\", \"2-3 weeks\" (kan dheer ayaa la isticmaalaa), \"3 months\", \"same day\" ama \"backorder\". Tiro kaliya waa unugga madasha (maalmo, marka madashu aan sheegin toddobaad ama bil). Faylasha Excel lama akhriyo: marka hore kaydi xaashiga CSV. Hubi xisaabinta Dooro Bixin, kadibna Ku dar fayl bixiye… oo dooro CSV-ga. Ku dar wax ka badan: ilaa shan fayl, 2,000 safaf oo wadar ah ayaa la hayaa, kuwa shayadaada la waafaqa ayaa marka hore. Shay kasta, shuruud labaad iyo qayb isku-dhis oo leh tiro waxaa lagu xidhaa safka magac ama SKU magaceeda ku jira. Magac u eg (mid ku jira mid kale) waa la isticmaalaa marka magac sax ah aanu jirin, waanana la sheegaa. Hoos Waxa xisaabintu u baahan tahay, kuwa gaaban ayaa hore u yimaadda: \"Short by 120 EA\", \"Lead time 21 days\", \"On backorder\", \"Unit differs\", \"No stock figure\" ama \"In stock\". Baahiga wuxuu ku jiraa qashinka. Unugga bixiyaha oo aan ahayn kii qiyaasta (tan halka fut) waa la sheegaa oo weligeed looma isbarbar dhigo. Safka kasta wuxuu leeyahay Dooro shayga, kaas oo kugu geeya shayga. Deji Waqtiga ugu dheer ee la doonayo (maalmo) (caadi ahaan 14). Shay aan kayd ku jirin oo sugaysa wakhti ka dheer taas waa la calaamadiyaa, koobku wuxuu magacaabaa sugista ugu dheer ee muhiimka ah. Liiska dalabka (CSV) wuxuu soo dejiyaa shayada gaaban, tirada ay ka yar yihiin, bixiyaha iyo waqtiga keenista. Ka reeb wuxuu baahiga ka saaraa hubinta (waa tallaabo ka noqo). Buug-shaqada iyo Maktabadda qiimaha Liiska bixiyaha wuxuu noqon karaa buug-shaqo Excel (.xlsx) sidoo kale CSV-ga: xaashiga ugu horreeya ayaa la akhriyaa, iyadoo la isticmaalayo magacyada tiirarka isku mid ah. Qaacidooyinka lama fuliyo; qiimaha uu faylku hayo ayaa la akhriyaa. Markii fayl leh qiimayaal la daro, Qiimayaasha Maktabadda oo ku yaal sanduuqa hadalka wuxuu dejiyaa qiimaha agabka ee kasta oo Maktabadda ah oo faylku qiimeeyo: isla magac, iyo unug isku mid ah (ama aan la sheegin). Shaqada, qashinka, dhererka iyo isku-dhisyada way sii joogaan sidooda, qoraalka qaybtana wuxuu sheegayaa faylka qiimaha laga soo qaatay. Qaybta mitirka ah lama qiimeeyo liis fut ah, kaas oo aan magac u dhigmin waa la reebaa; xariiqda xaaladda ayaa sheegaysa inta laga reebay unugga. Ku qiimee mar kale Maktabadda si qiimaha cusub ugu yimaado xisaabintan. Guddiga Dhibaatooyinka Yaraanta waa digniin, sugista dheer waa ogeysiis, oo ku jira guddiga la wadaago ee Dhibaatooyinka (\"Bixinta alaabta\"), sidaas darteed waxay la jiraan hubin kasta oo kale. Waxaad aqbali kartaa mid sabab la sheegay, aqbalaaddaasna waa lagu kaydiyaa xisaabinta. Kaaliyahaaga Haddii aad oggolaysid kaaliyayaasha Dejinta, way akhrin karaan hubinta (supply_check). Ku dar fayl bixiye waa shaqada adigaa leh. Waxa la xusuusto Tirooyinka kaydka waxay sax yihiin sida cusub faylka aad daratay. Dib u dar faylka si aad u cusboonaysiiso: fayl magac isku mid ah ayaa kii hore beddelaya.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"copy-paste","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Koobiyee, dhaji iyo nuqul calaamadaha","summary":"Koobiyee calaamadaha iyo walxahooda, dhaji meel aad riixdo ama isla meel xaashi kale, nuqul samee, gooy, tirtir, oo dooro dhammaan, mid kastaa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod.","section":"tasks","order":75,"keywords":["koobiyee","dhaji","gooy","nuqul","dhaji meeshii","clipboard","dooro dhammaan","dooro midna","calaamado badan","dabaq caadi","ku celi","isla qorshe","xaashi kale","koobiyee shayga","nuqul shayga"],"headings":[{"id":"dooro-calaamadaha","text":"Dooro calaamadaha","level":2},{"id":"koobiyee-iyo-dhaji-meesha-aad-riixdo","text":"Koobiyee iyo dhaji meesha aad riixdo","level":2},{"id":"dhaji-meeshii","text":"Dhaji meeshii","level":2},{"id":"miisaanku-waa-inuu-isku-mid-noqdaa","text":"Miisaanku waa inuu isku mid noqdaa","level":2},{"id":"nuqul","text":"Nuqul","level":2},{"id":"gooy-iyo-tirtir","text":"Gooy iyo tirtir","level":2},{"id":"koobiyee-walax","text":"Koobiyee walax","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/span\u003E ee qalabka sare waxay leedahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E. Menyuu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax badan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay kuwa kale, mid kastaa furaha: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGooy\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji meeshii\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENuqul\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro midna\u003C/span\u003E. Mid kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod oo leh \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-calaamadaha\"\u003EDooro calaamadaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) oo riix calaamad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo riix calaamado kale si aad ugu darto. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + riix calaamad la doortay ayaa mar kale ka saara.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E) si aad u doorato dhammaan calaamadaha xaashiga furan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka calaamado badan la doortay, dhinaca midig daaqaddu waxay muujinaysaa \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadaha la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E: inta mid kasta oo shay ah, oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENuqul\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGooy\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir calaamadaha\u003C/span\u003E. Gacmaha geeska waxay muuqdaan kaliya marka hal calaamad la doortay. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro midna\u003C/span\u003E) wuxuu nadiifiyaa doorashada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koobiyee-iyo-dhaji-meesha-aad-riixdo\"\u003EKoobiyee iyo dhaji meesha aad riixdo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro calaamadaha oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E). Calaamadaha waa la koobiyeeyaa iyagoo leh walxahooda, oo ay ku jiraan isku-dhiska, qashinta iyo kharashyada walax kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETag xaashiga aad rabto inay ku jiraan (wuxuu noqon karaa isla xaashiga).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E). Nuqul jajaban ayaa raacaya taabbiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix meesha ay tagayso. Dhexda calaamadaha la koobiyeeyay waxay ku degtaa taabbiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu joojiyaa oo waxba ma ku darto. Calaamadaha la dhajiyay kadib ayaa la doortaa, sidaas darteed \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa mar kale ka saari kara.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsla xisaabinta qadarka, calaamadaha la dhajiyay waxay tagaan \u003Cstrong\u003Ewalxaha isku mid ah\u003C/strong\u003E, sidaas darteed tirooyinkoodu waxay ku daraan walxahaas. Xisaabin kale (tab kale, ama kadib \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusub\u003C/span\u003E), walax leh magac iyo nooc isku mid ah ayaa la isticmaalaa; haddii kale walaxda waa la kudarayaa iyadoo leh isku-dhiskeeda. Haddii magaca uu qaaday walax nooc kale ah, walaxda la daray waxa loo bixiyaa &quot;(magac) (nuqul)&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadaha la dhajiyay waxay tagaan aagga tartanka ee lagu doortay sare panelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E (ama midna ma aha). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\"\u003EAagagga tartanka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhaji-meeshii\"\u003EDhaji meeshii\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji meeshii\u003C/span\u003E) wuxuu dhigaa nuqulka meel isku mid ah oo xaashiga furan, sida booska bogga. Isticmaal marka dabaqa caadiga ah: xisaabi dabaqa 2, koobiyee, fur dabaqa 3, dhaji meeshii.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhaji meeshii wuxuu u baahan yahay xaashi \u003Cstrong\u003Ecabbir isku mid ah\u003C/strong\u003E kii aad ka koobiyeysay. Xaashi cabbir kale ah TakeoffCraft wuu sheegaa oo ma dhajiyo wax; isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E oo riix. Xaashiga aad ka koobiyeysay, nuqulku wuxuu ku dhacaa kuwii asalka ahaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"miisaanku-waa-inuu-isku-mid-noqdaa\"\u003EMiisaanku waa inuu isku mid noqdaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDherer iyo aagag waxay ku xiran yihiin miisaanka xaashiga. Socod lagu cabbiray 10&#039; oo ku jira miisaan 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; wuxuu noqon lahaa 20&#039; xaashi miisaankiisu yahay 1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;. Sidaas darteed TakeoffCraft wuxuu dhajiyaa socodyada iyo aagagga oo keliya xaashi \u003Cstrong\u003Emiisaan isku mid ah\u003C/strong\u003E kii ay ka yimaadeen, wuxuuna si cad u sheegaa marka aanu sidaas ahayn:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXaashiga furan weli ma leh miisaan: marka hore sii mid (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EDejinta miisaanka\u003C/a\u003E), kadibna dhaji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXaashiga furan miisaan kale ayuu leeyahay: farriinta waxay magacaabaa labada miisaan. Dhaji xaashi miisaan isku mid ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETirooyinka miisaan uma baahna: tirooyinka la koobiyeeyay meel kasta ayay ku dhajmaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nuqul\"\u003ENuqul\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENuqul\u003C/span\u003E) wuxuu koobiyeeyaa calaamadaha la doortay oo wuxuu dhigaa nuqulka taabbiga isla markiiba; riix meesha ay tagayso. Waxba ma la darin ilaa aad riixdo, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxba ma tago. Nuqul ma beddelo waxa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E dhajiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gooy-iyo-tirtir\"\u003EGooy iyo tirtir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGooy\u003C/span\u003E) wuxuu koobiyeeyaa calaamadaha la doortay oo tirtiraa. Dhaji meeshooda saxda ah, ama ka noqo gooyga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E) wuxuu tirtiraa calaamadaha la doortay iyada oo aan la koobiyeyn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koobiyee-walax\"\u003EKoobiyee walax\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETafatiraha walaxda (hoos ee \u003Cstrong\u003EWalxaha\u003C/strong\u003E) wuxuu ku dhammaadaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee shayga\u003C/span\u003E: wuxuu koobiyeeyaa walaxda isku-dhiskeeda, qashintooda iyo kharashyada, iyada oo aan calaamad lahayn. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E kadib wuxuu ku daraa nuqul walaxda xisaabintan, ama mid kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee nuqul shayga\u003C/span\u003E: wuxuu hal mar ku daraa nuqul, magaceedu yahay &quot;(magac) (nuqul)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENuqulku wuxuu ku jiraa kombiyuutarkan: wuxuu ku jiraa tab-kan iyo kaydinta browser-ka, sidaas darteed tab kale oo TakeoffCraft ah ayaa dhajin karta. Waa lagu soo rarin, nidaamka clipboard-kana lama isticmaalo, sidaas darteed calaamadaha barnaamijyada kale uma dhajin kartid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENuqul hal xaashi ayuu ka yimaadaa mar kasta. Calaamadaha waxa la dhajiyaa sidii ay yihiin: weli ma jiro jiheyn ama muraayad nuqulka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Qaybta Wax ka beddel ee qalabka sare waxay leedahay Ka noqo, Samee mar kale, Koobiyee iyo Dhaji. Menyuu Wax badan wuxuu leeyahay kuwa kale, mid kastaa furaha: Gooy, Koobiyee, Dhaji, Dhaji meeshii, Nuqul, Tirtir, Dooro dhammaan iyo Dooro midna. Mid kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod oo leh Ctrl+Z. Dooro calaamadaha Dooro Dooro (V) oo riix calaamad. Hay Shift oo riix calaamado kale si aad ugu darto. Shift + riix calaamad la doortay ayaa mar kale ka saara. Ama riix Ctrl+A (Dooro dhammaan) si aad u doorato dhammaan calaamadaha xaashiga furan. Marka calaamado badan la doortay, dhinaca midig daaqaddu waxay muujinaysaa Calaamadaha la doortay: inta mid kasta oo shay ah, oo leh Koobiyee, Nuqul, Gooy iyo Tirtir calaamadaha. Gacmaha geeska waxay muuqdaan kaliya marka hal calaamad la doortay. Esc (Dooro midna) wuxuu nadiifiyaa doorashada. Koobiyee iyo dhaji meesha aad riixdo Dooro calaamadaha oo riix Ctrl+C (Koobiyee). Calaamadaha waa la koobiyeeyaa iyagoo leh walxahooda, oo ay ku jiraan isku-dhiska, qashinta iyo kharashyada walax kasta. Tag xaashiga aad rabto inay ku jiraan (wuxuu noqon karaa isla xaashiga). Riix Ctrl+V (Dhaji). Nuqul jajaban ayaa raacaya taabbiga. Riix meesha ay tagayso. Dhexda calaamadaha la koobiyeeyay waxay ku degtaa taabbiga. Esc wuu joojiyaa oo waxba ma ku darto. Calaamadaha la dhajiyay kadib ayaa la doortaa, sidaas darteed Delete ama Ctrl+Z ayaa mar kale ka saari kara. Isla xisaabinta qadarka, calaamadaha la dhajiyay waxay tagaan walxaha isku mid ah, sidaas darteed tirooyinkoodu waxay ku daraan walxahaas. Xisaabin kale (tab kale, ama kadib Cusub), walax leh magac iyo nooc isku mid ah ayaa la isticmaalaa; haddii kale walaxda waa la kudarayaa iyadoo leh isku-dhiskeeda. Haddii magaca uu qaaday walax nooc kale ah, walaxda la daray waxa loo bixiyaa \"(magac) (nuqul)\". Calaamadaha la dhajiyay waxay tagaan aagga tartanka ee lagu doortay sare panelka Walxaha (ama midna ma aha). Eeg Aagagga tartanka. Dhaji meeshii Ctrl+Shift+V (Dhaji meeshii) wuxuu dhigaa nuqulka meel isku mid ah oo xaashiga furan, sida booska bogga. Isticmaal marka dabaqa caadiga ah: xisaabi dabaqa 2, koobiyee, fur dabaqa 3, dhaji meeshii. Dhaji meeshii wuxuu u baahan yahay xaashi cabbir isku mid ah kii aad ka koobiyeysay. Xaashi cabbir kale ah TakeoffCraft wuu sheegaa oo ma dhajiyo wax; isticmaal Dhaji oo riix. Xaashiga aad ka koobiyeysay, nuqulku wuxuu ku dhacaa kuwii asalka ahaa. Miisaanku waa inuu isku mid noqdaa Dherer iyo aagag waxay ku xiran yihiin miisaanka xaashiga. Socod lagu cabbiray 10' oo ku jira miisaan 1/4\" = 1'-0\" wuxuu noqon lahaa 20' xaashi miisaankiisu yahay 1/8\" = 1'-0\". Sidaas darteed TakeoffCraft wuxuu dhajiyaa socodyada iyo aagagga oo keliya xaashi miisaan isku mid ah kii ay ka yimaadeen, wuxuuna si cad u sheegaa marka aanu sidaas ahayn: Xaashiga furan weli ma leh miisaan: marka hore sii mid (Dejinta miisaanka), kadibna dhaji. Xaashiga furan miisaan kale ayuu leeyahay: farriinta waxay magacaabaa labada miisaan. Dhaji xaashi miisaan isku mid ah. Tirooyinka miisaan uma baahna: tirooyinka la koobiyeeyay meel kasta ayay ku dhajmaan. Nuqul Ctrl+D (Nuqul) wuxuu koobiyeeyaa calaamadaha la doortay oo wuxuu dhigaa nuqulka taabbiga isla markiiba; riix meesha ay tagayso. Waxba ma la darin ilaa aad riixdo, Esc waxba ma tago. Nuqul ma beddelo waxa Dhaji dhajiyo. Gooy iyo tirtir Ctrl+X (Gooy) wuxuu koobiyeeyaa calaamadaha la doortay oo tirtiraa. Dhaji meeshooda saxda ah, ama ka noqo gooyga. Delete ama Backspace (Tirtir) wuxuu tirtiraa calaamadaha la doortay iyada oo aan la koobiyeyn. Koobiyee walax Tafatiraha walaxda (hoos ee Walxaha) wuxuu ku dhammaadaa: Koobiyee shayga: wuxuu koobiyeeyaa walaxda isku-dhiskeeda, qashintooda iyo kharashyada, iyada oo aan calaamad lahayn. Dhaji kadib wuxuu ku daraa nuqul walaxda xisaabintan, ama mid kale. Samee nuqul shayga: wuxuu hal mar ku daraa nuqul, magaceedu yahay \"(magac) (nuqul)\". Nuqulku wuxuu ku jiraa kombiyuutarkan: wuxuu ku jiraa tab-kan iyo kaydinta browser-ka, sidaas darteed tab kale oo TakeoffCraft ah ayaa dhajin karta. Waa lagu soo rarin, nidaamka clipboard-kana lama isticmaalo, sidaas darteed calaamadaha barnaamijyada kale uma dhajin kartid. Nuqul hal xaashi ayuu ka yimaadaa mar kasta. Calaamadaha waxa la dhajiyaa sidii ay yihiin: weli ma jiro jiheyn ama muraayad nuqulka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"carbon-and-5d-prices","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Karbonka lagu jiro iyo miiska qiimaha 5D","summary":"Karbon wuxuu isku daraa karbonka lagu jiro takeoff-ka, isagoo ka xisaabinaya tiro walxa kasta iyo miis factor furan, wuxuuna u diraa heerarka takeoff-ka BimCraft sida miis qiimo oo kharashka 5D.","section":"tasks","order":76,"keywords":["karbon","karbon lagu jiro","kgco2e","co2","factors","a1-a3","gaadiid","qashin","5d","miiska qiimaha","kharash","bimcraft","epd"],"headings":[{"id":"karbonka-lagu-jiro","text":"Karbonka lagu jiro","level":2},{"id":"miis-qiimo-oo-loogu-talagalay-kharashka-5d","text":"Miis qiimo oo loogu talagalay kharashka 5D","level":2},{"id":"caawiyahaaga","text":"Caawiyahaaga","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaan","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaan","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECarbon\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare wuxuu isku daraa karbonka lagu jiro waxa aad cabbirtay, oo wuxuu u beddelaa heerarkaaga miis qiimo oo moodeelka dhismaha isticmaali karo. Waa qiyaas, ma aha qiimayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"karbonka-lagu-jiro\"\u003EKarbonka lagu jiro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETirada walxa kasta, oo qashinkeeda la socota, waxaa lagu dhufaa safka miiska factor. Safka waxaa lagu kala saaraa erayada magaca walxa (&quot;concrete slab&quot; wuxuu helaa safka leh furaha concrete). Miiskan waa isla miiska furan ee BimCraft isticmaasho, sidaas darteed faylka aad halkan soo gelisid wuu shaqeeyaa halkaas. \u003Cstrong\u003ESafafka barnaamijka la socdaa waa qiimo bilow ah: guud, aan la hubin, mana aha xog ka timid database kasta.\u003C/strong\u003E Sanduuqa ayaa taas ku sheegaa tirooyinka xiga; ku bedel isha aad leedahay ka hor intaadan ku tiirsanaan lambarka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECarbon\u003C/span\u003E. Walxaha la tiriyay waa la liistaa kilogaraamada CO2e; wadarta ayaa kor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA4 transport\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA5 site waste\u003C/span\u003E si aad u tirisid marxaladahaas sidoo kale, safafka ku siiya qiimayn. Marxaladda wax soo saarka mar walba waa la tiriyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u isticmaasho safka kale walxa, ama midna, isticmaal liiska khadkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFactors from a file…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo geliyaa miis factor (JSON ama CSV) aad ka samaysay isha aad leedahay; safafkiisa waxay bedelaan safafka bilowga ah ee isla id leh. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFactors (JSON)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa kaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFactor waa mitir, mitir laba-geesood, mitir saddex-geesood, walxa, ama kilogaraam. Khad lagu cabbiray feet ama square feet waa la beddelaa. Factor kilogaraam wuxuu u baahan yahay mugga (yard kuwaad ama mitir) iyo density-ga safka. Walxa factor-kiisu u baahan yahay tiro aan cabbirin ayaa lagu liistaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeft out\u003C/span\u003E sababta, weligeed lama male-awaado. Wadarta socota ee status bar-ka waxay muujinaysaa isla tirada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafafka factor-kaaga, doorashooyinkaaga, iyo marxaladaha aad tirisid waa la kaydiyaa faylka takeoff-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"miis-qiimo-oo-loogu-talagalay-kharashka-5d\"\u003EMiis qiimo oo loogu talagalay kharashka 5D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E5D prices (JSON)\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E5D prices (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E waxay kaydiyaan heerarka takeoff-ka sida miis qiimo: hal safka walxa qiimaysan kasta oo leh heerkiisa agabka iyo shaqada unug kasta iyo qashinkiisa. Soo geli BimCraft cutubka kharashka (Karbonka lagu jiro iyo kharashka 5D) si aad u qiimayso hawlaha moodeelka dhismaha isla heerarkaas ee soo saaray tartanka. Walxaha lagu cabbiray unug uusan miiskani lahayn, iyo walxaha aan heer lahayn, waa la reebay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"caawiyahaaga\"\u003ECaawiyahaaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad oggolaatay caawiyayaasha Dejinta, way akhrin karaan karbonka (carbon_check). Soo gelinta factors-ka waa adigu kan qabanaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaan\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la yaqaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax ceel lagama dirayo. Qiyaasuhu waa sida ay u wanaagsan yihiin factors-ka aad soo gelisay.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Carbon qalabka sare wuxuu isku daraa karbonka lagu jiro waxa aad cabbirtay, oo wuxuu u beddelaa heerarkaaga miis qiimo oo moodeelka dhismaha isticmaali karo. Waa qiyaas, ma aha qiimayn. Karbonka lagu jiro Tirada walxa kasta, oo qashinkeeda la socota, waxaa lagu dhufaa safka miiska factor. Safka waxaa lagu kala saaraa erayada magaca walxa (\"concrete slab\" wuxuu helaa safka leh furaha concrete). Miiskan waa isla miiska furan ee BimCraft isticmaasho, sidaas darteed faylka aad halkan soo gelisid wuu shaqeeyaa halkaas. Safafka barnaamijka la socdaa waa qiimo bilow ah: guud, aan la hubin, mana aha xog ka timid database kasta. Sanduuqa ayaa taas ku sheegaa tirooyinka xiga; ku bedel isha aad leedahay ka hor intaadan ku tiirsanaan lambarka. Dooro Carbon. Walxaha la tiriyay waa la liistaa kilogaraamada CO2e; wadarta ayaa kor. Calaamee A4 transport ama A5 site waste si aad u tirisid marxaladahaas sidoo kale, safafka ku siiya qiimayn. Marxaladda wax soo saarka mar walba waa la tiriyaa. Si aad u isticmaasho safka kale walxa, ama midna, isticmaal liiska khadkiisa. Factors from a file… wuxuu soo geliyaa miis factor (JSON ama CSV) aad ka samaysay isha aad leedahay; safafkiisa waxay bedelaan safafka bilowga ah ee isla id leh. Factors (JSON) wuxuu kaydiyaa kaaga. Factor waa mitir, mitir laba-geesood, mitir saddex-geesood, walxa, ama kilogaraam. Khad lagu cabbiray feet ama square feet waa la beddelaa. Factor kilogaraam wuxuu u baahan yahay mugga (yard kuwaad ama mitir) iyo density-ga safka. Walxa factor-kiisu u baahan yahay tiro aan cabbirin ayaa lagu liistaa Left out sababta, weligeed lama male-awaado. Wadarta socota ee status bar-ka waxay muujinaysaa isla tirada. Safafka factor-kaaga, doorashooyinkaaga, iyo marxaladaha aad tirisid waa la kaydiyaa faylka takeoff-ka. Miis qiimo oo loogu talagalay kharashka 5D 5D prices (JSON) iyo 5D prices (CSV) waxay kaydiyaan heerarka takeoff-ka sida miis qiimo: hal safka walxa qiimaysan kasta oo leh heerkiisa agabka iyo shaqada unug kasta iyo qashinkiisa. Soo geli BimCraft cutubka kharashka (Karbonka lagu jiro iyo kharashka 5D) si aad u qiimayso hawlaha moodeelka dhismaha isla heerarkaas ee soo saaray tartanka. Walxaha lagu cabbiray unug uusan miiskani lahayn, iyo walxaha aan heer lahayn, waa la reebay. Caawiyahaaga Haddii aad oggolaatay caawiyayaasha Dejinta, way akhrin karaan karbonka (carbon_check). Soo gelinta factors-ka waa adigu kan qabanaya. Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaan Wax ceel lagama dirayo. Qiyaasuhu waa sida ay u wanaagsan yihiin factors-ka aad soo gelisay.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"tag-schedule","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Soo geli jadwalka calaamadaha sida tirooyin","summary":"Jadwalka calaamadaha oo laga dhoofiyay qalabka dhismaha (CSV) wuxuu noqdaa tirooyin nooc la qeexay xisaabintaada, mid kasta calaamad, si tirooyinka qalabka iyo waxa aad cabbirtay ay u istaagaan wada.","section":"tasks","order":77,"keywords":["calaamadaha","jadwalka calaamadaha","qalabka dhismaha","bimcraft","ifc","tirooyinka","csv","jadwal","soo geli","tiro nooc"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-la-xusuusto","text":"Waxa la xusuusto","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadaha\u003C/span\u003E oo ku yaal qalabka waxay soo gelisaa jadwal calaamadeed oo BimCraft u kaydiyay sidii fayl CSV. Calaamad kasta oo kala duwan waxay noqotaa tiro nooc la qeexay, isla nooca uu jar iyo buuxinta CivilCraft u noqdo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBimCraft, samee jadwalka calaamadaha aad rabto oo u kaydi CSV.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadaha\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro faylka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESheeg tiirka uu safka magacaysay (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMagacii safka ku xidh\u003C/span\u003E, badanaa calaamadda) iyo tiirka uu lambarka hayo (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirada ka soo qaad\u003C/span\u003E). Marka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiri safafka\u003C/span\u003E la doorto, safka kasta wuxuu tirinayaa hal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro unugga. Dherer mitir millimitar ah wuxuu noqdaa mitir marka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhufo\u003C/span\u003E 0.001.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar tirooyinka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafafka calaamad isku mid ah waa la isku daraa. Unug aan lambar ahayn waa la reebaa oo waxaa lagu tiriyaa koobka. Jadwalka isku mid ah mar kale soo gelinta wuxuu cusboonaysiinayaa tirooyinka hore ee haysid, halkii uu ku dari lahaa kuwo cusub; magacyadooda, qiimayaashooda iyo qashinkoodu waa kuwaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-xusuusto\"\u003EWaxa la xusuusto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETiro nooc la qeexay lama cabbiro xaashi, sidaas darteed ma leh calaamado. Wax looma dirin meel; faylka halkan ayaa la akhriyaa.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Calaamadaha oo ku yaal qalabka waxay soo gelisaa jadwal calaamadeed oo BimCraft u kaydiyay sidii fayl CSV. Calaamad kasta oo kala duwan waxay noqotaa tiro nooc la qeexay, isla nooca uu jar iyo buuxinta CivilCraft u noqdo. BimCraft, samee jadwalka calaamadaha aad rabto oo u kaydi CSV. Dooro Calaamadaha oo dooro faylka. Sheeg tiirka uu safka magacaysay (Magacii safka ku xidh, badanaa calaamadda) iyo tiirka uu lambarka hayo (Tirada ka soo qaad). Marka Tiri safafka la doorto, safka kasta wuxuu tirinayaa hal. Dooro unugga. Dherer mitir millimitar ah wuxuu noqdaa mitir marka Ku dhufo 0.001. Ku dar tirooyinka. Safafka calaamad isku mid ah waa la isku daraa. Unug aan lambar ahayn waa la reebaa oo waxaa lagu tiriyaa koobka. Jadwalka isku mid ah mar kale soo gelinta wuxuu cusboonaysiinayaa tirooyinka hore ee haysid, halkii uu ku dari lahaa kuwo cusub; magacyadooda, qiimayaashooda iyo qashinkoodu waa kuwaaga. Waxa la xusuusto Tiro nooc la qeexay lama cabbiro xaashi, sidaas darteed ma leh calaamado. Wax looma dirin meel; faylka halkan ayaa la akhriyaa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"assemblies","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Isku-dhisyada iyo qaacidooyinka","summary":"Ku dar qaybaha walxa, oo qaacidooyinku ha u beddelaan dherer, bal ama tiro dhagaxyo, saxano, xaashiyo loox, kontaree iyo qalab, iyadoo la isticmaalayo darbi la shaqeeyey.","section":"tasks","order":80,"keywords":["isku-dhis","qaybaha","qaacido","dhagaxyo","saxano","xaashiyo loox","kontaree","yard kuwaad","qalab","cunto","caadi","qaybaha walxa"],"headings":[{"id":"doorsoomayaasha-aad-isticmaali-karto","text":"Doorsoomayaasha aad isticmaali karto","level":2},{"id":"tusaale-la-shaqeeyey-darbi-gudaha","text":"Tusaale la shaqeeyey: darbi gudaha","level":2},{"id":"qaacido-kale","text":"Qaacido kale","level":2},{"id":"marka-qaacidadu-khaldan-tahay","text":"Marka qaacidadu khaldan tahay","level":2},{"id":"xaddidaadaha","text":"Xaddidaadaha","level":2},{"id":"ka-saar-qaybta","text":"Ka saar qaybta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIsku-dhisku ee walxa (\u003Cstrong\u003Eassembly\u003C/strong\u003E) waa liis qaybo ah, mid kastaa leeyahay qaacido tiro iyo qashin iyo heerarkiisa. Qaacidadu waxay isticmaashaa wadarta la cabbiray ee walxa, sidaas darteed hal cabbir oo darbi ah waxay kuu siinaysaa dhagaxyo, saxano iyo loox isla mar, waxayna cusboonaanayaan marka aad cabbirto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"doorsoomayaasha-aad-isticmaali-karto\"\u003EDoorsoomayaasha aad isticmaali karto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENooca walxa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorsoomayaasha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E dherer, \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E joog, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E bedka darbiga (L × H), \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E tirada socodsiinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBedka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E bedka, \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E wareegga (kontuur + goyn), \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E qoto ama dhumucda, \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E tirada bedadka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E tiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQiimaha waxaa lagu qoraa unugyada walxa: feet iyo square feet walxyada LF iyo SF, mitir iyo square mitir walxyada m iyo m². Walxa SY, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E waa square yard, \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E waxay ku sii jiraan feet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaacidooyinku waxay isticmaalaan \u003Ccode\u003E+ - * /\u003C/code\u003E (ama × ÷), qawsyo, lambarro, iyo hawlaha \u003Ccode\u003Eceil\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efloor\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eround\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emin\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emax\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Eabs\u003C/code\u003E. Xeerarka oo dhan waxay ku jiraan \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/formulas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/formulas\"\u003ELuuqadda qaacidada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tusaale-la-shaqeeyey-darbi-gudaha\"\u003ETusaale la shaqeeyey: darbi gudaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad cabbirtay \u003Cstrong\u003EDarbiga gudaha nooca A\u003C/strong\u003E sida walxa khadka ah: 4 socodsiin oo wadarteeda 120 LF, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight\u003C/span\u003E oo la dejiyay \u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. Qiimaha \u003Cstrong\u003ELa cabbiray\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu akhrinayaa L = 120, N = 4, A = 1,080 (SF darbi, hal dhinac).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro walxa hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssembly\u003C/span\u003E, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd component\u003C/span\u003E. Qayb magaceeda &quot;Component&quot; ayaa soo muuqda, qaacidadeeda \u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E iyo natiijadeeda hoosteeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor \u003Ccode\u003EStuds 16 in o.c.\u003C/code\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EName\u003C/span\u003E gudahana \u003Ccode\u003EEA\u003C/code\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnit\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantity formula\u003C/span\u003E ku qor \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L * 12 / 16) + N\u003C/code\u003E. Natiijadu way cusboonaanaysaa markaad qorto: &quot;= 94 EA&quot;. Taasi waa hal dhagax kasta 16 inch oo ku socda 120 feet (90), oo lagu daray mid kale si loo xidho 4 socodsiin kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMar kale dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd component\u003C/span\u003E saxanada: magaca \u003Ccode\u003EPlates, top and bottom\u003C/code\u003E, unugga \u003Ccode\u003ELF\u003C/code\u003E, qaacidada \u003Ccode\u003EL * 2\u003C/code\u003E. Natiijo: 240 LF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar loox: magaca \u003Ccode\u003EGypsum board 4x8, both sides\u003C/code\u003E, unugga \u003Ccode\u003Esheets\u003C/code\u003E, qaacidada \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 2 / 32)\u003C/code\u003E. Natiijo: 68 xaashi (2,160 SF loox ÷ 32 SF xaashi kasta = 67.5, oo la soo wareejiyay).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBuuxi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaste %\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterial $\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabor $\u003C/span\u003E qayb kasta. Qayb kasta waxay leedahay safkeeda u gaar ah hoosta walxa ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E, waana lagu qiimeeyaa sida walxa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJob total\u003C/span\u003E waxay ku jirtaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii kharashka darbiga oo dhan ku jiro qaybaha, ka dhig heerarka agabka iyo shaqada ee walxa 0, si aan wax mar labo ah loo tirin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQashinka waxaa lagu dabaqaa qaacidada ka dib, mana wareegna: 68 xaashi oo leh 10% qashin waa 74.8 xaashi. Si aad u dalbato xaashiyo oo dhan, geli qashinka gudaha qaacidada, sida \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 2 / 32 * 1.1)\u003C/code\u003E, oo qashinka qaybta ka dhig 0.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaacido-kale\"\u003EQaacido kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWalxa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQaacido\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhagaxyo 24 in dhexdhexaad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L / 2) + N\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDahaadhka dhareeraha, SF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadka leh joog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERang, labada dhinac, galoon 350 SF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadka leh joog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 2 / 350)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKatoonada tiilasha 15 SF, 10% dheeraad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBedka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 1.1 / 15)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaldhig ama xadka, LF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBedka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKontaree, yard kuwaad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBedka leh qoto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA * H / 27\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKontaree lagu wareejiyay rubuc yard\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBedka leh qoto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * H / 27 * 4) / 4\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhegaha, saddex albaab kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN * 3\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUgu yaraan hal kartoon, mid kasta 12\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emax(1, ceil(N / 12))\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-qaacidadu-khaldan-tahay\"\u003EMarka qaacidadu khaldan tahay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhadka hoosta qaacidada wuxuu noqdaa fariin khalad, tusaale \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;X&quot; is not a measured value here. Use L, H, A, N.\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003EA &quot;)&quot; is missing.\u003C/code\u003E Qaybtaas ma leh tirooyin, safkeeda ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa &quot;Khalad qaacido: …&quot;, headerka wuxuuna leeyahay &quot;Dhammaystirna la&#039;aan: 1 khalad qaacido (lama soo koobin wadarta)&quot;. Qaacidada saxda ka dib, wadarta way cusboonaanaysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaacido u qaybisa eber sidoo kale waa khalad (&quot;The formula divides by zero.&quot;), tusaale \u003Ccode\u003EA / H\u003C/code\u003E walxa aan qoto lahayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaddidaadaha\"\u003EXaddidaadaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaacidooyinku waxay ku shaqeeyaan \u003Cstrong\u003Ewadarta\u003C/strong\u003E walxa, ma aha socodsiin socodsiin. \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L * 12 / 16) + N\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu ku daraa hal dhagax socodsiin kasta; weli ma jiro wareejin socodsiin kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaacidu waxay isticmaali kartaa doorsoomayaasha walxa u gaar ah oo keliya, ma aha kuwa walxa kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIlaa 50 qayb walxa kasta, iyo 500 xaraf qaacido kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-saar-qaybta\"\u003EKa saar qaybta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove component\u003C/span\u003E hoosteeda. Waxaad ku noqon kartaa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Isku-dhisku ee walxa (assembly) waa liis qaybo ah, mid kastaa leeyahay qaacido tiro iyo qashin iyo heerarkiisa. Qaacidadu waxay isticmaashaa wadarta la cabbiray ee walxa, sidaas darteed hal cabbir oo darbi ah waxay kuu siinaysaa dhagaxyo, saxano iyo loox isla mar, waxayna cusboonaanayaan marka aad cabbirto. Doorsoomayaasha aad isticmaali karto Nooca walxa Doorsoomayaasha Khadka L dherer, H joog, A bedka darbiga (L × H), N tirada socodsiinta Bedka A bedka, P wareegga (kontuur + goyn), H qoto ama dhumucda, N tirada bedadka Tiro N tiro Qiimaha waxaa lagu qoraa unugyada walxa: feet iyo square feet walxyada LF iyo SF, mitir iyo square mitir walxyada m iyo m². Walxa SY, A waa square yard, P iyo H waxay ku sii jiraan feet. Qaacidooyinku waxay isticmaalaan + - * / (ama × ÷), qawsyo, lambarro, iyo hawlaha ceil, floor, round, min, max iyo abs. Xeerarka oo dhan waxay ku jiraan Luuqadda qaacidada. Tusaale la shaqeeyey: darbi gudaha Waxaad cabbirtay Darbiga gudaha nooca A sida walxa khadka ah: 4 socodsiin oo wadarteeda 120 LF, iyo Height oo la dejiyay 9'-0\". Qiimaha La cabbiray wuxuu akhrinayaa L = 120, N = 4, A = 1,080 (SF darbi, hal dhinac). Dooro walxa hoosta Items. Ku Assembly, dooro Add component. Qayb magaceeda \"Component\" ayaa soo muuqda, qaacidadeeda L iyo natiijadeeda hoosteeda. Ku qor Studs 16 in o.c. Name gudahana EA Unit. Quantity formula ku qor ceil(L * 12 / 16) + N. Natiijadu way cusboonaanaysaa markaad qorto: \"= 94 EA\". Taasi waa hal dhagax kasta 16 inch oo ku socda 120 feet (90), oo lagu daray mid kale si loo xidho 4 socodsiin kasta. Mar kale dooro Add component saxanada: magaca Plates, top and bottom, unugga LF, qaacidada L * 2. Natiijo: 240 LF. Ku dar loox: magaca Gypsum board 4x8, both sides, unugga sheets, qaacidada ceil(A * 2 / 32). Natiijo: 68 xaashi (2,160 SF loox ÷ 32 SF xaashi kasta = 67.5, oo la soo wareejiyay). Buuxi Waste %, Material $ iyo Labor $ qayb kasta. Qayb kasta waxay leedahay safkeeda u gaar ah hoosta walxa ee Quantities, waana lagu qiimeeyaa sida walxa, Job total waxay ku jirtaa. Haddii kharashka darbiga oo dhan ku jiro qaybaha, ka dhig heerarka agabka iyo shaqada ee walxa 0, si aan wax mar labo ah loo tirin. Qashinka waxaa lagu dabaqaa qaacidada ka dib, mana wareegna: 68 xaashi oo leh 10% qashin waa 74.8 xaashi. Si aad u dalbato xaashiyo oo dhan, geli qashinka gudaha qaacidada, sida ceil(A * 2 / 32 * 1.1), oo qashinka qaybta ka dhig 0. Qaacido kale Waxa Walxa Qaacido Dhagaxyo 24 in dhexdhexaad Khadka ceil(L / 2) + N Dahaadhka dhareeraha, SF Khadka leh joog A Rang, labada dhinac, galoon 350 SF Khadka leh joog ceil(A * 2 / 350) Katoonada tiilasha 15 SF, 10% dheeraad Bedka ceil(A * 1.1 / 15) Saldhig ama xadka, LF Bedka P Kontaree, yard kuwaad Bedka leh qoto A * H / 27 Kontaree lagu wareejiyay rubuc yard Bedka leh qoto ceil(A * H / 27 * 4) / 4 Dhegaha, saddex albaab kasta Tiro N * 3 Ugu yaraan hal kartoon, mid kasta 12 Tiro max(1, ceil(N / 12)) Marka qaacidadu khaldan tahay Khadka hoosta qaacidada wuxuu noqdaa fariin khalad, tusaale \"X\" is not a measured value here. Use L, H, A, N. ama A \")\" is missing. Qaybtaas ma leh tirooyin, safkeeda ee Quantities wuxuu muujinayaa \"Khalad qaacido: …\", headerka wuxuuna leeyahay \"Dhammaystirna la'aan: 1 khalad qaacido (lama soo koobin wadarta)\". Qaacidada saxda ka dib, wadarta way cusboonaanaysaa. Qaacido u qaybisa eber sidoo kale waa khalad (\"The formula divides by zero.\"), tusaale A / H walxa aan qoto lahayn. Xaddidaadaha Qaacidooyinku waxay ku shaqeeyaan wadarta walxa, ma aha socodsiin socodsiin. ceil(L * 12 / 16) + N wuxuu ku daraa hal dhagax socodsiin kasta; weli ma jiro wareejin socodsiin kasta. Qaacidu waxay isticmaali kartaa doorsoomayaasha walxa u gaar ah oo keliya, ma aha kuwa walxa kale. Ilaa 50 qayb walxa kasta, iyo 500 xaraf qaacido kasta. Ka saar qaybta Dooro Remove component hoosteeda. Waxaad ku noqon kartaa Ctrl+Z.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"price-library","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Maktabadda qiimaha","summary":"Ku hay alaabtaada, qiimahaaga iyo isku-dhisyadaada maktabad, ka soo geli CSV ama qiyaas hore, ku dar walxaha xisaabinta kasta, oo cusboonaysii qiimaha xisaabintaada ka.","section":"tasks","order":82,"keywords":["maktabad","xirmooyinka shaqada","liiska qiimaha","buug qiimaha","kaydka kharashka","soo geli csv","qiimaha","isku-dhisyo","dib-u-isticmaal","walxaha tusaalaha","cusboonaysii qiimaha","dib-u-qiimee"],"headings":[{"id":"buuxi-maktabadda","text":"Buuxi maktabadda","level":2},{"id":"ku-isticmaal-xisaabinta","text":"Ku isticmaal xisaabinta","level":2},{"id":"tiirarka-csv","text":"Tiirarka CSV","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMaktabadda qiimaha\u003C/strong\u003E waxay hayaa walxaha aad shaqo kasta isticmaasho: nooceeda, unit-kiisa, dhererkiisa, qashinkiisa, qiimaha alaabta iyo shaqaalaha, iyo isku-dhiskiisa. Waxaa lagu hayaa browser-kan, kana madax-banaan xisaabinta kasta, si xisaabin kasta oo aad ka furto halkan ay uga faa&#039;iidaysato.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaktabad\u003C/span\u003E sare ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E daaqadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buuxi-maktabadda\"\u003EBuuxi maktabadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa soo geli CSV…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhriyaa xaashi la kaydiyay sida CSV (eeg tiirarka hoose). Walxaha magaciisa iyo nooceeda horay ugu jira maktabadda waa la beddelaa; kuwa kale waa la daraa. Safafka aan la akhrin karin waa la dhaafaa, wuxuuna sheegaa kuwa iyo sababta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar walxaha xisaabintan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu nuqul ka sameeyaa walx kasta oo xisaabinta furan, qiimahooda iyo isku-dhiskooda (ma aha calaamadahooda).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQiyaasta CSV ee TakeoffCraft dhoofiyo (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003EDhoofi qiyaasta\u003C/a\u003E) wuxuu si toos ah u soo galaa: qiimaha shaqada hore wuxuu bilaabaa kan xiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXirmooyinka shaqada…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa isku-dhisyo bilaasho shaqo, sida drywall, korontada ama kontaraakhtarka, iyadoo aan qiimo lahayn. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003EXirmooyinka shaqada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi CSV\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu maktabadda ku kaydiyaa CSV, si aad nuqul u hayso, spreadsheet-ka uga tafatirto ama saaxiibkaaga siiso. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENadiifi\u003C/span\u003E wuu madhiyaa (riix laba jeer).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaktabaddu waxay ku nooshahay kaydka browser-kan. Browser kale, kombiyuutar kale ama daaqad gaar ah waxay leedahay mid kaloon (ama mid aan lahayn). Dhoofi si aad u guuriso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-isticmaal-xisaabinta\"\u003EKu isticmaal xisaabinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadee walxaha (ku qor \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa raadi maktabadda\u003C/span\u003E si aad liiska u yareyso) kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar xisaabinta\u003C/span\u003E. Waa lagu daraa isku-dhisyadooda hal tallaabo, taas oo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ka noqdiyaa. Magac horay uga jira xisaabinta wuxuu helaa lambar, sida \u003Ccode\u003ECarpet (2)\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusboonaysii qiimaha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu walxaha xisaabinta siiyaa qashinka iyo qiimaha maktabadda, walax kasta oo magaciisa iyo nooceedu isku mid yihiin walxa maktabadda, iyo sidoo kale qaybaha isku-dhiska ee magac isku mid ah. Dhererka, unitsyada iyo qaacidooyinka way joogaan sida ay yihiin. Hal \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu dib u celiyaa dhammaan qiimihii hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tiirarka-csv\"\u003ETiirarka CSV\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafka koowaad wuxuu magacaabaa tiirarka, siday kasta u jiraan; tiirarka kale waa la dhaafaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETiir\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ku jira\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItem (ama Name)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca walxa. Waa loo baahan yahay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EType\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear, Area ama Count (LF, SF iyo EA sidoo kale way shaqeeyaan). Haddii madhan la reebo, unit-ku go&#039;aamiyaa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF ama m; SF, SY ama m²; EA. Madhan: unit-ka caadiga ah ee nooca.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaste %\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E10%\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial per unit, Labor per unit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiimo sida \u003Ccode\u003E2.10\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E$1,250\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHeight (ama Depth)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E9\u003C/code\u003E, ama \u003Ccode\u003E2.7\u003C/code\u003E unitsyada metric-ka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EComponent, Formula\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafka leh magac Component (ama Type \u003Ccode\u003EComponent\u003C/code\u003E) waa qayb isku-dhiska walxa ka sare. Unit, Waste iyo qiimihiisu gaarka u yihiin; Formula-ku wuxuu isticmaalaa xarfaha walxa, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EIsku-dhisyada iyo qaacidooyinka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EItem,Type,Unit,Waste %,Material per unit,Labor per unit,Height,Component,Formula\nPartition type A,Linear,LF,10,2.10,3.33,9&#039;-0&quot;,,\n,Component,EA,,4.25,,,Studs 16 in. o.c.,ceil(L / 1.333) + N\nVCT flooring,Area,SF,5,1.85,1.10,,,\nDuplex outlets,Count,EA,,3.50,45,,,\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKala-soocidda tiirarka ee commas, semicolons ama tabs dhammaantood way shaqeeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Maktabadda qiimaha waxay hayaa walxaha aad shaqo kasta isticmaasho: nooceeda, unit-kiisa, dhererkiisa, qashinkiisa, qiimaha alaabta iyo shaqaalaha, iyo isku-dhiskiisa. Waxaa lagu hayaa browser-kan, kana madax-banaan xisaabinta kasta, si xisaabin kasta oo aad ka furto halkan ay uga faa'iidaysato. Ku fur Maktabad sare ee Walxaha daaqadda. Buuxi maktabadda Ka soo geli CSV… wuxuu akhriyaa xaashi la kaydiyay sida CSV (eeg tiirarka hoose). Walxaha magaciisa iyo nooceeda horay ugu jira maktabadda waa la beddelaa; kuwa kale waa la daraa. Safafka aan la akhrin karin waa la dhaafaa, wuxuuna sheegaa kuwa iyo sababta. Ku dar walxaha xisaabintan wuxuu nuqul ka sameeyaa walx kasta oo xisaabinta furan, qiimahooda iyo isku-dhiskooda (ma aha calaamadahooda). Qiyaasta CSV ee TakeoffCraft dhoofiyo (Dhoofi qiyaasta) wuxuu si toos ah u soo galaa: qiimaha shaqada hore wuxuu bilaabaa kan xiga. Xirmooyinka shaqada… wuxuu ku daraa isku-dhisyo bilaasho shaqo, sida drywall, korontada ama kontaraakhtarka, iyadoo aan qiimo lahayn. Eeg Xirmooyinka shaqada. Dhoofi CSV wuxuu maktabadda ku kaydiyaa CSV, si aad nuqul u hayso, spreadsheet-ka uga tafatirto ama saaxiibkaaga siiso. Nadiifi wuu madhiyaa (riix laba jeer). Maktabaddu waxay ku nooshahay kaydka browser-kan. Browser kale, kombiyuutar kale ama daaqad gaar ah waxay leedahay mid kaloon (ama mid aan lahayn). Dhoofi si aad u guuriso. Ku isticmaal xisaabinta Calaamadee walxaha (ku qor Ka raadi maktabadda si aad liiska u yareyso) kadibna dooro Ku dar xisaabinta. Waa lagu daraa isku-dhisyadooda hal tallaabo, taas oo Ctrl+Z ka noqdiyaa. Magac horay uga jira xisaabinta wuxuu helaa lambar, sida Carpet (2). Cusboonaysii qiimaha wuxuu walxaha xisaabinta siiyaa qashinka iyo qiimaha maktabadda, walax kasta oo magaciisa iyo nooceedu isku mid yihiin walxa maktabadda, iyo sidoo kale qaybaha isku-dhiska ee magac isku mid ah. Dhererka, unitsyada iyo qaacidooyinka way joogaan sida ay yihiin. Hal Ctrl+Z wuxuu dib u celiyaa dhammaan qiimihii hore. Tiirarka CSV Safka koowaad wuxuu magacaabaa tiirarka, siday kasta u jiraan; tiirarka kale waa la dhaafaa. Tiir Waxa ku jira Item (ama Name) Magaca walxa. Waa loo baahan yahay. Type Linear, Area ama Count (LF, SF iyo EA sidoo kale way shaqeeyaan). Haddii madhan la reebo, unit-ku go'aamiyaa. Unit LF ama m; SF, SY ama m²; EA. Madhan: unit-ka caadiga ah ee nooca. Waste % 10 ama 10%. Material per unit, Labor per unit Qiimo sida 2.10 ama $1,250. Height (ama Depth) 9'-0\", 9, ama 2.7 unitsyada metric-ka. Component, Formula Safka leh magac Component (ama Type Component) waa qayb isku-dhiska walxa ka sare. Unit, Waste iyo qiimihiisu gaarka u yihiin; Formula-ku wuxuu isticmaalaa xarfaha walxa, eeg Isku-dhisyada iyo qaacidooyinka. Item,Type,Unit,Waste %,Material per unit,Labor per unit,Height,Component,Formula Partition type A,Linear,LF,10,2.10,3.33,9'-0\",, ,Component,EA,,4.25,,,Studs 16 in. o.c.,ceil(L / 1.333) + N VCT flooring,Area,SF,5,1.85,1.10,,, Duplex outlets,Count,EA,,3.50,45,,, Kala-soocidda tiirarka ee commas, semicolons ama tabs dhammaantood way shaqeeyaan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"trade-packs","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Xirmooyinka shaqada","summary":"Ku dar isku-dhisyo bilaash ah oo shaqo gaar ah Maktabadda qiimahaaga, ka saar hal tallaabo, oo la wadaago maktabaddaada sidii xirmo.","section":"tasks","order":83,"keywords":["xirmo shaqo","xirmo","isku-dhisyo","qaababka","shayada bilowga","korontada","darbiga ballaaran","qaab dhismeed","rinjiga","cusub","dhulka","dhagaxa","saqafka","daboolka","naqshadda","qalabka","biyaha","hvac","kulaylka","deck","kontaraktarka guud","csi","masterformat","cc0","ku dar","ka saar","wadaag"],"headings":[{"id":"ku-dar-xirmo","text":"Ku dar xirmo","level":2},{"id":"ka-saar-xirmo","text":"Ka saar xirmo","level":2},{"id":"waxa-ku-jira-xirmada","text":"Waxa ku jira xirmada","level":2},{"id":"wadaag-maktabaddaada-sidii-xirmo","text":"Wadaag maktabaddaada sidii xirmo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXirmada shaqada\u003C/strong\u003E waa kooxda shayo diyaar ah oo shaqo gaar ah: mid kasta wuxuu leeyahay unugga, dhererka ama qoto-dheeftiisa, qashinkiisa iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eisku-dhiskiisa\u003C/strong\u003E, kaas oo ah qaybaha iyo qaacidooyinka u beddela socod, aag ama tiro la cabbiray agab. Darbi ballaaran, tusaale ahaan, wuxuu keenaa jidkiisa, tiirarkiisa, xaashiyadiisa, boolooyinkiisa, teebkiisa iyo garaaca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXirmooyinka waxaa lagu daraa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/price-library\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/price-library\"\u003EMaktabadda qiimaha\u003C/a\u003E kaaga, halkaas oo aad ku dari karto shayadooda xisaabinta kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar-xirmo\"\u003EKu dar xirmo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaktabad\u003C/span\u003E oo ku yaal sare \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E ee daaqadda, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXirmooyinka shaqada…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnug-yada\u003C/span\u003E: imperial (LF, SF), metric (m, m²) ama labadaba. Isku-dhis kasta labada nidaam buu ku jiraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar\u003C/span\u003E xagga xirmada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShayada xirmada ayaa ku soo muuqata maktabadda, oo lagu calaamadeeyay magaca xirmada. Si aad u isticmaasho, calaamee shayada maktabadda oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar xisaabinta\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXirmadu ma keento qiime.\u003C/strong\u003E Shayadeeda maktabadda waxay muujinaysaa &quot;dejin qiimahaaga&quot;. Qiimuhu waa kaagii: ku qor maktabadda ama tafatirka shayga, ama ku soo geli liiskaaga qiimaha CSV oo isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusboonaysii qiimaha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad hore u haysatay shay magac iyo nooc isku mid ah maktabaddaada, xirmadu waxay kaaga tagtaa sidii ay tahay. Mar kale ku dar xirmo ayaa beddelaysa shayadeeda isaga gaarka ah nooca cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-saar-xirmo\"\u003EKa saar xirmo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXirmooyinka shaqada…\u003C/span\u003E, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar\u003C/span\u003E xagga xirmada aad ku dartay, kadibna mar kale si aad u xaqiijiso. Shay kasta oo ka timid waxay ka baxdaa maktabadda hal tallaabo. Shayada aad hore ugu dartay xisaabinta way ku sii jiraan xisaabintaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-ku-jira-xirmada\"\u003EWaxa ku jira xirmada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlaha iyo faahfaahinta\u003C/span\u003E hoos xirmada si aad u aragto waxa isku-dhis kasta laga qoray: xeerarka dhismaha, heerarka iyo hagayaasha rakibidda ee ururrada shaqada. Maktabadda, shay kasta ku dhex hadhow tilmaamaha ayaad ku arki kartaa ilaha iyo malo-awaalahooda, sida masaafada dhuumaha ama xawaaraha rinjiga. Hubi kuwaas shaqadaada iyo xogta alaabtaada, oo beddel qaacidooyinka meelaha ay ka duwan yihiin (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EIsku-dhisyada iyo qaacidooyinka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXirmo kasta waxa lagu calaamadeeyay \u003Cstrong\u003EBilow: qiyaasayaal wali ma eegin\u003C/strong\u003E ilaa qiyaasayaasha shaqada ee khibrada leh ay dib u eegaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShay kasta waxa kale oo ku jira lambarka CSI MasterFormat, sida \u003Ccode\u003E09 21 16\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wadaag-maktabaddaada-sidii-xirmo\"\u003EWadaag maktabaddaada sidii xirmo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU dhoofi xirmo…\u003C/span\u003E gudaha maktabadda wuxuu kaydiyaa fayl xirmo (\u003Ccode\u003E.ccpack.json\u003C/code\u003E) oo qof kasta ku dari karo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur fayl xirmo…\u003C/span\u003E. Caadi ahaan wuu ka reebaa shayada ka timid xirmooyinka aad ku darteen, wuxuuna ka reebaa qiimaha. Calaamee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar heerarkayga tusaalooyin ahaan\u003C/span\u003E si aad qiimahaaga u dirto: waxay u yimaadaan calaamad gobolka iyo taariikhda aad siiso, qofkii ku daraa xirmada wuxuu go&#039;aaminayaa inuu isticmaalo iyo midna.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylasha xirmada waa xog qeexan oo kaliya, ma aha barnaamij. TakeoffCraft wuxuu hubiyaa qayb kasta oo ka mid ah ka hor inta uusan isticmaalin, wuxuuna ka reebaa wax aan akhrisan karin.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Xirmada shaqada waa kooxda shayo diyaar ah oo shaqo gaar ah: mid kasta wuxuu leeyahay unugga, dhererka ama qoto-dheeftiisa, qashinkiisa iyo isku-dhiskiisa, kaas oo ah qaybaha iyo qaacidooyinka u beddela socod, aag ama tiro la cabbiray agab. Darbi ballaaran, tusaale ahaan, wuxuu keenaa jidkiisa, tiirarkiisa, xaashiyadiisa, boolooyinkiisa, teebkiisa iyo garaaca. Xirmooyinka waxaa lagu daraa Maktabadda qiimaha kaaga, halkaas oo aad ku dari karto shayadooda xisaabinta kasta. Ku dar xirmo Fur Maktabad oo ku yaal sare Walxaha ee daaqadda, kadibna Xirmooyinka shaqada…. Dooro Unug-yada: imperial (LF, SF), metric (m, m²) ama labadaba. Isku-dhis kasta labada nidaam buu ku jiraa. Dooro Ku dar xagga xirmada. Shayada xirmada ayaa ku soo muuqata maktabadda, oo lagu calaamadeeyay magaca xirmada. Si aad u isticmaasho, calaamee shayada maktabadda oo dooro Ku dar xisaabinta. Xirmadu ma keento qiime. Shayadeeda maktabadda waxay muujinaysaa \"dejin qiimahaaga\". Qiimuhu waa kaagii: ku qor maktabadda ama tafatirka shayga, ama ku soo geli liiskaaga qiimaha CSV oo isticmaal Cusboonaysii qiimaha. Haddii aad hore u haysatay shay magac iyo nooc isku mid ah maktabaddaada, xirmadu waxay kaaga tagtaa sidii ay tahay. Mar kale ku dar xirmo ayaa beddelaysa shayadeeda isaga gaarka ah nooca cusub. Ka saar xirmo Gudaha Xirmooyinka shaqada…, dooro Ka saar xagga xirmada aad ku dartay, kadibna mar kale si aad u xaqiijiso. Shay kasta oo ka timid waxay ka baxdaa maktabadda hal tallaabo. Shayada aad hore ugu dartay xisaabinta way ku sii jiraan xisaabintaas. Waxa ku jira xirmada Dooro Ilaha iyo faahfaahinta hoos xirmada si aad u aragto waxa isku-dhis kasta laga qoray: xeerarka dhismaha, heerarka iyo hagayaasha rakibidda ee ururrada shaqada. Maktabadda, shay kasta ku dhex hadhow tilmaamaha ayaad ku arki kartaa ilaha iyo malo-awaalahooda, sida masaafada dhuumaha ama xawaaraha rinjiga. Hubi kuwaas shaqadaada iyo xogta alaabtaada, oo beddel qaacidooyinka meelaha ay ka duwan yihiin (eeg Isku-dhisyada iyo qaacidooyinka). Xirmo kasta waxa lagu calaamadeeyay Bilow: qiyaasayaal wali ma eegin ilaa qiyaasayaasha shaqada ee khibrada leh ay dib u eegaan. Shay kasta waxa kale oo ku jira lambarka CSI MasterFormat, sida 09 21 16. Wadaag maktabaddaada sidii xirmo U dhoofi xirmo… gudaha maktabadda wuxuu kaydiyaa fayl xirmo (.ccpack.json) oo qof kasta ku dari karo Fur fayl xirmo…. Caadi ahaan wuu ka reebaa shayada ka timid xirmooyinka aad ku darteen, wuxuuna ka reebaa qiimaha. Calaamee Ku dar heerarkayga tusaalooyin ahaan si aad qiimahaaga u dirto: waxay u yimaadaan calaamad gobolka iyo taariikhda aad siiso, qofkii ku daraa xirmada wuxuu go'aaminayaa inuu isticmaalo iyo midna. Faylasha xirmada waa xog qeexan oo kaliya, ma aha barnaamij. TakeoffCraft wuxuu hubiyaa qayb kasta oo ka mid ah ka hor inta uusan isticmaalin, wuxuuna ka reebaa wax aan akhrisan karin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"earthwork","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Dhulka shaqada iyo dhererka barta","summary":"Calaamadi dhererka barta ee sawirka goobta, u gudbi CivilCraft si ay u samayso dusha iyo jarista iyo buuxinta, oo halkan ka qaado tirooyinka fudud ee keenista.","section":"tasks","order":84,"keywords":["dhulka shaqada","keenis","jar","buuxin","jar iyo buuxin","sawirka dhulka","dhererka barta","dhererka","topo","dusha","saddex-geesood","civilcraft","barta","pnezd","god khadka"],"headings":[{"id":"keenista-fudud-halkan","text":"Keenista fudud halkan","level":2},{"id":"dhererka-barta-ee-civilcraft","text":"Dhererka barta ee CivilCraft","level":2},{"id":"jarista-iyo-buuxinta-civilcraft","text":"Jarista iyo buuxinta CivilCraft","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffCraft wuxuu qiyaasaa waxa lagu rejeeyay sawirka. Dhulka shaqadu waxay u baahan tahay dusha dhulka, sidaas darteed waxay la wadaagtaa CivilCraft, kaas oo ka dhisa duushaha barta, u sinaysa, oo xisaabiya jarista, buuxinta iyo gaadiidka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"keenista-fudud-halkan\"\u003EKeenista fudud halkan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhul loo keenay hal qoto ah, shay leh \u003Cstrong\u003Eqoto\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa ku filan: mugga = ballac × qoto. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003EXirmada ganacsiga guud\u003C/a\u003E waxay leedahay shay keenis dhul oo weyn (mugga dhulka dabiiciga ah, mugga dhulka furan iyo tirada gaadiidka baabuurta) iyo shay god khadka (keenista, saldhigga iyo dib-u-buuxinta iyada oo loo eegayo dherer iyo qoto).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhererka-barta-ee-civilcraft\"\u003EDhererka barta ee CivilCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDejji miisaanka sawirka goobta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamee shay \u003Cstrong\u003ETiro\u003C/strong\u003E, tusaale ahaan &quot;Dhulka jira&quot;, oo riix dhererka barta kasta ee sawirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro calaamad oo ku qor \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhererka\u003C/span\u003E panelka \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadda la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E102.5\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E102&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E31.24 m\u003C/code\u003E. Dhererka taban iyo eber labaduba way fiican yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofin\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhererka barta\u003C/span\u003E. Waxaad heleysaa fayl barta (\u003Ccode\u003E.csv\u003C/code\u003E) oo leh Point, Northing, Easting, Elevation iyo Description, hal safka mid kasta oo calaamadsan ee sawirka furan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur faylkaas CivilCraft (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/import-points\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/import-points\"\u003ESoo dhoofi barta\u003C/a\u003E). Waxay ka dhisaysaa dusha barta (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/build-surface\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/build-surface\"\u003EDhis dusha\u003C/a\u003E); halkaas ka dib waxay isbarbardhigtaa duushaha oo siisaa jarista iyo buuxinta (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/volumes\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/volumes\"\u003EMugga\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENorthing iyo easting waa isku-xidhka sawirka laftiisa, oo ah feet, oo laga qaaday geeska bogga iyada oo la eegayo miisaankiisa. Masaafooyinka iyo mugga udhaxeeya barta waa sax, laakiin ma aha isku-xidhka sahanka goobtaada. Markaad u baahato, u wareeji isku-xidhka goobta CivilCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBarta laga soo qaaday sawirro kala duwan ma wadaagaan isku-xidhka, sidaas darteed dhoofintu waxay qaadaa sawirka furan oo keliya. Dhererka waxa lagu kaydiyaa xisaabinta qadarka waxaana lagu wareejiyaa koobiyee iyo dhaji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jarista-iyo-buuxinta-civilcraft\"\u003EJarista iyo buuxinta CivilCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShaqada dhulka ee CivilCraft waxay ku soo noqotaa laba shay oo aad qiimayn karto:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECivilCraft, ku qiyaas padsyada iyo jidadka, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU dir TakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EDhulka shaqada\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/volumes\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/volumes\"\u003EMugga dhulka shaqada\u003C/a\u003E). Waxay kaydinaysaa fayl tirooyin (\u003Ccode\u003E.quantities.json\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETakeoffCraft, ku fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur xisaabinta\u003C/span\u003E, ama ku riix barnaamijka. Xisaabintaadu way furan tahay: faylku wuxuu ku daraa \u003Cstrong\u003EDhulka shaqada: jar\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDhulka shaqada: buuxin\u003C/strong\u003E sida \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items#typed-quantities-no-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-hash=\"typed-quantities-no-drawing\"\u003Etirooyinka nooca loo qoray\u003C/a\u003E, oo ku qoran kuyuubka yaardka (CY) mashruuca feet-ka, ama mitir kuyuub (m³) mashruuca mitirka. Waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa dib u celiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMagacyadooda beddel, dhigo qashinka, qiimayaasha iyo isku-dhisyada sidaad rabto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka naqshadda isbedesho, mar kale ku dir CivilCraft oo fur faylka cusub: laba shay ee isku mid ah ayaa helaya tirooyinka cusub. Magacyadooda, qiimayaasha, qashinka iyo isku-dhisyada way sii ahaanayaan sidaad dejisay. Haddii unugga mashruuca isbedelay, xariiqda xaaladda ayaa sheegaysa: hubi qiimayaasha. Fayl ka yimid mashruuc kale oo CivilCraft ah wuxuu ku daraa laba shay oo uu leeyahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETirooyinkan waa mugga dhulka dabiiciga ah sida CivilCraft u cabbiray (habka shabakadda): ma jiro yaraan ama kor u kac. Ku dar qashin, ama adigoo isticmaalaya qaacidda sida \u003Ccode\u003EQ * 1.25\u003C/code\u003E mugga dhulka furan. Tafatiraha shayga wuxuu muujinayaa meesha ay ka yimaadeen iyo waqtigooda; tiirka fiiro-gaarka ah ee qiyaasta kharashka ayaa sidoo kale sheegaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylka tirooyinka waa JSON qoraal fudud (\u003Ccode\u003E&quot;format&quot;: &quot;cadcraft-quantities&quot;\u003C/code\u003E), markaa qoraal ama barnaamij kale ayaa qori kara mid: magac app, mashruuc, iyo shayo leh fure, magac, unug iyo tiro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"TakeoffCraft wuxuu qiyaasaa waxa lagu rejeeyay sawirka. Dhulka shaqadu waxay u baahan tahay dusha dhulka, sidaas darteed waxay la wadaagtaa CivilCraft, kaas oo ka dhisa duushaha barta, u sinaysa, oo xisaabiya jarista, buuxinta iyo gaadiidka. Keenista fudud halkan Dhul loo keenay hal qoto ah, shay leh qoto ayaa ku filan: mugga = ballac × qoto. Xirmada ganacsiga guud waxay leedahay shay keenis dhul oo weyn (mugga dhulka dabiiciga ah, mugga dhulka furan iyo tirada gaadiidka baabuurta) iyo shay god khadka (keenista, saldhigga iyo dib-u-buuxinta iyada oo loo eegayo dherer iyo qoto). Dhererka barta ee CivilCraft Dejji miisaanka sawirka goobta. Samee shay Tiro, tusaale ahaan \"Dhulka jira\", oo riix dhererka barta kasta ee sawirka. Dooro calaamad oo ku qor Dhererka panelka Calaamadda la doortay: 102.5, 102'-6\" ama 31.24 m. Dhererka taban iyo eber labaduba way fiican yihiin. Fur menu-ga Dhoofin oo dooro Dhererka barta. Waxaad heleysaa fayl barta (.csv) oo leh Point, Northing, Easting, Elevation iyo Description, hal safka mid kasta oo calaamadsan ee sawirka furan. Fur faylkaas CivilCraft (eeg Soo dhoofi barta). Waxay ka dhisaysaa dusha barta (Dhis dusha); halkaas ka dib waxay isbarbardhigtaa duushaha oo siisaa jarista iyo buuxinta (Mugga). Northing iyo easting waa isku-xidhka sawirka laftiisa, oo ah feet, oo laga qaaday geeska bogga iyada oo la eegayo miisaankiisa. Masaafooyinka iyo mugga udhaxeeya barta waa sax, laakiin ma aha isku-xidhka sahanka goobtaada. Markaad u baahato, u wareeji isku-xidhka goobta CivilCraft. Barta laga soo qaaday sawirro kala duwan ma wadaagaan isku-xidhka, sidaas darteed dhoofintu waxay qaadaa sawirka furan oo keliya. Dhererka waxa lagu kaydiyaa xisaabinta qadarka waxaana lagu wareejiyaa koobiyee iyo dhaji. Jarista iyo buuxinta CivilCraft Shaqada dhulka ee CivilCraft waxay ku soo noqotaa laba shay oo aad qiimayn karto: CivilCraft, ku qiyaas padsyada iyo jidadka, kadibna dooro U dir TakeoffCraft hoosta Dhulka shaqada (Mugga dhulka shaqada). Waxay kaydinaysaa fayl tirooyin (.quantities.json). TakeoffCraft, ku fur Fur xisaabinta, ama ku riix barnaamijka. Xisaabintaadu way furan tahay: faylku wuxuu ku daraa Dhulka shaqada: jar iyo Dhulka shaqada: buuxin sida tirooyinka nooca loo qoray, oo ku qoran kuyuubka yaardka (CY) mashruuca feet-ka, ama mitir kuyuub (m³) mashruuca mitirka. Waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z ayaa dib u celiya. Magacyadooda beddel, dhigo qashinka, qiimayaasha iyo isku-dhisyada sidaad rabto. Marka naqshadda isbedesho, mar kale ku dir CivilCraft oo fur faylka cusub: laba shay ee isku mid ah ayaa helaya tirooyinka cusub. Magacyadooda, qiimayaasha, qashinka iyo isku-dhisyada way sii ahaanayaan sidaad dejisay. Haddii unugga mashruuca isbedelay, xariiqda xaaladda ayaa sheegaysa: hubi qiimayaasha. Fayl ka yimid mashruuc kale oo CivilCraft ah wuxuu ku daraa laba shay oo uu leeyahay. Tirooyinkan waa mugga dhulka dabiiciga ah sida CivilCraft u cabbiray (habka shabakadda): ma jiro yaraan ama kor u kac. Ku dar qashin, ama adigoo isticmaalaya qaacidda sida Q * 1.25 mugga dhulka furan. Tafatiraha shayga wuxuu muujinayaa meesha ay ka yimaadeen iyo waqtigooda; tiirka fiiro-gaarka ah ee qiyaasta kharashka ayaa sidoo kale sheegaya. Faylka tirooyinka waa JSON qoraal fudud (\"format\": \"cadcraft-quantities\"), markaa qoraal ama barnaamij kale ayaa qori kara mid: magac app, mashruuc, iyo shayo leh fure, magac, unug iyo tiro.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"bid-areas","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Aagga tartanka","summary":"Calaamadaha ku calaamee dhisme, dabaq ama marxalad, tiriso hal aag markiiba, oo akhri tirooyinka iyo kharashka aag kasta.","section":"tasks","order":85,"keywords":["ku dar ikhtiyaar","ka jar ikhtiyaar","qiimaha aasaasiga","ikhtiyaarrada","aagga tartanka","aag","dhisme","dabaq","heer","marxalad","gobol","ikhtiyaar","kala qaybin","dabaqa caadiga ah","wadar yar","aagga"],"headings":[{"id":"samee-aag-tartan","text":"Samee aag tartan","level":2},{"id":"taxan-dhul-aag-gudahiisa","text":"Taxan dhul aag gudahiisa","level":2},{"id":"calaamadaha-u-wareeji-aag-kale","text":"Calaamadaha u wareeji aag kale","level":2},{"id":"magac-beddel-dalbo-ama-tirtir","text":"Magac beddel, dalbo ama tirtir","level":2},{"id":"akhri-tirooyinka-aag-kasta","text":"Akhri tirooyinka aag kasta","level":2},{"id":"ikhtiyaarrada-qiimaha-aasaasiga-oo-lagu-daro-ama-laga-jaro","text":"Ikhtiyaarrada: qiimaha aasaasiga oo lagu daro ama laga jaro","level":2},{"id":"dhoofinta","text":"Dhoofinta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAagga tartanka waa qayb shaqada ah oo aad qiimayso gaar ahaan: dhisme, dabaq, marxalad, dhinac. Calaamad kasta waxay ku jiri kartaa hal aag tartan. Tirooyinka iyo qiyaasta ayaa markaas la akhrin karaa aag kasta, wadar-yar oo u gaar ah kasta, halka wadarta shaqada ay tahay wadarta wax walba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-aag-tartan\"\u003ESamee aag tartan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhanka sare ee panel-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E, fur liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid area\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003ENew bid area…\u003C/strong\u003E, ku qor magac sida &quot;Building A&quot; ama &quot;Level 2&quot;, oo dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EMake it\u003C/strong\u003E. Aagga cusub ayaa noqda midka hadda jira. Bar-ka xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;New marks go in (name). Marks in other bid areas are dimmed.&quot; (Calaamadaha cusub waxay galayaan (magac). Calaamadaha aagagga kale waa la dhumiyay.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"taxan-dhul-aag-gudahiisa\"\u003ETaxan dhul aag gudahiisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIntii aagga tartanka ah ee liiska lagu doortay, calaamad cusub kasta waxay galaysaa aagga: khadadka, bedadka, goobaha, tirooyinka, calaamadaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E ku daro, iyo waxa aad ku dhajiso. Calaamadaha aagagga kale, iyo kuwa aan aag lahayn, waa la dhumiyay xaashida si aad u aragto waxa haysa meesha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003ENo bid area\u003C/strong\u003E liiska si aad u taxato aan aag lahayn; markaas waxba ma dhumo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDabaqyada caadiga ah: taxan Level 2, dooro calaamadaha (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E xaashida), koobiyee, dooro Level 3 liiska ka dibna dhaji. Nuqulada waxay galayaan Level 3. Marka dabaqyadu isku mid yihiin oo aadan u baahnayn inay kala go&#039;aan, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/typical-groups\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/typical-groups\"\u003Ekooxda caadiga ah\u003C/a\u003E waxay tirisaa hal dabaq dhowr jeer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"calaamadaha-u-wareeji-aag-kale\"\u003ECalaamadaha u wareeji aag kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro hal calaamad ama dhowr (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + guji, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadda la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E (ama \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadaha la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E), dooro aagga goobta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid area\u003C/span\u003E. Bar-ka xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;3 marks moved to Level 2.&quot; (3 calaamadood waa loo wareejiyay Level 2.) Waa hal tallaabo oo dib u celin ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"magac-beddel-dalbo-ama-tirtir\"\u003EMagac beddel, dalbo ama tirtir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EMaamul aagagga tartanka…\u003C/strong\u003E liiska. Ku qor magac si aad u beddesho, isticmaal fallaadhaha si aad u beddesho kala horaynta (miisaska iyo buug-shaqada ayaa raacaya), ama tirtir mid bada kaarka. Tirtirida aagga tartanka waxay ilaalisaa calaamadeeda: markaas waxay ku jiraan aan aag lahayn. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu dib u celiyaa isbeddel kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhri-tirooyinka-aag-kasta\"\u003EAkhri tirooyinka aag kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy area\u003C/span\u003E (wuxuu muuqdaa marka takeoff-ku leeyahay aag tartan). Aag kasta wuxuu ku liistaa walxaha uu haysto, tirada, unugga iyo wadarta, ka dibna safka wadar-yarta. Calaamadaha aan aag lahayn waxay ku dambeeyaan, oo waxay ku muuqdaan sida \u003Cstrong\u003ENo bid area\u003C/strong\u003E. Guji safka walxa si walxa u iftiimo oo aagga uu noqdo midka hadda jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsku-dhisyada aag kasta waxaa lagu xisaabiyaa wadarta aagga gaarka ah. Qaacido wareegta sida \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L / 4)\u003C/code\u003E ayaa suurtogal ka dhigta in aagagga wada jira ay wax yar ka badan yihiin wadarta shaqada oo dhan, sida ay dhici lahayd marka shaqadu la qiimeeyo aag-aag.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ikhtiyaarrada-qiimaha-aasaasiga-oo-lagu-daro-ama-laga-jaro\"\u003EIkhtiyaarrada: qiimaha aasaasiga oo lagu daro ama laga jaro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAagga tartanka wuxuu noqon karaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eikhtiyaar\u003C/strong\u003E: shaqo uu milkiiluhu u sii dari karo tartanka, ama ka saari karo. Ku \u003Cstrong\u003EMaamul aagagga tartanka…\u003C/strong\u003E, aag kasta wuxuu leeyahay liis dhinaca magaciisa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorasho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBase bid\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETartanka, sida caadiga ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd alternate\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiimo gaar ah oo \u003Cstrong\u003Elaga reebay qiimaha aasaasiga\u003C/strong\u003E: ku kordhin roodhka, canopy dheeraad ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct alternate\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETartanka gudihiisa, oo loo soo jeedinayaa sida jarid: &quot;delete the canopy&quot; (tirtir canopy-ga).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShaqada ikhtiyaarka tiri aagga tartankeeda sida aag kasta. Marka takeoff-ku leeyahay ikhtiyaar:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMadhka miiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EBase bid\u003C/strong\u003E halkii \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJob total\u003C/span\u003E: takeoff-ka oo dhan oo aan lahayn ikhtiyaarrada lagu daro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy area\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku dhammaadaa qiimaha aasaasiga iyo hal safka ikhtiyaar kasta: \u003Cstrong\u003E+$300.00\u003C/strong\u003E ku darista, \u003Cstrong\u003E−$1,050.00\u003C/strong\u003E jarista.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhtiyaar wuxuu qiimeeyaa oo keliya walxaha leh calaamado ku jira, iyo isku-dhisyadooda, si isku-dhis walxa kale aan u soo galin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhoofinta, CSV-gu wuxuu ku dhammaadaa qiimaha aasaasiga iyo ikhtiyaarrada, buug-shaqadana waxay helaysaa xaashi \u003Cstrong\u003EAlternates\u003C/strong\u003E: qiimaha aasaasiga, walxaha ikhtiyaar kasta iyo isbeddelkiisa, iyo qiimaha aasaasiga oo dhan marka ikhtiyaarrada lagu daro laga jaro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhoofinta\"\u003EDhoofinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa xaashi \u003Cstrong\u003EBy bid area\u003C/strong\u003E: walxaha iyo qaybaha aag kasta oo leh tirada, tirada leh qashinka, agabka, shaqada iyo wadarta, wadar-yar aag kasta (qaacido \u003Ccode\u003ESUM\u003C/code\u003E) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EAll bid areas\u003C/strong\u003E ugu dambeeya. Xaashida \u003Cstrong\u003EMarks\u003C/strong\u003E waxay helaysaa tiir \u003Cstrong\u003EBid area\u003C/strong\u003E. Takeoff aan lahayn aagag tartan wuu dhoofiyaa sida hore. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-columns\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-columns\"\u003ETiirarka dhoofinta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAagagga tartanka waxay ku kaydsan yihiin faylka mashruuca oo calaamadaha la socda.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Aagga tartanka waa qayb shaqada ah oo aad qiimayso gaar ahaan: dhisme, dabaq, marxalad, dhinac. Calaamad kasta waxay ku jiri kartaa hal aag tartan. Tirooyinka iyo qiyaasta ayaa markaas la akhrin karaa aag kasta, wadar-yar oo u gaar ah kasta, halka wadarta shaqada ay tahay wadarta wax walba. Samee aag tartan Dhanka sare ee panel-ka Items, fur liiska Bid area. Dooro New bid area…, ku qor magac sida \"Building A\" ama \"Level 2\", oo dooro Make it. Aagga cusub ayaa noqda midka hadda jira. Bar-ka xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"New marks go in (name). Marks in other bid areas are dimmed.\" (Calaamadaha cusub waxay galayaan (magac). Calaamadaha aagagga kale waa la dhumiyay.) Taxan dhul aag gudahiisa Intii aagga tartanka ah ee liiska lagu doortay, calaamad cusub kasta waxay galaysaa aagga: khadadka, bedadka, goobaha, tirooyinka, calaamadaha Auto count ku daro, iyo waxa aad ku dhajiso. Calaamadaha aagagga kale, iyo kuwa aan aag lahayn, waa la dhumiyay xaashida si aad u aragto waxa haysa meesha. Dooro No bid area liiska si aad u taxato aan aag lahayn; markaas waxba ma dhumo. Dabaqyada caadiga ah: taxan Level 2, dooro calaamadaha (Ctrl+A xaashida), koobiyee, dooro Level 3 liiska ka dibna dhaji. Nuqulada waxay galayaan Level 3. Marka dabaqyadu isku mid yihiin oo aadan u baahnayn inay kala go'aan, kooxda caadiga ah waxay tirisaa hal dabaq dhowr jeer. Calaamadaha u wareeji aag kale Dooro hal calaamad ama dhowr (Shift + guji, ama Ctrl+A). Hoosta Calaamadda la doortay (ama Calaamadaha la doortay), dooro aagga goobta Bid area. Bar-ka xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"3 marks moved to Level 2.\" (3 calaamadood waa loo wareejiyay Level 2.) Waa hal tallaabo oo dib u celin ah. Magac beddel, dalbo ama tirtir Dooro Maamul aagagga tartanka… liiska. Ku qor magac si aad u beddesho, isticmaal fallaadhaha si aad u beddesho kala horaynta (miisaska iyo buug-shaqada ayaa raacaya), ama tirtir mid bada kaarka. Tirtirida aagga tartanka waxay ilaalisaa calaamadeeda: markaas waxay ku jiraan aan aag lahayn. Ctrl+Z wuxuu dib u celiyaa isbeddel kasta. Akhri tirooyinka aag kasta Miiska Quantities, dooro By area (wuxuu muuqdaa marka takeoff-ku leeyahay aag tartan). Aag kasta wuxuu ku liistaa walxaha uu haysto, tirada, unugga iyo wadarta, ka dibna safka wadar-yarta. Calaamadaha aan aag lahayn waxay ku dambeeyaan, oo waxay ku muuqdaan sida No bid area. Guji safka walxa si walxa u iftiimo oo aagga uu noqdo midka hadda jira. Isku-dhisyada aag kasta waxaa lagu xisaabiyaa wadarta aagga gaarka ah. Qaacido wareegta sida ceil(L / 4) ayaa suurtogal ka dhigta in aagagga wada jira ay wax yar ka badan yihiin wadarta shaqada oo dhan, sida ay dhici lahayd marka shaqadu la qiimeeyo aag-aag. Ikhtiyaarrada: qiimaha aasaasiga oo lagu daro ama laga jaro Aagga tartanka wuxuu noqon karaa ikhtiyaar: shaqo uu milkiiluhu u sii dari karo tartanka, ama ka saari karo. Ku Maamul aagagga tartanka…, aag kasta wuxuu leeyahay liis dhinaca magaciisa: Doorasho Waxa uu sameeyo Base bid Tartanka, sida caadiga ah. Add alternate Qiimo gaar ah oo laga reebay qiimaha aasaasiga: ku kordhin roodhka, canopy dheeraad ah. Deduct alternate Tartanka gudihiisa, oo loo soo jeedinayaa sida jarid: \"delete the canopy\" (tirtir canopy-ga). Shaqada ikhtiyaarka tiri aagga tartankeeda sida aag kasta. Marka takeoff-ku leeyahay ikhtiyaar: Madhka miiska Quantities wuxuu leeyahay Base bid halkii Job total: takeoff-ka oo dhan oo aan lahayn ikhtiyaarrada lagu daro. By area wuxuu ku dhammaadaa qiimaha aasaasiga iyo hal safka ikhtiyaar kasta: +$300.00 ku darista, −$1,050.00 jarista. Ikhtiyaar wuxuu qiimeeyaa oo keliya walxaha leh calaamado ku jira, iyo isku-dhisyadooda, si isku-dhis walxa kale aan u soo galin. Dhoofinta, CSV-gu wuxuu ku dhammaadaa qiimaha aasaasiga iyo ikhtiyaarrada, buug-shaqadana waxay helaysaa xaashi Alternates: qiimaha aasaasiga, walxaha ikhtiyaar kasta iyo isbeddelkiisa, iyo qiimaha aasaasiga oo dhan marka ikhtiyaarrada lagu daro laga jaro. Dhoofinta XLSX wuxuu ku daraa xaashi By bid area: walxaha iyo qaybaha aag kasta oo leh tirada, tirada leh qashinka, agabka, shaqada iyo wadarta, wadar-yar aag kasta (qaacido SUM) iyo All bid areas ugu dambeeya. Xaashida Marks waxay helaysaa tiir Bid area. Takeoff aan lahayn aagag tartan wuu dhoofiyaa sida hore. Eeg Tiirarka dhoofinta. Aagagga tartanka waxay ku kaydsan yihiin faylka mashruuca oo calaamadaha la socda.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"typical-groups","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Kooxaha caadiga ah","summary":"Hal unug caadi ah, qol ama dabaq mar qori, kuna tiri inta jeer ee uu ku celcelinayo, beddel tirada markaa dambe, oo arag calaamadaha caadiga ah.","section":"tasks","order":86,"keywords":["caadi","kooxda caadiga ah","ku celcelin","tirada ku celcelinta","dhufo","jeer","unug","qolka hoteelka","guri","dabaq caadi ah","x24","nuqullo"],"headings":[{"id":"samee-kooxda-caadiga-ah","text":"Samee kooxda caadiga ah","level":2},{"id":"hadda-ka-beddel","text":"Hadda ka beddel","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-xusuusto","text":"Waxa la xusuusto","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDhismuhu wuxuu inta badan ku celcelin: 24 qol oo hoteel oo isku mid ah, 6 dabaq oo caadi ah, 40 meel baabuur oo isku mid ah oo leh calaamado isku mid ah. \u003Cstrong\u003EKooxda caadiga ah\u003C/strong\u003E waxay kuu oggolaanaysaa inaad hal unug ka mid ah xisaabiso oo aad u tirisid inta jeer ee uu ku celcelinayo, adigoo nuqullada aan sawirin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-kooxda-caadiga-ah\"\u003ESamee kooxda caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXisaabi hal unug: derbiyadiisa, dabaqiisa, isha korantadiisa; shay kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro calaamadaha unugga adigoo isticmaalaya qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E: riix mid, kadibna \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + riix kuwa kale (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste#select-the-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-hash=\"select-the-marks\"\u003EDooro calaamadaha\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoos \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadda la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaadi\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoox caadi cusub…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESiiso magac (\u003Ccode\u003EUnit A\u003C/code\u003E) iyo inta jeer ee ku celcelinayo (\u003Ccode\u003E24\u003C/code\u003E), kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee kooxda\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETiro kasta oo calaamadahaas ah hadda 24 jeer ayay tirinayaan: socod 10 ft ah oo darbi wuxuu noqonayaa 240 ft, dabaq 80 SF ah 1,920 SF, laba isha 48. Qiimuhu wuu raacaa, qaacidooyinka isku-dhiskuna waxay arkaan wadarta ku celcelisay (\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu tiriyaa socod kasta 24 jeer).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXaashiga, sanduuq jaban (dashed) ayaa ku wareegsan calaamadaha kooxda, oo leh magaceeda iyo tirada, sida \u003Cstrong\u003EUnit A ×24\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hadda-ka-beddel\"\u003EHadda ka beddel\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxaha waxaa lagu liistaa \u003Cstrong\u003EKooxaha caadiga ah\u003C/strong\u003E dhinaca midig:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeddel lambarka ku xiga \u003Cstrong\u003E×\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u beddesho inta jeer ee ay tirinayso (1 ilaa 10,000). Tirooyin kasta way cusboonaadaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDib u magacee sanduuqa magaceeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAstaanta sanduuqa waxay doortaa calaamadaheeda (iyo muujinta xaashigooda).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQashinka wuu tirtiraa kooxda. Calaamadaheeda way sii jiraan, markaas mar keliya ayaa la tiriyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad calaamado ugu darto kooxda ama uga saarto, dooro iyaga oo doorto kooxda (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMa aha caadi (×1)\u003C/span\u003E) hoos \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaadi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-xusuusto\"\u003EWaxa la xusuusto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadaha kooxdu waxay ku yaallaan xaashiyo dhowr ah, iyo shay kasta. Calaamad kasta waxay ku jirtaa kooxda hal mar ugu badnaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENuqullada aad dhajiso kooxda kuma jiraan: nuqul ka dhajisan unug caadi ah wuxuu kale 24 jeer mar kale tiri lahaa. Kooxda isticmaal &quot;isku mid N jeer&quot;, nuqulka iyo dhajinta u isticmaal nuqullada aad sawirtay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadaha waa la sawiray mar keliya, sidaas darteed aragga 3D iyo PDF-ka calaamadsan waxay muujiyaan hal unug; tirooyinka, dhoofinta iyo miiska xaashi kasta waxay tiriyaan ×N. Xaashiga \u003Cstrong\u003EMarks\u003C/strong\u003E ee dhoofinta Excel wuxuu sheegayaa calaamadaha caadiga ah iyo inta jeer ee ay tiriyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka ay jiraan aagagga qiyaasta, calaamadaha kooxdu waxay tiriyaan ×N aagga qiyaasta ee ay gaarka u leeyihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Dhismuhu wuxuu inta badan ku celcelin: 24 qol oo hoteel oo isku mid ah, 6 dabaq oo caadi ah, 40 meel baabuur oo isku mid ah oo leh calaamado isku mid ah. Kooxda caadiga ah waxay kuu oggolaanaysaa inaad hal unug ka mid ah xisaabiso oo aad u tirisid inta jeer ee uu ku celcelinayo, adigoo nuqullada aan sawirin. Samee kooxda caadiga ah Xisaabi hal unug: derbiyadiisa, dabaqiisa, isha korantadiisa; shay kasta. Dooro calaamadaha unugga adigoo isticmaalaya qalabka Dooro: riix mid, kadibna Shift + riix kuwa kale (Dooro calaamadaha). Hoos Calaamadda la doortay, fur Caadi oo dooro Koox caadi cusub…. Siiso magac (Unit A) iyo inta jeer ee ku celcelinayo (24), kadibna dooro Samee kooxda. Tiro kasta oo calaamadahaas ah hadda 24 jeer ayay tirinayaan: socod 10 ft ah oo darbi wuxuu noqonayaa 240 ft, dabaq 80 SF ah 1,920 SF, laba isha 48. Qiimuhu wuu raacaa, qaacidooyinka isku-dhiskuna waxay arkaan wadarta ku celcelisay (N wuxuu tiriyaa socod kasta 24 jeer). Xaashiga, sanduuq jaban (dashed) ayaa ku wareegsan calaamadaha kooxda, oo leh magaceeda iyo tirada, sida Unit A ×24. Hadda ka beddel Kooxaha waxaa lagu liistaa Kooxaha caadiga ah dhinaca midig: Beddel lambarka ku xiga × si aad u beddesho inta jeer ee ay tirinayso (1 ilaa 10,000). Tirooyin kasta way cusboonaadaan. Dib u magacee sanduuqa magaceeda. Astaanta sanduuqa waxay doortaa calaamadaheeda (iyo muujinta xaashigooda). Qashinka wuu tirtiraa kooxda. Calaamadaheeda way sii jiraan, markaas mar keliya ayaa la tiriyaa. Si aad calaamado ugu darto kooxda ama uga saarto, dooro iyaga oo doorto kooxda (ama Ma aha caadi (×1)) hoos Caadi. Waxa la xusuusto Calaamadaha kooxdu waxay ku yaallaan xaashiyo dhowr ah, iyo shay kasta. Calaamad kasta waxay ku jirtaa kooxda hal mar ugu badnaan. Nuqullada aad dhajiso kooxda kuma jiraan: nuqul ka dhajisan unug caadi ah wuxuu kale 24 jeer mar kale tiri lahaa. Kooxda isticmaal \"isku mid N jeer\", nuqulka iyo dhajinta u isticmaal nuqullada aad sawirtay. Calaamadaha waa la sawiray mar keliya, sidaas darteed aragga 3D iyo PDF-ka calaamadsan waxay muujiyaan hal unug; tirooyinka, dhoofinta iyo miiska xaashi kasta waxay tiriyaan ×N. Xaashiga Marks ee dhoofinta Excel wuxuu sheegayaa calaamadaha caadiga ah iyo inta jeer ee ay tiriyaan. Marka ay jiraan aagagga qiyaasta, calaamadaha kooxdu waxay tiriyaan ×N aagga qiyaasta ee ay gaarka u leeyihiin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"issues-and-revisions","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Soo saaridda, dib u eegista iyo diiwaanka isbeddelada naqshadda","summary":"Hay hal taariikh soo saarid oo la wada leeyahay moodeelka naqshadeeyaha: akhri soo saaridda, diiwaan geli tilmaamaha goobta, naqshadaha warshadda iyo moodeelada xiriirsan soo saarid, oo akhri diiwaanka isbeddelada naqshadda.","section":"tasks","order":86,"keywords":["soo saarid","dib u eegis","dib u eegisyo","diiwaanka isbeddelada","diiwaanka naqshadda","diiwaanka soo saaridda","tilmaamaha goobta","naqshadda warshadda","moodeel xiriirsan","tender","dhisme","taariikhda soo saaridda","liiska qadarka","xisaabinta qadarka"],"headings":[{"id":"waxaad-samayn-doontaa","text":"Waxaad samayn doontaa","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-muhiim-ah","text":"Waxa muhiim ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxaad-samayn-doontaa\"\u003EWaxaad samayn doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu shaqee taariikhda soo saaridda ee kooxda oo dhan. Eeg xaashiyada ku baxay dib u eegis kasta, oo ku xidh waxa dhacaya goobta soo saaridda ee ay tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo saaridda iyo dib u eegista\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EAkhri taariikhda soo saaridda\u003C/strong\u003E oo dooro faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.issues.json\u003C/code\u003E ee laga kaydiyay BimCraft ama app kale. Soo saarideeda iyo diiwaannadeeda waxa lagu daraa kuwaaga. Waxba ma bedelmo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar diiwaan\u003C/strong\u003E tilmaam goob, naqshad warshad, set calaamadin, moodeel xiriirsan ama qoraal. Dooro soo saaridda ay ku tahay iyo xaaladeeda. Fayl aad doorato waxa lagu diiwaangeliyaa magacyadiisa, cabirkiisa iyo SHA-256; faylku meeshiisa ayuu ku sii jiri doonaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDiiwaanka isbeddelada naqshadda\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu tusayaa hal safka xaashi kasta iyo hal tiir soo saarid kasta. Dib u eegis ku jirta qaws waxa la soo saaray isla markaaba iyada oo aan wax laga beddelin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoo deji diiwaanka isbeddelada (CSV)\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa soo saaridda, miiska xaashiyada iyo diiwaannada. \u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi taariikhda soo saaridda\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qoraa fayl ay app kale akhrin karaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-muhiim-ah\"\u003EWaxa muhiim ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu diiwaan geli soo saarid\u003C/strong\u003E waxa lagu soo saaraa xaashiyada aad qadartay, tusaale ahaan liiska qadarka. \u003Cstrong\u003EWax laga beddelay tan kadib\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa sheegaya xaashiyada dib loo qadaray kadib soo saaridaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaariikhda waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka xisaabinta qadarka. Isbeddel kasta waa hal \u003Cstrong\u003EKa noqo\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhrinta isla faylka laba jeer ma ku darto wax laba jeer. Marka labo nuqul ay haystaan diiwaan isku mid ah, midka cusub ayaa la hayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxaad samayn doontaa Ku shaqee taariikhda soo saaridda ee kooxda oo dhan. Eeg xaashiyada ku baxay dib u eegis kasta, oo ku xidh waxa dhacaya goobta soo saaridda ee ay tahay. Tallaabooyinka Fur Soo saaridda iyo dib u eegista. Dooro Akhri taariikhda soo saaridda oo dooro faylka .issues.json ee laga kaydiyay BimCraft ama app kale. Soo saarideeda iyo diiwaannadeeda waxa lagu daraa kuwaaga. Waxba ma bedelmo. Dooro Ku dar diiwaan tilmaam goob, naqshad warshad, set calaamadin, moodeel xiriirsan ama qoraal. Dooro soo saaridda ay ku tahay iyo xaaladeeda. Fayl aad doorato waxa lagu diiwaangeliyaa magacyadiisa, cabirkiisa iyo SHA-256; faylku meeshiisa ayuu ku sii jiri doonaa. Diiwaanka isbeddelada naqshadda wuxuu tusayaa hal safka xaashi kasta iyo hal tiir soo saarid kasta. Dib u eegis ku jirta qaws waxa la soo saaray isla markaaba iyada oo aan wax laga beddelin. Soo deji diiwaanka isbeddelada (CSV) wuxuu kaydiyaa soo saaridda, miiska xaashiyada iyo diiwaannada. Kaydi taariikhda soo saaridda wuxuu qoraa fayl ay app kale akhrin karaan. Waxa muhiim ah Ku diiwaan geli soo saarid waxa lagu soo saaraa xaashiyada aad qadartay, tusaale ahaan liiska qadarka. Wax laga beddelay tan kadib ayaa sheegaya xaashiyada dib loo qadaray kadib soo saaridaas. Taariikhda waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka xisaabinta qadarka. Isbeddel kasta waa hal Ka noqo. Akhrinta isla faylka laba jeer ma ku darto wax laba jeer. Marka labo nuqul ay haystaan diiwaan isku mid ah, midka cusub ayaa la hayaa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"read-quantities","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Akhri tirooyinka iyo qiyaasta kharashka","summary":"Isticmaal miiska Tirooyinka sida shayba iyo sida xaashiga, wadarta guud ee mashruuca, iftiinka iyo digniinta Aan dhammaystirnayn.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["tirooyinka","wadarta","sida shayba","sida xaashiga","wadarta mashruuca","qiyaasta kharashka","warbixin","iftiin","aan dhammaystirnayn","kharashyada"],"headings":[{"id":"sida-shayba","text":"Sida shayba","level":2},{"id":"sida-xaashiga","text":"Sida xaashiga","level":2},{"id":"sida-aagga","text":"Sida aagga","level":2},{"id":"digniinta-aan-dhammaystirnayn","text":"Digniinta Aan dhammaystirnayn","level":2},{"id":"iftiimi-shay","text":"Iftiimi shay","level":2},{"id":"wadarta-shayada-panelka-dhinaca","text":"Wadarta shayada panelka dhinaca","level":2},{"id":"calaamadaha-pdf-yada-aan-la-furin","text":"Calaamadaha PDF-yada aan la furin","level":2},{"id":"meel-badan","text":"Meel badan","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMiiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirooyinka\u003C/span\u003E ee hoose ee daaqadda waa qiyaasta kharashkaaga oo toos ah. Wuu isbeddelaa isla markiiba marka aad sawirto, tirtirto, dib u dejiso miisaanka ama wax ka beddesho qiimaha unugga. Tirooyinka lama kaydiyo; mar kasta waa dib loo qiyaasaa calaamadaha, sidaas darteed ma ay duubi karaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-shayba\"\u003ESida shayba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESida shayba\u003C/span\u003E (kan caadiga ah). Shay kasta wuxuu leeyahay safar, safarrada qaybaha isku-dhisme ahna wuxuu leeyahay safar hoostiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETiir\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca, iyo midabka shayga. &quot;+(n) aan miisaan lahayn&quot; wuxuu macnaynayaa in calaamadaha qaarkood ku yaal xaashiyo aan miisaan lahayn.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWadarta la qiyaasay unugga shayga (qaybaha: natiijada qaacidada).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnugga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF, m, SF, SY, m², EA, ama unugga qaybta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQashin %\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHalkan ama tafatirka shayga ayaa lagu qoraa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQashinta ku jirta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiro × (1 + qashin).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlaab/unug, Shaqo/unug\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiimayaasha; halkan ayaad ku qori kartaa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlaab, Shaqo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQashinta ku jirta × qiimaha, oo lagu soo wareejiyay sentiga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWadarta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlaab + shaqo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafka ugu dambeeya, \u003Cstrong\u003EWadarta mashruuca\u003C/strong\u003E, wuxuu ku daraa tiirarka alaabta, shaqada iyo wadarta. Isla wadarta ayaa ka muuqata midig madasha miiska.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu qor unug qashin ama qiimo, kadibna taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama guji meel kale si aad u dabaqdo. Qiime TakeoffCraft aan akhriyi karin wuxuu lagu hareeeyay casaan, jaanqaadka xaaladdana wuxuu sharxaa sababta, tusaale ahaan &quot;Ku qor qadar sida 12.50.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji safka shay si calaamadaha ka muuqda xaashiyo kasta loo iftiimiyo, oo loo gudbo xaashi leh calaamadahaas (waa isla sida marka aad ku guujiso hoos \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-xaashiga\"\u003ESida xaashiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESida xaashiga\u003C/span\u003E si aad u aragto tirada shay kasta xaashi kasta, iyo tirada calaamadaha. Guji safka si xaashigaas loo furo oo shaygaas loo iftiimiyo. Isticmaal si aad u hubiso in xaashi kasta la qiyaasay, ama si aad tirooyinka ugu kala qaybiso dabaq ama aagga shaqada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-aagga\"\u003ESida aagga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka xisaabintu leedahay aagagga tartanka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAagga\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa shay kasta oo aag kasta iyo wadar-hoosaad. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\"\u003EAagagga tartanka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"digniinta-aan-dhammaystirnayn\"\u003EDigniinta Aan dhammaystirnayn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka wax laga tago wadarta, madasha waxay muujisaa digniin, tusaale ahaan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E&quot;Aan dhammaystirnayn: 1 khalad qaacido, 6 calaamadood oo xaashiyo aan miisaan lahayn (lama geliyo wadarta)&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhaladaadka qaacidada\u003C/strong\u003E: qaacidada qayb isku-dhis ma xallin karto. Safkeeda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Khalad qaacido: …&quot;. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies#when-a-formula-is-wrong\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-hash=\"when-a-formula-is-wrong\"\u003EIsku-dhisyada iyo qaacidooyinka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadaha xaashiyada aan miisaan lahayn\u003C/strong\u003E: siiya xaashiyadaas miisaan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale#why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-hash=\"why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\"\u003EDejiso miisaanka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsla qoraalladaas ayaa galaya miiska xisaabta la dhoofiyay, si qiyaas aan dhammaystirnayn aanu waligiis u muuqan mid dhammaystiran.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iftiimi-shay\"\u003EIftiimi shay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji shay hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E ama miiska. Calaamadaheeda xaashiyada oo dhan ayaa ku sii adkaada, kuwa kale way ifaan. Liiska xaashiyada wuxuu muujiyaa &quot;(n) la iftiimiyay&quot; xaashi kasta oo leh calaamadahaas. Dib u guji shayga si aad u joojiso iftiinka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wadarta-shayada-panelka-dhinaca\"\u003EWadarta shayada panelka dhinaca\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShay kasta oo ku jira liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E ayaa sidoo kale muujinaysa tiradeeda. Sharaxa shayga, qaybta \u003Cstrong\u003EMeasured\u003C/strong\u003E waxay muujinaysaa qiimayaasha ay qaacidooyinku isticmaalaan: dherer, socod iyo aagga derbiga; aag, wareeg iyo tirada aagagga; ama tiro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"calaamadaha-pdf-yada-aan-la-furin\"\u003ECalaamadaha PDF-yada aan la furin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXisaabintu waxay ku jiri kartaa calaamado PDF-yada aadan furin markan. Wali way tirinayaan wadarta kasta; liiska xaashiyada wuxuu magacaabaa PDF-yadaas. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003EKaydi oo dib u fur xisaabinta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meel-badan\"\u003EMeel badan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhanka fallaadha ee midig madasha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirooyinka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qariyaa miiska si xaashigu u helo meel dheeraad ah. Dib u guji si aad miiska dib ugu soo celiso.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Miiska Tirooyinka ee hoose ee daaqadda waa qiyaasta kharashkaaga oo toos ah. Wuu isbeddelaa isla markiiba marka aad sawirto, tirtirto, dib u dejiso miisaanka ama wax ka beddesho qiimaha unugga. Tirooyinka lama kaydiyo; mar kasta waa dib loo qiyaasaa calaamadaha, sidaas darteed ma ay duubi karaan. Sida shayba Dooro Sida shayba (kan caadiga ah). Shay kasta wuxuu leeyahay safar, safarrada qaybaha isku-dhisme ahna wuxuu leeyahay safar hoostiisa. Tiir Macnaha Shay Magaca, iyo midabka shayga. \"+(n) aan miisaan lahayn\" wuxuu macnaynayaa in calaamadaha qaarkood ku yaal xaashiyo aan miisaan lahayn. Tiro Wadarta la qiyaasay unugga shayga (qaybaha: natiijada qaacidada). Unugga LF, m, SF, SY, m², EA, ama unugga qaybta. Qashin % Halkan ama tafatirka shayga ayaa lagu qoraa. Qashinta ku jirta Tiro × (1 + qashin). Alaab/unug, Shaqo/unug Qiimayaasha; halkan ayaad ku qori kartaa. Alaab, Shaqo Qashinta ku jirta × qiimaha, oo lagu soo wareejiyay sentiga. Wadarta Alaab + shaqo. Safka ugu dambeeya, Wadarta mashruuca, wuxuu ku daraa tiirarka alaabta, shaqada iyo wadarta. Isla wadarta ayaa ka muuqata midig madasha miiska. Ku qor unug qashin ama qiimo, kadibna taabo Enter ama guji meel kale si aad u dabaqdo. Qiime TakeoffCraft aan akhriyi karin wuxuu lagu hareeeyay casaan, jaanqaadka xaaladdana wuxuu sharxaa sababta, tusaale ahaan \"Ku qor qadar sida 12.50.\" Guji safka shay si calaamadaha ka muuqda xaashiyo kasta loo iftiimiyo, oo loo gudbo xaashi leh calaamadahaas (waa isla sida marka aad ku guujiso hoos Walxaha). Sida xaashiga Dooro Sida xaashiga si aad u aragto tirada shay kasta xaashi kasta, iyo tirada calaamadaha. Guji safka si xaashigaas loo furo oo shaygaas loo iftiimiyo. Isticmaal si aad u hubiso in xaashi kasta la qiyaasay, ama si aad tirooyinka ugu kala qaybiso dabaq ama aagga shaqada. Sida aagga Marka xisaabintu leedahay aagagga tartanka, Aagga wuxuu liistaa shay kasta oo aag kasta iyo wadar-hoosaad. Eeg Aagagga tartanka. Digniinta Aan dhammaystirnayn Marka wax laga tago wadarta, madasha waxay muujisaa digniin, tusaale ahaan: \"Aan dhammaystirnayn: 1 khalad qaacido, 6 calaamadood oo xaashiyo aan miisaan lahayn (lama geliyo wadarta)\" Khaladaadka qaacidada: qaacidada qayb isku-dhis ma xallin karto. Safkeeda wuxuu leeyahay \"Khalad qaacido: …\". Eeg Isku-dhisyada iyo qaacidooyinka. Calaamadaha xaashiyada aan miisaan lahayn: siiya xaashiyadaas miisaan. Eeg Dejiso miisaanka. Isla qoraalladaas ayaa galaya miiska xisaabta la dhoofiyay, si qiyaas aan dhammaystirnayn aanu waligiis u muuqan mid dhammaystiran. Iftiimi shay Guji shay hoosta Walxaha ama miiska. Calaamadaheeda xaashiyada oo dhan ayaa ku sii adkaada, kuwa kale way ifaan. Liiska xaashiyada wuxuu muujiyaa \"(n) la iftiimiyay\" xaashi kasta oo leh calaamadahaas. Dib u guji shayga si aad u joojiso iftiinka. Wadarta shayada panelka dhinaca Shay kasta oo ku jira liiska Walxaha ayaa sidoo kale muujinaysa tiradeeda. Sharaxa shayga, qaybta Measured waxay muujinaysaa qiimayaasha ay qaacidooyinku isticmaalaan: dherer, socod iyo aagga derbiga; aag, wareeg iyo tirada aagagga; ama tiro. Calaamadaha PDF-yada aan la furin Xisaabintu waxay ku jiri kartaa calaamado PDF-yada aadan furin markan. Wali way tirinayaan wadarta kasta; liiska xaashiyada wuxuu magacaabaa PDF-yadaas. Eeg Kaydi oo dib u fur xisaabinta. Meel badan Badhanka fallaadha ee midig madasha Tirooyinka wuxuu qariyaa miiska si xaashigu u helo meel dheeraad ah. Dib u guji si aad miiska dib ugu soo celiso.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"check-in-3d","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Hubi takeoff-ka 3D","summary":"Arag derbiyada, dabaqyada iyo tirooyinka xaashida ee sawirka ku taagan, ku wareeg, oo guji mid si aad u doorato calaamadeeda.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["png","sawir","picture","screenshot","stack","dabaqyo","heerar","qaab","glb","gltf","export 3d","dhumucda darbiga","joogta saldhigga","furitaanka","madhnaanta albaabka","3d","saddex cabbir","hubi","muuqaal","darbiyo","joogta darbiga","dabaq","qoto","mugga","orbit","moodeel","dooro","isometric","perspective"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-muuqaalka-3d","text":"Fur muuqaalka 3D","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-aragto","text":"Waxa aad aragto","level":2},{"id":"ku-eeg-wareegga","text":"Ku eeg wareegga","level":2},{"id":"derbiyo-dhumuc-sal-iyo-furo-leh","text":"Derbiyo dhumuc, sal iyo furo leh","level":2},{"id":"dabaqyada-isku-rog","text":"Dabaqyada isku rog","level":2},{"id":"kaydi-muuqaalka-3d-sawir-ahaan","text":"Kaydi muuqaalka 3D sawir ahaan","level":2},{"id":"kaydi-muuqaalka-3d-moodel-ahaan","text":"Kaydi muuqaalka 3D moodel ahaan","level":2},{"id":"calaamad-ka-dooro-3d","text":"Calaamad ka dooro 3D","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalka 3D waa hubin, ma aha qorshe labaad: wuxuu xaashida furan ee takeoff-ka ka dhigaa mid kor loo taagan xaashida dusheeda, sidaas darteed darbi maqan, dabaq laba jeer, ama tiro ka baxsan ayaa si fudud u muuqda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa hor inta aadan bilaabin: xaashida waa u baahan tahay miisaan (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EDejinta miisaanka\u003C/a\u003E). Joogta iyo qotada waxay u baahan yihiin feet dhab ah, sidaas darteed xaashi aan miisaan lahayn \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E wuu sheegaa oo wuxuu ku sii jiraa xaashida fiiqan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-muuqaalka-3d\"\u003EFur muuqaalka 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuuji xaashida aad rabto inaad hubiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E bar-ka ku muuqda magaca xaashida iyo miisaanka, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Markii ugu horreysay, muuqaalka 3D wuxuu qaataa wakhti yar si uu u soo rido. Xaashida waxaa lagu sawiraa dhulka, takeoff-kana waa taagan yahay isagoo midabka walxa kasta leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad dib ugu noqoto, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E mar kale, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to the sheet\u003C/span\u003E, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Dooro qalab sawir (Linear, Area, Count iwm.) sidoo kale way dib u celisaa, sababtoo ah calaamadaha waxaa lagu sawiraa xaashida fiiqan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxay muujinaysaa xaashida shaashadda; beddel xaashiyada liiska xaashiyada, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, muuqaalka 3D wuu raacaa. Si aad u aragto dabaqyo dhowr mar, isku rog (hoos).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-aragto\"\u003EWaxa aad aragto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECalaamad\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E3D-ga\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhad toos ah, walxa leh joog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDarbi joogtiisu tahay oo khadka dheer ku taagan. Khadadka wareegsan ayaa raacaya wareegga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhad toos ah, walxa aan joog lahayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiq xaashida. Walxa u sii joog hoos \u003Cstrong\u003EItem\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u taagto.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBed, walxa leh qoto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDabaq qotadiisu tahay, godadkiisa oo furan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBed, walxa aan qoto lahayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaxan khafiif ah oo 2&quot;, si ay weli u muuqato.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiir yar oo ku taagan dhibic kasta oo la tiriyay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJoogta waa goobta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight\u003C/span\u003E ee walxa khadka, qotadana waa goobta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDepth\u003C/span\u003E ee walxa bedka, hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EItem\u003C/strong\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003ESamee walxaha takeoff-ka\u003C/a\u003E). Beddel, muuqaalka 3D isla markiiba wuu cusboonaysiiyaa. Qoraalka hoosta magaca xaashida wuxuu sheegayaa waxa xaashidu ku jirto, tusaale &quot;This sheet in 3D: 2 walls, 1 slab, 3 counts&quot; (Xaashidan 3D: 2 darbi, 1 dabaq, 3 tiro), iyo inta khadad ama bed aan joog ama qoto lahayn. Riix dhaqdhaqaaqyada waxay u gudbaan muuqaalka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETirooyinka 3D kuma beddelmaan: darbi waa dhererkiisa saxda ah oo jibbaaray joogiisa, mugga dabaqna waa bedkiisa saafi ah (kontuur ka jar goyn, wareegyada saxda ah) jibbaaray qotadiisa. Wareegyada waxaa lagu sawiraa khadad gaaban oo toosan oo keliya shaashadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-eeg-wareegga\"\u003EKu eeg wareegga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFicil\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid, ama jiid batoonka dhexe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu wareeg takeoff-ka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + jiid, ama jiid batoonka midig\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuuri.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGurigu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee ama yaree meesha curyaanka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaqdhaqaaqa laba farood ee trackpad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeg (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu guuraa). Pinch wuu weyneeyaa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETop\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFront\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeft\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERight\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBottom\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalada caadiga ah, oo loo habeeyay takeoff-ka. Muuqaalka 3D wuxuu ku furmaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPerspective\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPerspective wuu shaqeeyaa ama joogsadaa (parallel marka uu joogsado).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZoom extents\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashida oo dhan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheet\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuji ama qari xaashida dhulka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadda muuqaalka, geeska sare midig\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji dhinac, geeso ama geeso si aad uga aragto meeshaas; jiid si aad u wareegto; jiid giraangiraha isha si aad u rogto; badhanka guriga wuxuu dib ugu noqdaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeeska wuxuu muujinayaa calaamadda muuqaalka, X, Y, Z axis yar, ama waxba: dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, tab-ka TakeoffCraft, hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ECorner indicator\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta TakeoffCraft\u003C/a\u003E). Xaashida fiiqan ma leh calaamad geesood.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHal farood wuu wareegaa; laba farood wuu pinch-gareeyaa oo wuu guuraa. Taabasho wuxuu doortaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"derbiyo-dhumuc-sal-iyo-furo-leh\"\u003EDerbiyo dhumuc, sal iyo furo leh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWalxa khadka ah ee leh joog wuxuu taagan yahay sida qayb khafiif ah. Si aad uga aragto derbi dhab ah, ku sii qaabka walxa hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EIn 3D\u003C/strong\u003E dejintiisa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWall thickness\u003C/strong\u003E (8&quot;, 0.2 m): derbigu wuxuu noqonayaa jidh adag, dhexe khadka aad sawirtay, geesaha xiran.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBase height\u003C/strong\u003E: derbigu wuxuu ka bilaabmaa dhowr meel ka sare dhulka (soffit, cabinet sare). Walxa bedka sidoo kale way leedahay, tusaale saqaf ee 9&#039;-0&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOpening head\u003C/strong\u003E: qaybta la jarayo (albaab, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#deduct-a-part-of-a-run\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"deduct-a-part-of-a-run\"\u003EKa jar qayb khadka\u003C/a\u003E) waxay ilaalisaa derbiga ka sare joogtaas, sidaas darteed albaabku wuxuu u muuqdaa albaab. Had iyo jeer aan la dejin, qaybta la jaray waxay ka tagtaa god ilaa sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwan waxay qaabeeyaan kaliya muuqaalka 3D: tirooyinka (dherer, bal derbi, kharash) way sii joogaan sidii ay ahaayeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dabaqyada-isku-rog\"\u003EDabaqyada isku rog\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur PDF-ka dabaq kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuuqaalka 3D, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELevels…\u003C/span\u003E oo qor dhererka dabaq kasta, tusaale \u003Ccode\u003E0\u003C/code\u003E dabaqa dhulka iyo \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;\u003C/code\u003E kan xiga. Madhan waxay ka saaraysaa xaashida.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStack\u003C/span\u003E. Xaashi kasta oo leh heer wuxuu muujinayaa takeoff-kiisa joogtiisa; xaashida shaashadda ayaa ku jirta dabaqeeda, kuwa kale waa la cidhiidhiyay. Qoraalku wuxuu sheegayaa inta dabaq ee isku rogan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXaashidu waxay isku dhigtaa meeshooda bogga, sidaas darteed tani waxay shaqeysaa qorshayaasha dabaqyada oo lagu rogay siyaabo isku mid ah (isku cabbirka xaashida iyo booska). Xaashi leh heer laakiin aan miisaan lahayn ayaa laga reebay, qoraalkuna wuu sheegaa. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStack\u003C/span\u003E mar kale si aad u aragto hal xaashi mar. Heerarka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa takeoff-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-muuqaalka-3d-sawir-ahaan\"\u003EKaydi muuqaalka 3D sawir ahaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG\u003C/span\u003E bar-ka 3D si aad u hesho sawirka muuqaalka sida uu shaashadda ku yaal (\u003Ccode\u003E… 3D.png\u003C/code\u003E); \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka dhigaa laba jeer weyn (\u003Ccode\u003E… 3D@2x.png\u003C/code\u003E), daabacaadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-muuqaalka-3d-moodel-ahaan\"\u003EKaydi muuqaalka 3D moodel ahaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGLB\u003C/span\u003E bar-ka 3D. Waxaad heleysaa fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E (glTF, binary) oo ah waxa muuqaalku muujinayo — dabaqa shaashadda ama dabaqyada isku rogan oo dhan — kaas oo barnaamijyada 3D kale furi karaan: hal shay calaamad kasta, oo loo magacaabay walxaheeda, midabka walxa, mitir iyo Y kor loo taagan. Xaashida laftiisa iyo kontuurrada ma ku jiraan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"calaamad-ka-dooro-3d\"\u003ECalaamad ka dooro 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji derbi, dabaq, saxan ama tiir. Calaamaddiisu waxay noqonaysaa calaamadda la doortay, sida haddii aad ku guuntay xaashida: waxay muuqataa hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadda la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E, walxeedu wuxuu noqonayaa midka hadda jira, status bar-kuna wuxuu siinayaa dhererka iyo joogta, ama bedka, qotada iyo mugga yard kuwaad. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + guji wuxuu ku daraa calaamadaha doorashada ama wuu ka saaraa. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu tirtiraa calaamadaha la doortay, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu soo celiyaa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu doorto midna. Dib xaashida, calaamadahaas isla waxay ku sii jiraan la doortay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalku wuxuu raacaa mawduuca: Model-ka, xaashida dhulka waxay noqotaa mugdi sida muuqaalka fiiqan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Muuqaalka 3D waa hubin, ma aha qorshe labaad: wuxuu xaashida furan ee takeoff-ka ka dhigaa mid kor loo taagan xaashida dusheeda, sidaas darteed darbi maqan, dabaq laba jeer, ama tiro ka baxsan ayaa si fudud u muuqda. Ka hor inta aadan bilaabin: xaashida waa u baahan tahay miisaan (Dejinta miisaanka). Joogta iyo qotada waxay u baahan yihiin feet dhab ah, sidaas darteed xaashi aan miisaan lahayn 3D wuu sheegaa oo wuxuu ku sii jiraa xaashida fiiqan. Fur muuqaalka 3D Muuji xaashida aad rabto inaad hubiso. Dooro 3D bar-ka ku muuqda magaca xaashida iyo miisaanka, ama riix 3. Markii ugu horreysay, muuqaalka 3D wuxuu qaataa wakhti yar si uu u soo rido. Xaashida waxaa lagu sawiraa dhulka, takeoff-kana waa taagan yahay isagoo midabka walxa kasta leh. Si aad dib ugu noqoto, dooro 3D mar kale, Back to the sheet, ama riix 3. Dooro qalab sawir (Linear, Area, Count iwm.) sidoo kale way dib u celisaa, sababtoo ah calaamadaha waxaa lagu sawiraa xaashida fiiqan. Waxay muujinaysaa xaashida shaashadda; beddel xaashiyada liiska xaashiyada, ama Page Down iyo Page Up, muuqaalka 3D wuu raacaa. Si aad u aragto dabaqyo dhowr mar, isku rog (hoos). Waxa aad aragto Calaamad 3D-ga Khad toos ah, walxa leh joog Darbi joogtiisu tahay oo khadka dheer ku taagan. Khadadka wareegsan ayaa raacaya wareegga. Khad toos ah, walxa aan joog lahayn Xariiq xaashida. Walxa u sii joog hoos Item si aad u taagto. Bed, walxa leh qoto Dabaq qotadiisu tahay, godadkiisa oo furan. Bed, walxa aan qoto lahayn Saxan khafiif ah oo 2\", si ay weli u muuqato. Tiro Tiir yar oo ku taagan dhibic kasta oo la tiriyay. Joogta waa goobta Height ee walxa khadka, qotadana waa goobta Depth ee walxa bedka, hoosta Item (eeg Samee walxaha takeoff-ka). Beddel, muuqaalka 3D isla markiiba wuu cusboonaysiiyaa. Qoraalka hoosta magaca xaashida wuxuu sheegayaa waxa xaashidu ku jirto, tusaale \"This sheet in 3D: 2 walls, 1 slab, 3 counts\" (Xaashidan 3D: 2 darbi, 1 dabaq, 3 tiro), iyo inta khadad ama bed aan joog ama qoto lahayn. Riix dhaqdhaqaaqyada waxay u gudbaan muuqaalka. Tirooyinka 3D kuma beddelmaan: darbi waa dhererkiisa saxda ah oo jibbaaray joogiisa, mugga dabaqna waa bedkiisa saafi ah (kontuur ka jar goyn, wareegyada saxda ah) jibbaaray qotadiisa. Wareegyada waxaa lagu sawiraa khadad gaaban oo toosan oo keliya shaashadda. Ku eeg wareegga Ficil Waxa uu sameeyo Jiid, ama jiid batoonka dhexe Ku wareeg takeoff-ka. Shift + jiid, ama jiid batoonka midig Guuri. Gurigu Weynee ama yaree meesha curyaanka. Dhaqdhaqaaqa laba farood ee trackpad Wareeg (Shift wuu guuraa). Pinch wuu weyneeyaa. Iso, Top, Front, Back, Left, Right, Bottom Muuqaalada caadiga ah, oo loo habeeyay takeoff-ka. Muuqaalka 3D wuxuu ku furmaa Iso. Perspective Perspective wuu shaqeeyaa ama joogsadaa (parallel marka uu joogsado). Zoom extents ama F Xaashida oo dhan. Sheet Muuji ama qari xaashida dhulka. Calaamadda muuqaalka, geeska sare midig Guji dhinac, geeso ama geeso si aad uga aragto meeshaas; jiid si aad u wareegto; jiid giraangiraha isha si aad u rogto; badhanka guriga wuxuu dib ugu noqdaa Iso. Geeska wuxuu muujinayaa calaamadda muuqaalka, X, Y, Z axis yar, ama waxba: dooro Settings, tab-ka TakeoffCraft, hoosta Corner indicator (Dejinta TakeoffCraft). Xaashida fiiqan ma leh calaamad geesood. Hal farood wuu wareegaa; laba farood wuu pinch-gareeyaa oo wuu guuraa. Taabasho wuxuu doortaa. Derbiyo dhumuc, sal iyo furo leh Walxa khadka ah ee leh joog wuxuu taagan yahay sida qayb khafiif ah. Si aad uga aragto derbi dhab ah, ku sii qaabka walxa hoosta In 3D dejintiisa: Wall thickness (8\", 0.2 m): derbigu wuxuu noqonayaa jidh adag, dhexe khadka aad sawirtay, geesaha xiran. Base height: derbigu wuxuu ka bilaabmaa dhowr meel ka sare dhulka (soffit, cabinet sare). Walxa bedka sidoo kale way leedahay, tusaale saqaf ee 9'-0\". Opening head: qaybta la jarayo (albaab, Ka jar qayb khadka) waxay ilaalisaa derbiga ka sare joogtaas, sidaas darteed albaabku wuxuu u muuqdaa albaab. Had iyo jeer aan la dejin, qaybta la jaray waxay ka tagtaa god ilaa sare. Kuwan waxay qaabeeyaan kaliya muuqaalka 3D: tirooyinka (dherer, bal derbi, kharash) way sii joogaan sidii ay ahaayeen. Dabaqyada isku rog Fur PDF-ka dabaq kasta. Muuqaalka 3D, dooro Levels… oo qor dhererka dabaq kasta, tusaale 0 dabaqa dhulka iyo 12' kan xiga. Madhan waxay ka saaraysaa xaashida. Dooro Stack. Xaashi kasta oo leh heer wuxuu muujinayaa takeoff-kiisa joogtiisa; xaashida shaashadda ayaa ku jirta dabaqeeda, kuwa kale waa la cidhiidhiyay. Qoraalku wuxuu sheegayaa inta dabaq ee isku rogan. Xaashidu waxay isku dhigtaa meeshooda bogga, sidaas darteed tani waxay shaqeysaa qorshayaasha dabaqyada oo lagu rogay siyaabo isku mid ah (isku cabbirka xaashida iyo booska). Xaashi leh heer laakiin aan miisaan lahayn ayaa laga reebay, qoraalkuna wuu sheegaa. Dooro Stack mar kale si aad u aragto hal xaashi mar. Heerarka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa takeoff-ka. Kaydi muuqaalka 3D sawir ahaan Dooro PNG bar-ka 3D si aad u hesho sawirka muuqaalka sida uu shaashadda ku yaal (… 3D.png); Shift + guji PNG wuxuu ka dhigaa laba jeer weyn (… 3D@2x.png), daabacaadda. Kaydi muuqaalka 3D moodel ahaan Dooro GLB bar-ka 3D. Waxaad heleysaa fayl .glb (glTF, binary) oo ah waxa muuqaalku muujinayo — dabaqa shaashadda ama dabaqyada isku rogan oo dhan — kaas oo barnaamijyada 3D kale furi karaan: hal shay calaamad kasta, oo loo magacaabay walxaheeda, midabka walxa, mitir iyo Y kor loo taagan. Xaashida laftiisa iyo kontuurrada ma ku jiraan. Calaamad ka dooro 3D Guji derbi, dabaq, saxan ama tiir. Calaamaddiisu waxay noqonaysaa calaamadda la doortay, sida haddii aad ku guuntay xaashida: waxay muuqataa hoosta Calaamadda la doortay, walxeedu wuxuu noqonayaa midka hadda jira, status bar-kuna wuxuu siinayaa dhererka iyo joogta, ama bedka, qotada iyo mugga yard kuwaad. Shift + guji wuxuu ku daraa calaamadaha doorashada ama wuu ka saaraa. Delete wuxuu tirtiraa calaamadaha la doortay, Ctrl+Z wuu soo celiyaa; Esc wuxuu doorto midna. Dib xaashida, calaamadahaas isla waxay ku sii jiraan la doortay. Muuqaalku wuxuu raacaa mawduuca: Model-ka, xaashida dhulka waxay noqotaa mugdi sida muuqaalka fiiqan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"markups","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Qoraallada, daruuradda iyo iftiiminta","summary":"Calaamadi su'aalaha iyo isbeddelada xaashiyada qoraallo, daruuro dib u eegis iyo iftiimo, raac xaalad kasta oo furan, la jawaabay ama xiran, oo ku dir PDF-ka calaamadsan.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["calaamad","calaamadaha","qoraal","faallo","su'aal","rfi","daruur","daruur dib u eegis","iftiin","xaalad","furan","la jawaabay","xiran","dib u eegis","liiska calaamadaha"],"headings":[{"id":"ku-dar-mid","text":"Ku dar mid","level":2},{"id":"xaalad-iyo-wax-ka-beddelka","text":"Xaalad iyo wax ka beddelka","level":2},{"id":"liiska","text":"Liiska","level":2},{"id":"wadaag","text":"Wadaag","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadaha waxay u dhigan yihiin wax aad xusuusato ama weydiiso intii aad xisaabinayso: &quot;xaqiiji nooca salka&quot;, daruur dib u eegis oo ku wareegsan derbi isbeddelay, qoraal iftiimay oo ku jira qorshaha. Waxay saaran yihiin xaashiga oo leh xaalad, waxaa lagu liis garaynayaa meel keli ah, waxayna ku daabacmaan PDF-ka calaamadsan. \u003Cstrong\u003EMarna lama tiro\u003C/strong\u003E: ma jiro tiro, ma jiro kharash.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar-mid\"\u003EKu dar mid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadin\u003C/span\u003E bar-ka ku sare xaashiga, oo dooro:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECalaamad\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESidee\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoraal\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix meesha ay tagayso, qor qoraalka, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar\u003C/span\u003E. Waxay u muuqataa sidii pin wareegsan oo sadarka koowaad ku taal dhinaceeda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDaruur\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix hal geesood, kadibna geeska ka soo horjeeda, oo qor qoraal (ama ka tag madhan). Daruur dib u eegis oo dhaadheer ayaa ku wareegta sanduuqa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIftiin\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix labo geesood: sanduuq jaalle ah oo hufan, oo qoraal ku jira haddii aad rabto.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ka dib geesta koowaad wuu joojiyaa. Qalabku wuu sii shaqeynayaa kan xiga; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu dib ugu celinayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaalad-iyo-wax-ka-beddelka\"\u003EXaalad iyo wax ka beddelka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix calaamad oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E si aad u doorato. Panelka midig wuxuu tusayaa \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadin\u003C/strong\u003E: nooceeda iyo xaashigeeda, \u003Cstrong\u003EXaalad\u003C/strong\u003E — Furan, La jawaabay ama Xiran — iyo qoraalkeeda, oo aad beddeli karto. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E) ayaa ka saaraa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa soo celinaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPin-ka qoraalka wuu oranji yahay inta uu furan yahay, buluug markii la jawaabo, cirro markii la xiro; daruurta xirani waxay noqotaa cirro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"liiska\"\u003ELiiska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadin\u003C/strong\u003E dhinaca midig wuxuu liisanayaa calaamad kasta oo xisaabinta ku jirta, xaaladeeda, wuxuuna sheegayaa inta furan ee weli jirta. Calig \u003Cstrong\u003EFuran oo keliya\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u aragto waxa weli la xallinayo. Riix safka si aad u tagto xaashigiisa oo aad u doorato.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wadaag\"\u003EWadaag\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF calaamadsan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku sawiraa bogagga: iftiimada, daruuradda iyo pin-ka, mid kastaa sanduuq leh xaaladdiisa oo ku qoran xarfo waaweyn (OPEN, ANSWERED, CLOSED) iyo qoraalkiisa. Bog leh calaamado laakiin aan calaamado xisaabin lahayn ayaa sidoo kale lagu daraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa xaashi shaqo oo \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadin\u003C/strong\u003E ah: xaashiga, nooca, xaaladda iyo qoraalka, hal safka mid kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxaa lagu kaydiyaa \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E iyo PDF ku jira xisaabinta qadarka (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\"\u003EPDF ay ku jirto xisaabinta qadarka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Calaamadaha waxay u dhigan yihiin wax aad xusuusato ama weydiiso intii aad xisaabinayso: \"xaqiiji nooca salka\", daruur dib u eegis oo ku wareegsan derbi isbeddelay, qoraal iftiimay oo ku jira qorshaha. Waxay saaran yihiin xaashiga oo leh xaalad, waxaa lagu liis garaynayaa meel keli ah, waxayna ku daabacmaan PDF-ka calaamadsan. Marna lama tiro: ma jiro tiro, ma jiro kharash. Ku dar mid Fur Calaamadin bar-ka ku sare xaashiga, oo dooro: Calaamad Sidee Qoraal Riix meesha ay tagayso, qor qoraalka, dooro Ku dar. Waxay u muuqataa sidii pin wareegsan oo sadarka koowaad ku taal dhinaceeda. Daruur Riix hal geesood, kadibna geeska ka soo horjeeda, oo qor qoraal (ama ka tag madhan). Daruur dib u eegis oo dhaadheer ayaa ku wareegta sanduuqa. Iftiin Riix labo geesood: sanduuq jaalle ah oo hufan, oo qoraal ku jira haddii aad rabto. Esc ka dib geesta koowaad wuu joojiyaa. Qalabku wuu sii shaqeynayaa kan xiga; V wuxuu dib ugu celinayaa Dooro. Xaalad iyo wax ka beddelka Riix calaamad oo leh Dooro si aad u doorato. Panelka midig wuxuu tusayaa Calaamadin: nooceeda iyo xaashigeeda, Xaalad — Furan, La jawaabay ama Xiran — iyo qoraalkeeda, oo aad beddeli karto. Delete (ama Tirtir) ayaa ka saaraa; Ctrl+Z ayaa soo celinaysa. Pin-ka qoraalka wuu oranji yahay inta uu furan yahay, buluug markii la jawaabo, cirro markii la xiro; daruurta xirani waxay noqotaa cirro. Liiska Calaamadin dhinaca midig wuxuu liisanayaa calaamad kasta oo xisaabinta ku jirta, xaaladeeda, wuxuuna sheegayaa inta furan ee weli jirta. Calig Furan oo keliya si aad u aragto waxa weli la xallinayo. Riix safka si aad u tagto xaashigiisa oo aad u doorato. Wadaag PDF calaamadsan wuxuu ku sawiraa bogagga: iftiimada, daruuradda iyo pin-ka, mid kastaa sanduuq leh xaaladdiisa oo ku qoran xarfo waaweyn (OPEN, ANSWERED, CLOSED) iyo qoraalkiisa. Bog leh calaamado laakiin aan calaamado xisaabin lahayn ayaa sidoo kale lagu daraa. XLSX wuxuu ku daraa xaashi shaqo oo Calaamadin ah: xaashiga, nooca, xaaladda iyo qoraalka, hal safka mid kasta. Waxaa lagu kaydiyaa .takeoff.json iyo PDF ku jira xisaabinta qadarka (PDF ay ku jirto xisaabinta qadarka).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"export-estimate","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Dhoofi qiyaasta iyo PDF calaamadsan","summary":"Soo dejiso qiyaasta sida buug XLSX oo leh qaacidooyin firfircoon ama CSV, iyo nuqullo PDF-kaaga oo leh xisaabinta lagu rinjiyeeyay.","section":"tasks","order":100,"keywords":["soo jeedin","koobid tartan","dhoofin","spreadsheet","buug","miiska xisaabta","xlsx","csv","pdf calaamadsan","daabac xisaabinta","warbixin","la wadaag","dir","sharaxaad"],"headings":[{"id":"qiyaasta-sida-miiska-xisaabta-xlsx","text":"Qiyaasta sida miiska xisaabta (XLSX)","level":2},{"id":"qiyaasta-sida-csv","text":"Qiyaasta sida CSV","level":2},{"id":"qiyaasta-google-sheets","text":"Qiyaasta Google Sheets","level":2},{"id":"qiimayaasha-maqan-iyo-saxiixa","text":"Qiimayaasha maqan iyo saxiixa","level":2},{"id":"pdf-calaamadsan","text":"PDF calaamadsan","level":2},{"id":"ma-jiro-wax-la-dhoofiyo","text":"Ma jiro wax la dhoofiyo?","level":2},{"id":"kaydi-xisaabinta-sidoo-kale","text":"Kaydi xisaabinta sidoo kale","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDhoofinta waa soo dejin. Waxay ku samaysmaan kombiyuutarkaaga xisaabinta iyo PDF-yada furan; wax meel loo diraa ma jiro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qiyaasta-sida-miiska-xisaabta-xlsx\"\u003EQiyaasta sida miiska xisaabta (XLSX)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofin\u003C/span\u003E ee qalabka, oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E. Browserkaagu wuxuu soo dejinayaa \u003Ccode\u003E(name).xlsx\u003C/code\u003E. Xariiqda xaaladda waxay leedahay &quot;Dhoofisay (name).xlsx (qiyaas kharash oo leh qaacidooyin firfircoon, sida xaashiga, calaamadaha, miisaamaha).&quot; waxayna ku darta digniin haddii qiyaasta aan dhamaystirnayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu fur barnaamijkaaga miiska xisaabta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBuuggu wuxuu leeyahay afar xaashi, iyo warbixinnada hoose marka ay khusayaan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXaashi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ku jira\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiyaas kharash\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafka shay kasta iyo qayb kasta: tiro, qashin, tiro oo qashin leh, qiimayaasha, alaab, shaqo, wadar, fiiro gaar ah. Wadarta guud hoosta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESida xaashiga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiro kasta oo shay ah oo xaashi kasta, oo leh tirada calaamadaha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamad kasta: xaashi, shay, nooc, tiro, faahfaahin (dherarka qaybaha, aagagga guud iyo kuwa la jaray, iyo perimeter-ka).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiisaamaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashi kasta oo leh miisaan ama calaamado: miisaankiisa, sida loo dejiyay (preset, ama calibrated on ...), iyo feet halkii unug PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESoo koobid xisaabinta qadarka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiro kasta oo shay, lambarka CSI, calaamadaha iyo xaashiyada, iyada oo aan qiimo lahayn.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELiiska agabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQayb kasta oo isku-dhis oo lagu daray xisaabinta oo dhan oo lagu wada geliyay (qayb isticmaashay dhowr shay waa hal safka), oo leh qashin iyo kharashka agabka, iyo shayada isticmaalaya.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECodsiga qiimaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELiiska agabka oo loo diro iibiyaha: tirooyinka oo qashin leh, tiir qiime halkii unug oo madhan, iyo wadar oo buuxda marka qiimayaasha la qoro.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESida qaybta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlaab, shaqo iyo wadar sida qaybta CSI MasterFormat, marka shayada leeyihiin \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELambarka CSI\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-summary\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-summary\"\u003Ekoobidda tartanka\u003C/a\u003E jirto, xaashida Qiyaas kharash waxay ku dhammaataa calaamadaha dheeraadka ah (shaqada, canshuuraha iibka, overhead, faa&#039;iidada, bond-ka iyo tartanka) oo ah qaacidooyin firfircoon.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXaashida Qiyaas kharash waxay sii haysataa \u003Cstrong\u003Eqaacidooyin firfircoon\u003C/strong\u003E: tiro oo qashin leh, alaabta iyo shaqada la wareejiyay, wadarta safka kasta iyo wadarta guud. Barnaamijyada miiska xisaabta dib ayay u xisaabiyaan, sidaas darteed waad beddeli kartaa qiime ama qashin miiska xisaabta oo wadarta ayaa raacaysa. Tirooyinka uu TakeoffCraft xisaabiyey waxa sidoo kale lagu kaydiyaa unugyada, oo waxay isku mid yihiin ilaa sentiga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETiirka fiiro-gaarka wuxuu ku qoraa qaacidada qayb kasta, khaladaadka qaacidada, calaamadaha xaashiyada aan miisaan lahayn, aagga darbiga iyo perimeter-ka. Marka wax laga tago, safka wadarta guud wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Dhammaystirnayn ma aha: eeg fiiro gaarka kor ku yaal&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBuugga waxa lagu hubiyay LibreOffice Calc, kaas oo dib u xisaabiyey wadarta isku mid ah. Weli lama furin Excel. Faahfaahinta tiir-tiir waxa lagu sharaxay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-columns\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-columns\"\u003ETiirarka dhoofinta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qiyaasta-sida-csv\"\u003EQiyaasta sida CSV\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofin\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E. Waxaad heleysaa \u003Ccode\u003E(name).csv\u003C/code\u003E: safafka iyo tiirarka isku mid ah ee xaashida Qiyaas kharash, oo ah qiimayaal caadi ah (qaacidooyin la&#039;aan), iyo wadarta guud. Isticmaal si aad ugu dhejiso nidaam kale oo qiyaas ama xisaab.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECSV-gu wuxuu leeyahay qiyaasta oo keliya; tirooyinka sida xaashiga iyo liiska calaamadaha, isticmaal XLSX. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELiiska agabka\u003C/span\u003E oo ku jirta isla menu-ga wuxuu kaydiyaa liiska agabka oo keliya sida CSV, si loo dalbado.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qiyaasta-google-sheets\"\u003EQiyaasta Google Sheets\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa sare miiska Tirooyinka, \u003Cstrong\u003EKoobiyee for Google Sheets\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qiyaasta ku rogayaa clipboard-kaaga sida qoraal tab-ka kala soocan, isla safafka sida CSV. Google Sheet, riix unugga A1 oo dhaji. TakeoffCraft ma galo Google, mana diro wax halkaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qiimayaasha-maqan-iyo-saxiixa\"\u003EQiimayaasha maqan iyo saxiixa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafka leh tiro laakiin aan qiime lahayn wuxuu ku qoraa \u003Cstrong\u003ENo rate\u003C/strong\u003E fiiro gaarkiisa, dhoofintuna waxay tirinaysaa inta ku jirta wadarta. Marka qiyaasta si rasmi ah loo saxiixay, dhoofintu waxay magacaabaa yuu saxiixay, goorta, iyo wadarta loo saxiixay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/sign-off-the-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/sign-off-the-estimate\"\u003EQiimayaasha maqan iyo saxiixa qiyaasta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pdf-calaamadsan\"\u003EPDF calaamadsan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur PDF-yada aad rabto in calaamadaha lagu rinjiyeeyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofin\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF calaamadsan\u003C/span\u003E. &quot;Waxa la qorayaa PDF-ka calaamadsan…&quot; ayaa muuqda, kadibna browserkaagu wuxuu soo dejinayaa hal fayl PDF kasta oo calaamadsan, oo magac loo bixiyay \u003Ccode\u003E(PDF name) (takeoff).pdf\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENuqulka dhexdiisa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esocdaalada waxa lagu rinjiyeeyaa xariiqyo midabka shayga ay leeyihiin,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eaagagga waxa lagu buuxiyaa midab khafiif ah oo geesta adag leh, kuwa la jaray waxay ka furan yihiin,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Etirooyinka waa dhibco,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebog kasta oo calaamad leh waxa geeska hoose ee bidix ku yaal sharax yar: midabka shay kasta, magaciisa iyo tirada bogga ku jirta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPDF-yadaadii asalka ahayd lama beddelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFiiro gaar ah:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxa la qori karo oo keliya PDF-yada furan. Calaamadaha PDF-yada aan furnayn waxay ku jiraan wadarta laakiin lama rinjiyeeyo; fur PDF-yadaas marka hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMagacyada sharaxa waxay isticmaalaan font PDF caadi ah. Xarfaha aan lagu muujin karin waxay daabacmaan &quot;?&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPDF-ka sirtaa (password ama encrypted) nuqul calaamadsan lama qori karo: &quot;Tani PDF waa password-ka ama encrypted, markaa nuqul calaamadsan lama qori karo. Xisaabintu way fiican tahay; ku dhoofi xaashida halkii.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF calaamadsan\u003C/span\u003E ee ugu horreysa tab-ka wuxuu soo rarayaa qoraha PDF. Khadka ka baxsan, wuxuu halkaas ku jiraa kaliya haddii app bar-ka muujiyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EShaqaynta khadka ka baxsan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka PDF calaamadsan dhowr yihiin, Chrome iyo Edge way weydiin karaan hal mar in site-kan lo ogolaado inuu soo dejiyo faylal badan. Dooro Allow, haddii kale waxaad heleysaa faylka koowaad oo keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ma-jiro-wax-la-dhoofiyo\"\u003EMa jiro wax la dhoofiyo?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E waxay u baahan yihiin ugu yaraan hal shay: &quot;Wax la dhoofiyo weli ma jiro: samee shay oo qadar ka qaad.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF calaamadsan\u003C/span\u003E waxay u baahan tahay calaamado PDF furan: &quot;Calaamado ma jiraan PDF-yada furan weli.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-xisaabinta-sidoo-kale\"\u003EKaydi xisaabinta sidoo kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhoofintu waa warbixin. Si aad ugu sii shaqeyso xisaabinta mar dambe, dooro sidoo kale \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi xisaabinta\u003C/span\u003E: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003EKaydi oo dib u fur xisaabinta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u darto overhead, faa&#039;iido, canshuur iyo bond oo aad u dirto soo jeedin, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-summary\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-summary\"\u003EKoobidda tartanka iyo soo jeedinta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Dhoofinta waa soo dejin. Waxay ku samaysmaan kombiyuutarkaaga xisaabinta iyo PDF-yada furan; wax meel loo diraa ma jiro. Qiyaasta sida miiska xisaabta (XLSX) Fur menu-ga Dhoofin ee qalabka, oo dooro XLSX. Browserkaagu wuxuu soo dejinayaa (name).xlsx. Xariiqda xaaladda waxay leedahay \"Dhoofisay (name).xlsx (qiyaas kharash oo leh qaacidooyin firfircoon, sida xaashiga, calaamadaha, miisaamaha).\" waxayna ku darta digniin haddii qiyaasta aan dhamaystirnayn. Ku fur barnaamijkaaga miiska xisaabta. Buuggu wuxuu leeyahay afar xaashi, iyo warbixinnada hoose marka ay khusayaan: Xaashi Waxa ku jira Qiyaas kharash Safka shay kasta iyo qayb kasta: tiro, qashin, tiro oo qashin leh, qiimayaasha, alaab, shaqo, wadar, fiiro gaar ah. Wadarta guud hoosta. Sida xaashiga Tiro kasta oo shay ah oo xaashi kasta, oo leh tirada calaamadaha. Calaamadaha Calaamad kasta: xaashi, shay, nooc, tiro, faahfaahin (dherarka qaybaha, aagagga guud iyo kuwa la jaray, iyo perimeter-ka). Miisaamaha Xaashi kasta oo leh miisaan ama calaamado: miisaankiisa, sida loo dejiyay (preset, ama calibrated on ...), iyo feet halkii unug PDF. Soo koobid xisaabinta qadarka Tiro kasta oo shay, lambarka CSI, calaamadaha iyo xaashiyada, iyada oo aan qiimo lahayn. Liiska agabka Qayb kasta oo isku-dhis oo lagu daray xisaabinta oo dhan oo lagu wada geliyay (qayb isticmaashay dhowr shay waa hal safka), oo leh qashin iyo kharashka agabka, iyo shayada isticmaalaya. Codsiga qiimaha Liiska agabka oo loo diro iibiyaha: tirooyinka oo qashin leh, tiir qiime halkii unug oo madhan, iyo wadar oo buuxda marka qiimayaasha la qoro. Sida qaybta Alaab, shaqo iyo wadar sida qaybta CSI MasterFormat, marka shayada leeyihiin Lambarka CSI. Haddii koobidda tartanka jirto, xaashida Qiyaas kharash waxay ku dhammaataa calaamadaha dheeraadka ah (shaqada, canshuuraha iibka, overhead, faa'iidada, bond-ka iyo tartanka) oo ah qaacidooyin firfircoon. Xaashida Qiyaas kharash waxay sii haysataa qaacidooyin firfircoon: tiro oo qashin leh, alaabta iyo shaqada la wareejiyay, wadarta safka kasta iyo wadarta guud. Barnaamijyada miiska xisaabta dib ayay u xisaabiyaan, sidaas darteed waad beddeli kartaa qiime ama qashin miiska xisaabta oo wadarta ayaa raacaysa. Tirooyinka uu TakeoffCraft xisaabiyey waxa sidoo kale lagu kaydiyaa unugyada, oo waxay isku mid yihiin ilaa sentiga. Tiirka fiiro-gaarka wuxuu ku qoraa qaacidada qayb kasta, khaladaadka qaacidada, calaamadaha xaashiyada aan miisaan lahayn, aagga darbiga iyo perimeter-ka. Marka wax laga tago, safka wadarta guud wuxuu leeyahay \"Dhammaystirnayn ma aha: eeg fiiro gaarka kor ku yaal\". Buugga waxa lagu hubiyay LibreOffice Calc, kaas oo dib u xisaabiyey wadarta isku mid ah. Weli lama furin Excel. Faahfaahinta tiir-tiir waxa lagu sharaxay Tiirarka dhoofinta. Qiyaasta sida CSV Fur menu-ga Dhoofin oo dooro CSV. Waxaad heleysaa (name).csv: safafka iyo tiirarka isku mid ah ee xaashida Qiyaas kharash, oo ah qiimayaal caadi ah (qaacidooyin la'aan), iyo wadarta guud. Isticmaal si aad ugu dhejiso nidaam kale oo qiyaas ama xisaab. CSV-gu wuxuu leeyahay qiyaasta oo keliya; tirooyinka sida xaashiga iyo liiska calaamadaha, isticmaal XLSX. Liiska agabka oo ku jirta isla menu-ga wuxuu kaydiyaa liiska agabka oo keliya sida CSV, si loo dalbado. Qiyaasta Google Sheets Ka sare miiska Tirooyinka, Koobiyee for Google Sheets wuxuu qiyaasta ku rogayaa clipboard-kaaga sida qoraal tab-ka kala soocan, isla safafka sida CSV. Google Sheet, riix unugga A1 oo dhaji. TakeoffCraft ma galo Google, mana diro wax halkaas. Qiimayaasha maqan iyo saxiixa Safka leh tiro laakiin aan qiime lahayn wuxuu ku qoraa No rate fiiro gaarkiisa, dhoofintuna waxay tirinaysaa inta ku jirta wadarta. Marka qiyaasta si rasmi ah loo saxiixay, dhoofintu waxay magacaabaa yuu saxiixay, goorta, iyo wadarta loo saxiixay. Eeg Qiimayaasha maqan iyo saxiixa qiyaasta. PDF calaamadsan Fur PDF-yada aad rabto in calaamadaha lagu rinjiyeeyo. Fur menu-ga Dhoofin oo dooro PDF calaamadsan. \"Waxa la qorayaa PDF-ka calaamadsan…\" ayaa muuqda, kadibna browserkaagu wuxuu soo dejinayaa hal fayl PDF kasta oo calaamadsan, oo magac loo bixiyay (PDF name) (takeoff).pdf. Nuqulka dhexdiisa: socdaalada waxa lagu rinjiyeeyaa xariiqyo midabka shayga ay leeyihiin, aagagga waxa lagu buuxiyaa midab khafiif ah oo geesta adag leh, kuwa la jaray waxay ka furan yihiin, tirooyinka waa dhibco, bog kasta oo calaamad leh waxa geeska hoose ee bidix ku yaal sharax yar: midabka shay kasta, magaciisa iyo tirada bogga ku jirta. PDF-yadaadii asalka ahayd lama beddelo. Fiiro gaar ah: Waxa la qori karo oo keliya PDF-yada furan. Calaamadaha PDF-yada aan furnayn waxay ku jiraan wadarta laakiin lama rinjiyeeyo; fur PDF-yadaas marka hore. Magacyada sharaxa waxay isticmaalaan font PDF caadi ah. Xarfaha aan lagu muujin karin waxay daabacmaan \"?\". PDF-ka sirtaa (password ama encrypted) nuqul calaamadsan lama qori karo: \"Tani PDF waa password-ka ama encrypted, markaa nuqul calaamadsan lama qori karo. Xisaabintu way fiican tahay; ku dhoofi xaashida halkii.\" PDF calaamadsan ee ugu horreysa tab-ka wuxuu soo rarayaa qoraha PDF. Khadka ka baxsan, wuxuu halkaas ku jiraa kaliya haddii app bar-ka muujiyo Khadka ka baxsan diyaar; eeg Shaqaynta khadka ka baxsan. Marka PDF calaamadsan dhowr yihiin, Chrome iyo Edge way weydiin karaan hal mar in site-kan lo ogolaado inuu soo dejiyo faylal badan. Dooro Allow, haddii kale waxaad heleysaa faylka koowaad oo keliya. Ma jiro wax la dhoofiyo? XLSX iyo CSV waxay u baahan yihiin ugu yaraan hal shay: \"Wax la dhoofiyo weli ma jiro: samee shay oo qadar ka qaad.\" PDF calaamadsan waxay u baahan tahay calaamado PDF furan: \"Calaamado ma jiraan PDF-yada furan weli.\" Kaydi xisaabinta sidoo kale Dhoofintu waa warbixin. Si aad ugu sii shaqeyso xisaabinta mar dambe, dooro sidoo kale Kaydi xisaabinta: eeg Kaydi oo dib u fur xisaabinta. Si aad u darto overhead, faa'iido, canshuur iyo bond oo aad u dirto soo jeedin, eeg Koobidda tartanka iyo soo jeedinta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"bid-summary","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Soo koobid iyo soo jeedin","summary":"Ku dar culayska shaqada, cashuurta iibka, overhead, profit iyo bond qiyaasta, qor waxa ku jira iyo waxa laga reebay, oo soo deji PDF soo jeedin oo la diro.","section":"tasks","order":101,"keywords":["tartan","culayska shaqada","culayska","mushahar","soo jeedin","quote","overhead","profit","markup","faa'iido","cashuurta iibka","bond","ku jira","laga reebay","shuruudaha","saxiixa","macmiil","qiime"],"headings":[{"id":"kor-u-kordhinta","text":"Kor u kordhinta","level":2},{"id":"soo-jeedinta","text":"Soo jeedinta","level":2},{"id":"dhoofinta","text":"Dhoofinta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQiyaasta waxay qiimeysaa waxa aad cabbirtay. \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo koobidka tartanka\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa u beddelaa qiime: wuxuu ku daraa cashuurta iibka, overhead, profit iyo bond, wuxuuna sameeyaa \u003Cstrong\u003EPDF soo jeedin\u003C/strong\u003E oo leh waxa ku jira iyo waxa laga reebay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid summary &amp; proposal…\u003C/span\u003E. Waxa ku jira oo dhan waa la kaydiyaa takeoff-ka, isbeddel kasta waa la dib u celin karaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kor-u-kordhinta\"\u003EKor u kordhinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu qor boqolkiiba mid kasta shanta (ka tag kuwa kale 0). Waxaa lagu xisaabiyaa tallaabadan, mid kasta wuxuu ku salaysan yahay wixii ka sare:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESafka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESida loo xisaabiyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial, Labor\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWadarta qiyaasta (base bid marka takeoff-ku leeyahay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas#alternates-base-bid-plus-adds-and-deducts\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-hash=\"alternates-base-bid-plus-adds-and-deducts\"\u003Eikhtiyaarro\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabor burden\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBurden % × shaqo: cashuurta mushaharka, caymiska iyo faa&#039;iidooyinka shaqaalahayaga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECost\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAgab + shaqo + culayska shaqada.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESales tax on material\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETax % × agab.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOverhead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOverhead % × (kharash + cashuur).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProfit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProfit % × (kharash + cashuur + overhead).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBond\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBond % × wax kasta oo sare.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBid\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWadarta safafka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafka kasta waxaa lagu wareejiyaa sentiga. Xaashida buug-shaqada waxay muujinaysaa safafkan isla hoosta wadarta xaashida Estimate, oo leh qaacido nool. Soo koobidku wuu cusboonaanayaa marka aad qorto: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu qaadaa boqolkiiba. Ikhtiyaar kasta waxaa lagu muujiyaa markups isku mid ah oo ku saabsan kharashkiisa, si milkiiluhu u arko waxa ikhtiyaarku dhab ahaan beddelayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-jeedinta\"\u003ESoo jeedinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBuuxi waxa soo jeedintu sheegi karto:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EProject\u003C/strong\u003E (magaca takeoff-ka haddii madhan), \u003Cstrong\u003ETo\u003C/strong\u003E (macmiilka) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EFrom\u003C/strong\u003E (shirkadaada).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInclusions\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EExclusions\u003C/strong\u003E: mid safka kasta; dash ama bullet hore waa fiican.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETerms\u003C/strong\u003E: qoraal xor ah, sida &quot;Valid for 30 days.&quot; (Ansax 30 maalmood.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EList the items and quantities\u003C/strong\u003E: shaqada, walxaha mid mid, tirooyinka, iyadoo aan qiimo lahayn. Ka saar calaamada haddii soo jeedintu tahay lump-sum.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProposal PDF\u003C/span\u003E. PDF-ku (\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;takeoff&gt; - proposal.pdf\u003C/code\u003E) wuxuu leeyahay taariikhda, sanduuqa qiimaha oo leh markup kasta iyo tartanka, ikhtiyaarrada, shaqada, inclusions iyo exclusions, terms, iyo khadadka saxiixa iyo taariikhda. Haddii tirooyinka qaarkood aan la cabbiri karin (xaashi aan miisaan lahayn), waxay sheegtaa hoosta qiimaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhoofinta\"\u003EDhoofinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka takeoff-ku leeyo soo koobid tartan, CSV-gu wuxuu ku dhammaadaa, buug-shaqadana waxay helaysaa xaashi \u003Cstrong\u003EBid summary\u003C/strong\u003E, oo leh safka kasta, boqolkiiba iyo qadarka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003EDhoofi qiyaasta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Qiyaasta waxay qiimeysaa waxa aad cabbirtay. Soo koobidka tartanka ayaa u beddelaa qiime: wuxuu ku daraa cashuurta iibka, overhead, profit iyo bond, wuxuuna sameeyaa PDF soo jeedin oo leh waxa ku jira iyo waxa laga reebay. Fur Export › Bid summary & proposal…. Waxa ku jira oo dhan waa la kaydiyaa takeoff-ka, isbeddel kasta waa la dib u celin karaa. Kor u kordhinta Ku qor boqolkiiba mid kasta shanta (ka tag kuwa kale 0). Waxaa lagu xisaabiyaa tallaabadan, mid kasta wuxuu ku salaysan yahay wixii ka sare: Safka Sida loo xisaabiyo Material, Labor Wadarta qiyaasta (base bid marka takeoff-ku leeyahay ikhtiyaarro). Labor burden Burden % × shaqo: cashuurta mushaharka, caymiska iyo faa'iidooyinka shaqaalahayaga. Cost Agab + shaqo + culayska shaqada. Sales tax on material Tax % × agab. Overhead Overhead % × (kharash + cashuur). Profit Profit % × (kharash + cashuur + overhead). Bond Bond % × wax kasta oo sare. Bid Wadarta safafka. Safka kasta waxaa lagu wareejiyaa sentiga. Xaashida buug-shaqada waxay muujinaysaa safafkan isla hoosta wadarta xaashida Estimate, oo leh qaacido nool. Soo koobidku wuu cusboonaanayaa marka aad qorto: Enter wuxuu qaadaa boqolkiiba. Ikhtiyaar kasta waxaa lagu muujiyaa markups isku mid ah oo ku saabsan kharashkiisa, si milkiiluhu u arko waxa ikhtiyaarku dhab ahaan beddelayo. Soo jeedinta Buuxi waxa soo jeedintu sheegi karto: Project (magaca takeoff-ka haddii madhan), To (macmiilka) iyo From (shirkadaada). Inclusions iyo Exclusions: mid safka kasta; dash ama bullet hore waa fiican. Terms: qoraal xor ah, sida \"Valid for 30 days.\" (Ansax 30 maalmood.) List the items and quantities: shaqada, walxaha mid mid, tirooyinka, iyadoo aan qiimo lahayn. Ka saar calaamada haddii soo jeedintu tahay lump-sum. Dooro Proposal PDF. PDF-ku (\u003Ctakeoff\u003E - proposal.pdf) wuxuu leeyahay taariikhda, sanduuqa qiimaha oo leh markup kasta iyo tartanka, ikhtiyaarrada, shaqada, inclusions iyo exclusions, terms, iyo khadadka saxiixa iyo taariikhda. Haddii tirooyinka qaarkood aan la cabbiri karin (xaashi aan miisaan lahayn), waxay sheegtaa hoosta qiimaha. Dhoofinta Marka takeoff-ku leeyo soo koobid tartan, CSV-gu wuxuu ku dhammaadaa, buug-shaqadana waxay helaysaa xaashi Bid summary, oo leh safka kasta, boqolkiiba iyo qadarka. Eeg Dhoofi qiyaasta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"bid-leveling","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Xirmooyinka tartanka iyo isku-simaynta tartanka","summary":"Qaybi qiyaasta xirmooyin ka mid ah shaqo, dir shaqada xirmo kasta qandaraasleyda, isbarbardhig tartamaha ku soo laabanaya isla shaqada, oo isticmaal tartanka la doortay qiimaha xirmada.","section":"tasks","order":102,"keywords":["isku-simaynta tartanka","isku-simaynta","xirmada tartanka","qandaraasle","tartan qandaraasle","shaqada","plug","shaqo","qaybta CSI","isbarbardhig tartamaha","tartanka ugu hooseeya","miiska tartanka","tartame","abaal","tartanka la doortay","qiimaha qandaraasleyda"],"headings":[{"id":"xirmooyinka","text":"Xirmooyinka","level":2},{"id":"geli-tartamaha","text":"Geli tartamaha","level":2},{"id":"sida-tartamaha-loo-isku-simaayo","text":"Sida tartamaha loo isku simaayo","level":2},{"id":"tartanka-u-isticmaal-qiimaha-xirmada","text":"Tartanka u isticmaal qiimaha xirmada","level":2},{"id":"tartamo-ku-soo-laabanaya-emailka","text":"Tartamo ku soo laabanaya emailka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQandaraasle guud wuxuu u diraa shaqo kasta oo shaqo ah qandaraasleyda, wuxuuna isbarbardhigaa waxa soo laabanaya. TakeoffCraft labaduba wuu sameeyaa takeoff-ka: fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid packages and leveling…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xirmooyinka\"\u003EXirmooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaa jira hal xirmo oo loo qaybiyay CSI division kasta oo walxahayagu isticmaalaan (laba lambarka hore ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSI number\u003C/span\u003E ee walxa, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003ESamee walxaha takeoff-ka\u003C/a\u003E). Walxaha aan lambar lahayn waxay samaysaa xirmo gaar ah. Xirmo kasta wuxuu muujinayaa walxahiisa, inta xaashi ay calaamadaheedu ku jiraan, iyo kharashkayaga (agabka iyo shaqada ka hor markups, ka qaadashada base bid).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScope CSV\u003C/span\u003E si aad u soo dejiso waxa loo diro qandaraasle: walxa kasta oo leh lambarka CSI, tirada, unugga iyo xaashiyada uu ku yaal. Ma leh qiimo. Agabka iibiyayaasha, buug-shaqada codsiga qiimaha ayaa leh liiska qaybaha (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003EDhoofi qiyaasta\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"geli-tartamaha\"\u003EGeli tartamaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafka madhan ee hoosta xirmada, qor magaca tartameha iyo qiimaha tartanka, ka dibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the bid\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii tartanku qayb ka reebo shaqada, fur liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeft out\u003C/span\u003E oo calaamee walxaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u saxdo magac ama qiime, ku qor miiska; badhanka × ayaa tartanka ka saara.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E dib u celisa, tartamaduna waxay la kaydiyaan takeoff-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-tartamaha-loo-isku-simaayo\"\u003ESida tartamaha loo isku simaayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETartamuhu marar dhif ah ma daboolaan isla shaqada. Isku-simaynta wuxuu walxa kasta oo laga reebay ku buuxiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eplug\u003C/strong\u003E oo qiimaheeda kharashkayaga, si tartan kasta loo isbarbardhigo xirmada oo dhan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-simay = tartanka + plugs\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETartanka isku-simaysan ee ugu hooseeya waxaa lagu calaamaysay \u003Cstrong\u003ELow\u003C/strong\u003E; isla dhibcaha, kan horay loo galiyay. \u003Cstrong\u003EAgainst our cost\u003C/strong\u003E waa tartanka isku-simaysan oo ka yar kharashkayaga xirmada; qiime taban waxay ka hooseeyaa. Tartan kaa muuqda inuu ugu hooseeyo wuu lumi karaa marka shaqada ka maqan la tiriyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBuug-shaqada waxay helaysaa xaashi \u003Cstrong\u003EBid leveling\u003C/strong\u003E oo leh xirmo kasta oo tartan leh: qiyaastayada, tartan kasta, plug-kiisa, wadarta isku-simaysan iyo kala duwanaanta, iyo waxa tartan kasta ka reebay, oo dhan qaacido nool.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tartanka-u-isticmaal-qiimaha-xirmada\"\u003ETartanka u isticmaal qiimaha xirmada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse\u003C/span\u003E tartan, wuxuuna noqonayaa qiimaha xirmada oo dhan ee qiyaastaada: qiimaynta xirmada (walxaha, shuruudahooda labaad iyo qaybaha isku-dhisyada) waa ka baxaa wadarta shaqada, walxuhuna waxay ahaadaan tiro leh heerarkayaga, hal safka, \u003Cstrong\u003EChosen bid\u003C/strong\u003E, wuxuu qaadaa qiimaha tartanka. Walxaha tartanku ka reebay waxay ku sii jiraan kharashkayaga, taasoo ah plug-ka isku-simaynku horey u tiriyay. Dooro tartan kale, ama dooro isla mid si aad u celiso; mid kastaa waa hal tallaabo oo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E dib u celisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo koobidka tartanka, tartamaha qandaraasleyda waa hal safka gudaha kharashka: overhead, profit iyo bond waa lagu daraa sida kharash kasta; cashuurta iibka (agabka keliya) iyo culayska shaqada (shaqada keliya) ma ahan. Xaashida Estimate ee buug-shaqada waxay leedahay tartanka la doortay safkeeda, oo markups block-ku wuu ku daraa, qaacido nool. Liiska agabka waxa uu ka reebayaa agabka xirmo la siiyay, sababtoo ah qandaraaslaha ayaa bixiya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXirmo ku jirta aagga tartanka ee ikhtiyaarka ah lama dib-u-qiimeeyo: ikhtiyaaraadka iyo wadar-yarrada aagga waxay isticmaalaan qiimayaasha aad leedahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tartamo-ku-soo-laabanaya-emailka\"\u003ETartamo ku soo laabanaya emailka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMa aha inaad tartamaha gacanta ku qortid. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend for bids…\u003C/span\u003E hoosta xirmada wuxuu u emaylaa qandaraasle kasta xiriir bog ah oo ay ku qoraan qiime safka kasta; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGet prices\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku soo qaadaa waxa ay diireen miiskan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-invitations\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-invitations\"\u003EDir xirmo tartan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETartan gacanta lagu qoro weli wuu shaqeeyaa, tartanka gacanta lagu qoray iyo kan websaydhka way isku dhinacyo. Tartamaha ka imanaya websaydhka waxaa lagu calaamaysay \u003Cstrong\u003Eweb\u003C/strong\u003E (ama \u003Cstrong\u003Eweb, late\u003C/strong\u003E haddii ay yimaadeen ka dib due time); qiimahooda wuxuu isbeddelaa kaliya marka tartamuhu uu diro nooc cusub, sidaas darteed tafatirkaaga ayaa sii jira ilaa markaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Qandaraasle guud wuxuu u diraa shaqo kasta oo shaqo ah qandaraasleyda, wuxuuna isbarbardhigaa waxa soo laabanaya. TakeoffCraft labaduba wuu sameeyaa takeoff-ka: fur Export › Bid packages and leveling…. Xirmooyinka Waxaa jira hal xirmo oo loo qaybiyay CSI division kasta oo walxahayagu isticmaalaan (laba lambarka hore ee CSI number ee walxa, eeg Samee walxaha takeoff-ka). Walxaha aan lambar lahayn waxay samaysaa xirmo gaar ah. Xirmo kasta wuxuu muujinayaa walxahiisa, inta xaashi ay calaamadaheedu ku jiraan, iyo kharashkayaga (agabka iyo shaqada ka hor markups, ka qaadashada base bid). Dooro Scope CSV si aad u soo dejiso waxa loo diro qandaraasle: walxa kasta oo leh lambarka CSI, tirada, unugga iyo xaashiyada uu ku yaal. Ma leh qiimo. Agabka iibiyayaasha, buug-shaqada codsiga qiimaha ayaa leh liiska qaybaha (eeg Dhoofi qiyaasta). Geli tartamaha Safka madhan ee hoosta xirmada, qor magaca tartameha iyo qiimaha tartanka, ka dibna dooro Add the bid. Haddii tartanku qayb ka reebo shaqada, fur liiska Left out oo calaamee walxaha. Si aad u saxdo magac ama qiime, ku qor miiska; badhanka × ayaa tartanka ka saara. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo Ctrl+Z dib u celisa, tartamaduna waxay la kaydiyaan takeoff-ka. Sida tartamaha loo isku simaayo Tartamuhu marar dhif ah ma daboolaan isla shaqada. Isku-simaynta wuxuu walxa kasta oo laga reebay ku buuxiyaa plug oo qiimaheeda kharashkayaga, si tartan kasta loo isbarbardhigo xirmada oo dhan: Isku-simay = tartanka + plugs Tartanka isku-simaysan ee ugu hooseeya waxaa lagu calaamaysay Low; isla dhibcaha, kan horay loo galiyay. Against our cost waa tartanka isku-simaysan oo ka yar kharashkayaga xirmada; qiime taban waxay ka hooseeyaa. Tartan kaa muuqda inuu ugu hooseeyo wuu lumi karaa marka shaqada ka maqan la tiriyo. Buug-shaqada waxay helaysaa xaashi Bid leveling oo leh xirmo kasta oo tartan leh: qiyaastayada, tartan kasta, plug-kiisa, wadarta isku-simaysan iyo kala duwanaanta, iyo waxa tartan kasta ka reebay, oo dhan qaacido nool. Tartanka u isticmaal qiimaha xirmada Dooro Use tartan, wuxuuna noqonayaa qiimaha xirmada oo dhan ee qiyaastaada: qiimaynta xirmada (walxaha, shuruudahooda labaad iyo qaybaha isku-dhisyada) waa ka baxaa wadarta shaqada, walxuhuna waxay ahaadaan tiro leh heerarkayaga, hal safka, Chosen bid, wuxuu qaadaa qiimaha tartanka. Walxaha tartanku ka reebay waxay ku sii jiraan kharashkayaga, taasoo ah plug-ka isku-simaynku horey u tiriyay. Dooro tartan kale, ama dooro isla mid si aad u celiso; mid kastaa waa hal tallaabo oo Ctrl+Z dib u celisa. Soo koobidka tartanka, tartamaha qandaraasleyda waa hal safka gudaha kharashka: overhead, profit iyo bond waa lagu daraa sida kharash kasta; cashuurta iibka (agabka keliya) iyo culayska shaqada (shaqada keliya) ma ahan. Xaashida Estimate ee buug-shaqada waxay leedahay tartanka la doortay safkeeda, oo markups block-ku wuu ku daraa, qaacido nool. Liiska agabka waxa uu ka reebayaa agabka xirmo la siiyay, sababtoo ah qandaraaslaha ayaa bixiya. Xirmo ku jirta aagga tartanka ee ikhtiyaarka ah lama dib-u-qiimeeyo: ikhtiyaaraadka iyo wadar-yarrada aagga waxay isticmaalaan qiimayaasha aad leedahay. Tartamo ku soo laabanaya emailka Ma aha inaad tartamaha gacanta ku qortid. Send for bids… hoosta xirmada wuxuu u emaylaa qandaraasle kasta xiriir bog ah oo ay ku qoraan qiime safka kasta; Get prices wuxuu ku soo qaadaa waxa ay diireen miiskan. Eeg Dir xirmo tartan. Tartan gacanta lagu qoro weli wuu shaqeeyaa, tartanka gacanta lagu qoray iyo kan websaydhka way isku dhinacyo. Tartamaha ka imanaya websaydhka waxaa lagu calaamaysay web (ama web, late haddii ay yimaadeen ka dib due time); qiimahooda wuxuu isbeddelaa kaliya marka tartamuhu uu diro nooc cusub, sidaas darteed tafatirkaaga ayaa sii jira ilaa markaas.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"bid-invitations","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Dir xirmo tartan","summary":"Email u dir xirmo tartan qandaraasleyada, ka dhig inay qiimaha ku qoraan bog aan akoon u baahnayn, qiimayaasha xidh ilaa waqtiga furitaanka, oo ku soo qaad xaashida isku-simaynta.","section":"tasks","order":103,"keywords":["dir tartan","martiqaad","martiqaadka tartanka","tartame","qandaraasle","martiqaad","email","codsiga qiimaha","tartamo xidhan","furitaanka tartanka","maalinta tartanka","tartan dambe","ugu dambaysta","xasuusin","diiwaanka qandaraasleyda","daboolka","caymiska","ansixin","csv","isku xidh","sheets pdf"],"headings":[{"id":"ka-hor-inta-aadan-diraynin","text":"Ka hor inta aadan diraynin","level":2},{"id":"dir-xirmo","text":"Dir xirmo","level":2},{"id":"waxa-tartamuhu-arkaa","text":"Waxa tartamuhu arkaa","level":2},{"id":"tartamo-xidhan-iyo-furitaanka","text":"Tartamo xidhan iyo furitaanka","level":2},{"id":"soo-qaad-qiimayaasha","text":"Soo qaad qiimayaasha","level":2},{"id":"websaydhka","text":"Websaydhka","level":2},{"id":"cidda-aragta-waxa-iyo-intee-le-eg","text":"Cidda aragta waxa, iyo intee le'eg","level":2},{"id":"wali-lama-dhisin","text":"Wali lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid packages and leveling…\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend for bids…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu u diraa hal xirmo dadka aad dooratay. Websaydhku mid kasta wuxuu u emaylaa xidhiidh; iyagu waxay furaan bog, arkaan shaqada oo qoraan qiime safka kasta. Qiimayaasha waxaad ku aragtaa xaashida isku-simaynta, oo diyaar u ah isbarbardhig (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-leveling\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-leveling\"\u003EXirmooyinka tartanka iyo isku-simaynta tartanka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDiritaanku weli ma furna dadka oo dhan. Inta uu astaanta tijaabada socoto wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa akoonnada uu kooxda CadCraft awoodday; haddii akoonkaaga aan la awoodin, wada-hadalku waa sheegi doonaa. Bogga tartamaha wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa martiqaad kasta oo la diray.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-hor-inta-aadan-diraynin\"\u003EKa hor inta aadan diraynin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxaad u baahan tahay akoon CadCraft oo leh cinwaan email la xaqiijiyay. TakeoffCraft browser-ka wuxuu weydiinayaa inaad \u003Cstrong\u003EKu xidh\u003C/strong\u003E: tab ayaa furmaa getcadcraft.com, waxaad riixaysaa Connect, tabkaasna waxa uu helaa gelitaan 30 maalmood ku shaqeysa, xirmooyinka tartanka oo keliya, ilaa aad xidho tab-ka TakeoffCraft. Waad ka saari kartaa wakhti kasta bogga amniga. Daaqadda Studio weli ma diri karto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybta CSI u sii lambar kasta walxa: xirmo waa walxaha hal qaybta CSI (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003ESamee walxaha takeoff-ka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMiisaan xaashida calaamadaha xirmada ku jira, si tirooyinka ay arkaan tartamuhu loo cabbiro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dir-xirmo\"\u003EDir xirmo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend for bids…\u003C/span\u003E hoosta xirmada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBuuxi cinwaanka, mashruuca, fariinta ikhtiyaarka ah, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Edue time\u003C/strong\u003E waqtiga aad ku jirto waqtigaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa tag \u003Cstrong\u003EKeep prices sealed\u003C/strong\u003E oo la calaamaysan si aad u qariso qiimayaasha ilaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eopening time\u003C/strong\u003E (aan ka hor due time), ama ka saar calaamada si aad u aragto qiimayaasha markay yimaadaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa tag sanduuqa xaashiyada si aad u dirto PDF xaashiyada calaamadaha xirmada leh, calaamadaha lagu sawiray. Qiimayaashaada waligood kuma jiraan wax la diro: kaliya magacyada walxaha, lambarada CSI, tirooyinka, unugyada iyo magacyada xaashida.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor dadka la martiqaadayo, mid kasta safka hal, sida \u003Ccode\u003EName &lt;name@company.com&gt;\u003C/code\u003E ama cinwaanka keliya, ama calaamee dad ka mid ah diiwaanka qandaraasleyadaada. Ilaa 60 mar kasta, 100 xirmo kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend invitations\u003C/span\u003E. Qof kasta wuxuu helaa hal email oo fudud oo leh magacaaga iyo cinwaankaaga email-ka, waqtiga due time iyo xidhiidhka; jawaabaha waxay u tagaan adiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDialog-ku wuxuu kuu sheegayaa inta la diray oo magacyada kuwa la dhaafay: horey loo martiqaadey xirmadan, codsaday inaan la siin martiqaad tartan, cinwaan email aan sax ahayn, ama ka dhaadhacay xadka diritaanka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-tartamuhu-arkaa\"\u003EWaxa tartamuhu arkaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBog ku yaal xidhiidh gaar ah oo dheer, oo aan galitaan lahayn. Wuxuu muujinayaa cidda martiqaadday, waqtiga due time, in qiimayaashu xidhnaan yihiin, fariintaada iyo xaashida PDF, ka dibna safka kasta oo leh tirada. Safka kasta wuxuu geliyaa qiime ama calaamee \u003Cstrong\u003ELama daro\u003C/strong\u003E, wuxuuna ku dari karaa qoraal; qoraallada wuxuu ku daraa xirmada oo dhan iyo ilaa 3 fayl (qiimaha, warqadda shaqada, shahaadada). Waxay kaydin karaan oo mar kale bedeli karaan qiimayaashooda ilaa furitaanka, ama \u003Cstrong\u003Edecline\u003C/strong\u003E, oo leh sanduuq ay ku codsanayaan in CadCraft aan mar dambe u diro martiqaado tartan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tartamo-xidhan-iyo-furitaanka\"\u003ETartamo xidhan iyo furitaanka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa hor waqtiga furitaanka \u003Cstrong\u003Ema jiro qof\u003C/strong\u003E aragaya qiime, qoraal ama fayl: adiga ma aragto, TakeoffCraft ma aragto, bogga Bid packages-kaaga ma aragto. Waxaad aragtaa cidda la martiqaadday iyo haddii ay jawaabeen. Waqtiga furitaanka, tartan kasta wuu soo muuqdaa isla markiiba. Tartan la kaydiyay ka dib due time waa la aqbalaa oo calaamad \u003Cstrong\u003Elate\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa la siiyaa; isku-simaynta weli way ku liistaa, dib u dhaca waa calaamad, ma aha xukun. Furitaanka ka dib tartamuhu ma beddeli karo qiime. Haddii aan xidhnaan jirin, tartanku waa dhammaad marka uu dhammaado due time.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-qaad-qiimayaasha\"\u003ESoo qaad qiimayaasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGet prices\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu weydiiyaa websaydhka wuxuuna ku daraa jawaab kasta xirmada hal tartan, oo lagu calaamaysay \u003Cstrong\u003Eweb\u003C/strong\u003E. TakeoffCraft sidoo kale si aamusan ayuu weydiiyaa mar kasta oo aad furto dialog-ka inta uu xidhiidhsan yahay. Tartan ay tartamuhu kaydiyay nooc cusub ayaa la cusboonaysiiyaa meeshiisa; tartan aad tafatirtay wuxuu ku sii jiraa sidii aad ka tagtay ilaa ay soo dirto nooc cusub. Soo qaadista kasta waa hal tallaabo oo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E dib u celisa. Safyada laga reebay waxay u soo gudbaan sida shaqada tartanku ka reebayo, si isku-simaynta u buuxiso qiimo kasta oo kharash ahaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"websaydhka\"\u003EWebsaydhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkoonkaaga wuxuu leeyahay laba bog oo dheeraad ah marka aad diri karto: \u003Cstrong\u003EBid packages\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa waxaad dirtay, cidda jawaabtay, tartamada dambe iyo faylasha, wuxuuna kuu oggolaanayaa inaad dirto xasuusin (link cusub; kii hore wuu joogsanayaa), xidho, dib u furo ama jooji xirmada. \u003Cstrong\u003ESubcontractors\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu hayaa diiwaan kasta shirkad: xiriirrada, shaqooyinka, jawaabaha ansixinta (sannadaha ganacsiga, awoodda kafaalada, EMR, rikoodka badbaadada, union ama open shop, tixraacyo), taariikhaha dhicitaanka liisanka iyo caymiska, lagu calaamaysay marka ay dhacday ama ku dhow tahay 30 maalmood, iyo tartamadooda hore. Diiwaanka waxaad ku soo dejin kartaa oo dhoofin kartaa CSV: hal safka xiriir kasta, tiirarka dhoofinta ayaa muujinaya; shirkad aad horay u haysay waa la cusboonaysiiyaa, mana loo soo celiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cidda-aragta-waxa-iyo-intee-le-eg\"\u003ECidda aragta waxa, iyo intee le&#039;eg\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQiimayaasha, qoraallada iyo faylasha tartamuhu waxay u tagaan adiga iyo kooxda CadCraft, oo maamusha bogga. Waa la kaydiyaa 24 bilood ka dib taariikhda due date; faylasha 180 maalmood; ka dibna waa la tirtiraa. Cinwaanka email ee tartamuhu waa kii aad gelisay; waxaa loo isticmaalaa oo keliya martiqaadka iyo xasuusinta ee. Cinwaan kasta wuxuu helaa ugu badnaan 3 martiqaad maalintii oo dhan, isagoo wada; waxaad diri kartaa ilaa 200 maalintii.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wali-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAddenda, warqadaha abaalmarinta, xaashi shaqo oo la xaqiijiyay tartamuhu kasta, iyo xasuusinta toos ah ka hor taariikhka caymisku dhacayo ma la dhisin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Export › Bid packages and leveling… › Send for bids… wuxuu u diraa hal xirmo dadka aad dooratay. Websaydhku mid kasta wuxuu u emaylaa xidhiidh; iyagu waxay furaan bog, arkaan shaqada oo qoraan qiime safka kasta. Qiimayaasha waxaad ku aragtaa xaashida isku-simaynta, oo diyaar u ah isbarbardhig (Xirmooyinka tartanka iyo isku-simaynta tartanka). Diritaanku weli ma furna dadka oo dhan. Inta uu astaanta tijaabada socoto wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa akoonnada uu kooxda CadCraft awoodday; haddii akoonkaaga aan la awoodin, wada-hadalku waa sheegi doonaa. Bogga tartamaha wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa martiqaad kasta oo la diray. Ka hor inta aadan diraynin Waxaad u baahan tahay akoon CadCraft oo leh cinwaan email la xaqiijiyay. TakeoffCraft browser-ka wuxuu weydiinayaa inaad Ku xidh: tab ayaa furmaa getcadcraft.com, waxaad riixaysaa Connect, tabkaasna waxa uu helaa gelitaan 30 maalmood ku shaqeysa, xirmooyinka tartanka oo keliya, ilaa aad xidho tab-ka TakeoffCraft. Waad ka saari kartaa wakhti kasta bogga amniga. Daaqadda Studio weli ma diri karto. Qaybta CSI u sii lambar kasta walxa: xirmo waa walxaha hal qaybta CSI (Samee walxaha takeoff-ka). Miisaan xaashida calaamadaha xirmada ku jira, si tirooyinka ay arkaan tartamuhu loo cabbiro. Dir xirmo Dooro Send for bids… hoosta xirmada. Buuxi cinwaanka, mashruuca, fariinta ikhtiyaarka ah, iyo due time waqtiga aad ku jirto waqtigaaga. Ka tag Keep prices sealed oo la calaamaysan si aad u qariso qiimayaasha ilaa opening time (aan ka hor due time), ama ka saar calaamada si aad u aragto qiimayaasha markay yimaadaan. Ka tag sanduuqa xaashiyada si aad u dirto PDF xaashiyada calaamadaha xirmada leh, calaamadaha lagu sawiray. Qiimayaashaada waligood kuma jiraan wax la diro: kaliya magacyada walxaha, lambarada CSI, tirooyinka, unugyada iyo magacyada xaashida. Qor dadka la martiqaadayo, mid kasta safka hal, sida Name \u003Cname@company.com\u003E ama cinwaanka keliya, ama calaamee dad ka mid ah diiwaanka qandaraasleyadaada. Ilaa 60 mar kasta, 100 xirmo kasta. Dooro Send invitations. Qof kasta wuxuu helaa hal email oo fudud oo leh magacaaga iyo cinwaankaaga email-ka, waqtiga due time iyo xidhiidhka; jawaabaha waxay u tagaan adiga. Dialog-ku wuxuu kuu sheegayaa inta la diray oo magacyada kuwa la dhaafay: horey loo martiqaadey xirmadan, codsaday inaan la siin martiqaad tartan, cinwaan email aan sax ahayn, ama ka dhaadhacay xadka diritaanka. Waxa tartamuhu arkaa Bog ku yaal xidhiidh gaar ah oo dheer, oo aan galitaan lahayn. Wuxuu muujinayaa cidda martiqaadday, waqtiga due time, in qiimayaashu xidhnaan yihiin, fariintaada iyo xaashida PDF, ka dibna safka kasta oo leh tirada. Safka kasta wuxuu geliyaa qiime ama calaamee Lama daro, wuxuuna ku dari karaa qoraal; qoraallada wuxuu ku daraa xirmada oo dhan iyo ilaa 3 fayl (qiimaha, warqadda shaqada, shahaadada). Waxay kaydin karaan oo mar kale bedeli karaan qiimayaashooda ilaa furitaanka, ama decline, oo leh sanduuq ay ku codsanayaan in CadCraft aan mar dambe u diro martiqaado tartan. Tartamo xidhan iyo furitaanka Ka hor waqtiga furitaanka ma jiro qof aragaya qiime, qoraal ama fayl: adiga ma aragto, TakeoffCraft ma aragto, bogga Bid packages-kaaga ma aragto. Waxaad aragtaa cidda la martiqaadday iyo haddii ay jawaabeen. Waqtiga furitaanka, tartan kasta wuu soo muuqdaa isla markiiba. Tartan la kaydiyay ka dib due time waa la aqbalaa oo calaamad late ayaa la siiyaa; isku-simaynta weli way ku liistaa, dib u dhaca waa calaamad, ma aha xukun. Furitaanka ka dib tartamuhu ma beddeli karo qiime. Haddii aan xidhnaan jirin, tartanku waa dhammaad marka uu dhammaado due time. Soo qaad qiimayaasha Get prices wuxuu weydiiyaa websaydhka wuxuuna ku daraa jawaab kasta xirmada hal tartan, oo lagu calaamaysay web. TakeoffCraft sidoo kale si aamusan ayuu weydiiyaa mar kasta oo aad furto dialog-ka inta uu xidhiidhsan yahay. Tartan ay tartamuhu kaydiyay nooc cusub ayaa la cusboonaysiiyaa meeshiisa; tartan aad tafatirtay wuxuu ku sii jiraa sidii aad ka tagtay ilaa ay soo dirto nooc cusub. Soo qaadista kasta waa hal tallaabo oo Ctrl+Z dib u celisa. Safyada laga reebay waxay u soo gudbaan sida shaqada tartanku ka reebayo, si isku-simaynta u buuxiso qiimo kasta oo kharash ahaan. Websaydhka Akoonkaaga wuxuu leeyahay laba bog oo dheeraad ah marka aad diri karto: Bid packages wuxuu liistaa waxaad dirtay, cidda jawaabtay, tartamada dambe iyo faylasha, wuxuuna kuu oggolaanayaa inaad dirto xasuusin (link cusub; kii hore wuu joogsanayaa), xidho, dib u furo ama jooji xirmada. Subcontractors wuxuu hayaa diiwaan kasta shirkad: xiriirrada, shaqooyinka, jawaabaha ansixinta (sannadaha ganacsiga, awoodda kafaalada, EMR, rikoodka badbaadada, union ama open shop, tixraacyo), taariikhaha dhicitaanka liisanka iyo caymiska, lagu calaamaysay marka ay dhacday ama ku dhow tahay 30 maalmood, iyo tartamadooda hore. Diiwaanka waxaad ku soo dejin kartaa oo dhoofin kartaa CSV: hal safka xiriir kasta, tiirarka dhoofinta ayaa muujinaya; shirkad aad horay u haysay waa la cusboonaysiiyaa, mana loo soo celiyo. Cidda aragta waxa, iyo intee le'eg Qiimayaasha, qoraallada iyo faylasha tartamuhu waxay u tagaan adiga iyo kooxda CadCraft, oo maamusha bogga. Waa la kaydiyaa 24 bilood ka dib taariikhda due date; faylasha 180 maalmood; ka dibna waa la tirtiraa. Cinwaanka email ee tartamuhu waa kii aad gelisay; waxaa loo isticmaalaa oo keliya martiqaadka iyo xasuusinta ee. Cinwaan kasta wuxuu helaa ugu badnaan 3 martiqaad maalintii oo dhan, isagoo wada; waxaad diri kartaa ilaa 200 maalintii. Wali lama dhisin Addenda, warqadaha abaalmarinta, xaashi shaqo oo la xaqiijiyay tartamuhu kasta, iyo xasuusinta toos ah ka hor taariikhka caymisku dhacayo ma la dhisin. Eeg Wali lama dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"save-and-reopen","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Kaydi oo dib u fur xisaabinta qadarka","summary":"Kaydi xisaabinta sida mashruuc .takeoff.json, dib ugu fur isla PDF-yadii, iyo waxa dhaca marka PDF maqan yahay ama uu isbeddelay.","section":"tasks","order":110,"keywords":["xisaabinta qadarka","dhex PDF","lifaaq","kaydi","fur","dib u fur","mashruuc","takeoff.json","sii wad","PDF cusub","PDF la beddelay","PDF maqan","backup","autosave","soo celi","burbur"],"headings":[{"id":"kaydi","text":"Kaydi","level":2},{"id":"ku-hay-xisaabinta-gudaha-pdf-ka","text":"Ku hay xisaabinta gudaha PDF-ka","level":2},{"id":"haddii-tab-ka-ama-browser-ku-joogsado","text":"Haddii tab-ka ama browser-ku joogsado","level":2},{"id":"dib-u-fur","text":"Dib u fur","level":2},{"id":"marka-pdf-maqan-yahay","text":"Marka PDF maqan yahay","level":2},{"id":"marka-pdf-la-beddelay","text":"Marka PDF la beddelay","level":2},{"id":"fayl-dhaawacan-ama-shisheeye","text":"Fayl dhaawacan ama shisheeye","level":2},{"id":"taariikhda-ka-noqoshada","text":"Taariikhda ka noqoshada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EXisaabinta waxaa lagu kaydiyaa fayl mashruuc oo yar, \u003Ccode\u003E(name).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E. Waxay haysaa shayadaada, qaacidooyinkaaga, qiimayaashaada, miisaanka xaashi kasta iyo calaamad kasta. \u003Cstrong\u003EMa\u003C/strong\u003E haysato PDF-yada; waxay dib u helaan iyagii adiga oo ku salaysan waxa ku jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi xisaabinta\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, ama taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Browser-kaaga wuxuu soo dejinayaa \u003Ccode\u003E(name).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E. Jaanqaadka xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Waa la kaydiyay (name).takeoff.json. Waxay dib ugu furmaysaa isla PDF-yadii (iyagu waxaa lagu isku xidhaa waxa ku jira).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu rig faylka meel u dhow PDF-yada mashruuca, si labadoodu isku jiraan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydinta kasta wuxuu soo dejiyaa fayl cusub. Browser-kaagu wuxuu magacaabi karaa labaad \u003Ccode\u003E(name) (1).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E; kii ugu dambeeyay ayaad hayso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMagaca wuxuu ka yimaadaa PDF-ka ugu horeeya ee aad ku furtay xisaabintan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydi xisaabinta weli waa kaliya habka loo hayo xisaabinta fayl ahaan. Intaad shaqaynayso, TakeoffCraft wuxuu sidoo kale hayaa nuqul soo kabasho browser-kan (eeg hoos), balse kaydinta daruurta weli ma diyaar. Haddii aad isku daydo inaad xirto tab-ka isbeddel aan la kaydin ku jiro, browser-ku wuxuu kaa weydiinayaa inaad ka baxdo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-hay-xisaabinta-gudaha-pdf-ka\"\u003EKu hay xisaabinta gudaha PDF-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofin\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF oo ku jira xisaabinta qadarka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo dejiyaa nuqul PDF kasta oo furan, magaceedu sida \u003Ccode\u003EPlans (with takeoff).pdf\u003C/code\u003E, kaas oo xisaabinta oo dhan u qaada lifaaq: shayada, calaamadaha, miisaannada, aagagga tartanka, iyo wax kasta oo \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E ku jira. Bogagiisu lama beddelo, sidaas darteed wuu u eegaa oo u daabacaa sida asalka, akhristayaasha PDF kale ayaana xisaabinta ku arki doona lifaafkooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur nuqulkaas TakeoffCraft (siyaabkasta aad PDF-yada u furto) wuxuu weydiinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EPdf-kan wuxuu ku jiraa xisaabin qadar\u003C/strong\u003E: dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur xisaabinta qadarka\u003C/span\u003E si aad u soo celiso, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF-ka keliya\u003C/span\u003E si aad u furto oo keliya naqshadda. Nuqulku wuxuu matalaa PDF-ka laga sameeyay, sidaas darteed \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E oo laga kaydiyay midkoodna labadaba ayuu ku furmaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii PDF-yo badan ay jiraan, nuqul kasta wuxuu xambaarsan yahay xisaabinta oo dhan; furtoodaba wada. Mar kale kaydinta nuqulka waxay bedeshaa xisaabinta ku jirta, ma ay ku dari doonto mid labaad. \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E weli waa faylka loo hayo: waa yar yahay, waana kan ay autosave iyo app-ka desktop-ku qoraan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"haddii-tab-ka-ama-browser-ku-joogsado\"\u003EHaddii tab-ka ama browser-ku joogsado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhowr ilbiriqsi ka dib isbeddel kasta, TakeoffCraft wuxuu hayaa nuqul xisaabinta ah kaydka browser-kan, oo ay ku jiraan PDF-yadiisa haddii wadarta ay ka yar tahay ama le&#039;eg tahay 64 MB. Waxba server-ka lama soo dirayo. Marka aad kaydiso xisaabinta, aad bilowdo mid cusub ama aad furto mashruuc kale, nuqulkaas waa la tirtiraa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii tab-ku burburo, browser-ka ama kombiyuutarku joogsado, ama aad ka baxdo isbeddel aan la kaydin, marka xigta aad furto TakeoffCraft wuxuu weydiinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EMa soo celinaysaa shaqadaada?\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuuna magacaabaa xisaabinta. Guji \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo celi\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u soo celiso: shayada, calaamadaha iyo miisaannadu way soo noqdaan, PDF-yadiisana way dib u furmaan haddii la kaydiyay. Jaanqaadka xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Waa la soo celiyay (name). Weli fayl looma kaydin; Kaydi xisaabinta ayaa hayn doonta.&quot; Haddii PDF-yadu aad u waaweyn yihiin si loo kaydiyo, dib u fur; calaamadaha ayaa xaashiyadooda ku soo muuqan doona. Wax dheeraad ah: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/recover\" data-topic=\"basics/recover\"\u003ESoo celi shaqadaada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-fur\"\u003EDib u fur\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur TakeoffCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu rid faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E iyo PDF-yadiisa bogga dushiisa wada. Ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur qorshayaasha\u003C/span\u003E PDF-yada, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur xisaabinta\u003C/span\u003E mashruuca, siday kala horreeyaan. Jaanqaadka xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Waa la furay (name): 12 shay, 340 calaamo.&quot; Xaashi kasta miisaankiisa ayuu helaa, calaamadahana xaashiyadooda ayay ku soo muuqdaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDalabka PDF-yada muhiim ma aha, magacyadooda ama faylalkooda ma muhiim. TakeoffCraft wuxuu PDF kasta ku aqoonsadaa farshaxan (fingerprint) ee waxa ku jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad furto mashruuc intaad xisaabinta jirto isbeddel aan la kaydin ku jiro, TakeoffCraft marka hore wuxuu weydiinayaa: \u003Cstrong\u003EJooji\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EKa tag isbeddelada\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi xisaabinta marka hore\u003C/strong\u003E. Furidda mashruuc waxay beddeshaa shayada iyo calaamadaha hadda jira; PDF-yada horay loo furay way furan yihiin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-pdf-maqan-yahay\"\u003EMarka PDF maqan yahay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad furto mashruuca aanad furin dhammaan PDF-yadiisa, bar-ka xaaladda wuxuu ku daraa &quot;Fur PDF-yadiisa si aad u aragto calaamadaha (ku liistan hoos Xaashiyada).&quot; Hoosta liiska xaashiyada, qoraal wuxuu leeyahay:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E&quot;Xisaabintani waxay sidoo kale daboolaysaa PDF-yo aan la furin. Tiradooda waa la tiriyay; furo si aad u aragto oo u wax ka beddesho calaamadahooda:&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKadibna magacyada faylalka iyo cabbirradooda. Calaamadahooda weli waxay ku tiran yihiin wadar kasta iyo dhoofin, miisaannada ay lagu qiyaasay. Fur PDF-yadaas si aad u aragto oo u wax ka beddesho calaamadaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-pdf-la-beddelay\"\u003EMarka PDF la beddelay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPDF la dib u eegay, ama barnaamij kale oo mar kale kaydiyay, waxa ku jira ayaa kala duwan, sidaas darteed TakeoffCraft wuxuu u arkaa \u003Cstrong\u003Efayl kale\u003C/strong\u003E, xataa haddii magaca isku mid yahay. Qoraalka hoosta liiska xaashiyada, faylkaas noocaas ah wuxuu leeyahay &quot;magacaas fayl ayaa furan, laakiin waxa ku jira way kala duwan yihiin&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadaha waxay ku xiran yihiin nooca hore. Way sii tirinayaan, meelahooda hore iyo miisaannadoodii hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPDF-ka la dib u eegay wuxuu u furmaa xaashiyo cusub oo aan miisaan lahayn, iyo calaamo la&#039;aan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad xisaabinta ugu wareejiso dib u eegista, fur labada PDF oo isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBarbardhig\u003C/span\u003E xaashiga cusub: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\"\u003EBarbardhig xaashi dib loo eegay oo xisaabinta wareeji\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fayl-dhaawacan-ama-shisheeye\"\u003EFayl dhaawacan ama shisheeye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffCraft wuxuu hubiyaa fayl mashruuc kasta ka hor intuusan isticmaalin. Fariimaha aad arki kartid:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;(file) ma aha mashruuc TakeoffCraft (ma aha JSON sax ah).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Tani ma aha fayl mashruuc TakeoffCraft.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Mashruucan waxaa kaydiyay TakeoffCraft cusub. Ku fur halkaas.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;3 calaamo waa la burburiyay oo waa la tegey.&quot; (kuwa kale way furmaan)\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"taariikhda-ka-noqoshada\"\u003ETaariikhda ka noqoshada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaariikhda ka noqoshadu waxay bilaabataa mar cusub marka aad furto mashruuc. Kaydintu ma tirtirto.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Xisaabinta waxaa lagu kaydiyaa fayl mashruuc oo yar, (name).takeoff.json. Waxay haysaa shayadaada, qaacidooyinkaaga, qiimayaashaada, miisaanka xaashi kasta iyo calaamad kasta. Ma haysato PDF-yada; waxay dib u helaan iyagii adiga oo ku salaysan waxa ku jira. Kaydi Dooro Kaydi xisaabinta kooxda File, ama taabo Ctrl+S. Browser-kaaga wuxuu soo dejinayaa (name).takeoff.json. Jaanqaadka xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"Waa la kaydiyay (name).takeoff.json. Waxay dib ugu furmaysaa isla PDF-yadii (iyagu waxaa lagu isku xidhaa waxa ku jira).\" Ku rig faylka meel u dhow PDF-yada mashruuca, si labadoodu isku jiraan. Kaydinta kasta wuxuu soo dejiyaa fayl cusub. Browser-kaagu wuxuu magacaabi karaa labaad (name) (1).takeoff.json; kii ugu dambeeyay ayaad hayso. Magaca wuxuu ka yimaadaa PDF-ka ugu horeeya ee aad ku furtay xisaabintan. Kaydi xisaabinta weli waa kaliya habka loo hayo xisaabinta fayl ahaan. Intaad shaqaynayso, TakeoffCraft wuxuu sidoo kale hayaa nuqul soo kabasho browser-kan (eeg hoos), balse kaydinta daruurta weli ma diyaar. Haddii aad isku daydo inaad xirto tab-ka isbeddel aan la kaydin ku jiro, browser-ku wuxuu kaa weydiinayaa inaad ka baxdo. Ku hay xisaabinta gudaha PDF-ka Dhoofin › PDF oo ku jira xisaabinta qadarka wuxuu soo dejiyaa nuqul PDF kasta oo furan, magaceedu sida Plans (with takeoff).pdf, kaas oo xisaabinta oo dhan u qaada lifaaq: shayada, calaamadaha, miisaannada, aagagga tartanka, iyo wax kasta oo .takeoff.json ku jira. Bogagiisu lama beddelo, sidaas darteed wuu u eegaa oo u daabacaa sida asalka, akhristayaasha PDF kale ayaana xisaabinta ku arki doona lifaafkooda. Fur nuqulkaas TakeoffCraft (siyaabkasta aad PDF-yada u furto) wuxuu weydiinayaa Pdf-kan wuxuu ku jiraa xisaabin qadar: dooro Fur xisaabinta qadarka si aad u soo celiso, ama PDF-ka keliya si aad u furto oo keliya naqshadda. Nuqulku wuxuu matalaa PDF-ka laga sameeyay, sidaas darteed .takeoff.json oo laga kaydiyay midkoodna labadaba ayuu ku furmaa. Haddii PDF-yo badan ay jiraan, nuqul kasta wuxuu xambaarsan yahay xisaabinta oo dhan; furtoodaba wada. Mar kale kaydinta nuqulka waxay bedeshaa xisaabinta ku jirta, ma ay ku dari doonto mid labaad. .takeoff.json weli waa faylka loo hayo: waa yar yahay, waana kan ay autosave iyo app-ka desktop-ku qoraan. Haddii tab-ka ama browser-ku joogsado Dhowr ilbiriqsi ka dib isbeddel kasta, TakeoffCraft wuxuu hayaa nuqul xisaabinta ah kaydka browser-kan, oo ay ku jiraan PDF-yadiisa haddii wadarta ay ka yar tahay ama le'eg tahay 64 MB. Waxba server-ka lama soo dirayo. Marka aad kaydiso xisaabinta, aad bilowdo mid cusub ama aad furto mashruuc kale, nuqulkaas waa la tirtiraa. Haddii tab-ku burburo, browser-ka ama kombiyuutarku joogsado, ama aad ka baxdo isbeddel aan la kaydin, marka xigta aad furto TakeoffCraft wuxuu weydiinayaa Ma soo celinaysaa shaqadaada? wuxuuna magacaabaa xisaabinta. Guji Soo celi si aad u soo celiso: shayada, calaamadaha iyo miisaannadu way soo noqdaan, PDF-yadiisana way dib u furmaan haddii la kaydiyay. Jaanqaadka xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"Waa la soo celiyay (name). Weli fayl looma kaydin; Kaydi xisaabinta ayaa hayn doonta.\" Haddii PDF-yadu aad u waaweyn yihiin si loo kaydiyo, dib u fur; calaamadaha ayaa xaashiyadooda ku soo muuqan doona. Wax dheeraad ah: Soo celi shaqadaada. Dib u fur Fur TakeoffCraft. Ku rid faylka .takeoff.json iyo PDF-yadiisa bogga dushiisa wada. Ama dooro Fur qorshayaasha PDF-yada, iyo Fur xisaabinta mashruuca, siday kala horreeyaan. Jaanqaadka xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"Waa la furay (name): 12 shay, 340 calaamo.\" Xaashi kasta miisaankiisa ayuu helaa, calaamadahana xaashiyadooda ayay ku soo muuqdaan. Dalabka PDF-yada muhiim ma aha, magacyadooda ama faylalkooda ma muhiim. TakeoffCraft wuxuu PDF kasta ku aqoonsadaa farshaxan (fingerprint) ee waxa ku jira. Haddii aad furto mashruuc intaad xisaabinta jirto isbeddel aan la kaydin ku jiro, TakeoffCraft marka hore wuxuu weydiinayaa: Jooji, Ka tag isbeddelada, ama Kaydi xisaabinta marka hore. Furidda mashruuc waxay beddeshaa shayada iyo calaamadaha hadda jira; PDF-yada horay loo furay way furan yihiin. Marka PDF maqan yahay Haddii aad furto mashruuca aanad furin dhammaan PDF-yadiisa, bar-ka xaaladda wuxuu ku daraa \"Fur PDF-yadiisa si aad u aragto calaamadaha (ku liistan hoos Xaashiyada).\" Hoosta liiska xaashiyada, qoraal wuxuu leeyahay: \"Xisaabintani waxay sidoo kale daboolaysaa PDF-yo aan la furin. Tiradooda waa la tiriyay; furo si aad u aragto oo u wax ka beddesho calaamadahooda:\" Kadibna magacyada faylalka iyo cabbirradooda. Calaamadahooda weli waxay ku tiran yihiin wadar kasta iyo dhoofin, miisaannada ay lagu qiyaasay. Fur PDF-yadaas si aad u aragto oo u wax ka beddesho calaamadaha. Marka PDF la beddelay PDF la dib u eegay, ama barnaamij kale oo mar kale kaydiyay, waxa ku jira ayaa kala duwan, sidaas darteed TakeoffCraft wuxuu u arkaa fayl kale, xataa haddii magaca isku mid yahay. Qoraalka hoosta liiska xaashiyada, faylkaas noocaas ah wuxuu leeyahay \"magacaas fayl ayaa furan, laakiin waxa ku jira way kala duwan yihiin\". Calaamadaha waxay ku xiran yihiin nooca hore. Way sii tirinayaan, meelahooda hore iyo miisaannadoodii hore. PDF-ka la dib u eegay wuxuu u furmaa xaashiyo cusub oo aan miisaan lahayn, iyo calaamo la'aan. Si aad xisaabinta ugu wareejiso dib u eegista, fur labada PDF oo isticmaal Barbardhig xaashiga cusub: Barbardhig xaashi dib loo eegay oo xisaabinta wareeji. Fayl dhaawacan ama shisheeye TakeoffCraft wuxuu hubiyaa fayl mashruuc kasta ka hor intuusan isticmaalin. Fariimaha aad arki kartid: \"(file) ma aha mashruuc TakeoffCraft (ma aha JSON sax ah).\" \"Tani ma aha fayl mashruuc TakeoffCraft.\" \"Mashruucan waxaa kaydiyay TakeoffCraft cusub. Ku fur halkaas.\" \"3 calaamo waa la burburiyay oo waa la tegey.\" (kuwa kale way furmaan) Taariikhda ka noqoshada Taariikhda ka noqoshadu waxay bilaabataa mar cusub marka aad furto mashruuc. Kaydintu ma tirtirto.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"compare-revisions","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Barbardhig xaashi dib loo eegay oo wareeji xisaabinta","summary":"Ku dheji xaashiga hore xaashiga dib loo eegay, isku hagaaji, arag wax isbeddelay, oo wareeji xisaabinta xaashiga cusub iyo calaamadaha loo hubinayo ee calaamadsan.","section":"tasks","order":115,"keywords":["dib u eegis","dib loo eegay","barbardhig","dul-dhig","hore","cusub","isbeddelo","ku darid","war-saxid","dib u soo saar","wareeji xisaabinta","u wareeji","u qaad","isku hagaaji","calaamadsan","hubi"],"headings":[{"id":"barbardhig","text":"Barbardhig","level":2},{"id":"isku-hagaaji","text":"Isku hagaaji","level":2},{"id":"hel-wixii-isbeddelay","text":"Hel wixii isbeddelay","level":2},{"id":"wareeji-xisaabinta","text":"Wareeji xisaabinta","level":2},{"id":"hubi-calaamadaha-la-calaamadiyay","text":"Hubi calaamadaha la calaamadiyay","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMarka xaashi dib loo soo saaro, ma u baahnid inaad mar kale xisaabiso. Fur PDF-ka hore iyo kan cusub, barbardhig labada xaashi, oo xisaabinta u wareeji. TakeoffCraft wuxuu calaamadiyaa calaamad kasta oo naqshaddu ka isbeddelay, si aad kuwaas u hubiso, kuwa kale ilaali.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"barbardhig\"\u003EBarbardhig\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur labada PDF: set-ka hore iyo kii dib loo eegay (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur qorshayaasha\u003C/span\u003E; waxay ku jiri karaan hal fayl ama dhowr).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuuji xaashiga \u003Cstrong\u003Ecusub\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBarbardhig\u003C/span\u003E bar xaashiga ee hoosta sawirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro xaashiga hore liiska. TakeoffCraft wuxuu soo jeediyaa xaashiga isla lambarka ah ee PDF kale, ama isla bogga. Dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EBarbardhig\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHadda xaashiga hore wuxuu ku dul yaal xaashiga cusub oo casaan ah. Halka labadoodu isku waafaqaan, khadadka casaanku waxay saaran yihiin kuwa madow; halka ay kala duwan yihiin, waxaad aragtaa khadad casaan oo keligood (la saaray) iyo khadad madow oo keligood (lagu daray). Bar ku yaal hoosta xaashiga wuxuu haystaa tallaabooyinka hoose; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXir\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhammaysiiyaa barbardhigga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-hagaaji\"\u003EIsku hagaaji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXaashiyada dib loo soo saaray badanaa si yar ayaa loo daabacay: waa lagu dhaqaajiyay bogga, ama cabbir yar oo kala duwan. Haddii casaanka aanu ku dhicin madowga, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku hagaaji laba barood\u003C/strong\u003E oo riix afar jeer:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebarta xaashiga hore (casaan), sida xarunta tiirka ama geesta dhismaha,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eisla barta xaashiga cusub (madow),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebarta labaad ee xaashiga casaan, oo aad uga fog barta koowaad,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eisla barta xaashiga madow.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXaashiga casaanka wuu dhaqaajinayaa, wuu jiheynayaa oo wuu cabbiraa si uu ugu dego madowga. Bar xaaladda wuxuu sheegayaa xaashiga cusub intee in ka weyn (&quot;size × 1.000&quot; marka ay isku mid tahay). Ku weynee si aad u doorato barta: ka dhow ee riixdo, ayaa ka wanaagsan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hel-wixii-isbeddelay\"\u003EHel wixii isbeddelay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EHel isbeddelada\u003C/strong\u003E. TakeoffCraft wuxuu barbardhigaa xaraashka labada sawir: xaraashka xaashiga hore oo keliya casaan buu noqonayaa, xaraashka xaashiga cusub oo keliya buluug buu noqonayaa, bar xaaladduna way tirinaysaa. Khadad ka guuray xidid yar (dib u daabac) looma tirinayo isbeddel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWuxuu sidoo kale eegaa calaamad kasta oo xaashiga hore ku jirta, oo tiriyaa kuwa ku yaal meesha naqshaddu isbeddeshay:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esocod ama aag marka naqshaddu isbeddesho geeskiisa ama gees kasta, ama dhinac ugu yaraan qiyaastii hal meel oo lixaad ee dhererkiisa;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Etiro marka wax isbeddelo uu ku dhow yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wareeji-xisaabinta\"\u003EWareeji xisaabinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EWareeji xisaabinta halkan\u003C/strong\u003E. Calaamad kasta oo xaashiga hore ku jirta waxay u guurtaa xaashiga cusub, iyadoo laga maraayo isku hagaaysiga, hal tallaabo oo ka noqod. Kuwa ku dhow isbeddel waa la calaamadiyaa: waxay leeyihiin wareeg oranji ah, bar xaashiga wuxuu tusayaa &quot;(n) la hubiyo&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii xaashiga cusub uusan lahayn miisaan, wuxuu qaadanayaa miisaanka xaashiga hore (la hagaajiyay haddii naqshadaha loo baahday in la cabbiro si ay isku dhigmaan). Haddii uu horay u lahaa miisaan kale oo ka duwan, TakeoffCraft wuu weydiiyaa marka hore: calaamadaha la guuray waxa lagu cabbiraa miisaanka xaashiga cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubi-calaamadaha-la-calaamadiyay\"\u003EHubi calaamadaha la calaamadiyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro &quot;(n) la hubiyo&quot; bar xaashiga. Waxay weyneeyaa calaamadda calaamadsan ee xigta oo doorata; daaqaddeeda waxay sheegaysaa sababta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadda sax haddii naqshadu ku isbeddeshay (jiid geesahayada, ku dar ama tirtir calaamado, ama ka qaad mar kale).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003ELa hubiyay\u003C/strong\u003E daaqaddeeda. Calaamaddu way baxdaa, tirada bar xaashiga way hoosaysaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadaha la calaamadiyay waa la kaydiyaa xisaabinta, sidaas darteed mar dambe ayaad u hubin kartaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBarbardhiggu wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa PDF-yada vector iyo sawirrada iskaanka labadaba, sababtoo ah wuxuu barbardhigaa waxa la sawiray. Iskaan la jiifay ama la fidiyay wuxuu isku dhigi karaa oo keliya qiyaas laba barood ku; markaas calaamado badan indhaha ku hubi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Marka xaashi dib loo soo saaro, ma u baahnid inaad mar kale xisaabiso. Fur PDF-ka hore iyo kan cusub, barbardhig labada xaashi, oo xisaabinta u wareeji. TakeoffCraft wuxuu calaamadiyaa calaamad kasta oo naqshaddu ka isbeddelay, si aad kuwaas u hubiso, kuwa kale ilaali. Barbardhig Fur labada PDF: set-ka hore iyo kii dib loo eegay (Fur qorshayaasha; waxay ku jiri karaan hal fayl ama dhowr). Muuji xaashiga cusub. Dooro Barbardhig bar xaashiga ee hoosta sawirka. Dooro xaashiga hore liiska. TakeoffCraft wuxuu soo jeediyaa xaashiga isla lambarka ah ee PDF kale, ama isla bogga. Dooro Barbardhig. Hadda xaashiga hore wuxuu ku dul yaal xaashiga cusub oo casaan ah. Halka labadoodu isku waafaqaan, khadadka casaanku waxay saaran yihiin kuwa madow; halka ay kala duwan yihiin, waxaad aragtaa khadad casaan oo keligood (la saaray) iyo khadad madow oo keligood (lagu daray). Bar ku yaal hoosta xaashiga wuxuu haystaa tallaabooyinka hoose; Esc ama Xir wuxuu dhammaysiiyaa barbardhigga. Isku hagaaji Xaashiyada dib loo soo saaray badanaa si yar ayaa loo daabacay: waa lagu dhaqaajiyay bogga, ama cabbir yar oo kala duwan. Haddii casaanka aanu ku dhicin madowga, dooro Isku hagaaji laba barood oo riix afar jeer: barta xaashiga hore (casaan), sida xarunta tiirka ama geesta dhismaha, isla barta xaashiga cusub (madow), barta labaad ee xaashiga casaan, oo aad uga fog barta koowaad, isla barta xaashiga madow. Xaashiga casaanka wuu dhaqaajinayaa, wuu jiheynayaa oo wuu cabbiraa si uu ugu dego madowga. Bar xaaladda wuxuu sheegayaa xaashiga cusub intee in ka weyn (\"size × 1.000\" marka ay isku mid tahay). Ku weynee si aad u doorato barta: ka dhow ee riixdo, ayaa ka wanaagsan. Hel wixii isbeddelay Dooro Hel isbeddelada. TakeoffCraft wuxuu barbardhigaa xaraashka labada sawir: xaraashka xaashiga hore oo keliya casaan buu noqonayaa, xaraashka xaashiga cusub oo keliya buluug buu noqonayaa, bar xaaladduna way tirinaysaa. Khadad ka guuray xidid yar (dib u daabac) looma tirinayo isbeddel. Wuxuu sidoo kale eegaa calaamad kasta oo xaashiga hore ku jirta, oo tiriyaa kuwa ku yaal meesha naqshaddu isbeddeshay: socod ama aag marka naqshaddu isbeddesho geeskiisa ama gees kasta, ama dhinac ugu yaraan qiyaastii hal meel oo lixaad ee dhererkiisa; tiro marka wax isbeddelo uu ku dhow yahay. Wareeji xisaabinta Dooro Wareeji xisaabinta halkan. Calaamad kasta oo xaashiga hore ku jirta waxay u guurtaa xaashiga cusub, iyadoo laga maraayo isku hagaaysiga, hal tallaabo oo ka noqod. Kuwa ku dhow isbeddel waa la calaamadiyaa: waxay leeyihiin wareeg oranji ah, bar xaashiga wuxuu tusayaa \"(n) la hubiyo\". Haddii xaashiga cusub uusan lahayn miisaan, wuxuu qaadanayaa miisaanka xaashiga hore (la hagaajiyay haddii naqshadaha loo baahday in la cabbiro si ay isku dhigmaan). Haddii uu horay u lahaa miisaan kale oo ka duwan, TakeoffCraft wuu weydiiyaa marka hore: calaamadaha la guuray waxa lagu cabbiraa miisaanka xaashiga cusub. Hubi calaamadaha la calaamadiyay Dooro \"(n) la hubiyo\" bar xaashiga. Waxay weyneeyaa calaamadda calaamadsan ee xigta oo doorata; daaqaddeeda waxay sheegaysaa sababta. Calaamadda sax haddii naqshadu ku isbeddeshay (jiid geesahayada, ku dar ama tirtir calaamado, ama ka qaad mar kale). Dooro La hubiyay daaqaddeeda. Calaamaddu way baxdaa, tirada bar xaashiga way hoosaysaa. Calaamadaha la calaamadiyay waa la kaydiyaa xisaabinta, sidaas darteed mar dambe ayaad u hubin kartaa. Barbardhiggu wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa PDF-yada vector iyo sawirrada iskaanka labadaba, sababtoo ah wuxuu barbardhigaa waxa la sawiray. Iskaan la jiifay ama la fidiyay wuxuu isku dhigi karaa oo keliya qiyaas laba barood ku; markaas calaamado badan indhaha ku hubi.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"use-with-ai-assistants","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Isticmaal TakeoffCraft kaaliye AI ah","summary":"Ogolow kaaliyahaaga AI ama qoraalkaaga inuu akhriyo qadarrada iyo qiyaasha xisaabinta, uuna ku daro walxaha iyo calaamadaha, tiriyo oo cabbiro DWG ama DXF, uuna dhoofiyo: ogolaansho, ku xidhid CadCraft Studio, iyo diiwaanka waxqabadka.","section":"tasks","order":118,"keywords":["ai","kaaliye","wakiil","mcp","model context protocol","qoraal","otomaatig","qadarro","qiyaas","ogolaansho","ka jar","waxqabad"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-baran-doontid","text":"Waxa aad baran doontid","level":2},{"id":"bilow","text":"Bilow","level":2},{"id":"ku-xidh-kaaliyahaaga","text":"Ku xidh kaaliyahaaga","level":2},{"id":"adigu-waad-maamushaa","text":"Adigu waad maamushaa","level":2},{"id":"waxa-kaaliye-uu-weydiisan-karo","text":"Waxa kaaliye uu weydiisan karo","level":2},{"id":"haddii-wax-aan-shaqeynin","text":"Haddii wax aan shaqeynin","level":2},{"id":"eeg-sidoo-kale","text":"Eeg sidoo kale","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-baran-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad baran doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESida loo ogolaado kaaliye AI (ama qoraal aad qortay) inuu la shaqeeyo TakeoffCraft, iyo sida loo go&#039;aamiyo waxa uu samayn karo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffCraft \u003Cstrong\u003Ema lahan AI gaar ah\u003C/strong\u003E mana dirto wax meel. Adigu keenta kaaliyaha: barnaamij kasta oo ku hadla Model Context Protocol (MCP). TakeoffCraft wuxuu siinayaa qalab kaliya, adiguna waad doortaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bilow\"\u003EBilow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (giraanta qalabka sare, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) oo tag tabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssistants\u003C/span\u003E, calaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EOgolow kaaliyayaasha AI iyo qoraallada inay isticmaalaan TakeoffCraft\u003C/strong\u003E. Waa la demiyay ilaa aad samayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro waxa ay sameyn karto: \u003Cstrong\u003EAkhri\u003C/strong\u003E waa la calaamadiyay bilowga; calaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003ETafatir\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofin\u003C/strong\u003E kaliya marka aad u baahan tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabka aan ku calaamadin awoodda looma soo bandhigo kaaliyaha. Haddii uu si kastaba u weydiisto, TakeoffCraft wuu diidaa oo wuxuu ku qoraa diiwaanka waxqabadka. Demidda badhanka waxay joojisaa dhammaan xidhiidhyada hal mar; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u deji dejinta TakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E wuu demaa sidoo kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-xidh-kaaliyahaaga\"\u003EKu xidh kaaliyahaaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaaliyayaashu waxay ku xidhmaan \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E kombiyuutarkaaga: Studio wuxuu socodsiiyaa server yar oo kaliya kombiyuutarkan gaari karo, oo ilaalinaya token uu sameeyo mar kasta oo bilowdo. Studio dhexdiisa, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu xidh kaaliye\u003C/span\u003E oo koobiyee cinwaanka iyo tokanka ku dhaji kaaliyahaaga (Studio wuxuu tusayaa dejinta saxda ah ee lagu dhejiyo). Ha wadaagin tokanka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETab browser ma furi karo xidhiid kaaliye: barnaamijyada browserka ee switch-ku ma saameeyo ilaa aad isticmaasho CadCraft Studio kombiyuutarkaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"adigu-waad-maamushaa\"\u003EAdigu waad maamushaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo\u003C/strong\u003E, oo lagu magacaabay magaca kaaliyaha (tusaale &quot;Kaaliye: …&quot;). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu dib u qaadaa isbeddelka ugu dambeeya ee kaaliyaha oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaad ogaataa marka mid la xidhay.\u003C/strong\u003E Badhanka qalabka sare wuxuu magacaabaa kaaliyaha inta uu xidhan yahay; riix si aad u aragto waxa uu samayn karo, ama si aad \u003Cstrong\u003Euga jartid\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxqabadka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssistants\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EActivity\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liis gareeyaa wac kasta: goorta, qalabka, dhammaatay ama la diiday. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave the log\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu hayaa nuqul.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-kaaliye-uu-weydiisan-karo\"\u003EWaxa kaaliye uu weydiisan karo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQalab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOgolaansho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eapp_info\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esheets_list\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXisaabinta furan, PDF-yadeeda iyo xaashiyadeeda, miisaan iyo calaamadaha xaashi kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eitems_list\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWalxaha unit-kooda, qiimaha iyo qaacidooyinka isku-dhisyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_quantities\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQadarka shay kasta ama xaashi kasta; calaamadaha xaashiyada aan miisaan lahayn waa la liistaa, lama tiro sida eber\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_estimate\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiyaasta qiimaysan sida TakeoffCraft u xisaabiyo, oo wadarteeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_export\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofinta CSV ama XLSX ee TakeoffCraft laftiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eitems_add\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETafatir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu daraa walxaha unit-kooda, qiimaha iyo qashinka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emarks_add\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETafatir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbiraa safafka, aagga iyo tirada xaashi. Dherer iyo aag kaliya xaashi miisaan leh, marna xaashi aan miisaan lahayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecad_sheets\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecad_catalog\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecad_count\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDWG ama DXF aad furtay: xaashiyadeeda iyo miisaankooda, waxa la tiri karo (bloogyo, lakabyo iyo noocyo, qoraallo), iyo tiro saxda ah, sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirinta CAD\u003C/span\u003E u samayso (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003ETirinta naqshadda\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecad_count_add\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETafatir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu tiraa naqshadda oo calaamad tiro ku dhejiyaa shay kasta oo la helay, hal tallaabo; mar kale tirinta wuxuu ku daraa kaliya waxa cusub\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecad_measure\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETafatir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu cabbiraa walax dherer ama aag ah xariiqyada, qaansooyinka, polilaynnada iyo hatch-yada naqshadda, sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshadda ka cabbir\u003C/span\u003E u samayso (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\"\u003ECabbirka naqshadda\u003C/a\u003E); kaliya xaashi miisaan leh\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eusd_export\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafafka, aagga iyo tirada xaashi miisaan leh oo la cabbiray, sida moodel hubin 3D ah oo USD ah (\u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usda\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.usdc\u003C/code\u003E), sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXidhmada USD (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E muuqaalka hubinta 3D u qoro (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/usd\"\u003EDhoofi muuqaalka hubinta 3D ee USD\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka \u003Cstrong\u003ETafatir\u003C/strong\u003E la calaamadiyo, kaaliye wuxuu ku daraa walxaha iyo calaamadaha (wac kasta hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo). Ma dhaqdhaqaajin, ma beddelin, mana tirtiri karo calaamadaha horeba u jiray.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsla tiro iyo qiyaas waxaa laga heli karaa adigoon furin TakeoffCraft: CadCraft MCP server wuxuu furaa fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E folder aad magacowday (\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_open\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_quantities\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_estimate\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_export\u003C/code\u003E), \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft info Job.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu ku daabacaa qoraal amarka. Wuxuu sidoo kale furaa DWG ama DXF oo xisaabin cusub ah oo xaashiyadeeda ku jira (miisaankooda laga qaatay naqshadda sida TakeoffCraft u qaato), tiraa oo cabbiraa isagoo isticmaalaya qalabka \u003Ccode\u003Ecad_*\u003C/code\u003E isku mid, ku daraa walxaha, oo kaydiyaa xisaabinta (\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_save\u003C/code\u003E). \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft count plan.dwg --block SHELF-18X48 --sheet K-101\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu tiraa amarka qoraalka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"haddii-wax-aan-shaqeynin\"\u003EHaddii wax aan shaqeynin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaaliyuhu ma arko qalabka TakeoffCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E hubi in badhanku uu daaran yahay daaqadan, iyo in daaqaddu ay furan tahay Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;needs the export permission&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E calaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofin\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssistants\u003C/span\u003E, ka dibna weydii mar kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhaladaadka &quot;401&quot; ama &quot;token&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E tokanku wuu is beddelay (Studio ayaa dib u bilowday, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETokan cusub\u003C/span\u003E). Koobiyee tokanka cusub dejinta kaaliyaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eeg-sidoo-kale\"\u003EEeg sidoo kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/assistants-recipes\" data-topic=\"basics/assistants-recipes\"\u003ETusaalooyinka kaaliyayaasha AI\u003C/a\u003E: tusaalooyin shaqo, mid kasta oo leh qalabka uu isticmaalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad baran doontid Sida loo ogolaado kaaliye AI (ama qoraal aad qortay) inuu la shaqeeyo TakeoffCraft, iyo sida loo go'aamiyo waxa uu samayn karo. TakeoffCraft ma lahan AI gaar ah mana dirto wax meel. Adigu keenta kaaliyaha: barnaamij kasta oo ku hadla Model Context Protocol (MCP). TakeoffCraft wuxuu siinayaa qalab kaliya, adiguna waad doortaa. Bilow Fur Settings (giraanta qalabka sare, ama Ctrl+,) oo tag tabka TakeoffCraft. Hoosta Assistants, calaamadi Ogolow kaaliyayaasha AI iyo qoraallada inay isticmaalaan TakeoffCraft. Waa la demiyay ilaa aad samayso. Dooro waxa ay sameyn karto: Akhri waa la calaamadiyay bilowga; calaamadi Tafatir, Kaydi ama Dhoofin kaliya marka aad u baahan tahay. Qalabka aan ku calaamadin awoodda looma soo bandhigo kaaliyaha. Haddii uu si kastaba u weydiisto, TakeoffCraft wuu diidaa oo wuxuu ku qoraa diiwaanka waxqabadka. Demidda badhanka waxay joojisaa dhammaan xidhiidhyada hal mar; Dib u deji dejinta TakeoffCraft wuu demaa sidoo kale. Ku xidh kaaliyahaaga Kaaliyayaashu waxay ku xidhmaan CadCraft Studio kombiyuutarkaaga: Studio wuxuu socodsiiyaa server yar oo kaliya kombiyuutarkan gaari karo, oo ilaalinaya token uu sameeyo mar kasta oo bilowdo. Studio dhexdiisa, dooro Ku xidh kaaliye oo koobiyee cinwaanka iyo tokanka ku dhaji kaaliyahaaga (Studio wuxuu tusayaa dejinta saxda ah ee lagu dhejiyo). Ha wadaagin tokanka. Tab browser ma furi karo xidhiid kaaliye: barnaamijyada browserka ee switch-ku ma saameeyo ilaa aad isticmaasho CadCraft Studio kombiyuutarkaaga. Adigu waad maamushaa Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo, oo lagu magacaabay magaca kaaliyaha (tusaale \"Kaaliye: …\"). Ctrl+Z wuxuu dib u qaadaa isbeddelka ugu dambeeya ee kaaliyaha oo dhan. Waad ogaataa marka mid la xidhay. Badhanka qalabka sare wuxuu magacaabaa kaaliyaha inta uu xidhan yahay; riix si aad u aragto waxa uu samayn karo, ama si aad uga jartid. Waxqabadka. Settings › TakeoffCraft › Assistants › Activity wuxuu liis gareeyaa wac kasta: goorta, qalabka, dhammaatay ama la diiday. Save the log wuxuu hayaa nuqul. Waxa kaaliye uu weydiisan karo Qalab Ogolaansho Waxa uu sameeyo app_info, sheets_list Akhri Xisaabinta furan, PDF-yadeeda iyo xaashiyadeeda, miisaan iyo calaamadaha xaashi kasta items_list Akhri Walxaha unit-kooda, qiimaha iyo qaacidooyinka isku-dhisyada takeoff_quantities Akhri Qadarka shay kasta ama xaashi kasta; calaamadaha xaashiyada aan miisaan lahayn waa la liistaa, lama tiro sida eber takeoff_estimate Akhri Qiyaasta qiimaysan sida TakeoffCraft u xisaabiyo, oo wadarteeda takeoff_export Dhoofin Dhoofinta CSV ama XLSX ee TakeoffCraft laftiisa items_add Tafatir Ku daraa walxaha unit-kooda, qiimaha iyo qashinka marks_add Tafatir Cabbiraa safafka, aagga iyo tirada xaashi. Dherer iyo aag kaliya xaashi miisaan leh, marna xaashi aan miisaan lahayn cad_sheets, cad_catalog, cad_count Akhri DWG ama DXF aad furtay: xaashiyadeeda iyo miisaankooda, waxa la tiri karo (bloogyo, lakabyo iyo noocyo, qoraallo), iyo tiro saxda ah, sida Tirinta CAD u samayso (Tirinta naqshadda) cad_count_add Tafatir Wuxuu tiraa naqshadda oo calaamad tiro ku dhejiyaa shay kasta oo la helay, hal tallaabo; mar kale tirinta wuxuu ku daraa kaliya waxa cusub cad_measure Tafatir Wuxuu cabbiraa walax dherer ama aag ah xariiqyada, qaansooyinka, polilaynnada iyo hatch-yada naqshadda, sida Naqshadda ka cabbir u samayso (Cabbirka naqshadda); kaliya xaashi miisaan leh usd_export Dhoofin Safafka, aagga iyo tirada xaashi miisaan leh oo la cabbiray, sida moodel hubin 3D ah oo USD ah (.usdz, .usda ama .usdc), sida Xidhmada USD (.usdz) muuqaalka hubinta 3D u qoro (Dhoofi muuqaalka hubinta 3D ee USD) Marka Tafatir la calaamadiyo, kaaliye wuxuu ku daraa walxaha iyo calaamadaha (wac kasta hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo). Ma dhaqdhaqaajin, ma beddelin, mana tirtiri karo calaamadaha horeba u jiray. Isla tiro iyo qiyaas waxaa laga heli karaa adigoon furin TakeoffCraft: CadCraft MCP server wuxuu furaa fayl .takeoff.json folder aad magacowday (takeoff_open, takeoff_quantities, takeoff_estimate, takeoff_export), cadcraft info Job.takeoff.json wuxuu ku daabacaa qoraal amarka. Wuxuu sidoo kale furaa DWG ama DXF oo xisaabin cusub ah oo xaashiyadeeda ku jira (miisaankooda laga qaatay naqshadda sida TakeoffCraft u qaato), tiraa oo cabbiraa isagoo isticmaalaya qalabka cad_* isku mid, ku daraa walxaha, oo kaydiyaa xisaabinta (takeoff_save). cadcraft count plan.dwg --block SHELF-18X48 --sheet K-101 wuxuu tiraa amarka qoraalka. Haddii wax aan shaqeynin Kaaliyuhu ma arko qalabka TakeoffCraft: hubi in badhanku uu daaran yahay daaqadan, iyo in daaqaddu ay furan tahay Studio. \"needs the export permission\": calaamadi Dhoofin hoosta Assistants, ka dibna weydii mar kale. Khaladaadka \"401\" ama \"token\": tokanku wuu is beddelay (Studio ayaa dib u bilowday, ama Tokan cusub). Koobiyee tokanka cusub dejinta kaaliyaha. Eeg sidoo kale Tusaalooyinka kaaliyayaasha AI: tusaalooyin shaqo, mid kasta oo leh qalabka uu isticmaalo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"work-live","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Hal xisaabin oo wada ah ku samee Live TeamWork","summary":"Waxa isbeddela TakeoffCraft inta aad ku jirto fadhiga Live TeamWork ee CadCraft Studio: walxaha iyo calaamadaha qof kasta hal xisaabin, wadarta isku mid ah dhammaantood, undo-gaaga gaarka ah, iyo ku biirista browser-ka isla shabakadda.","section":"tasks","order":119,"keywords":["live","live teamwork","studio live","wada","iskaashi","fadhi","wadaag live","ku biir","walxo","calaamado","wadar","qiyaas","cursor","dhibic","is arag","magacyo","midab","xulasho","undo","martiqaad"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-baran-doontid","text":"Waxa aad baran doontid","level":2},{"id":"qof-walba-isla-waqtiga-cabbira","text":"Qof walba isla waqtiga cabbira","level":2},{"id":"is-arag","text":"Is arag","level":2},{"id":"undo-waxa-uu-dib-u-qaadaa-shaqadaada","text":"Undo waxa uu dib u qaadaa shaqadaada","level":2},{"id":"ku-biir-browser-ka","text":"Ku biir browser-ka","level":2},{"id":"markii-fadhigu-dhammaado","text":"Markii fadhigu dhammaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-baran-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad baran doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa ka dhaca xisaabinta markii dhowr qof ay isla shaqada isla waqtiga cabbiraan. CadCraft Studio wuxuu bilaabaa oo ku biiraa fadhiga Live TeamWork (Wadaag live, Ku biir); bogaggan waxay ka hadlayaan xisaabinta laftiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qof-walba-isla-waqtiga-cabbira\"\u003EQof walba isla waqtiga cabbira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPDF-yada martiqaadaha waxay gaadhaan qof kasta oo ku biira. Ku dar walxaha, cabbir safafka, aagga iyo tirooyinka, dejiso miisaanka iyo qiimaha sida caadiga ah. Calaamadahaaga waxay muuqdaan isla markiiba; kuwa kale waxay muuqdaan wax yar ka dib markay sameeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWadarta waa isku mid dhammaantood:\u003C/strong\u003E daaqad kasta waxay xisaabisaa qadarrada iyo qiyaasha calaamadaha, sidaas darteed wadar ma kala duwanaan karto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELaba qof oo beddelaya hal shay ama calaamad:\u003C/strong\u003E wax kala duwan labadooda way ku kaydsan yihiin; isla shayga isbeddelka dambe ayaa qaata.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamad walax tirtirtay qof:\u003C/strong\u003E waa la celiyaa, sawirka hoose ayaa sheegaa sababta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalxaha cusub iyo calaamadaha qof kastaa tirooyin u gaar ah ayey helaan, sidaas darteed laba qof had iyo jeer isku lambar ma sameeyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"is-arag\"\u003EIs arag\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQof kasta oo fadhiga ku jira wuxuu leeyahay midab u gaar ah. Xaashiga aad eegayso waxaad aragtaa dhibcaha qof kasta oo ah fallaadho midabkooda ah, magacooda ag yaal, iyo sanduuq jajab ah oo midabkooda ah oo ku wareegsan calaamadaha ay xulatay. Dadka xaashi kale joogaa waxa lagu liistaa dhinaca sare ee midig ee aragtada, magaca xaashigaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhibcaha, magacyada iyo xulashooyinka waa kuwo fadhiga kaliya: waligood ma kaydsana faylka, marna ma gelaan undo-ga qof. Way u gudbaan meesha qof kasta joogo, sidaas darteed waxay sii ahaadaan kuwo siman xidhiid gaabsi ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"undo-waxa-uu-dib-u-qaadaa-shaqadaada\"\u003EUndo waxa uu dib u qaadaa shaqadaada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu dib u qaadaa isbeddelkaaga ugu dambeeya oo keliya, oo wuxuu daaya kuwa kale. Haddii qof uu wax isla isbeddelay ka dib, waxba lama dib u qaadayo, safka xaaladda wuxuu sheegaa cidda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-biir-browser-ka\"\u003EKu biir browser-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAsxaab aan Studio lahayn waxay ku skaneyn karaan sawirka hoosta koodka martiqaadka telefoon, tablet ama kombiyuutar isla shabakadda. TakeoffCraft wuxuu furmaa browser-ka oo wuxuu ku buuxaa xisaabinta martiqaadka iyo PDF-yadeeda marka martiqaadku ku oggolaado. Link martiqaad wuxuu qof u oggolaanayaa inuu ka shabakad kale ku biiro: martiqaadku wuxuu u baahan yahay kursi Team Cloud Plan oo app-ka ah, qofka kale wuu ku biiraa bilaash, link-gu wuxuu shaqeeyaa kaliya inta fadhigii martiqaadka uu furan yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"markii-fadhigu-dhammaado\"\u003EMarkii fadhigu dhammaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMartiqaadka kaliya ayaa kaydiya xisaabinta. Qof kasta kale wuxuu haysaa nuqul aan la kaydin: kaydi haddii aad rabto inaad hayso.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad baran doontid Waxa ka dhaca xisaabinta markii dhowr qof ay isla shaqada isla waqtiga cabbiraan. CadCraft Studio wuxuu bilaabaa oo ku biiraa fadhiga Live TeamWork (Wadaag live, Ku biir); bogaggan waxay ka hadlayaan xisaabinta laftiisa. Qof walba isla waqtiga cabbira PDF-yada martiqaadaha waxay gaadhaan qof kasta oo ku biira. Ku dar walxaha, cabbir safafka, aagga iyo tirooyinka, dejiso miisaanka iyo qiimaha sida caadiga ah. Calaamadahaaga waxay muuqdaan isla markiiba; kuwa kale waxay muuqdaan wax yar ka dib markay sameeyaan. Wadarta waa isku mid dhammaantood: daaqad kasta waxay xisaabisaa qadarrada iyo qiyaasha calaamadaha, sidaas darteed wadar ma kala duwanaan karto. Laba qof oo beddelaya hal shay ama calaamad: wax kala duwan labadooda way ku kaydsan yihiin; isla shayga isbeddelka dambe ayaa qaata. Calaamad walax tirtirtay qof: waa la celiyaa, sawirka hoose ayaa sheegaa sababta. Walxaha cusub iyo calaamadaha qof kastaa tirooyin u gaar ah ayey helaan, sidaas darteed laba qof had iyo jeer isku lambar ma sameeyaan. Is arag Qof kasta oo fadhiga ku jira wuxuu leeyahay midab u gaar ah. Xaashiga aad eegayso waxaad aragtaa dhibcaha qof kasta oo ah fallaadho midabkooda ah, magacooda ag yaal, iyo sanduuq jajab ah oo midabkooda ah oo ku wareegsan calaamadaha ay xulatay. Dadka xaashi kale joogaa waxa lagu liistaa dhinaca sare ee midig ee aragtada, magaca xaashigaas. Dhibcaha, magacyada iyo xulashooyinka waa kuwo fadhiga kaliya: waligood ma kaydsana faylka, marna ma gelaan undo-ga qof. Way u gudbaan meesha qof kasta joogo, sidaas darteed waxay sii ahaadaan kuwo siman xidhiid gaabsi ah. Undo waxa uu dib u qaadaa shaqadaada Ctrl+Z wuxuu dib u qaadaa isbeddelkaaga ugu dambeeya oo keliya, oo wuxuu daaya kuwa kale. Haddii qof uu wax isla isbeddelay ka dib, waxba lama dib u qaadayo, safka xaaladda wuxuu sheegaa cidda. Ku biir browser-ka Asxaab aan Studio lahayn waxay ku skaneyn karaan sawirka hoosta koodka martiqaadka telefoon, tablet ama kombiyuutar isla shabakadda. TakeoffCraft wuxuu furmaa browser-ka oo wuxuu ku buuxaa xisaabinta martiqaadka iyo PDF-yadeeda marka martiqaadku ku oggolaado. Link martiqaad wuxuu qof u oggolaanayaa inuu ka shabakad kale ku biiro: martiqaadku wuxuu u baahan yahay kursi Team Cloud Plan oo app-ka ah, qofka kale wuu ku biiraa bilaash, link-gu wuxuu shaqeeyaa kaliya inta fadhigii martiqaadka uu furan yahay. Markii fadhigu dhammaado Martiqaadka kaliya ayaa kaydiya xisaabinta. Qof kasta kale wuxuu haysaa nuqul aan la kaydin: kaydi haddii aad rabto inaad hayso.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"new-takeoff","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Bilow xisaabin cusub","summary":"Nadiifi wax walba oo bilow xisaabin madhan iyada oo aan bogga dib loo soo rarin, oo marka hore ilaali shaqadaada.","section":"tasks","order":120,"keywords":["cusub","xisaabin cusub","nadiifi","dib u deji","bilow mar kale","madhan","xir PDF-yada","shaqada xigta"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusub\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu xiraa PDF kasta oo bilaabaa xisaabin madhan bogga isku mid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaydi xisaabinta hadda haysa haddii aad rabto inaad ilaaliso: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi xisaabinta\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusub\u003C/span\u003E koox \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii isbeddello aan la kaydin jiraan, TakeoffCraft wuxuu weydiinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EXisaabin aan la kaydin\u003C/strong\u003E: dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarka hore kaydi xisaabinta\u003C/span\u003E (wuxuu soo dejinayaa mashruuca, kadibna nadiifiyaa), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa tag isbeddellada\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E. Daaqaddu waxay ku noqotaa xaaladdeeda madhan: PDF ma jiro, shay ma jiro, calaamad ma jiro, miisaan ma jiro. Saddex-ka hoose wuxuu yidhi: &quot;Xisaabin cusub. Fur PDF-yada si aad u bilowdo.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa la nadiifiyo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPDF kasta oo furan, xaashiyadiisa iyo sawirrada yaryar,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ewalxaha, isku-dhisyada, calaamadaha iyo miisaanka,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eweynaynta iyo meesha xaashi kasta,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Etaariikhda ka noqoshada (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusub\u003C/span\u003E ma ka noqon kartid),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ehabka qaansada, iyo raadinta tirin otomaatig ah ama dib u eegista.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylasha diskaaga ma taabtaan. Si aad xisaabintii hore dib u soo qaado, fur \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E iyo PDF-yadeeda: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003EKaydi oo dib u fur xisaabinta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXisaabin cusub kasta wuxuu bilaabmaa iyada oo aan wax shay lahayn. Si aad shayada u keento, marka hore koobiyee: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee shayga\u003C/span\u003E hoosta Walxaha (ama koobiyee calaamadaha, kuwaas oo iyaga qaba shayadooda), kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E xisaabinta cusub. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKoobiyee, dhaji iyo nuqul calaamadaha\u003C/a\u003E. Shayada aad shaqo kasta isticmaasho, ku hay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/price-library\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/price-library\"\u003Emaktabadda qiimaha\u003C/a\u003E adigoo ka soo ku dari, ama ku dar \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003Exirmada ganacsiga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Cusub wuxuu xiraa PDF kasta oo bilaabaa xisaabin madhan bogga isku mid. Kaydi xisaabinta hadda haysa haddii aad rabto inaad ilaaliso: Kaydi xisaabinta ama Ctrl+S. Dooro Cusub koox Fayl. Haddii isbeddello aan la kaydin jiraan, TakeoffCraft wuxuu weydiinayaa Xisaabin aan la kaydin: dooro Marka hore kaydi xisaabinta (wuxuu soo dejinayaa mashruuca, kadibna nadiifiyaa), Ka tag isbeddellada, ama Jooji. Daaqaddu waxay ku noqotaa xaaladdeeda madhan: PDF ma jiro, shay ma jiro, calaamad ma jiro, miisaan ma jiro. Saddex-ka hoose wuxuu yidhi: \"Xisaabin cusub. Fur PDF-yada si aad u bilowdo.\" Waxa la nadiifiyo: PDF kasta oo furan, xaashiyadiisa iyo sawirrada yaryar, walxaha, isku-dhisyada, calaamadaha iyo miisaanka, weynaynta iyo meesha xaashi kasta, taariikhda ka noqoshada (Cusub ma ka noqon kartid), habka qaansada, iyo raadinta tirin otomaatig ah ama dib u eegista. Faylasha diskaaga ma taabtaan. Si aad xisaabintii hore dib u soo qaado, fur .takeoff.json iyo PDF-yadeeda: eeg Kaydi oo dib u fur xisaabinta. Xisaabin cusub kasta wuxuu bilaabmaa iyada oo aan wax shay lahayn. Si aad shayada u keento, marka hore koobiyee: Koobiyee shayga hoosta Walxaha (ama koobiyee calaamadaha, kuwaas oo iyaga qaba shayadooda), kadibna Dhaji xisaabinta cusub. Eeg Koobiyee, dhaji iyo nuqul calaamadaha. Shayada aad shaqo kasta isticmaasho, ku hay maktabadda qiimaha adigoo ka soo ku dari, ama ku dar xirmada ganacsiga.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"usd","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Dhoofinta aragga hubinta 3D ee USD","summary":"Qor derbiyada, dabaqyada, saxanka iyo socodyada aragga hubinta 3D sidii xidhmo USD ah, mid kastaa shayga iyo tirada.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["usd","usdz","openusd","dhoofin","3d","aragga hubinta","derbiyo","dabaqyo","rendar"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAragga hubinta 3D, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXidhmada USD (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E oo ku xiga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGLB\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShay kasta (darbi, dabaq, saxan, tiir tirin ah ama socod) waa hal shay faylka ku jira, oo lagu magacaabay shayga, wuxuuna sidoo kale qaadanayaa tirada uu aragga cabbiray. Dabaqyada iyo saxanada waa kuwo muuqda sida aragga. Faylku waa mitir, Z waa kor.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Aragga hubinta 3D, dooro Xidhmada USD (.usdz) oo ku xiga GLB. Shay kasta (darbi, dabaq, saxan, tiir tirin ah ama socod) waa hal shay faylka ku jira, oo lagu magacaabay shayga, wuxuuna sidoo kale qaadanayaa tirada uu aragga cabbiray. Dabaqyada iyo saxanada waa kuwo muuqda sida aragga. Faylku waa mitir, Z waa kor.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"coming-from","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Ka imaanshaha barnaamijyada kale ee xisaabinta qadarka","summary":"Sida caadooyinka barnaamijyada xisaabinta qadarka ee gaarka ah iyo qalabka calaamadinta PDF ugu habboon yihiin TakeoffCraft, iyo farqiyaasha dadka qaarkiis ku dhacaan.","section":"switching","order":10,"keywords":["u beddelid","u guur","shuruudaha","qaybaha","qalabka cabbirka","liiska calaamadaha","xidhiidhka tirada","caadooyinka xisaabinta qadarka","farqiyaasha","barbardhig"],"headings":[{"id":"caadooyinka-loo-beddelay","text":"Caadooyinka loo beddelay","level":2},{"id":"farqiyaasha-dadka-qaarkiis-ku-dhacaan","text":"Farqiyaasha dadka qaarkiis ku dhacaan","level":2},{"id":"weli-halkan-ma-jiro","text":"Weli halkan ma jiro","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad xisaabinta qadarka ku samaysay PlanSwift ama qalabka cabbirka ee Bluebeam Revu, inta badan TakeoffCraft waad ku heli doontaa wax aad la aqoon: xaashiyada qorshaha, miisaan xaashi kasta, waxyaabaha aad cabirto, iyo wadar qiimeysan. Siday qaybaha isugu xidhmaan way ka duwan tahay meelo qaar, meelahaas waa hoos.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad PlanSwift ama On-Screen Takeoff ogtahay, dooro qaabka menyuu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiiska xisaabinta qadarka\u003C/span\u003E ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/span\u003E: bar menyuu oo leh Fayl, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/span\u003E, Muuqaal, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E, Xisaabinta qadarka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadin\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofin\u003C/span\u003E, oo ku dul yaal safka qalabka xisaabinta, iyo diyaarinta miisaanka ee bar xaashiga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EMenyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"caadooyinka-loo-beddelay\"\u003ECaadooyinka loo beddelay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad caadi ahaan u samaysay\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETakeoffCraft-ka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFurista shaqo ama mashruuc oo kaydiya qorshayaasha (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur PDF-yada iyo mashruuca \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E isku dhinac. Mashruucu wuxuu kaydiyaa oo keliya xisaabinta qadarka; PDF-yadu waxay ahaanayaan faylashaada gaarka ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELiiska calaamadaha oo leh qoraallo, daruuro iyo iftiin-sarayn (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadin\u003C/span\u003E bar xaashiga: qoraallo, daruuro iyo iftiin-sarayn oo leh xaalad (Open, Answered, Closed), lagu liistay \u003Cstrong\u003EMarkups\u003C/strong\u003E, lagana sawiray PDF-ka calaamadsan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/markups\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/markups\"\u003EQoraallo, daruuro iyo iftiin-sarayn\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirro lagu kaydiyay calaamado gudaha PDF-ka (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXisaabinta qadarka waxay ku jirtaa faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF calaamadsan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa nuqul leh xisaabinta lagu sawiray, si loo wadaago; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF oo ku jira xisaabinta qadarka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa nuqul xisaabinta ku jirta, si dib loogu furo TakeoffCraft.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWalxaha xisaabinta (PlanSwift), qalabka cabbirka ee gaarka ah ee lagu kaydiyay Tool Chest (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWalxaha\u003C/strong\u003E hoos ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E: magac, nooc, midab, unug, joog ama qoto, qashin, iyo heerar.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybaha iyo isku-dhisyada leh qaacidooyin (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku-dhis\u003C/span\u003E ee walaxda: qaybo leh qaacido isticmaalaya \u003Ccode\u003EL H A N P\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDejinta miisaanka xaashi, ama calibrate (labadaba)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELiiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiyaar\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E koox \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E gudaheeda, xaashi kasta. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu cabbiraa cabbir la yaqaan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECodsashada miisaan hal bogga kala duwan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeli ma jiro: xaashi kasta u dejiso.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalo leh miisaano kala duwan oo xaashi isku mid ah (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeli ma jiro: hal miisaan xaashi kasta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalabka dhererka polyline iyo aagga (Bluebeam), xisaabinta socodka iyo aagga (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESocod\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAag\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShift oo loo hayo khadadka toosan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu u dhejiyaa tallaabooyin 45°, fikrad isku mid ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dhejinta khadadka sawirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECaadi ahaan waa shaqeeya: geesaha, dhexaadka, isgoyska iyo barta ugu dhow xariiq, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa demiya, sida barnaamijyada CAD.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalabka tirinta (labadaba)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiri\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERaadinta muuqaalka astaamaha (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): sanduuq hal astaan, eeg, ku dar.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGodad ama ka jarid aagagga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGod\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) aagga la doortay, iyo godad wareegsan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa jarid socodyada toosan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESocodka toosan ku jiid oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa jar\u003C/span\u003E) godka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\"\u003ECabbir socodyada toosan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybaha qaansada ee polyline\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaanso\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): riix barta ku taal qalloocanka, kadibna dhammaadkiisa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELiiska calaamadaha leh tiirarka tirada (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirooyinka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESida shayba\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESida xaashiga\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiiska qiimeynta leh qiimo (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsla miiskaas: qashin, agab iyo shaqo halkii unug, wadarta isku xidhan, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWadarta shaqada\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofinta Excel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E oo leh qaacidooyin toos ah, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEscape si loo joojiyo qalab\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu joojiyaa oo wuxuu ku laabanayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix midig si aad u dhammaysato\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHalkan riix midig ayaa dhammaysiiya socod ama xidha aag. Ma jiro menyuu midig-riix.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"farqiyaasha-dadka-qaarkiis-ku-dhacaan\"\u003EFarqiyaasha dadka qaarkiis ku dhacaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXisaabinta qadarka ma ku jirto PDF-kaaga.\u003C/strong\u003E Wax kasta oo aad samayso ma beddelayo PDF-yadaada. Kaydi faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E oo ku hay naqshadaha. Qof u dirta PDF calaamadsan ma siinayo xisaabin la wax ka beddeli karo: u dir faylka mashruuca iyo PDF-yada asalka ah, ama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\"\u003EPDF oo ku jira xisaabinta qadarka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPDF-yada waxaa lagu xidhiidhiyaa waxa ku jira, ma aha magacooda.\u003C/strong\u003E Xaashi la dib u eegay oo lagu kaydiyay magaca faylka hore, TakeoffCraft wuxuu u arkaa fayl cusub, oo aan miisaan iyo calaamad lahayn. Calaamadahaaga hore waxay ku sii jiraan nuqulka hore, oo weli waa tirinayaan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#when-a-pdf-has-changed\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"when-a-pdf-has-changed\"\u003EKaydi oo dib u fur xisaabinta qadarka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadaha aan miisaan lahayn waa laga reebaa, ma aha wax loo tiriyo eber.\u003C/strong\u003E Haddii xaashi aan miisaan lahayn, socodyadeeda iyo aagyadeeda ma tirinayaan, miisaanka waxa muuqda &quot;Aan dhammaystirnayn&quot;. Barnaamijyo badan waxaad arki lahayd 0. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale#why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-hash=\"why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\"\u003EDejinta miisaanka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMa jiro saadaal cabbir bogga.\u003C/strong\u003E Diyaaruhu waxay u qaataan in PDF-ka la daabacay cabbir buuxa. PDF nus ama &quot;fit to page&quot; wuxuu u baahan yahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E. Had iyo jeer isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHal walax, hal nooc oo ugu weyn, ka badan haddii aad codsato.\u003C/strong\u003E Walax waa socod, aag ama tiro, nooceeda waa la xidhaa markay calaamado yeelato. Shuruud siinaysa aag iyo wareegeeda labadaba waa walax aag ah: wareegeeda waa doorsoomaha \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E. Darbi leh dherer iyo aag labadaba waa walax socod ah oo leh joog. Walax shuruudo badan leh, sida qol leh sagxad, saldhig iyo albaabbo, calaamadee noocyada kale hoos ee \u003Cstrong\u003ESidoo kale cabbir\u003C/strong\u003E: mid kastaa qiimo gaar ah ayuu safkiisa u helaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items#one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-hash=\"one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\"\u003EHal walax, dhowr nooc calaamadood\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaacidooyinku waxay ku shaqeeyaan wadarta.\u003C/strong\u003E Qaacidooyinka isku-dhiska waxay isticmaalaan wadarta walaxda xaashiyada oo dhan, ma aha socod kasta gaar ahaan. \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E (tirada socodyada ama aagagga) waxa loo isticmaalaa xarig kasta oo dheeraad ah, sida hal stud dheeraad ah darbi kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWareegga wuxuu ku jiraa godadka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E aagga wuxuu ku daraa geesaha godadkiisa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas#read-the-area\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-hash=\"read-the-area\"\u003ECabbir aagag leh godad\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiidista wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa xaashiga.\u003C/strong\u003E Jiidista badhanka bidix ee xaashiga wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa, qalab kasta marka laga reebo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/span\u003E. Weligaa uma baahnid inaad u beddesho qalab dhaqaajin. Tiirka wareegga wuxuu weyneeyaa ama yareeyaa; ma wareejiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENuqul soo celin, ma aha daruur.\u003C/strong\u003E TakeoffCraft wuxuu nuqul shaqadaada ku hayaa browser-kan, wuxuuna ku soo celinayaa kadib shil (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#if-the-tab-or-the-browser-stops\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"if-the-tab-or-the-browser-stops\"\u003EHaddii tab-ka ama browser-ku joogsado\u003C/a\u003E), laakiin xisaabinta qadarka waa adiga kaydinta: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Kaydinta daruurta weli ma diyaar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWax walba browser-ka ayay ku jiraan.\u003C/strong\u003E Ma jiro wax la rakibo, qorshayaasha weligood ma la soo rarin. Barnaamij desktop ah, TakeoffCraft wuxuu ku jiraa CadCraft Studio, oo leh toddobada app ee kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-halkan-ma-jiro\"\u003EWeli halkan ma jiro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGobollada miisaanka xaashi kasta weli lama dhisin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa weli aan la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E liiska oo dhan iyo waxa la sameeyo halkii.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Haddii aad xisaabinta qadarka ku samaysay PlanSwift ama qalabka cabbirka ee Bluebeam Revu, inta badan TakeoffCraft waad ku heli doontaa wax aad la aqoon: xaashiyada qorshaha, miisaan xaashi kasta, waxyaabaha aad cabirto, iyo wadar qiimeysan. Siday qaybaha isugu xidhmaan way ka duwan tahay meelo qaar, meelahaas waa hoos. Haddii aad PlanSwift ama On-Screen Takeoff ogtahay, dooro qaabka menyuu Miiska xisaabinta qadarka ee Dejinta › TakeoffCraft › Menyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka: bar menyuu oo leh Fayl, Wax ka beddel, Muuqaal, Miisaan, Xisaabinta qadarka, Walxaha, Calaamadin iyo Dhoofin, oo ku dul yaal safka qalabka xisaabinta, iyo diyaarinta miisaanka ee bar xaashiga. Eeg Menyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka. Caadooyinka loo beddelay Waxa aad caadi ahaan u samaysay TakeoffCraft-ka Furista shaqo ama mashruuc oo kaydiya qorshayaasha (PlanSwift) Fur PDF-yada iyo mashruuca .takeoff.json isku dhinac. Mashruucu wuxuu kaydiyaa oo keliya xisaabinta qadarka; PDF-yadu waxay ahaanayaan faylashaada gaarka ah. Liiska calaamadaha oo leh qoraallo, daruuro iyo iftiin-sarayn (Bluebeam) Calaamadin bar xaashiga: qoraallo, daruuro iyo iftiin-sarayn oo leh xaalad (Open, Answered, Closed), lagu liistay Markups, lagana sawiray PDF-ka calaamadsan. Eeg Qoraallo, daruuro iyo iftiin-sarayn. Cabbirro lagu kaydiyay calaamado gudaha PDF-ka (Bluebeam) Xisaabinta qadarka waxay ku jirtaa faylka .takeoff.json. PDF calaamadsan wuxuu sameeyaa nuqul leh xisaabinta lagu sawiray, si loo wadaago; PDF oo ku jira xisaabinta qadarka wuxuu sameeyaa nuqul xisaabinta ku jirta, si dib loogu furo TakeoffCraft. Walxaha xisaabinta (PlanSwift), qalabka cabbirka ee gaarka ah ee lagu kaydiyay Tool Chest (Bluebeam) Walxaha hoos ee Walxaha: magac, nooc, midab, unug, joog ama qoto, qashin, iyo heerar. Qaybaha iyo isku-dhisyada leh qaacidooyin (PlanSwift) Isku-dhis ee walaxda: qaybo leh qaacido isticmaalaya L H A N P. Dejinta miisaanka xaashi, ama calibrate (labadaba) Liiska Diyaar ama Hagaaji koox Miisaan gudaheeda, xaashi kasta. Hubi wuxuu cabbiraa cabbir la yaqaan. Codsashada miisaan hal bogga kala duwan Weli ma jiro: xaashi kasta u dejiso. Muuqaalo leh miisaano kala duwan oo xaashi isku mid ah (Bluebeam) Weli ma jiro: hal miisaan xaashi kasta. Qalabka dhererka polyline iyo aagga (Bluebeam), xisaabinta socodka iyo aagga (PlanSwift) Socod (L) iyo Aag (A). Shift oo loo hayo khadadka toosan Shift wuxuu u dhejiyaa tallaabooyin 45°, fikrad isku mid ah. Ku dhejinta khadadka sawirka Caadi ahaan waa shaqeeya: geesaha, dhexaadka, isgoyska iyo barta ugu dhow xariiq, F3 ayaa demiya, sida barnaamijyada CAD. Qalabka tirinta (labadaba) Tiri (C). Raadinta muuqaalka astaamaha (Bluebeam) Tirin otomaatig ah (S): sanduuq hal astaan, eeg, ku dar. Godad ama ka jarid aagagga God (X) aagga la doortay, iyo godad wareegsan. Ka jarid socodyada toosan Socodka toosan ku jiid oo riix E (Ka jar) godka. Eeg Cabbir socodyada toosan. Qaybaha qaansada ee polyline Qaanso (R): riix barta ku taal qalloocanka, kadibna dhammaadkiisa. Liiska calaamadaha leh tiirarka tirada (Bluebeam) Miiska Tirooyinka, Sida shayba ama Sida xaashiga. Miiska qiimeynta leh qiimo (PlanSwift) Isla miiskaas: qashin, agab iyo shaqo halkii unug, wadarta isku xidhan, Wadarta shaqada. Dhoofinta Excel XLSX oo leh qaacidooyin toos ah, ama CSV. Escape si loo joojiyo qalab Esc wuu joojiyaa oo wuxuu ku laabanayaa Dooro. Riix midig si aad u dhammaysato Halkan riix midig ayaa dhammaysiiya socod ama xidha aag. Ma jiro menyuu midig-riix. Farqiyaasha dadka qaarkiis ku dhacaan Xisaabinta qadarka ma ku jirto PDF-kaaga. Wax kasta oo aad samayso ma beddelayo PDF-yadaada. Kaydi faylka .takeoff.json oo ku hay naqshadaha. Qof u dirta PDF calaamadsan ma siinayo xisaabin la wax ka beddeli karo: u dir faylka mashruuca iyo PDF-yada asalka ah, ama PDF oo ku jira xisaabinta qadarka. PDF-yada waxaa lagu xidhiidhiyaa waxa ku jira, ma aha magacooda. Xaashi la dib u eegay oo lagu kaydiyay magaca faylka hore, TakeoffCraft wuxuu u arkaa fayl cusub, oo aan miisaan iyo calaamad lahayn. Calaamadahaaga hore waxay ku sii jiraan nuqulka hore, oo weli waa tirinayaan. Eeg Kaydi oo dib u fur xisaabinta qadarka. Calaamadaha aan miisaan lahayn waa laga reebaa, ma aha wax loo tiriyo eber. Haddii xaashi aan miisaan lahayn, socodyadeeda iyo aagyadeeda ma tirinayaan, miisaanka waxa muuqda \"Aan dhammaystirnayn\". Barnaamijyo badan waxaad arki lahayd 0. Eeg Dejinta miisaanka. Ma jiro saadaal cabbir bogga. Diyaaruhu waxay u qaataan in PDF-ka la daabacay cabbir buuxa. PDF nus ama \"fit to page\" wuxuu u baahan yahay Hagaaji. Had iyo jeer isticmaal Hubi. Hal walax, hal nooc oo ugu weyn, ka badan haddii aad codsato. Walax waa socod, aag ama tiro, nooceeda waa la xidhaa markay calaamado yeelato. Shuruud siinaysa aag iyo wareegeeda labadaba waa walax aag ah: wareegeeda waa doorsoomaha P. Darbi leh dherer iyo aag labadaba waa walax socod ah oo leh joog. Walax shuruudo badan leh, sida qol leh sagxad, saldhig iyo albaabbo, calaamadee noocyada kale hoos ee Sidoo kale cabbir: mid kastaa qiimo gaar ah ayuu safkiisa u helaa. Eeg Hal walax, dhowr nooc calaamadood. Qaacidooyinku waxay ku shaqeeyaan wadarta. Qaacidooyinka isku-dhiska waxay isticmaalaan wadarta walaxda xaashiyada oo dhan, ma aha socod kasta gaar ahaan. N (tirada socodyada ama aagagga) waxa loo isticmaalaa xarig kasta oo dheeraad ah, sida hal stud dheeraad ah darbi kasta. Wareegga wuxuu ku jiraa godadka. P aagga wuxuu ku daraa geesaha godadkiisa. Eeg Cabbir aagag leh godad. Jiidista wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa xaashiga. Jiidista badhanka bidix ee xaashiga wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa, qalab kasta marka laga reebo Tirin otomaatig ah. Weligaa uma baahnid inaad u beddesho qalab dhaqaajin. Tiirka wareegga wuxuu weyneeyaa ama yareeyaa; ma wareejiso. Nuqul soo celin, ma aha daruur. TakeoffCraft wuxuu nuqul shaqadaada ku hayaa browser-kan, wuxuuna ku soo celinayaa kadib shil (Haddii tab-ka ama browser-ku joogsado), laakiin xisaabinta qadarka waa adiga kaydinta: Ctrl+S. Kaydinta daruurta weli ma diyaar. Wax walba browser-ka ayay ku jiraan. Ma jiro wax la rakibo, qorshayaasha weligood ma la soo rarin. Barnaamij desktop ah, TakeoffCraft wuxuu ku jiraa CadCraft Studio, oo leh toddobada app ee kale. Weli halkan ma jiro Gobollada miisaanka xaashi kasta weli lama dhisin. Eeg Waxa weli aan la dhisin liiska oo dhan iyo waxa la sameeyo halkii.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"settings","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Dejinta TakeoffCraft","summary":"Muuji inji ilaa 1/16, 1/8 ama 1/4, bilow shayada qashin boqolkiiba, dooro meesha uu jiirka Auto count ka bilaabmo, ku xidh xariiqyada naqshadda ama 45° adigoon haysan Shift, dejiso ballaca albaabka uu Buuxinta qolka xiro, iyo dooro calaamadda geesta ee aragtida 3D.","section":"reference","order":5,"keywords":["dejinta","doorashooyin","saxnaan","jajab","inji","wareejin","qashin","qashin caadi ah","auto count","bar","isbarbardhig","jiir","xidh","45","xagal","shift","kaarka aragtida","calaamadda tooska","calaamadda geesta","3d"],"headings":[{"id":"feet-iyo-inji","text":"Feet iyo inji","level":2},{"id":"qashinta-bilowga","text":"Qashinta bilowga","level":2},{"id":"auto-count-halka-jiirka-isbarbardhigga-uu-ka-bilaabmo","text":"Auto count: halka jiirka isbarbardhigga uu ka bilaabmo","level":2},{"id":"ku-xidh-xariiqyada-naqshadda","text":"Ku xidh xariiqyada naqshadda","level":2},{"id":"buuxinta-qolka-ballaca-furka-ay-xirto","text":"Buuxinta qolka: ballaca furka ay xirto","level":2},{"id":"ku-xidh-45-adigoon-haysan-shift","text":"Ku xidh 45° adigoon haysan Shift","level":2},{"id":"cabbirka-calaamadda-tirinta","text":"Cabbirka calaamadda tirinta","level":2},{"id":"calaamadda-geesta","text":"Calaamadda geesta","level":2},{"id":"qalabka-jidka-farqiga-ugu-weyn-ee-lagu-xidho","text":"Qalabka jidka: farqiga ugu weyn ee lagu xidho","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E badhanka gear ee app bar-ka ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Tab-ka koowaad, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E, wuxuu haystaa dejinta app-kan oo keliya; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu haystaa kuwa dhammaan apps-ka CadCraft ay wadaagaan (mawduuca, panelada, qalabka). Dejinta TakeoffCraft waxay ku jirtaa app-ka oo keliya: halkan ayaad ka beddeshaa, browser-kanna wuu xasuustaa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u deji dejinta TakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku celiyaa bilowgii.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"feet-iyo-inji\"\u003EFeet iyo inji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuji dherarka ilaa \u003Cstrong\u003E1/16&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E (bilowga), \u003Cstrong\u003E1/8&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003E1/4&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E. Tani waxay beddeshaa sida dherarku ugu akhrisan yihiin xaashiga, panelada, tirooyinka iyo bar-ka xaaladda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuujinta oo keliya ayaa la wareejiyaa. Tirooyinka, kharashyada iyo dhoofintu waxay ka xisaabsan yihiin dherarka sax ah, dhoofintuna mar walba waxay muujinaysaa 1/16&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qashinta-bilowga\"\u003EQashinta bilowga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoqolkiiba qashinta shay kasta oo cusub ku bilaabato: 0% (bilowga), 2%, 3%, 5%, 7.5%, 10%, 15% ama 20%. Wali qashin kale ayaad u qori kartaa shay kasta, tafatirka shayga ama si toos ah miiska tirooyinka. Shayada aad hore u haysay waxay hayn doonaan qashintooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"auto-count-halka-jiirka-isbarbardhigga-uu-ka-bilaabmo\"\u003EAuto count: halka jiirka isbarbardhigga uu ka bilaabmo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHalka jiirka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsbarbardhig\u003C/span\u003E ku sugan marka raadinta \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/a\u003E dhammaato, 50% ilaa 95%; 75% waa bilowga. Hoose wuxuu siinayaa wax la mid ah oo badan oo aad diidi karto; sare wuxuu siinayaa kuwa yar. Jiirka wali waad dhaqdhaqaajin kartaa dib-u-eegista kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-xidh-xariiqyada-naqshadda\"\u003EKu xidh xariiqyada naqshadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBilowga way shaqeysaa. Marka aad cabbirayso ama hagaajinayso, barta u dhow xariiq PDF-ka waxay u dhaqaaqaysaa dhamaadkeeda, dhexdeeda, isgoyska ama barta u dhow. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu xidh\u003C/span\u003E bar-ka xaaladda ayaa sidoo kale shaqeeya. Wax dheeraad ah: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\"\u003EKu xidh xariiqyada naqshadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buuxinta-qolka-ballaca-furka-ay-xirto\"\u003EBuuxinta qolka: ballaca furka ay xirto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuuxinta qolka wuxuu xidhaa furka ilaa\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dejiyaa ballaca albaab ama god ay qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQol\u003C/span\u003E u tixgeliyo mid xidhan: 3&#039;-0&quot; ilaa 8&#039;-0&quot;, bilowgana 4&#039;-0&quot;. Ka ballaaran albaabkaaga ugu ballaaran wuxuu u oggolaanayaa qolka inuu gudbo kan xiga; ka yar albaab wuxuu ka tagayaa qolka oo furan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas#fill-a-room-with-one-click\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-hash=\"fill-a-room-with-one-click\"\u003EQolka buuxi hal riix\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-xidh-45-adigoon-haysan-shift\"\u003EKu xidh 45° adigoon haysan Shift\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBilowga way damisan tahay. Marka ay shaqeyso, xariiqyada, qaabka, goosyada iyo geesaha la jiido waxay ku xidhmaan 0°, 45°, 90° ama 135° barta ugu dambaysay adigoon haynin \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u gujiso xagal kasta. Bar-ka xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Ku xidhmaya 45°; Shift ayaa xagasha xorayn&quot;. Barta aad ku gujiso qalooca qaansada iyo goobaha ma ay ku xidhmaan; geeska qaansada ayaa ku xidhma.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbirka-calaamadda-tirinta\"\u003ECabbirka calaamadda tirinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhibcaha tirinta intee le&#039;eg yihiin: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAad u yar\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYar\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhexdhexaad\u003C/span\u003E (bilowga: cabbirka dhibcaha weligiis lahaa) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWeyn\u003C/span\u003E. Cabbirku wuxuu ku sii jiraa shaashadda heer kasta oo weynayn ah, PDF-ka la calaamadeeyay wuxuu dhibic kasta ku sawiraa isla cabbir warqadda, iyadoo aan loo eegin cabbirka xaashiga, sidaas darteed PDF-ka 100% wuu u eegaa sida shaashaddu. Wax dheeraad ah: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-by-hand#dot-size-on-screen-and-in-the-pdf\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-by-hand\" data-hash=\"dot-size-on-screen-and-in-the-pdf\"\u003ETirinta gacanta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"calaamadda-geesta\"\u003ECalaamadda geesta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaliya \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003EHubinta 3D\u003C/a\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaarka aragtida\u003C/span\u003E (bilowga: kaar ku yaal geeska midig oo laga riixo, la jiido, laguna leexiyo), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadda tooska\u003C/span\u003E (calaamad yar oo X, Y, Z ah hoose midig) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidna\u003C/span\u003E. Waa isbeddelaa isla markiiba oo browser-kan ayaa xasuustaa. Xaashiga fidsan calaamad ma muujiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalabka-jidka-farqiga-ugu-weyn-ee-lagu-xidho\"\u003EQalabka jidka: farqiga ugu weyn ee lagu xidho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalabka jidka: farqiga ugu weyn ee lagu xidho\u003C/span\u003E waa intee le&#039;eg ayay laba dhamaad xariiq u kala fogaan karaan oo weli loo tiro hal jid, PDF points (0.05 ilaa 60; 1.5 bilowga). Xariiqyada naqshadda badanaa waxay ka joogsadaan wax yar oo ay isku dhan yihiin. Weyn ayaa badan ku xidha; yar ayaa xariiqyada kala dhigta. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"[\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"]\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa beddela markaad dooranayso, goobtanna way raacaysaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\"\u003EXariiqyada dooro\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Fur Dejinta badhanka gear ee app bar-ka ama Ctrl+,. Tab-ka koowaad, TakeoffCraft, wuxuu haystaa dejinta app-kan oo keliya; Guud wuxuu haystaa kuwa dhammaan apps-ka CadCraft ay wadaagaan (mawduuca, panelada, qalabka). Dejinta TakeoffCraft waxay ku jirtaa app-ka oo keliya: halkan ayaad ka beddeshaa, browser-kanna wuu xasuustaa. Dib u deji dejinta TakeoffCraft wuxuu ku celiyaa bilowgii. Feet iyo inji Muuji dherarka ilaa 1/16\" (bilowga), 1/8\" ama 1/4\". Tani waxay beddeshaa sida dherarku ugu akhrisan yihiin xaashiga, panelada, tirooyinka iyo bar-ka xaaladda. Muujinta oo keliya ayaa la wareejiyaa. Tirooyinka, kharashyada iyo dhoofintu waxay ka xisaabsan yihiin dherarka sax ah, dhoofintuna mar walba waxay muujinaysaa 1/16\". Qashinta bilowga Boqolkiiba qashinta shay kasta oo cusub ku bilaabato: 0% (bilowga), 2%, 3%, 5%, 7.5%, 10%, 15% ama 20%. Wali qashin kale ayaad u qori kartaa shay kasta, tafatirka shayga ama si toos ah miiska tirooyinka. Shayada aad hore u haysay waxay hayn doonaan qashintooda. Auto count: halka jiirka isbarbardhigga uu ka bilaabmo Halka jiirka Isbarbardhig ku sugan marka raadinta Auto count dhammaato, 50% ilaa 95%; 75% waa bilowga. Hoose wuxuu siinayaa wax la mid ah oo badan oo aad diidi karto; sare wuxuu siinayaa kuwa yar. Jiirka wali waad dhaqdhaqaajin kartaa dib-u-eegista kasta. Ku xidh xariiqyada naqshadda Bilowga way shaqeysaa. Marka aad cabbirayso ama hagaajinayso, barta u dhow xariiq PDF-ka waxay u dhaqaaqaysaa dhamaadkeeda, dhexdeeda, isgoyska ama barta u dhow. F3 iyo Ku xidh bar-ka xaaladda ayaa sidoo kale shaqeeya. Wax dheeraad ah: Ku xidh xariiqyada naqshadda. Buuxinta qolka: ballaca furka ay xirto Buuxinta qolka wuxuu xidhaa furka ilaa wuxuu dejiyaa ballaca albaab ama god ay qalabka Qol u tixgeliyo mid xidhan: 3'-0\" ilaa 8'-0\", bilowgana 4'-0\". Ka ballaaran albaabkaaga ugu ballaaran wuxuu u oggolaanayaa qolka inuu gudbo kan xiga; ka yar albaab wuxuu ka tagayaa qolka oo furan. Eeg Qolka buuxi hal riix. Ku xidh 45° adigoon haysan Shift Bilowga way damisan tahay. Marka ay shaqeyso, xariiqyada, qaabka, goosyada iyo geesaha la jiido waxay ku xidhmaan 0°, 45°, 90° ama 135° barta ugu dambaysay adigoon haynin Shift; hay Shift si aad u gujiso xagal kasta. Bar-ka xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"Ku xidhmaya 45°; Shift ayaa xagasha xorayn\". Barta aad ku gujiso qalooca qaansada iyo goobaha ma ay ku xidhmaan; geeska qaansada ayaa ku xidhma. Cabbirka calaamadda tirinta Dhibcaha tirinta intee le'eg yihiin: Aad u yar, Yar, Dhexdhexaad (bilowga: cabbirka dhibcaha weligiis lahaa) ama Weyn. Cabbirku wuxuu ku sii jiraa shaashadda heer kasta oo weynayn ah, PDF-ka la calaamadeeyay wuxuu dhibic kasta ku sawiraa isla cabbir warqadda, iyadoo aan loo eegin cabbirka xaashiga, sidaas darteed PDF-ka 100% wuu u eegaa sida shaashaddu. Wax dheeraad ah: Tirinta gacanta. Calaamadda geesta Kaliya Hubinta 3D: Kaarka aragtida (bilowga: kaar ku yaal geeska midig oo laga riixo, la jiido, laguna leexiyo), Calaamadda tooska (calaamad yar oo X, Y, Z ah hoose midig) ama Midna. Waa isbeddelaa isla markiiba oo browser-kan ayaa xasuustaa. Xaashiga fidsan calaamad ma muujiyo. Qalabka jidka: farqiga ugu weyn ee lagu xidho Qalabka jidka: farqiga ugu weyn ee lagu xidho waa intee le'eg ayay laba dhamaad xariiq u kala fogaan karaan oo weli loo tiro hal jid, PDF points (0.05 ilaa 60; 1.5 bilowga). Xariiqyada naqshadda badanaa waxay ka joogsadaan wax yar oo ay isku dhan yihiin. Weyn ayaa badan ku xidha; yar ayaa xariiqyada kala dhigta. [ iyo ] ayaa beddela markaad dooranayso, goobtanna way raacaysaa. Eeg Xariiqyada dooro.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"menus-keys-and-mouse","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Menyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka","summary":"Dooro qaab menu ah oo u dhigma sidaad hore u shaqeyso, siiso amar kasta furahaaga, u wareeji amarrada menu-yada kala duwan, oo deji waxa wheel-ka iyo badhamada mouse-ka sameeyaan.","section":"reference","order":6,"keywords":["qaabka menu","menyuyaasha","menu bar","ribbon","tabs-ka ribbon","qalabka sare","gaabiyo kiiboodh","furayaasha","habayn","dib u habee","mouse","wheel","rogaal","jihada weynaynta","badhanka dhexe","badhanka midig","guuri","dhoof","soo deji","beddelid","miiska xisaabinta","xaaladaha"],"headings":[{"id":"saddexda-qaab","text":"Saddexda qaab","level":2},{"id":"ka-dhig-midkaaga","text":"Ka dhig midkaaga","level":2},{"id":"mouse","text":"Mouse","level":2},{"id":"qaabkaaga-u-qaad","text":"Qaabkaaga u qaad","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAmarrada TakeoffCraft waa isku mid sida aad ugu gaarto. \u003Cstrong\u003EQaabka menu-ga\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu go&#039;aaminayaa meesha ay shaashadda ku taalliyaan, magacyada ay ku yaalliyaan iyo furayaasha ku shaqeeya. Dooro mid ka mid ah \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/span\u003E; isbeddelku wuu degdeg yahay, browser-kanna wuu xasuustaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"saddexda-qaab\"\u003ESaddexda qaab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQaab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad heshaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalabka sare ee TakeoffCraft: Fayl, Dhoofin, Miisaan, Xisaabinta, Wax ka beddel iyo Muuqaal, oo furayaasha qalabka xarf keli ah. Kan bilowga ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiiska xisaabinta qadarka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMenu bar (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaal\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXisaabinta\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadin\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofin\u003C/span\u003E) oo ku dul yaal hal safka qalabka xisaabinta, sida barnaamijyada xisaabinta screen-ka ay u habeeyaan. Walxaha safka waxa loo yaqaannaa shuruudo (conditions). Furayaasha isku mid, oo ku daraan \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E shay cusub. Miisaanka hore u dejisan wuxuu u guuraa bar-ka xaashiga, dhinaca miisaanka xaashiga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERibbon-ka xisaabinta qadarka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETabs-ka ribbon-ka oo loo magacaabay shaqada: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXisaabinta\u003C/span\u003E (cabbir, qaab, miisaan, naqshadda ka, shuruudaha), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaal\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadin\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas kharash\u003C/span\u003E (buug-shaqada, PDF-yada calaamadsan, tartanka), oo leh menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E iyo safka degdegga ah ee furista, kaydinta, ka noqoshada iyo samee mar kale. Qalabyada aad maalinta oo dhan isticmaasho way weyn yihiin, deriskooda way yaryihiin oo isku kacan. Furayaasha isku mid; miisaanka hore u dejisan wuxuu u guuraa bar-ka xaashiga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaddexda qaab oo dhan waxay ilaaliyaan furayaasha TakeoffCraft: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E dooro, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E socod, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E aag, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E goobo, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E qol, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waddo (dooro xariiqyada PDF-ka), \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E god, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tiri, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tirin otomaatig ah, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hagaaji, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hubi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E habka qaansada, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E habka ka jarista, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si ay u buuxiyaan, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E muuqaalka 3D ee hubinta, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E qabsashada, iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabyada bar-ka xaashiga (qoraallo, daruuro, iftiimo, Compare, 3D) waxay sugaan ilaa PDF la furo; haddii hore la doorto, saddex-ka hoose ayaa sheegaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFurayaasha ku jira qaabka TakeoffCraft laakiin ay qaabkaaga u siiyey amar kale ma sameeyaan wax, saddex-ka hoose wuxuu sheegaa amarkiisa meesha uu tagay (&quot;Furayaashayda, Tiri waa Ctrl+Alt+C&quot;). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo fallaadhaha weligood waxay ilaaliyaan macnahooda. Intaad socod ama dibuc sawirayso, dhajinayso ama dib u eegayso tirin otomaatig ah, xarfaha iyo lambarada dherer la qoray waxay ku sii jiraan naqshadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-dhig-midkaaga\"\u003EKa dhig midkaaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro qaabka ugu dhow waxa aad rabto, kadibna riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHabayn…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhinaca \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFurayaasha iyo menyuyaasha\u003C/span\u003E, hel amar (sanduuqa raadinta ayaa caawiya). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar fur\u003C/span\u003E kadibna riix furaha, ama labo furayaal oo isku xiga furaha laba xarfood. Riix furaha si aad uga saarto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMenu bar-ka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeesha ay ku taal\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu amarka u guurinayaa menu kale, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFurayaasha oo keliya\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhinaca \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMouse\u003C/span\u003E, deji wheel-ka iyo badhamada xaashiga guuraya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESiiso magac kadibna riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydinta qaab hore u jiray waxay samaysaa nuqul kaaga (&quot;Miiskayga xisaabinta qadarka&quot;); kan hore weligiis ma beddelmo. Furay ay labo amar leeyihiin waa cas lagu muujiyaa, waana in la saxo ka hor intaadan kaydin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mouse\"\u003EMouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWheel-ka mouse-ka\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShubis kor u sii weynee wuxuu weynayaa\u003C/span\u003E (bilowga) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShubis kor u sii weynee wuxuu yareeyaa\u003C/span\u003E, iyo sida uu u dhakhsaha badan yahay. Trackpad pinch-ka wuxuu weyneeyaa had iyo jeer sida farahaagu u dhaqaaqayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGuuri xaashiga\u003C/strong\u003E: badhanka dhexe, badhanka midig, ama labadaba. Jiidista bidix ee warqadda madhan iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo leh jiid mar walba way guuraan; midig-riixu adigoo aan jiidin mar walba wuxuu dhammeeyaa socod ama qeex.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiid muuqaalka 3D\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaal kasta kan u gaar ah\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ilaaliyaa badhamada muuqaalka hubinta 3D (bidix iyo dhexe wareega, midig guuraya). Ama deji badhamada dhexe iyo midig inay wareegaan, guuraan, weynaystaan ama waxba; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo leh badhanka ayaa beddelaya wareega iyo guurinta. Badhanka bidix had iyo jeer wuu wareegaa oo dooraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaabkaaga-u-qaad\"\u003EQaabkaaga u qaad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofin\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa qaabka la isticmaalayo fayl yar oo \u003Ccode\u003E.ccinput.json\u003C/code\u003E ah; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo deji…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu mid ku daraa, kombuyuutar kale ama saaxiib kaa. Fayl la soo dejiyay wuxuu tilmaamaa amarrada TakeoffCraft keliya: wixii kale ee ku jira waa la ka tagaa, oo saddex-ka hoose ayaa tiriya. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir qaabkan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka saaraa midka aad leedahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejintan waxay ku sii jiraan browser-kan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal qaabkan app kasta\u003C/span\u003E hoosta kaarka qaababka wuxuu ka dhigayaa app kasta inuu ku furmo qaabkiisa u dhigma (qalabkiisa, menu bar ama ribbon), isbeddellada aad app kasta ku samaysay oo ku jira. TakeoffCraft ma leh qaab leh safka amarrada: marka qaab loo doorto app kasta, TakeoffCraft wuxuu ilaaliyaa qalabkiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERibbon-ka xisaabinta qadarka\u003C/span\u003E waa sidoo kale ribbon-ka qaabeynta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERibbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaalami\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaabeynta\u003C/span\u003E): eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/workspace\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/workspace\"\u003EShaashadda TakeoffCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELa xidhiidha: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/keyboard\"\u003EFurayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta TakeoffCraft\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/coming-from\"\u003EKa imow software kale oo xisaabinta\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Amarrada TakeoffCraft waa isku mid sida aad ugu gaarto. Qaabka menu-ga wuxuu go'aaminayaa meesha ay shaashadda ku taalliyaan, magacyada ay ku yaalliyaan iyo furayaasha ku shaqeeya. Dooro mid ka mid ah Dejinta (Ctrl+,) › TakeoffCraft › Menyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka; isbeddelku wuu degdeg yahay, browser-kanna wuu xasuustaa. Saddexda qaab Qaab Waxa aad heshaa TakeoffCraft Qalabka sare ee TakeoffCraft: Fayl, Dhoofin, Miisaan, Xisaabinta, Wax ka beddel iyo Muuqaal, oo furayaasha qalabka xarf keli ah. Kan bilowga ah. Miiska xisaabinta qadarka Menu bar (Fayl, Wax ka beddel, Muuqaal, Miisaan, Xisaabinta, Walxaha, Calaamadin, Dhoofin) oo ku dul yaal hal safka qalabka xisaabinta, sida barnaamijyada xisaabinta screen-ka ay u habeeyaan. Walxaha safka waxa loo yaqaannaa shuruudo (conditions). Furayaasha isku mid, oo ku daraan N shay cusub. Miisaanka hore u dejisan wuxuu u guuraa bar-ka xaashiga, dhinaca miisaanka xaashiga. Ribbon-ka xisaabinta qadarka Tabs-ka ribbon-ka oo loo magacaabay shaqada: Xisaabinta (cabbir, qaab, miisaan, naqshadda ka, shuruudaha), Wax ka beddel, Muuqaal, Calaamadin iyo Qiyaas kharash (buug-shaqada, PDF-yada calaamadsan, tartanka), oo leh menu Fayl iyo safka degdegga ah ee furista, kaydinta, ka noqoshada iyo samee mar kale. Qalabyada aad maalinta oo dhan isticmaasho way weyn yihiin, deriskooda way yaryihiin oo isku kacan. Furayaasha isku mid; miisaanka hore u dejisan wuxuu u guuraa bar-ka xaashiga. Saddexda qaab oo dhan waxay ilaaliyaan furayaasha TakeoffCraft: V dooro, L socod, A aag, O goobo, B qol, P waddo (dooro xariiqyada PDF-ka), X god, C tiri, S tirin otomaatig ah, K hagaaji, D hubi, R habka qaansada, E habka ka jarista, F iyo W si ay u buuxiyaan, 3 muuqaalka 3D ee hubinta, F3 qabsashada, iyo Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+Y, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O, Ctrl+C, Ctrl+X, Ctrl+V, Ctrl+D, Ctrl+A. Qalabyada bar-ka xaashiga (qoraallo, daruuro, iftiimo, Compare, 3D) waxay sugaan ilaa PDF la furo; haddii hore la doorto, saddex-ka hoose ayaa sheegaa. Furayaasha ku jira qaabka TakeoffCraft laakiin ay qaabkaaga u siiyey amar kale ma sameeyaan wax, saddex-ka hoose wuxuu sheegaa amarkiisa meesha uu tagay (\"Furayaashayda, Tiri waa Ctrl+Alt+C\"). Delete, Esc, Enter, Tab, Space iyo fallaadhaha weligood waxay ilaaliyaan macnahooda. Intaad socod ama dibuc sawirayso, dhajinayso ama dib u eegayso tirin otomaatig ah, xarfaha iyo lambarada dherer la qoray waxay ku sii jiraan naqshadda. Ka dhig midkaaga Dooro qaabka ugu dhow waxa aad rabto, kadibna riix Habayn…. Dhinaca Furayaasha iyo menyuyaasha, hel amar (sanduuqa raadinta ayaa caawiya). Ku dar fur kadibna riix furaha, ama labo furayaal oo isku xiga furaha laba xarfood. Riix furaha si aad uga saarto. Menu bar-ka, Meesha ay ku taal wuxuu amarka u guurinayaa menu kale, ama Furayaasha oo keliya. Dhinaca Mouse, deji wheel-ka iyo badhamada xaashiga guuraya. Siiso magac kadibna riix Kaydi. Kaydinta qaab hore u jiray waxay samaysaa nuqul kaaga (\"Miiskayga xisaabinta qadarka\"); kan hore weligiis ma beddelmo. Furay ay labo amar leeyihiin waa cas lagu muujiyaa, waana in la saxo ka hor intaadan kaydin. Mouse Wheel-ka mouse-ka: Shubis kor u sii weynee wuxuu weynayaa (bilowga) ama Shubis kor u sii weynee wuxuu yareeyaa, iyo sida uu u dhakhsaha badan yahay. Trackpad pinch-ka wuxuu weyneeyaa had iyo jeer sida farahaagu u dhaqaaqayo. Guuri xaashiga: badhanka dhexe, badhanka midig, ama labadaba. Jiidista bidix ee warqadda madhan iyo Space oo leh jiid mar walba way guuraan; midig-riixu adigoo aan jiidin mar walba wuxuu dhammeeyaa socod ama qeex. Jiid muuqaalka 3D: Muuqaal kasta kan u gaar ah wuxuu ilaaliyaa badhamada muuqaalka hubinta 3D (bidix iyo dhexe wareega, midig guuraya). Ama deji badhamada dhexe iyo midig inay wareegaan, guuraan, weynaystaan ama waxba; Shift oo leh badhanka ayaa beddelaya wareega iyo guurinta. Badhanka bidix had iyo jeer wuu wareegaa oo dooraa. Qaabkaaga u qaad Dhoofin wuxuu kaydiyaa qaabka la isticmaalayo fayl yar oo .ccinput.json ah; Soo deji… wuxuu mid ku daraa, kombuyuutar kale ama saaxiib kaa. Fayl la soo dejiyay wuxuu tilmaamaa amarrada TakeoffCraft keliya: wixii kale ee ku jira waa la ka tagaa, oo saddex-ka hoose ayaa tiriya. Tirtir qaabkan wuxuu ka saaraa midka aad leedahay. Dejintan waxay ku sii jiraan browser-kan. Isticmaal qaabkan app kasta hoosta kaarka qaababka wuxuu ka dhigayaa app kasta inuu ku furmo qaabkiisa u dhigma (qalabkiisa, menu bar ama ribbon), isbeddellada aad app kasta ku samaysay oo ku jira. TakeoffCraft ma leh qaab leh safka amarrada: marka qaab loo doorto app kasta, TakeoffCraft wuxuu ilaaliyaa qalabkiisa. Ribbon-ka xisaabinta qadarka waa sidoo kale ribbon-ka qaabeynta Ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca (Dejinta › Caalami › Qaabeynta): eeg Shaashadda TakeoffCraft. La xidhiidha: Furayaasha iyo mouse-ka · Dejinta TakeoffCraft · Ka imow software kale oo xisaabinta","lang":"so"},{"slug":"keyboard","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Kiiboodhka iyo mouse-ka","summary":"Furayaasha oo dhan, mouse-ka, trackpad-ka iyo falalka taabashada ee TakeoffCraft, oo koox koox ah, iyo kala duwanaanshaha nidaamyada.","section":"reference","order":10,"keywords":["furayaasha","gaabiyo","kiiboodh","mouse","trackpad","taabasho","guuri","weynee","shubis","midig-riix","labo-riix","space","shift","koobiyee","dhaji","god","nuqul","dooro dhammaan"],"headings":[{"id":"qalabka","text":"Qalabka","level":2},{"id":"intii-aad-sawirayso","text":"Intii aad sawirayso","level":2},{"id":"doorashada-iyo-wax-ka-beddelka","text":"Doorashada iyo wax ka beddelka","level":2},{"id":"koobiyee-iyo-dhaji","text":"Koobiyee iyo dhaji","level":2},{"id":"fayloota","text":"Fayloota","level":2},{"id":"muuqaalka-iyo-xaashiyada","text":"Muuqaalka iyo xaashiyada","level":2},{"id":"muuqaalka-3d","text":"Muuqaalka 3D","level":2},{"id":"tirin-otomaatig-ah","text":"Tirin otomaatig ah","level":2},{"id":"caawimaad","text":"Caawimaad","level":2},{"id":"dialogyada-iyo-goobaha","text":"Dialogyada iyo goobaha","level":2},{"id":"qoraallada-nidaamka","text":"Qoraallada nidaamka","level":2},{"id":"furayaasha-browser-ku-hayo","text":"Furayaasha browser-ku hayo","level":2},{"id":"meesha-ay-guuri-ku-taal","text":"Meesha ay Guuri ku taal","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFurayaasha xarfaha waxay shaqeeyaan markii mawshinku uu yahay meel kasta oo bogga ah, oo aadan ku qorin goob. Markii dialog furan yahay, furayaashiisa ayaa shaqeeya. Xarfaha waxay shaqeeyaan iyaga oo la socda ama aan la socon \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalabka\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuray\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQalab\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESocod\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAag\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQol\u003C/span\u003E (buuxi qol hal riix)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaanso\u003C/span\u003E shid ama dami (ku jira Socod, Aag iyo God)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa jar\u003C/span\u003E shid ama dami: qaybaha xiga ee socodka waa la sawiraa laakiin lama tiriyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELambar, \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E intii aad sawirayso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur sanduuqa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeli\u003C/span\u003E: qor dherer ama isku-xidhka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa dhigaya barta (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#type-lengths-and-coordinates\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"type-lengths-and-coordinates\"\u003ECabbir socodyada toosan\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGod\u003C/span\u003E (dooro aag marka hore)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiri\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi\u003C/span\u003E miisaanka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"intii-aad-sawirayso\"\u003EIntii aad sawirayso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuray ama falka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhig barta (dhibic, marka Tiri la isticmaalo).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaddo: dooro jidka oo dhan ee xariiqda PDF-ka, ama koontuurka ku wareegsan riixitaanka (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\"\u003EDooro xariiqyada PDF-ka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu qabso xariiqyada naqshadda shid ama dami (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\"\u003EKu qabso xariiqyada naqshadda\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E la haysto markii la riixayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqda ku qabso 0°, 45°, 90° ama 135° laga bilaabo barta u dambaysa. Ma aha barta qaansada ama goobooyinka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabo-riix\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhammee socod, ama xir aag ama god.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhammee socod, ama xir aag ama god.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMidig-riix (adigoo aan dhaqdhaqaaqin)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhammee socod, ama xir aag ama god.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix barta koowaad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXir aag ama god (laga bilaabo barta saddexaad).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa saar barta u dambaysa (marka hore barta qaansada sugaysa).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa tag barta qaansada sugaysa; kadib ka joogso calaamadda aan dhammaan; kadib ku noqo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"doorashada-iyo-wax-ka-beddelka\"\u003EDoorashada iyo wax ka beddelka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuray ama falka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix calaamad (qalabka Dooro)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro oo ka dhig shayga hadda jira.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + riix calaamad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar doorashada, ama ka saar.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro calaamadaha oo dhan ee xaashiga furan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid gacanta geesta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuuri barta (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ku qabsadaa 45°). Waxay shaqeysaa marka hal calaamad la doorto.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirtir calaamadaha la doortay (marka aanad sawirayn).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa dooro midna: nadiifi doorashada iyo xariiqda hubinta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command Z\"\u003E⇧⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESamee mar kale.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koobiyee-iyo-dhaji\"\u003EKoobiyee iyo dhaji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuray\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoobiyee calaamadaha la doortay, oo alaabtooda la socota.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGod: koobiyee calaamadaha la doortay, kadibna tirtir.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaji: nuqulku wuxuu raacaa mawshinka; riix meesha uu tagayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaji meeshii: isla meesha bogga furan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqul calaamadaha la doortay: nuqulku wuxuu raacaa mawshinka; riix meesha uu tagayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ha dhigin: jooji dhajinta ama nuqulka ee mawshinka saaran.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXarfaha keligood weli qalabyada way doortaan (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiri\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGod\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAag\u003C/span\u003E); oo kaliya \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo leh iyaga ayaa koobiyeeya oo dhajinaya. Goob qoraal ah furayaashan qoraal ayay koobiyeeyaan oo dhajiyaan sida caadiga ah. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKoobiyee, dhaji iyo nuqul calaamadaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu tirtiraa calaamadda la doortay marka aadan sawirayn. Haddii taas si lama filaan ah dhacdo, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa soo celinaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fayloota\"\u003EFayloota\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuray\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur qorshayaasha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi xisaabinta\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELabadan waxay shaqeeyaan xataa markii aad ku qorayso goob.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalka-iyo-xaashiyada\"\u003EMuuqaalka iyo xaashiyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuray ama falka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMouse wheel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee oo yaree mawshinka ku sare.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid (badhanka bidix, dhexe ama midig)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuuri. Dhex \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/span\u003E, jiidista bidix waxay sawirtaa sanduuqa raadinta halkii.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E la haysto + jiid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuuri, qalab kasta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBogga buuxi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBallaca buuxi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"=\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee dhexda aragga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYaree dhexda aragga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashiga xiga ama kii hore ee liiska xaashiyada.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareegi qaababka shaashadda buuxda (Control nidaam kasta, oo ay ku jirto Mac).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur ama xir caawimaadan, oo ah panel dhinaca ku taal.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka 3D ee hubinta xaashiga, shid ama dami.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalka-3d\"\u003EMuuqaalka 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuray ama falka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid, ama jiid badhanka dhexe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeg.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + jiid, ama jiid badhanka midig\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuuri.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMouse wheel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShubis: weynee ama yaree barta mawshinka ku jirta. Trackpad-ka, labo-farood oo la jiido wuxuu wareegaa, pinch-ka wuu weynaynayaa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro calaamadda ku jirta mawshinka (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + riix wuu ku daraa ama ka saaraa).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee dhammaan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu noqo xaashiga fidsan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003EHubi xisaabinta qadarka 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tirin-otomaatig-ah\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuray ama falka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid sanduuq\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESanduuqa calaamadda la raadinayo (taasi bilaabeysa raadinta).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix sanduuqa la waafaqay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDiidi, ama soo celi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJooji raadinta socota, ama ka tag dib u eegista.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"caawimaad\"\u003ECaawimaad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuray\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur ama xir panelka caawimaadda (sidoo kale badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaawimaad\u003C/span\u003E ee bar-ka app). Wuxuu shaqeeyaa qalab kasta, xataa markii aad ku qorayso goob.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXir panelka caawimaadda. Sanduuqa raadinta gudihiisa, Esc kowaad wuxuu nadiifiyaa raadinta. Markii panelku furan yahay, Esc ka dib markii la riixay xaashiga ayaa marka hore panelka xiraysa; mar kale riix si aad ugu joojiso TakeoffCraft.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiiboodhadaha Mac badan safka sare ayaa xakameeya iftiinka iyo codka. Riix fn oo leh F1, ama shid &quot;Isticmaal furayaasha F1, F2 iwm sida furayaasha shaqada caadiga ah&quot; Dejinta nidaamka, hoosta Kiiboodh.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dialogyada-iyo-goobaha\"\u003EDialogyada iyo goobaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuray\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoob gudihiisa: ansixi qiimaha. Dialogga hagaajinta: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejiso miisaanka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXir dialogga (sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E); xir foomka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShay cusub\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGal goobta xigta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qoraallada-nidaamka\"\u003EQoraallada nidaamka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa furaha Command: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Shaashadda buuxda way ka duwan tahay: Control+Shift+F.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMidig-riixu waa labo-farood riix trackpad-ka, marka secondary click la shido, Dejinta nidaamka, hoosta Trackpad. TakeoffCraft wuxuu akhrisaa badhanka labaad kaliya; Control-riix waxa laga yaabaa in loo tiriyo riix caadi ah oo barta ku daro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELabo farood oo skrol-ka trackpad-ka waxay xaashiga weynaysaa (ma jiidaan). Si aad u guurto, riix oo jiid, ama hay Space oo jiid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPage Up iyo Page Down waa fn oo leh fallaadhaha sare iyo hoose kiiboodhadaha aan lahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBackspace waa furaha la sheego delete.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa Ctrl: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETouchpad-ka laptop-ka, labo farood oo skrol ah ayaa xaashiga weynaysa. Si aad u guurto, riix oo jiid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ELinux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa Ctrl. Desktop-yada qaarkood waxay leeyihiin gaabiyo Ctrl+Alt ama Super oo gaar ah; TakeoffCraft ma isticmaalo midna.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETouchpad-ka, labo farood oo skrol ah ayaa xaashiga weynaysa. Si aad u guurto, riix oo jiid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffCraft wuxuu akhrisaa taabashada sida mawshin keli ah:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaabasho waxay dhigtaa barta, dooraysa calaamad ama ku darta dhibic tiro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid hal farood ah wuxuu guuraa xaashiga (ku jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sawiraa sanduuqa raadinta).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPinch-to-zoom weli lama taageero. Isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBogga buuxi\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBallaca buuxi\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kiiboodh ahaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u xirto aag, taabo barta koowaad. Si aad u dhammeysid socod, labo-taabo meesha browser-kaagu uga dhigo labo-taabasho labo-riix, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kiiboodh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMa jiro akhrin dhererka toosan ilaa aad taabato, sababtoo ah ma jiro dul-saar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiiboodh iyo mouse ama trackpad ayaa maanta xisaabinta qadarka ugu fiican.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furayaasha-browser-ku-hayo\"\u003EFurayaasha browser-ku hayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBrowser-yadu waxay hayaan gaabiyo qaar oo bog ma isticmaali karo: xidhidda tab-ka (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command W\"\u003E⌘W\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+W\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), tab ama daaqad cusub (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command T\"\u003E⌘T\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command N\"\u003E⌘N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), iyo weynaynta browser-ka (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command +\"\u003E⌘+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl++\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command −\"\u003E⌘−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Sidaas daraadeed TakeoffCraft xaashiga wuxuu weynaysiiyaa mawshinka iyo furayaasha keligood \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Haddii aad si khalad ah u riixdo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command +\"\u003E⌘+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl++\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, bogga oo dhan ayaa weynaanaya; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command 0\"\u003E⌘0\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+0\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa soo celinaysa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EFurayaasha, mouse-yada iyo trackpad-yada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meesha-ay-guuri-ku-taal\"\u003EMeesha ay Guuri ku taal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMa jiro amar Guuri: dooro dhibic tiro oo jiid, ama dooro aag ama xariiq oo jiid xiriirinta geesteeda.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Furayaasha xarfaha waxay shaqeeyaan markii mawshinku uu yahay meel kasta oo bogga ah, oo aadan ku qorin goob. Markii dialog furan yahay, furayaashiisa ayaa shaqeeya. Xarfaha waxay shaqeeyaan iyaga oo la socda ama aan la socon Shift. Qalabka Furay Qalab V Dooro L Socod A Aag O Goobo B Qol (buuxi qol hal riix) R Qaanso shid ama dami (ku jira Socod, Aag iyo God) E Ka jar shid ama dami: qaybaha xiga ee socodka waa la sawiraa laakiin lama tiriyo Lambar, @ ama # intii aad sawirayso Fur sanduuqa Geli: qor dherer ama isku-xidhka, Enter ayaa dhigaya barta (Cabbir socodyada toosan) X God (dooro aag marka hore) C Tiri S Tirin otomaatig ah K Hagaaji D Hubi miisaanka Intii aad sawirayso Furay ama falka Waxa uu sameeyaa Riix Dhig barta (dhibic, marka Tiri la isticmaalo). P Waddo: dooro jidka oo dhan ee xariiqda PDF-ka, ama koontuurka ku wareegsan riixitaanka (Dooro xariiqyada PDF-ka). F3 Ku qabso xariiqyada naqshadda shid ama dami (Ku qabso xariiqyada naqshadda). Shift la haysto markii la riixayo Xariiqda ku qabso 0°, 45°, 90° ama 135° laga bilaabo barta u dambaysa. Ma aha barta qaansada ama goobooyinka. Labo-riix Dhammee socod, ama xir aag ama god. Enter Dhammee socod, ama xir aag ama god. Midig-riix (adigoo aan dhaqdhaqaaqin) Dhammee socod, ama xir aag ama god. Riix barta koowaad Xir aag ama god (laga bilaabo barta saddexaad). Backspace ama Delete Ka saar barta u dambaysa (marka hore barta qaansada sugaysa). Esc Ka tag barta qaansada sugaysa; kadib ka joogso calaamadda aan dhammaan; kadib ku noqo Dooro. Doorashada iyo wax ka beddelka Furay ama falka Waxa uu sameeyaa Riix calaamad (qalabka Dooro) Dooro oo ka dhig shayga hadda jira. Shift + riix calaamad Ku dar doorashada, ama ka saar. Ctrl+A Dooro calaamadaha oo dhan ee xaashiga furan. Jiid gacanta geesta Guuri barta (Shift wuxuu ku qabsadaa 45°). Waxay shaqeysaa marka hal calaamad la doorto. Delete ama Backspace Tirtir calaamadaha la doortay (marka aanad sawirayn). Esc Ka dooro midna: nadiifi doorashada iyo xariiqda hubinta. Ctrl+Z Ka noqo. Ctrl+Y ama Ctrl+Shift+Z Samee mar kale. Koobiyee iyo dhaji Furay Waxa uu sameeyaa Ctrl+C Koobiyee calaamadaha la doortay, oo alaabtooda la socota. Ctrl+X God: koobiyee calaamadaha la doortay, kadibna tirtir. Ctrl+V Dhaji: nuqulku wuxuu raacaa mawshinka; riix meesha uu tagayo. Ctrl+Shift+V Dhaji meeshii: isla meesha bogga furan. Ctrl+D Nuqul calaamadaha la doortay: nuqulku wuxuu raacaa mawshinka; riix meesha uu tagayo. Esc Wax ha dhigin: jooji dhajinta ama nuqulka ee mawshinka saaran. Xarfaha keligood weli qalabyada way doortaan (C waa Tiri, D waa Hubi, X waa God, V waa Dooro, A waa Aag); oo kaliya Ctrl oo leh iyaga ayaa koobiyeeya oo dhajinaya. Goob qoraal ah furayaashan qoraal ayay koobiyeeyaan oo dhajiyaan sida caadiga ah. Eeg Koobiyee, dhaji iyo nuqul calaamadaha. Backspace wuxuu tirtiraa calaamadda la doortay marka aadan sawirayn. Haddii taas si lama filaan ah dhacdo, Ctrl+Z ayaa soo celinaysa. Fayloota Furay Waxa uu sameeyaa Ctrl+O Fur qorshayaasha Ctrl+S Kaydi xisaabinta Labadan waxay shaqeeyaan xataa markii aad ku qorayso goob. Muuqaalka iyo xaashiyada Furay ama falka Waxa uu sameeyaa Mouse wheel Weynee oo yaree mawshinka ku sare. Jiid (badhanka bidix, dhexe ama midig) Guuri. Dhex Tirin otomaatig ah, jiidista bidix waxay sawirtaa sanduuqa raadinta halkii. Space la haysto + jiid Guuri, qalab kasta. F Bogga buuxi W Ballaca buuxi + ama = Weynee dhexda aragga. − Yaree dhexda aragga. Page Down / Page Up Xaashiga xiga ama kii hore ee liiska xaashiyada. Ctrl+Shift+F Wareegi qaababka shaashadda buuxda (Control nidaam kasta, oo ay ku jirto Mac). F1 Fur ama xir caawimaadan, oo ah panel dhinaca ku taal. 3 Muuqaalka 3D ee hubinta xaashiga, shid ama dami. Muuqaalka 3D Furay ama falka Waxa uu sameeyaa Jiid, ama jiid badhanka dhexe Wareeg. Shift + jiid, ama jiid badhanka midig Guuri. Mouse wheel Shubis: weynee ama yaree barta mawshinka ku jirta. Trackpad-ka, labo-farood oo la jiido wuxuu wareegaa, pinch-ka wuu weynaynayaa. Riix Dooro calaamadda ku jirta mawshinka (Shift + riix wuu ku daraa ama ka saaraa). F ama W Weynee dhammaan. 3 Ku noqo xaashiga fidsan. Eeg Hubi xisaabinta qadarka 3D. Tirin otomaatig ah Furay ama falka Waxa uu sameeyaa Jiid sanduuq Sanduuqa calaamadda la raadinayo (taasi bilaabeysa raadinta). Riix sanduuqa la waafaqay Diidi, ama soo celi. Esc Jooji raadinta socota, ama ka tag dib u eegista. Caawimaad Furay Waxa uu sameeyaa F1 Fur ama xir panelka caawimaadda (sidoo kale badhanka Caawimaad ee bar-ka app). Wuxuu shaqeeyaa qalab kasta, xataa markii aad ku qorayso goob. Esc Xir panelka caawimaadda. Sanduuqa raadinta gudihiisa, Esc kowaad wuxuu nadiifiyaa raadinta. Markii panelku furan yahay, Esc ka dib markii la riixay xaashiga ayaa marka hore panelka xiraysa; mar kale riix si aad ugu joojiso TakeoffCraft. Kiiboodhadaha Mac badan safka sare ayaa xakameeya iftiinka iyo codka. Riix fn oo leh F1, ama shid \"Isticmaal furayaasha F1, F2 iwm sida furayaasha shaqada caadiga ah\" Dejinta nidaamka, hoosta Kiiboodh. Dialogyada iyo goobaha Furay Waxa uu sameeyaa Enter Goob gudihiisa: ansixi qiimaha. Dialogga hagaajinta: Dejiso miisaanka. Esc Xir dialogga (sida Jooji); xir foomka Shay cusub. Tab Gal goobta xigta. Qoraallada nidaamka Ctrl waa furaha Command: Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O. Shaashadda buuxda way ka duwan tahay: Control+Shift+F. Midig-riixu waa labo-farood riix trackpad-ka, marka secondary click la shido, Dejinta nidaamka, hoosta Trackpad. TakeoffCraft wuxuu akhrisaa badhanka labaad kaliya; Control-riix waxa laga yaabaa in loo tiriyo riix caadi ah oo barta ku daro. Labo farood oo skrol-ka trackpad-ka waxay xaashiga weynaysaa (ma jiidaan). Si aad u guurto, riix oo jiid, ama hay Space oo jiid. Page Up iyo Page Down waa fn oo leh fallaadhaha sare iyo hoose kiiboodhadaha aan lahayn. Backspace waa furaha la sheego delete. Ctrl waa Ctrl: Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O. Touchpad-ka laptop-ka, labo farood oo skrol ah ayaa xaashiga weynaysa. Si aad u guurto, riix oo jiid. Ctrl waa Ctrl. Desktop-yada qaarkood waxay leeyihiin gaabiyo Ctrl+Alt ama Super oo gaar ah; TakeoffCraft ma isticmaalo midna. Touchpad-ka, labo farood oo skrol ah ayaa xaashiga weynaysa. Si aad u guurto, riix oo jiid. TakeoffCraft wuxuu akhrisaa taabashada sida mawshin keli ah: Taabasho waxay dhigtaa barta, dooraysa calaamad ama ku darta dhibic tiro. Jiid hal farood ah wuxuu guuraa xaashiga (ku jira Tirin otomaatig ah wuxuu sawiraa sanduuqa raadinta). Pinch-to-zoom weli lama taageero. Isticmaal Bogga buuxi iyo Ballaca buuxi, ama + iyo − kiiboodh ahaan. Si aad u xirto aag, taabo barta koowaad. Si aad u dhammeysid socod, labo-taabo meesha browser-kaagu uga dhigo labo-taabasho labo-riix, ama riix Enter kiiboodh. Ma jiro akhrin dhererka toosan ilaa aad taabato, sababtoo ah ma jiro dul-saar. Kiiboodh iyo mouse ama trackpad ayaa maanta xisaabinta qadarka ugu fiican. Furayaasha browser-ku hayo Browser-yadu waxay hayaan gaabiyo qaar oo bog ma isticmaali karo: xidhidda tab-ka (Ctrl+W), tab ama daaqad cusub (Ctrl+T, Ctrl+N), iyo weynaynta browser-ka (Ctrl++, Ctrl+−). Sidaas daraadeed TakeoffCraft xaashiga wuxuu weynaysiiyaa mawshinka iyo furayaasha keligood + iyo −. Haddii aad si khalad ah u riixdo Ctrl++, bogga oo dhan ayaa weynaanaya; Ctrl+0 ayaa soo celinaysa. Eeg Furayaasha, mouse-yada iyo trackpad-yada. Meesha ay Guuri ku taal Ma jiro amar Guuri: dooro dhibic tiro oo jiid, ama dooro aag ama xariiq oo jiid xiriirinta geesteeda.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"entry-formats","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Qaabka dhererka, qiimaha iyo boqolkiiba","summary":"Waxa aad ku qori kartid masaafooyinka, joogta, qiimaha lacagta iyo boqolkiiba qashinka, oo leh tusaalooyin iyo fariimaha u soo baxa qoraal aan TakeoffCraft akhriyi karin.","section":"reference","order":20,"keywords":["gelin","qaab","feet iyo inch","jajab","feet tobanle","metric","mitir","millimitir","qiime","lacag","doolar","boqolkiiba","qashin","qorid"],"headings":[{"id":"dherarka","text":"Dherarka","level":2},{"id":"xisaabinta","text":"Xisaabinta","level":3},{"id":"sida-dherarka-loo-muujiyo","text":"Sida dherarka loo muujiyo","level":2},{"id":"qiimaha-alaabta-shaqada-iyo-wadarta","text":"Qiimaha (alaabta, shaqada iyo wadarta)","level":2},{"id":"boqolkiiba-qashinka","text":"Boqolkiiba qashinka","level":2},{"id":"magacyada-iyo-unugyada","text":"Magacyada iyo unugyada","level":2},{"id":"qaacidooyin","text":"Qaacidooyin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"dherarka\"\u003EDherarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaa isticmaala \u003Cstrong\u003EMasaafada dhabta ah\u003C/strong\u003E ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoog\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoto\u003C/span\u003E tafatiraha shayga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad qortaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24 feet\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24 feet iyo 6½ inch\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039; 6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12 feet iyo 6½ inch (meel bannaan halkii dash)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6-1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12 feet iyo 6½ inch (dash u dhexeeya qaybaha)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24 feet\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E30&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E30 inch\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6½ inch\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E¾ inch\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24 ft 6 in\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24 feet iyo 6 inch (sidoo kale \u003Ccode\u003Efoot\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efeet\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Einch\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Einches\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24.5\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24.5 unugga caadiga ah (eeg hoos)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24.5&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24.5 feet\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E7.5 m\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E7.5 mitir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E750 cm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E750 sentimitir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E7500 mm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E7,500 millimitir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETiro caadi ah waa \u003Cstrong\u003Efeet\u003C/strong\u003E hagaajinta iyo shayada LF, SF ama SY, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Emitir\u003C/strong\u003E shayada m ama m².\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadaha qalinka iyo kuwa habaynta (′ ″ ’ ”) waxay u shaqeeyaan sida \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. Laba apostrophe \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;&#039;\u003C/code\u003E waxay tirinayaan \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECommas waa la iska dhaafaa: \u003Ccode\u003E1,200 mm\u003C/code\u003E waa 1200 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJajabyadu waxay u baahan yihiin tirooyin dhammaystiran labada dhinac: \u003Ccode\u003E6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E way shaqeysaa, \u003Ccode\u003E6.5 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ma shaqeyso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMasaafo eber iyo taban waa la diidaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFariimaha:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Ku qor masaafo, sida 24&#039;-0&quot; ama 7.5 m.&quot; (goobta waa madhan)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Ku qor masaafo ka weyn eber.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Isticmaal feet iyo inch (24&#039;-6 1/2&quot;), feet tobanle, m, cm ama mm.&quot; (unug aan la aqoon)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Masaafadaas lama akhriyi karo. Isku day 24&#039;-6 1/2&quot; ama 24.5.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u tirtirto joogta ama qotada shayga, goobta madhig.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"xisaabinta\"\u003EXisaabinta\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGoobta dherer kasta, iyo sanduuqa qorista intii aad sawirayso, waxay sidoo kale aqbali kartaa xisaab leh \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E*\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E/\u003C/code\u003E iyo qaansooyin: \u003Ccode\u003E4+7/16\u003C/code\u003E (4.4375 inch unugga caadiga ah), \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot; + 3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E(24&#039;-0&quot;)/3\u003C/code\u003E (8 feet), \u003Ccode\u003E2*450mm\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDash la qoro dherer wuxuu weli qayb ka yahay: \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E waa 24 feet 6 inch, \u003Ccode\u003E6-1/2\u003C/code\u003E waa 6½. Dhig meel bannaan dash hareeraha si aad u jarto: \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039; - 6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E waa 23&#039;-6&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETiro caadi ah wuxuu dherer u dhufaa ama u qaybiyaa sida tiro; marka lagu daro dherer, waa unugga caadiga ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eabs\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eround\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eceil\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Efloor\u003C/code\u003E sidoo kale way shaqeeyaan. Xisaab aan la akhriyi karin waa la diidaa, waxaana lagu sheegayaa meesha ay ku qaldantay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-dherarka-loo-muujiyo\"\u003ESida dherarka loo muujiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDherarka waxa lagu muujiyaa feet, inch iyo sideeda meelood: \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0&#039;-0 3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. Qiimayaasha waxa loo wareejiyaa 1/16 inch ee ugu dhow si loo muujiyo; tirooyinka laftooda ma wareejinayn. Qiimayaasha tobanleyda waxay muujiyaan laba tobanle iyo kala-soocaha kumanka, sida \u003Ccode\u003E1,234.50 LF\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qiimaha-alaabta-shaqada-iyo-wadarta\"\u003EQiimaha (alaabta, shaqada iyo wadarta)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad qortaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12.5\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$12.50\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E$12.50\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$12.50\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1,250\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$1,250.00\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E0.385\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$0.385 (ilaa afar tobanle; kuwa ka badan waa la wareejiyaa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(madhan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$0\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFariin: &quot;Ku qor qiime sida 12.50.&quot; ama &quot;Qiimahaas aad ayuu u weyn yahay.&quot; Qiimayaasha taban lama aqbalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELacagaha dheeraadka ah (alaabta, shaqada, wadarta) waxa lagu xisaabiyaa ilaa sentiga: tiro oo qashin leh × qiime, oo la wareejiyo fogaanta eber, siday miiska xisaabta u sameeyo \u003Ccode\u003EROUND(x, 2)\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"boqolkiiba-qashinka\"\u003EBoqolkiiba qashinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad qortaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E7.5%\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E7.5%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(madhan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIlaa laba tobanle, 0% ilaa 1000%. Fariimaha: &quot;Ku qor boqolkiiba sida 10 ama 7.5.&quot; ama &quot;Qashin ka weyn 1000% lama oggola.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"magacyada-iyo-unugyada\"\u003EMagacyada iyo unugyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMagaca shayga iyo qaybta: ilaa 200 xaraf.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnug\u003C/span\u003E qaybta: qoraal kasta oo ilaa 20 xaraf, sida \u003Ccode\u003EEA\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esheets\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ECY\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Egal\u003C/code\u003E. Waa calaamad keliya; TakeoffCraft ma beddelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaacidooyin\"\u003EQaacidooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaacidooyinka isku-dhisku waxay leeyihiin xeerarkooda gaarka ah: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/formulas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/formulas\"\u003ELuqadda qaacidada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Dherarka Waxaa isticmaala Masaafada dhabta ah ee Hagaaji, iyo Joog iyo Qoto tafatiraha shayga. Waxa aad qortaa Macnaha 24'-0\" 24 feet 24'-6 1/2\" 24 feet iyo 6½ inch 12' 6 1/2\" 12 feet iyo 6½ inch (meel bannaan halkii dash) 12'-6-1/2\" 12 feet iyo 6½ inch (dash u dhexeeya qaybaha) 24' 24 feet 30\" 30 inch 6 1/2\" 6½ inch 3/4\" ¾ inch 24 ft 6 in 24 feet iyo 6 inch (sidoo kale foot, feet, inch, inches) 24.5 24.5 unugga caadiga ah (eeg hoos) 24.5' 24.5 feet 7.5 m 7.5 mitir 750 cm 750 sentimitir 7500 mm 7,500 millimitir Tiro caadi ah waa feet hagaajinta iyo shayada LF, SF ama SY, iyo mitir shayada m ama m². Calaamadaha qalinka iyo kuwa habaynta (′ ″ ’ ”) waxay u shaqeeyaan sida ' iyo \". Laba apostrophe '' waxay tirinayaan \". Commas waa la iska dhaafaa: 1,200 mm waa 1200 mm. Jajabyadu waxay u baahan yihiin tirooyin dhammaystiran labada dhinac: 6 1/2\" way shaqeysaa, 6.5 1/2\" ma shaqeyso. Masaafo eber iyo taban waa la diidaa. Fariimaha: \"Ku qor masaafo, sida 24'-0\" ama 7.5 m.\" (goobta waa madhan) \"Ku qor masaafo ka weyn eber.\" \"Isticmaal feet iyo inch (24'-6 1/2\"), feet tobanle, m, cm ama mm.\" (unug aan la aqoon) \"Masaafadaas lama akhriyi karo. Isku day 24'-6 1/2\" ama 24.5.\" Si aad u tirtirto joogta ama qotada shayga, goobta madhig. Xisaabinta Goobta dherer kasta, iyo sanduuqa qorista intii aad sawirayso, waxay sidoo kale aqbali kartaa xisaab leh +, -, *, / iyo qaansooyin: 4+7/16 (4.4375 inch unugga caadiga ah), 12'6\" + 3/4\", (24'-0\")/3 (8 feet), 2*450mm. Dash la qoro dherer wuxuu weli qayb ka yahay: 24'-6\" waa 24 feet 6 inch, 6-1/2 waa 6½. Dhig meel bannaan dash hareeraha si aad u jarto: 24' - 6\" waa 23'-6\". Tiro caadi ah wuxuu dherer u dhufaa ama u qaybiyaa sida tiro; marka lagu daro dherer, waa unugga caadiga ah. abs, round, ceil iyo floor sidoo kale way shaqeeyaan. Xisaab aan la akhriyi karin waa la diidaa, waxaana lagu sheegayaa meesha ay ku qaldantay. Sida dherarka loo muujiyo Dherarka waxa lagu muujiyaa feet, inch iyo sideeda meelood: 12'-6 1/2\", 0'-0 3/4\". Qiimayaasha waxa loo wareejiyaa 1/16 inch ee ugu dhow si loo muujiyo; tirooyinka laftooda ma wareejinayn. Qiimayaasha tobanleyda waxay muujiyaan laba tobanle iyo kala-soocaha kumanka, sida 1,234.50 LF. Qiimaha (alaabta, shaqada iyo wadarta) Waxa aad qortaa Macnaha 12.5 $12.50 $12.50 $12.50 1,250 $1,250.00 0.385 $0.385 (ilaa afar tobanle; kuwa ka badan waa la wareejiyaa) (madhan) $0 Fariin: \"Ku qor qiime sida 12.50.\" ama \"Qiimahaas aad ayuu u weyn yahay.\" Qiimayaasha taban lama aqbalo. Lacagaha dheeraadka ah (alaabta, shaqada, wadarta) waxa lagu xisaabiyaa ilaa sentiga: tiro oo qashin leh × qiime, oo la wareejiyo fogaanta eber, siday miiska xisaabta u sameeyo ROUND(x, 2). Boqolkiiba qashinka Waxa aad qortaa Macnaha 10 10% 7.5% 7.5% (madhan) 0% Ilaa laba tobanle, 0% ilaa 1000%. Fariimaha: \"Ku qor boqolkiiba sida 10 ama 7.5.\" ama \"Qashin ka weyn 1000% lama oggola.\" Magacyada iyo unugyada Magaca shayga iyo qaybta: ilaa 200 xaraf. Unug qaybta: qoraal kasta oo ilaa 20 xaraf, sida EA, sheets, CY, gal. Waa calaamad keliya; TakeoffCraft ma beddelo. Qaacidooyin Qaacidooyinka isku-dhisku waxay leeyihiin xeerarkooda gaarka ah: eeg Luqadda qaacidada.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"scale-presets","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Diyaarinta miisaanka","summary":"Diyaar kasta oo ku jira liiska Diyaar - mimaari, injineeri iyo metric - iyo waxa kasta uu qaadanayo PDF-ka.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["miisaan","diyaar","miisaanka mimaarka","miisaanka injineeriga","miisaanka metric","nisbad","1/4 inch","1/8 inch","1:100","cabbir buuxa"],"headings":[{"id":"mimaarka","text":"Mimaarka","level":2},{"id":"injineeriga","text":"Injineeriga","level":2},{"id":"metric","text":"Metric","level":2},{"id":"miisaannada-la-hagaajiyay","text":"Miisaannada la hagaajiyay","level":2},{"id":"naqshado-aan-caadi-ahayn","text":"Naqshado aan caadi ahayn","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELiiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiyaar\u003C/span\u003E ee kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay 32 miisaan oo saddex koox ah. Diyaar wuxuu si sax ah u dejiyaa miisaanka xaashiga furan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDiyaar kasta wuxuu qaadanayaa in bogga PDF uu yahay cabbirka dhabta ah ee warqadda naqshadda: hal inch oo bogga PDF ah waa hal inch oo warqad dhab ah (bogagga PDF waxay leeyihiin 72 point hal inch kasta). Haddii PDF-ka la cabbiray, isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E. Isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi\u003C/span\u003E ka dib kasta miisaan kasta. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EDejiso miisaanka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mimaarka\"\u003EMimaarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDiyaar\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHal inch oo warqad waa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/16&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/32&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10 ft 8 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E8 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/16&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E5 ft 4 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2 ft 8 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1 ft 4 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1 1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E8 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"injineeriga\"\u003EInjineeriga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDiyaar\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHal inch oo warqad waa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 10&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 20&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E20 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 30&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E30 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 40&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E40 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 50&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E50 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 60&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E60 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 100&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E100 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"metric\"\u003EMetric\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1:1\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:2\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:5\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:10\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:20\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:25\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:50\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:75\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:150\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:200\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:250\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:500\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:1000\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENisbad metric macnaheedu waa hal unug oo warqad ah wuxuu u dhigmaa tiro unug oo dhab ah oo badan: \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E waxaa 10 mm bogga ku jira 1 m dhab ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"miisaannada-la-hagaajiyay\"\u003EMiisaannada la hagaajiyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiisaan la hagaajiyay wuxuu ku muuqdaa sida &quot;La hagaajiyay 1&quot; = 4.002&#039; on 24&#039;-6&quot;&quot; bar-ka hoosta xaashiga: feet dhab ah halkii inch warqad, iyo masaafadii aad qortay. Marka uu ku dhow yahay 0.5% diyaar, bar-ka wuxuu ku daraa &quot;(waafaqa 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;)&quot;, liiska xaashiyadana wuxuu muujinayaa magaca diyaarka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"naqshado-aan-caadi-ahayn\"\u003ENaqshado aan caadi ahayn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar PDF-yo waxay ku caddeeyaan unug bog oo weyn (user unit); TakeoffCraft wuu ka qaadaa diyaarrada iyo miisaanka la muujiyo. Bogagga PDF-ka ee la wareejiyay waxaa loo qiyaasaa sida kuwa toosan.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Liiska Diyaar ee kooxda Miisaan wuxuu leeyahay 32 miisaan oo saddex koox ah. Diyaar wuxuu si sax ah u dejiyaa miisaanka xaashiga furan. Diyaar kasta wuxuu qaadanayaa in bogga PDF uu yahay cabbirka dhabta ah ee warqadda naqshadda: hal inch oo bogga PDF ah waa hal inch oo warqad dhab ah (bogagga PDF waxay leeyihiin 72 point hal inch kasta). Haddii PDF-ka la cabbiray, isticmaal Hagaaji. Isticmaal Hubi ka dib kasta miisaan kasta. Eeg Dejiso miisaanka. Mimaarka Diyaar Hal inch oo warqad waa 1/16\" = 1'-0\" 16 ft 3/32\" = 1'-0\" 10 ft 8 in 1/8\" = 1'-0\" 8 ft 3/16\" = 1'-0\" 5 ft 4 in 1/4\" = 1'-0\" 4 ft 3/8\" = 1'-0\" 2 ft 8 in 1/2\" = 1'-0\" 2 ft 3/4\" = 1'-0\" 1 ft 4 in 1\" = 1'-0\" 1 ft 1 1/2\" = 1'-0\" 8 in 3\" = 1'-0\" 4 in Injineeriga Diyaar Hal inch oo warqad waa 1\" = 10' 10 ft 1\" = 20' 20 ft 1\" = 30' 30 ft 1\" = 40' 40 ft 1\" = 50' 50 ft 1\" = 60' 60 ft 1\" = 100' 100 ft Metric 1:1, 1:2, 1:5, 1:10, 1:20, 1:25, 1:50, 1:75, 1:100, 1:150, 1:200, 1:250, 1:500, 1:1000. Nisbad metric macnaheedu waa hal unug oo warqad ah wuxuu u dhigmaa tiro unug oo dhab ah oo badan: 1:100 waxaa 10 mm bogga ku jira 1 m dhab ah. Miisaannada la hagaajiyay Miisaan la hagaajiyay wuxuu ku muuqdaa sida \"La hagaajiyay 1\" = 4.002' on 24'-6\"\" bar-ka hoosta xaashiga: feet dhab ah halkii inch warqad, iyo masaafadii aad qortay. Marka uu ku dhow yahay 0.5% diyaar, bar-ka wuxuu ku daraa \"(waafaqa 1/4\" = 1'-0\")\", liiska xaashiyadana wuxuu muujinayaa magaca diyaarka. Naqshado aan caadi ahayn Qaar PDF-yo waxay ku caddeeyaan unug bog oo weyn (user unit); TakeoffCraft wuu ka qaadaa diyaarrada iyo miisaanka la muujiyo. Bogagga PDF-ka ee la wareejiyay waxaa loo qiyaasaa sida kuwa toosan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"formulas","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Luqadda qaacidada","summary":"Xeerarka qaacidooyinka tirada isku-dhiska - doorsoomayaasha, hawlaha, shaqooyinka, wareejinta iyo dhammaan fariimaha khaladka.","section":"reference","order":40,"keywords":["qaacid","muujin","syntax","shaqooyin","ceil","floor","round","min","max","abs","doorsoomayaal","hawlo","xisaab"],"headings":[{"id":"doorsoomayaasha","text":"Doorsoomayaasha","level":2},{"id":"hawlaha","text":"Hawlaha","level":2},{"id":"shaqooyinka","text":"Shaqooyinka","level":2},{"id":"khaladaadka","text":"Khaladaadka","level":2},{"id":"amaan-ahaan-naqshadda","text":"Amaan ahaan naqshadda","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQaybaha isku-dhisku tirada ay ka helaan waxay ka imanayaan qaacidda. Qaacidda waa muujin yar oo xisaab ah oo ku saleysan qiyamka shayga la cabbiray. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EIsku-dhisyada iyo qaacidooyinka\u003C/a\u003E tusaalooyin dhamaystiran.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"doorsoomayaasha\"\u003EDoorsoomayaasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENooca shayga\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorsoomaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDherer wadar ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJoogta shayga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAagga darbiga, L × H, oo laga jaray furitaanada socdaalada ee giraan (qadar ka yimid BimCraft). Marka qadarkaas uu magacaabo habka cabbirka, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E waxa cabbira habkaas: furitaanada aan ka weynayn cabbirka ugu yar ee habka way ku jiraan, wixii darbiyada ku kulma waa laga reebaa. Qoraalka hoosta shayga wuxuu magacaabaa habka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirada socdaalada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAagga net-ka oo dhan (dhinacyada ka jarnaan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPerimeter-ka oo dhan, oo ku daraan cidhifyada jarista\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQotada ama qaroka shayga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirada aagagga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDoorsoomayaashu waxay ku jiraan unugyada shayga: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/units\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/units\"\u003EUnugyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXarfaha weyn iyo kuwa yar isku mid ayay yihiin: \u003Ccode\u003El\u003C/code\u003E waa \u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDoorsoomayaasha nooca shayga keliya ayaa shaqeeya. \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E shay linear ah wuxuu siinayaa \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;P&quot; ma aha qiime la cabbiray halkan. Isticmaal L, H, A, N.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJoog ama qoto madhan waa 0.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hawlaha\"\u003EHawlaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQor\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E−\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa jar, ama qiime taban\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E*\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E×\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhufo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E/\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E÷\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E( )\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKooxee\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhufashada iyo qaybinta waxay ka horreeyaan ku darka iyo jaridda: \u003Ccode\u003EL * 2 + 4\u003C/code\u003E waa (L × 2) + 4. Isticmaal qaw-qaw marka aad shakiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETirooyinku waxay leeyihiin meelo jajab ah (\u003Ccode\u003E1.333\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.5\u003C/code\u003E) iyo tilmaamo (\u003Ccode\u003E1e3\u003C/code\u003E = 1000). Meelaha bannaan waa la iska dhaafaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shaqooyinka\"\u003EShaqooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EShaqada\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENatiijada\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETusaale\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EU kor-wareeji tiro oo dhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(67.5)\u003C/code\u003E = 68\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efloor(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EU hoos-wareeji tiro oo dhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efloor(67.5)\u003C/code\u003E = 67\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUgu dhow tiro oo dhan, badhaha fogaanta eber\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(2.5)\u003C/code\u003E = 3\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(x, d)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EU wareeji d tobanle (0 ilaa 10)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(3.14159, 2)\u003C/code\u003E = 3.14\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emin(a, b, …)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiimaha ugu yar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emin(N, 10)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emax(a, b, …)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiimaha ugu weyn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emax(1, ceil(N / 12))\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eabs(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiimaha aan calaamadiisa lahayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eabs(-3)\u003C/code\u003E = 3\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Efloor\u003C/code\u003E waxay iska dhaafaan dhawaaqa wareejinta yar ee kombiyuutarka, sidaas darteed qiime u dhow 1 weligeed lama kor-wareejin 2.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaadka\"\u003EKhaladaadka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaacidda aan la akhriyi karin ama aan la xisaabin karin waxay muujisaa khaladkeeda hoosta goobta, qaybtana waa laga reebaa wadarta (header-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirooyinka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Dhammaystirnayn ma aha&quot;). Fariimaha:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESax\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu qor qaacid, sida L ama ceil(L / 1.333) + 1.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaacidda waa madhan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;X&quot; ma aha qiime la cabbiray halkan. Isticmaal …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaal mid ka mid ah doorsoomayaasha la sheegay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;X&quot; ma aha shaqo halkan. Isticmaal ceil, floor, round, min, max, abs.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaal mid ka mid ah shaqooyinkaas.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;#&quot; lama oggola qaacidda gudaheeda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa saar jilaacaddaas (unugyada, \u003Ccode\u003E%\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E$\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E lama oggola).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxaa maqan &quot;)&quot;. / Waxaa jira &quot;)&quot; aan &quot;(&quot; lahayn.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku dheelli qawsiga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiime waa maqan ka hor &quot;)&quot;, sida \u003Ccode\u003Emax(1, )\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar qiimaha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaacidda si degdeg ah ayay u dhammaatay, sida \u003Ccode\u003EL *\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhammaystir.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa yaab leh &quot;…&quot;. Operator ma maqan yahay?\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba qiime oo isku xiga, sida \u003Ccode\u003E2L\u003C/code\u003E: qor \u003Ccode\u003E2 * L\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eceil() wuxuu qaataa 1 qiime.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESiiso shaqada tirada saxda ah ee qiimaha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eround(x, digits) wuxuu u baahan yahay tiro oo tobanle oo dhammaystiran 0 ilaa 10.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaal tiro oo tobanle oo dhammaystiran.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaacidda waxay u qaybinaysaa eber.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta badan H waa 0: deji joogta ama qotada shayga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaacidda ma siiso tiro.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENatiijadu aad bay u weyn tahay si ay u noqoto tiro.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaacidaas aad bay u dheer tahay (ugu badnaan 500 xaraf).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGaabi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaan-ahaan-naqshadda\"\u003EAmaan ahaan naqshadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaacidda waxay samayn kartaa oo keliya xisaab iyada oo la adeegsanayo doorsoomayaasha iyo shaqooyinka kor ku qoran. Ma fulin karto code, mana akhrin wax kale, sidaas darteed qaacidda ku jirta faylka mashruuc uu kuu soo diro qof kale waa wax aan waxyeello lahayn.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Qaybaha isku-dhisku tirada ay ka helaan waxay ka imanayaan qaacidda. Qaacidda waa muujin yar oo xisaab ah oo ku saleysan qiyamka shayga la cabbiray. Eeg Isku-dhisyada iyo qaacidooyinka tusaalooyin dhamaystiran. Doorsoomayaasha Nooca shayga Doorsoomaha Macnaha Linear L Dherer wadar ah Linear H Joogta shayga Linear A Aagga darbiga, L × H, oo laga jaray furitaanada socdaalada ee giraan (qadar ka yimid BimCraft). Marka qadarkaas uu magacaabo habka cabbirka, A waxa cabbira habkaas: furitaanada aan ka weynayn cabbirka ugu yar ee habka way ku jiraan, wixii darbiyada ku kulma waa laga reebaa. Qoraalka hoosta shayga wuxuu magacaabaa habka Linear N Tirada socdaalada Area A Aagga net-ka oo dhan (dhinacyada ka jarnaan) Area P Perimeter-ka oo dhan, oo ku daraan cidhifyada jarista Area H Qotada ama qaroka shayga Area N Tirada aagagga Count N Tirada Doorsoomayaashu waxay ku jiraan unugyada shayga: eeg Unugyada. Xarfaha weyn iyo kuwa yar isku mid ayay yihiin: l waa L. Doorsoomayaasha nooca shayga keliya ayaa shaqeeya. P shay linear ah wuxuu siinayaa \"P\" ma aha qiime la cabbiray halkan. Isticmaal L, H, A, N. Joog ama qoto madhan waa 0. Hawlaha Qor Macnaha + Ku dar - ama − Ka jar, ama qiime taban * ama × Dhufo / ama ÷ Qaybi ( ) Kooxee Dhufashada iyo qaybinta waxay ka horreeyaan ku darka iyo jaridda: L * 2 + 4 waa (L × 2) + 4. Isticmaal qaw-qaw marka aad shakiso. Tirooyinku waxay leeyihiin meelo jajab ah (1.333, .5) iyo tilmaamo (1e3 = 1000). Meelaha bannaan waa la iska dhaafaa. Shaqooyinka Shaqada Natiijada Tusaale ceil(x) U kor-wareeji tiro oo dhan ceil(67.5) = 68 floor(x) U hoos-wareeji tiro oo dhan floor(67.5) = 67 round(x) Ugu dhow tiro oo dhan, badhaha fogaanta eber round(2.5) = 3 round(x, d) U wareeji d tobanle (0 ilaa 10) round(3.14159, 2) = 3.14 min(a, b, …) Qiimaha ugu yar min(N, 10) max(a, b, …) Qiimaha ugu weyn max(1, ceil(N / 12)) abs(x) Qiimaha aan calaamadiisa lahayn abs(-3) = 3 ceil iyo floor waxay iska dhaafaan dhawaaqa wareejinta yar ee kombiyuutarka, sidaas darteed qiime u dhow 1 weligeed lama kor-wareejin 2. Khaladaadka Qaacidda aan la akhriyi karin ama aan la xisaabin karin waxay muujisaa khaladkeeda hoosta goobta, qaybtana waa laga reebaa wadarta (header-ka Tirooyinka wuxuu leeyahay \"Dhammaystirnayn ma aha\"). Fariimaha: Fariinta Sax Ku qor qaacid, sida L ama ceil(L / 1.333) + 1. Qaacidda waa madhan. \"X\" ma aha qiime la cabbiray halkan. Isticmaal … Isticmaal mid ka mid ah doorsoomayaasha la sheegay. \"X\" ma aha shaqo halkan. Isticmaal ceil, floor, round, min, max, abs. Isticmaal mid ka mid ah shaqooyinkaas. \"#\" lama oggola qaacidda gudaheeda. Ka saar jilaacaddaas (unugyada, %, $ iyo = lama oggola). Waxaa maqan \")\". / Waxaa jira \")\" aan \"(\" lahayn. Isku dheelli qawsiga. Qiime waa maqan ka hor \")\", sida max(1, ). Ku dar qiimaha. Qaacidda si degdeg ah ayay u dhammaatay, sida L *. Dhammaystir. Ka yaab leh \"…\". Operator ma maqan yahay? Laba qiime oo isku xiga, sida 2L: qor 2 * L. ceil() wuxuu qaataa 1 qiime. Siiso shaqada tirada saxda ah ee qiimaha. round(x, digits) wuxuu u baahan yahay tiro oo tobanle oo dhammaystiran 0 ilaa 10. Isticmaal tiro oo tobanle oo dhammaystiran. Qaacidda waxay u qaybinaysaa eber. Inta badan H waa 0: deji joogta ama qotada shayga. Qaacidda ma siiso tiro. Natiijadu aad bay u weyn tahay si ay u noqoto tiro. Qaacidaas aad bay u dheer tahay (ugu badnaan 500 xaraf). Gaabi. Amaan ahaan naqshadda Qaacidda waxay samayn kartaa oo keliya xisaab iyada oo la adeegsanayo doorsoomayaasha iyo shaqooyinka kor ku qoran. Ma fulin karto code, mana akhrin wax kale, sidaas darteed qaacidda ku jirta faylka mashruuc uu kuu soo diro qof kale waa wax aan waxyeello lahayn.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"units","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Unugyada","summary":"Unugyada shayga ay ku warbixin karaan, unugyada doorsoomayaasha qaacidadu isticmaasho, iyo sida unugyada imperial iyo metric isugu jiraan.","section":"reference","order":50,"keywords":["unugyo","lf","sf","sy","sq","yaardh labajibbaaran","saddexyo saqaf","acre","hektaar","mitir","mitir labajibbaaran","ea","mid kasta","metric","imperial","beddelid","unug caadi ah"],"headings":[{"id":"unugyada-shayga","text":"Unugyada shayga","level":2},{"id":"unugyada-doorsoomayaasha-qaacidada","text":"Unugyada doorsoomayaasha qaacidada","level":2},{"id":"meelaha-unugyada-aan-lagu-beddelin","text":"Meelaha unugyada aan lagu beddelin","level":2},{"id":"miisaanka-iyo-unugyada-waa-kala-gooyan","text":"Miisaanka iyo unugyada waa kala gooyan","level":2},{"id":"saxnaanta","text":"Saxnaanta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"unugyada-shayga\"\u003EUnugyada shayga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENooca shayga\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUnug\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMagac\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESocod\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efut socod (caadi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESocod\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emitir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAag\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efut labajibbaaran (caadi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAag\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyaardh labajibbaaran\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAag\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESQ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Esaqaf (100 fut labajibbaaran)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAag\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eacre\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAag\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em²\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emitir labajibbaaran\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAag\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehektaar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEA\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emid kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu beddel \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnug\u003C/span\u003E tafatirka shayga wakhti kasta, xitaa ka dib markii la cabbiray; tirada waa la beddelaa isla markiiba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnug\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa unugyada loo shiday \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnugyada\u003C/span\u003E, iyo had iyo jeer unugga shayga oo gaar ah. Shay cusub wuxuu bilaabmaa unugga dherer ama aag ee halkaas lagu calaamadeeyay, marka uu ka mid yahay unugyada shayga; haddii kale LF ama SF. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/unit-lists\" data-topic=\"basics/unit-lists\"\u003EUnugyada, qorista qiimaha iyo liisaska unugyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"unugyada-doorsoomayaasha-qaacidada\"\u003EUnugyada doorsoomayaasha qaacidada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUnugga shayga\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EL, P, H\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EA\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efut\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efut labajibbaaran (aagga darbiga)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emitir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emitir labajibbaaran (aagga darbiga)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efut\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efut labajibbaaran\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efut\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyaardh labajibbaaran\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESQ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efut\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Esaqaf\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efut\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eacre\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em²\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emitir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emitir labajibbaaran\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emitir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehektaar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShayada SY, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E waa yaardh labajibbaaran, \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E ayaa fut ku jira. Mugga shay SY ah waa \u003Ccode\u003EA * 9 * H / 27\u003C/code\u003E yaardh saddex-geesle; haddii aad SF u isticmaasho dabaqyada, way fududaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meelaha-unugyada-aan-lagu-beddelin\"\u003EMeelaha unugyada aan lagu beddelin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah akhrinta had iyo jeer waxay isticmaalaan fut:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eakhrinta tooska ah ee bar xaaladda markaad sawireyso (fut-inji, SF),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadda la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E (fut-inji, LF iyo SF),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Enatiijada hubinta (fut-inji, oo leh fut tobanle iyo mitir),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edhererka qaybaha iyo perimeter-yada xaashiga Marks ee spreadsheet-ka (fut-inji).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWadarta shayga, miiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirooyinka\u003C/span\u003E, qaacidooyinka iyo xaashiga Qiyaas kharash waxay isticmaalaan unugga shayga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"miisaanka-iyo-unugyada-waa-kala-gooyan\"\u003EMiisaanka iyo unugyada waa kala gooyan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiisaanka xaashi wuxuu sheegaa sida naqshaddu u weyn tahay; unugga shayga wuxuu sheegaa sida loo warbixinayo. Naqshad mitir oo \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E ah waxaa lagu xisaabin karaa LF, naqshad imperial ahna waxaa lagu xisaabin karaa m². Hagaajintu waxay aqbashaa unug kasta: \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E7.5 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E7500 mm\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"saxnaanta\"\u003ESaxnaanta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffCraft wuxuu si sax ah u cabbiraa dhibcaha aad riixdo, oo ay ku jiraan dhererrada qalooca dhabta ah iyo aagagga, mana wareejiyo tirooyinka. Muujintu waxay dhererka wareejisaa 1/16 inji, tobanleyda labo meelood. Lacagta waxaa la wareejiyaa oo kaliya wadarta dhammaatay, ilaa sentiin.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Unugyada shayga Nooca shayga Unug Magac Socod LF fut socod (caadi) Socod m mitir Aag SF fut labajibbaaran (caadi) Aag SY yaardh labajibbaaran Aag SQ saqaf (100 fut labajibbaaran) Aag ac acre Aag m² mitir labajibbaaran Aag ha hektaar Tiro EA mid kasta Ku beddel Unug tafatirka shayga wakhti kasta, xitaa ka dib markii la cabbiray; tirada waa la beddelaa isla markiiba. Liiska Unug wuxuu muujiyaa unugyada loo shiday Dejinta › Guud › Unugyada, iyo had iyo jeer unugga shayga oo gaar ah. Shay cusub wuxuu bilaabmaa unugga dherer ama aag ee halkaas lagu calaamadeeyay, marka uu ka mid yahay unugyada shayga; haddii kale LF ama SF. Eeg Unugyada, qorista qiimaha iyo liisaska unugyada. Unugyada doorsoomayaasha qaacidada Unugga shayga L, P, H A LF fut fut labajibbaaran (aagga darbiga) m mitir mitir labajibbaaran (aagga darbiga) SF fut fut labajibbaaran SY fut yaardh labajibbaaran SQ fut saqaf ac fut acre m² mitir mitir labajibbaaran ha mitir hektaar Shayada SY, A waa yaardh labajibbaaran, P iyo H ayaa fut ku jira. Mugga shay SY ah waa A * 9 * H / 27 yaardh saddex-geesle; haddii aad SF u isticmaasho dabaqyada, way fududaa. Meelaha unugyada aan lagu beddelin Qaar ka mid ah akhrinta had iyo jeer waxay isticmaalaan fut: akhrinta tooska ah ee bar xaaladda markaad sawireyso (fut-inji, SF), Calaamadda la doortay (fut-inji, LF iyo SF), natiijada hubinta (fut-inji, oo leh fut tobanle iyo mitir), dhererka qaybaha iyo perimeter-yada xaashiga Marks ee spreadsheet-ka (fut-inji). Wadarta shayga, miiska Tirooyinka, qaacidooyinka iyo xaashiga Qiyaas kharash waxay isticmaalaan unugga shayga. Miisaanka iyo unugyada waa kala gooyan Miisaanka xaashi wuxuu sheegaa sida naqshaddu u weyn tahay; unugga shayga wuxuu sheegaa sida loo warbixinayo. Naqshad mitir oo 1:100 ah waxaa lagu xisaabin karaa LF, naqshad imperial ahna waxaa lagu xisaabin karaa m². Hagaajintu waxay aqbashaa unug kasta: 24'-6\", 7.5 m, 7500 mm. Saxnaanta TakeoffCraft wuxuu si sax ah u cabbiraa dhibcaha aad riixdo, oo ay ku jiraan dhererrada qalooca dhabta ah iyo aagagga, mana wareejiyo tirooyinka. Muujintu waxay dhererka wareejisaa 1/16 inji, tobanleyda labo meelood. Lacagta waxaa la wareejiyaa oo kaliya wadarta dhammaatay, ilaa sentiin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"export-columns","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Tiirarka dhoofinta","summary":"Xaashi kasta iyo tiir kasta oo ka mid ah dhoofinta XLSX iyo CSV, oo leh qaacidooyinka uu xaashida Qiyaas kharash ku haysto.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["dhoofin","tiirar","xlsx","csv","xaashi","xaashida qiyaasta","sida xaashiga","calaamadaha","miisaamaha","qaacidooyin","goobaha"],"headings":[{"id":"qiyaas-kharash-xaashida-xlsx-iyo-csv","text":"Qiyaas kharash (xaashida XLSX iyo CSV)","level":2},{"id":"sida-xaashiga-xlsx-oo-keliya","text":"Sida xaashiga (XLSX oo keliya)","level":2},{"id":"calaamadaha-xlsx-oo-keliya","text":"Calaamadaha (XLSX oo keliya)","level":2},{"id":"sida-aagga-tartanka-xlsx-oo-keliya-marka-xisaabintu-leedahay-aagag-tartan","text":"Sida aagga tartanka (XLSX oo keliya, marka xisaabintu leedahay aagag tartan)","level":2},{"id":"miisaamaha-xlsx-oo-keliya","text":"Miisaamaha (XLSX oo keliya)","level":2},{"id":"magacyada-faylalka","text":"Magacyada faylalka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"qiyaas-kharash-xaashida-xlsx-iyo-csv\"\u003EQiyaas kharash (xaashida XLSX iyo CSV)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHal safka shay kasta, ku xigta safka qayb kasta oo isku-dhiskiisa ku jira (faraq lagu galay). Kadib safka madhan iyo wadarta guud ee shaqada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETiir\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ku jira\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXLSX-ka gudihiisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA Shay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca shayga (qoraal qalin) ama magaca qaybta (faraq lagu galay)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoraal\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EB Nooca\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear, Area, Count ama Component\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoraal\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC Unug\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF, m, SF, SY, m², EA, ama unugga qaybta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoraal\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ED Tiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWadarta la cabbiray, ama natiijada qaacidda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EE Qashin %\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQashinka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoqolkiiba (0.10 = 10%)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EF Tiro oo qashin leh\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiro × (1 + qashin)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaacid \u003Ccode\u003ED*(1+E)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EG Alaab halka unug kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiimaha alaabta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EH Shaqo halka unug kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiimaha shaqada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI Alaab\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlaabta la wareejiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaacid \u003Ccode\u003EROUND(F*G,2)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJ Shaqo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShaqada la wareejiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaacid \u003Ccode\u003EROUND(F*H,2)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EK Wadar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlaab + shaqo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaacid \u003Ccode\u003EI+J\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EL Fiiro gaar ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaacidda la isticmaalay, khaladka qaacidda, calaamadaha xaashiyada aan miisaan lahayn, aagga darbiga, perimeter-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoraal\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafka wadarta guud: \u003Ccode\u003ESUM\u003C/code\u003E oo ah tiirarka I, J iyo K ee safafka kor ku yaal oo dhan, iyo &quot;Dhammaystirnayn ma aha: eeg fiiro gaarka kor ku yaal&quot; tiirka Fiiro gaar ah marka wax laga tago.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafka leh khalad qaacidda ma leeyahay tiro ama lacag; fiiro gaarkiisa ayaa sheegaya khaladka. Safka koowaad ayaa la xiray.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECSV-ga, tiirarka isku mid ah waxay haystaan qiimayaal caadi ah, Qashin % waa tiro boqolkiiba ah (10 oo u taagan 10%), lacagta waa doolar oo leh laba tobanle. Qoraal uu barnaamijka miiska xisaabta u qaadan karo qaacid (oo ku bilaabma \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E) waxaa hor dhigan \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;\u003C/code\u003E, si u sii ahaato qoraal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-xaashiga-xlsx-oo-keliya\"\u003ESida xaashiga (XLSX oo keliya)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETiir\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ku jira\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca xaashiga (oo leh magaca PDF marka aan la furin)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca shayga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirada shaygaas xaashigaas, unugga shayga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnug\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnugga shayga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirada calaamadaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"calaamadaha-xlsx-oo-keliya\"\u003ECalaamadaha (XLSX oo keliya)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHal safka calaamad kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETiir\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ku jira\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca xaashiga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca shayga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENooca\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear, Area ama Count\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDherer, aagga net-ka, ama 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnug\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF ama m; SF, SY ama m²; EA\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaahfaahin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear: dherarka qaybaha, qaybaha laga jaray oo lagu calaamadiyay &quot;(deduct)&quot;, iyo &quot;deducts (length) of (length) drawn&quot;. Area: aagga guud iyo kuwa la jaray marka ay jiraan, iyo perimeter-ka. &quot;Sheet has no scale&quot; calaamadaha aan miisaan lahayn.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAagga tartanka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaliya marka xisaabintu leedahay aagag tartan: aagga calaamadda, ama &quot;No bid area&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-aagga-tartanka-xlsx-oo-keliya-marka-xisaabintu-leedahay-aagag-tartan\"\u003ESida aagga tartanka (XLSX oo keliya, marka xisaabintu leedahay aagag tartan)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETiir\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ku jira\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAagga tartanka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca aagga, ama &quot;No bid area&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShayga, ama qayb faraq lagu galay hoostiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnug\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnugga shayga ama qaybta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELa cabbiray aagga (qaybaha: qaacidda ku saleysan wadarta aagga)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiro oo qashin leh\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiro × (1 + qashin)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlaab, Shaqo, Wadar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELa wareejiyay ilaa sentiga, sida Qiyaas kharash\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFiiro gaar ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaacidda, khaladaadka iyo calaamadaha aan miisaan lahayn, sida Qiyaas kharash\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAag kasta wuxuu ku dhammaadaa safka &quot;(magaca) subtotal&quot; oo kharashkiisu yahay qaacidooyin \u003Ccode\u003ESUM\u003C/code\u003E oo ku saleysan safafkiisa; safka ugu dambeeya, \u003Cstrong\u003EAll bid areas\u003C/strong\u003E, wuxuu ku daraa subtotal-yada. Xaashida \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadaha\u003C/strong\u003E kadib waxay leedahay tiir todobaad, \u003Cstrong\u003EAagga tartanka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"miisaamaha-xlsx-oo-keliya\"\u003EMiisaamaha (XLSX oo keliya)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHal safka xaashi kasta oo leh miisaan ama calaamado.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETiir\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ku jira\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca xaashiga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiisaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca preset-ka, ama miisaanka la calibrate-ay, ama &quot;No scale&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESidee\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Preset&quot;, ama &quot;Calibrated on (the distance you typed)&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFeet halkii unug PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiimaha saxda ah ee miisaanka ee TakeoffCraft isticmaasho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"magacyada-faylalka\"\u003EMagacyada faylalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(name).xlsx\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E(name).csv\u003C/code\u003E, halkaas oo magaca laga qaado PDF-ka ugu horreeya ee la furay xisaabinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECSV-ga waa UTF-8 oo leh calaamadda bytes-ka ee bilowga iyo xariiqyada Windows, taas oo barnaamijyada miiska xisaabta ee dhammaan nidaamyada akhristaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Qiyaas kharash (xaashida XLSX iyo CSV) Hal safka shay kasta, ku xigta safka qayb kasta oo isku-dhiskiisa ku jira (faraq lagu galay). Kadib safka madhan iyo wadarta guud ee shaqada. Tiir Waxa ku jira XLSX-ka gudihiisa A Shay Magaca shayga (qoraal qalin) ama magaca qaybta (faraq lagu galay) Qoraal B Nooca Linear, Area, Count ama Component Qoraal C Unug LF, m, SF, SY, m², EA, ama unugga qaybta Qoraal D Tiro Wadarta la cabbiray, ama natiijada qaacidda Tiro E Qashin % Qashinka Boqolkiiba (0.10 = 10%) F Tiro oo qashin leh Tiro × (1 + qashin) Qaacid D*(1+E) G Alaab halka unug kasta Qiimaha alaabta Tiro H Shaqo halka unug kasta Qiimaha shaqada Tiro I Alaab Alaabta la wareejiyay Qaacid ROUND(F*G,2) J Shaqo Shaqada la wareejiyay Qaacid ROUND(F*H,2) K Wadar Alaab + shaqo Qaacid I+J L Fiiro gaar ah Qaacidda la isticmaalay, khaladka qaacidda, calaamadaha xaashiyada aan miisaan lahayn, aagga darbiga, perimeter-ka Qoraal Safka wadarta guud: SUM oo ah tiirarka I, J iyo K ee safafka kor ku yaal oo dhan, iyo \"Dhammaystirnayn ma aha: eeg fiiro gaarka kor ku yaal\" tiirka Fiiro gaar ah marka wax laga tago. Safka leh khalad qaacidda ma leeyahay tiro ama lacag; fiiro gaarkiisa ayaa sheegaya khaladka. Safka koowaad ayaa la xiray. CSV-ga, tiirarka isku mid ah waxay haystaan qiimayaal caadi ah, Qashin % waa tiro boqolkiiba ah (10 oo u taagan 10%), lacagta waa doolar oo leh laba tobanle. Qoraal uu barnaamijka miiska xisaabta u qaadan karo qaacid (oo ku bilaabma =, +, - ama @) waxaa hor dhigan ', si u sii ahaato qoraal. Sida xaashiga (XLSX oo keliya) Tiir Waxa ku jira Xaashi Magaca xaashiga (oo leh magaca PDF marka aan la furin) Shay Magaca shayga Tiro Tirada shaygaas xaashigaas, unugga shayga Unug Unugga shayga Calaamadaha Tirada calaamadaha Calaamadaha (XLSX oo keliya) Hal safka calaamad kasta. Tiir Waxa ku jira Xaashi Magaca xaashiga Shay Magaca shayga Nooca Linear, Area ama Count Tiro Dherer, aagga net-ka, ama 1 Unug LF ama m; SF, SY ama m²; EA Faahfaahin Linear: dherarka qaybaha, qaybaha laga jaray oo lagu calaamadiyay \"(deduct)\", iyo \"deducts (length) of (length) drawn\". Area: aagga guud iyo kuwa la jaray marka ay jiraan, iyo perimeter-ka. \"Sheet has no scale\" calaamadaha aan miisaan lahayn. Aagga tartanka Kaliya marka xisaabintu leedahay aagag tartan: aagga calaamadda, ama \"No bid area\" Sida aagga tartanka (XLSX oo keliya, marka xisaabintu leedahay aagag tartan) Tiir Waxa ku jira Aagga tartanka Magaca aagga, ama \"No bid area\" Shay Shayga, ama qayb faraq lagu galay hoostiisa Unug Unugga shayga ama qaybta Tiro La cabbiray aagga (qaybaha: qaacidda ku saleysan wadarta aagga) Tiro oo qashin leh Tiro × (1 + qashin) Alaab, Shaqo, Wadar La wareejiyay ilaa sentiga, sida Qiyaas kharash Fiiro gaar ah Qaacidda, khaladaadka iyo calaamadaha aan miisaan lahayn, sida Qiyaas kharash Aag kasta wuxuu ku dhammaadaa safka \"(magaca) subtotal\" oo kharashkiisu yahay qaacidooyin SUM oo ku saleysan safafkiisa; safka ugu dambeeya, All bid areas, wuxuu ku daraa subtotal-yada. Xaashida Calaamadaha kadib waxay leedahay tiir todobaad, Aagga tartanka. Miisaamaha (XLSX oo keliya) Hal safka xaashi kasta oo leh miisaan ama calaamado. Tiir Waxa ku jira Xaashi Magaca xaashiga Miisaan Magaca preset-ka, ama miisaanka la calibrate-ay, ama \"No scale\" Sidee \"Preset\", ama \"Calibrated on (the distance you typed)\" Feet halkii unug PDF Qiimaha saxda ah ee miisaanka ee TakeoffCraft isticmaasho Magacyada faylalka (name).xlsx iyo (name).csv, halkaas oo magaca laga qaado PDF-ka ugu horreeya ee la furay xisaabinta. CSV-ga waa UTF-8 oo leh calaamadda bytes-ka ee bilowga iyo xariiqyada Windows, taas oo barnaamijyada miiska xisaabta ee dhammaan nidaamyada akhristaan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"troubleshooting","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Xalinta dhibaatooyinka","summary":"Calaamadaha, sababaha iyo xalalka fariimaha iyo wax-yeelada aad ku kulmi karto TakeoffCraft, oo loo xigtay sida app-ku u muujiyo.","section":"trouble","order":10,"keywords":["dhibaatooyin","khaladaad","ma shaqeynayo","xal","caawimaad","diidmo","ma cabbiro","calaamado maqan","dhoofin fashil","khadka ka baxsan","taabasho"],"headings":[{"id":"furidda-faylalka","text":"Furidda faylalka","level":2},{"id":"cabbirka","text":"Cabbirka","level":2},{"id":"miisaanka","text":"Miisaanka","level":2},{"id":"tirooyinka-iyo-qaacidooyinka","text":"Tirooyinka iyo qaacidooyinka","level":2},{"id":"tirinta-otomaatiga-ah","text":"Tirinta otomaatiga ah","level":2},{"id":"kaydinta-iyo-dhoofinta","text":"Kaydinta iyo dhoofinta","level":2},{"id":"furayaasha-iyo-mouse-ka","text":"Furayaasha iyo mouse-ka","level":2},{"id":"shaashadaha-taabashada","text":"Shaashadaha taabashada","level":2},{"id":"shaqada-khadka-ka-baxsan","text":"Shaqada khadka ka baxsan","level":2},{"id":"weli-waa-ku-adkaaday","text":"Weli waa ku adkaaday","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffCraft wuxuu sharxaa inta badan diidmooyinka bar xaaladda ku taal hoosta daaqadda. Ka hel fariinta hoose.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furidda-faylalka\"\u003EFuridda faylalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariin ama wax-yeel\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESabab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXal\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhristaha PDF-ka ma furmin. Dib u rari bogga si aad mar kale isu daydo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhristaha PDF-ka ma furmin, badanaa sababtoo ah khadka ka baxsan baad tahay oo app-ka lama kaydin khadka ka baxsan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu xidh oo dib u rari. Kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E oo sug \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EShaqada khadka ka baxsan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(magaca) waa ilaalin password. Fur nuqul aan ilaalin lahayn.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF-ku wuxuu u baahan yahay password si loo furo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeydii nuqul aan ilaalin lahayn, ama ka saar password-ka PDF program aad aaminto.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(magaca) PDF looma akhrin karo (…)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylku waa jaban yahay ama ma aha PDF dhab ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMar kale soo deji, ama dib u kaydi programka uu sameeyay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(magaca) horey ayuu u furan yahay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsla PDF-ka (isla waxa ku jira) ayaa furan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax la sameeyo ma jiro.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffCraft wuxuu furaa PDF-yada iyo mashruucyada .takeoff.json. Laga tegay: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENoocyada kale ee faylasha waa la tuuray.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarka hore naqshadaha u beddel PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ma dhacaan markaan faylasha dhigo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylasha waxaa lagu dhigay meel ka baxsan daaqadda browser-ka, ama browser-ku wuxuu PDF-ka ku furay tab cusub.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dhig bogga TakeoffCraft laftiisa; qaabka &quot;Dhig PDF-yada ama .takeoff.json&quot; ayaa muujinaya marka uu shaqeyn doono.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFuridda set weyn waxay qaadataa wakhti\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF kasta waa la akhriyaa oo dhan si loo aqoonsado.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESug fariinta &quot;Furaya (magaca)…&quot; inay dhammaato. Sawirrada yar-yar waxay buuxmaan markaad hoos u dhaadhacayso.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbirka\"\u003ECabbirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariin ama wax-yeel\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESabab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXal\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarka hore PDF fur.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashi ma furna.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashigan weli miisaan ma lahan, mana cabbiri karo. Dooro miisaan diyaar ah ama marka hore hagaaji (tirinta ayaa shaqeysa iyada oo aan miisaan lahayn).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalabyada socodka, aagga, goobada iyo goynta waxay u baahan yihiin miisaan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EDejinta miisaanka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarka hore samee shay socod ah (magacaa hoos ku qor Items), kadibna riix xaashiga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMa jiro shay nooca sidaas ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBuuxi foomka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShay cusub\u003C/span\u003E ee furmay, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarka hore dooro shay la xisaabinayo (qaybta Walxaha).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShayga hadda la doortay waa la tirtiray.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix shay hoos \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESocodku wuxuu u baahan yahay ugu yaraan laba dhibcood.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxaad dhammaysay hal riix ka dib.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix ugu yaraan laba dhibcood.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAagga wuxuu u baahan yahay ugu yaraan saddex dhibcood.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesaha waa yar yihiin.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix ugu yaraan saddex geesood.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaabka wuu is-jaraa, sidaas darteed aagga waa khalad. Mar kale sawir iyada oo aan is-jarin.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaab shan-iyo-lixaad (figure-eight).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir sidii laba aag, ama wareeg geeska si-tartiib ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibcahaas ma xidhayaan wax aag ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhammaan dhibcaha waxay ku yaalliin hal xariiq.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix geesaha meel xidha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarka hore dooro calaamad aag (qalabka Dooro), kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGod\u003C/span\u003E oo sawir godka gudaha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGod\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu u baahan yahay aag la doortay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, riix aagga, kadibna \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGod waa inuu ku jiro aagga oo dhan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGodka wuu gudbaa ama ka baxaa qaabka aagga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir godka aagga gudihiisa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGodadka ma isku dhejin karaan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba god ayaa isku dhejaan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir hal god oo ku wareegsan labadaba, ama u dhowee oo kala fogee.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E… Dhibcaha dib ayaa loo celiyay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesta la jiidey ayaa qaabka ka dhigi lahayd mid isgoysa, ama godka ka saari lahayd aagga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid meel dhowrta qaabka sax ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix dhibic goobada geesteeda, ka fog xarunta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiixa labaad aad bay ugu dhowayd xarunta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix ka fogaado.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiixyadu xaashiga ayay dhaqaajiyaan halkii ay dhibcood ku dari lahaayeen\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMouse-ku wuxuu dhaqaaqay ka badan dhowr pikselki intii badhanku hoos yahay; taasi waa jiid.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix adigoo aan dhaqaajin, gaar ahaan trackpad-ka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShift ma ku xidho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxaad dhibic ku dhigaysaa qaanso, ama waxaad sawireysaa goobo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E45° ku xidhka waxa uu ku shaqeeyaa xariiqyo toosan oo keliya.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibcaha waxay u dhaadhacaan xariiq u dhow\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu xidh\u003C/span\u003E xariiqyada sawirka waa furan yahay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKor u kac si aad ugu riixdo inta u dhexaysa xariiqyada, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu xidh\u003C/span\u003E u demiso.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamad ku xidh ma muuqato\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu xidh waa demay, xaashigu waa iskaan (scan), ama qalabku ma ku xidho (Tiri, Tirin otomaatig ah, ku dhejinta).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; xaashiga iskaanka ah xariiq ma jiro oo lagu xidho.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhererku waa khalad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiisaanku waa khalad (badanaa PDF la cabbiray oo leh diyaar).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi\u003C/span\u003E masaafo la yaqaan, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"miisaanka\"\u003EMiisaanka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariin ama wax-yeel\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESabab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXal\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibco u fogee ka dib labo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibcaha hagaajinta aad bay u dhowyihiin.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHagaaji masaafo dheer.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFariin ku jirta sanduuqa hagaajinta, sida &quot;Masaafadaas lama akhriyi karo&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMasaafada waxay ku qoran tahay qaab TakeoffCraft aan akhriyi karin.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EGelinta dherer, qiime iyo boqolleyda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashigan weli miisaan ma lahan, mana hubin karo. Hagaaji, ama dooro diyaar.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi\u003C/span\u003E xaashi aan miisaan lahayn.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarka hore dejin miisaan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELiiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiyaar\u003C/span\u003E waa madow\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashi ma furna.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tirooyinka-iyo-qaacidooyinka\"\u003ETirooyinka iyo qaacidooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariin ama wax-yeel\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESabab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXal\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhammaystiran ma: … (kuma jirto wadarta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhalad qaacido, ama calaamado xaashiyo aan miisaan lahayn.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/read-quantities#the-incomplete-warning\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/read-quantities\" data-hash=\"the-incomplete-warning\"\u003EAkhri tirooyinka iyo qiyaasta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E+(n) aan miisaan lahayn oo ku xiga shay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaar ka mid ah calaamadihiisa waxay ku yaallaan xaashiyo aan miisaan lahayn.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashiyadaas ku sii miisaan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhalad qaacido: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaacidada lama xisaabin karo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/formulas#errors\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/formulas\" data-hash=\"errors\"\u003ELuuqada qaacidooyinka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShaygan calaamado ayuu leeyahay, sidaas darteed nooca lama beddeli karo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENooca waa la xidhay markii uu calaamado yeesho.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESamee shay nooc kale ah oo calaamadaha dib ugu sawir.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShaygu wuxuu u baahan yahay magac.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGaroonka magaca waa la tirtiray.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQor magac.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQor qadar sida 12.50. / Qor boqolleyda sida 10 ama 7.5.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiime ama qashin lama akhriyi karo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EGelinta dherer, qiime iyo boqolleyda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWadarta waa laba jibbaaran\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShaygu wuxuu leeyahay qiimayaal u gaar ah iyo qaybo qiimo isku mid ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDejinta qiimayaasha u gaarka ah ee shaygu waa 0 marka qaybtiisu qiimaha qaadaan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadaha shaygan waxay ku yaallaan PDF-yo aan furnayn.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShay aad riixday, calaamadihiisa oo dhan waxay ku yaallaan PDF-yo aanad furin.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur PDF-yadaas; magacyadooda waa la sheegay hoos \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaashiyada\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tirinta-otomaatiga-ah\"\u003ETirinta otomaatiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariin ama wax-yeel\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESabab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXal\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESanduuqaasi aad buu yar yahay. Ku sawir dhammaan astaanta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESanduuqu aad buu yar yahay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKor u kac oo sanduuq ku sawir astaanta oo dhan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESanduuqaasi waa madow. Ku sawir astaan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESanduuqu wuxuu haystaa oo kaliya warqad.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESanduuq ku sawir astaanta laftiisa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxba ma helin. Hoos u dhig gacanta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsbarbardhig\u003C/span\u003E, ama sanduuqa si adag ugu sawir astaanta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxba ma gaadhin dhibco ku filan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESanduuq si adag ugu sawir astaanta, ama hoos u dhig \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsbarbardhig\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax badan oo khaldan, oo ku jira astaamo qalad ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAstaamaha u eg waxay dhibco ku dhowyihiin kan saxda ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKor u qaad \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsbarbardhig\u003C/span\u003E oo riix sanduuqyada khaldan si aad u diido.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamado ayaa maqan xaashiyada kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashiyadaas astaanta waxay ku sawiran yihiin cabbir kale, ama xagal aan ahayn 90°.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashiyadaas ku raadi sanduuq lagu sawiray, ama tiri gacanta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(n) xaashi aad bay u weynaayeen si loo baadho astaanta cabbirkan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashigu waa weyn yahay cabbirka shaqada.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESanduuq astaan weyn ku sawir, ama xaashigaas tiri gacanta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBaadhitaanku wuu fashilmay: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBaadhitaanka asal ahaan wuu joogsaday.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMar kale isku day; dib u rari bogga haddii uu soo noqnoqdo (marka hore kaydi). Khadka ka baxsan, wuxuu shaqeeyaa kaliya markii bar app-ka tuso \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiidista waxay sanduuq sawirtaa halkii ay ka guuri lahayd\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESidaas ayuu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/span\u003E u shaqeeyaa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo jiid, ama jiid batoonka dhexe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydinta-iyo-dhoofinta\"\u003EKaydinta iyo dhoofinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariin ama wax-yeel\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESabab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXal\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax la dhoofin karo weli ma jiro: samee shay oo ka qaad xisaabinta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShay ma jiro.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarka hore samee shay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeli calaamad ma jiro PDF-yada furan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF calaamadsan\u003C/span\u003E wax ma lahan oo lagu sawiro PDF-yada furan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur PDF-yada leh calaamado.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF-kaan waa ilaalin password ama sir, sidaas darteed nuqul calaamadsan lama qori karo. …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF-ku waa la sirtay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E halkiisa, ama isticmaal nuqul PDF ah oo aan la sirin (markaas waxay u baahan tahay xisaabin gaar ah, sababtoo ah waa fayl kale).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF calaamadsan looma qori karo: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBadanaa: khadka ka baxsan, app-ka lama kaydin khadka ka baxsan, sidaas darteed qoraaga PDF-ka waa maqan yahay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOnline ahow oo mar kale dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF calaamadsan\u003C/span\u003E. Si aad uga fogaato, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E oo sug \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal PDF calaamadsan ayaa la soo dejiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrowser-ku wuxuu xannibay dhowr soo dejin oo isku mar ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOgolow soo dejin badan website-kan, kadibna mar kale dhoofi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(faylka) ma aha mashruuc TakeoffCraft (ma aha JSON sax ah). / Tani ma aha fayl mashruuca TakeoffCraft.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFayl qaldan, ama mid jaban.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMashruucan waxaa kaydiyay TakeoffCraft cusub. Halkaas ka fur.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylku wuxuu ka yimid dhismo cusub.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu fur dhismaha cusub.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(n) calaamado waa jabeen oo laga tegay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQayb ka mid ah faylka waa jabay, ama gacanta ayaa lagu wax ka beddelay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybta kale waa furmay. Calaamadaha maqan dib u sawir, ama fur nuqul hore.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamado maqan ka dib markii dib loo furay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF-yada ma furna, ama mid ka mid ah ayaa isbeddelay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#when-a-pdf-has-changed\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"when-a-pdf-has-changed\"\u003EKaydi oo dib u fur xisaabinta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrowser-ku wuxuu weyddiinayaa &quot;Ka tag bogga?&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxaa jira isbeddello aan la kaydin.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJoog, oo kaydi \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furayaasha-iyo-mouse-ka\"\u003EFurayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECalaamad\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESabab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXal\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFurayaasha xarfaha waxba ma sameeyaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKursiga ku jira goob (raadin, tafatirka shayga, miiska).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix xagga xaashiga, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad uga baxdo goobta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWheel-ku wuxuu kor u qaadaa halkii uu dhaqaajin lahaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWheel-ku had iyo jeer wuu kor u qaadaa xaashiga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid si aad u dhaqaajiso.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBogga oo dhan wuu weynaaday ama yaraaday\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZoom-ka browser-ka (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command +\"\u003E⌘+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl++\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command −\"\u003E⌘−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command 0\"\u003E⌘0\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+0\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Xaashiga kor u qaad wheel-ka, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kaliya.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamad ayaa ka baxday markii aan riixay Backspace\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBackspace wuxuu tirtiraa calaamadda la doortay marka aanad sawirin.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa soo celinaya.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix-midig Mac-ka ma dhamaysto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EControl-click waxa uu u muuqdaa riix caadi ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaal laba-farood riix oo midig, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shaashadaha-taabashada\"\u003EShaashadaha taabashada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShaashadda taabashada:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETaabo\u003C/strong\u003E waxay dhigtaa dhibic (ama waxay dooraysaa calaamad \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E). Hal farood oo jiidaya waxay jiidaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELaba farood\u003C/strong\u003E waxay ku dhejinaan si ay xaashiga ugu kor u qaadaan meesha ay dhexda yihiin, waxayna jiidaan marka ay wada socdaan. Farood labaad oo la dhigo waxay joojisaa tii hore, sidaas darteed ku dhejinta ma ka tagto dhibic.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhammee\u003C/strong\u003E socodka ama geeska adigoo \u003Cstrong\u003Eriix dheer\u003C/strong\u003E (riix midig), \u003Cstrong\u003Elaba-taabo\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhammee\u003C/span\u003E ee xariiqda hoose ee xaashiga. Isla xariiqdaas waxa ku jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDambe\u003C/span\u003E (qaado dhibicda ugu dambeysay) iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E. Aagga waxaa sidoo kale lagu xidhaa taabashada dhibicda koowaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFarooduhu bartilmaamo weyn ayay leeyihiin: dhibcaha way ku xidhmaan, way xidhaan, meelo fog ayay ka dooranayaan, gacmaha kanaaliska waa weyn yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGelinta masaafooyinka waxay u baahan tahay kiiboodh; kiiboodhka shaashadda wuu shaqeeyaa marka sanduuqa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeli\u003C/span\u003E la xulo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETablet-ka, kiiboodh iyo mouse ama trackpad ayaa xisaabinta si fudud u dhigaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shaqada-khadka-ka-baxsan\"\u003EShaqada khadka ka baxsan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhanka ama wax-yeelka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESabab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXal\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELama kaydin karin\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaar ka mid ah faylasha app-ka ma soo dejin intii khadka ka baxsan loo kaydinayay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHubi xiriirkaaga oo mar kale dooro badhanka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan lama heli karo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaaqadaha gaarka ah iyo kombiyuutarada la maamulo qaar ayaa xannibaya nuqullada khadka ka baxsan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaal daaqad caadi ah, ama browser kale.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Kaydinta…&quot; ma bilaabmo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaad ka baxsan tahay khadka; kaydintu waxay u baahan tahay xiriir.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydi markaad online tahay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EApp-ku waa duug marka cusboonaysiin dhacdo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqulka khadka ka baxsan wuxuu ka yimid maalin hore.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOnline ahow, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMar kale kaydi (hel nooca ugu dambeeya)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxaad rabtaa meeshii dib\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqulka khadka ka baxsan wuxuu qaadaa ku dhowaad 6 MB.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar nuqulka khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EShaqada khadka ka baxsan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-waa-ku-adkaaday\"\u003EWeli waa ku adkaaday\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDib u rari bogga haddii app-ku joogsado jawaabta. Xisaabintaadu waa lumi doontaa marka dib loo rarayo, mooyaane haddii aad kaydisay, sidaas darteed marka hore kaydi \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E haddii aad awoodo. Su&#039;aalaha browser-ka eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EBrowser-ka iyo kombiyuutarada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"TakeoffCraft wuxuu sharxaa inta badan diidmooyinka bar xaaladda ku taal hoosta daaqadda. Ka hel fariinta hoose. Furidda faylalka Fariin ama wax-yeel Sabab Xal Akhristaha PDF-ka ma furmin. Dib u rari bogga si aad mar kale isu daydo. Akhristaha PDF-ka ma furmin, badanaa sababtoo ah khadka ka baxsan baad tahay oo app-ka lama kaydin khadka ka baxsan. Ku xidh oo dib u rari. Kadibna dooro Kaydi khadka ka baxsan oo sug Khadka ka baxsan diyaar; eeg Shaqada khadka ka baxsan. (magaca) waa ilaalin password. Fur nuqul aan ilaalin lahayn. PDF-ku wuxuu u baahan yahay password si loo furo. Weydii nuqul aan ilaalin lahayn, ama ka saar password-ka PDF program aad aaminto. (magaca) PDF looma akhrin karo (…) Faylku waa jaban yahay ama ma aha PDF dhab ah. Mar kale soo deji, ama dib u kaydi programka uu sameeyay. (magaca) horey ayuu u furan yahay. Isla PDF-ka (isla waxa ku jira) ayaa furan. Wax la sameeyo ma jiro. TakeoffCraft wuxuu furaa PDF-yada iyo mashruucyada .takeoff.json. Laga tegay: … Noocyada kale ee faylasha waa la tuuray. Marka hore naqshadaha u beddel PDF. Wax ma dhacaan markaan faylasha dhigo Faylasha waxaa lagu dhigay meel ka baxsan daaqadda browser-ka, ama browser-ku wuxuu PDF-ka ku furay tab cusub. Ku dhig bogga TakeoffCraft laftiisa; qaabka \"Dhig PDF-yada ama .takeoff.json\" ayaa muujinaya marka uu shaqeyn doono. Furidda set weyn waxay qaadataa wakhti PDF kasta waa la akhriyaa oo dhan si loo aqoonsado. Sug fariinta \"Furaya (magaca)…\" inay dhammaato. Sawirrada yar-yar waxay buuxmaan markaad hoos u dhaadhacayso. Cabbirka Fariin ama wax-yeel Sabab Xal Marka hore PDF fur. Xaashi ma furna. Fur PDF. Xaashigan weli miisaan ma lahan, mana cabbiri karo. Dooro miisaan diyaar ah ama marka hore hagaaji (tirinta ayaa shaqeysa iyada oo aan miisaan lahayn). Qalabyada socodka, aagga, goobada iyo goynta waxay u baahan yihiin miisaan. Dejinta miisaanka. Marka hore samee shay socod ah (magacaa hoos ku qor Items), kadibna riix xaashiga. Ma jiro shay nooca sidaas ah. Buuxi foomka Shay cusub ee furmay, kadibna dooro Ku dar. Marka hore dooro shay la xisaabinayo (qaybta Walxaha). Shayga hadda la doortay waa la tirtiray. Riix shay hoos Walxaha. Socodku wuxuu u baahan yahay ugu yaraan laba dhibcood. Waxaad dhammaysay hal riix ka dib. Riix ugu yaraan laba dhibcood. Aagga wuxuu u baahan yahay ugu yaraan saddex dhibcood. Geesaha waa yar yihiin. Riix ugu yaraan saddex geesood. Qaabka wuu is-jaraa, sidaas darteed aagga waa khalad. Mar kale sawir iyada oo aan is-jarin. Qaab shan-iyo-lixaad (figure-eight). Sawir sidii laba aag, ama wareeg geeska si-tartiib ah. Dhibcahaas ma xidhayaan wax aag ah. Dhammaan dhibcaha waxay ku yaalliin hal xariiq. Riix geesaha meel xidha. Marka hore dooro calaamad aag (qalabka Dooro), kadibna dooro God oo sawir godka gudaha. God wuxuu u baahan yahay aag la doortay. Riix V, riix aagga, kadibna X. God waa inuu ku jiro aagga oo dhan. Godka wuu gudbaa ama ka baxaa qaabka aagga. Sawir godka aagga gudihiisa. Godadka ma isku dhejin karaan. Laba god ayaa isku dhejaan. Sawir hal god oo ku wareegsan labadaba, ama u dhowee oo kala fogee. … Dhibcaha dib ayaa loo celiyay. Geesta la jiidey ayaa qaabka ka dhigi lahayd mid isgoysa, ama godka ka saari lahayd aagga. Jiid meel dhowrta qaabka sax ah. Riix dhibic goobada geesteeda, ka fog xarunta. Riixa labaad aad bay ugu dhowayd xarunta. Riix ka fogaado. Riixyadu xaashiga ayay dhaqaajiyaan halkii ay dhibcood ku dari lahaayeen Mouse-ku wuxuu dhaqaaqay ka badan dhowr pikselki intii badhanku hoos yahay; taasi waa jiid. Riix adigoo aan dhaqaajin, gaar ahaan trackpad-ka. Shift ma ku xidho Waxaad dhibic ku dhigaysaa qaanso, ama waxaad sawireysaa goobo. 45° ku xidhka waxa uu ku shaqeeyaa xariiqyo toosan oo keliya. Dhibcaha waxay u dhaadhacaan xariiq u dhow Ku xidh xariiqyada sawirka waa furan yahay. Kor u kac si aad ugu riixdo inta u dhexaysa xariiqyada, ama riix F3 si aad Ku xidh u demiso. Calaamad ku xidh ma muuqato Ku xidh waa demay, xaashigu waa iskaan (scan), ama qalabku ma ku xidho (Tiri, Tirin otomaatig ah, ku dhejinta). Riix F3; xaashiga iskaanka ah xariiq ma jiro oo lagu xidho. Dhererku waa khalad Miisaanku waa khalad (badanaa PDF la cabbiray oo leh diyaar). Isticmaal Hubi masaafo la yaqaan, kadibna Hagaaji. Miisaanka Fariin ama wax-yeel Sabab Xal Dhibco u fogee ka dib labo. Dhibcaha hagaajinta aad bay u dhowyihiin. Hagaaji masaafo dheer. Fariin ku jirta sanduuqa hagaajinta, sida \"Masaafadaas lama akhriyi karo\" Masaafada waxay ku qoran tahay qaab TakeoffCraft aan akhriyi karin. Eeg Gelinta dherer, qiime iyo boqolleyda. Xaashigan weli miisaan ma lahan, mana hubin karo. Hagaaji, ama dooro diyaar. Hubi xaashi aan miisaan lahayn. Marka hore dejin miisaan. Liiska Diyaar waa madow Xaashi ma furna. Fur PDF. Tirooyinka iyo qaacidooyinka Fariin ama wax-yeel Sabab Xal Dhammaystiran ma: … (kuma jirto wadarta) Khalad qaacido, ama calaamado xaashiyo aan miisaan lahayn. Eeg Akhri tirooyinka iyo qiyaasta. +(n) aan miisaan lahayn oo ku xiga shay Qaar ka mid ah calaamadihiisa waxay ku yaallaan xaashiyo aan miisaan lahayn. Xaashiyadaas ku sii miisaan. Khalad qaacido: … Qaacidada lama xisaabin karo. Eeg Luuqada qaacidooyinka. Shaygan calaamado ayuu leeyahay, sidaas darteed nooca lama beddeli karo. Nooca waa la xidhay markii uu calaamado yeesho. Samee shay nooc kale ah oo calaamadaha dib ugu sawir. Shaygu wuxuu u baahan yahay magac. Garoonka magaca waa la tirtiray. Qor magac. Qor qadar sida 12.50. / Qor boqolleyda sida 10 ama 7.5. Qiime ama qashin lama akhriyi karo. Eeg Gelinta dherer, qiime iyo boqolleyda. Wadarta waa laba jibbaaran Shaygu wuxuu leeyahay qiimayaal u gaar ah iyo qaybo qiimo isku mid ah. Dejinta qiimayaasha u gaarka ah ee shaygu waa 0 marka qaybtiisu qiimaha qaadaan. Calaamadaha shaygan waxay ku yaallaan PDF-yo aan furnayn. Shay aad riixday, calaamadihiisa oo dhan waxay ku yaallaan PDF-yo aanad furin. Fur PDF-yadaas; magacyadooda waa la sheegay hoos Xaashiyada. Tirinta otomaatiga ah Fariin ama wax-yeel Sabab Xal Sanduuqaasi aad buu yar yahay. Ku sawir dhammaan astaanta. Sanduuqu aad buu yar yahay. Kor u kac oo sanduuq ku sawir astaanta oo dhan. Sanduuqaasi waa madow. Ku sawir astaan. Sanduuqu wuxuu haystaa oo kaliya warqad. Sanduuq ku sawir astaanta laftiisa. Waxba ma helin. Hoos u dhig gacanta Isbarbardhig, ama sanduuqa si adag ugu sawir astaanta. Waxba ma gaadhin dhibco ku filan. Sanduuq si adag ugu sawir astaanta, ama hoos u dhig Isbarbardhig. Wax badan oo khaldan, oo ku jira astaamo qalad ah Astaamaha u eg waxay dhibco ku dhowyihiin kan saxda ah. Kor u qaad Isbarbardhig oo riix sanduuqyada khaldan si aad u diido. Calaamado ayaa maqan xaashiyada kale Xaashiyadaas astaanta waxay ku sawiran yihiin cabbir kale, ama xagal aan ahayn 90°. Xaashiyadaas ku raadi sanduuq lagu sawiray, ama tiri gacanta. (n) xaashi aad bay u weynaayeen si loo baadho astaanta cabbirkan. Xaashigu waa weyn yahay cabbirka shaqada. Sanduuq astaan weyn ku sawir, ama xaashigaas tiri gacanta. Baadhitaanku wuu fashilmay: … Baadhitaanka asal ahaan wuu joogsaday. Mar kale isku day; dib u rari bogga haddii uu soo noqnoqdo (marka hore kaydi). Khadka ka baxsan, wuxuu shaqeeyaa kaliya markii bar app-ka tuso Khadka ka baxsan diyaar. Jiidista waxay sanduuq sawirtaa halkii ay ka guuri lahayd Sidaas ayuu Tirin otomaatig ah u shaqeeyaa. Hay Space oo jiid, ama jiid batoonka dhexe. Kaydinta iyo dhoofinta Fariin ama wax-yeel Sabab Xal Wax la dhoofin karo weli ma jiro: samee shay oo ka qaad xisaabinta. Shay ma jiro. Marka hore samee shay. Weli calaamad ma jiro PDF-yada furan. PDF calaamadsan wax ma lahan oo lagu sawiro PDF-yada furan. Fur PDF-yada leh calaamado. PDF-kaan waa ilaalin password ama sir, sidaas darteed nuqul calaamadsan lama qori karo. … PDF-ku waa la sirtay. Dhoofi XLSX halkiisa, ama isticmaal nuqul PDF ah oo aan la sirin (markaas waxay u baahan tahay xisaabin gaar ah, sababtoo ah waa fayl kale). PDF calaamadsan looma qori karo: … Badanaa: khadka ka baxsan, app-ka lama kaydin khadka ka baxsan, sidaas darteed qoraaga PDF-ka waa maqan yahay. Online ahow oo mar kale dooro PDF calaamadsan. Si aad uga fogaato, dooro Kaydi khadka ka baxsan oo sug Khadka ka baxsan diyaar. Hal PDF calaamadsan ayaa la soo dejiyay Browser-ku wuxuu xannibay dhowr soo dejin oo isku mar ah. Ogolow soo dejin badan website-kan, kadibna mar kale dhoofi. (faylka) ma aha mashruuc TakeoffCraft (ma aha JSON sax ah). / Tani ma aha fayl mashruuca TakeoffCraft. Fayl qaldan, ama mid jaban. Dooro faylka .takeoff.json. Mashruucan waxaa kaydiyay TakeoffCraft cusub. Halkaas ka fur. Faylku wuxuu ka yimid dhismo cusub. Ku fur dhismaha cusub. (n) calaamado waa jabeen oo laga tegay. Qayb ka mid ah faylka waa jabay, ama gacanta ayaa lagu wax ka beddelay. Qaybta kale waa furmay. Calaamadaha maqan dib u sawir, ama fur nuqul hore. Calaamado maqan ka dib markii dib loo furay PDF-yada ma furna, ama mid ka mid ah ayaa isbeddelay. Eeg Kaydi oo dib u fur xisaabinta. Browser-ku wuxuu weyddiinayaa \"Ka tag bogga?\" Waxaa jira isbeddello aan la kaydin. Joog, oo kaydi Ctrl+S. Furayaasha iyo mouse-ka Calaamad Sabab Xal Furayaasha xarfaha waxba ma sameeyaan Kursiga ku jira goob (raadin, tafatirka shayga, miiska). Riix xagga xaashiga, ama riix Tab si aad uga baxdo goobta. Wheel-ku wuxuu kor u qaadaa halkii uu dhaqaajin lahaa Wheel-ku had iyo jeer wuu kor u qaadaa xaashiga. Jiid si aad u dhaqaajiso. Bogga oo dhan wuu weynaaday ama yaraaday Zoom-ka browser-ka (Ctrl++ ama Ctrl+−). Riix Ctrl+0. Xaashiga kor u qaad wheel-ka, ama + iyo − kaliya. Calaamad ayaa ka baxday markii aan riixay Backspace Backspace wuxuu tirtiraa calaamadda la doortay marka aanad sawirin. Ctrl+Z ayaa soo celinaya. Riix-midig Mac-ka ma dhamaysto Control-click waxa uu u muuqdaa riix caadi ah. Isticmaal laba-farood riix oo midig, ama riix Enter. Shaashadaha taabashada Shaashadda taabashada: Taabo waxay dhigtaa dhibic (ama waxay dooraysaa calaamad Dooro). Hal farood oo jiidaya waxay jiidaa. Laba farood waxay ku dhejinaan si ay xaashiga ugu kor u qaadaan meesha ay dhexda yihiin, waxayna jiidaan marka ay wada socdaan. Farood labaad oo la dhigo waxay joojisaa tii hore, sidaas darteed ku dhejinta ma ka tagto dhibic. Dhammee socodka ama geeska adigoo riix dheer (riix midig), laba-taabo, ama Dhammee ee xariiqda hoose ee xaashiga. Isla xariiqdaas waxa ku jira Dambe (qaado dhibicda ugu dambeysay) iyo Jooji. Aagga waxaa sidoo kale lagu xidhaa taabashada dhibicda koowaad. Farooduhu bartilmaamo weyn ayay leeyihiin: dhibcaha way ku xidhmaan, way xidhaan, meelo fog ayay ka dooranayaan, gacmaha kanaaliska waa weyn yihiin. Gelinta masaafooyinka waxay u baahan tahay kiiboodh; kiiboodhka shaashadda wuu shaqeeyaa marka sanduuqa Geli la xulo. Tablet-ka, kiiboodh iyo mouse ama trackpad ayaa xisaabinta si fudud u dhigaya. Shaqada khadka ka baxsan Badhanka ama wax-yeelka Sabab Xal Lama kaydin karin Qaar ka mid ah faylasha app-ka ma soo dejin intii khadka ka baxsan loo kaydinayay. Hubi xiriirkaaga oo mar kale dooro badhanka. Khadka ka baxsan lama heli karo Daaqadaha gaarka ah iyo kombiyuutarada la maamulo qaar ayaa xannibaya nuqullada khadka ka baxsan. Isticmaal daaqad caadi ah, ama browser kale. \"Kaydinta…\" ma bilaabmo Waad ka baxsan tahay khadka; kaydintu waxay u baahan tahay xiriir. Kaydi markaad online tahay. App-ku waa duug marka cusboonaysiin dhacdo Nuqulka khadka ka baxsan wuxuu ka yimid maalin hore. Online ahow, dooro Khadka ka baxsan diyaar, kadibna Mar kale kaydi (hel nooca ugu dambeeya). Waxaad rabtaa meeshii dib Nuqulka khadka ka baxsan wuxuu qaadaa ku dhowaad 6 MB. Dooro Khadka ka baxsan diyaar, kadibna Ka saar nuqulka khadka ka baxsan. Eeg Shaqada khadka ka baxsan. Weli waa ku adkaaday Dib u rari bogga haddii app-ku joogsado jawaabta. Xisaabintaadu waa lumi doontaa marka dib loo rarayo, mooyaane haddii aad kaydisay, sidaas darteed marka hore kaydi Ctrl+S haddii aad awoodo. Su'aalaha browser-ka eeg Browser-ka iyo kombiyuutarada.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"not-built-yet","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Waxa weli aan la dhisin","summary":"Astaamaha TakeoffCraft ee dhismahan ma laha, iyo waxa loo samaynayo maanta.","section":"trouble","order":20,"keywords":["xaddidaad","maqan","weli ma jiro","qorshe mustaqbal","la qorsheeyay","xal kale","marka kasta","daruur","miis-kombiyuutar"],"headings":[{"id":"cabbirka","text":"Cabbirka","level":2},{"id":"walxaha-iyo-qiimaynta","text":"Walxaha iyo qiimaynta","level":2},{"id":"naqshadaha-dwg-iyo-dxf","text":"Naqshadaha (DWG iyo DXF)","level":2},{"id":"tirin-otomaatig-ah","text":"Tirin otomaatig ah","level":2},{"id":"faylasha-iyo-wadaagista","text":"Faylasha iyo wadaagista","level":2},{"id":"shaashadda-iyo-gelinta","text":"Shaashadda iyo gelinta","level":2},{"id":"muuqaalka-3d","text":"Muuqaalka 3D","level":2},{"id":"tartanka","text":"Tartanka","level":2},{"id":"daaqadaha","text":"Daaqadaha","level":2},{"id":"jadwalada-xisaabta","text":"Jadwalada xisaabta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffCraft waa la horumarinayaa. Liistadan waxay ku tusinaysaa waxa dhismahan hadda aan samayn, iyo sida shaqada loo dhamaystiro si kastaba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbirka\"\u003ECabbirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhex-gelinta barta dhexe ee jid ama kontuur\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirtir calaamadda oo mar kale ku sawir.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXulasho sanduuq (daaqad)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + guji calaamad kasta, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E calaamadaha dhammaan ee xaashida. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKoobiyee, dhaji iyo laabo calaamadaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareejinta, muraayad-samaynta ama cabbir-dib-u-habeynta nuqul la dhajiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaji xaashida isla miisaanka iyo isla jihada; wixii kale gacanta ku sawir.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhriska miisaanka xaashi la skaanay, ama bar miisaan sawir ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro diyaarka, ama hagaaji dhererka barka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIn ka badan hal miisaan xaashi kasta (aagagga faahfaahinta, qorshayaasha weyn)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbir qaybta miisaanka xaashida, oo faahfaahinta ka tir xaashideeda weyn haddii ururintu leedahay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"walxaha-iyo-qiimaynta\"\u003EWalxaha iyo qiimaynta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaacidooyinka isku-dhisku isticmaalo noocyada kale ee calaamadaha walax (albaabada qolka ee qaacidooyinka dabaqiisa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaacidooyinku waxay isticmaalaan wadarta nooca ugu weyn; qiimee noocyada kale safafkooda gaarka ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaacidooyinka isku-dhisku oo lagu xisaabiyo jid kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaacidooyinku waxay isticmaalaan wadarta walxa; isticmaal \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E dheeraadka jid kasta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaacidooyin isticmaalaya tirooyinka walax kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirka mar kale ku celi walaxda, ama xisaabi xaashida xogta la dhoofiyay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKooxaha qaybaha isku-dhiska, ama maalin shaqo oo aan 8 saac ahayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKooxda ku qor walxa; muddada maalinta kale, akhri maalmaha-kooxda sida saacadaha-kooxda ÷ maalintaada.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadin ka duwan qoraallada, daruuraha iyo iftiinka (fallaadho, cabbirro, shaabado), ama jawaabaha qoraal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQor qoraalka; beddel xaalkiisa marka la dhammeeyo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaktabad qiimo oo koox wadaaga, ama lagu hayo akoonkaaga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaktabadda waxaa lagu hayaa browser-kan: dhoofi CSV oo ku soo geli kombiyuutarka kale.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXirmooyinka shaqada oo ay hagaajiyeen qiimeeyayaasha shaqada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXirmo kasta waa bilow: hubi qaddaarkiisa shaqadaada iyo alaabtaada ka hor intaadan ku qiimayn. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003EXirmooyinka shaqada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiimaha xirmooyinka shaqada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXirmooyinku waxay keenaan isku-dhisyo kaliya: dejji heerarkaaga, ama soo geli liiskaaga qiimaha CSV.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagacaabidda xisaabinta mar kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca waxaa ka yimid PDF-ka ugu horreeya; magacyada faylalka la soo dejiyay mar kale u magacow.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashiyada gacanta lagu magacaabo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashiyada waxaa lagu magacaabaa calaamadaha bogga PDF-ka; ku raadi magaca faylka iyo bogga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"naqshadaha-dwg-iyo-dxf\"\u003ENaqshadaha (DWG iyo DXF)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiisaska qaabka plot-ka, qoridda qalinka iyo faylasha CTB ee xaashiyada naqshadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqshadda waa madow, ama midabkeeda oo dhumuqsan warqadda; cabbirrada xariijinta waxay ka yimaadaan naqshadda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFuridda DXF binary, ama DWG ka hor AutoCAD 2000\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydi ASCII DXF ama DWG cusub.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHelidda naqshad xiriirsan (xref) iyada oo loo eegayo galka ay ku jirto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur faylka naqshadda xiriirsan oo la socod martida: waxaa lagu helaa magaca faylka dhexdiisa faylasha furan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirka polilaynada 3D, shabakadaha, jidhka adag iyo gobolada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiri iyaga iyada oo loo eegayo lakabka iyo nooca, ama cabbir muuqaalka qorshaha adigoo isticmaalaya qalabka Linear iyo Area.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoraal PDF calaamadsan oo naqshad ka timid qoraallo aan Latin ahayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXarfaha uusan Helvetica lahayn glyph-ka waxay ku soo baxaan &quot;?&quot; PDF calaamadsan; naqshadda shaashadda ma saamaynayso.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGacan-siin naqshad barnaamij kale oo laga sameeyo xaashi-barka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur isla faylka barnaamijkaas.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqshad xisaabinta ku jirta, sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF oo ku jira xisaabinta qadarka\u003C/span\u003E u sameyso PDF-yada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi xisaabinta\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu dib ugu furmaa isla naqshadda, oo lagu helaa waxa ku jira.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHoos-dahaadyada PDF, sawirada iyo walxaha OLE ee lagu dhejiyay naqshadda, ama tirinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawirada waxay muuqdaan qaab-sariir kaliya. Fur PDF-ka hoos-dahaadka sida xaashi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tirin-otomaatig-ah\"\u003ETirin otomaatig ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHelidda astaamaha xaashi aan miisaan lahayn oo cabbir kale lagu sawiray\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESiiso xaashida miisaankeeda, ama raadi sanduuq lagu sawiro halkaas.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHelidda astaamaha muraayadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiri gacanta, ama mar kale raadi sanduuq ku wareegsan mid muraayad ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylasha-iyo-wadaagista\"\u003EFaylasha iyo wadaagista\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF keliya oo labadaba muujinaya calaamadaha iyo xisaabinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF calaamadsan\u003C/span\u003E dadka si ay u arkaan calaamadaha; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF oo ku jira xisaabinta qadarka\u003C/span\u003E si mar kale TakeoffCraft looga furo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECSV tirooyinka xaashi kasta ama calaamadaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E: xaashiyadeeda By sheet iyo Marks ayaa leh.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydinta daruurta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeli ma diyaar. Kaydi faylasha mashruuca kombiyuutarkaaga oo sameyso nuqul.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarnaamij desktop oo TakeoffCraft gaar ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaga bilaabo 0.5 barnaamijka desktop waa CadCraft Studio, oo dhammaan siddeed barnaamij ku jira hal rakib. TakeoffCraft waxa kale oo uu ku shaqeeyaa browser-ka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shaashadda-iyo-gelinta\"\u003EShaashadda iyo gelinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELiiska riix-midig (ama riix-dheer)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaal qalabka, daaqadaha iyo furayaasha. Riix-dheer wuxuu dhammeeyaa jid ama kontuur.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareejinta muuqaalka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBogagga PDF-ka ee la wareejiyay horey ayay u muuqdaan toosan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalka-3d\"\u003EMuuqaalka 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadaha 3D ku sawirka ama wax ka beddelka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu noqo xaashida (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) si aad u sawirto; xulashada iyo tirtirku waxay ka shaqeeyaan 3D.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDabaqyada is-dul saaran ee lagu qorsheeyay meelo kala duwan bogagooda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDabaqyada oo kale qorsheeyay isku mid ah ku dhig; kuwa kale mid mid xaashi ku hubi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirinta tiirarka cabbirkoodu la mid yahay walxda la tirinayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhammaan tiirarka xaashida waa isku cabbir; waxay calaamadaynayaan meesha tirintu ku taal, ma aha waxa ay yihiin.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tartanka\"\u003ETartanka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu darid xirmo horey loo diray, warqadaha bixinta, iyo xaashi shaqo oo mid kasta oo codsadaha saxeexo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDir xirmo cusub, oo qoraalka bixinta naftaada qor. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-invitations\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-invitations\"\u003EDir xirmo tartan\u003C/a\u003E waxa uu daboolaa waxa la dhisay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDiritaanka martiqaadyada tartanka akoon kasta: intii la tijaabinayo, emailka codsadaha dibadda waa la damiyay marka laga reebo akoonada ay kooxda CadCraft awoodsiisay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESoo dejiso \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV-ga shaqada\u003C/span\u003E, email-ka u dir naftaada oo qiimayaasha ku qor.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDiritaanka xirmooyinka tartanka daaqadda Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa dir TakeoffCraft browser-ka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDib-u-qiimaynta aagga tartanka beddelka oo tartan la doortay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeddelka iyo wadarta aagagga tartanka waxay isticmaalaan qiimayaashaada; beddelka gacanta ku hagaaji.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXusuusin toos ah ka hor inta taariikhda caymiska ama shatiga kontaraakhtarka hoosaadka ay dhacayso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaariikhda waa la calaamadiyaa bogga Kontaraakhtarrada hoosaadka marka ay dhaafto ama ku jirto 30 maalmood gudahood; hubi markaad martiqaadayso.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"daaqadaha\"\u003EDaaqadaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareejinta miiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirooyinka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaliya daaqadaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaashiyada\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E ayaa la wareejin karaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHabee daaqadaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jadwalada-xisaabta\"\u003EJadwalada xisaabta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBuug-shaqada XLSX waxaa lagu hubiyay LibreOffice Calc, kaasoo wadar kasta dib u xisaabiyay ilaa centka isku mid ah ee TakeoffCraft. Weli Excel lama furin. Haddii barnaamijka jadwalka xisaabta uu wax yaab leh muujiyo, dhoofinta CSV waxay haysaa isla qiyaasta qiimo-caadi ah.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"TakeoffCraft waa la horumarinayaa. Liistadan waxay ku tusinaysaa waxa dhismahan hadda aan samayn, iyo sida shaqada loo dhamaystiro si kastaba. Cabbirka Weli lama dhisin Halkii, maanta Dhex-gelinta barta dhexe ee jid ama kontuur Tirtir calaamadda oo mar kale ku sawir. Xulasho sanduuq (daaqad) Shift + guji calaamad kasta, ama Ctrl+A calaamadaha dhammaan ee xaashida. Eeg Koobiyee, dhaji iyo laabo calaamadaha. Wareejinta, muraayad-samaynta ama cabbir-dib-u-habeynta nuqul la dhajiyay Dhaji xaashida isla miisaanka iyo isla jihada; wixii kale gacanta ku sawir. Akhriska miisaanka xaashi la skaanay, ama bar miisaan sawir ah Dooro diyaarka, ama hagaaji dhererka barka. In ka badan hal miisaan xaashi kasta (aagagga faahfaahinta, qorshayaasha weyn) Cabbir qaybta miisaanka xaashida, oo faahfaahinta ka tir xaashideeda weyn haddii ururintu leedahay. Walxaha iyo qiimaynta Weli lama dhisin Halkii, maanta Qaacidooyinka isku-dhisku isticmaalo noocyada kale ee calaamadaha walax (albaabada qolka ee qaacidooyinka dabaqiisa) Qaacidooyinku waxay isticmaalaan wadarta nooca ugu weyn; qiimee noocyada kale safafkooda gaarka ah. Qaacidooyinka isku-dhisku oo lagu xisaabiyo jid kasta Qaacidooyinku waxay isticmaalaan wadarta walxa; isticmaal N dheeraadka jid kasta. Qaacidooyin isticmaalaya tirooyinka walax kale Cabbirka mar kale ku celi walaxda, ama xisaabi xaashida xogta la dhoofiyay. Kooxaha qaybaha isku-dhiska, ama maalin shaqo oo aan 8 saac ahayn Kooxda ku qor walxa; muddada maalinta kale, akhri maalmaha-kooxda sida saacadaha-kooxda ÷ maalintaada. Calaamadin ka duwan qoraallada, daruuraha iyo iftiinka (fallaadho, cabbirro, shaabado), ama jawaabaha qoraal Qor qoraalka; beddel xaalkiisa marka la dhammeeyo. Maktabad qiimo oo koox wadaaga, ama lagu hayo akoonkaaga Maktabadda waxaa lagu hayaa browser-kan: dhoofi CSV oo ku soo geli kombiyuutarka kale. Xirmooyinka shaqada oo ay hagaajiyeen qiimeeyayaasha shaqada Xirmo kasta waa bilow: hubi qaddaarkiisa shaqadaada iyo alaabtaada ka hor intaadan ku qiimayn. Eeg Xirmooyinka shaqada. Qiimaha xirmooyinka shaqada Xirmooyinku waxay keenaan isku-dhisyo kaliya: dejji heerarkaaga, ama soo geli liiskaaga qiimaha CSV. Magacaabidda xisaabinta mar kale Magaca waxaa ka yimid PDF-ka ugu horreeya; magacyada faylalka la soo dejiyay mar kale u magacow. Xaashiyada gacanta lagu magacaabo Xaashiyada waxaa lagu magacaabaa calaamadaha bogga PDF-ka; ku raadi magaca faylka iyo bogga. Naqshadaha (DWG iyo DXF) Weli lama dhisin Halkii, maanta Miisaska qaabka plot-ka, qoridda qalinka iyo faylasha CTB ee xaashiyada naqshadda Naqshadda waa madow, ama midabkeeda oo dhumuqsan warqadda; cabbirrada xariijinta waxay ka yimaadaan naqshadda. Furidda DXF binary, ama DWG ka hor AutoCAD 2000 Kaydi ASCII DXF ama DWG cusub. Helidda naqshad xiriirsan (xref) iyada oo loo eegayo galka ay ku jirto Fur faylka naqshadda xiriirsan oo la socod martida: waxaa lagu helaa magaca faylka dhexdiisa faylasha furan. Cabbirka polilaynada 3D, shabakadaha, jidhka adag iyo gobolada Tiri iyaga iyada oo loo eegayo lakabka iyo nooca, ama cabbir muuqaalka qorshaha adigoo isticmaalaya qalabka Linear iyo Area. Qoraal PDF calaamadsan oo naqshad ka timid qoraallo aan Latin ahayn Xarfaha uusan Helvetica lahayn glyph-ka waxay ku soo baxaan \"?\" PDF calaamadsan; naqshadda shaashadda ma saamaynayso. Gacan-siin naqshad barnaamij kale oo laga sameeyo xaashi-barka Fur isla faylka barnaamijkaas. Naqshad xisaabinta ku jirta, sida PDF oo ku jira xisaabinta qadarka u sameyso PDF-yada Kaydi xisaabinta: .takeoff.json wuxuu dib ugu furmaa isla naqshadda, oo lagu helaa waxa ku jira. Hoos-dahaadyada PDF, sawirada iyo walxaha OLE ee lagu dhejiyay naqshadda, ama tirinta Sawirada waxay muuqdaan qaab-sariir kaliya. Fur PDF-ka hoos-dahaadka sida xaashi. Tirin otomaatig ah Weli lama dhisin Halkii, maanta Helidda astaamaha xaashi aan miisaan lahayn oo cabbir kale lagu sawiray Siiso xaashida miisaankeeda, ama raadi sanduuq lagu sawiro halkaas. Helidda astaamaha muraayadda Tiri gacanta, ama mar kale raadi sanduuq ku wareegsan mid muraayad ah. Faylasha iyo wadaagista Weli lama dhisin Halkii, maanta PDF keliya oo labadaba muujinaya calaamadaha iyo xisaabinta PDF calaamadsan dadka si ay u arkaan calaamadaha; PDF oo ku jira xisaabinta qadarka si mar kale TakeoffCraft looga furo. CSV tirooyinka xaashi kasta ama calaamadaha Isticmaal XLSX: xaashiyadeeda By sheet iyo Marks ayaa leh. Kaydinta daruurta Weli ma diyaar. Kaydi faylasha mashruuca kombiyuutarkaaga oo sameyso nuqul. Barnaamij desktop oo TakeoffCraft gaar ah Laga bilaabo 0.5 barnaamijka desktop waa CadCraft Studio, oo dhammaan siddeed barnaamij ku jira hal rakib. TakeoffCraft waxa kale oo uu ku shaqeeyaa browser-ka. Shaashadda iyo gelinta Weli lama dhisin Halkii, maanta Liiska riix-midig (ama riix-dheer) Isticmaal qalabka, daaqadaha iyo furayaasha. Riix-dheer wuxuu dhammeeyaa jid ama kontuur. Wareejinta muuqaalka Bogagga PDF-ka ee la wareejiyay horey ayay u muuqdaan toosan. Muuqaalka 3D Weli lama dhisin Halkii, maanta Calaamadaha 3D ku sawirka ama wax ka beddelka Ku noqo xaashida (3) si aad u sawirto; xulashada iyo tirtirku waxay ka shaqeeyaan 3D. Dabaqyada is-dul saaran ee lagu qorsheeyay meelo kala duwan bogagooda Dabaqyada oo kale qorsheeyay isku mid ah ku dhig; kuwa kale mid mid xaashi ku hubi. Tirinta tiirarka cabbirkoodu la mid yahay walxda la tirinayo Dhammaan tiirarka xaashida waa isku cabbir; waxay calaamadaynayaan meesha tirintu ku taal, ma aha waxa ay yihiin. Tartanka Weli lama dhisin Halkii, maanta Ku darid xirmo horey loo diray, warqadaha bixinta, iyo xaashi shaqo oo mid kasta oo codsadaha saxeexo Dir xirmo cusub, oo qoraalka bixinta naftaada qor. Dir xirmo tartan waxa uu daboolaa waxa la dhisay. Diritaanka martiqaadyada tartanka akoon kasta: intii la tijaabinayo, emailka codsadaha dibadda waa la damiyay marka laga reebo akoonada ay kooxda CadCraft awoodsiisay Soo dejiso CSV-ga shaqada, email-ka u dir naftaada oo qiimayaasha ku qor. Diritaanka xirmooyinka tartanka daaqadda Studio Ka dir TakeoffCraft browser-ka. Dib-u-qiimaynta aagga tartanka beddelka oo tartan la doortay Beddelka iyo wadarta aagagga tartanka waxay isticmaalaan qiimayaashaada; beddelka gacanta ku hagaaji. Xusuusin toos ah ka hor inta taariikhda caymiska ama shatiga kontaraakhtarka hoosaadka ay dhacayso Taariikhda waa la calaamadiyaa bogga Kontaraakhtarrada hoosaadka marka ay dhaafto ama ku jirto 30 maalmood gudahood; hubi markaad martiqaadayso. Daaqadaha Weli lama dhisin Halkii, maanta Wareejinta miiska Tirooyinka Kaliya daaqadaha Xaashiyada iyo Walxaha ayaa la wareejin karaa. Eeg Habee daaqadaha. Jadwalada xisaabta Buug-shaqada XLSX waxaa lagu hubiyay LibreOffice Calc, kaasoo wadar kasta dib u xisaabiyay ilaa centka isku mid ah ee TakeoffCraft. Weli Excel lama furin. Haddii barnaamijka jadwalka xisaabta uu wax yaab leh muujiyo, dhoofinta CSV waxay haysaa isla qiyaasta qiimo-caadi ah.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"help","scope":"basics","title":"Isticmaalka caawintan","summary":"Fur caawinta, baadh, oo arag tillaabooyinka kombiyuutarkaaga.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["caawin","f1","baadh","casharro","buug"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-caawinta","text":"Fur caawinta","level":2},{"id":"raadi-mawduuc","text":"Raadi mawduuc","level":2},{"id":"tillaabooyinka-kombiyuutarkaaga","text":"Tillaabooyinka kombiyuutarkaaga","level":2},{"id":"caawintaas-oo-kale-websaydhka","text":"Caawintaas oo kale websaydhka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EApp kasta waxa uu leeyahay caawintiisa. Waa qayb ka mid ah app-ka, sidaas darteed xidhiidh la&#039;aan ayuu furmaa, had iyo jeerna nooca aad isticmaalayso ayuu sharxaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-caawinta\"\u003EFur caawinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaawin\u003C/span\u003E barka sare ee app-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXir\u003C/span\u003E si aad u ridto. Naqshaddaadu waxay ku sii jirtaa sida ay ahayd.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiiboodhka Mac-ka badankiisa safka sare ayaa maamula iftiinka iyo codka. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo la socda furaha \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (ama furaha globe-ka), ama isticmaal badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaawin\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys#function-keys-on-a-mac\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\" data-hash=\"function-keys-on-a-mac\"\u003EFurayaasha Mac-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"raadi-mawduuc\"\u003ERaadi mawduuc\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor sanduuqa baadhista ee caawinta sare. Natiijooyinku waa cusboonaadaan intaad qorayso, waxayna ku jiraan magacyada amarada barnaamijyada kale, sidaas darteed waxa aad meel kale qori lahayd inta badan bogga saxda ah ayaa la helaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMawduucyada waxa loo kooxeeyaa siyaabo isku mid ah app kasta: bilaabidda, tilmaamaha tallaabo-tallaabo, kuwa laga soo guuray barnaamij kale, tixraacyada, iyo dhibaatooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXiriirrada mawduuc gudihiisa waxay furaan mawduuca xiga isla panelka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u noqo\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kuu celinayaa meeshii aad ka timid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tillaabooyinka-kombiyuutarkaaga\"\u003ETillaabooyinka kombiyuutarkaaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah tillaabooyinka way kala duwan yihiin Mac, Windows iyo Linux, browserada dhexdooda, iyo marka aad online tahay iyo marka aad offline tahay. Caawintu waxay go&#039;aamisaa kan kugu khuseeya oo waxay tusaysaa tillaabooyinkaas. Sadarka sare ee mawduuca waxa uu sheegayaa waxa uu dooray, tusaale ahaan &quot;Showing steps for Mac, Chrome or Edge, online&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeddel\u003C/span\u003E sadarkaas si aad kombiyuutar ama browser kale u doorato, tusaale ahaan si aad u caawiso shaqaale kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E si aad u aragto nooc kasta oo tillaabo kasta, mid kastaa calaamad leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGaadhka furayaasha kiiboodhka waxa loo qoraa siyaabta kiiboodhkaagu u calaamadeeyo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu Mac-ka ku akhrisanayaa ⌘S, Windows iyo Linux-na Ctrl+S.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"caawintaas-oo-kale-websaydhka\"\u003ECaawintaas oo kale websaydhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWebsaydhku wuxuu tusaa isla mawduucyada getcadcraft.com/tutorials, tillaabooyinka nidaam kasta. App-ka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu fur website-ka\u003C/span\u003E oo ku yaal hoosta mawduuca wuxuu furaa bogaas markaad online tahay.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"App kasta waxa uu leeyahay caawintiisa. Waa qayb ka mid ah app-ka, sidaas darteed xidhiidh la'aan ayuu furmaa, had iyo jeerna nooca aad isticmaalayso ayuu sharxaa. Fur caawinta Riix F1, ama dooro Caawin barka sare ee app-ka. Riix Esc ama dooro Xir si aad u ridto. Naqshaddaadu waxay ku sii jirtaa sida ay ahayd. Kiiboodhka Mac-ka badankiisa safka sare ayaa maamula iftiinka iyo codka. Riix F1 oo la socda furaha fn (ama furaha globe-ka), ama isticmaal badhanka Caawin. Eeg Furayaasha Mac-ka. Raadi mawduuc Ku qor sanduuqa baadhista ee caawinta sare. Natiijooyinku waa cusboonaadaan intaad qorayso, waxayna ku jiraan magacyada amarada barnaamijyada kale, sidaas darteed waxa aad meel kale qori lahayd inta badan bogga saxda ah ayaa la helaa. Mawduucyada waxa loo kooxeeyaa siyaabo isku mid ah app kasta: bilaabidda, tilmaamaha tallaabo-tallaabo, kuwa laga soo guuray barnaamij kale, tixraacyada, iyo dhibaatooyinka. Xiriirrada mawduuc gudihiisa waxay furaan mawduuca xiga isla panelka. Dib u noqo wuxuu kuu celinayaa meeshii aad ka timid. Tillaabooyinka kombiyuutarkaaga Qaar ka mid ah tillaabooyinka way kala duwan yihiin Mac, Windows iyo Linux, browserada dhexdooda, iyo marka aad online tahay iyo marka aad offline tahay. Caawintu waxay go'aamisaa kan kugu khuseeya oo waxay tusaysaa tillaabooyinkaas. Sadarka sare ee mawduuca waxa uu sheegayaa waxa uu dooray, tusaale ahaan \"Showing steps for Mac, Chrome or Edge, online\". Dooro Beddel sadarkaas si aad kombiyuutar ama browser kale u doorato, tusaale ahaan si aad u caawiso shaqaale kale. Dooro Muuji dhammaan si aad u aragto nooc kasta oo tillaabo kasta, mid kastaa calaamad leh. Gaadhka furayaasha kiiboodhka waxa loo qoraa siyaabta kiiboodhkaagu u calaamadeeyo: Ctrl+S wuxuu Mac-ka ku akhrisanayaa ⌘S, Windows iyo Linux-na Ctrl+S. Caawintaas oo kale websaydhka Websaydhku wuxuu tusaa isla mawduucyada getcadcraft.com/tutorials, tillaabooyinka nidaam kasta. App-ka, Ku fur website-ka oo ku yaal hoosta mawduuca wuxuu furaa bogaas markaad online tahay.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"browsers","scope":"basics","title":"Browserrada iyo kombiyuutarada","summary":"Browserrada app-yadu ku shaqeeyaan, waxa ka duwan dhexdooda, iyo waxa kombiyuutarkaagu u baahan yahay.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["chrome","edge","firefox","safari","brave","browser","mac","windows","linux","ipad","tablet","webgl","shuruudaha","xusuusta"],"headings":[{"id":"browserka","text":"Browserka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-browserada-ku-kala-duwan","text":"Waxa browserada ku kala duwan","level":2},{"id":"mac-windows-iyo-linux","text":"Mac, Windows iyo Linux","level":2},{"id":"taabletyada-iyo-shaashadaha-taabashada","text":"Taabletyada iyo shaashadaha taabashada","level":2},{"id":"browserka-iyo-nidaamka-ugu-duqsan","text":"Browserka iyo nidaamka ugu duqsan","level":2},{"id":"waxa-kombiyuutarkaagu-u-baahan-yahay","text":"Waxa kombiyuutarkaagu u baahan yahay","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EApp-yadu waxay ku shaqeeyaan browser web. Shaqada kombiyuutarkaaga ayey ku sameeyaan: faylalkaagu halkaas ayaa la furaa oo weligood ma nala soo dirin (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EMeesha ay faylalkaagu aadaan\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browserka\"\u003EBrowserka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsticmaal nooca cusub ee mid ka mid ah kuwan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBrowser\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEngine\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaahfaahin\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKan ugu buuxsamaya: doorashada folder-ka, kaydinta offline-ka, maaraynta faylasha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGecko\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWay shaqeysaa. Furidda folder oo dhan waxay isticmaashaa doorasho fudud. Kaydinta offline-ka waxa laga yaabaa inaysan ku shaqeynin daaqadaha gaarka ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWebKit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWay shaqeysaa Mac iyo iPad. Furidda folder oo dhan waxay isticmaashaa doorasho fudud. Safari waxay tirtiri kartaa nuqul offline ah oo aanad isticmaalin dhowr toddobaad.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhammaan saddexdan engine way wanaagsan yihiin shaqada maalinlaha ah. Meel app uu wax ku kala duwan sameeyo mid ka mid ah, caawinta uu ku leeyahay waxay tusinaysaa tillaabooyinka browserkaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-browserada-ku-kala-duwan\"\u003EWaxa browserada ku kala duwan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFuridda folder-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Browserada Chromium waxay tusaan doorashada folder-ka dhabta ah, folder-kana si toos ah ayey u akhriyaan. Firefox iyo Safari waxay kugu weydiinayaan inaad folder dooratid kadibna mid kasta oo ku jira way akhriyaan, taas oo qaadanaysa waqti dheer folderada mashruucyada waaweyn; folder-ka app-ka ku jiid waxay ku shaqeysaa saddexdaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydinta.\u003C/strong\u003E Apps-yadu waxay kaydiyaan iyagoo fayl soo dejinaya. Browserkaagu wuxuu go&#039;aaminayaa meesha soo dejintu tagto iyo inuu hore u weydiiyo mise uusan weydiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChrome ama Edge, shid &quot;Ask where to save each file before downloading&quot; (Settings gudaheeda, hoosta Downloads) si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFirefox, fur Settings, kadibna General, kadibna Downloads, kadibna dooro &quot;Always ask you where to save files&quot; si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafari, fur Settings, kadibna General, kadibna deji &quot;File download location&quot; &quot;Ask for each download&quot; si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mac-windows-iyo-linux\"\u003EMac, Windows iyo Linux\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EApps-yadu kombiyuutar kasta waa isku mid. Waxa isbedela waa kiiboodhka: gaadhka furayaasha si toos ah ayaa loogu qoraa kombiyuutarkaaga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EFurayaasha, mouse-yada iyo trackpad-yada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"taabletyada-iyo-shaashadaha-taabashada\"\u003ETaabletyada iyo shaashadaha taabashada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah apps-yada waxay aqbalaan taabashada (hal farta ayaa sawirta ama doortaa, labo farood ayaa weynaysa oo dhaqaajiya). Caawinta app kasta ayaa sheegaysa inay taasi jirto. iPad-ka, isticmaal Safari ama Chrome. Kiiboodhku wuxuu caawiyaa apps-yada isticmaala amarro la qoro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browserka-iyo-nidaamka-ugu-duqsan\"\u003EBrowserka iyo nidaamka ugu duqsan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaan kuwan ka akhrinnay koodka apps-yada 0.7, ma aha malo-malo: fayl kasta waa la falanqeeyay, astaamo kasta oo luqadda ah oo ay isticmaalaan waxaa laga eegay xogta isku-habaynta ee browserrada ee la daabacay. Nooca ka hooseeya kuwan, apps-yadu ma bilaabi karaan, sababtoo ah browserku koodka ma fahmo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENooca ugu duqsan ee apps-yada bilaabi kara\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium 94\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E93\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari (Mac, iPad, iPhone)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS and iOS 16.4)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECadCraft Studio waxa uu Windows-ka ku leeyahay engine web-kiisa, sidaas darteed wuxuu u baahan yahay Windows 10 ama 11; Mac-ka wuxuu isticmaalaa kan nidaamka, sidaas darteed wuxuu u baahan yahay macOS 13.3 ama ka cusub. Dejinta › Cusboonaysiinta ee Studio waxa ay muujinaysaa nidaamka nuqulkaagu ku shaqeeyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETanu waa nooca ugu duqsan ee \u003Cem\u003Ebilaabmo\u003C/em\u003E, laga akhriyay koodka. Ma aha liis browserro duq ah oo aan apps-yada ku shaqeynay, sidaas darteed browser duq ah oo bilaabmi kara ayaa laga yaabaa inuu weli maqan yahay astaamo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-kombiyuutarkaagu-u-baahan-yahay\"\u003EWaxa kombiyuutarkaagu u baahan yahay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwani waa qadarka ugu yar ee la qorsheeyay apps-yada, ma aha shuruudo la cabbiray:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E8 GB oo xusuus ah (16 GB ayaa lagu talinayaa moodallada isku-dhafan ee waaweyn).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChip garaafyada oo leh WebGL 2 apps-yada 3D-ga. Haddii muuqaalka 3D-ga madhan yahay, hubi in hardware acceleration uu shaqeynayo dejinta browserkaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShaashad ugu yaraan 1280 pixel ballaadhka leh si qalabyada oo dhan u buuxaan; shaashadaha yar safaf badan ayay u qaybiyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylal aad u waaweyn (qorshe-tiro waaweyn, moodallo waaweyn) xusuus badan ayey ku isticmaalaan tab-ka browserka. Haddii app-ku gaabiyo, xir tab-yada kale ee culus.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"App-yadu waxay ku shaqeeyaan browser web. Shaqada kombiyuutarkaaga ayey ku sameeyaan: faylalkaagu halkaas ayaa la furaa oo weligood ma nala soo dirin (eeg Meesha ay faylalkaagu aadaan). Browserka Isticmaal nooca cusub ee mid ka mid ah kuwan: Browser Engine Faahfaahin Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium Kan ugu buuxsamaya: doorashada folder-ka, kaydinta offline-ka, maaraynta faylasha. Firefox Gecko Way shaqeysaa. Furidda folder oo dhan waxay isticmaashaa doorasho fudud. Kaydinta offline-ka waxa laga yaabaa inaysan ku shaqeynin daaqadaha gaarka ah. Safari WebKit Way shaqeysaa Mac iyo iPad. Furidda folder oo dhan waxay isticmaashaa doorasho fudud. Safari waxay tirtiri kartaa nuqul offline ah oo aanad isticmaalin dhowr toddobaad. Dhammaan saddexdan engine way wanaagsan yihiin shaqada maalinlaha ah. Meel app uu wax ku kala duwan sameeyo mid ka mid ah, caawinta uu ku leeyahay waxay tusinaysaa tillaabooyinka browserkaaga. Waxa browserada ku kala duwan Furidda folder-ka. Browserada Chromium waxay tusaan doorashada folder-ka dhabta ah, folder-kana si toos ah ayey u akhriyaan. Firefox iyo Safari waxay kugu weydiinayaan inaad folder dooratid kadibna mid kasta oo ku jira way akhriyaan, taas oo qaadanaysa waqti dheer folderada mashruucyada waaweyn; folder-ka app-ka ku jiid waxay ku shaqeysaa saddexdaba. Kaydinta. Apps-yadu waxay kaydiyaan iyagoo fayl soo dejinaya. Browserkaagu wuxuu go'aaminayaa meesha soo dejintu tagto iyo inuu hore u weydiiyo mise uusan weydiin. Chrome ama Edge, shid \"Ask where to save each file before downloading\" (Settings gudaheeda, hoosta Downloads) si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid. Firefox, fur Settings, kadibna General, kadibna Downloads, kadibna dooro \"Always ask you where to save files\" si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid. Safari, fur Settings, kadibna General, kadibna deji \"File download location\" \"Ask for each download\" si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid. Mac, Windows iyo Linux Apps-yadu kombiyuutar kasta waa isku mid. Waxa isbedela waa kiiboodhka: gaadhka furayaasha si toos ah ayaa loogu qoraa kombiyuutarkaaga. Eeg Furayaasha, mouse-yada iyo trackpad-yada. Taabletyada iyo shaashadaha taabashada Qaar ka mid ah apps-yada waxay aqbalaan taabashada (hal farta ayaa sawirta ama doortaa, labo farood ayaa weynaysa oo dhaqaajiya). Caawinta app kasta ayaa sheegaysa inay taasi jirto. iPad-ka, isticmaal Safari ama Chrome. Kiiboodhku wuxuu caawiyaa apps-yada isticmaala amarro la qoro. Browserka iyo nidaamka ugu duqsan Waxaan kuwan ka akhrinnay koodka apps-yada 0.7, ma aha malo-malo: fayl kasta waa la falanqeeyay, astaamo kasta oo luqadda ah oo ay isticmaalaan waxaa laga eegay xogta isku-habaynta ee browserrada ee la daabacay. Nooca ka hooseeya kuwan, apps-yadu ma bilaabi karaan, sababtoo ah browserku koodka ma fahmo. Nooca ugu duqsan ee apps-yada bilaabi kara Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium 94 Firefox 93 Safari (Mac, iPad, iPhone) 16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS and iOS 16.4) CadCraft Studio waxa uu Windows-ka ku leeyahay engine web-kiisa, sidaas darteed wuxuu u baahan yahay Windows 10 ama 11; Mac-ka wuxuu isticmaalaa kan nidaamka, sidaas darteed wuxuu u baahan yahay macOS 13.3 ama ka cusub. Dejinta › Cusboonaysiinta ee Studio waxa ay muujinaysaa nidaamka nuqulkaagu ku shaqeeyo. Tanu waa nooca ugu duqsan ee bilaabmo, laga akhriyay koodka. Ma aha liis browserro duq ah oo aan apps-yada ku shaqeynay, sidaas darteed browser duq ah oo bilaabmi kara ayaa laga yaabaa inuu weli maqan yahay astaamo. Waxa kombiyuutarkaagu u baahan yahay Kuwani waa qadarka ugu yar ee la qorsheeyay apps-yada, ma aha shuruudo la cabbiray: 8 GB oo xusuus ah (16 GB ayaa lagu talinayaa moodallada isku-dhafan ee waaweyn). Chip garaafyada oo leh WebGL 2 apps-yada 3D-ga. Haddii muuqaalka 3D-ga madhan yahay, hubi in hardware acceleration uu shaqeynayo dejinta browserkaaga. Shaashad ugu yaraan 1280 pixel ballaadhka leh si qalabyada oo dhan u buuxaan; shaashadaha yar safaf badan ayay u qaybiyaan. Faylal aad u waaweyn (qorshe-tiro waaweyn, moodallo waaweyn) xusuus badan ayey ku isticmaalaan tab-ka browserka. Haddii app-ku gaabiyo, xir tab-yada kale ee culus.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"keys","scope":"basics","title":"Furayaasha, mouse-yada iyo trackpad-yada","summary":"Sida gaadhka furayaasha loo qoro, furayaasha function ee Mac-ka, riix midig iyo panning la'aan mouse.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["kiiboodh","gaadh","shortcut","ctrl","command","cmd","option","fn","furayaasha function","trackpad","riix midig","badhanka dhexe","magic mouse"],"headings":[{"id":"sida-gaadhka-furayaasha-loo-qoro","text":"Sida gaadhka furayaasha loo qoro","level":2},{"id":"furayaasha-function-ee-mac-ka","text":"Furayaasha function ee Mac-ka","level":2},{"id":"gaadhka-browserku-hayo","text":"Gaadhka browserku hayo","level":2},{"id":"badhamada-mouse-ka-ee-trackpad-ka","text":"Badhamada mouse-ka ee trackpad-ka","level":2},{"id":"qorista-sanduuq-qoraal","text":"Qorista sanduuq qoraal","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-gaadhka-furayaasha-loo-qoro\"\u003ESida gaadhka furayaasha loo qoro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECaawintu gaadh kasta waxa ay u qorta siyaabta kiiboodhkaagu u calaamadeeyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQoran\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMac-ka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWindows iyo Linux\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECommand (⌘) iyo S\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl iyo S\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EControl (⌃), Shift (⇧) iyo F\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl, Shift iyo F\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ←\"\u003E⌥←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOption (⌥) iyo ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlt iyo ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuraha Delete\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBackspace\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efn iyo Delete (tirtirka hore)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDelete\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReturn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEnter\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadda plus waxa ay ka dhigan tahay in furayaasha si wada jir ah loo hayo. &quot;Kadib&quot; waxa ay ka dhigan tahay in mid mid ka dib la riixo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGaadhka apps-yada badankiisa Mac-ka waxa ay aqbalaan Command ama Control, sidaas darteed \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E labada siyaabood ayuu shaqeeyaa. Yar oo ka mid ah, sida shaashadda buuxda (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), furaha Control ayey kombiyuutar kasta isticmaalaan; caawintu waxa ay sheegtaa meesha ay khuseyso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furayaasha-function-ee-mac-ka\"\u003EFurayaasha function ee Mac-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiiboodhka Mac-ka badankiisa safka sare wuxuu beddelaa iftiinka, codka iyo warbaahinta. Si aad F1 ilaa F12 u dirto:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ehay \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (ama furaha globe-ka) intaad furaha riixayso, ama\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Efur \u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EKeyboard\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EKeyboard Shortcuts\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EFunction Keys\u003C/strong\u003E, oo shid &quot;Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah furayaasha F-ka macOS-ku lafteeda ayuu leeyahay (tusaale ahaan Mission Control). Haddii furaha app-ka aan wax samaynin, ku isku day fn, ama isticmaal badhanka qalabka halkii.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gaadhka-browserku-hayo\"\u003EGaadhka browserku hayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBog web ah ma qaadi karo qaar ka mid ah gaadhka browserka, wax kasta oo ay samaysa. App kasta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command N\"\u003E⌘N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command T\"\u003E⌘T\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command W\"\u003E⌘W\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+W\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E had iyo jeer daaqadaha iyo tab-yada browserka ayey furaan ama xiraan. Apps-yadu waxay isticmaalaan badhamo ah Cusub iyo Xir halkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Q\"\u003E⌘Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E Mac-ka iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option F4\"\u003E⌥ F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E Windows-ka browserka way xiraan. Haddii aad shaqo aan la kaydin haysato, browserku marka hore wuu weydiin doonaa (&quot;Leave site?&quot;); dooro inaad joogto, kadibna kaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShaashadda buuxda ee browserka (\u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EControl-Command-F, ama badhanka cagaaran ee daaqadda\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\" title=\"Windows or Linux\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E) weli way shaqeysaa. Apps-yadu waxay leeyihiin qaabab shaashad oo gaar ah oo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku, kuwaas oo sidoo kale barrada app-ka qarin kara.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"badhamada-mouse-ka-ee-trackpad-ka\"\u003EBadhamada mouse-ka ee trackpad-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EApps-yadu waxay isticmaalaan badhanka midig iyo badhanka dhexe. Haddii aadan mouse saddex-badhan ah lahayn:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERiix midig:\u003C/strong\u003E guji labo farood. Shid &quot;Secondary click&quot; \u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings\u003C/strong\u003E gudaha, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003ETrackpad\u003C/strong\u003E, haddii guji labo farood aan waxba samaynin. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E la hayo markaad gujinayso waxay furaysaa menu-ga browserka, laakiin naqshadda gudaheeda qaar ka mid ah apps-yada waxay u akhriyaan guji caadi ah (Control la hayo), sidaas darteed guji labo farood ayaa ka wanaagsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiidida badhanka dhexe (pan):\u003C/strong\u003E app kasta wuxuu bixiyaa siyaabo kale oo loo dhaqaajiyo, sida \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E la hayo intaad jiidayso ama jiidida badhanka midig. Bogga kiiboodhka app-ka ayaa sheegaya kan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWeynaynta wheel-ka:\u003C/strong\u003E kor-u-dhaaf labo farood oo trackpad-ka ku sawiran badankiisa apps-yada ayey weynaysaa. Labo farood oo isku soo dhowaynaya ayaa sidoo kale weynayn meesha app-ku taageero.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows or Linux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERiix midig:\u003C/strong\u003E guji labo farood, ama guji geeska hoose ee midig ee touchpad-ka. Tani waxay ku xiran tahay dejinta touchpad-kaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiidida badhanka dhexe (pan):\u003C/strong\u003E app kasta wuxuu bixiyaa siyaabo kale oo loo dhaqaajiyo, sida \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E la hayo intaad jiidayso ama jiidida badhanka midig. Bogga kiiboodhka app-ka ayaa sheegaya kan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWeynaynta wheel-ka:\u003C/strong\u003E kor-u-dhaaf labo farood oo touchpad-ka ku sawiran badankiisa apps-yada ayey weynaysaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qorista-sanduuq-qoraal\"\u003EQorista sanduuq qoraal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIntaad sanduuq ku qorayso (magac, faallo, baadhis), gaadhka app-ka ee xarfo keliya ahi way damaan, sidaas darteed qorista &quot;L&quot; waxay qortaa L. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama guji naqshadda si aad furayaasha app-ka dib ugu celiso.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Sida gaadhka furayaasha loo qoro Caawintu gaadh kasta waxa ay u qorta siyaabta kiiboodhkaagu u calaamadeeyo. Qoran Mac-ka Windows iyo Linux Ctrl+S Command (⌘) iyo S Ctrl iyo S Ctrl+Shift+F Control (⌃), Shift (⇧) iyo F Ctrl, Shift iyo F Alt+← Option (⌥) iyo ← Alt iyo ← Backspace furaha Delete Backspace Delete fn iyo Delete (tirtirka hore) Delete Enter Return Enter Calaamadda plus waxa ay ka dhigan tahay in furayaasha si wada jir ah loo hayo. \"Kadib\" waxa ay ka dhigan tahay in mid mid ka dib la riixo. Gaadhka apps-yada badankiisa Mac-ka waxa ay aqbalaan Command ama Control, sidaas darteed Ctrl+Z labada siyaabood ayuu shaqeeyaa. Yar oo ka mid ah, sida shaashadda buuxda (Ctrl+Shift+F), furaha Control ayey kombiyuutar kasta isticmaalaan; caawintu waxa ay sheegtaa meesha ay khuseyso. Furayaasha function ee Mac-ka Kiiboodhka Mac-ka badankiisa safka sare wuxuu beddelaa iftiinka, codka iyo warbaahinta. Si aad F1 ilaa F12 u dirto: hay fn (ama furaha globe-ka) intaad furaha riixayso, ama fur System Settings, kadibna Keyboard, kadibna Keyboard Shortcuts, kadibna Function Keys, oo shid \"Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys\". Qaar ka mid ah furayaasha F-ka macOS-ku lafteeda ayuu leeyahay (tusaale ahaan Mission Control). Haddii furaha app-ka aan wax samaynin, ku isku day fn, ama isticmaal badhanka qalabka halkii. Gaadhka browserku hayo Bog web ah ma qaadi karo qaar ka mid ah gaadhka browserka, wax kasta oo ay samaysa. App kasta: Ctrl+N, Ctrl+T iyo Ctrl+W had iyo jeer daaqadaha iyo tab-yada browserka ayey furaan ama xiraan. Apps-yadu waxay isticmaalaan badhamo ah Cusub iyo Xir halkaas. Ctrl+Q Mac-ka iyo Alt+F4 Windows-ka browserka way xiraan. Haddii aad shaqo aan la kaydin haysato, browserku marka hore wuu weydiin doonaa (\"Leave site?\"); dooro inaad joogto, kadibna kaydi. Shaashadda buuxda ee browserka (Control-Command-F, ama badhanka cagaaran ee daaqadda / F11) weli way shaqeysaa. Apps-yadu waxay leeyihiin qaabab shaashad oo gaar ah oo Ctrl+Shift+F ku, kuwaas oo sidoo kale barrada app-ka qarin kara. Badhamada mouse-ka ee trackpad-ka Apps-yadu waxay isticmaalaan badhanka midig iyo badhanka dhexe. Haddii aadan mouse saddex-badhan ah lahayn: Riix midig: guji labo farood. Shid \"Secondary click\" System Settings gudaha, kadibna Trackpad, haddii guji labo farood aan waxba samaynin. Ctrl la hayo markaad gujinayso waxay furaysaa menu-ga browserka, laakiin naqshadda gudaheeda qaar ka mid ah apps-yada waxay u akhriyaan guji caadi ah (Control la hayo), sidaas darteed guji labo farood ayaa ka wanaagsan. Jiidida badhanka dhexe (pan): app kasta wuxuu bixiyaa siyaabo kale oo loo dhaqaajiyo, sida Space la hayo intaad jiidayso ama jiidida badhanka midig. Bogga kiiboodhka app-ka ayaa sheegaya kan. Weynaynta wheel-ka: kor-u-dhaaf labo farood oo trackpad-ka ku sawiran badankiisa apps-yada ayey weynaysaa. Labo farood oo isku soo dhowaynaya ayaa sidoo kale weynayn meesha app-ku taageero. Riix midig: guji labo farood, ama guji geeska hoose ee midig ee touchpad-ka. Tani waxay ku xiran tahay dejinta touchpad-kaaga. Jiidida badhanka dhexe (pan): app kasta wuxuu bixiyaa siyaabo kale oo loo dhaqaajiyo, sida Space la hayo intaad jiidayso ama jiidida badhanka midig. Bogga kiiboodhka app-ka ayaa sheegaya kan. Weynaynta wheel-ka: kor-u-dhaaf labo farood oo touchpad-ka ku sawiran badankiisa apps-yada ayey weynaysaa. Qorista sanduuq qoraal Intaad sanduuq ku qorayso (magac, faallo, baadhis), gaadhka app-ka ee xarfo keliya ahi way damaan, sidaas darteed qorista \"L\" waxay qortaa L. Riix Esc ama guji naqshadda si aad furayaasha app-ka dib ugu celiso.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"find-tools","scope":"basics","title":"Hel qalab ama dejin","summary":"Riix Ctrl+K oo qor xarfo yar si aad u wada fuliso qalab kasta, u beddesho dejin ama furto mawduuc caawin.","section":"start","order":32,"keywords":["raadi","baadh","palet amarka","furid degdeg","fuli amar","qalab","dejin","gaadh","ctrl k","cmd k"],"headings":[{"id":"raadi-oo-fuli","text":"Raadi oo fuli","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-ogaataa","text":"Waxa aad ogaataa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EApp kasta wuxuu leeyahay sanduuq baadhis oo qalabkiisa, dejimihiisa iyo caawintan ku jira. Ma u baahnid inaad ogaato qalabku meeshuu ku yaal qalabka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"raadi-oo-fuli\"\u003ERaadi oo fuli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaadi\u003C/span\u003E barka sare ku jirta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor xarfo yar oo waxa aad rabtid: &quot;fillet&quot;, &quot;panel text&quot;, &quot;units&quot;. Erey kasta oo aad qorto waa inuu iswaafaqo, sidaas darteed erey labaad ku dar si liiska u yaraysid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u fuliso natiijada ugu horreysa, ama marka hore furayaasha fallaadhka u dhaqaaji. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa sanduuqa xidha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sida haddii aad qalabka ku guntay qalabka. Dejin wuxuu furaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E oo dejintaas ku jirta. Mawduuc caawin wuxuu halkan ku furmaa, panelka caawinta gudihiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-ogaataa\"\u003EWaxa aad ogaataa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxa aad ugu dambeyn isticmaashay ayaa mar xiga horta ku jiri doona, sidaas darteed qalab aad inta badan isticmaasho hal riix oo furaha ah ayuu kaa dhow yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalabyada aan hadda shaqayn karin, tusaale ahaan ka hor inta fayl la furin, waa la liistaa laakiin waa la madoobeeyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalabyada add-on-ka ayaa sidoo kale liiska ku jira, marka add-on-ka la shido.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"App kasta wuxuu leeyahay sanduuq baadhis oo qalabkiisa, dejimihiisa iyo caawintan ku jira. Ma u baahnid inaad ogaato qalabku meeshuu ku yaal qalabka. Raadi oo fuli Riix Ctrl+K, ama dooro Raadi barka sare ku jirta. Qor xarfo yar oo waxa aad rabtid: \"fillet\", \"panel text\", \"units\". Erey kasta oo aad qorto waa inuu iswaafaqo, sidaas darteed erey labaad ku dar si liiska u yaraysid. Riix Enter si aad u fuliso natiijada ugu horreysa, ama marka hore furayaasha fallaadhka u dhaqaaji. Esc ayaa sanduuqa xidha. Qalab wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sida haddii aad qalabka ku guntay qalabka. Dejin wuxuu furaa Dejinta oo dejintaas ku jirta. Mawduuc caawin wuxuu halkan ku furmaa, panelka caawinta gudihiisa. Waxa aad ogaataa Waxa aad ugu dambeyn isticmaashay ayaa mar xiga horta ku jiri doona, sidaas darteed qalab aad inta badan isticmaasho hal riix oo furaha ah ayuu kaa dhow yahay. Qalabyada aan hadda shaqayn karin, tusaale ahaan ka hor inta fayl la furin, waa la liistaa laakiin waa la madoobeeyay. Qalabyada add-on-ka ayaa sidoo kale liiska ku jira, marka add-on-ka la shido.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"arrange-panels","scope":"basics","title":"Habee panelada oo isticmaal shaashad labaad","summary":"Ku xidh panelada dhinaca bidix, midig ama hoosta, isku rari, u kooxee sida tab-yo, ku hay ama qari, ku dhaaf naqshadda, ka dhig qaabeynta mid dhow, dooro inta safka qalabku isticmaalo, ama u wareeji daaqad gaar ah shaashad kale.","section":"start","order":35,"keywords":["panelada","ku xidh","ku dhaaf","wareeji panel","jiid","qaabeynta","tab-yada","kooxda tab-ka","isku rari","ku hay","auto-hide","qari panel","xir panel","kooban","cabbirka qaabeynta","dhow","safafka qalabka","lafmeyso","1 safka","2 safka","khadka qalabka","shaashad labaad","laba shaashad","shaashado badan","daaqad","daaqad kor u soo booda","dib u deji qaabka"],"headings":[{"id":"dhaqaaji-panel-daaqadda-gudaheeda","text":"Dhaqaaji panel daaqadda gudaheeda","level":2},{"id":"u-kooxee-panelada-sida-tab-yo","text":"U kooxee panelada sida tab-yo","level":2},{"id":"pin-qari-oo-soo-celi","text":"Pin, qari oo soo celi","level":2},{"id":"ka-dhig-qaabeynta-mid-dhow","text":"Ka dhig qaabeynta mid dhow","level":2},{"id":"dooro-inta-safka-qalabku-isticmaalo","text":"Dooro inta safka qalabku isticmaalo","level":2},{"id":"isticmaal-kiiboodhka","text":"Isticmaal kiiboodhka","level":2},{"id":"dib-u-dhig-panelada-shaashad-labaad","text":"Dib u dhig panelada shaashad labaad","level":2},{"id":"hal-daaqad-oo-panelo-ka-badan","text":"Hal daaqad oo panelo ka badan","level":2},{"id":"isku-mid-qaab-kasta-oo-qaabeyn-ah","text":"Isku mid qaab kasta oo qaabeyn ah","level":2},{"id":"dhaqaaji-wada-hadal","text":"Dhaqaaji wada-hadal","level":2},{"id":"dib-u-dhig-panelada","text":"Dib u dhig panelada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPanelada ku yaal dhinaca naqshadda way dhaqaaqi karaan. Ku dhig meesha ku habboon, ama u sii daaqad u gaar ah shaashad labaad si naqshaddu u qaadato shaashadda koowaad oo dhan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanel kasta wuxuu leeyahay safka magacyada: xariiq khafiif ah oo leh magaca panelka, menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E, pin iyo badhanka xidhka ee sare ee panelka. Noocyada ka hor 0.7 waxay leeyihiin magaca iyo menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E oo keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhaqaaji-panel-daaqadda-gudaheeda\"\u003EDhaqaaji panel daaqadda gudaheeda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid panelka adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIntaad jiidayso, meelo jaranjaro ah ayaa soo muuqda dhinaca bidix, midig iyo hoosta naqshadda. Ku dhig panelka mid ka mid ah si uu halkaas ugu xirmo. Meeshii aad ku jirtid way madowtaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dhig meel kasta oo kale naqshadda dushiisa si uu u noqdo mid kor u kaca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelada wadaag hal dhinac: way isku rarmaan, xariiq kasta oo u dhexeeya laba panel ayaa la jiidi karaa si ay booska u wadaagaan (marka xariiqda uu xiran yahay, furayaasha fallaadhaha ayaa dhaqaajiya, laba jeer riixista ayaana booska si siman u wadaagta). Jiid geeska gudaha dhinac xidhan si aad uga dhigto mid ballac weyn ama mid yar; laba jeer riix geeska si aad u celiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanel kor u kaca wuxuu ku sii jiraa naqshadda dushiisa. Dhaqaaji adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa, cabbirka beddel adigoo jiidayo geeska hoose ee midigta (ama u gudub geeska adigoo isticmaalaya furaha Tab oo furayaasha fallaadhaha isticmaal). Laba jeer riix magiciisa si uu dib ugu xirmo meeshii uu ka ahaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu jiid hal farta adigoo ku qabanaya magaca panelka. Geeska hoose ee midigta ee panelka kor u kaca ku jiid hal farta si aad u beddesho cabbirka, iyo xuduudaha u dhexeeya panelada xidhan si isku mid ah. Si aad u kor u kacdo ama u xidho adigoon jiidin, isticmaal menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-kooxee-panelada-sida-tab-yo\"\u003EU kooxee panelada sida tab-yo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELaba panel waxay wadaagi karaan hal qaab oo mid mid ayay tusi karaan. Jiid panel adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa oo ku dhig safka magaca panel kale (safka waa jaranjaro intaad korkiisa taagan tahay), kadibna sii dayn: qaabku wuxuu hadda leeyahay tab kasta panel kasta, safka magaciisa. Riix tab si aad panelkaas u muujiso. Markaad tab-ka xulan tahay, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa beddela tab-yada, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay tagaan kii ugu horreeyay iyo kii ugu dambeeyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad panel uga saarto kooxda, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove out of the tab group\u003C/span\u003E menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E-ka, ama jiid meel kale. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETab with\u003C/span\u003E iyo magaca panel si aad u kooxeyso adigoon jiidin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pin-qari-oo-soo-celi\"\u003EPin, qari oo soo celi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPin-ka safka magaca panelka wuxuu ka dhigaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eauto-hide\u003C/strong\u003E: panelka wuu ka baxaa dhinacaas oo wuxuu noqdaa tab yar oo dhinaca ku yaal. Ku tilmaam tab-ka, xulo ama riix, panelka ayaa ku sii dhacaa naqshadda dushiisa; ka fogow (ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuu dib ugu soo laabanayaa. Mar kale riix pin-ka, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnpin\u003C/span\u003E, si aad u xidho si joogto ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBadhanka xidhka, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHide this panel\u003C/span\u003E menu-ga, ayaa qari panelka oo xidha dhinaciisa. Tab dhinaca ku jira oo jaranjaro ah ayaa soo celinaya: riix, ama xulo oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-dhig-qaabeynta-mid-dhow\"\u003EKa dhig qaabeynta mid dhow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout density\u003C/span\u003E waxay leedahay laba doorasho. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EComfortable\u003C/span\u003E waa caadiga. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECompact\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kooban gareeyaa dhererka safafka, dhexdhexaadinta panelka, badhanada qalabka iyo qoraalka panelka ee barnaamijkaas si wax badan u dhacaan shaashadda. Waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta. Shaashad taabasho waxay haysaa badhamada weyn labadaba, taleefankuna qaabeynta gaarka ah. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E ma beddelo cabbirka sida aad dooratay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-inta-safka-qalabku-isticmaalo\"\u003EDooro inta safka qalabku isticmaalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar rows\u003C/span\u003E waxay leedahay saddex doorasho. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWrap\u003C/span\u003E waa caadiga: koox kasta oo qalab ayaa muuqda, sidii ay u qaadanayso safar badan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E2 rows\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qalabka ku haya laba safka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E1 row\u003C/span\u003E hal safka, si naqshaddu u heli dhererka; kooxaha aan mugga u filnayn ayaa dhinac u jeeda gudaha qalabka (isticmaal tuubbada mouse-ka, jiidista labada farood, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ilaa qalab). Qalab horay u mugga u ah laba safka wuxuu ku sii jiraa sidiisa hoos \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E2 rows\u003C/span\u003E, sababtoo ah shabakad kaliya way dheereyn lahayd. Doorashadu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta. Shaashad taabasho iyo taleefanku qaabeynta gaarka ah ayay haystaan. CadCraft waxay leedahay dejintiisa qalabkeeda, hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isticmaal-kiiboodhka\"\u003EIsticmaal kiiboodhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E ee panel kasta wuxuu furaa menu: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDock on the left\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDock on the right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDock at the bottom\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFloat over the drawing\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPin to the edge\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHide this panel\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETab with\u003C/span\u003E panel kale, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/span\u003E. Tab ilaa badhanka, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, u dhaqaaji furayaasha fallaadhaha, kadibna mar kale riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa xidha menu-ga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-dhig-panelada-shaashad-labaad\"\u003EDib u dhig panelada shaashad labaad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E panel, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove all panels to a new window\u003C/span\u003E. Waxaad sidoo kale dooran kartaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove panels to a new window\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E gudahiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaaqad yar ayaa furmaysa oo panelada ku jira. Jiid shaashadda kale ee aad leedahay oo ka dhig mid weyn sidii aad rabto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESii shaqada: panelada ayaa sida hore u shaqeeya naqshadda, naqshaddana waxay buuxinaysaa daaqadda koowaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFurayaasha wali way shaqeeyaan intaan daaqadda panelada hore u jirto: furayaasha aad halkaas riixdo, marka aan qoraal sanduuq ah lagu qorin, waxay u gudbaan naqshadda. Su&#039;aalaha iyo wada-hadallada barnaamijku weydiiyo waxay ku furmaan daaqadda koowaad, sidaas darteed halkaas ka eeg marka ay soo muuqdaan. Midabka iyo cabbirka qoraalka panelka way raacaan daaqadda koowaad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChrome iyo Edge waxay daaqadda ku dhigi karaan shaashadda kale adiga ayagu. Shaashad labaad oo xidhan, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut it on my other screen\u003C/span\u003E daaqadda panelada (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels on my other screen\u003C/span\u003E menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E panel). Browser-ka mar ayuu weydiiyaa in goobtan la oggolaado inay aragto shaashadahaaga; markaad oggolaatid, daaqadda panelada mar kasta shaashadaas ayay ku furmaysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox,safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox or Safari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDaaqadda panelada adigu ku jiid shaashadda kale. Xiligii xiga way isla meeshii iyo cabbirkii isla ahaa ku furmaysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hal-daaqad-oo-panelo-ka-badan\"\u003EHal daaqad oo panelo ka badan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanel kasta wuxuu leeyahay daaqad u gaar ah: ilaa afar daaqadood oo panelo ah, tusaale ahaan mid shaashad kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMenu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E ee panel, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa daaqad kale panelkaas, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to panels window 2\u003C/span\u003E (iyo kuwa kale) wuxuu u wareejiyaa mid furan. Daaqadda labaad waxa lagu magacaabaa &quot;panels 2&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid panel adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa daaqad ka tegi daaqad kale: ku sii dayn daaqadda koowaad si aad ugu xidho halkaas (jaranjarooyinku waa muuqdaan intaad korkiisa taagan tahay) ama si kor u kaco. Ku sii dayn daaqadda panelada kale si aad ugu wareejiso halkaas. Meel kasta oo kale ku sii dayn, wuu ku sii jiraa meeshii uu ka ahaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaaqadda panelada oo aan panel ku harin waxay isku xidhaa iyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad dib u soo rartid, barnaamijku wuxuu dib kuu soo bandhigaa daaqadaha panelada. Browser-ku daaqad kaliya mar kasta riix, sidaas darteed dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen the next one\u003C/span\u003E mar kasta daaqad kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-mid-qaab-kasta-oo-qaabeyn-ah\"\u003EIsku mid qaab kasta oo qaabeyn ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta amarrada, sanduuqa qalabka, safafka qalabka iyo safka xaaladda ayaa daaqad gaar ah u dhaqaaqa si isku mid ah sida panel: fur menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E qaybtaas oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/span\u003E (ama xidhida daaqadda) ayaa soo celinaya. Furayaasha aad daaqadaas ku riixdo waxay gaaraan barnaamijka, sida ay ka gaaraan daaqadda panelada. Qayb kasta wuxuu leeyaa hal menu oo sidaas ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhaqaaji-wada-hadal\"\u003EDhaqaaji wada-hadal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWada-hadal kasta waa la dhaqaajin karaa si uu u baxo naqshadda dariiqeeda: riix oo jiid magaca sare. Wada-hadalku wuxuu xasuustaa meesha aad ka tagtay, wada-hadal kasta gaar ahaan, oo markii dambe ee la furo isla meeshaas ayuu ku soo laabanayaa. Laba jeer riix magaca sare si aad dib ugu dhexdhexaadiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiiboodhka, adigoo wada-hadalka gudihiisa ku jira riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+furaha fallaadha si aad u dhaqaajiso 16 pixel mar kasta; ku dar \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad 64 u dhaqaajiso. Wada-hadal dhacaya shaashadda ka baxsan (kadib daaqad ama shaashad yar) ayaa dib loo soo celiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaleefan kasta, wada-hadalku waa xaashi buuxda oo aan la dhaqaajin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu dhex jira CadCraft Studio, wada-hadalka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlot to PDF\u003C/span\u003E ee CadCraft, kaas oo aad furan u hayn kartid intaad shaqaynayso, wuxuu badhan ku leeyahay magaca sare, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen in its own window\u003C/span\u003E. Wada-hadalku wuxuu galaa daaqad gaar ah oo aad shaashad kale ku dhigi karto. Wada-hadalka xidhida daaqadda ayaa xidha, daaqadda xidhidana wada-hadalka ayaa xidha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-dhig-panelada\"\u003EDib u dhig panelada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels back\u003C/span\u003E daaqadda panelada, ama si fudud xidh. Panelada waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXidhida ama dib-u-rartida daaqadda koowaad ayaa sidoo kale xidha daaqadda panelada. Marka barnaamijku mar kale furmo wuxuu sheegayaa in paneladaadu daaqad gaar ah ku jireen; dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen it\u003C/span\u003E si aad daaqadda dib ugu soo celiso, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep them here\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu panel kasta ku celinayaa meeshii ay ka bilaabeen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii waxba aanu furmin markaad panelada u wareejinayso daaqad cusub, browser-ku wuu xannibay pop-up-ka. Barnaamijku taas ayuu sheegayaa oo panelada meeshii ay ku jireen ayuu ku hayaa. Oggolow pop-up-yada getcadcraft.com, kadibna isku day mar kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabeyntu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta browser-kan, oo wayn dejintaada kale.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Panelada ku yaal dhinaca naqshadda way dhaqaaqi karaan. Ku dhig meesha ku habboon, ama u sii daaqad u gaar ah shaashad labaad si naqshaddu u qaadato shaashadda koowaad oo dhan. Panel kasta wuxuu leeyahay safka magacyada: xariiq khafiif ah oo leh magaca panelka, menu ⋯, pin iyo badhanka xidhka ee sare ee panelka. Noocyada ka hor 0.7 waxay leeyihiin magaca iyo menu ⋯ oo keliya. Dhaqaaji panel daaqadda gudaheeda Jiid panelka adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa sare. Intaad jiidayso, meelo jaranjaro ah ayaa soo muuqda dhinaca bidix, midig iyo hoosta naqshadda. Ku dhig panelka mid ka mid ah si uu halkaas ugu xirmo. Meeshii aad ku jirtid way madowtaa. Ku dhig meel kasta oo kale naqshadda dushiisa si uu u noqdo mid kor u kaca. Panelada wadaag hal dhinac: way isku rarmaan, xariiq kasta oo u dhexeeya laba panel ayaa la jiidi karaa si ay booska u wadaagaan (marka xariiqda uu xiran yahay, furayaasha fallaadhaha ayaa dhaqaajiya, laba jeer riixista ayaana booska si siman u wadaagta). Jiid geeska gudaha dhinac xidhan si aad uga dhigto mid ballac weyn ama mid yar; laba jeer riix geeska si aad u celiso. Panel kor u kaca wuxuu ku sii jiraa naqshadda dushiisa. Dhaqaaji adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa, cabbirka beddel adigoo jiidayo geeska hoose ee midigta (ama u gudub geeska adigoo isticmaalaya furaha Tab oo furayaasha fallaadhaha isticmaal). Laba jeer riix magiciisa si uu dib ugu xirmo meeshii uu ka ahaa. Ku jiid hal farta adigoo ku qabanaya magaca panelka. Geeska hoose ee midigta ee panelka kor u kaca ku jiid hal farta si aad u beddesho cabbirka, iyo xuduudaha u dhexeeya panelada xidhan si isku mid ah. Si aad u kor u kacdo ama u xidho adigoon jiidin, isticmaal menu ⋯. U kooxee panelada sida tab-yo Laba panel waxay wadaagi karaan hal qaab oo mid mid ayay tusi karaan. Jiid panel adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa oo ku dhig safka magaca panel kale (safka waa jaranjaro intaad korkiisa taagan tahay), kadibna sii dayn: qaabku wuxuu hadda leeyahay tab kasta panel kasta, safka magaciisa. Riix tab si aad panelkaas u muujiso. Markaad tab-ka xulan tahay, ← iyo → ayaa beddela tab-yada, Home iyo End waxay tagaan kii ugu horreeyay iyo kii ugu dambeeyay. Si aad panel uga saarto kooxda, dooro Move out of the tab group menu ⋯-ka, ama jiid meel kale. Dooro Tab with iyo magaca panel si aad u kooxeyso adigoon jiidin. Pin, qari oo soo celi Pin-ka safka magaca panelka wuxuu ka dhigaa auto-hide: panelka wuu ka baxaa dhinacaas oo wuxuu noqdaa tab yar oo dhinaca ku yaal. Ku tilmaam tab-ka, xulo ama riix, panelka ayaa ku sii dhacaa naqshadda dushiisa; ka fogow (ama riix Esc) wuu dib ugu soo laabanayaa. Mar kale riix pin-ka, ama dooro Unpin, si aad u xidho si joogto ah. Badhanka xidhka, ama Hide this panel menu-ga, ayaa qari panelka oo xidha dhinaciisa. Tab dhinaca ku jira oo jaranjaro ah ayaa soo celinaya: riix, ama xulo oo riix Enter. Ka dhig qaabeynta mid dhow Settings › General › Layout density waxay leedahay laba doorasho. Comfortable waa caadiga. Compact wuxuu kooban gareeyaa dhererka safafka, dhexdhexaadinta panelka, badhanada qalabka iyo qoraalka panelka ee barnaamijkaas si wax badan u dhacaan shaashadda. Waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta. Shaashad taabasho waxay haysaa badhamada weyn labadaba, taleefankuna qaabeynta gaarka ah. Reset layout ma beddelo cabbirka sida aad dooratay. Dooro inta safka qalabku isticmaalo Settings › General › Toolbar rows waxay leedahay saddex doorasho. Wrap waa caadiga: koox kasta oo qalab ayaa muuqda, sidii ay u qaadanayso safar badan. 2 rows wuxuu qalabka ku haya laba safka, 1 row hal safka, si naqshaddu u heli dhererka; kooxaha aan mugga u filnayn ayaa dhinac u jeeda gudaha qalabka (isticmaal tuubbada mouse-ka, jiidista labada farood, ama Tab ilaa qalab). Qalab horay u mugga u ah laba safka wuxuu ku sii jiraa sidiisa hoos 2 rows, sababtoo ah shabakad kaliya way dheereyn lahayd. Doorashadu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta. Shaashad taabasho iyo taleefanku qaabeynta gaarka ah ayay haystaan. CadCraft waxay leedahay dejintiisa qalabkeeda, hoosta Settings › CadCraft. Isticmaal kiiboodhka Badhanka ⋯ ee panel kasta wuxuu furaa menu: Dock on the left, Dock on the right, Dock at the bottom, Float over the drawing, Pin to the edge, Hide this panel, Tab with panel kale, Move to a new window iyo Put it back. Tab ilaa badhanka, riix Enter, u dhaqaaji furayaasha fallaadhaha, kadibna mar kale riix Enter. Esc ayaa xidha menu-ga. Dib u dhig panelada shaashad labaad Dooro ⋯ panel, kadibna Move all panels to a new window. Waxaad sidoo kale dooran kartaa Move panels to a new window Settings gudahiisa. Daaqad yar ayaa furmaysa oo panelada ku jira. Jiid shaashadda kale ee aad leedahay oo ka dhig mid weyn sidii aad rabto. Sii shaqada: panelada ayaa sida hore u shaqeeya naqshadda, naqshaddana waxay buuxinaysaa daaqadda koowaad. Furayaasha wali way shaqeeyaan intaan daaqadda panelada hore u jirto: furayaasha aad halkaas riixdo, marka aan qoraal sanduuq ah lagu qorin, waxay u gudbaan naqshadda. Su'aalaha iyo wada-hadallada barnaamijku weydiiyo waxay ku furmaan daaqadda koowaad, sidaas darteed halkaas ka eeg marka ay soo muuqdaan. Midabka iyo cabbirka qoraalka panelka way raacaan daaqadda koowaad. Chrome iyo Edge waxay daaqadda ku dhigi karaan shaashadda kale adiga ayagu. Shaashad labaad oo xidhan, dooro Put it on my other screen daaqadda panelada (ama Put the panels on my other screen menu ⋯ panel). Browser-ka mar ayuu weydiiyaa in goobtan la oggolaado inay aragto shaashadahaaga; markaad oggolaatid, daaqadda panelada mar kasta shaashadaas ayay ku furmaysaa. Daaqadda panelada adigu ku jiid shaashadda kale. Xiligii xiga way isla meeshii iyo cabbirkii isla ahaa ku furmaysaa. Hal daaqad oo panelo ka badan Panel kasta wuxuu leeyahay daaqad u gaar ah: ilaa afar daaqadood oo panelo ah, tusaale ahaan mid shaashad kasta. Menu ⋯ ee panel, Move to a new window wuxuu furaa daaqad kale panelkaas, Move to panels window 2 (iyo kuwa kale) wuxuu u wareejiyaa mid furan. Daaqadda labaad waxa lagu magacaabaa \"panels 2\". Jiid panel adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa daaqad ka tegi daaqad kale: ku sii dayn daaqadda koowaad si aad ugu xidho halkaas (jaranjarooyinku waa muuqdaan intaad korkiisa taagan tahay) ama si kor u kaco. Ku sii dayn daaqadda panelada kale si aad ugu wareejiso halkaas. Meel kasta oo kale ku sii dayn, wuu ku sii jiraa meeshii uu ka ahaa. Daaqadda panelada oo aan panel ku harin waxay isku xidhaa iyada. Markaad dib u soo rartid, barnaamijku wuxuu dib kuu soo bandhigaa daaqadaha panelada. Browser-ku daaqad kaliya mar kasta riix, sidaas darteed dooro Open the next one mar kasta daaqad kasta. Isku mid qaab kasta oo qaabeyn ah Qaybta amarrada, sanduuqa qalabka, safafka qalabka iyo safka xaaladda ayaa daaqad gaar ah u dhaqaaqa si isku mid ah sida panel: fur menu ⋯ qaybtaas oo dooro Move to a new window; Put it back (ama xidhida daaqadda) ayaa soo celinaya. Furayaasha aad daaqadaas ku riixdo waxay gaaraan barnaamijka, sida ay ka gaaraan daaqadda panelada. Qayb kasta wuxuu leeyaa hal menu oo sidaas ah. Dhaqaaji wada-hadal Wada-hadal kasta waa la dhaqaajin karaa si uu u baxo naqshadda dariiqeeda: riix oo jiid magaca sare. Wada-hadalku wuxuu xasuustaa meesha aad ka tagtay, wada-hadal kasta gaar ahaan, oo markii dambe ee la furo isla meeshaas ayuu ku soo laabanayaa. Laba jeer riix magaca sare si aad dib ugu dhexdhexaadiso. Kiiboodhka, adigoo wada-hadalka gudihiisa ku jira riix Alt+Shift+furaha fallaadha si aad u dhaqaajiso 16 pixel mar kasta; ku dar Ctrl si aad 64 u dhaqaajiso. Wada-hadal dhacaya shaashadda ka baxsan (kadib daaqad ama shaashad yar) ayaa dib loo soo celiyaa. Taleefan kasta, wada-hadalku waa xaashi buuxda oo aan la dhaqaajin. Ku dhex jira CadCraft Studio, wada-hadalka Plot to PDF ee CadCraft, kaas oo aad furan u hayn kartid intaad shaqaynayso, wuxuu badhan ku leeyahay magaca sare, Open in its own window. Wada-hadalku wuxuu galaa daaqad gaar ah oo aad shaashad kale ku dhigi karto. Wada-hadalka xidhida daaqadda ayaa xidha, daaqadda xidhidana wada-hadalka ayaa xidha. Dib u dhig panelada Dooro Put the panels back daaqadda panelada, ama si fudud xidh. Panelada waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen. Xidhida ama dib-u-rartida daaqadda koowaad ayaa sidoo kale xidha daaqadda panelada. Marka barnaamijku mar kale furmo wuxuu sheegayaa in paneladaadu daaqad gaar ah ku jireen; dooro Open it si aad daaqadda dib ugu soo celiso, ama Keep them here. Settings › General › Reset layout wuxuu panel kasta ku celinayaa meeshii ay ka bilaabeen. Haddii waxba aanu furmin markaad panelada u wareejinayso daaqad cusub, browser-ku wuu xannibay pop-up-ka. Barnaamijku taas ayuu sheegayaa oo panelada meeshii ay ku jireen ayuu ku hayaa. Oggolow pop-up-yada getcadcraft.com, kadibna isku day mar kale. Qaabeyntu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta browser-kan, oo wayn dejintaada kale.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"dock-tool-groups","scope":"basics","title":"Dock a group of tools beside the drawing, and bring your windows back","summary":"Turn a ribbon group, a tool-row group or a toolbox group into a palette in a side panel or a column of the drawing, with tabs and collapse, and put it back; every bar has the same grip and close; the windows you tore off come back in one click.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["dock","palette","ribbon group","tool group","toolbox group","tool rows","side panel","tabs","collapse","grip","handle","drag","close","open in a window","restore my windows","second monitor","two screens","remembered windows"],"headings":[{"id":"the-grip-and-the-close-button","text":"The grip and the close button","level":2},{"id":"dock-a-group-as-a-palette","text":"Dock a group as a palette","level":2},{"id":"put-it-back","text":"Put it back","level":2},{"id":"arrange-mode","text":"Arrange mode","level":2},{"id":"your-windows-next-time","text":"Your windows, next time","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E&lt;!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --&gt; &lt;!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner&#039;s switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=&quot;1&quot;]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php &lt;app&gt; for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10&#039;s. --&gt;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-grip-and-the-close-button\"\u003EThe grip and the close button\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEvery bar that can move has the same head: a grip \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⠿\u003C/span\u003E at the far left and a close button \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen in a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the bar&#039;s own choices (such as \u003Cstrong\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/strong\u003E) and \u003Cstrong\u003EHide\u003C/strong\u003E. You can also right-click the head.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dock-a-group-as-a-palette\"\u003EDock a group as a palette\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrag the group&#039;s grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing&#039;s left and right columns.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group&#039;s name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOr click the grip and pick \u003Cstrong\u003EDock to\u003C/strong\u003E and a place.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETwo groups in the same place become tabs. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E button folds the palette to its head and opens it again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"put-it-back\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClick the palette&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E, pick \u003Cstrong\u003EPut it back\u003C/strong\u003E in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arrange-mode\"\u003EArrange mode\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-windows-next-time\"\u003EYour windows, next time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E again. \u003Cstrong\u003EKeep them here\u003C/strong\u003E forgets them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"\u003C!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --\u003E \u003C!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner's switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=\"1\"]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php \u003Capp\u003E for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10's. --\u003E In a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools. The grip and the close button Every bar that can move has the same head: a grip ⠿ at the far left and a close button × at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: Open in a window, the bar's own choices (such as Collapse the ribbon) and Hide. You can also right-click the head. Each group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name. Dock a group as a palette Drag the group's grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing's left and right columns. Drop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group's name. Or click the grip and pick Dock to and a place. Two groups in the same place become tabs. The ⌃ button folds the palette to its head and opens it again. Put it back Click the palette's ×, pick Put it back in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox. Where you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout. Arrange mode While you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined. Your windows, next time A bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers Restore my windows: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click Restore my windows again. Keep them here forgets them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-ribbon","scope":"basics","title":"Ka shaqee qaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca","summary":"Beddel barnaamijka ribbon tab-yo ah oo naqshadda dushiisa ku jira, oo leh Properties iyo baadhe mashruuc dhinaca bidix iyo tab kasta muuqaal furan, oo mar kasta ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["qaabeyn","meel shaqo","ribbon","tab-yada ribbon","baadhaha mashruuca","baadhe","palet-yada","palet properties","tab-yada muuqaalka","safka xaaladda","degdeg fur","xidh ribbon","qaabka caadiga ah","beddel qaabeyn","beddel","dhigan"],"headings":[{"id":"dooro","text":"Dooro","level":2},{"id":"waxa-meel-kasta-ku-yaal","text":"Waxa meel kasta ku yaal","level":2},{"id":"ka-isticmaal-ribbon-ka-kiiboodhka","text":"Ka isticmaal ribbon-ka kiiboodhka","level":2},{"id":"ribbon-ka-qabo-ama-daaqad-u-gaar-ah-sii","text":"Ribbon-ka qabo ama daaqad u gaar ah sii","level":2},{"id":"panelada-aad-leedahay-way-sii-haysaan","text":"Panelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan","level":2},{"id":"ku-noqo-qaabeynta-caadiga-ah","text":"Ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca\u003C/strong\u003E waa mid ka mid ah saddexda qaabeyn ee meel shaqo ee barnaamijka. Ribbon tab-yo ah ayaa u dhex maraya sare, Properties iyo baadhaha mashruuca ayaa wadaagaan panelka bidix, muuqaal kasta oo aad furto wuxuu helaa tab naqshadda dushiisa, safka xaaladdana wuxuu ku sugan yahay hoose. Qalabka waa kuwa barnaamijka laftiisa: wax kasta oo aad ku samayn karto qaabeynta caadiga ah halkaan ayay ku shaqeeyaan, naqshaddaadu, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha aad ayay sidaas ku sii jiraan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro\"\u003EDooro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (gear-ka, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna gali \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERibbon and project browser\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabeynta waa isla markiiba beddelmaysa. Doorashadu waa mid barnaamij kasta browser-kan: barnaamij kasta wuxuu ka furmaa marka xiga, waxayna ku jirtaa ka hor inta bogga aan la sawirin, sidaas darteed qaabeynta caadiga ah ma aragto mar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-meel-kasta-ku-yaal\"\u003EWaxa meel kasta ku yaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafka magaca:\u003C/strong\u003E magaca barnaamijka, badhamada degdega ah ee furidda, kaydinta, dib-u-noqoshada iyo dib-u-samaynta, magaca faylka furan, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat each tool does here\u003C/span\u003E (liis dhammaan qalabka oo leh sanduuq raadin, oo sheegaysa kuwa hadda diyaar u ah iyo sababta kuwa kale aan u diyaarin), shaashad buuxda, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E. Qaabeyntan, safka magaca wuxuu meesha ka qaadaa safka barnaamijka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon:\u003C/strong\u003E qalabka barnaamijka tab-yada, tab kasta kooxo ku jira. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E bidixda ayaa furaysa, kaydinaysa iyo waxa kale. Barnaamijyada qaarkood tab gaar ah ayay ku daraan markaad ku shaqeyso habka ama meel shaqo gaar ah; wuu iftiimaa intuu khusaysan yahay, kadibna wuu baxaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafka xulashada:\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta ribbon-ka, waxa qalabka socda uu kaa rabo ama waxa la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPanelka bidix:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E sare, hoosteeda palet-yada (baadhaha mashruuca iyo waxa panelka u gaar ah) sida tab-yo. Jiid xariiqa u dhexeeya si aad booska u wadaagto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETab-yada muuqaalka:\u003C/strong\u003E hal tab muuqaal kasta oo aad furtay (xaashi, qorshe, muuqaal saddex-geesood...). Ku xidh badhanka xidhka; faylku wuu furan yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafka muuqaalka iyo safka xaaladda:\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta naqshadda, dejinta muuqaalka (cabbir, zoom); hoose, fariimaha barnaamijka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab aan hadda shaqayn karin ayaa lagu madoobeeyaa, qalabkeeda sharaxaad ayaa sababta sheegta (tusaale &quot;Marka hore fur fayl&quot;, ama in barnaamijku weli qalabkaas ma laha). Riix ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad sababta uga akhrido sanduuq.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-isticmaal-ribbon-ka-kiiboodhka\"\u003EKa isticmaal ribbon-ka kiiboodhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad tab ribbon-ka xulan tahay, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa u dhaqaaqa tab-yada, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay tagaan kii ugu horreeyay iyo kii ugu dambeeyay. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E marka hore wuxuu joojiyaa qalabka socda, sida qaabeynta caadiga ah, dhammaan gaabinta iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (hababka shaashadda) sidii hore ayay u shaqeeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ribbon-ka-qabo-ama-daaqad-u-gaar-ah-sii\"\u003ERibbon-ka qabo ama daaqad u gaar ah sii\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELaba jeer riix tab ribbon-ka si ribbon-ka u qabsado tab-yadiisa; riix tab wuxuu markaas tusaa qalabkiisa ilaa aad ka guurto. Mar kale laba jeer riix si aad u furan u hayso. Badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E ee dhinaca midig ee ribbon-ka wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep the ribbon open\u003C/span\u003E sidoo kale. Barnaamij kasta ayaa xasuusta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E ribbon-ka wuxuu geynayaa daaqad gaar ah, tusaale ahaan shaashad labaad. Furayaasha lagu riixo halkaas waxay gaaraan barnaamijka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the ribbon back\u003C/span\u003E, ama xidhida daaqadda, ayaa soo celinaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejinta qalabka waxay ku dhacaysaa ribbon-ka: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons and labels\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons only\u003C/span\u003E (ribbon-ka wuxuu markaas muujinayaa laba safood oo calaamado yaryar oo kooxda kasta ku jira) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabels only\u003C/span\u003E, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow group names (File, Draw, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panelada-aad-leedahay-way-sii-haysaan\"\u003EPanelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelada bidix iyo midig waxay haystaan wax kasta oo lagu sharaxay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHabee panelada\u003C/a\u003E: xirid, dhaqaaq, pin, qari, tab-yo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-noqo-qaabeynta-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKu noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft classic\u003C/span\u003E. Safaf kasta, tab kasta iyo panel kasta waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaleefan ama daaqad 760 pixel ama ka yar ballaadhka ah, barnaamijku wuxuu isticmaalaa qaabeynta taleefanka ima doorateen. Daaqad ballaaran ayaa qaabeyntaada soo celinaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad qaabeyn kale isku daydo, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Eqaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo macluumaadka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u beddesho waxa qaabeyntani muujinayso, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EBeddel qaabeynta shaashadda\u003C/a\u003E; habka madow, menu-bar iyo ribbon, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eqaabeynta Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca waa mid ka mid ah saddexda qaabeyn ee meel shaqo ee barnaamijka. Ribbon tab-yo ah ayaa u dhex maraya sare, Properties iyo baadhaha mashruuca ayaa wadaagaan panelka bidix, muuqaal kasta oo aad furto wuxuu helaa tab naqshadda dushiisa, safka xaaladdana wuxuu ku sugan yahay hoose. Qalabka waa kuwa barnaamijka laftiisa: wax kasta oo aad ku samayn karto qaabeynta caadiga ah halkaan ayay ku shaqeeyaan, naqshaddaadu, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha aad ayay sidaas ku sii jiraan. Dooro Fur Settings (gear-ka, ama Ctrl+,). Dooro tab-ka Global, kadibna gali Layout › Workspace. Dooro Ribbon and project browser. Qaabeynta waa isla markiiba beddelmaysa. Doorashadu waa mid barnaamij kasta browser-kan: barnaamij kasta wuxuu ka furmaa marka xiga, waxayna ku jirtaa ka hor inta bogga aan la sawirin, sidaas darteed qaabeynta caadiga ah ma aragto mar. Waxa meel kasta ku yaal Safka magaca: magaca barnaamijka, badhamada degdega ah ee furidda, kaydinta, dib-u-noqoshada iyo dib-u-samaynta, magaca faylka furan, What each tool does here (liis dhammaan qalabka oo leh sanduuq raadin, oo sheegaysa kuwa hadda diyaar u ah iyo sababta kuwa kale aan u diyaarin), shaashad buuxda, Help iyo Settings. Qaabeyntan, safka magaca wuxuu meesha ka qaadaa safka barnaamijka. Ribbon: qalabka barnaamijka tab-yada, tab kasta kooxo ku jira. File bidixda ayaa furaysa, kaydinaysa iyo waxa kale. Barnaamijyada qaarkood tab gaar ah ayay ku daraan markaad ku shaqeyso habka ama meel shaqo gaar ah; wuu iftiimaa intuu khusaysan yahay, kadibna wuu baxaa. Safka xulashada: hoosta ribbon-ka, waxa qalabka socda uu kaa rabo ama waxa la doortay. Panelka bidix: Properties sare, hoosteeda palet-yada (baadhaha mashruuca iyo waxa panelka u gaar ah) sida tab-yo. Jiid xariiqa u dhexeeya si aad booska u wadaagto. Tab-yada muuqaalka: hal tab muuqaal kasta oo aad furtay (xaashi, qorshe, muuqaal saddex-geesood...). Ku xidh badhanka xidhka; faylku wuu furan yahay. Safka muuqaalka iyo safka xaaladda: hoosta naqshadda, dejinta muuqaalka (cabbir, zoom); hoose, fariimaha barnaamijka. Qalab aan hadda shaqayn karin ayaa lagu madoobeeyaa, qalabkeeda sharaxaad ayaa sababta sheegta (tusaale \"Marka hore fur fayl\", ama in barnaamijku weli qalabkaas ma laha). Riix ama Enter si aad sababta uga akhrido sanduuq. Ka isticmaal ribbon-ka kiiboodhka Markaad tab ribbon-ka xulan tahay, ← iyo → ayaa u dhaqaaqa tab-yada, Home iyo End waxay tagaan kii ugu horreeyay iyo kii ugu dambeeyay. Esc marka hore wuxuu joojiyaa qalabka socda, sida qaabeynta caadiga ah, dhammaan gaabinta iyo Ctrl+Shift+F (hababka shaashadda) sidii hore ayay u shaqeeyaan. Ribbon-ka qabo ama daaqad u gaar ah sii Laba jeer riix tab ribbon-ka si ribbon-ka u qabsado tab-yadiisa; riix tab wuxuu markaas tusaa qalabkiisa ilaa aad ka guurto. Mar kale laba jeer riix si aad u furan u hayso. Badhanka Move the ribbon ee dhinaca midig ee ribbon-ka wuxuu leeyahay Collapse the ribbon iyo Keep the ribbon open sidoo kale. Barnaamij kasta ayaa xasuusta. Move the ribbon › Move to a new window ribbon-ka wuxuu geynayaa daaqad gaar ah, tusaale ahaan shaashad labaad. Furayaasha lagu riixo halkaas waxay gaaraan barnaamijka. Put the ribbon back, ama xidhida daaqadda, ayaa soo celinaya. Dejinta qalabka waxay ku dhacaysaa ribbon-ka: Settings › Global › Toolbar › Icons and labels, Icons only (ribbon-ka wuxuu markaas muujinayaa laba safood oo calaamado yaryar oo kooxda kasta ku jira) ama Labels only, iyo Show group names (File, Draw, …). Panelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan Panelada bidix iyo midig waxay haystaan wax kasta oo lagu sharaxay Habee panelada: xirid, dhaqaaq, pin, qari, tab-yo, Move to a new window iyo Reset layout. Ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah Fur Settings › Global › Layout › Workspace oo dooro CadCraft classic. Safaf kasta, tab kasta iyo panel kasta waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen. Taleefan ama daaqad 760 pixel ama ka yar ballaadhka ah, barnaamijku wuxuu isticmaalaa qaabeynta taleefanka ima doorateen. Daaqad ballaaran ayaa qaabeyntaada soo celinaysa. Si aad qaabeyn kale isku daydo, eeg qaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo macluumaadka. Si aad u beddesho waxa qaabeyntani muujinayso, eeg Beddel qaabeynta shaashadda; habka madow, menu-bar iyo ribbon, eeg qaabeynta Drafting.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"layout-toolbox","scope":"basics","title":"Ka shaqee qaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo sanduuqa macluumaadka","summary":"Beddel barnaamijka tiir qalab ah oo dhinaca bidix ku jira, oo leh meel aad ku kaydiso qalabkaaga, sanduuq macluumaad oo naqshadda sare ku socda oo raacaya qalabka socda ama waxa aad dooratay, socodsiiye dhinaca midig, tab muuqaal kasta, degdeg dooro iyo palet wax-beddel, oo mar kasta ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["qaabeyn","meel shaqo","sanduuqa qalabka","tiirka qalabka","sanduuqa macluumaadka","macluumaad","socodsiiye","khariidadda mashruuca","safka degdega ah","degdeg dooro","palet wax-beddel","palet pet","my tools","qalabkayga","tab-yada muuqaalka","daaqadda sanduuqa qalabka","qaabeynta caadiga ah","beddel qaabeyn"],"headings":[{"id":"dooro","text":"Dooro","level":2},{"id":"waxa-meel-kasta-ku-yaal","text":"Waxa meel kasta ku yaal","level":2},{"id":"sanduuqa-qalabka-u-gaar-daaqad-sii","text":"Sanduuqa qalabka u gaar daaqad sii","level":2},{"id":"panelada-aad-leedahay-way-sii-haysaan","text":"Panelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan","level":2},{"id":"ku-noqo-qaabeynta-caadiga-ah","text":"Ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESanduuqa qalabka iyo sanduuqa macluumaadka\u003C/strong\u003E waa mid ka mid ah saddexda qaabeyn ee meel shaqo ee barnaamijka. Qalabka naqshaddu waxay taagan yihiin tiir dhinaca bidix, sanduuq macluumaad oo u dhex maraya sare ayaa muujinaya waxa qalabka socda ama waxa aad dooratay, muuqaal kasta wuxuu leeyahay tab, safka degdega ah ayaa hoosta naqshadda ku yaal oo wuxuu haya doorashooyin maalin walba loo isticmaalo. Qalabka waa kuwa barnaamijka laftiisa: wax kasta oo aad ku samayn karto qaabeynta caadiga ah halkaan ayay ku shaqeeyaan, naqshaddaadu, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha aad ayay sidaas ku sii jiraan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro\"\u003EDooro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (gear-ka, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna gali \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbox and info box\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabeynta waa isla markiiba beddelmaysa. Doorashadu waa mid barnaamij kasta browser-kan: barnaamij kasta wuxuu ka furmaa marka xiga, waxayna ku jirtaa ka hor inta bogga aan la sawirin, sidaas darteed qaabeynta caadiga ah ma aragto mar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-meel-kasta-ku-yaal\"\u003EWaxa meel kasta ku yaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka:\u003C/strong\u003E qalabka barnaamijka oo sare ku sugan naqshadda, menu-yadiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESanduuqa macluumaadka:\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta qalabka. Intii qalabku socdo wuxuu muujiyaa qalabka iyo waxa uu kaa rabo. Markaad wax dooratid wuxuu muujiyaa dejintooda ugu muhiimsan (darbi ahaan: noociisa, cabbirka, dherer, khadka meesha iyo joogga), oo halkaas ayaad ka beddeli kartaa: beddelka halkaas waa isku mid sida Properties, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka soo celinaya. Wax la dooran waayo wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Nothing selected&quot;. Barnaamij kasta wuxuu halkaan ku darayaa sanduuqyadiisa, sida layer-ka ama heerka hadda, ama dukumeentiga furan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESanduuqa qalabka:\u003C/strong\u003E tiirka bidix, qalabka barnaamijka kooxo ku jira. Riix magaca kooxda si aad u qabsato ama dib u furto. Qalabka socda wuu iftiimaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMy tools:\u003C/strong\u003E kooxda ugu horeysa ee sanduuqa qalabka, siddeed godad madhan oo qalabka aad ugu badan isticmaashid. Riix godka madhan si aad u doorato qalab ama amar kasta oo barnaamijka ah; ama midig-riix qalab sanduuqa qalabka kuna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd to My tools\u003C/span\u003E; ama jiid qalab godka. Midig-riix godka si aad u beddesho ama u faaruq. Godyadaadu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta browser-kan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESocodsiiyaha:\u003C/strong\u003E panelka midig. Baadhaha mashruuca barnaamijka ayaa sare (xaashiyada, qorshayaasha, muuqaalka dhinacyada, muuqaalka 3D, jadwalada, xaashiyada, sida barnaamijku leeyahay): riix mid si aad u furto. Hoosteeda, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E iyo tab leh waxyaabaha kale ee panelka midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETab-yada muuqaalka:\u003C/strong\u003E tab muuqaal kasta oo faylka furan (xaashi, qorshe, muuqaal saddex-geesood...), naqshadda dushiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafka degdega ah:\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta naqshadda, doorashooyinka muuqaalka iyo kuwa maalin walba loo isticmaalo ee barnaamijka, sida miisaanka, heerka faahfaahinta, kala duwanaanshaha muuqaalka, fit, plan, split ama 3D, snaps iyo unit-yada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPalet-ka wax-beddelka:\u003C/strong\u003E riix wax naqshadda ku jira, palet yar ayaa imanaya oo ku dhow mu&#039;aashaaraha, leh amarrada wax-beddelka barnaamijka sida dhaqaajinta, koobiyeynta, jeedinta, muraayadda, koobiyada, iyo tirtirka, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, tuubbada mouse-ka, riix kale ama badhanka xidhka ayaa dhigaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab aan hadda shaqayn karin ayaa lagu madoobeeyaa, sharaxaaddiisa ayaa sababta sheegta. Riix ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad sababta uga akhrido sanduuq.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E marka hore wuxuu joojiyaa qalabka socda, sida qaabeynta caadiga ah, dhammaan gaabinta iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (hababka shaashadda) sidii hore ayay u shaqeeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sanduuqa-qalabka-u-gaar-daaqad-sii\"\u003ESanduuqa qalabka u gaar daaqad sii\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove the toolbox\u003C/span\u003E ee sare ee sanduuqa qalabka wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E: sanduuqa qalabka wuxuu furmaa daaqad yar oo gaar ah oo aad dhinaca barnaamijka ama shaashad labaad ku dhigi karto. Furayaasha lagu riixo halkaas waxay gaaraan barnaamijka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the toolbox back\u003C/span\u003E, ama xidhida daaqadda, ayaa soo celinaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejinta qalabka waxay ku dhacaysaa sanduuqa qalabka sidoo kale: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons and labels\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons only\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabels only\u003C/span\u003E, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow group names (File, Draw, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panelada-aad-leedahay-way-sii-haysaan\"\u003EPanelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelada bidix iyo midig waxay haystaan wax kasta oo lagu sharaxay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHabee panelada\u003C/a\u003E: xirid, dhaqaaq, pin, qari, tab-yo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-noqo-qaabeynta-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKu noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft classic\u003C/span\u003E. Safaf kasta, tab kasta iyo panel kasta waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaleefan ama daaqad 760 pixel ama ka yar ballaadhka ah, barnaamijku wuxuu isticmaalaa qaabeynta taleefanka ima doorateen. Daaqad ballaaran ayaa qaabeyntaada soo celinaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad qaabeyn kale isku daydo, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Eqaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u beddesho waxa qaabeyntani muujinayso, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EBeddel qaabeynta shaashadda\u003C/a\u003E; habka madow, menu-bar iyo ribbon, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eqaabeynta Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Sanduuqa qalabka iyo sanduuqa macluumaadka waa mid ka mid ah saddexda qaabeyn ee meel shaqo ee barnaamijka. Qalabka naqshaddu waxay taagan yihiin tiir dhinaca bidix, sanduuq macluumaad oo u dhex maraya sare ayaa muujinaya waxa qalabka socda ama waxa aad dooratay, muuqaal kasta wuxuu leeyahay tab, safka degdega ah ayaa hoosta naqshadda ku yaal oo wuxuu haya doorashooyin maalin walba loo isticmaalo. Qalabka waa kuwa barnaamijka laftiisa: wax kasta oo aad ku samayn karto qaabeynta caadiga ah halkaan ayay ku shaqeeyaan, naqshaddaadu, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha aad ayay sidaas ku sii jiraan. Dooro Fur Settings (gear-ka, ama Ctrl+,). Dooro tab-ka Global, kadibna gali Layout › Workspace. Dooro Toolbox and info box. Qaabeynta waa isla markiiba beddelmaysa. Doorashadu waa mid barnaamij kasta browser-kan: barnaamij kasta wuxuu ka furmaa marka xiga, waxayna ku jirtaa ka hor inta bogga aan la sawirin, sidaas darteed qaabeynta caadiga ah ma aragto mar. Waxa meel kasta ku yaal Qalabka: qalabka barnaamijka oo sare ku sugan naqshadda, menu-yadiisa. Sanduuqa macluumaadka: hoosta qalabka. Intii qalabku socdo wuxuu muujiyaa qalabka iyo waxa uu kaa rabo. Markaad wax dooratid wuxuu muujiyaa dejintooda ugu muhiimsan (darbi ahaan: noociisa, cabbirka, dherer, khadka meesha iyo joogga), oo halkaas ayaad ka beddeli kartaa: beddelka halkaas waa isku mid sida Properties, Ctrl+Z ayaa ka soo celinaya. Wax la dooran waayo wuxuu leeyahay \"Nothing selected\". Barnaamij kasta wuxuu halkaan ku darayaa sanduuqyadiisa, sida layer-ka ama heerka hadda, ama dukumeentiga furan. Sanduuqa qalabka: tiirka bidix, qalabka barnaamijka kooxo ku jira. Riix magaca kooxda si aad u qabsato ama dib u furto. Qalabka socda wuu iftiimaa. My tools: kooxda ugu horeysa ee sanduuqa qalabka, siddeed godad madhan oo qalabka aad ugu badan isticmaashid. Riix godka madhan si aad u doorato qalab ama amar kasta oo barnaamijka ah; ama midig-riix qalab sanduuqa qalabka kuna dooro Add to My tools; ama jiid qalab godka. Midig-riix godka si aad u beddesho ama u faaruq. Godyadaadu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta browser-kan. Socodsiiyaha: panelka midig. Baadhaha mashruuca barnaamijka ayaa sare (xaashiyada, qorshayaasha, muuqaalka dhinacyada, muuqaalka 3D, jadwalada, xaashiyada, sida barnaamijku leeyahay): riix mid si aad u furto. Hoosteeda, Properties iyo tab leh waxyaabaha kale ee panelka midig. Tab-yada muuqaalka: tab muuqaal kasta oo faylka furan (xaashi, qorshe, muuqaal saddex-geesood...), naqshadda dushiisa. Safka degdega ah: hoosta naqshadda, doorashooyinka muuqaalka iyo kuwa maalin walba loo isticmaalo ee barnaamijka, sida miisaanka, heerka faahfaahinta, kala duwanaanshaha muuqaalka, fit, plan, split ama 3D, snaps iyo unit-yada. Palet-ka wax-beddelka: riix wax naqshadda ku jira, palet yar ayaa imanaya oo ku dhow mu'aashaaraha, leh amarrada wax-beddelka barnaamijka sida dhaqaajinta, koobiyeynta, jeedinta, muraayadda, koobiyada, iyo tirtirka, iyo Properties. Esc, tuubbada mouse-ka, riix kale ama badhanka xidhka ayaa dhigaya. Qalab aan hadda shaqayn karin ayaa lagu madoobeeyaa, sharaxaaddiisa ayaa sababta sheegta. Riix ama Enter si aad sababta uga akhrido sanduuq. Esc marka hore wuxuu joojiyaa qalabka socda, sida qaabeynta caadiga ah, dhammaan gaabinta iyo Ctrl+Shift+F (hababka shaashadda) sidii hore ayay u shaqeeyaan. Sanduuqa qalabka u gaar daaqad sii Badhanka Move the toolbox ee sare ee sanduuqa qalabka wuxuu leeyahay Move to a new window: sanduuqa qalabka wuxuu furmaa daaqad yar oo gaar ah oo aad dhinaca barnaamijka ama shaashad labaad ku dhigi karto. Furayaasha lagu riixo halkaas waxay gaaraan barnaamijka. Put the toolbox back, ama xidhida daaqadda, ayaa soo celinaya. Dejinta qalabka waxay ku dhacaysaa sanduuqa qalabka sidoo kale: Settings › Global › Toolbar › Icons and labels, Icons only ama Labels only, iyo Show group names (File, Draw, …). Panelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan Panelada bidix iyo midig waxay haystaan wax kasta oo lagu sharaxay Habee panelada: xirid, dhaqaaq, pin, qari, tab-yo, Move to a new window iyo Reset layout. Ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah Fur Settings › Global › Layout › Workspace oo dooro CadCraft classic. Safaf kasta, tab kasta iyo panel kasta waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen. Taleefan ama daaqad 760 pixel ama ka yar ballaadhka ah, barnaamijku wuxuu isticmaalaa qaabeynta taleefanka ima doorateen. Daaqad ballaaran ayaa qaabeyntaada soo celinaysa. Si aad qaabeyn kale isku daydo, eeg qaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca. Si aad u beddesho waxa qaabeyntani muujinayso, eeg Beddel qaabeynta shaashadda; habka madow, menu-bar iyo ribbon, eeg qaabeynta Drafting.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"icons-one-set","scope":"basics","title":"One set of icons in every layout","summary":"Every tool in the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the menus and the palettes is drawn from one icon set, in the same style in every layout; choose full colour, an outline in your own colour, or the app's own drawings under Settings.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["icons","icon set","icon style","full colour","outline","colorized","each app's own drawings","ribbon icons","toolbar icons","toolbox icons","menu icons","palette icons","consistent icons","layout icons","tool pictures","icon colour"],"headings":[{"id":"choose-how-the-icons-look","text":"Choose how the icons look","level":2},{"id":"what-stays-the-same","text":"What stays the same","level":2},{"id":"if-a-picture-is-wrong","text":"If a picture is wrong","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EEvery tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-how-the-icons-look\"\u003EChoose how the icons look\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (Ctrl+,) and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick one:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull colour\u003C/span\u003E: two-tone drawings with colour fills.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline\u003C/span\u003E: line drawings in one colour. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline colour\u003C/span\u003E sets the colour; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse the theme colour\u003C/span\u003E puts it back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEach app&#039;s own drawings\u003C/span\u003E: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E. They follow the light and dark theme too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-stays-the-same\"\u003EWhat stays the same\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe tool&#039;s name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EArrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library&#039;s and are not touched.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-a-picture-is-wrong\"\u003EIf a picture is wrong\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHover the tool to read its name, then use \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Every tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel's ⋯ button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once. This is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten. Choose how the icons look Open Settings (Ctrl+,) and find Icons. Pick one: Full colour: two-tone drawings with colour fills. Outline: line drawings in one colour. Outline colour sets the colour; Use the theme colour puts it back. Each app's own drawings: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set. The drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow Interface size. They follow the light and dark theme too. What stays the same The tool's name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture. Arrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape. The pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library's and are not touched. If a picture is wrong Hover the tool to read its name, then use Report a problem from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-own","scope":"basics","title":"Habee qaabeyntaada oo kaydi habayntaada","summary":"Dooro panelka ku muujinaya baadhaha mashruuca, Properties ama waxa panelka u gaar ah, meesha sanduuqa qalabka ku jiro iyo waxa safafka ku jiro, kaydi sida qaabeyntaada, oo kaydi habayn oo dhan magac hoose oo aad ku beddesho.","section":"start","order":39,"keywords":["qaabeyn","meel shaqo","habee","u habee","qaabeyntayda","qaabeyntayda gaarka ah","panelada","tafatirayaasha","baadhaha mashruuca","properties","sanduuqa qalabka","safka degdega","sanduuqa macluumaadka","deegaanka shaqada","habayn","profile","kaydi habayn","beddel habayn","dhoofi habayn","soo deji habayn","ccenv"],"headings":[{"id":"habee-qaabeyntaada","text":"Habee qaabeyntaada","level":2},{"id":"kaydi-dejintaada-sida-deegaan-shaqo","text":"Kaydi dejintaada sida deegaan shaqo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMarka laga reebo qaabeynta dhisan ee saddexda ah, waxaad habaysan kartaa midkaaga, habaynta oo dhanna waad kaydin kartaa magac hoose si aad hal tallaabo ugu noqoto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"habee-qaabeyntaada\"\u003EHabee qaabeyntaada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (gear-ka, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange your own layout…\u003C/span\u003E. Wada-hadalku wuxuu ka bilaabmaa qaabeynta aad hadda isticmaasho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu sii magac, kadibna dooro:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadda dushiisa:\u003C/strong\u003E qalabka barnaamijka, ribbon ama midna; safka magaca; sanduuq macluumaad iyo gacan-ka-hayaasha uu hayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadda dhinaceeda:\u003C/strong\u003E sanduuqa qalabka dhinaca bidix, midig ama midna, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy tools\u003C/span\u003E oo la socda ama aan la socon; panelka hayaa palet-yada, kan kor ku jira (baadhaha mashruuca ama Properties, tusaale ahaan), iyo kuwa ka mid ah tab-yada hoosteeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMeel naqshaddu:\u003C/strong\u003E tab-yada muuqaalka, safka degdega ah iyo safka muuqaalka oo leh gacan-ka-hayaasha aad calaamadiso, palet-ka wax-beddelka, safka xaaladda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalka:\u003C/strong\u003E cabbirka, geesaha badhanada iyo qaabka tab-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse this layout\u003C/span\u003E. Barnaamijku waa u beddelaa isla markiiba, barnaamij kasta oo leh qaabeyn ayaa sidoo kale isticmaalaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa barnaamijkan haysta oo keliya ayaa la soo bandhigaa. Qaabeyntaada waxay ku jirtaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport this layout\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa sida fayl aad saaxiibkaaga siin karto, badhanka ka saarista ayaa ka saaraa. Panelada ay buuxinayso wali way ku xirmaan, ku sabaan, u dhaqaaqaan daaqadahooda, sida ku qoran \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHabee panelada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-dejintaada-sida-deegaan-shaqo\"\u003EKaydi dejintaada sida deegaan shaqo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDeegaanka shaqada waa dejintaada oo dhan barnaamij kasta browser-kan: qaabeynta, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha, qaabka safka qalabka, panelada iyo cabbirkooda, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy tools\u003C/span\u003E. Muuqaalka iyo luuqadu ma qaybo ka mid ahan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi:\u003C/strong\u003E qor magac hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWork environments\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave my setup\u003C/span\u003E. Kaydinta magac jira ayaa beddelaysa dejintaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBeddel:\u003C/strong\u003E dooro dejinta liiska, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESwitch to it\u003C/span\u003E. Barnaamijku wuu dib u furmaa dejintaas; haddii aad shaqo aan la kaydin haysid, barnaamijku marka hore wuu weydiiyaa, sida uu ku sameeyo dib-u-furasho kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWadaag:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa dejinta la doortay sida fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.ccenv.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport a setup…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu mid ka soo ceyn karaa fayl. Faylku wuxuu kaliya dejimaha kuwan dejin karaa, wax kale midna.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa saar:\u003C/strong\u003E dooro dejin, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad haysan kartaa ilaa laba iyo toban dejin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad qaabeyn u beddesho adigoon wada-hadalka furin (jiid block, midig-riix qalab), eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EBeddel qaabeynta shaashadda\u003C/a\u003E. Si aad marka hore u tijaabiso qaabeynada dhisan, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Eqaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo macluumaadka\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Eqaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eqaabeynta Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Marka laga reebo qaabeynta dhisan ee saddexda ah, waxaad habaysan kartaa midkaaga, habaynta oo dhanna waad kaydin kartaa magac hoose si aad hal tallaabo ugu noqoto. Habee qaabeyntaada Fur Settings (gear-ka, ama Ctrl+,), dooro Global, kadibna Layout. Dooro Arrange your own layout…. Wada-hadalku wuxuu ka bilaabmaa qaabeynta aad hadda isticmaasho. Ku sii magac, kadibna dooro: Naqshadda dushiisa: qalabka barnaamijka, ribbon ama midna; safka magaca; sanduuq macluumaad iyo gacan-ka-hayaasha uu hayo. Naqshadda dhinaceeda: sanduuqa qalabka dhinaca bidix, midig ama midna, iyo My tools oo la socda ama aan la socon; panelka hayaa palet-yada, kan kor ku jira (baadhaha mashruuca ama Properties, tusaale ahaan), iyo kuwa ka mid ah tab-yada hoosteeda. Meel naqshaddu: tab-yada muuqaalka, safka degdega ah iyo safka muuqaalka oo leh gacan-ka-hayaasha aad calaamadiso, palet-ka wax-beddelka, safka xaaladda. Muuqaalka: cabbirka, geesaha badhanada iyo qaabka tab-ka. Dooro Use this layout. Barnaamijku waa u beddelaa isla markiiba, barnaamij kasta oo leh qaabeyn ayaa sidoo kale isticmaalaya. Waxa barnaamijkan haysta oo keliya ayaa la soo bandhigaa. Qaabeyntaada waxay ku jirtaa From add-ons and files; Export this layout wuxuu kaydiyaa sida fayl aad saaxiibkaaga siin karto, badhanka ka saarista ayaa ka saaraa. Panelada ay buuxinayso wali way ku xirmaan, ku sabaan, u dhaqaaqaan daaqadahooda, sida ku qoran Habee panelada. Kaydi dejintaada sida deegaan shaqo Deegaanka shaqada waa dejintaada oo dhan barnaamij kasta browser-kan: qaabeynta, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha, qaabka safka qalabka, panelada iyo cabbirkooda, iyo My tools. Muuqaalka iyo luuqadu ma qaybo ka mid ahan. Kaydi: qor magac hoosta Work environments oo dooro Save my setup. Kaydinta magac jira ayaa beddelaysa dejintaas. Beddel: dooro dejinta liiska, kadibna dooro Switch to it. Barnaamijku wuu dib u furmaa dejintaas; haddii aad shaqo aan la kaydin haysid, barnaamijku marka hore wuu weydiiyaa, sida uu ku sameeyo dib-u-furasho kasta. Wadaag: Export wuxuu kaydiyaa dejinta la doortay sida fayl .ccenv.json; Import a setup… wuxuu mid ka soo ceyn karaa fayl. Faylku wuxuu kaliya dejimaha kuwan dejin karaa, wax kale midna. Ka saar: dooro dejin, kadibna dooro Remove. Waxaad haysan kartaa ilaa laba iyo toban dejin. Si aad qaabeyn u beddesho adigoon wada-hadalka furin (jiid block, midig-riix qalab), eeg Beddel qaabeynta shaashadda. Si aad marka hore u tijaabiso qaabeynada dhisan, eeg qaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo macluumaadka, qaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca iyo qaabeynta Drafting.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"addons-basics","scope":"basics","title":"Add-ons and your account list","summary":"How add-ons work in every app and edition. Add one once in the Library and it follows your account, loads the first time an app needs it, and updates inside its major version. Sign in on a computer, pin a version, add a package from a file, or keep working offline.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["add-ons","library","add","remove","update","pin","lab channel","your add-ons","sign in","offline","offline on this device","use offline","add from a file","download as a file","drag and drop","ccaddon","package","paid","licence","entitlement","this file uses","engine","needs","orphan","team add-ons"],"headings":[{"id":"what-an-add-on-is","text":"What an add-on is","level":2},{"id":"your-list","text":"Your list","level":2},{"id":"needs","text":"Needs","level":2},{"id":"files-that-use-add-ons","text":"Files that use add-ons","level":2},{"id":"skill-packs-and-agents","text":"Skill packs and agents","level":2},{"id":"offline","text":"Offline","level":2},{"id":"add-from-a-file","text":"Add from a file","level":2},{"id":"paid-add-ons-offline","text":"Paid add-ons offline","level":2},{"id":"ipad-and-iphone","text":"iPad and iPhone","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-add-on-is\"\u003EWhat an add-on is\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-list\"\u003EYour list\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESign in\u003C/strong\u003E connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERemove\u003C/strong\u003E takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECheck for updates\u003C/strong\u003E lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKeep a version\u003C/strong\u003E pins it. \u003Cstrong\u003EFollow newest\u003C/strong\u003E unpins it. \u003Cstrong\u003ETry lab versions\u003C/strong\u003E moves one add-on to the lab channel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERoll back\u003C/strong\u003E returns to the version you had.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"needs\"\u003ENeeds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"files-that-use-add-ons\"\u003EFiles that use add-ons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says &quot;This file uses ...&quot; and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"skill-packs-and-agents\"\u003ESkill packs and agents\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe add-on directory at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps&#039; tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker&#039;s code, and they have no price here. Open them with the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkill packs\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgents\u003C/span\u003E filters.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend a skill pack\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend an agent listing\u003C/span\u003E in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"offline\"\u003EOffline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload everything for offline\u003C/span\u003E fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open \u003Cstrong\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/strong\u003E on getcadcraft.com and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EMake my add-ons available offline\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EOffline on this device\u003C/strong\u003E, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (&quot;Your add-ons in this browser&quot;) with the same button; \u003Cstrong\u003EUse offline\u003C/strong\u003E on an add-on&#039;s page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"add-from-a-file\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn an add-on&#039;s page, \u003Cstrong\u003EDownload as a file\u003C/strong\u003E saves its signed package (a \u003Ccode\u003E.ccaddon.json\u003C/code\u003E file). In the app, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app&#039;s window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"paid-add-ons-offline\"\u003EPaid add-ons offline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipad-and-iphone\"\u003EiPad and iPhone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAdd-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What an add-on is An add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the Library and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet. Your list Open Settings › Add-ons › Your add-ons. Sign in connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser. Remove takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which. Check for updates lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes. Keep a version pins it. Follow newest unpins it. Try lab versions moves one add-on to the lab channel. Roll back returns to the version you had. Needs An add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days. Files that use add-ons A drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says \"This file uses ...\" and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched. Skill packs and agents The add-on directory at Add-ons on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps' tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker's code, and they have no price here. Open them with the Skill packs and Agents filters. To offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses Send a skill pack or Send an agent listing in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on. Offline Download everything for offline fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used. In a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open Your add-ons on getcadcraft.com and choose Make my add-ons available offline under Offline on this device, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (Save for offline in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go. With no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (\"Your add-ons in this browser\") with the same button; Use offline on an add-on's page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account. Add from a file On an add-on's page, Download as a file saves its signed package (a .ccaddon.json file). In the app, Add from a file under Your add-ons takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app's window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it. Paid add-ons offline A paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it. iPad and iPhone Add-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-edit","scope":"basics","title":"Change a layout on the screen","summary":"Drag a block to another place, right-click a tool to remove, move or add one, and keep the result as a layout of your own that you can export.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["layout","arrange","drag","handle","move block","right-click","tool","remove tool","add tool","new group","rename group","my layout","reset","undo","workspace","customize ribbon","customize toolbox"],"headings":[{"id":"move-a-block","text":"Move a block","level":2},{"id":"change-what-a-block-holds","text":"Change what a block holds","level":2},{"id":"switch-layouts","text":"Switch layouts","level":2},{"id":"keep-it","text":"Keep it","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EYou can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy\u003C/span\u003E and the layout&#039;s name, and every later change edits that copy.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"move-a-block\"\u003EMove a block\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange your own layout…\u003C/span\u003E. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEvery block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the block on a place. The layout changes at once.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe bar at the bottom has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E for each move, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E to bring the built-in layout back, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"change-what-a-block-holds\"\u003EChange what a block holds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove from here\u003C/span\u003E takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove earlier\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove later\u003C/span\u003E change its place in the group.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a tool\u003C/span\u003E lists the app&#039;s tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew group\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERename the group\u003C/span\u003E make a group and name it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset this block\u003C/span\u003E gives the block back the tools the app offers.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"switch-layouts\"\u003ESwitch layouts\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELayouts are chosen in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E. Choosing one does not reload the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"keep-it\"\u003EKeep it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour layout is listed in Settings under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport this layout\u003C/span\u003E saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers&#039; layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee also \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-own\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-own\"\u003EArrange your own layout and save your setups\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"You can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named My and the layout's name, and every later change edits that copy. Move a block Open Settings (the gear, or Ctrl+,), choose Global, then Layout, and choose Arrange your own layout…. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes. Every block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why. Drop the block on a place. The layout changes at once. The bar at the bottom has Undo and Redo for each move, Reset to bring the built-in layout back, and Done. Without a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press Enter. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one. Change what a block holds Right-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox: Remove from here takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here). Move earlier and Move later change its place in the group. Add a tool lists the app's tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked. New group and Rename the group make a group and name it. Reset this block gives the block back the tools the app offers. Switch layouts Layouts are chosen in Settings › Global › Layout: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and Classic. Choosing one does not reload the app. Keep it Your layout is listed in Settings under From add-ons and files. Export this layout saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers' layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code. See also Arrange your own layout and save your setups.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"offline","scope":"basics","title":"Shaqada khadka ka baxsan","summary":"Kaydi app si aad ugu shaqeyso khadka ka baxsan, waxa ku shaqeeya xidhiidh la'aan, iyo waxa u baahan xidhiidh.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["offline","internet la'aan","diyaarad","booqasho goob","cache","service worker","rakib","soo deji","xidhiidh"],"headings":[{"id":"kaydi-app-si-loo-isticmaalo-khadka-ka-baxsan","text":"Kaydi app si loo isticmaalo khadka ka baxsan","level":2},{"id":"waxa-khadka-ka-baxsan-ku-shaqeeya","text":"Waxa khadka ka baxsan ku shaqeeya","level":2},{"id":"waxa-xidhiidh-u-baahan","text":"Waxa xidhiidh u baahan","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-ogaataa","text":"Waxa aad ogaataa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EApps-yadu shaqadooda kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sameeyaan, sidaas darteed inta badan way shaqeysaa xidhiidh la&#039;aan. Browserku wuxuu kaliya u baahan yahay in fayllada app-ka marka hore la kaydiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-app-si-loo-isticmaalo-khadka-ka-baxsan\"\u003EKaydi app si loo isticmaalo khadka ka baxsan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur app-ka intaad online tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E barka sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESug &quot;Offline ready&quot;. Fayllada app-ka, akhrinta faylashiisa iyo caawintan hadda waxa lagu kaydiyay browserkaaga. Apps-yada akhrinta faylasha DWG ama PDF akhrinta ayaa sidoo kale kaydiya, sidaas darteed markii ugu horreysay daqiiqad ayaa qaadan kartaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETan mar keliya ayaa lagu sameeyaa app kasta, browser kasta oo aad isticmaashid. Si aad dib ugu noqoto app-ka markii dambe xidhiidh la&#039;aan, fur isla cinwaankii hore ee aad isticmaali jirtay, ama bookmark-kiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHadda offline baad tahay. Haddii app-kan loo kaydiyay isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan, wax kasta oo hoos ku qoran way shaqeeyaan. Haddii aanu kaydin, weli waxaad isticmaali kartaa waxa horeyba tab-kan ugu soo rogmay, laakiin ha dib u cusboonaysiin ilaa aad mar kale online tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-khadka-ka-baxsan-ku-shaqeeya\"\u003EWaxa khadka ka baxsan ku shaqeeya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFuridda faylal kombiyuutarkaaga ka soo jeeda, naqshadeynta, tafatirka, cabbirka iyo hubinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaydinta iyo dhoofinta: kaydin kasta waa soo dejin kombiyuutarkaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECaawintan, oo ay ku jiraan baadhistooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-xidhiidh-u-baahan\"\u003EWaxa xidhiidh u baahan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkii ugu horreysay app-ka oo la furo, iyo markii la kaydinayo isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHelidda nooca cusub ee app-ka. Markaad online tahay, app-ku wuxuu soo qaadaa nooca ugu cusub markii xigta la furo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E nuqulkii la kaydiyay wuu cusboonaysiiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXiriirrada websaydhka, sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu fur website-ka\u003C/span\u003E iyo xiriirrada bogagga kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaydinta cloud-ka iyo isku-waafajinta kombiyuutarrada, oo weli diyaar aan ahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-ogaataa\"\u003EWaxa aad ogaataa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENuqulka la kaydiyay wuxuu u gaar yahay hal browser oo hal kombiyuutar. Haddii aad tirtirto xogta websaydhka browserkaaga, way baabi&#039;ax.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaaqadaha gaarka ah ee browser-ka qaarkood, iyo kombiyuutarada shaqada ee xidhan qaarkood, kaydinta offline ma oggolaan. Badhanku wuu kuu sheegaa marka aanu kaydin karin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafari waxay tirtirtaa xogta websaydhka la kaydiyay ee websaydhyada aadan booqan dhowr toddobaad. Mararka qaar app-ka fur intaad online tahay, ama mar kale kaydi ka hor safar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECadCraft Studio, app-ka desktop-ka ah oo leh sideed apps oo hal rakibid ku jira, waxa uu ku yaal getcadcraft.com/download.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Apps-yadu shaqadooda kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sameeyaan, sidaas darteed inta badan way shaqeysaa xidhiidh la'aan. Browserku wuxuu kaliya u baahan yahay in fayllada app-ka marka hore la kaydiyo. Kaydi app si loo isticmaalo khadka ka baxsan Fur app-ka intaad online tahay. Dooro Kaydi khadka ka baxsan barka sare. Sug \"Offline ready\". Fayllada app-ka, akhrinta faylashiisa iyo caawintan hadda waxa lagu kaydiyay browserkaaga. Apps-yada akhrinta faylasha DWG ama PDF akhrinta ayaa sidoo kale kaydiya, sidaas darteed markii ugu horreysay daqiiqad ayaa qaadan kartaa. Tan mar keliya ayaa lagu sameeyaa app kasta, browser kasta oo aad isticmaashid. Si aad dib ugu noqoto app-ka markii dambe xidhiidh la'aan, fur isla cinwaankii hore ee aad isticmaali jirtay, ama bookmark-kiisa. Hadda offline baad tahay. Haddii app-kan loo kaydiyay isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan, wax kasta oo hoos ku qoran way shaqeeyaan. Haddii aanu kaydin, weli waxaad isticmaali kartaa waxa horeyba tab-kan ugu soo rogmay, laakiin ha dib u cusboonaysiin ilaa aad mar kale online tahay. Waxa khadka ka baxsan ku shaqeeya Furidda faylal kombiyuutarkaaga ka soo jeeda, naqshadeynta, tafatirka, cabbirka iyo hubinta. Kaydinta iyo dhoofinta: kaydin kasta waa soo dejin kombiyuutarkaaga. Caawintan, oo ay ku jiraan baadhistooda. Waxa xidhiidh u baahan Markii ugu horreysay app-ka oo la furo, iyo markii la kaydinayo isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan. Helidda nooca cusub ee app-ka. Markaad online tahay, app-ku wuxuu soo qaadaa nooca ugu cusub markii xigta la furo, Kaydi khadka ka baxsan nuqulkii la kaydiyay wuu cusboonaysiiyaa. Xiriirrada websaydhka, sida Ku fur website-ka iyo xiriirrada bogagga kale. Kaydinta cloud-ka iyo isku-waafajinta kombiyuutarrada, oo weli diyaar aan ahayn. Waxa aad ogaataa Nuqulka la kaydiyay wuxuu u gaar yahay hal browser oo hal kombiyuutar. Haddii aad tirtirto xogta websaydhka browserkaaga, way baabi'ax. Daaqadaha gaarka ah ee browser-ka qaarkood, iyo kombiyuutarada shaqada ee xidhan qaarkood, kaydinta offline ma oggolaan. Badhanku wuu kuu sheegaa marka aanu kaydin karin. Safari waxay tirtirtaa xogta websaydhka la kaydiyay ee websaydhyada aadan booqan dhowr toddobaad. Mararka qaar app-ka fur intaad online tahay, ama mar kale kaydi ka hor safar. CadCraft Studio, app-ka desktop-ka ah oo leh sideed apps oo hal rakibid ku jira, waxa uu ku yaal getcadcraft.com/download.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"layout-drafting","scope":"basics","title":"The Drafting layout: a 2D drafting workspace","summary":"A workspace with a menu bar, a ribbon, file tabs, a viewport label, navigation bar and axes over the drawing, Model and sheet tabs and a row of drawing-mode toggles, in dark chrome.","section":"start","order":42,"keywords":["drafting","layout","workspace","menu bar","ribbon","quick access","navigation bar","axes","viewport label","command line","model tab","sheet tab","status bar","toggles","grid","snap","ortho","polar","dark","2D"],"headings":[{"id":"what-is-where","text":"What is where","level":2},{"id":"choose-it","text":"Choose it","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDrafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-is-where\"\u003EWhat is where\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETop row:\u003C/strong\u003E the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenu bar\u003C/strong\u003E under it, with the menus drafting programs use: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModify\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E and the rest the app has.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon\u003C/strong\u003E under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app&#039;s colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOver the drawing:\u003C/strong\u003E the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECommand line:\u003C/strong\u003E in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app&#039;s own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBottom:\u003C/strong\u003E the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrid\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrtho\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolar\u003C/span\u003E and the others the app has) with the app&#039;s messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app&#039;s name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-it\"\u003EChoose it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EChange a layout on the screen\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Drafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example). What is where Top row: the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes. Menu bar under it, with the menus drafting programs use: File, Edit, View, Modify, Tools and the rest the app has. Ribbon under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app's colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a ⋯ button. Over the drawing: the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer. Command line: in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app's own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one. Bottom: the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (Grid, Snap, Ortho, Polar and the others the app has) with the app's messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there. The app's name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window. Choose it Settings › Global › Layout › Drafting. Classic always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see Change a layout on the screen. Good to know On a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back. This layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"interface-sizes","scope":"basics","title":"The interface on a small laptop and on a very large screen","summary":"The interface picks a compact, normal or comfortable step for your window by itself, keeps side panels at a width that suits it, and folds extra tools into a menu instead of wrapping.","section":"start","order":43,"keywords":["density","compact","comfortable","small screen","laptop","13 inch","large screen","ultrawide","4k","panel width","toolbar wrap","scale","window size","responsive"],"headings":[{"id":"three-steps","text":"Three steps","level":2},{"id":"panels-and-bars","text":"Panels and bars","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"three-steps\"\u003EThree steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECompact\u003C/strong\u003E on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENormal\u003C/strong\u003E on a regular monitor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EComfortable\u003C/strong\u003E on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EArrange the panels\u003C/a\u003E). A touch screen is never made compact.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panels-and-bars\"\u003EPanels and bars\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESide panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself, and no presentation mode, yet.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"The interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything. Three steps Compact on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room. Normal on a regular monitor. Comfortable on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little. The step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see Arrange the panels). A touch screen is never made compact. Panels and bars Side panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a ⋯ menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider. Good to know This is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself, and no presentation mode, yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"your-files","scope":"basics","title":"Meesha ay faylalkaagu aadaan","summary":"Faylalku kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sii jiraan, sida kaydintu u shaqeyso, iyo waxa browserku xasuusto.","section":"start","order":50,"keywords":["asturnaan","upload","cloud","kaydi","soo dejin","kaydin","maxalli","amni","sirta"],"headings":[{"id":"faylalkaagu-kombiyuutarkaaga-ayay-ku-sii-jiraan","text":"Faylalkaagu kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sii jiraan","level":2},{"id":"sida-kaydintu-u-shaqeyso","text":"Sida kaydintu u shaqeyso","level":2},{"id":"waxa-browserku-xasuusto","text":"Waxa browserku xasuusto","level":2},{"id":"kaydinta-cloud-ka","text":"Kaydinta cloud-ka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"faylalkaagu-kombiyuutarkaaga-ayay-ku-sii-jiraan\"\u003EFaylalkaagu kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sii jiraan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad naqshad, moodel ama PDF furto, app-ku browserkaaga gudihiisa ayuu akhriyaa. \u003Cstrong\u003EFaylka lama soo dirin.\u003C/strong\u003E Weligeed ma aragno, waxaana uu sidoo kale u shaqeeyaa xidhiidh la&#039;aan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-kaydintu-u-shaqeyso\"\u003ESida kaydintu u shaqeyso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBog browser ah ma beddeli karo fayllada kombiyuutarkaaga isaga keligiis, sidaas darteed apps-yadu waxay kaydiyaan iyagoo \u003Cstrong\u003Esoo dejinaya\u003C/strong\u003E fayl cusub:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESoo dejintu waxay tagtaa meesha browserku ku dhigo soo dejinta, badiyaa folder-ka Downloads, marka laga reebo haddii aad browserka u dejisay inuu mar kasta weydiiyo (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers#what-differs-between-browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\" data-hash=\"what-differs-between-browsers\"\u003EBrowserrada iyo kombiyuutarrada\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EApps-yada beddela fayl waxay kaydiyaan nuqul magac cusub leh, sida &quot;(edited)&quot; ama &quot;(marked up)&quot;, si asalkaagu u sii jiro sidiisii.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii aad tab-ka xirto shaqo aan la kaydin, browserku marka hore wuu weydiin doonaa (&quot;Leave site?&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-browserku-xasuusto\"\u003EWaxa browserku xasuusto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah apps-yadu browserkaaga ayay ku xasuustaan dejimo yar, sida magaca qoraha ama qaabka qalabka. Waxay ku sii jiraan browserkaas kombiyuutarkaas, xogta websaydhka oo la tirtiro ayaa tirtira. Caawinta app kasta waxay sheegtaa waxa ay kaydiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydinta-cloud-ka\"\u003EKaydinta cloud-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydinta cloud-ka iyo isku-waafajinta kombiyuutarada waa qayb ka mid ah ruqsadda ganacsiga. Weli ma diyaar aha. Ilaa markaas, faylalkaaga ku hay meesha aad ku haysid faylalka mashruucyadaaga kale, oo caadi ahaan ku kaydi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Faylalkaagu kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sii jiraan Markaad naqshad, moodel ama PDF furto, app-ku browserkaaga gudihiisa ayuu akhriyaa. Faylka lama soo dirin. Weligeed ma aragno, waxaana uu sidoo kale u shaqeeyaa xidhiidh la'aan. Sida kaydintu u shaqeyso Bog browser ah ma beddeli karo fayllada kombiyuutarkaaga isaga keligiis, sidaas darteed apps-yadu waxay kaydiyaan iyagoo soo dejinaya fayl cusub: Soo dejintu waxay tagtaa meesha browserku ku dhigo soo dejinta, badiyaa folder-ka Downloads, marka laga reebo haddii aad browserka u dejisay inuu mar kasta weydiiyo (eeg Browserrada iyo kombiyuutarrada). Apps-yada beddela fayl waxay kaydiyaan nuqul magac cusub leh, sida \"(edited)\" ama \"(marked up)\", si asalkaagu u sii jiro sidiisii. Haddii aad tab-ka xirto shaqo aan la kaydin, browserku marka hore wuu weydiin doonaa (\"Leave site?\"). Waxa browserku xasuusto Qaar ka mid ah apps-yadu browserkaaga ayay ku xasuustaan dejimo yar, sida magaca qoraha ama qaabka qalabka. Waxay ku sii jiraan browserkaas kombiyuutarkaas, xogta websaydhka oo la tirtiro ayaa tirtira. Caawinta app kasta waxay sheegtaa waxa ay kaydiso. Kaydinta cloud-ka Kaydinta cloud-ka iyo isku-waafajinta kombiyuutarada waa qayb ka mid ah ruqsadda ganacsiga. Weli ma diyaar aha. Ilaa markaas, faylalkaaga ku hay meesha aad ku haysid faylalka mashruucyadaaga kale, oo caadi ahaan ku kaydi.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"connect-ai-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Windows","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":63,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","windows"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-macos","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a Mac","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":64,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","macos"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-linux","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Linux","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":65,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","linux"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-mobile","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a phone or tablet","summary":"How your own AI app reaches the CadCraft apps from a phone or tablet: through the hosted connector, with CadCraft Studio open on a computer. Includes the one-line test.","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","android","ipad","phone","tablet","hosted connector","test"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-can-and-cannot-do","text":"What it can and cannot do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn the computer, open \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EHosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn your AI app, add a connector (a &quot;remote&quot; or &quot;custom&quot; connector) with that address and sign in when asked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKeep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-can-and-cannot-do\"\u003EWhat it can and cannot do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn An AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a hosted connector instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer. How On the computer, open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI and choose Hosted connector. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in. In your AI app, add a connector (a \"remote\" or \"custom\" connector) with that address and sign in when asked. Keep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. What it can and cannot do The hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"local-models","scope":"basics","title":"Use an AI that runs on your own computer","summary":"Work with a local AI model and no network: through an AI app that can use tools, .","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","local","offline","ollama","lm studio","llama.cpp","jan","air-gapped","private","model","ask box"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUse an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp&#039;s server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (&quot;MCP&quot;). Add the single \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E entry shown in \u003Cstrong\u003EConnect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EProgram\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECan use tools through MCP\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELM Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ellama.cpp (llama-server)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, start it with \u003Ccode\u003E--jinja\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, turn on tool calling for the model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOllama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis list is taken from each program&#039;s own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaise the model&#039;s context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESmall models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything else stays the same: the permission levels, \u003Cstrong\u003ESuggest\u003C/strong\u003E mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. How Use an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp's server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (\"MCP\"). Add the single cadcraft entry shown in Connect your AI, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app. Program Can use tools through MCP LM Studio Yes llama.cpp (llama-server) Yes, start it with --jinja Jan Yes, turn on tool calling for the model Ollama Not on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front This list is taken from each program's own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system. Good to know Raise the model's context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit. Small models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools. Everything else stays the same: the permission levels, Suggest mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"engines","scope":"basics","title":"Run an engine on a model","summary":"The Engines panel runs the shared calculation engines (schematics, pipe and power networks, motion, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems, PLC) on a model you paste.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["engines","schematic","network","power","load flow","robot","kinematics","queue","simulation","schedule","critical path","requirements","risk","fault tree","modbus","circuit","spice","board","pcb","modelica","plc"],"headings":[{"id":"run-one","text":"Run one","level":2},{"id":"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene","text":"Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open \u003Cstrong\u003EEngines\u003C/strong\u003E from the button in the bar at the top, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and type &quot;engines&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"run-one\"\u003ERun one\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun\u003C/span\u003E. The results come back as tables, with the engine&#039;s own problems above them and the limits of its method below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E puts the example text back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene\"\u003EControls on a model, or on the 3D scene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to a flow model\u003C/span\u003E is the queues engine&#039;s model. In ModelCraft, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to the 3D scene\u003C/span\u003E ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads \u003Ccode\u003EName.x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.z\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.rotZ\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003EName.hidden\u003C/code\u003E, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a \u003Ccode\u003Escale\u003C/code\u003E (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and \u003Ccode\u003Evalues\u003C/code\u003E says what off and on mean (\u003Ccode\u003E[0, 2]\u003C/code\u003E puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;keep&quot;: true\u003C/code\u003E to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProblems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Some calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open Engines from the button in the bar at the top, or press Ctrl+K and type \"engines\". Run one Choose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls. Choose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text). Press Run. The results come back as tables, with the engine's own problems above them and the limits of its method below. Reset puts the example text back. Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene The controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. The program bound to a flow model is the queues engine's model. In ModelCraft, The program bound to the 3D scene ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads Name.x, Name.y, Name.z, Name.rotZ or Name.hidden, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a scale (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and values says what off and on mean ([0, 2] puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \"keep\": true to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name. Things to know Everything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file. Problems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source. The examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design. The results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistant-in-the-app","scope":"basics","title":"Ask for help inside the app","summary":"Open the Ask box from Help, see why something happened from the steps you took, report a problem with those steps, and see exactly what an assistant was sent.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["show me how","teacher","walk me through","how do i","sign off","signed off","unsigned","unverified","figures","rules","ask","assistant","ai","help button","why did this happen","history","steps","undo","report a problem","bug report","model excerpt","model data only","personal data","sent back","held back","project stage","brief","concept","tender","step by step","teacher","knowledge pack"],"headings":[{"id":"open-it-from-help","text":"Open it from Help","level":2},{"id":"why-did-this-happen","text":"Why did this happen?","level":2},{"id":"report-a-problem-with-the-steps","text":"Report a problem with the steps","level":2},{"id":"what-an-assistant-is-sent","text":"What an assistant is sent","level":2},{"id":"project-stage","text":"Project stage","level":2},{"id":"show-me-how-with-no-assistant","text":"Show me how, with no assistant","level":2},{"id":"rules-every-assistant-follows","text":"Rules every assistant follows","level":2},{"id":"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit","text":"Sign off an estimate or an audit","level":2},{"id":"step-by-step-on-your-screen","text":"Step by step on your screen","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app&#039;s own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"open-it-from-help\"\u003EOpen it from Help\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E or choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant\u003C/span\u003E at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your question and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith a question goes a short note of where you are: the file&#039;s name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"why-did-this-happen\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERead the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith an assistant connected, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant to explain\u003C/span\u003E and it explains from those same steps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"report-a-problem-with-the-steps\"\u003EReport a problem with the steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E. The app&#039;s own About box opens with your words in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELeave \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the steps I took before it happened\u003C/span\u003E ticked. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the steps\u003C/span\u003E to read them first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOnly if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the excerpt\u003C/span\u003E to read it first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd your name and email and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend report\u003C/span\u003E. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-assistant-is-sent\"\u003EWhat an assistant is sent\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAssistants get model data only. People&#039;s names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EActivity\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESet the list to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEverything\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder each line read \u003Cstrong\u003ESent back\u003C/strong\u003E: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. \u003Cstrong\u003EHeld back\u003C/strong\u003E lists each value that was kept, with the reason.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe log never keeps the answer itself.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"project-stage\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/span\u003E: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave details\u003C/span\u003E. The stage is kept in the file with the other details.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"show-me-how-with-no-assistant\"\u003EShow me how, with no assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe teacher works from the app&#039;s own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box type what you want to do, for example &quot;how do I draw a wall&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow me how\u003C/span\u003E. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a topic. A step card opens with the topic&#039;s first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDo the step, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENext\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rules-every-assistant-follows\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOptional.\u003C/strong\u003E Everything works without an assistant and offline.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe app calculates.\u003C/strong\u003E An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrust but verify.\u003C/strong\u003E What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say &quot;Not signed off by a person&quot; until you sign them off. Open the list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/span\u003E in the Ask box.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel data only.\u003C/strong\u003E Your personal and account details are never sent.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit\"\u003ESign off an estimate or an audit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign-off\u003C/span\u003E, check your name, add a note if you like and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign off\u003C/span\u003E beside \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEstimate\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAudit\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWho signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOnly you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETake my sign-off back\u003C/span\u003E removes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"step-by-step-on-your-screen\"\u003EStep by step on your screen\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose the step\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"The apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app's own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds. Open it from Help Press F1 or choose Help. Choose Ask the assistant at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens. Type your question and choose Ask. With a question goes a short note of where you are: the file's name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file. Why did this happen? In the Ask box choose Why did this happen?. Read the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused. With an assistant connected, choose Ask the assistant to explain and it explains from those same steps. The list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement. Report a problem with the steps In the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose Report a problem. The app's own About box opens with your words in it. Leave Add the steps I took before it happened ticked. Open See the steps to read them first. Only if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open See the excerpt to read it first. Add your name and email and choose Send report. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it. An assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours. What an assistant is sent Assistants get model data only. People's names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app. Choose Activity in the bar at the top. Set the list to Everything. Under each line read Sent back: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. Held back lists each value that was kept, with the reason. The log never keeps the answer itself. Project stage Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Pick the Project stage: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out. Choose Save details. The stage is kept in the file with the other details. An assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is. Show me how, with no assistant The teacher works from the app's own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere. In the Ask box type what you want to do, for example \"how do I draw a wall\". Choose Show me how. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top. Choose a topic. A step card opens with the topic's first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one. Do the step, then choose Next. Back goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you. A topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead. Rules every assistant follows Optional. Everything works without an assistant and offline. The app calculates. An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it. Trust but verify. What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say \"Not signed off by a person\" until you sign them off. Open the list under Rules every assistant follows in the Ask box. Model data only. Your personal and account details are never sent. Sign off an estimate or an audit Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Under Sign-off, check your name, add a note if you like and choose Sign off beside Estimate or Audit. Who signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again. Only you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. Take my sign-off back removes it. Step by step on your screen An assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its Close the step button. An assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistants-recipes","scope":"basics","title":"Recipes for AI assistants","summary":"Worked examples for using your own AI assistant with the CadCraft apps: what to ask, the tools it calls, and the permissions each needs. Every recipe here is run by our tests with the same calls.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["ai","assistant","mcp","recipes","examples","prompts","automation","batch","convert","plot","check","takeoff","cut","fill","parameters","script"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"recipes","text":"Recipes","level":2},{"id":"tidy-a-drawing","text":"Tidy a drawing","level":3},{"id":"plot-a-set-of-sheets","text":"Plot a set of sheets","level":3},{"id":"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant","text":"Convert drawings for a consultant","level":3},{"id":"check-drawings-before-sending-them","text":"Check drawings before sending them","level":3},{"id":"ask-a-building-model-questions","text":"Ask a building model questions","level":3},{"id":"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft","text":"Draw a room in BimCraft","level":3},{"id":"total-a-takeoff","text":"Total a takeoff","level":3},{"id":"site-numbers","text":"Site numbers","level":3},{"id":"try-a-part-variant","text":"Try a part variant","level":3},{"id":"fill-in-a-title-block","text":"Fill in a title block","level":3},{"id":"your-files-and-your-assistant","text":"Your files and your assistant","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EReady-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps&#039; tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThere are two ways in. In \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). \u003Cstrong\u003EWithout a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the CadCraft file server for assistants (\u003Ccode\u003Enpx @getcadcraft/mcp --root &lt;folder&gt;\u003C/code\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStart read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"recipes\"\u003ERecipes\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"tidy-a-drawing\"\u003ETidy a drawing\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_open {path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg&quot;}            → d1\ndrawing_describe {doc: &quot;d1&quot;}                                    layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses\ncommand_run {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, input: &quot;PURGE&quot;}                         one undo step: &quot;Assistant: PURGE&quot;\ndrawing_save {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"plot-a-set-of-sheets\"\u003EPlot a set of sheets\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_open {path: …}  ·  drawing_describe {doc}                the sheets of each drawing\ndrawing_plot {doc, layout: &quot;&lt;sheet&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Plots/&lt;drawing&gt; &lt;sheet&gt;.pdf&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant\"\u003EConvert drawings for a consultant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_convert {path: &quot;Kitchen/&lt;file&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Out/&lt;file&gt;.dwg&quot;, version: &quot;2013&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"check-drawings-before-sending-them\"\u003ECheck drawings before sending them\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [&quot;0&quot;]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. Keep your office&#039;s rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json\u003C/code\u003E (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ask-a-building-model-questions\"\u003EAsk a building model questions\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eifc_open {path: &quot;house.ifc&quot;}                                    → d1\nifc_query {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, class: &quot;IfcDoor&quot;}                         each door with its level\nifc_properties {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, id: &lt;door&gt;}                          Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. In Studio, BimCraft&#039;s own tools answer the same about the model you have open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft\"\u003EDraw a room in BimCraft\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ewalls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true}     one undo step\nopening_add {wall: &quot;&lt;the first wall&#039;s GlobalId&gt;&quot;, kind: &quot;door&quot;}                    one undo step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_new\u003C/code\u003E starts a building first and \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_save\u003C/code\u003E writes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"total-a-takeoff\"\u003ETotal a takeoff\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_open {path: &quot;job.takeoff.json&quot;}  ·  takeoff_estimate {doc}  ·  takeoff_export {doc, out: &quot;job.xlsx&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"site-numbers\"\u003ESite numbers\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How much cut and fill does the pad need?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esite_open {path: &quot;site.civilcraft.json&quot;}  ·  surface_volume {doc}       cut, fill and net, per pad\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. With a level instead of a design: \u003Ccode\u003Esurface_volume {doc, datum: 100}\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"try-a-part-variant\"\u003ETry a part variant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epart_open {path: &quot;screw.partcraft.json&quot;}  ·  params_list {doc}\nparam_set {doc, name: &quot;l&quot;, value: 40}                           one undo step, the part rebuilt\nmass_properties {doc}                                            volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit; Save (\u003Ccode\u003Epart_save\u003C/code\u003E) to keep it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"fill-in-a-title-block\"\u003EFill in a title block\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eblock_insert {doc, block: &quot;TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD&quot;, at: [0, 0], attributes: {&quot;SHEET-NO&quot;: &quot;A-101&quot;, &quot;SHEET-TITLE&quot;: &quot;Kitchen plan&quot;}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-files-and-your-assistant\"\u003EYour files and your assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe apps never send your files anywhere. \u003Cstrong\u003EBut what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant:\u003C/strong\u003E a cloud assistant&#039;s maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job&#039;s folders out of the ones you allow.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn Ready-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps' tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working. There are two ways in. In CadCraft Studio, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). Without a window, the CadCraft file server for assistants (npx @getcadcraft/mcp --root \u003Cfolder\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the cadcraft command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways. Start read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with. Recipes Tidy a drawing Ask: \"List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.\" The assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE: drawing_open {path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg\"} → d1 drawing_describe {doc: \"d1\"} layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses command_run {doc: \"d1\", input: \"PURGE\"} one undo step: \"Assistant: PURGE\" drawing_save {doc: \"d1\", path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg\"} Needs Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay. Plot a set of sheets Ask: \"Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_open {path: …} · drawing_describe {doc} the sheets of each drawing drawing_plot {doc, layout: \"\u003Csheet\u003E\", out: \"Plots/\u003Cdrawing\u003E \u003Csheet\u003E.pdf\"} Needs Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: cadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all. Convert drawings for a consultant Ask: \"Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_convert {path: \"Kitchen/\u003Cfile\u003E\", out: \"Out/\u003Cfile\u003E.dwg\", version: \"2013\"} Needs Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: cadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013. Check drawings before sending them Ask: \"Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.\" drawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [\"0\"]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}} Needs Read. Keep your office's rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: cadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script). Ask a building model questions Ask: \"How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?\" ifc_open {path: \"house.ifc\"} → d1 ifc_query {doc: \"d1\", class: \"IfcDoor\"} each door with its level ifc_properties {doc: \"d1\", id: \u003Cdoor\u003E} Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal Needs Read. In Studio, BimCraft's own tools answer the same about the model you have open. Draw a room in BimCraft Ask: \"Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.\" walls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true} one undo step opening_add {wall: \"\u003Cthe first wall's GlobalId\u003E\", kind: \"door\"} one undo step Needs Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, ifc_new starts a building first and ifc_save writes it. Total a takeoff Ask: \"Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.\" takeoff_open {path: \"job.takeoff.json\"} · takeoff_estimate {doc} · takeoff_export {doc, out: \"job.xlsx\"} Needs Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so. Site numbers Ask: \"How much cut and fill does the pad need?\" site_open {path: \"site.civilcraft.json\"} · surface_volume {doc} cut, fill and net, per pad Needs Read. With a level instead of a design: surface_volume {doc, datum: 100}. Try a part variant Ask: \"Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.\" part_open {path: \"screw.partcraft.json\"} · params_list {doc} param_set {doc, name: \"l\", value: 40} one undo step, the part rebuilt mass_properties {doc} volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia Needs Read and Edit; Save (part_save) to keep it. Fill in a title block Ask: \"Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.\" block_insert {doc, block: \"TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD\", at: [0, 0], attributes: {\"SHEET-NO\": \"A-101\", \"SHEET-TITLE\": \"Kitchen plan\"}} Needs Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults. Your files and your assistant The apps never send your files anywhere. But what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant: a cloud assistant's maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job's folders out of the ones you allow.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"community-testing","scope":"basics","title":"Community testing","summary":"How to try a test on the Community testing page and send your result.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["community","testing","test","results","report","feedback","files","passed","failing"],"headings":[{"id":"send-a-result","text":"Send a result","level":2},{"id":"sending-files","text":"Sending files","level":2},{"id":"your-privacy","text":"Your privacy","level":2},{"id":"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work","text":"What counts as \"known not to work\"","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"send-a-result\"\u003ESend a result\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the \u003Cstrong\u003ECommunity testing\u003C/strong\u003E page on the website and choose a test.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUse the public build named in \u003Cstrong\u003EBefore you start\u003C/strong\u003E, never a lab build.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFollow the \u003Cstrong\u003ESteps\u003C/strong\u003E and compare with the \u003Cstrong\u003EExpected result\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFill in \u003Cstrong\u003ESend a result\u003C/strong\u003E: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sending-files\"\u003ESending files\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-privacy\"\u003EYour privacy\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYour first name is shown next to a result only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EShow my first name\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENotes are shown to others only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EAnyone may read my notes\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFiles are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work\"\u003EWhat counts as &quot;known not to work&quot;\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Some checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help. Send a result Open the Community testing page on the website and choose a test. Use the public build named in Before you start, never a lab build. Follow the Steps and compare with the Expected result. Fill in Send a result: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened. You do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files. Sending files When a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages. Your privacy A result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page. Your first name is shown next to a result only if you tick Show my first name. Notes are shown to others only if you tick Anyone may read my notes. Files are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first. What counts as \"known not to work\" Each test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"work-together-live","scope":"basics","title":"Work together live","summary":"Share the file open in an app so teammates edit it with you on your own network with a short code, and join someone else's session. Invite links over the internet are not open yet.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["live","studio live","work together","collaborate","share live","join","code","qr","invite link","link","host","approve","guest","network","relay","license","many people","limit","allow anyway","slow","recent edits","edit log","who changed","history"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"share-the-file-you-have-open","text":"Share the file you have open","level":2},{"id":"let-people-in","text":"Let people in","level":2},{"id":"when-many-people-join","text":"When many people join","level":2},{"id":"codes-on-your-own-network","text":"Codes on your own network","level":2},{"id":"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet","text":"Invite links over the internet: not open yet","level":2},{"id":"join-someone-else-s-session","text":"Join someone else's session","level":2},{"id":"who-changed-what-recent-edits","text":"Who changed what: Recent edits","level":2},{"id":"assistants-in-a-session","text":"Assistants in a session","level":2},{"id":"when-the-session-ends","text":"When the session ends","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app&#039;s own page about live sessions.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-the-file-you-have-open\"\u003EShare the file you have open\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E in the app&#039;s bar, type the name others should see, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShare live\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio shows a code like \u003Ccode\u003EK7-Q4M2X\u003C/code\u003E with a picture to scan and the computer&#039;s address. Give the code to the people you want to invite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-people-in\"\u003ELet people in\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E lets them change the file with you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E turns them away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E shows everyone. Change a person&#039;s role there, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can&#039;t come back without a new invitation.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-many-people-join\"\u003EWhen many people join\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA session&#039;s usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow anyway\u003C/span\u003E lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep it at 20\u003C/span\u003E turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo allow more before anyone knocks, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow more people…\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to 20\u003C/span\u003E puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"codes-on-your-own-network\"\u003ECodes on your own network\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA code works for 10 minutes. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew code\u003C/span\u003E makes another; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop inviting\u003C/span\u003E closes it. People already in stay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOne-time code\u003C/span\u003E lets one person in per code.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAfter 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESessions on your own network are free, for everyone.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet\"\u003EInvite links over the internet: not open yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInvite links aren&#039;t open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E part of the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen invite links open, this is how they will work:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInvite by link\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECopy the link and send it like a meeting link.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe link&#039;s secret part (after \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can&#039;t read, and you still approve each person. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew link\u003C/span\u003E makes the old one stop working at once; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop the link\u003C/span\u003E ends it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaking an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"join-someone-else-s-session\"\u003EJoin someone else&#039;s session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft Studio&#039;s home screen, find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin a live session\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host&#039;s link here too.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your name and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin\u003C/span\u003E. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host&#039;s file once the host lets you in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout Studio, scan the picture under the host&#039;s code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E, then under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin with the drawing open here\u003C/span\u003E type the code or the address and code, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin here\u003C/span\u003E. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host&#039;s drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can&#039;t find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"who-changed-what-recent-edits\"\u003EWho changed what: Recent edits\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe Live panel lists \u003Cstrong\u003ERecent edits\u003C/strong\u003E: who made each change and what it was (the step&#039;s name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow more\u003C/span\u003E lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly what is selected\u003C/span\u003E keeps just the edits that touched it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list is made in your own window from the session&#039;s edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"assistants-in-a-session\"\u003EAssistants in a session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf someone turned on assistants in their app&#039;s settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host&#039;s own assistant joins at once; anyone else&#039;s waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-session-ends\"\u003EWhen the session ends\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe host chooses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEnd the session\u003C/span\u003E, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeave\u003C/span\u003E does the same for you alone.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app's own page about live sessions. Share the file you have open Open the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer. Choose Live in the app's bar, type the name others should see, then choose Share live. Studio shows a code like K7-Q4M2X with a picture to scan and the computer's address. Give the code to the people you want to invite. Your file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves. Let people in Nobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet: Edit lets them change the file with you. View only lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back. Deny turns them away. The list under In the session shows everyone. Change a person's role there, or Remove them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can't come back without a new invitation. When many people join A session's usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you. When someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose: Allow anyway lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your Edit, View only or Deny. Keep it at 20 turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small. To allow more before anyone knocks, choose Allow more people… under In the session. Back to 20 puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again. If things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps. Codes on your own network A code works for 10 minutes. New code makes another; Stop inviting closes it. People already in stay. One-time code lets one person in per code. After 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you. Sessions on your own network are free, for everyone. Invite links over the internet: not open yet Invite links aren't open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the Over the internet part of the Live panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link. When invite links open, this is how they will work: Under Over the internet, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then Invite by link. Copy the link and send it like a meeting link. The link's secret part (after #) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can't read, and you still approve each person. New link makes the old one stop working at once; Stop the link ends it. Making an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license. Join someone else's session In CadCraft Studio's home screen, find Join a live session. Type the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host's link here too.) Type your name and choose Join. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host's file once the host lets you in. Without Studio, scan the picture under the host's code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser. In CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose Live, then under Join with the drawing open here type the code or the address and code, and choose Join here. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host's drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is. Guest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can't find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet. Who changed what: Recent edits The Live panel lists Recent edits: who made each change and what it was (the step's name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. Show more lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and Only what is selected keeps just the edits that touched it. The list is made in your own window from the session's edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so. Assistants in a session If someone turned on assistants in their app's settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host's own assistant joins at once; anyone else's waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: Allow or Deny. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves. When the session ends The host chooses End the session, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. Leave does the same for you alone.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"pen-and-touch","scope":"basics","title":"Draw with a pen on a tablet","summary":"What the app does when you draw with a pen on a touch screen: it ignores your palm, can leave the drawing to the pen while your fingers move the view, and lets the pen's buttons and a two-finger tap undo.","section":"tasks","order":94,"keywords":["pen","stylus","tablet","touch","palm","palm rejection","finger","fingers","two fingers","tap","undo","redo","side button","barrel button","eraser","pressure","hover","phone"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time","text":"A pen is noticed the first time","level":2},{"id":"your-palm-is-ignored","text":"Your palm is ignored","level":2},{"id":"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view","text":"Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view","level":2},{"id":"undo-with-a-tap","text":"Undo with a tap","level":2},{"id":"the-pen-s-buttons","text":"The pen's buttons","level":2},{"id":"these-are-the-device-s-settings","text":"These are the device's settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time\"\u003EA pen is noticed the first time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-palm-is-ignored\"\u003EYour palm is ignored\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgnore my palm while I use a pen\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view\"\u003ELet the pen draw and your fingers move the view\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw and select\u003C/span\u003E (the start): a finger does what the pen does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly move the view\u003C/span\u003E: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"undo-with-a-tap\"\u003EUndo with a tap\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETap with two fingers to undo, three to redo\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-pen-s-buttons\"\u003EThe pen&#039;s buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen side button\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does (a right click)\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen eraser end\u003C/span\u003E (on pens that have one): \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"these-are-the-device-s-settings\"\u003EThese are the device&#039;s settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E and resetting an app&#039;s settings leave them as they are.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPen pressure and tilt don&#039;t change line weights yet, and no app has a handwriting or sketch-to-shape tool. The app reads the pen&#039;s pressure, tilt and hover, so these can come later per app.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in Settings › General › Pen and touch, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen. A pen is noticed the first time Nothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual. Your palm is ignored With Ignore my palm while I use a pen on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw. If a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work. Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view Under Fingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here: Draw and select (the start): a finger does what the pen does. Only move the view: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual. The toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way. Undo with a tap With Tap with two fingers to undo, three to redo on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap. The pen's buttons Pen side button: What the app does (a right click) at the start, or Undo or Redo. Pen eraser end (on pens that have one): What the app does at the start, or Undo or Redo. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches. These are the device's settings The pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. Reset the layout and resetting an app's settings leave them as they are. Not built yet Pen pressure and tilt don't change line weights yet, and no app has a handwriting or sketch-to-shape tool. The app reads the pen's pressure, tilt and hover, so these can come later per app.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"input-devices","scope":"basics","title":"Use a trackpad, 3D mouse or controller","summary":"Set what a trackpad, your mouse's side buttons, a pen, finger taps, a 3D mouse, a game controller or a MIDI controller does, for every app or for one app.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["trackpad","touchpad","two fingers","pinch","scroll","mouse","side button","back button","forward button","tilt wheel","pen","stylus","eraser","tap","3D mouse","space mouse","6 axis","game controller","gamepad","joystick","MIDI","knob","fader","pad","input device","customize","assign"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"every-app-or-only-this-app","text":"Every app, or only this app","level":2},{"id":"trackpad","text":"Trackpad","level":2},{"id":"mouse-buttons","text":"Mouse buttons","level":2},{"id":"pen-and-finger-taps","text":"Pen and finger taps","level":2},{"id":"3d-mouse","text":"3D mouse","level":2},{"id":"game-controller","text":"Game controller","level":2},{"id":"midi-controller","text":"MIDI controller","level":2},{"id":"share-your-settings","text":"Share your settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInput devices\u003C/span\u003E, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"every-app-or-only-this-app\"\u003EEvery app, or only this app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the top, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThese settings are for\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly\u003C/span\u003E this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E again to drop this app&#039;s own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app&#039;s apps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"trackpad\"\u003ETrackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger scroll\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPan the view\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZoom\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrbit (3D views)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPinch\u003C/span\u003E: zoom, as the app does, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse the direction\u003C/span\u003E apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mouse-buttons\"\u003EMouse buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack side button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EForward side button\u003C/span\u003E: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit everything in view\u003C/span\u003E. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWheel tilted sideways\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe wheel&#039;s zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app&#039;s own tab, under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pen-and-finger-taps\"\u003EPen and finger taps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESide button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser end\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, or any command.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThree-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPalm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-mouse\"\u003E3D mouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect a 3D mouse\u003C/span\u003E and pick it in the browser&#039;s list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach movement (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELift and press\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwist\u003C/span\u003E) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse\u003C/span\u003E turns it round.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly the strongest movement at a time\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach button runs a command or fits the view.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"game-controller\"\u003EGame controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPlug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse up and down on the sticks\u003C/span\u003E are there too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"midi-controller\"\u003EMIDI controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect MIDI\u003C/span\u003E. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a control for\u003C/span\u003E (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearn it\u003C/span\u003E, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-your-settings\"\u003EShare your settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E saves the settings shown as a file; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E reads one back (settings this version doesn&#039;t know are left out, and you&#039;re told how many). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to the defaults\u003C/span\u003E undoes every change for the settings shown.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app&#039;s own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in Settings › Global › Input devices, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before. Every app, or only this app At the top, These settings are for: Every app (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own. Only this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps. Choose Every app again to drop this app's own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app's apps. Trackpad Two-finger scroll: What the app does, Pan the view, Zoom or Orbit (3D views). Pinch: zoom, as the app does, or Nothing. Speed and Reverse the direction apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit. The app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does. Mouse buttons Back side button and Forward side button: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or Fit everything in view. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page. Wheel tilted sideways: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing. The wheel's zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app's own tab, under Menus, keys and mouse. Pen and finger taps Side button and Eraser end: what the app does, or any command. Two-finger tap and Three-finger tap (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or Nothing. Palm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under Pen and touch. 3D mouse Choose Connect a 3D mouse and pick it in the browser's list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer: Each movement (Push left and right, Push forward and back, Lift and press, Tilt forward and back, Tilt left and right, Twist) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and Reverse turns it round. Speed, Dead zone (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and Only the strongest movement at a time. Each button runs a command or fits the view. A 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Game controller Plug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. Speed, Dead zone and Reverse up and down on the sticks are there too. MIDI controller Choose Connect MIDI. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under Add a control for (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose Learn it, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Share your settings Export saves the settings shown as a file; Import reads one back (settings this version doesn't know are left out, and you're told how many). Back to the defaults undoes every change for the settings shown. Not built yet A wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app's own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"undo-across-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Undo the last step across windows","summary":"In CadCraft Studio, take back the last thing you did in any app window from the Studio window, in the order you worked, without changing windows first.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["undo","undo across apps","undo last step","last step","project undo","studio undo","order I worked","undo in another app","windows","journal"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-do","text":"What you will do","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works","text":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-will-not-do","text":"What it will not do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-do\"\u003EWhat you will do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffCraft, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen windows\u003C/strong\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how-it-works\"\u003EHow it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example &quot;Rename the takeoff in TakeoffCraft&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E in the Studio window. Studio asks &quot;Undo this step in that app?&quot;; nothing happens until you say \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo it\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-will-not-do\"\u003EWhat it will not do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt takes back \u003Cstrong\u003Eone window&#039;s own last step\u003C/strong\u003E only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffCraft by this.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA closed window&#039;s steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app&#039;s own Undo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will do You drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffCraft, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under Open windows, choose Undo last step. How it works Each app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example \"Rename the takeoff in TakeoffCraft\". Choose Undo last step in the Studio window. Studio asks \"Undo this step in that app?\"; nothing happens until you say Undo it. Studio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before. What it will not do It takes back one window's own last step only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffCraft by this. If you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app. A closed window's steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered. It does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio. Each app's own Undo (Ctrl+Z) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"full-screen-crosshair","scope":"basics","title":"Full-screen crosshair","summary":"Two thin lines through the pointer, edge to edge across the drawing or view, to check by eye that things line up. One switch turns it on in every app.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["full screen crosshair","full-screen cursor","crosshair","cursor","cursorsize","cursorsize 100","edge to edge","line up","alignment","align","guide lines","cross hairs"],"headings":[{"id":"turn-it-on","text":"Turn it on","level":2},{"id":"what-it-does","text":"What it does","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD&#039;s \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E 100.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"turn-it-on\"\u003ETurn it on\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear in the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), go to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E and tick \u003Cstrong\u003ECrosshair from edge to edge in every app\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EFull-screen crosshair\u003C/strong\u003E. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-does\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EToolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003ECursor\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EFull screen\u003C/strong\u003E, or type \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E and 100.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"The full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD's CURSORSIZE 100. Turn it on Open Settings (the gear in the app bar, or Ctrl+,), go to General and tick Crosshair from edge to edge in every app under Full-screen crosshair. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open. What it does The lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running. Toolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them. With a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen. In CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: Settings › CadCraft › Cursor › Full screen, or type CURSORSIZE and 100.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"unit-lists","scope":"basics","title":"Units, typed values and the unit lists","summary":"Type a length in any unit with its mark, choose which units the unit lists show, and star the unit new work starts in. A file always keeps its own unit.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["units","unit list","metric","imperial","feet","inches","feet and inches","meters","millimeters","US survey foot","survey feet","international foot","yards","miles","nautical mile","chain","rod","link","furlong","fathom","point","pica","acre","hectare","square","roofing square","acre-foot","board foot","gallon","gon","grad","radian","degrees minutes seconds","slope","percent","H:V","rise run","default unit","star","INSUNITS"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"type-a-length-in-any-unit","text":"Type a length in any unit","level":2},{"id":"choose-the-units-the-lists-show","text":"Choose the units the lists show","level":2},{"id":"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used","text":"Where the lists and the star are used","level":2},{"id":"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit","text":"A file keeps its own unit","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"type-a-length-in-any-unit\"\u003EType a length in any unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit&#039;s mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EType\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeans\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039; 6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ft 6 in\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efeet and inches\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E450 mm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3.2 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1.5 km\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2 dm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E400 nm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetric lengths (\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is the nanometer)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2.5 mi\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E250 mil\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyards, miles, thousandths of an inch\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 US mi\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ethe US survey foot and mile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2 rd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E100 li\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ch\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 fur\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Erods, links, chains, furlongs\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1 nmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E1 NM\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6 ftm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Enautical miles, fathoms\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12 pt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 pc\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Epoints and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type \u003Ccode\u003Enmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003ENM\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003ENm\u003C/code\u003E is refused, because it could be either.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eft\u003C/code\u003E is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type \u003Ccode\u003EUS ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eusft\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003Esurvey ft\u003C/code\u003E. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: \u003Ccode\u003E2*3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot; + 3 ch\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so \u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 and \u003Ccode\u003E10 ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 project feet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-the-units-the-lists-show\"\u003EChoose the units the lists show\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear on the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E, and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E. There is one list for each kind: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVolume\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAngle\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlope\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file&#039;s unit, or the one for your region).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the unit lists\u003C/span\u003E puts the starting lists back, with no stars.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used\"\u003EWhere the lists and the star are used\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EApp\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat follows the switches\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat the star sets\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECadCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECivilCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe project&#039;s units list\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModelCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list beside the value box\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit of a new model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBimCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list on the plan toolbar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring and position units in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, and the unit in the calibrate dialog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring unit, until MarkupCraft&#039;s own settings have been saved\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit lists of an item\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength and area: the unit of a new item\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe angle and slope lists are saved, but no app&#039;s box follows them yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit\"\u003EA file keeps its own unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give. Type a length in any unit In a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit's mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in. Type Means 12'6\", 12' 6 1/2\", 12'-6\", 3 ft 6 in feet and inches 450 mm, 3.2 m, 1.5 km, 2 dm, 400 nm metric lengths (nm is the nanometer) 3 yd, 2.5 mi, 250 mil yards, miles, thousandths of an inch 10 US ft, 1 US mi the US survey foot and mile 2 rd, 100 li, 3 ch, 1 fur rods, links, chains, furlongs 1 nmi or 1 NM, 6 ftm nautical miles, fathoms 12 pt, 3 pc points and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch) nm is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type nmi or NM. Nm is refused, because it could be either. ft is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type US ft, usft or survey ft. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones. Sums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: 2*3 yd, 12'6\" + 3 ch. In CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch. In CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so 10 US ft is 10 and 10 ft is 10 project feet. Choose the units the lists show Open Settings (the gear on the app bar, or Ctrl+,), choose General, and find Units. There is one list for each kind: Length, Area, Volume, Angle and Slope. Each unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps. Click the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file's unit, or the one for your region). Reset the unit lists puts the starting lists back, with no stars. The choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them. Where the lists and the star are used App What follows the switches What the star sets CadCraft The units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry CivilCraft The project's units list Length: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in ModelCraft The units list beside the value box The unit of a new model BimCraft The units list on the plan toolbar The display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept) MarkupCraft The measuring and position units in Settings, and the unit in the calibrate dialog The measuring unit, until MarkupCraft's own settings have been saved TakeoffCraft The unit lists of an item Length and area: the unit of a new item The angle and slope lists are saved, but no app's box follows them yet. A file keeps its own unit The settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in Settings.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"lost-toolbar","scope":"basics","title":"Where did my toolbar go?","summary":"The bars, menus or panels went missing. Here is what hides them on purpose, the keys that bring them back, and one button that puts the whole layout back.","section":"trouble","order":5,"keywords":["toolbar gone","toolbar missing","lost toolbar","lost menu","menu disappeared","ribbon disappeared","bars hidden","show bars","full screen","panels gone","reset layout","layout","ribbon","collapsed","locked toolbar"],"headings":[{"id":"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout","text":"The quickest fix: reset the layout","level":2},{"id":"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen","text":"The bars are hidden (full screen)","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-looks-different","text":"The toolbar looks different","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-s-own-menu","text":"The toolbar's own menu","level":2},{"id":"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small","text":"Everything is too big or too small","level":2},{"id":"the-panels-are-gone","text":"The panels are gone","level":2},{"id":"on-a-phone","text":"On a phone","level":2},{"id":"still-missing","text":"Still missing?","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout\"\u003EThe quickest fix: reset the layout\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E with the gear button in the app bar, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E tab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app&#039;s own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft Studio, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E in Studio&#039;s own window also has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout in every app\u003C/span\u003E. Each app&#039;s windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen\"\u003EThe bars are hidden (full screen)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe screen-mode button in the app bar, and \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile the bars are hidden, a small \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave this mode, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave full screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScreen\u003C/span\u003E: the app does what is chosen there when it opens.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETap the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab, or tap the top edge of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-looks-different\"\u003EThe toolbar looks different\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools in another order, or tools you can&#039;t find:\u003C/strong\u003E someone arranged the toolbar. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOriginal order\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOnly icons, or only words:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar buttons\u003C/span\u003E in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools won&#039;t move:\u003C/strong\u003E the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E, or clear \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA ribbon that shows only its tab names:\u003C/strong\u003E it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar:\u003C/strong\u003E a menu style is on. Pick the app&#039;s own style under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › the app&#039;s tab › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E. Every command is in every style; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E finds any of them by name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-s-own-menu\"\u003EThe toolbar&#039;s own menu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone arranging\u003C/span\u003E in the same menu, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, when it looks right.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: a locked toolbar can&#039;t be arranged or reset by accident.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: tools back in their first order.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a ribbon menu style: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPin the ribbon open\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a keyboard, the menu key (or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift F10\"\u003E⇧ F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) opens it for the tool that has the focus.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small\"\u003EEverything is too big or too small\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanel text size\u003C/span\u003E beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio&#039;s own window has one in its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-panels-are-gone\"\u003EThe panels are gone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELook for a second window called after the app with &quot;panels&quot;, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels back\u003C/span\u003E in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOr choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanels\u003C/span\u003E, which brings every panel home.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"on-a-phone\"\u003EOn a phone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"still-missing\"\u003EStill missing?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFind any tool by name with \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app&#039;s name and what you were doing.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Nothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back. The quickest fix: reset the layout Open Settings with the gear button in the app bar, or press Ctrl+,. Choose the General tab. Under Layout, choose Reset the layout. The toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app's own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under Menus, keys and mouse). In CadCraft Studio, Settings in Studio's own window also has Reset the layout in every app. Each app's windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout. The bars are hidden (full screen) The screen-mode button in the app bar, and Ctrl+Shift+F, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back. While the bars are hidden, a small Show bars tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press Ctrl+Shift+F to leave this mode, or Esc to leave full screen. If the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at Settings › General › Screen: the app does what is chosen there when it opens. Tap the Show bars tab, or tap the top edge of the screen. The toolbar looks different Tools in another order, or tools you can't find: someone arranged the toolbar. Choose Original order under Settings › General › Toolbar. Only icons, or only words: Toolbar buttons in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name. Tools won't move: the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose Unlock the toolbar, or clear Lock the toolbar under Settings › General › Toolbar. A ribbon that shows only its tab names: it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open. Menus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar: a menu style is on. Pick the app's own style under Settings › the app's tab › Menus, keys and mouse. Every command is in every style; Ctrl+K finds any of them by name. The toolbar's own menu Right-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu: Arrange the toolbar: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose Done arranging in the same menu, or press Esc, when it looks right. Lock the toolbar / Unlock the toolbar: a locked toolbar can't be arranged or reset by accident. Reset the toolbar: tools back in their first order. With a ribbon menu style: Collapse the ribbon or Pin the ribbon open. On a keyboard, the menu key (or Shift+F10) opens it for the tool that has the focus. Everything is too big or too small Settings › General › Interface size makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. Panel text size beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio's own window has one in its Settings too. The panels are gone Panels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window). Look for a second window called after the app with \"panels\", and choose Put the panels back in it. Or choose Reset layout under Settings › General › Panels, which brings every panel home. On a phone On a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The Tools button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and Move puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen. Still missing? Find any tool by name with Ctrl+K, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app's name and what you were doing.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"recover","scope":"basics","title":"Recover unsaved work","summary":"How the apps keep a recovery copy while you work, and how to get your work back after a crash or a closed tab.","section":"trouble","order":55,"keywords":["autosave","recover","recovery","crash","lost work","closed tab","unsaved","restore","backup"],"headings":[{"id":"when-the-copy-is-kept","text":"When the copy is kept","level":2},{"id":"get-your-work-back","text":"Get your work back","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWhile you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-copy-is-kept\"\u003EWhen the copy is kept\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you switch to another tab or window.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"get-your-work-back\"\u003EGet your work back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the same app again, in the same browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf it closed before your work was saved, it asks \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover your work?\u003C/span\u003E and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover\u003C/span\u003E to open it, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiscard\u003C/span\u003E to throw it away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESave it to a file as soon as it opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENot now\u003C/span\u003E keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAnother tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrivate windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClearing your browser&#039;s site data removes the copies.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENot every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app&#039;s own help says whether it does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"While you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work. When the copy is kept A few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going. When you switch to another tab or window. The copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded. Get your work back Open the same app again, in the same browser. If it closed before your work was saved, it asks Recover your work? and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy. Choose Recover to open it, or Discard to throw it away. Save it to a file as soon as it opens. Not now keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back. Things to know When you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed. Another tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone. Private windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often. Clearing your browser's site data removes the copies. Not every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app's own help says whether it does.","lang":"en"}],"locale":"so","chain":["so","en"]};
